# game/script day2.rpy:18
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5ae443b3:

    # a "Well done Samuel. You are all looking ready."
    a "不错，Samuel，看来你们都准备好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e38ca69b:

    # "Arthur stands in front of you with his hands behind his back. He slowly gives each of you a quick visual inspection from head to toe."
    "Arthur双手背在身后，站在你们面前，慢条斯理地上下打量着你们每个人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_df43aa31:

    # s "Of course."
    s "当然"

# game/script day2.rpy:24
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_07e371ce:

    # a "Since I didn't start you three yesterday, this'll be your first shift."
    a "既然昨天没让你们三个开始干活，今天就是你们的第一个班了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:26
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_614bc4ff:

    # a "To give you a little time to settle in and get acclimatized."
    a "让你们先适应适应，熟悉一下环境。"

# game/script day2.rpy:28
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9ef91a78:

    # a "You three will join Samuel in my larboard watch.{w} We have two watches on this ship, so you'll follow the usual schedule of 4 hours on and 4 hours off."
    a "你们三个和Samuel来我的左舷班。{w} 我们船上分两班轮值，所以你们也按四值四休的规矩来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:30
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_af5f37bf:

    # a "With the two dog watches from 16:00 to 20:00 for dinner time."
    a "16:00 到 20:00 是晚饭时间，期间会分成两个“狗班”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:32
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_72655f60:

    # "The three of you nod briefly at each point."
    "你们三个对所有安排都简短的点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:34
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bbe6db98:

    # a "You've organised breakfast for them, I presume?"
    a "早餐应该都给他们安排好了吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:36
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f04b0466:

    # s "Affirm, sir."
    s "是的，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:40
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_959c23cf:

    # "Arthur nods in acknowledgement."
    "Arthur点头表示知晓。"

# game/script day2.rpy:42
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_619bdf71:

    # a "We've had a quiet night.{w} Course is steady for now, however we may be required to tack with both watches at the end of the watch if the wind stays as it is."
    a "昨晚很平静。{w} 目前航向也很稳定，但如果风况一直不变的话，我们可能要在交班的时候两个班一起抢风调向。"

# game/script day2.rpy:47
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5cf6bf51:

    # p "Should we be prepared for that, too?"
    p "那我们也要准备一下吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:51
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_725ec22d:

    # "Arthur exhales slowly but audibly through his nose. His eyes are fixed on you with obvious annoyance."
    "Arthur从鼻子里重重地哼了一声，带着明显的怒意瞪着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:53
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8f0b2833:

    # a "What do you think we pay you for?"
    a "那你以为我们花钱请你来是干什么的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:55
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7d0cc800:

    # a "You can pull a sheet?{w} Or is that another thing you don't know anything about?"
    a "你会拉帆脚索吗？{w} 还是说，你又是点都不会？"

# game/script day2.rpy:57
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_01bf7211:

    # "Your stomach sinks as he scolds you in front of the others. You take a breath and struggle to get the answer past your lips, which suddenly feel terribly dry."
    "被他当着其他人的面这么训斥，你的心猛地一沉。你深吸一口气，费了好大力气才把回答从干涩的嘴唇间挤出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:59
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9aa6b81d:

    # "You can't see them, but it sure feels like the other's eyes are trained on you, too."
    "你看不到他们，却能感觉到其他人的目光似乎也都落在了你身上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:61
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bc89f1df:

    # p "M-My apologies, sir.{w} Of course. I can."
    p "十、十分抱歉，长官。{w}没问题，我这就去办。"

# game/script day2.rpy:63
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3d1d880f:

    # a "There you go. I really cannot be sure with you anymore, and I don't like that."
    a "这不就对了。我现在对你真是没个底了，我可不喜欢这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:67
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_300d09e9:

    # a "It'll be a miracle if you manage to keep the same rhythm as the others.{w} But I won't hold my breath."
    a "你要是能跟上其他人的节奏，那可真是神了。{w} 不过我可不抱什么希望。"

# game/script day2.rpy:69
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b97f8c18:

    # "With an exasperated sigh he turns away from you and back to Samuel."
    "他无奈地叹了口气，转头看向Samuel。"

# game/script day2.rpy:72
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_fd88089e:

    # j "Should we be ready for that as well?"
    j "那我们也要准备一下吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:76
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9b5c0a66:

    # a "Naturally.{w} You can pull a sheet, or am I mistaken?"
    a "那是自然，{w}你会扯帆脚索吧，又或者我猜错了？"
    #sheet不是帆桁是帆脚索，帆脚索是用来控制风帆角度的绳索，用来控制航向。帆桁是用来横着撑开帆的木杆。

# game/script day2.rpy:78
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2cdf67ba:

    # "Julian needs a second before he manages to answer."
    "Julian顿了一下才回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:82
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f75acc27:

    # j "I can indeed, sir."
    j "当然会，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:86
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1851d0fe:

    # a "There you go."
    a "那就好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:88
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_de9e994a:

    # a "If you can do it in the same rhythm as the others, then there's nothing standing between you and a successful career, boy."
    a "小子，要是你能跟上其他人的节奏，那你的职业生涯肯定会顺风顺水。"

# game/script day2.rpy:90
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b97f8c18_1:

    # "With an exasperated sigh he turns away from you and back to Samuel."
    "他无奈地叹了口气，转过身去面向Samuel，不再理你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:92
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e0272825:

    # a "That is all for now, though.{w} Samuel?"
    a "目前就先这样吧。{w} Samuel？"

# game/script day2.rpy:97
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_17d431f4:

    # "The maned wolf takes a step forward."
    "鬃狼向前走了一步。"

# game/script day2.rpy:99
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_491ca647:

    # s "Yes, sir?"
    s "是，长官？"

# game/script day2.rpy:102
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8e132029:

    # a "You did well bringing the other two up to speed. I won't hold this one against you."
    a "你把另外俩小子带得不错，这次我就不怪你了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:104
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8024ea2e:

    # "He waves dismissively at you, causing your ears to drop low in shame."
    "他不耐烦地冲你挥挥手，你羞愧得耷拉下耳朵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:106
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_adbd62f4:

    # a "You are free to keep them occupied as you see fit until someone requests a helping hand."
    a "你先自己看着安排，别让他们闲着，等有人需要帮忙的时候再说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:109
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9ff24436:

    # a "You did well integrating them so far. You are free to keep them occupied as you see fit until someone requests a helping hand."
    a "目前为止你把他们带的还不错。你先自己看着安排，别让他们闲着，等有人需要帮忙的时候再说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:111
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_58d3baef:

    # a "That is all for now."
    a "目前就这些了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:114
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_39d98798:

    # "Samuel straightens up and raises his hand in a brief salute to Arthur."
    "Samuel挺直了身子，抬手向Arthur简短的敬了个礼"

# game/script day2.rpy:116
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f9956746:

    # s "Understood."
    s "明白了"

# game/script day2.rpy:118
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1d00c6fe:

    # "Arthur nods in return and leaves your group to its own devices."
    "Arthur点点头走了，让你们自己看着办。"

# game/script day2.rpy:131
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b69aea68:

    # p "How does the power feel, Sam?"
    p "当官的感觉怎么样，Sam？"

# game/script day2.rpy:136
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_77ee7366:

    # s "Huh?"
    s "嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:138
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_77e4afa9:

    # s "Don't be an idiot. This ain't the first time I've led others."
    s "别犯傻了，我又不是第一次带新人了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:142
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_57ea3c25:

    # p "So it feels good is what you're saying?"
    p "所以你是说这感觉不错喽？"

# game/script day2.rpy:147
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bd669897:

    # s "Oh, ya bet it does, pussycat."
    s "哦，那可不，小宝贝儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:159
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3dba5768:

    # "You turn to Julian once Arthur is out of earshot, and whisper to the lizard."
    "等Arthur走远了，你转头对着Julian小声说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:161
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6eede56c:

    # p "You're all right?"
    p "你没事吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:163
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a226c6ce:

    # "He nods and looks back at you."
    "他点了点头，然后看向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:165
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_301c5582:

    # j "Used to it...they're always stuck up like that."
    j "习惯了...他们那些当官的，一直都这德行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:167
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_169ab71e:

    # j "Must be the power they feel they have."
    j "肯定是觉得自己手握重权吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:169
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9c9312be:

    # p "Yeah...easy to become an ass..."
    p "是啊……太容易变混蛋了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:178
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e9e1cb59:

    # s "All right. You heard'im."
    s "好了。你们都听见了啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:187
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e9e1cb59_1:

    # s "All right. You heard'im."
    s "好了。你们都听见了啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:189
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_86a96ff8:

    # s "Not much excitement today, so we might as well get the annoying part out the way while we can."
    s "今天也没啥事儿，不如趁现在把那烦人的活儿给干了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:191
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e0c022ce:

    # w "It's swabbing, isn't it?"
    w "是擦甲板吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:196
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0e520dc8:

    # s "Sure is!{w} Nobody wants to do it while in port. Everyone's busy using their time on land, and then unloading and loading the ship."
    s "没错！{w} 谁也不想在港口里干这活儿。大家都忙着在陆地上逍遥快活，还得卸货装船的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:198
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_942c3449:

    # s "Usually it's one of the first things we need to do after we leave."
    s "通常一出海，这都是咱们头一件要干的事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:200
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b14777d9:

    # s "And as new guys, it shouldn't come as much of a surprise that you're the prime targets for it."
    s "你们是新来的，肯定得先拿你们开刀，这也没啥好奇怪的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:205
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a38033e8:

    # s "And, well, by extension me, I guess."
    s "而且，这么算下来我也得跟你们一起干了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:207
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6d13d7e1:

    # p "Sorry about that."
    p "不好意思啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:212
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_286e4dc2:

    # s "I'll gladly take some booze, if ya want to make it up to me, 'course."
    s "要不你请我喝点酒，就当赔罪了，怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:216
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_45683a3f:

    # j "Noted."
    j "记下了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:225
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_978ec699:

    # "Samuel already prepares what you will need, with several holystones and a few buckets of salt water at the ready."
    "Samuel已经准备好了你们需要的东西，几块磨石和几桶盐水都备好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:238
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2c12da01:

    # "He hands them out to each of you as your group makes its way to the front of the ship to get started."
    "你们小组往船头走去准备开工的时候他把工具分给了每个人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:240
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7e9c30fb:

    # w "Not the worst thing to start the day with."
    w "用这种活开启一天还不算最糟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:242
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ad4c2b55:

    # "Wolf says and tosses the piece of holystone in the air as he walks up the steps of the forecastle."
    "Wolf说着，将手里的磨石抛向空中，走上前甲板的台阶。"

# game/script day2.rpy:246
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ebee1a2a:

    # w "I'm still not feeling quite awake, so this is the extent of what I can deal with."
    w "我还困得不行呢，眼下能应付的也就这么多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:249
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2211b205:

    # "With the first bucket being emptied, you begin your work."
    "随着第一桶水泼洒而出，你们开始了工作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:251
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b2b0b36e:

    # "Your first real day."
    "这是你真正意义上的第一天。"

# game/script day2.rpy:253
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9614758b:

    # "You are sure that it'll become a chore soon enough, but for now the sheer novelty of it makes it enjoyable."
    "你确定这活儿很快会变成枯燥的例行公事，但此刻的新鲜感让它看起来还算有趣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:255
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5edcdc70:

    # "Simply spending time with the new people you've met."
    "光是和新认识的人呆在一起就感觉很好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:257
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_93500df0:

    # "Each new slide of the holystone pushes a small wave of the salt water in front of it, and the water quickly begins to soak into the fabric around your knees."
    "磨石一推，就带起一小股盐水往前涌，很快就浸湿了你膝盖周围的衣物。"

# game/script day2.rpy:259
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d6a2f63e:

    # "At first you try to avoid it and squat down on your paws, but eventually you just give in when it becomes too uncomfortable a position to scrub in."
    "一开始你还想躲开，尽量蹲着，但后来实在蹲得难受，就干脆放弃了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:263
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_db12c10e:

    # j "So how did you end up helping her yesterday?"
    j "昨天你是怎么帮她的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:265
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_79087f5d:

    # "You don't even realize that the question is directed at you and you continue to work quietly."
    "你压根没意识到这话是对你说的，只是默默地干着手里的活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:269
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_52aaa155:

    # j "[name]?"
    j "[name]?"

# game/script day2.rpy:278
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5261994f:

    # p "Oh? Me?"
    p "噢！我吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:282
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d98b3697:

    # j "Yes, of course. You were the one trotting after her as if she was pulling on a leash."
    j "可不是？昨天你跟在她屁股后面，就像被她拴着条绳儿似的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:287
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8f59ed3e:

    # "You feel a rush of warmth in your face. Did you look so smitten yesterday?"
    "你觉得脸上有点发烫。我昨天看起来有那么着迷吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:289
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0509c1a9:

    # p "I already told you. She just needed me to hold a few things."
    p "我不是说过了吗，她只是让我帮她拿点东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:291
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8d1889b1:

    # w "Who is this about?"
    w "你们在说谁呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:293
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_556d24e2:

    # j "[name] is becoming a man."
    j "[name] 要变成男子汉啦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:297
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a4fde08e:

    # s "Be careful what ya say now, Julian..."
    s "说话小心点，Julian..."

# game/script day2.rpy:299
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a475dd4c:

    # j "What?"
    j "啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:301
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7fae0b48:

    # p "... I saw Arthur and her during dinner time and I wanted to ask Arthur something.{w} She needed help and I was there. That's really all there was to it."
    p "....晚饭那会儿我看见Arthur和她了，想问Arthur点事儿。{w} 她需要帮忙，我正好在那儿。事情就是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:303
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ec05b720:

    # p "We went down to-"
    p "我们下到-"

# game/script day2.rpy:305
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_33b727c9:

    # "Julian interrupts your sentence with a suggestive whistle."
    "Julian吹了个流里流气的口哨，打断了你的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:316
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8ce9418a:

    # "A sudden burst of movement ends with Julian's back forcefully being pressed against a nearby barrel, and Samuel's arm across his throat to hold him in place." with vpunch
    "突然，Julian被人猛地按在旁边的桶上，Samuel一只胳膊锁住了他的喉咙，让他动弹不得。" with vpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:318
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2a04606e:

    # "It is an intensity you have not seen from Samuel before, and suddenly things around you appear quiet as Julian looks up at him with wide-eyed surprise."
    "你从没见过Samuel这么凶狠的样子，周围一下子安静了下来，Julian也瞪大了眼睛，一脸惊讶地看着他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:320
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_71aa0bcb:

    # s "Shut the hell up, lizard! Or I'll make sure that you need her help. This is a lesson you better learn quickly.."
    s "闭上你的臭嘴，小蜥蜴！不然老子非得揍得你去找她治病不可。这规矩你最好趁早学聪明点……"

# game/script day2.rpy:322
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_637cb40c:

    # s "I'm not going to stand here and let you play out your childish fantasies about Rajeeyah. Are we clear on that?!"
    s "我可不会站在这儿，让你在这儿意淫Rajeeyah。听明白了没有？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:326
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9f857561:

    # "Samuel holds firm until he sees a meek nod from the lizard, which finally releases Julian from between Samuel and the barrel."
    "Samuel死死地按着他，直到看到那蜥蜴点头认怂，这才把Julian从桶边放开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:332
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_97114dbe:

    # "The lizard's boisterous nature flicks off in an instant as he idly adjusts his clothes."
    "刚才还咋咋呼呼的蜥蜴，一下子就安静了下来，漫不经心地整理着自己的衣服。"

# game/script day2.rpy:334
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_df959a65:

    # s "Try to think once in a while before ya open your food hole."
    s "开腔之前稍微动动脑子好吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:336
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e00679c5:

    # "Moment after moment of silence passes, everyone hesitant to be the first to break it. Until Samuel finally does."
    "大家沉默不语，没人愿意先开口打破僵局，最终还是Samuel先说话了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:338
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_96042ebe:

    # s "Now that we cleared that up... I appreciate you helping her, [name]."
    s "既然把话说开了……多谢你肯去帮她搭把手，[name]。"

# game/script day2.rpy:340
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_537061df:

    # p "Uhm, sure."
    p "呃，分内的事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:342
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8562bda0:

    # s "With Perce, I presume?"
    s "是帮Perce？"

# game/script day2.rpy:344
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_43490b83:

    # "You nod as one after another of you resume your efforts to clean the deck."
    "你点点头，众人也陆陆续续地重新开始清理甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:346
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_01d6c6ba:

    # p "Yes. I think that was his name."
    p "嗯，我记得好像是这个名字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:350
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bb3d992b:

    # s "How was he, dead by any chance?"
    s "他现在怎么样了，该不会一命呜呼了吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:352
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_39001c1d:

    # p "Um, I'm sorry?"
    p "啊？你说什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:356
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_dfc82195:

    # s "I'm jokin'. Don't get along very well with the fucker, but not gonna go as far as wishing death on him."
    s "开玩笑的。我跟那混蛋处不来，但还不至于咒他死。"

# game/script day2.rpy:358
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_70271840:

    # p "He seemed alright under the circumstances? She mentioned things are looking better as we changed the bandages."
    p "看起来情况还行？她说换药的时候，情况正在好转。"

# game/script day2.rpy:360
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c9d0684d:

    # p "Why do you two not get along well?"
    p "你们俩怎么合不来？"

# game/script day2.rpy:362
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9fabb5cd:

    # s "My own issue, if ya mind."
    s "那是我自己的事，别多问。"

# game/script day2.rpy:368
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_babf8cbc:

    # w "Rajeeyah. I take it she is the ship's surgeon?"
    w "Rajeeyah？她是船上的医生吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:370
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_47cd1d79:

    # s "Correct. Tall cheetah. Might'a seen her before."
    s "没错。个儿挺高的那只猎豹。你可能见过她。"

# game/script day2.rpy:375
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e286f432:

    # "Wolf shakes his head."
    "Wolf 摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:377
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_fce99d05:

    # w "Not that I can remember."
    w "没什么印象。"

# game/script day2.rpy:382
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_df95ffe9:

    # s "At least Perce is doing well though. Was a bit dicey for a moment from what I heard."
    s "至少Perce现在没事了。听人说之前的情况挺悬的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:386
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_54405dc5:

    # p "It did look pretty rough. But if she is confident then that's surely a good sign."
    p "看起来确实挺糟糕的。不过她要是心里有数，那肯定没事了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:390
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b4130f7e:

    # p "If she feels he's getting better, then hopefully it won't cause any troubles anymore."
    p "既然Rajeeyah觉得Perce在好转，希望之后不会再出什么问题了"

# game/script day2.rpy:392
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ddb3b4fb:

    # "Samuel goes for the next bucket of water, his body nothing but a silhouette in your view against the bright sunlight."
    "Samuel又去打了一桶水，在刺眼的阳光下，他的身影在你眼中变成了一个黑色的剪影。"

# game/script day2.rpy:396
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_db12c10e_1:

    # j "So how did you end up helping her yesterday?"
    j "昨天你是怎么帮她的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:398
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_48098ab7:

    # "You don't even realize that the question is directed at you and you continue working quietly."
    "你压根没意识到他是在问你，继续默默地干着活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:400
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_52aaa155_1:

    # j "[name]?"
    j "[name]？"

# game/script day2.rpy:409
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5261994f_1:

    # p "Oh? Me?"
    p "噢！我吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:413
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_245db069:

    # j "Yes, of course. The cheetah from yesterday at dinner time."
    j "对，当然。就是昨天晚餐时遇到的那只猎豹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:418
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0509c1a9_1:

    # p "I already told you. She just needed me to hold a few things."
    p "我不是说过了吗，她只是让我帮她拿点东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:420
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8d1889b1_1:

    # w "Who is this about?"
    w "你们在说谁呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:429
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_cd3bfe2c:

    # s "Rajeeyah. She's our surgeon. We saw [name] with her yesterday."
    s "Rajeeyah。她是我们的医生。昨天我们看到[name]和她在一起。"

# game/script day2.rpy:431
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e5749cd8:

    # s "Tall cheetah. Might'a seen her before."
    s "个儿挺高的那只猎豹。你可能见过她。"

# game/script day2.rpy:437
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e286f432_1:

    # "Wolf shakes his head."
    "Wolf 摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:439
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_fce99d05_1:

    # w "Not that I can remember."
    w "没什么印象。"

# game/script day2.rpy:441
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b811c76e:

    # j "Yeah. Just curious how you out of all people ended up helping her."
    j "我就是有点好奇，你怎么会帮她来着？"

# game/script day2.rpy:443
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7fae0b48_1:

    # p "... I saw Arthur and her during dinner time and I wanted to ask Arthur something.{w} She needed help and I was there. That's really all there was to it."
    p "....晚饭那会儿我看见Arthur和她了，想问Arthur点事儿。{w} 她需要帮忙，我正好在那儿。事情就是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:445
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d3992277:

    # p "We went down to help some guy who was injured a little while ago."
    p "之前，我们下去帮了个受伤的家伙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:447
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_17207b38:

    # p "I was just holding supplies while she changed bandages. It really wasn't anything noteworthy."
    p "她换绷带的时候，我就是帮着拿点东西。没什么特别的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:449
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8562bda0_1:

    # s "With Perce, I presume?"
    s "是帮Perce？"

# game/script day2.rpy:451
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_43490b83_1:

    # "You nod as one after another of you resume your efforts to clean the deck."
    "你点点头，众人也陆陆续续地重新开始清理甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:453
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_01d6c6ba_1:

    # p "Yes. I think that was his name."
    p "嗯，我记得好像是这个名字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:457
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c6717dc0:

    # s "How was he?"
    s "他现在怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:459
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7a79b804:

    # p "Umm. Good under the circumstances? She mentioned things are looking better as we changed the bandages."
    p "嗯……就当时的情况来说，还算好吧？她说换药的时候，情况正在好转。"

# game/script day2.rpy:464
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_df95ffe9_1:

    # s "At least Perce is doing well though. Was a bit dicey for a moment from what I heard."
    s "至少Perce现在没事了。听人说之前的情况挺悬的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:468
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5f125c0d:

    # s "Not exactly on the best terms with him, but he don't deserve being crippled, or worse either."
    s "我跟他交情确实一般，但他好歹罪不至残，更不该平白送命。"

# game/script day2.rpy:472
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_54405dc5_1:

    # p "It did look pretty rough. But if she is confident then that's surely a good sign."
    p "看起来确实挺糟糕的。不过她要是心里有数，那肯定没事了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:476
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b4130f7e_1:

    # p "If she feels he's getting better, then hopefully it won't cause any troubles anymore."
    p "只要她说情况在好转，应该就没什么后顾之忧了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:478
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ddb3b4fb_1:

    # "Samuel goes for the next bucket of water, his body nothing but a silhouette in your view against the bright sunlight."
    "Samuel又去打了一桶水，在刺眼的阳光下，他的身影在你眼中变成了一个黑色的剪影。"

# game/script day2.rpy:481
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ddb3b4fb_2:

    # "Samuel goes for the next bucket of water, his body nothing but a silhouette in your view against the bright sunlight."
    "Samuel又去打了一桶水，在刺眼的阳光下，他的身影在你眼中变成了一个黑色的剪影。"

# game/script day2.rpy:487
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1b69b9ac:

    # "He empties it low to the deck and wets the next part of it for you, sending the water in a small wave across the wooden floor."
    "他将水壶贴近甲板倒空，又帮你往旁边一块区域浇了些水，水流随之在木地板上荡开，形成一道小小的水波。"

# game/script day2.rpy:492
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_437de20f:

    # "Wolf finds himself right in the way of perhaps a too strong swing of the bucket. He tries to jump aside to avoid getting his breeches too drenched by it."
    "Wolf发现自己正好挡住了水桶，眼看就要被泼个正着。他赶紧往旁边跳，想躲开这兜头而下的水，免得裤子被浸透。"

# game/script day2.rpy:498
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0ed8bef7:

    # "You wouldn't exactly call his hop athletic, but he does sucessfully avoid the water!"
    "这跳跃姿势实在算不上优雅，但他总算是成功躲过了水！"

# game/script day2.rpy:500
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_85ab175e:

    # "Even if it does send him tumbling backwards right onto his backside."
    "结果他一个趔趄，向后摔了个屁股墩儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:505
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_49a2f5f4:

    # "His fall is accompanied by a sound very unlike that made by a soft, fleshy creature when it hits the deck."
    "伴随他摔倒的，发出的却不是身体撞击甲板的沉闷声响。"

# game/script day2.rpy:511
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_adc25197:

    # "A light wooden pang as an object rolls across the soaked deck."
    "一个轻微的木质撞击声，好像有什么东西在湿透的甲板上滚动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:513
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_fa2fb55b:

    # "It stops as it rolls against the scales of Julian's foot, finally giving you a proper view of it."
    "它滚动着，撞到了Julian的脚边，最终让你看清了那是什么东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:517
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_077c39ae:

    # "A fife?"
    "横笛？"

# game/script day2.rpy:519
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e3e05d64:

    # "Simple looking initially, smoothly polished wood, but the ends of it are wrapped in brass with a bit of detail on them."
    "初看其貌不扬，是光滑抛光的木头，但两端都用黄铜包裹着，还带着精致的花纹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:528
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_4175e239:

    # j "Yours?"
    j "你的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:532
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8e174062:

    # "Julian looks over at the black wolf beside him, who reaches for the instrument."
    "Julian看向他身旁的黑狼，黑狼正伸手去拿那个乐器。"

# game/script day2.rpy:541
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9efb4b57:

    # w "Yes."
    w "嗯。"

# game/script day2.rpy:550
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_26ee7cf7:

    # j "You can play an instrument?!"
    j "你会演奏乐器？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:559
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f696d953:

    # w "Yes...{w}well, a bit."
    w "是的……{w}嗯……略懂一点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:561
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5c7dbcdc:

    # w "Why is that such a surprise?{w} I didn't know it was forbidden to own an instrument."
    w "这么惊讶？{w} 难道船上还不许人带乐器了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:570
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_cdd248f9:

    # "Julian leans in a little closer to have a look at the instrument."
    "Julian稍微凑近了一点，仔细观察那个乐器。"

# game/script day2.rpy:572
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_95616329:

    # j "No, no. It's not.{w} I just didn't take you for the musically inclined type."
    j "倒也不是禁止……{w} 就是没想到你还有这方面的爱好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:574
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_75ce680d:

    # s "Not going to lie to you. I didn't expect it either, Wolf."
    s "我跟你说实话吧。我也没料到，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:576
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_713b2607:

    # j "Can you play something?"
    j "来一曲？"

# game/script day2.rpy:585
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bfeac925:

    # "Wolf's expression immediately turns into easily the most terrified you've seen him."
    "Wolf的表情瞬间变成了你见过的最惊恐的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:587
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_36649e84:

    # w "What?! I'd rather not."
    w "什么？！我不要。"

# game/script day2.rpy:596
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d9c9821e:

    # j "Oh come on. You can't just put it away without playing something for us."
    j "哦，你不能就这样收起来就完了，至少给我们演奏一段吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:598
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b33ed4cb:

    # j "Just think of what a hot property you'd be on this ship, if people knew you could play an instrument."
    j "你想想，如果大伙知道你会演奏乐器，你在船上可就成了红人了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:607
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_cafaf65b:

    # w "...And what makes you think that is what I would want?"
    w "……你凭什么觉得这是我想要的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:610
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_be38e3d9:

    # "Wolf opens the pocket of his breeches where the fife fell out and puts it back inside."
    "Wolf打开马裤的口袋，横笛就是从那里掉出来的，然后又塞了回去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:616
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d615b806:

    # s "Not even something really brief?"
    s "就算是很短的一段也不行吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:618
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f15d81d0:

    # w "As I said...I can only play a little.{w} And certainly not in front of other people..."
    w "都说了……我只会一点点。{w} 而且肯定不能在别人面前……"

# game/script day2.rpy:623
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_964fdbd9:

    # j "Why did you bring it with you then?{w} I don't think you'll have many opportunities to play it without others hearing it around here."
    j "那你还随身带着？{w} 在这船上，想躲着人偷偷吹都没机会吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:625
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1a0e1da5:

    # w "Someone gave it to me and I didn't want to leave it behind.{w} I didn't bring it with the intention of playing it."
    w "只是别人送的，舍不得扔下。{w} 我真没打算要吹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:627
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0a600aef:

    # w "However, she never had the chance to teach me."
    w "可惜她没机会教我了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:629
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2d6948e4:

    # w "All I've done so far is try to learn on my own."
    w "我到现在都只是自己摸索着学。"

# game/script day2.rpy:632
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6990c12c:

    # w "All I've done so far is try to learn on my own." nointeract
    w "我到现在都只是自己摸索着学。" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:644
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6b6fb023:

    # p "If he's not up for it, then he's not up for it."
    p "他要是不乐意，那就算了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:646
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d40e3648:

    # "Wolf nods respectfully back at you."
    "Wolf 感激地向你点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:651
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_84aa8ba0:

    # p "You said it was a gift?"
    p "你说这是个礼物？"

# game/script day2.rpy:653
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9efb4b57_1:

    # w "Yes."
    w "是的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:655
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_89a9985b:

    # p "You do appear to get a lot of gifts. The coin, the flute."
    p "你收到的礼物可真不少，又是硬币又是笛子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:657
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bc2b138e:

    # w "Fife."
    w "横笛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:659
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b702796f:

    # "He corrects you matter-of-factly."
    "他语气平淡地纠正了你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:661
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c2cab723:

    # w "Why is that so surprising?"
    w "这有什么好奇怪的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:663
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_89c426aa:

    # p "It's just,{w} and please don't take it the wrong way, but you just seem so closed off to everyone around."
    p "只是，{w} 别往心里去，但你看起来对谁都挺封闭的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:665
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6aa85af7:

    # p "To become a sailor at your age for no other reason than money...{w} Money which isn't that noteworthy of an amount in the first place."
    p "但你这年纪去当水手却只是为了钱...{w}况且这钱也没多少。"

# game/script day2.rpy:667
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_258c822f:

    # p "Yet clearly that's not all you care about."
    p "显然，你想要的肯定不止这些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:669
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_18c73e53:

    # p "It just appears like it wouldn't make sense to choose this here of all things."
    p "总感觉你选这条路，怎么想都不对劲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:671
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_80396a2c:

    # "You motion broadly around you to include the others and the ship in your point."
    "你抬手朝四周大致一挥，将其他人连同整艘船都划进了你意指的范围里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:673
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_641eeaa9:

    # "Wolf hesitates for a brief moment before he parts his lips to respond."
    "Wolf 犹豫了一下，然后才开口："

# game/script day2.rpy:678
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b3c67d0d:

    # w "Would this have been my first choice?"
    w "这是我的首选吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:680
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_66b95cc8:

    # w "No.{w} It wouldn't have been."
    w "不是。{w}从来都不是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:682
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_984517fd:

    # w "But it is what makes the most sense at the moment."
    w "但眼下，这是最合理的选择。"

# game/script day2.rpy:686
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_96365938:

    # w "I don't think you realize what a privileged position you are in.{w} With your parents waving you goodbye on the shore as you leave them to do your thing. Ready to catch you at any moment."
    w "你真是身在福中不知福。{w} 你看看你，爹妈在岸上跟你挥手告别，让你自己出来一个人闯荡，还随时可以准备接你回家。"

# game/script day2.rpy:688
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b9296778:

    # "His eyes hold onto yours until you are the one to look away."
    "他的目光紧紧地盯着你，直到你先移开视线。"

# game/script day2.rpy:693
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7d0e9d28:

    # s "He's right though. Nothing against you of course, you can't choose your position in life any more than anyone else can."
    s "不过他说得也没错。当然，我不是针对你。谁也没法选择自己的出身。"

# game/script day2.rpy:695
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8473075f:

    # p "No, I understand. I guess I get carried away sometimes."
    p "我知道。 我有时候是有上头了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:700
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bc0ed17a:

    # p "Probably because I am lucky enough to where I was able to choose this as what I wanted to do."
    p "可能是因为我足够幸运，才能选择这个作为我想做的事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:702
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_961186ad:

    # p "With the only reservation being that it might not live up to my fantasies."
    p "唯一担心的，就是现实可能没我想的那么美好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:704
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3372c276:

    # "Another accepting nod comes from the black wolf as he hunches over again to concentrate on his work."
    "黑狼再次接受地点点头，然后再次弓下身子专注于他的工作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:706
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d90973e3:

    # w "So my apologies, but for me this really is just a means to an end right now."
    w "所以抱歉了，对我来说，现在这真的只是权宜之计。"

# game/script day2.rpy:708
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5b74d85e:

    # p "But would spending time with us really change that?"
    p "但跟我们待一起，就能改变你的目的了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:713
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_af61dd5f:

    # p "You'd still get paid. You'd just have a better time doing it."
    p "工资照拿，还能更开心，何乐而不为？"

# game/script day2.rpy:715
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_be4f6718:

    # w "Am I not doing that right now? All it earns me is questions, as if I'm a book to be unraveled."
    w "我现在不就是这样吗？结果呢？换来的只有一堆问题，好像我是一本等着人来解读的书。"

# game/script day2.rpy:717
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c6faaf8e:

    # w "I can very well appreciate quiet company. You know that by now."
    w "我很享受安静，这你早就知道了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:719
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b6dc4d75:

    # w "So the one thing that would actually make my time here better, is if you'd all stop trying to rope me into things."
    w "所以，想让我在这儿待得更舒坦，你们就别再拉我下水了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:724
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2850c966:

    # w "I appreciate the thought, but I fear that now is not the time for it."
    w "谢谢你的好意，但我恐怕现在不是时候。"

# game/script day2.rpy:726
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_910a6eff:

    # p "I'm not sure I fully understand, but if that's what you want..."
    p "我不太明白你的意思，不过你要是想这样..."

# game/script day2.rpy:738
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_46590eba:

    # j "Alright. That's fair. Apologies for being pushy."
    j "好吧，这倒是公平。抱歉，我有点强人所难了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:740
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_54f5ff85:

    # j "I just thought it would be interesting to hear you play it.{w} But I guess I get not wanting to do it."
    j "我就是想听你吹一段来着，{w} 不过我明白你可能不太愿意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:744
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e024b5d4:

    # s "Yeah, [name]'s right. My bad for being pushy."
    s "是，[name]说得对。怪我太强求了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:746
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_fbbc05b6:

    # s "I can imagine how difficult it is to learn and the anxiety of feeling like ya not good enough that comes with it."
    s "我能想象学习乐器有多难，还有那种觉得自己不够好的焦虑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:753
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_fbaf20f7:

    # "Wolf glares back with obvious annoyance, his ears fold back to leave his head to take on a triangular shape."
    "Wolf怒目而视，显然很不高兴，耳朵也向后拢起，脑袋看起来都成了三角形。"

# game/script day2.rpy:755
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c6806d5c:

    # w "What is it with you people that makes it so difficult for you to understand a simple \"No\"?"
    w "你们这些人怎么回事，一个简单的“不”就这么难理解吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:760
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2aa3280a:

    # p "We don't want to make fun of you. It would just be interesting to hear you play something."
    p "我们不是要嘲笑你，就是单纯想听你吹点什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:762
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b181cb25:

    # w "And it would be a blessing to never hear you talk again."
    w "要是你们能从此闭上嘴，那可就太好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:764
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5e28b441:

    # p "I'm just saying..."
    p "我只是说说而已..."

# game/script day2.rpy:769
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_393dd418:

    # "Clearly he is not a fan of the idea..."
    "显然，他对这个提议没什么兴趣..."

# game/script day2.rpy:773
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_42248b26:

    # p "But if you ever change your mind about it..."
    p "不过，你要是哪天改变主意了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:784
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7669addc:

    # w "Unlikely. But I will let you know if that should happen."
    w "不太可能，但真要那样，我会告诉你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:786
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2d9ba112:

    # w "And you might all get your badly played 30 second long fife concert."
    w "到时候你们说不定就能听到我这蹩脚的30秒横笛演奏会了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:788
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f04056dd:

    # "After the shock earlier, you now get another first when you spot what can almost count as a smile on the black canine?"
    "经历了之前的震惊，现在你又有了新发现——这只黑狼居然笑了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:793
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d33e486c:

    # "Yet just a moment later he visibly tries to straighten his expression again."
    "但紧接着，他就又赶紧板起脸，装作若无其事的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:798
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ede3e05b:

    # s "It's going to be a great 30 seconds, I'm sure."
    s "我敢肯定，那30秒一定会“非常精彩”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:809
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2b8c6fab:

    # w "Unlikely..."
    w "不太可能..."

# game/script day2.rpy:811
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7e7cb51a:

    # "He growls in your direction."
    "他朝你低吼了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:813
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_38e305b2:

    # "Your chances probably aren't great that you'll ever get to hear him play..."
    "估计你这辈子都没啥机会听到他演奏了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:818
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_289a4a2c:

    # s "I never touched an instrument in my life, so anyone who can play anything appears like a magician to me."
    s "我这辈子都没碰过乐器，所以在我看来，会乐器的人都跟魔法师一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:828
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6e3ee3b5:

    # j "Never even touched one?"
    j "一次都没碰过？"

# game/script day2.rpy:837
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9daf8cf3:

    # s "No, never. Have you?"
    s "一次都没有。你碰过吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:846
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_741f1414:

    # j "Of course. The fife too, actually. It's small enough to hide, which comes in handy..."
    j "当然。我还真会吹横笛，而且它够小，方便藏..."

# game/script day2.rpy:848
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_488276c1:

    # j "You've really never even touched one?"
    j "你真的连碰都没碰过？"

# game/script day2.rpy:850
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_50287f5c:

    # "He tilts his head to the side as he asks once again."
    "他歪着头，又问了一遍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:859
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_257b8318:

    # s "No, Julian. Do ya know how expensive instruments are?{w} Not everyone grows up like you."
    s "Julian，你知道乐器有多贵吗？{w} 又不是所有人都能像你一样，在蜜罐里长大。"

# game/script day2.rpy:861
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_07df792a:

    # s "In fact, most don't, if your dad is as high ranking as you made him sound."
    s "事实上，要是你爹真像你说的那样位高权重，那大多数人都和你不一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:863
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_490f7bb7:

    # s "For many of us we had to work to support the families we grew up in. I know I did, and [name] has mentioned his family's homestead."
    s "我们大多数人都得挣钱养家糊口。我就是，[name]也提到过他家的农场。"

# game/script day2.rpy:867
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_dc7606bf:

    # s "It doesn't leave a lot of time for leisurely fancies like instruments. Not to mention finding someone to teach ya in the first place."
    s "哪有时间学乐器这种闲情逸致。更别说还得找人教你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:869
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0ef41a86:

    # w "That's true. It does sound like you grew up in a pretty privileged environment."
    w "说的也是。听着你以前的生活条件挺优越啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:878
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f082c053:

    # j "I guess I never thought of it that way."
    j "我倒从没这么想过。"

# game/script day2.rpy:880
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5c1ac73e:

    # "Julian thinks quietly for a moment."
    "Julian安静地想了想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:882
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1d1c332f:

    # p "Why'd you have to hide them? Did you grow up in a house with unruly siblings?"
    p "你干嘛藏着它们？你小时候家里是不是有熊孩子啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:884
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_10c5ea61:

    # p "Always going after your things and handling with the utter disregard for it that only siblings can?"
    p "就是那种老是抢你东西，还死活不当回事的熊孩子？"

# game/script day2.rpy:888
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_268e1a2d:

    # "He snaps out of his contemplation and leans against the nearby railing."
    "他从沉思中回过神，靠在了旁边的栏杆上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:890
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b8f72b52:

    # j "No, it was my father. He didn't approve of such \"unmanly\" things as making music."
    j "不，是我父亲。他看不惯玩音乐这种“娘娘腔”的玩意儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:892
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_95121e86:

    # "Immediately you feel a pang of guilt for delving into the subject."
    "一问到这个，你立马觉得有点内疚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:894
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_043bf40e:

    # j "I always wanted to play the violin instead, but you can't really stuff a violin into the hole of a tree trunk."
    j "我倒是想拉小提琴来着，可没法把小提琴塞进树洞里啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:896
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_66303d55:

    # j "A fife is cheap enough that I was able to buy one with my own money without anyone noticing or asking about the money.{w} And it's small enough to hide."
    j "横笛挺便宜的，我攒了点钱，偷偷摸摸就买了，谁也没注意，也没人问钱的事儿。{w} 而且它够小，能藏起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:900
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_cdbf0f8b:

    # "You must look a bit awkward as you try to find the right moment to speak up while Julian was talking."
    "看Julian在那儿叭叭，你瞅准机会想插话，样子肯定挺局促的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:902
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_849f6222:

    # p "I'm sorry. You had your own troubles, it sounds like."
    p "抱歉啊。听上去你也有你的难处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:904
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0f2c8cee:

    # p "It wasn't my intention to belittle them."
    p "我不是想贬低你的意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:908
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_addb81f3:

    # "Julian returns a smile to you."
    "Julian对你笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:910
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_981dcd1e:

    # j "It's all right."
    j "没事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:919
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_54392a66:

    # s "At least you managed to find a way to get 'round it."
    s "至少你还是找到了门路。"

# game/script day2.rpy:930
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0b931678:

    # p "I expected nothing less from a troublemaker like you."
    p "就你这捣蛋鬼，我早该想到的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:934
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3fc4f924:

    # j "Troublemaker?"
    j "捣蛋鬼？"

# game/script day2.rpy:936
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e67846fe:

    # p "You know who you are.{w} Mr. Locked in the Castle's Food Storage."
    p "你自己心里清楚。 城堡食品储藏室里的那位大盗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:938
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_4c5c1d1f:

    # p "\"We stuffed ourselves all night long\" and \"Took a bite out of everything within reach.\""
    p "“我们可吃了一整个晚上”，还“逮着什么啃什么”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:940
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b16cc555:

    # "You rattle off the bits of the story that have stuck in your memory."
    "你七零八落地回忆着那些还记得的片段。"

# game/script day2.rpy:944
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c5d5b0ba:

    # j "Look. That is not being a troublemaker. What that is, is just making the most of an opportunity!"
    j "喂，我说。那可不是捣蛋。那叫充分利用机会！"

# game/script day2.rpy:948
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5bc4eeec:

    # "He replies and flicks the tip of his tail excitedly behind him across the wooden floor."
    "他一边说着，一边兴奋地用尾巴尖扫着木地板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:950
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_63daf115:

    # j "The troublemaker part is only attached to it when the adults catch you and spoil the fun."
    j "只有大人抓住你，坏了你的好事儿，你才会被叫做捣蛋鬼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:959
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7eed8994:

    # s "Very true."
    s "确实是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:961
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ed49d7de:

    # s "But you were asking for it."
    s "但你也是自找的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:963
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1a19eb39:

    # p "And paid the price."
    p "结果也付出了代价。"

# game/script day2.rpy:973
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_be57d642:

    # w "Did he get his ass beaten?"
    w "他屁股开花了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:975
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9cb14a76:

    # "Wolf jumps in with what sounds perhaps a little too much eagerness."
    "Wolf一听这话，立马跳出来，听着还挺兴奋。"

# game/script day2.rpy:977
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bb0eb3b2:

    # w "Please tell me he got his ass beaten."
    w "告诉我，他是不是被打得满地找牙了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:981
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5e1d6b18:

    # j "Wolf, no. You weren't there when I told the story. You don-"
    j "Wolf，别闹。你又没听我讲故事。你——"

# game/script day2.rpy:986
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_dd61efa1:

    # p "Oh you bet! It was what we were waiting for all story long!"
    p "那当然！我们等的就是这个！"

# game/script day2.rpy:988
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_871b4f7c:

    # p "I would have felt robbed of my valuable time if the ending would have been any different."
    p "如果结局不是这样，我宝贵的时间就白费了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:993
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1fad932a:

    # "Wolf looks ever so pleased when he hears that."
    "Wolf 听了这话，得意洋洋的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:998
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_93440d49:

    # w "At least others get to fulfill my dreams."
    w "至少我的梦想能让别人实现。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1002
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_12b7f8a7:

    # j "Stop being so cruel to me, Wolf!"
    j "别这么损我，Wolf！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1007
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_62e09fa0:

    # "Wolf smirks with a glimpse of his teeth showing through his lips."
    "Wolf 嘴角一勾，露出一丝坏笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1009
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8506c693:

    # w "If you'd stop being such an idiot then maybe I wouldn't have to wish for it."
    w "你要是不那么蠢，我就不用盼着他倒霉了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1019
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d916f1b6:

    # p "Speaking of idiot though."
    p "说到蠢货。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1025
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b58dd64f:

    # j "Not you too."
    j "不是吧你也？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1027
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d7214cbc:

    # p "Could you not play something, Julian?"
    p "Julian，你就不能消停会儿吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1037
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bac14895:

    # p "Speaking of which.{w} Could you not play something, Julian?"
    p "说起来。{w} Julian，你就不能消停会儿吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1048
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bac14895_1:

    # p "Speaking of which.{w} Could you not play something, Julian?"
    p "说起来。{w} Julian，你就不能消停会儿吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1052
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c9f37838:

    # j "I suppose I could. If Wolf is fine with it?"
    j "倒也不是不行。Wolf 没意见吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1065
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_15bac0cb:

    # "You turn around to Wolf to hear what he thinks of it."
    "你转头看向 Wolf，想听听他的意见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1067
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c58b7305:

    # "You can tell from his expression that he doesn't seem all too sure about it."
    "看他的表情，好像不太情愿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1069
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ea4c83c6:

    # p "Just for a minute."
    p "就一小会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1074
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_594387c9:

    # w "Fine..."
    w "行吧..."

# game/script day2.rpy:1078
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a2cf40e2:

    # "He reaches into the pocket on the side of his trousers and takes out the instrument."
    "他伸手进口袋，掏出了那支横笛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1080
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7c87bd7e:

    # w "Here. Just... be careful with it."
    w "拿着。小心点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1089
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b00df0d7:

    # "Julian takes the offered fife and looks at it more closely. He turns it between his fingers to get a view of every side."
    "Julian 接过横笛，仔细端详。他用手指转动着，细细打量。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1091
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5e4ace8e:

    # j "Of course."
    j "当然。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1095
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_70a06223:

    # j "It looks really nice.{w} You've taken good care of it."
    j "真漂亮。{w} 你保养得真好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1106
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b715e8df:

    # "Wolf doesn't stop watching Julian for even a second, but some of the tension in his body appears to dissipate at the compliment."
    "Wolf 眼睛一眨不眨地盯着 Julian，但听到夸奖，身体的紧绷似乎放松了些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1108
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8ba3cd84:

    # w "Of course."
    w "当然。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1110
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d0f6e239:

    # j "It certainly looks a lot nicer than the one I've got.{w} They're simple instruments usually, so it's nice to see one with some detail."
    j "确实比我的那支好多了。{w} 横笛这玩意儿通常都很朴素，难得看到这么精致的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1112
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_613858a9:

    # "He let his claw run along one of the decorative lines stamped into the metal."
    "他的爪子轻轻划过压在金属上的装饰纹路。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1114
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8c1f6c8d:

    # "Every now and then the tip of it catches in the lines and is guided along them."
    "爪尖偶尔会卡在线条里，顺着纹路滑动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1116
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_de4a10ab:

    # w "Thank you."
    w "谢谢你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1118
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e92f26ec:

    # "After a visual inspection Julian raises the instrument to his mouth, he takes a breath and begins to blow over it gently."
    "仔细观察了一番后，Julian 将横笛放到嘴边，深吸一口气，轻轻吹了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1120
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_341cf9cc:

    # "He tries one or two notes at first, just to get a feel for it. All under the watchful eyes of the three of you."
    "他先试着吹了一两个音，找找感觉。你们三个都目不转睛地看着他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1122
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_bdba2c55:

    # "When he seems comfortable enough he begins to play in earnest. Fingers dancing along the length of the instrument."
    "感觉差不多了，他就认真地吹奏起来。手指在横笛上飞快地跳动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1127
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_dc4a1470:

    # "The tone is rather shrill at first, but he adjusts his playing until he manages to soften it."
    "一开始音调有些刺耳，但他调整了一下指法，总算让声音柔和了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1131
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b33a11ab:

    # "Immediately the lizard appears to become one with the music he plays, finding the rhythm and soon after a subtle sway goes through his whole body."
    "那蜥蜴仿佛瞬间和他的音乐融为了一体，找到了节奏，全身都跟着轻轻摇摆起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1133
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a224f431:

    # "You don't recognize the music he plays, but it was a more simple piece. Something rather easy on the ear."
    "你听不出他吹的是什么曲子，不过挺简单的，听着也挺舒服。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1135
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_067ff47e:

    # "Samuel catches your eye and nods respectfully. Apparently someone else who is quite impressed with some of the tricks Julian has hidden away!"
    "Samuel朝你看来，恭敬地点了点头。看来他也对Julian藏的那些小花招挺佩服！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1137
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_4be0294f:

    # "As promised though, he stops again after playing for a little while and hands the fife back to Wolf."
    "不过，就像说好的那样，他吹了一小会儿就停了下来，把横笛还给了Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1139
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_212973a8:

    # s "Not bad. Not bad at all!"
    s "不错啊，真不错！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1145
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9a6fb353:

    # j "Thank you."
    j "谢谢你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1147
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1311fe48:

    # p "I agree! It sounded great!"
    p "我也觉得！吹得太棒了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1149
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_364b86b8:

    # "Julian laughs, trying to play down just how much he appears to drink in the praise leveled at his playing."
    "Julian笑了笑，想掩饰自己其实对这些赞美有多么受用。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1151
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1124ec66:

    # j "Thank you. It's a silly marching song, but it's what you hear the most when you live in a fort."
    j "谢谢夸奖。就是首傻乎乎的进行曲，不过住在堡垒里天天听，想忘都忘不掉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1153
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9f3fa77d:

    # j "So I learned to play it after hearing it over and over again."
    j "所以听多了，自然而然就会吹了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1157
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9e9b642f:

    # w "You are certainly ahead of what I'm able to do with it."
    w "你吹得可比我好多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1159
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f1c9c03c:

    # j "Ah, does that matter?{w} The fact that you learn it at all is what counts."
    j "嗨，这有什么要紧的？{w} 学会了就是好事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1161
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2f1fb184:

    # "Julian says, probably finding the first non-confrontational words he ever said to Wolf."
    "Julian说道，这大概是他头一次不那么带火药味地跟Wolf说话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1163
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2d965b55:

    # j "Especially if you have no one to teach you."
    j "尤其是在没人教你的情况下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1165
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_4d1b68b3:

    # j "Are you sure you don't want to play something?"
    j "你真不打算试试？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1174
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d9709c4f:

    # "Wolf still holds onto the instrument and must have been thinking about it for a moment, but decides to stash it away again."
    "Wolf还拿着横笛，估计是刚才一直在琢磨，但最后还是决定收起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1179
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_61ca7b10:

    # w "I'd rather not."
    w "我还是算了吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1181
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_697cbad2:

    # p "If you can play, Julian, couldn't you teach him?"
    p "Julian，既然你会吹，要不你教教他？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1186
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_21b17e19:

    # "Wolf's ears snap in your direction and once again the anxiety from earlier returns across his features."
    "Wolf的耳朵立刻转向你这边，之前的焦虑又回到了他的脸上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1188
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f379bff2:

    # p "If he's never had some-"
    p "如果他从来没接触过..."

# game/script day2.rpy:1190
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_adbb7ea4:

    # w "What?! No!" with vpunch
    w "什么？！不要！" with vpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:1192
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6310eaa3:

    # j "I probably could."
    j "我应该可以。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1194
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3ea2a9b3:

    # p "What? Why not? You're going to have a lot of time to fill.{w} So why not fill it with this?"
    p "为什么不呢？反正你闲着也是闲着。{w} 不如用这个打发时间？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1199
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_50a3a263:

    # "His eyebrows furrow and he hesitates for a moment."
    "他皱着眉头，犹豫了一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1201
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_750a352c:

    # w "I think you are overestimating how much I would enjoy spending time with him."
    w "我觉得你太看得起我了，我可不觉得跟他待在一起是件享受的事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1205
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2e0c1823:

    # w "Or rather enduring time with him."
    w "应该说是，我得忍受和他在一起的时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1215
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_49fc9cf2:

    # j "Really?{w} I appreciate the kind words for wanting to help..."
    j "真的吗？{w} 感谢你好意啊..."

# game/script day2.rpy:1224
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d691955b:

    # s "I mean, have you actually stopped to listen to yourself when you're around him?"
    s "我是说，你跟他待在一起的时候，有没有好好听听自己都说了些什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1226
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2c2ba663:

    # s "Can't exactly blame Wolf for thinking that you'd be annoying as a teacher."
    s "Wolf觉得你当老师会很烦人，这也怪不得他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1235
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3f0bdb2c:

    # j "Just because I'm joking around every now and then doesn't mean that I can't be serious when it's needed."
    j "我是偶尔会开开玩笑，但这不代表我正经不起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1237
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7dd63ec8:

    # "Julian's tail slithers over the ground and curls around where he is sitting."
    "Julian的尾巴在地上蜿蜒滑动，蜷在他坐的地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1239
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d01ce880:

    # j "And teaching him would be such a time."
    j "而且教他得花不少时间呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1248
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b0a4de15:

    # s "Yeah, but who's gonna believe it?"
    s "是啊，但是谁会相信呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1257
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_de6be545:

    # j "Fine, fuck me, I guess. Nobody {i}has{/i} to.{w} I'm just making a genuine offer to help."
    j "好吧，算我多管闲事。又没人{i}逼{/i}我。{w}我就是真心想帮个忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1267
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3df499f8:

    # s "All I'm saying is that it's understandable why he might be hesitant to take ya up on it."
    s "我就是觉得，他不太好意思接受，也正常。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1272
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_873bde43:

    # "Wolf speaks up with a hint of exasperation to his words."
    "Wolf有点不耐烦地说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1274
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_493b1f94:

    # w "Could you stop talking about me in the third person so that we can get this done here?"
    w "能不能别搞得好像我不在这里一样说我？赶紧干活吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1279
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_01256ef1:

    # "Samuel already has an empty bucket ready to get more water from the sea."
    "Samuel已经准备好了一个空桶，准备从海里取更多的水。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1281
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_35f67fe2:

    # p "That's probably for the best...I feel like I have made a mistake for even suggesting it."
    p "可能还是别提的好...我真不该多嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1283
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b87fc603:

    # w "You haven't."
    w "你没有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1285
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ce46ce70:

    # "Slowly Samuel drags the now filled bucket up along the outside of the hull of the ship. Once it's back in his paws he provides the rest of you with more water to soak the boards of the deck in."
    "Samuel费劲地把装满水的桶沿着船舷拖上来。桶一回到他手里，他就分给大家更多的水，用来冲刷甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1288
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e1e91780:

    # "You feel the sting of saltwater in your eye as a drop of it splashes up and hits you."
    "当一滴海水溅起并击中你时，你感觉到眼睛里有海水的刺痛感。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1290
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_74714c09:

    # "You raise your hand to rub your eye and continue your work of scrubbing the deck of the ship."
    "你抬起手揉了揉眼睛，继续擦洗船的甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1301
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2db13885:

    # "As time goes on and you slowly make your way across the deck you find yourself working close to Wolf and out of earshot of the others."
    "渐渐地，你挪到了Wolf旁边，其他人也听不见你们说话了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1303
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d1a24b89:

    # p "You really don't want to give him a chance?"
    p "你真的不想给他一个机会吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1307
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5fc660f1:

    # "It takes a while before Wolf answers, but you can see that he's clearly thinking about your question as he works."
    "Wolf过了好一会儿才吭声，看得出来他一边干活，一边琢磨你的问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1309
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c699575f:

    # "With an almost defeated sigh he stops and sits down to answer."
    "他叹了口气，好像被打败了一样，停下手里的活儿坐下来说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1313
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_876f110f:

    # w "What are you trying to accomplish here?"
    w "你到底想搞什么鬼？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1315
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3ef5d8ec:

    # p "Isn't that clear? You want to learn to play the instrument. Julian can play it.{w} Is there so much of a mystery about it?"
    p "这不明摆着吗？你想学乐器，Julian会吹。{w}这有什么难理解的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1317
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_be876c45:

    # p "It clearly means something to you."
    p "这对你来说显然意义重大。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1319
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_237bcf3f:

    # w "Yes, but..."
    w "是，但是……"

# game/script day2.rpy:1321
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e92ad233:

    # "He glances over to Julian, who just like you two, is scooting around on his knees and more or less diligently going after his task."
    "他瞥了眼Julian，那家伙正和你们一样，跪在地上，吭哧吭哧地干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1323
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d850699e:

    # p "Did you see how he played? Or when he looked at the fife?"
    p "你看到他吹笛子的时候了吗？还有他看笛子的眼神？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1325
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8bb4a5b1:

    # w "And?"
    w "然后呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1327
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9d51054e:

    # p "He clearly loves it.{w} Playing it and making music, I mean."
    p "他是真爱那玩意儿。{w}爱吹笛子，爱音乐。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1329
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9fbc35a3:

    # p "He can be a bit of an idiot, sure, but I think he seriously would enjoy having more opportunities to play."
    p "当然，他可能有点傻气，但我觉得他确实会喜欢有更多发挥的机会。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1333
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0c4f2db1:

    # w "Again...what are you trying to achieve here?"
    w "再说一遍...你到底想干嘛？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1335
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a9f104ec:

    # p "What are you afraid to lose?"
    p "你怕失去什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1340
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_102a2d32:

    # "The black canine remains silent and looks over to Julian once more."
    "那只黑犬沉默不语，又看了Julian一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1342
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_4f212639:

    # p "Just give it a go. Worst case, I'm wrong and you have to put up with him for 10 minutes before you've had enough."
    p "试试呗。大不了我错了，你忍他十分钟就够了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1344
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6657715a:

    # p "That's not gonna kill you, is it?"
    p "又不会搞死你，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1349
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3dc380cf:

    # "He rolls his eyes and goes back to work, and after a few moments you assume he's just doing the same old thing, trying to ignore you."
    "他翻了个白眼，回去干活了，你还以为他还是老样子，想不理你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1351
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0bfe3679:

    # "But on closer inspection, you notice he looks rather deep in thought again."
    "但仔细观察，你发现他又陷入了沉思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1353
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_4436c877:

    # w "Maybe I could."
    w "也许我可以。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1355
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2c65fc38:

    # w "Just...{w} don't make it a habit of trying to convince me, all right?"
    w "就...{w}别老想着说服我，行不行？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1357
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e34f09e7:

    # "You smile warmly and your tail flicks a little more animatedly behind you."
    "你温柔一笑，身后的尾巴也更加欢快地摇摆起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1359
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_455c0f33:

    # p "Only when I think it's a good idea.{w} Or did I try to push you to play it?"
    p "除非我觉得主意不错。{w} 或者说，我逼你玩了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1363
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0c00ced5:

    # w "Just what I feared...you're starting to assume you know what's best for me..."
    w "真让我担心……你是不是开始自以为是，觉得什么都为我好了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:1367
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a8d005fc:

    # "Before you can respond, a call from Samuel draws your attention as the maned wolf calls you to come over."
    "还没等你回应，Samuel叫住了你，那只鬃狼让你过去一趟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1378
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3aefd73b:

    # "You and Wolf do as you're told and rejoin with the other two."
    "你和Wolf照做，回到他们俩身边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1395
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_23e0d84f:

    # "Before he even speaks, his disagreement is clearly visible on his face."
    "他还没开口，脸上就写满了不赞同。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1397
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_39beed99:

    # w "Why would I?"
    w "我为什么要那样做？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1399
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d4665b44:

    # p "Really? It's just for a minute."
    p "真的假的？就耽误一分钟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1401
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f27a114c:

    # p "He can't exactly run off with it, can he?"
    p "他又不能拿着东西跑了，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1403
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_84789747:

    # s "Careful now..."
    s "小心点……"

# game/script day2.rpy:1405
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7b91b3b3:

    # "Wolf bends down again and pushes the stone across the now only slightly damp deck, as most of the water has already evaporated."
    "Wolf又弯下腰，推着石头在甲板上擦拭，现在甲板只有一点点潮湿了，大部分水都蒸发掉了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1407
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b6cd059d:

    # w "I don't like having lizard gunk all over it."
    w "我可不喜欢这玩意儿沾上蜥蜴的脏东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1411
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_501c3eb4:

    # w "It's too important for that."
    w "这东西很重要，不能弄脏了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1413
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_37772dba:

    # "Julian frowns and, like Wolf, continues to scrub the deck."
    "Julian皱着眉，也像Wolf一样，继续擦洗甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1427
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_120a0c95:

    # j "Fine. If you want to be like that, mutt."
    j "行。你非要这样是吧，杂种。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1434
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_61d2751c:

    # "Wolf snaps back immediately and smashes the stone he was working with on the deck." with vpunch
    "Wolf立刻顶了回去，一把将手里的磨石砸在了甲板上。" with vpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:1436
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_54536e20:

    # w "Yes. I'm going to be like that!"
    w "没错。我就是要！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1440
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_40115c0e:

    # w "Because you two do nothing but get into my business."
    w "还不是因为你们两个老爱管我的事！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1442
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8e6e28d1:

    # w "And you won't fucking take no for an answer!"
    w "而且你们他妈的就没想过别人说不要就算了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1444
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_fa72cb2a:

    # "He exhales audibly and looks at the holystone, as if considering flinging the thing at Julian."
    "他重重地呼出一口气，看着那块磨石，好像在考虑要不要把这玩意儿朝Julian扔过去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1446
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_299b43b2:

    # w "That's why."
    w "这就是为什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1448
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0d313fd0:

    # j "Oh shut it."
    j "噢，滚吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1450
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_edfb2e31:

    # w "Now let's get this shit over with so that I can try my best to avoid you two."
    w "赶紧把这破事儿弄完，我好尽量离你和这混球远点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1452
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d38b82d6:

    # "He nods in your direction. His eyes so firmly locked with yours that you end up looking away."
    "他朝你点点头，眼神却死死地盯着你，你只好尴尬地移开视线。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1454
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_86d425d8:

    # s "Quiet! All of you."
    s "都给我安静点！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1460
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_61abf916:

    # "Samuel watches you and the other two with his arms crossed over his chest."
    "Samuel抱着胳膊，看着你和其他两个人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1462
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_57dfc03a:

    # "He stands up, making even his small stature look imposing from your point of view."
    "他站起身来，在你看来，即使是他矮小的身材也显得气势逼人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1467
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_756d8d9f:

    # s "I think you're all forgetting where we are, and while I may not have as tight a leash as Arthur, if that means that you all will act like this, then I may have to do things differently."
    s "我想各位是忘了自己在哪儿了吧。我管束可能没Arthur那么严厉，但如果你们非要这样，我可就要换个方式管教你们了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1469
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7dc99410:

    # s "Because I'm not sure how tenable it is to refrain from punishment if this is how you all end up whenever you're working together."
    s "要是你们每次一起干活都这样，我可没法保证一直忍着不罚你们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1475
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7964cfdd:

    # "He pauses to look at each of you, infusing the moment of silence with even more tension."
    "他停顿了一下，目光扫过你们每一个人，空气都变得更加紧张。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1477
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ff89f39f:

    # s "It's in your best interest to figure it out quick.{w} I can guarantee that."
    s "我劝你们最好快点搞清楚状况，{w} 我可不是在开玩笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1479
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_fbbbe5c4:

    # s "If it means not talking. Then ya won't talk.{w} But I won't have your disruptions escalate into fights or other disobediences."
    s "要是不想说话，那就都闭嘴！{w} 我可不会让你们的瞎胡闹搞成斗殴或者其他违规行为。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1481
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_501cca51:

    # s "Are we clear on that?"
    s "听明白了没有？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1483
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_02cb606c:

    # "He looks from one of you to the next, searching for some sign of understanding.{w} You nod your head when it's your turn."
    "他挨个看着你们，想从你们脸上看出是否听懂了。{w} 轮到你时，你点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1485
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_963f7586:

    # "The silence lingers on until Samuel finally speaks again. Apparently satisfied for now."
    "沉默持续了一会儿，直到Samuel再次开口，看来暂时还算满意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1487
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ae1c19a3:

    # s "Very well."
    s "很好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1489
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_f9b042cd:

    # s "Let's try it right away, shall we? I don't want to hear a word."
    s "那咱们现在就开始试试？我不想听到任何声音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1491
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_641c2c8e:

    # "Not a word is said in return."
    "没有人回应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1493
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_dbe19bd2:

    # "Instead Samuel begins to pull up another bucket of water from the sea and empties it right in front of you."
    "Samuel二话不说，又从海里提了一桶水，直接泼在你面前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1497
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e1e91780_1:

    # "You feel the sting of saltwater in your eye as a drop of it splashes up and hits you."
    "当一滴海水溅起并击中你时，你感觉到眼睛里有海水的刺痛感。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1499
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_74714c09_1:

    # "You raise your hand to rub your eye and continue your work of scrubbing the deck of the ship."
    "你抬起手揉了揉眼睛，继续擦洗船的甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1508
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_27ad48f4:

    # j "Fine. If you want to be like that."
    j "行啊，你要是想这样，那就这样吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1510
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_449dbd8d:

    # w "Yes. I will be like that."
    w "我乐意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1512
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_11a88389:

    # "Samuel begins to pull up another bucket of water from the sea and empties it right in front of you."
    "Samuel再次从海里提了一桶水，泼在你面前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1516
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_e1e91780_2:

    # "You feel the sting of saltwater in your eye as a drop of it splashes up and hits you."
    "当一滴海水溅起并击中你时，你感觉到眼睛里有海水的刺痛感。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1518
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_03552867:

    # "You raise your hand to rub your eye and continue your work alongside the others."
    "你抬手揉了揉眼睛，继续和大家一起干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1522
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5f0cc393:

    # s "Be careful, all o' ya."
    s "都给我小心点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1524
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_624faf47:

    # s "Ya don't have to be best friends, but be aware that active hostility is not tolerated."
    s "我不指望你们能成为好朋友，但记住，我不允许你们之间有任何敌对行为。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1526
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a34f3c93:

    # s "Our superiors may not be as strict as military officers. But they won't be afraid to punish you if you cross the line."
    s "我们的上级可能没有军队的长官那么严苛，但要是你们敢越界，他们可不会手下留情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1528
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a40c95a8:

    # s "Got that?"
    s "听懂了没？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1533
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_66e43465:

    # "You nod in return, and both Julian and Wolf express their understanding."
    "你点点头，Julian和Wolf也表示明白。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1537
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8fdebf27:

    # s "Good.{w} I try not to be too strict, but as of right now you are still under my command. So I'd appreciate it if it doesn't escalate to the point where it would reflect badly on me."
    s "很好。{w} 我也不想太严厉，但现在你们还是归我管。我希望你们别闹出什么事来，让我跟着倒霉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1539
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b2b4cbb9:

    # p "Understood."
    p "明白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1541
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_585f89a9:

    # "All your voices fall silent for a while, and nothing but the scrubbing of the stone replaces them."
    "一时间，所有人都闭上了嘴，只剩下擦洗甲板的声音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1543
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6af69ed7:

    # "Now and then a larger wave breaks against the bow of the ship, but nothing disruptive enough to interrupt your work."
    "偶尔会有大浪拍打在船头，但并不足以影响你们的工作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1547
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c9d56379:

    # "Another bucket of seawater is emptied across the deck as you work your way along it."
    "又一桶海水泼洒在甲板上，你们继续擦洗着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1549
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b0c98178:

    # "The silence continues until Julian finally breaks it."
    "沉默持续了一段时间，最终Julian打破了沉默。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1558
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9ddddd60:

    # j "Maybe that's what I'll spend some of the wages on."
    j "也许我会用这笔工钱买点什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1560
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3d6763b4:

    # p "Huh?"
    p "啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1562
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_d17c47f1:

    # j "Well, a fife. When we dock at the next port."
    j "嗯，买根横笛。等咱们下次靠岸的时候再说吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1571
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_fc0a45b0:

    # s "Feeling the urge now?"
    s "现在就想要了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1576
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0bc0f418:

    # "Wolf moves away from the rest of you as you progress. Not surprising that he prefers the quieter end of the deck."
    "你们继续往前走，Wolf 离你们越来越远。他喜欢待在甲板安静的地方，这倒也不奇怪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1583
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ddd14f92:

    # j "A little bit, yeah. I should have remembered to bring it..."
    j "是有点。我应该记得带上的……"

# game/script day2.rpy:1588
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7296867a:

    # j "But it's too late for that now."
    j "不过现在说这些都晚了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1590
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b863f1d2:

    # j "What's the next port again? Mo-something..."
    j "下个港口叫什么来着？摩……什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1592
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a762ac72:

    # p "Mogador.{w} In Morocco."
    p "墨加多尔，在摩洛哥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1596
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_76692c80:

    # j "You really remembered that?"
    j "你居然还记得？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1600
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1d35966f:

    # "You laugh and sit up from your hunched position."
    "你笑着坐直了身子，不再蜷缩着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1602
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c8e46b46:

    # p "Of course. That's part of what I'm looking forward to."
    p "当然，我也很期待的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1606
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_dc9260c8:

    # p "Seeing places that aren't just my home town.{w} A bit of an adventure."
    p "看看家乡以外的地方嘛。也算是一场小冒险。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1613
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8fdcd61c:

    # s "Just don't get too excited.{w} Harbor districts are notorious for trying to make you part with your wages."
    s "别太激动了。港口那地方，最喜欢的就是怎么榨干你口袋里的钱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1615
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_45df6eaa:

    # s "They know exactly what you want after a few weeks out at sea, and they're happy to take the coin you're bringing along."
    s "他们太清楚水手们在海上憋了几个星期后想要什么了，肯定会想方设法掏空你的钱包。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1622
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_87fd46bc:

    # j "Do they have fifes over there?"
    j "那边有卖横笛的吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1629
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3cf5fef1:

    # "Samuel needs a moment to process the question."
    "Samuel 愣了一下，似乎在思考这个问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1631
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_eb619674:

    # s "Uh..."
    s "嗯……"

# game/script day2.rpy:1638
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b3bccf4a:

    # j "Do they even play them over there? They might use different instruments.{w} Maybe I won't find any..."
    j "他们那边会吹横笛吗？说不定用的是别的乐器呢。可能我什么都找不到……"

# game/script day2.rpy:1645
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7a0dd6ac:

    # s "Uhm... I don't know. I was talking more about taverns, brothels, expensive places to sleep... that sort of thing."
    s "嗯……我不太清楚。我说的更多的是酒馆、窑子、还有那些死贵的旅馆……之类的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1652
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7f1ea483:

    # j "Oh. Wait. Are you saying those are bad?{w} Because they sound pretty good to me?"
    j "噢。等等。你是说那些地方不好吗？我听着感觉还行啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1654
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8cac2b4a:

    # j "Well, perhaps not the expensive beds, but brothels and taverns? What's wrong with them?"
    j "算了，贵的旅馆咱不去，但窑子和酒馆怎么了？有什么问题吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1661
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_29c7d5f2:

    # "Samuel waves the lizard off with a flick of his wrist."
    "Samuel 像赶苍蝇似的挥了挥手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1663
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0c67f9c3:

    # s "I'm not telling ya how to live your life. They just know that you are who you are and that you come to the port with money to spend."
    s "我又不是教你做人。他们就是知道你这种人，带着钱来港口找乐子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1670
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_1c635400:

    # j "So you're not coming along for a night full of drinks, Sam?"
    j "这么说，你是不打算跟我们一起去喝个痛快了，Sam？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1677
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_42be1f84:

    # s "Drinks perhaps.{w} But not, if at some point during the night, ya just going to bugger off and leave me with nothing but the mental image of...{w}whatever it is you're planning to do with the girl you paid for."
    s "喝点倒也行。不过你要是半夜偷偷溜走，只留下我一个人在那儿浮想联翩……想着你花钱找的姑娘……"

# game/script day2.rpy:1684
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_5b2b3e6f:

    # j "Really? You? A prude?"
    j "真的假的？你？这么老古董？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1693
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7996bf7e:

    # s "No, but I'm not at the point where I want to carry the burden of {i}those{/i} mental images with me every time I pass you."
    s "倒也不是，但我可不想每次见到你，脑子里就浮现出{i}那些{/i}乱七八糟的画面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1695
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9852b74f:

    # s "Neither of you."
    s "你们俩都一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1697
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c3f23ad4:

    # "He says, looking at you with an accusatory glance."
    "他斜着眼看你，那眼神就差没直接说你犯事儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1699
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6f152974:

    # p "I didn't say anything!"
    p "我可啥都没说啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1701
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_767df0cc:

    # s "I'm just including you as a precaution.{w} I know how you young, pent up, sailors are when we stop in port."
    s "我就是提前防着你一手。{w} 我还不了解你们这些年轻气盛的小水手，一靠岸就按捺不住。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1708
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_3f9c294d:

    # j "You are no more than a handful of years older. So you know this froooom{w} experience?"
    j "你也就比我大那么几岁。怎么着，这是过来人的经验之谈？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1715
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7aa16cb9:

    # s "Shut up."
    s "闭嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1722
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_c50ae591:

    # j "I'll take that as a yes."
    j "就当你默认了啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1729
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_79277381:

    # s "You really are a lost cause, Jules."
    s "你真是烂泥扶不上墙，Jules。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1736
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0126078c:

    # j "You started it by talking about brothels. Don't pawn it off on me now that I'm thinking about where that knowledge comes from."
    j "还不是你先聊窑子！现在我开始琢磨你这些门道是从哪儿学来的，你倒想甩锅给我了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1740
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6e434afb:

    # j "Not that it's anything to be ashamed about. I'm sure you had plenty of fun when you did."
    j "当然，这也没啥不好意思的。想必你当年也乐在其中吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1742
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_578f0af2:

    # "Samuel takes one of the full buckets and instead of emptying it out in front of you he instead makes sure to spill most of it over Julian."
    "Samuel抄起一个装满水的水桶，没往你这儿倒，反而对着Julian一顿猛泼，大半桶都招呼他身上了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1747
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_0d382172:

    # "Julian is unable to get out of the way quickly enough and gets thoroughly drenched, and even as an innocent bystander you get your fair share of water over yourself."
    "Julian躲闪不及，彻底湿透，就连我这个无辜的倒霉蛋，也跟着挨了不少水。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1749
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_cf08b1aa:

    # "Immediately the chill of it sets in with the breeze that comes across the deck."
    "海风一吹，瞬间就感觉冷飕飕的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1751
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_cd88fbb2:

    # j "Hey!"
    j "喂！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1758
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_2f703010:

    # s "Shut up. You needed to cool off."
    s "闭嘴。给你降降温。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1760
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_25986f1e:

    # p "Did I need it too, though?!"
    p "那我也需要降温吗？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1762
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7c503f19:

    # "You ask, looking down at the big dark splotch of wetness that has formed on your clothes."
    "你指着衣服上那一大片深色的水渍，没好气地问道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1764
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_a5e14f00:

    # s "I don't know, did you?"
    s "我哪儿知道，你也想吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1766
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_9c2f0f00:

    # p "Maybe a little?"
    p "也许... 可能... 稍微有一点吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1768
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_347fb8ee:

    # "You answer without being able to hide a cheeky smile."
    "你咧嘴一笑，有点小得意地回答道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1773
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_728bdd5d:

    # s "Then my aim is true. But don't even think about starting too, or I will actually get another one for you."
    s "那看来我这手艺还不错。不过你最好也给我老实点，不然下一桶就泼你身上！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1775
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_8803f24e:

    # p "I'll try to rein in my thoughts then."
    p "成成成，我尽量让我的脑子放干净点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1780
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_6c8fe016:

    # s "Ya two are the worst."
    s "你们俩可真是绝了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1782
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b7332974:

    # "Samuel shakes his head and taps the ground with his paw."
    "Samuel摇摇头，用脚掌拍了拍甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1784
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7c5109c6:

    # s "We're fresh out o' port.{w} You got plenty time to be pent up. So get your heads out gutter and finish this thing up, will ya?"
    s "咱们刚出海！{w} 有的是时间让你们精力过剩。都他娘的把脑子从臭水沟里拿出来，赶紧干完活，行不行？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1793
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_62a923ff:

    # s "No, but there are better people than you to think about."
    s "呸，老子就算要胡思乱想，也轮不着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1795
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_b6609cc7:

    # s "So I won't even start."
    s "所以我啥也不会想的，放心吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1799
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_7bfe5069:

    # "Samuel doesn't even bother to carry another bucket and just knocks one of them over with his paw this time around."
    "Samuel这次更懒了，直接一脚踹翻了一个水桶。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1801
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_ef2604bf:

    # s "Now get on with it."
    s "都别闲着，赶紧干活！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1803
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_164f65b4:

    # s "We're fresh out o' port.{w} You got plenty time to be pent up. So get your head out gutter and finish this thing up, will ya?"
    s "咱们刚出海！{w} 有的是时间让你们精力过剩。都他娘的把脑子从臭水沟里拿出来，赶紧干完活，行不行？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1805
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_003de1f3:

    # j "All right, all right, boss."
    j "好嘞，好嘞，老大。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1810
translate Chinese day_2_morningshift_32e998e8:

    # "After a little while, you catch up with Wolf again."
    "过了一会儿，你又追上了Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1819
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_3e173b77:

    # sailschwartz "Samuel!"
    sailschwartz "Samuel！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1823
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_74e64aa7:

    # "A voice calls out from the other end of the deck."
    "甲板那头传来一声呼喊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1829
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_2f238614:

    # "And doing so once more while he approaches your group, getting Samuel to face him."
    "他走近时又喊了一声，Samuel转过身去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1834
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_3438d11b:

    # sailschwartz "Samuel. Can you come with me for a moment?"
    sailschwartz "Samuel。过来帮个忙成吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1836
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_aaeeab56:

    # "Samuel cocks his head slightly to the right, while raising the opposite brow in an inquisitive look, his ears now trained on the sailor as he draws close."
    "Samuel微微歪头，挑起眉毛，带着疑惑的表情，耳朵也朝着走近的水手转了过去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1838
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_aec1e0c5:

    # s "What for?"
    s "做啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1844
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_9f84cf11:

    # "The mustelid closes the last few meters between you before he stops abruptly with an unexpected grace for his size."
    "那只鼬在你几步开外停了下来，以他的体型来说，还挺利索。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1846
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_cc4ac5ee:

    # sailschwartz "I just need a pair of hands real quick. We noticed a sheet is almost through and need someone to help patch it up."
    sailschwartz "就想找个人搭把手。我们发现有张帆快要撕裂了，得赶紧补补。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1848
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_bb2bcbd6:

    # "Samuel looks back at you three for a second before turning back to face him."
    "Samuel回头看了我们几个一眼，又转回去面对他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1850
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_7b117934:

    # s "I guess they'll manage without me for a second."
    s "没我他们应该也能凑合。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1852
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_468ec456:

    # s "All right, which one is it?"
    s "行吧，是哪张帆？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1854
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_2ca40b2a:

    # "Your ears perk up as you overhear the conversation."
    "他们的谈话让你竖起了耳朵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1856
translate Chinese day2_morningshift_decision_b86fd573:

    # "Something other than cleaning the deck? Maybe you can tag along with them?"
    "终于不是擦甲板了？要不我也跟着去看看？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1889
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_75bd7c92:

    # "It isn't a difficult decision to make. While cleaning the decks with Julian could be amusing, you joined the Conway to learn how to sail, and here is an opportunity to do just that."
    "这还用考虑吗？虽然和Julian一起擦甲板可能挺有意思，但你上“Conway号”号是为了学航海的，现在机会来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1895
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_931c9a01:

    # "You quickly step forward before Samuel trots off and grab his attention with a tap on the shoulder."
    "Samuel还没跑开，你就赶紧上前拍了拍他的肩膀。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1897
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_cceb7071:

    # p "Hey, mind if I join you? I'd love to learn some repair work."
    p "嘿，介意我加入不？我也想学点帆索修理。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1899
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_91de754a:

    # "Samuel takes a moment to think before he gestures for you to come along."
    "Samuel想了想，朝你招了招手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1903
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_bdd1a1e7:

    # s "Actually, not a bad idea! Since ya new, it wouldn't hurt to start with something a little more exciting on your first real day. Yeah, come on, let's handle this quickly."
    s "哎，这主意不错！反正你是新来的，第一天干点刺激的也没啥不好。走，咱们赶紧把这事儿解决了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1905
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_a1e8e721:

    # sailschwartz "If you've the greenhorn in tow, you won't need me. I'll head back to the others again."
    sailschwartz "既然你带着这新来的，就用不着我了。我回去找他们了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1907
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_4fa49bd9:

    # s "Sure. We got this, Schwartz."
    s "行。交给我们吧，Schwartz。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1914
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_65bd4571:

    # "The sea breeze ruffles through your fur as you fall in next to the maned wolf, trying your best to match your steps with Samuel's long, graceful strides."
    "海风吹拂着你的毛发，你走到鬃狼旁边，努力跟上Samuel那优雅的大步子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1916
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_ca994d3c:

    # "While still morning, the sunlight beams across the waves are already warming the chill that had come from your early start. A beautiful beginning for your adventure."
    "虽然是早上，但阳光洒在海面上，驱散了清晨的寒意。你的冒险有了一个美好的开始。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1918
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_33476911:

    # s "So? You manage to get much sleep last night? First night's always the roughest."
    s "咋样？昨晚睡得好不？第一晚都难熬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1920
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_05d8c116:

    # "Samuel is first to break the silence as you walk alongside him."
    "你俩并排走着，Samuel率先打破了沉默。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1924
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_357f3b73:

    # p "You did ask me before, Sam."
    p "你之前问过了，Sam。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1926
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_7271bb7a:

    # s "Oh, did I?!"
    s "是吗，有这事儿？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1928
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_992286cc:

    # p "Tsk, so that's how little attention you pay to what I tell you?"
    p "啧，看来你根本没听进去我说的啥啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1930
translate Chinese day2_ask_to_help_samuel_d9a0bd99:

    # p "Sorry, that sounded mean now that I heard out loud—I was just pulling your tail."
    p "抱歉，我说出来有点冲——跟你开玩笑呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1948
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_5a205ec1:

    # "The maned wolf gives you a knowing look, complete with a lip-curling smirk."
    "鬃狼心领神会地看了你一眼，嘴角还带着一丝坏笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1950
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_3b83e90f:

    # s "Oh really now? Feel like sharing?"
    s "哦，是吗？说来听听？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1952
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_a24e18af:

    # "Samuel's gaze lingers on you before he turns to the task at hand, making sure to flick one of his big ears in acknowledgement."
    "Samuel的目光在你身上停留片刻，然后才转向手头的工作，还抖了抖他那大耳朵，算是回应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1954
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_8352d55b:

    # p "Well you see it's... personal."
    p "哎，这事儿…有点私人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1956
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_927d2717:

    # s "Personal?"
    s "私人？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1958
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_891d9110:

    # s "Ah. Yes, I get ya. Personal. So, who's the lucky lady? Or is it a lucky lad?"
    s "啊，我懂了。私事。那么，是哪位幸运的姑娘？还是小伙子？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1960
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_18e73a07:

    # "You're confident there is no way he could know you'd been dreaming of him, yet the smirk on Samuel's lips make you doubt yourself as a wave of heat rushes to your snout and eartips."
    "你本来觉得他不可能知道你梦见过他，但他嘴角那抹笑意，反倒让你开始怀疑是不是自己想多了，一股热流直冲鼻尖和耳根。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1962
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_4e5687a1:

    # p "...Aren't we supposed to hurry with the repair?"
    p "……咱们不是应该赶快修理吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1964
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_01deb930:

    # "He looks at you again, this time flashing a teasing smile full of teeth."
    "他又看了你一眼，这次露出了一个带着坏笑，露出了一排牙齿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1969
translate Chinese day2_spicydream_samuel_a6b7c54a:

    # s "Work and pleasure can go hand in hand, you know, but you're right. The problem's right there."
    s "工作娱乐两不误嘛，不过你说的对，问题就在那儿呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1977
translate Chinese day2_nervoussleep_samuel_e48278aa:

    # "The maned wolf gives you a sympathetic smile and pats your back."
    "那个鬃狼同情地笑了笑，拍了拍你的背。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1979
translate Chinese day2_nervoussleep_samuel_f497346c:

    # s "Pretty standard, y'know. Nothing to feel bad about, though officers won't take it easy on you just because you didn't sleep."
    s "很正常，别往心里去。不过长官可不会因为你没睡好就对你客气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1981
translate Chinese day2_nervoussleep_samuel_166e314c:

    # s "If it's the hammocks, ya get used to it. If the swaying gets to you, just try putting a foot on the deck. Helps a lot more than you might think!"
    s "要是吊床不舒服，睡睡就习惯了。船晃得厉害睡不着的话，就试着把一只脚放在甲板上，比你想象的管用！"

# game/script day2.rpy:1983
translate Chinese day2_nervoussleep_samuel_d12acfe4:

    # p "If only I could reach the ground from that high up."
    p "要是我能从那么高的地方够到地就好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1987
translate Chinese day2_nervoussleep_samuel_dcc3ce5e:

    # p "No it's not the hammock. Just, I guess just anxious, you know?"
    p "不是吊床的问题。就是…有点焦虑，你知道吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:1989
translate Chinese day2_nervoussleep_samuel_0393639c:

    # p "Leaving the place you know for something unknown."
    p "离开熟悉的地方，去面对未知的世界。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1993
translate Chinese day2_nervoussleep_samuel_732fb8b5:

    # s "Trust me, I know that just too well."
    s "相信我，我太有体会了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1995
translate Chinese day2_nervoussleep_samuel_e5a5ac39:

    # s "It took me a bit to get used to it as well. It just takes a little while before it feels like home."
    s "我也花了好长时间才适应。得一阵子才能有家的感觉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:1999
translate Chinese day2_nervoussleep_samuel_789fdabe:

    # s "You'll figure it out, though. Everyone's got their way through things. Now here, take a look. See that? That's our little problem."
    s "不过你肯定能行的。每个人都有自己的办法。来，看看这儿。看到了吗？就是这儿出了问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2007
translate Chinese day2_normalsleep_samuel_a85c0265:

    # s "That's the spirit! With an answer like that and volunteering to help out here, we'll make a fine sailor of you yet."
    s "有干劲！冲你这句话，再加上你主动帮忙，肯定能把你培养成一个好水手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2009
translate Chinese day2_normalsleep_samuel_3ef0964c:

    # p "Well don't flatter me too much, I still don't know what we're doing. They said a sail needed repair, right?"
    p "别太夸我了，我还是不知道现在要干啥。他们说要修帆，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2013
translate Chinese day2_normalsleep_samuel_05856091:

    # s "Close. A sheet is one of these ropes here."
    s "差不多。帆脚索就是这些绳子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2017
translate Chinese day2_normalsleep_samuel_aced6347:

    # "Samuel steps near the edge of the ship and taps one of the thicker ropes with a clawed digit."
    "Samuel走到船边，用带着爪子的手指敲了敲一根比较粗的绳子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2019
translate Chinese day2_normalsleep_samuel_68165d89:

    # s "Said one's almost through, so we're looking for a bit o' fraying. Might last 'til port, might not. Better to fix it now than hope for the best."
    s "这根快不行了，所以咱们得找找看有没有磨损的地方。没准能撑到港口，没准撑不到。与其到时候抓瞎，不如现在修了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2021
translate Chinese day2_normalsleep_samuel_e6472a8e:

    # "The maned wolf's eyes narrow as he studies the lines, brows lifting when he finally spots the problem."
    "鬃狼眯起眼睛，仔细地检查着那些绳索，最后发现了问题，眉毛挑了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2023
translate Chinese day2_normalsleep_samuel_684e8ac1:

    # s "There. Ya see it?"
    s "找到了，看到没？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2033
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_823a403d:

    # "Samuel crouches down and directs your attention to a few threads that are starting to separate from the main line."
    "Samuel蹲下身子，指着几根开始和主绳分离的线，让你注意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2035
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_f7df9c94:

    # s "Not the worst, but it needs repairing before we encounter stronger winds. This is why every sailor worth his salt carries one of these."
    s "情况不算糟，但得赶在遇到大风前修好。所以说，合格的水手都会带这个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2039
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_a64df4a3:

    # "He reaches for his belt and unfastens a loop that holds a long spike in place at his hip. He twirls it deftly in his fingers as he brings the tool down toward the rope."
    "他摸了摸腰带，解开一个套，里面装着一根长长的锥子。他手指灵巧地转动着锥子，然后把工具放到绳子旁边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2041
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_7965eb27:

    # s "This is a marlinspike. It helps work out knots and unweave rope. Here, we're just going to use it to start this bit of twine."
    s "这是松绳锥，能解开绳结、拆开绳股。现在我们要用它来穿这根细绳。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2045
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_c709e02e:

    # "Samuel retrieves a small roll of thick twine from the pouch on his belt and begins to push it through the frayed strands of rope with the marlinspike."
    "Samuel从腰带上的小包里拿出一卷粗绳，用松绳锥穿过磨损的绳股。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2047
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_7767f39e:

    # s "We'll start by securing it here and then whip it around the fraying. It should hold for a while with a little bit of work. Not a fix that'll last forever, but more than enough until we can get a proper replacement."
    s "先固定住，然后把细绳缠绕在磨损的地方。简单处理一下能撑一阵子。肯定不是长久之计，但在找到替代品之前，也够用了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2049
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_0855955d:

    # "Samuel works fast, his skilled fingers wind the twine tightly with practiced ease as he follows his own directions and walks you through the simple repair."
    "Samuel手脚麻利，只见他用那双熟练的手，三两下就把绳子紧紧缠好，一边按着自己的步骤，一边教你如何轻松修理。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2051
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_16e9e53d:

    # s "It's not hard, just takes some practice. I'll see if we can find one that could use a touch-up but isn't too far gone. That way, you can give it a try."
    s "不难，就是得练练。我看看能不能找着一个还能抢救一下-，但又没完全报废的。这样你就能试试手了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2055
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_4f74a7f2:

    # s "In fact, I think there's one near the b-"
    s "说起来，我记得附近好像就……"

# game/script day2.rpy:2060
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_ab254363:

    # "CRACK!" with hpunch
    "砰！" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:2062
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_e465dbb3:

    # "The sudden, thunderous sound reverberates through the air, startling both you and Samuel. The tension in the line above gives way, and the rope thrashes violently, hurtling towards the deck."
    "突如其来的一声巨响，像雷鸣般震得空气都颤了，你和Samuel都吓了一跳。只听“啪”的一声，上面的绳子断了，像疯了似的朝甲板上抽来！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2066
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_7da0fa03:

    # "Reacting swiftly, Samuel pushes you aside, instinctively shielding you from the impending danger. His agile form twists to the side, barely avoiding a strike to the face, only to have the line lash across his leg with a sickening sound."
    "Samuel反应真快，一把把你推开，想都没想就把你护在身下。他身子一扭，险险避开了要命的一击，可那绳子还是狠狠抽在了他的腿上，听着都疼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2070
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_135cbbd2:

    # "The maned wolf's face contorts in pain as he stumbles backward and collapses to the deck, sending out some of the vilest curses imaginable."
    "这鬃狼疼得五官都扭在了一起，踉跄着倒在甲板上，嘴里冒出一些你能想到的最恶毒的咒骂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2072
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_a6e93ef6:

    # p "Samuel! Are you alright?!"
    p "Samuel！你没事吧？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2076
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_8ce51579:

    # "Shaking off the initial shock, you quickly regain your composure and rush over to him, putting your arm around his shoulders to support him."
    "你赶紧回过神来，一把扶住他，胳膊搂着他的肩膀支撑着他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2080
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_e39f76f1:

    # "The sudden turn of events shatters the previously calm atmosphere, replacing it with a flurry of urgency and concern. The nearest crew members rush to the scene to try and help."
    "这突如其来的变故打破了之前的平静，顿时变得一片慌乱。附近的船员也赶紧跑过来帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2082
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_4b7530bd:

    # s "Yes, yes, I'm fine."
    s "没事没事，我好着呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2084
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_68ed165d:

    # p "Are you sure? That could have killed you."
    p "你确定？这一下可是会死人的！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2086
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_d5a284cc:

    # s "But it didn't, did it?{p} Yeah, man, I'm fine."
    s "可这不没死成么？{p} 没事啦，老兄，我真没事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2088
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_a03f51fb:

    # "He wipes your arm away and slowly gets to his feet without any outside assistance."
    "他推开你的胳膊，自己慢慢地站了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2090
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_39d3f1bf:

    # "Once upright again, he dusts himself off and neatly adjusts his vest back into place."
    "重新站直后，他拍了拍身上的灰，又利索地把马甲拉平整。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2092
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_c650111e:

    # s "Are you all done gawking now? Don't you have anything better to do? I heard there's a line that needs fixing.{w} Y'know, maybe one o' ya can take care of it?"
    s "喂，你们看够了没？没事儿干了吗？我记得有根绳子坏了，要不要去修一下？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2094
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_be39ccbb:

    # s "And ya-"
    s "还有你…"

# game/script day2.rpy:2096
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_f52829dd:

    # "Samuel begins, turning back to you."
    "Samuel转过身来，对你说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2098
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_55014122:

    # s "Do you want me to wipe away your tears? Come on, the line broke; that's it."
    s "想要我帮你擦眼泪吗？别这样了，绳子断了而已，又不是什么大事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2102
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_8e7c20a7:

    # s "Don't be such a wu-ahgrrrDamnit!"
    s "别哭哭啼啼的...啊...呃...该死！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2106
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_d5a48f11:

    # "Samuel takes a step toward you and suddenly sinks together when he puts his weight on his left leg. You catch him and gently guide him to sit on the floor."
    "Samuel朝你走了一步，结果重心一放到左腿上，身体突然一沉。你赶紧扶住他，让他慢慢坐在地上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2108
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_46a87ad0:

    # s "Ffffuck!"
    s "操！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2110
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_91c2de6d:

    # "He grits his teeth as he clutches his leg tightly where the rope had hit him, and where a significant spot of blood begins to stain the damaged fabric."
    "他咬紧牙关，紧紧地抓住被绳子抽打的腿，一大片血迹开始浸透了破损的裤子，触目惊心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2113
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_a1968b0a:

    # "He grits his teeth as he clutches his leg tightly where the rope had hit him."
    "他咬紧牙关，紧紧地抓住被绳子抽打的腿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2115
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_8abbef45:

    # p "You're anything but fine, Sam."
    p "你这样子可不像没事，Sam。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2117
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_805030bd:

    # s "It's... not that bad."
    s "没...没那么严重。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2119
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_b97232e9:

    # p "You just took one step and folded together like a piece of cloth. Sorry if I don't believe you."
    p "你这才走了一步就跟块破布一样瘫了。别怪我不相信你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2123
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_77ca5c13:

    # "Samuel manages a strained chuckle, though a wince betrays his pain."
    "Samuel 强忍着痛苦，勉强挤出一个笑容，但还是忍不住龇牙咧嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2127
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_4de9bec5:

    # s "I guess we aren't getting around this. Fine, since you were around, you gotta be the one to report it. Arthur's officer on duty—go find him. I'll manage."
    s "看来是躲不过去了。好吧，既然你在这儿，就得你去报告了。去找Arthur，他今天值班——快去找他。我撑得住。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2130
translate Chinese day2_repair_samuel_0eae68da:

    # s "{cps=5000}I guess we aren't getting around this. Fine, since you were around, you gotta be the one to report it. Arthur's officer on duty—go find him. I'll manage.{/cps}" nointeract
    s "{cps=5000} 看来这事儿躲不掉了。好吧，既然你当时在场，就得你去报告。去找Arthur的执勤官——去找他。我会处理的。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:2146
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_5baa6862:

    # s "Ya... Ugh, you can follow orders. Good to know."
    s "嗯... 呃，你还算听话。 知道了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2148
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_e5f62141:

    # "You huff, which earns a pained chuckle from him."
    "你不满地哼了一声，换来他一声带着痛楚的轻笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2150
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_5c1edaf7:

    # p "Don't waste your energy on jokes, please."
    p "请不要浪费精力开玩笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2154
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_4a21d91f:

    # s "Does it look like I lost my leg? I'll be fine, idiot."
    s "我看起来像断了腿吗？ 我没事，蠢货。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2156
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_1ffc6421:

    # "He teased with a sly smile breaking through his expression."
    "他脸上露出狡黠的笑容，带着戏谑的意味。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2158
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_627c6424:

    # s "It just burns a little bit."
    s "只是有点火辣辣的疼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2160
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_31e44df7:

    # s "They'll help me to the doctor, so don't worry, I'll be fine. If Raj's telling me to lay flat for a while I'll have plenty of energy to waste."
    s "他们会扶我去找医生，别担心，我没事。 如果Raj要我躺一会儿，我会有大把精力可以挥霍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2164
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_982f020e:

    # "You catch his tone to be a little too suggestive for someone visibly injured..."
    "你觉得他一个伤员，语气却轻佻得过分..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2166
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_4370af16:

    # "Samuel..."
    "Samuel..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2170
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_1b5a45c9:

    # "Samuel waves you off. A couple of other crewmen begin to carefully lift him as you weave through the crowd, looking for Arthur's imposing presence, who was no doubt alerted by the gathering crowd."
    "Samuel挥手示意你走开。 你穿过人群，其他几个船员开始小心翼翼地抬起他，你寻找着Arthur那魁梧的身影，他肯定是被聚集的人群惊动了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2174
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_5b9483ff:

    # "You find him in short order, standing amidships and peering in the direction you're coming from. When his eyes fall on you, the feeling of awkwardness and uselessness from when you realized you were standing under a crane yesterday returns."
    "你很快就找到了他，他站在船中央，正朝着你来的方向张望。 当他的目光落到你身上时，昨天站在起重机下时那种尴尬和无用的感觉又涌上心头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2176
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_3952ff34:

    # a "I heard a loud snap. What is going on?"
    a "我听到一声脆响。 发生了什么事？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2178
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_dcf7c71a:

    # p "An accident, sir. I was on scene. A line snapped and hit Samuel."
    p "是事故，先生。 我在现场。 一根绳索断了，击中了Samuel。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2180
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_a211deca:

    # "Swallowing the nervous tension you feel as Arthur looks down on you, you attempt to stay composed as you recount the situation that led up to the incident, trying to not leave out a single detail."
    "Arthur俯视着你，你强压下心中的紧张，努力保持冷静，一五一十地叙述了事故的经过，力求不漏掉任何细节。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2184
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_4502aa6e:

    # "His eyes narrow as you speak, fixed on yours. You can sense that he is trying to detect if you are leaving something incriminating out. The morning sunlight does not ease the chill you feel."
    "你说话时，他眯起眼睛，目光紧紧地盯着你。 你能感觉到他试图从你的话语中找出你是否隐瞒了什么。 即使是清晨的阳光也无法驱散你感受到的寒意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2186
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_010ffaee:

    # a "The line snapped? Just like that?"
    a "绳子断了？ 就这么突然？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2188
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_bee4f3e3:

    # p "No, sir. We were trying to fix it, and it tore itself apart."
    p "不是，先生。 我们当时正在尝试修理，结果它自己就断开了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2190
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_c169b6ec:

    # a "The one you two worked on?{w} Samuel...He is not one to miss a sheet at its breaking point, lad."
    a "是你们两个修的那根？{w} Samuel...他不可能没注意到帆脚索的断裂点，小子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2192
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_79cee0d1:

    # "You do not miss the unspoken accusation that you are the cause."
    "你明白他话里话外都在暗示是你造成的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2196
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_827f04ed:

    # a "And his condition?"
    a "他现在情况怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2198
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_a29acce2:

    # p "The other men are taking him to the doctor, sir. He was in good enough spirits to joke, at least."
    p "长官，其他人正带他去看医生。 至少他精神头还行，还能开玩笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2202
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_a4e17ada:

    # "You both turn as the men helping Samuel move him below deck."
    "你们都转身看着几个船员将Samuel抬到下甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2204
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_6b9a2da1:

    # a "Samuel would joke if he were dying."
    a "Samuel就算要死了也会开玩笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2206
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_622da979:

    # "His tone is admonishing, but you can detect the faintest hint of fondness in there."
    "他的语气带着责备，但你能察觉到一丝不易察觉的喜爱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2208
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_30bf1cd7:

    # "Fondness that you do not feel as he turns his gaze back to you. You are very aware of the ship's motion beneath your feet, making you feel all the more unsteady."
    "这份喜爱不是给你的，他转过头来，目光再次落到你身上。你能清楚地感觉到脚下船身的摇晃，这让你更加感到心神不宁。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2210
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_f3a001a0:

    # "Silence drags on for a few seconds between the two of you."
    "沉默在你们之间持续了几秒，显得格外漫长。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2214
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_1701e773:

    # a "I can't help but notice it's you again."
    a "我不得不注意到，怎么又是你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2216
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_c98b50b0:

    # a "On your first day, you nearly got yourself hurt by being in the way of the loading crew, and potentially jeopardizing other crew and the planned running of the ship."
    a "第一天，你差点因为挡了装卸工的路而受伤，还可能危害到其他船员和船只的航行计划。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2220
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_4c3e2e2b:

    # a "You followed that up by flaunting your disrespect of your superiors."
    a "紧接着，你又公然藐视上级。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2224
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_3f71c898:

    # a "And now on your second day, one of my crew gets hurt while teaching you.{w} I've known Samuel for a long time. He's not one so careless to miss a sheet at its breaking point. So, I will ask you again: What happened?"
    a "现在第二天，我的一个船员在教你的时候受伤了。{w} 我认识Samuel很久了。他不是那种粗心大意到会忽略帆脚索断裂点的人。所以，我再问你一遍：到底发生了什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2226
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_71a6af1c:

    # "His gaze is piercing, watching every twitch on your face. Dread seeps through you, threatening to break the composure that you are trying so hard to maintain."
    "他目光如炬，审视着你脸上的一丝表情。恐惧感逐渐蔓延，几乎要击溃你竭力维持的镇定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2228
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_e46a6bb3:

    # p "Just an accident, sir. Maybe the rope didn't look as bad as it actually was. I wasn't distracting Samuel from his duties."
    p "只是个意外，长官。可能那绳子看起来没那么糟。我没有干扰Samuel执行任务。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2230
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_443c27cd:

    # a "Did I say you were?"
    a "我说你打扰他了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2232
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_cbd9e3b5:

    # p "...No, sir."
    p "“……没有，长官。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:2234
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_444ecb59:

    # "The silence between the two of you lingers for a moment, letting you both hear the shuffle of crew as they return to their work after the commotion."
    "短暂的沉默在你们之间蔓延，你们都能听到船员们在一阵忙乱后回到岗位上的走动声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2239
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_7db8e51d:

    # "Arthur's harsh look finally relents as he turns towards the sea."
    "Arthur严厉的目光终于缓和下来，他转头望向大海。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2241
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_12349c81:

    # a "Tell me. In your previous vocation, did you work with anyone accident prone? Someone that, no matter how hard he tried, bad events seemed to follow?"
    a "说吧。你之前做活的时候，有没有和那种倒霉蛋一起干过？就是那种无论多努力，坏事都缠着他的人？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2243
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_54ed538e:

    # "Despite the insinuation, you spend a moment thinking. And you do recall someone: A boy from town who occasionally helped your family in harvest season."
    "虽然听出了他的暗示，你还是认真地想了想。你确实想起了一个人：镇上的一个男孩，有时会在收割的季节帮你的家人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2245
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_0f865591:

    # "Despite clearly being a hard worker, he tripped and fell and made enough of a mess that sometimes, he was more trouble than it was worth."
    "他明明很努力，但他总是会绊倒，摔跤，把事情搞得一团糟，有时候真是越帮越忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2247
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_4e56a140:

    # p "Yes,{w} sir."
    p "是的，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2251
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_be447138:

    # a "Ensure you are not that man. Small mistakes on land are an annoyance. Here they can cascade into disaster. Work on this ship requires discipline, precision, and looking out for your crew. Don't forget that and don't be near another accident."
    a "记住你别做那种人。在陆地上犯点小错，最多让人心烦。在这里，小错会酿成大祸。在这艘船上干活，要守纪律，要精准，要照顾好你的同伴。别忘了这些，还有，别再靠近任何事故。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2255
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_f4337867:

    # a "And ensure that you don't forget your position. If you do, you may receive more than a stern talking to."
    a "还有，记住你的身份。要是你忘了，可就不是挨顿臭骂能解决的了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2257
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_d27f3463:

    # a "Are we clear on that?"
    a "听明白了没有？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2259
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_b8e76e49:

    # "His eyes pierce you once more as he slowly and deliberately states his question."
    "他再次用锐利的目光刺穿你，缓慢而郑重其事地重复着他的问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2261
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_a4897fbc:

    # "You nod, trying to look determined and to push down that lingering dread."
    "你点点头，努力摆出一副坚定的样子，想要压下那挥之不去的恐惧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2263
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_0235207e:

    # p "...Yes, sir.{w} I understand."
    p "……是的，长官。我明白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2268
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_08272878:

    # a "Very well.{w} Return to your duties, then. Hopefully we won't have to discuss this further. I must report to the captain."
    a "很好。回去干活吧。希望我们不用再谈这件事了。我得去向船长报告。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2272
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_cdd14fc5:

    # "He dismisses you with a shallow nod and then strides off, leaving you awash with a touch of anxiety. You didn't think you had anything to do with it, but after Arthur's questioning, you can't quell a little bit of irrational worry that you somehow do. He certainly seems to think so."
    "他微微点头，示意你可以走了，然后便大步走开，留下你独自一人，心中隐隐有些不安。你本来觉得自己和这件事没什么关系，但经过Arthur的盘问，你心里还是冒出了一丝没来由的担忧，觉得自己可能也脱不了干系。他似乎也是这么认为的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2274
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_2822f82b:

    # "Just one day and you're being treated as a potential menace."
    "才来第一天，就被当成潜在的威胁对待了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2280
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_c0b3263e:

    # "You sigh as you run your hands over your face, starting at your whiskers and smoothing out your fur up and back towards your ears. A faint noise behind you draws your gaze and you realize it's your own tail flicking anxiously."
    "你叹了口气，用手揉搓着脸，从胡须开始，向上向后捋平耳朵边的毛。身后传来一个细微的声响，你转头一看，是自己的尾巴在焦躁地拍打着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2282
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_73bbe40f:

    # "Willing it back to its usual calm, less animated state, you determine its time to check on Sam to ensure he is okay; hopefully that will calm your nerves."
    "你努力让尾巴恢复到平时平静、不那么活跃的状态，然后决定去看看Sam，确保他没事；希望这样能让你平静下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2284
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_8d3fd817:

    # "Trying your best to follow the route the crewmen used earlier to take him below decks earlier, you find yourself in the narrow corridors which lead to the cabins."
    "你努力回忆着之前船员们带他去下层甲板的路线，你发现自己身处通往下层船舱的狭窄走廊里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2286
translate Chinese day2_arthur_report_4794781a:

    # "After asking a passing man for directions, he points you to one in particular: The doctor Rajeeyah's quarters."
    "向一个路过的船员打听方向后，他给你指了一个地方：Rajeeyah医生的住处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2294
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_99dd6427:

    # "Samuel glances at you, his eyes holding a mix of appreciation and resistance."
    "Samuel 看了你一眼，眼神中既有感激，也有抗拒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2296
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_68d7f7ac:

    # s "Alright, alright,"
    s "好吧好吧……"

# game/script day2.rpy:2298
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_4703b698:

    # "He finally concedes, giving you a small nod."
    "他终于让步了，轻轻地对你点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2300
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_0e07393d:

    # s "But make it quick, eh? I don't want to cause too much fuss."
    s "不过你得快点，嗯？我不想太麻烦大家。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2306
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_01bab89a:

    # "You move in as a few of the crew begin to stand Samuel up on his feet, feeling a pang of sympathy as you see the maned wolf grit his teeth in pain. You slip in beside Samuel, lowering your head to allow him to sling an arm around your neck and over a shoulder."
    "你走上前去，这时几个船员正准备扶Samuel站起来，看到这只鬃狼因为疼痛而咬紧牙关，你心里一阵难受。你走到Samuel身边，低下头，让他把胳膊搭在你的脖子和肩膀上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2308
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_6dbbbf72:

    # "A few of the crew who had arrived first offer to help as well, but Sam is quick to wave them off, brushing a paw through the air dismissively to try and play it off as less severe than it was."
    "几个先到的船员也提出要帮忙，但Sam连忙拒绝了，不以为意地挥了挥爪子，想让这件事看起来没那么严重。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2312
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_851e149d:

    # s "I'll be fine. Best he helps me down anyway. He was 'round for it, any questions Rajeeyah has he can chime in. Any more than that would just be a crowd."
    s "我没事。还是让他扶我下去吧。他当时在场，Rajeeyah有什么问题他也能搭把腔。人多了反而碍事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2314
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_7efe3381:

    # s "And get someone to fix the bloody thing! Don't ya end up bein' so enchanted with me and just forget about it."
    s "还有，找人把那该死的绳子修好！别光顾着迷恋我，把这事儿给忘了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2316
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_04c31ca0:

    # "You're impressed that Sam can think so clearly, despite the blood oozing down his leg and staining his pants. It is easy to see why he seems such a valued member of the crew even with the short amount of time you've been aboard the ship."
    "血都糊了他一腿，裤子都染红了，Sam还能这么清醒，真让人佩服。怪不得你上船没多久，就觉得他这么受大家伙儿待见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2318
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_bebd394b:

    # p "We're going to have to go below deck."
    p "咱们得下到下层甲板去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2320
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_828a8789:

    # "While it is obvious Samuel knew where to go, you think it best to prepare him before descending the narrow stairway which leads to the lower decks."
    "虽然看样子他知道路，不过你觉得还是先跟他说清楚，再带他下那通往下层甲板的窄楼梯比较好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2322
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_c012744a:

    # p "Who knew I'd be the one giving you a tour today?"
    p "想不到今天给你当导游的人居然是我？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2327
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_250d4eea:

    # "You joke, causing the maned wolf to grin ever so slightly as you lead him down the first steps."
    "你开了个玩笑，那家伙——鬃狼——就冲你咧嘴一笑，你这才带着他往下走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2335
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_491c7e3e:

    # s "You.. ugh... Ya gettin' cocky already? Better hope I forget all about that by the time I'm walking on my own again."
    s "你... 哎哟... 已经开始得瑟了？最好等我能自己走道了，你还记得现在说的话！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2337
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_3732786b:

    # "Sam teases with a flash of teeth, a faux threat that only makes you laugh."
    "Sam呲着牙，假模假样地威胁道，把你逗乐了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2339
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_fe781548:

    # "As you descend the stairs with Samuel, you can feel the ship's motion more profoundly. The gentle swaying of the deck is now more apparent below, a constant reminder of the vast, powerful sea which surrounds you."
    "你扶着Sam走下楼梯，能更明显地感觉到船在摇晃。在下层，甲板的轻微晃动更加明显，时刻提醒着你，周围是多么广阔而充满力量的海洋。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2341
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_2f2b56cb:

    # "You try to keep your balance steady, cautious that Samuel's injured leg doesn't bear too much weight as you both slowly make your way below deck."
    "你小心翼翼地稳住身子，生怕Sam受伤的腿吃不消，你们俩这才慢慢地往下层甲板挪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2343
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_369cbfe6:

    # "As you reach the bottom of the stairs, the sounds of the crew working above are slightly muffled, creating a more subdued atmosphere. Augmented now with the occasional groans and creaks of the Conway's timbers and the sounds of the waves against the hull."
    "到了楼梯下面，上面船员们干活的声音就小多了，气氛也变得沉闷起来。现在又加上了Conway号\'s号时不时发出的呻吟和吱嘎声，还有海浪拍打船体的声音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2345
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_21e5f03d:

    # "The ship's corridors are tight, and you have to navigate carefully to avoid bumping into any passing crew."
    "船上的走廊窄得很，你得小心点，别撞到过路的伙计。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2351
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_2fe1278f:

    # "You confidently lead Samuel back toward where you'd helped Rajeeyah the previous night, however as you near the room, the maned wolf nudges in the opposite direction with his snout. "
    "你挺自信地带着Sam往昨天晚上帮Rajeeyah的地方走，结果快到房间的时候，那家伙用鼻子往反方向拱了拱。 "

# game/script day2.rpy:2353
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_ddbd2eb8:

    # s "Too early for her to be checkin' on patients. She'll still be waking up I bet. Her room's down that way. She's got everything I need in there, don't worry."
    s "现在她才不会查房呢，我敢说她肯定还在睡觉。她的房间在那边。她要用的东西都在她屋里，放心吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2355
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_9aac0220:

    # "With Samuel's guidance, you make your way through the labyrinth of passages until you finally arrive at a door with a small brass plate engraved with \"Surgeon's Quarters\" engraved into it."
    "在Sam的指引下，你们穿过迷宫一样的通道，最后来到一扇门前，门上钉着一块小铜牌，上面刻着“外科医生宿舍”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2357
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_ceadcba7:

    # s "Here we are."
    s "到了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2359
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_9220850d:

    # "Samuel says, nodding to the door."
    "Sam说着，朝那扇门点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2361
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_a31b3137:

    # s "Any later in the day and she'd have already been treatin' me on the deck. Hate to bother her this early, but don't think we got any other choice."
    s "要是再晚点，她肯定已经在甲板上给我治了。这么早就打扰她，实在不好意思，但看来咱们也没别的辙了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2365
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_1e44b9f2:

    # "Leaning your weight to help keep Samuel up, you reach out to knock loudly on the door. You hear a muffled grumble, followed by some faint shuffling, before the door slowly opens; a cheetah face peeking out from the crack."
    "你费劲巴力地扶着Sam，伸手咚咚地敲响了房门。你听到里面传来一声含糊不清的咕哝，然后是一些窸窸窣窣的声音，过了一会儿，门才慢慢打开，一张花豹脸从门缝里探了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2371
translate Chinese day2_rajeeyah_talk_7846418e:

    # "Rajeeyah's gaze holds the uncertain quality of someone who got far too little sleep. Fatigue seems to only accentuate the dark lines around her eyes. Still, it only takes a moment for her to recognize this isn't a social visit, her brows furrow as she focuses on Samuel."
    "Rajeeyah的眼神里透着睡眠不足的疲惫，黑眼圈也更重了。不过，她很快就意识到这不是来串门的，皱起眉头，目光落在了Sam身上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2376
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_03069964:

    # "Samuel's brows furrow in contemplation, his pride warring with the obvious pain he's experiencing. However, he ultimately relents, realizing that seeking medical attention might be the wiser decision."
    "Sam紧锁眉头，心里很矛盾，既想逞强，又实在疼得厉害。不过，他最后还是认了怂，觉得还是去看医生比较明智。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2378
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_8b763536:

    # s "Fine, but let's be quick about it. Can't have ya missin' out on all the excitement of your first day."
    s "行吧，不过麻利点儿。可别耽误了我第一天的好戏。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2380
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_bc16f602:

    # "He tries to tease, masking the pain behind his eyes."
    "他想开个玩笑，用笑容掩饰眼中的疼痛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2386
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_6cbb5afa:

    # "You move in as some of the crew begin to stand Samuel up on his feet, and feel a pang of sympathy as the maned wolf grits his teeth in pain. You slip in beside Samuel, lowering your head to allow him to sling an arm over your shoulder and around your neck."
    "有几个船员过来扶Sam，你赶紧也过去帮忙，看到那家伙疼得直咬牙，你心里也挺不是滋味。你挤到Sam旁边，低下头，让他把胳膊搭在你的肩膀和脖子上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2388
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_6dbbbf72:

    # "A few of the crew who had arrived first offer to help as well, but Sam is quick to wave them off, brushing a paw through the air dismissively to try and play it off as less severe than it was."
    "几个先到的船员也提出要帮忙，但Sam连忙拒绝了，不以为意地挥了挥爪子，想让这件事看起来没那么严重。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2392
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_851e149d:

    # s "I'll be fine. Best he helps me down anyway. He was 'round for it, any questions Rajeeyah has he can chime in. Any more than that would just be a crowd."
    s "我没事。还是让他扶我下去吧。他当时在场，Rajeeyah有什么问题他也能搭把腔。人多了反而碍事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2394
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_5d7666ea:

    # s "And get someone to fix the bloody thing! Not that you end up being so enchanted with me and just forget 'bout it."
    s "还有，找人把那玩意儿修好喽！别到时候你光顾着迷恋我，把这事儿给忘了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2396
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_04c31ca0:

    # "You're impressed that Sam can think so clearly, despite the blood oozing down his leg and staining his pants. It is easy to see why he seems such a valued member of the crew even with the short amount of time you've been aboard the ship."
    "血都糊了他一腿，裤子都染红了，Sam还能这么清醒，真让人佩服。怪不得你上船没多久，就觉得他这么受大家伙儿待见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2398
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_c616a281:

    # p "Below decks, right? You're going to have to guide me. Something I'd need to know for a future emergency anyway."
    p "在下层甲板，是吧？你得给我带路。反正以后要是有啥急事，我也得知道怎么走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2402
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_7f97c60a:

    # s "Hmf... Yeah. Yeah. Not the standard tour, but it'll work."
    s "哼... 行吧。行吧。这可不是正经参观，不过也凑合了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2404
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_45cd1144:

    # "Samuel flashes a grin with his words, nodding in the direction of the stairs that led down below."
    "Sam咧嘴一笑，朝通往下层的楼梯努了努嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2406
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_c03d2c2f:

    # "You support Samuel's weight as he leans on you, guiding him towards the stairs that lead below decks. The crew around you clear a path, giving you enough space to maneuver through the bustling deck."
    "你扶着靠在你身上的Sam，领着他走向通往下层甲板的楼梯。周围的船员们让开一条路，好让你们在熙熙攘攘的甲板上通行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2408
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_9d50ab69:

    # "Despite the pain, Samuel manages to keep up his usual banter, flashing grins and cracking jokes to mask his discomfort."
    "尽管疼得厉害，Sam还是强撑着，不停地开着玩笑，咧着嘴笑，想掩饰自己的难受。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2417
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_fe781548:

    # "As you descend the stairs with Samuel, you can feel the ship's motion more profoundly. The gentle swaying of the deck is now more apparent below, a constant reminder of the vast, powerful sea which surrounds you."
    "你扶着Sam走下楼梯，能更明显地感觉到船在摇晃。在下层，甲板的轻微晃动更加明显，时刻提醒着你，周围是多么广阔而充满力量的海洋。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2419
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_2f2b56cb:

    # "You try to keep your balance steady, cautious that Samuel's injured leg doesn't bear too much weight as you both slowly make your way below deck."
    "你小心翼翼地稳住身子，生怕Sam受伤的腿吃不消，你们俩这才慢慢地往下层甲板挪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2421
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_97461761:

    # p "So, this is an exciting start to my first day."
    p "看来我这第一天，开局就挺刺激啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2425
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_4867f52a:

    # "You chuckle, trying to lighten the mood as you descend the stairs together."
    "你笑了笑，想缓和一下气氛，你们一起下了楼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2427
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_2ad10701:

    # s "Oh, you have no idea. It's not every day we get such a grand entrance."
    s "哦，你可没概念。可不是每天都有这么隆重的登场。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2429
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_0abe3142:

    # "Samuel responds, but you can sense a slight wince in his voice."
    "Samuel应了一声，但你能听出他声音里带着一丝勉强。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2431
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_369cbfe6:

    # "As you reach the bottom of the stairs, the sounds of the crew working above are slightly muffled, creating a more subdued atmosphere. Augmented now with the occasional groans and creaks of the Conway's timbers and the sounds of the waves against the hull."
    "到了楼梯下面，上面船员们干活的声音就小多了，气氛也变得沉闷起来。现在又加上了Conway号时不时发出的呻吟和吱嘎声，还有海浪拍打船体的声音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2433
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_21e5f03d:

    # "The ship's corridors are tight, and you have to navigate carefully to avoid bumping into any passing crew."
    "船上的走廊窄得很，你得小心点，别撞到过路的伙计。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2437
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_e8d6b028:

    # "With Samuel's guidance, you make your way through the labyrinth of passages until you finally arrive at a door with a small brass plate with \"Surgeon's Quarters\" engraved into it."
    "在Samuel的搀扶下，你穿过迷宫般的通道，终于来到一扇门前。门上有一块小黄铜牌，刻着“外科医生宿舍”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2439
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_ceadcba7:

    # s "Here we are."
    s "到了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2441
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_9220850d:

    # "Samuel says, nodding to the door."
    "Sam说着，朝那扇门点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2443
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_37eb6eb3:

    # s "Rajeeyah's got her own quarters down here. Any later in the day and she'd have been right there on the deck. This early, I doubt she's out of bed. Guh... Hate to bother her, but don't think I'm walkin' this off."
    s "Rajeeyah的住处就在这下面。要是再晚点，她肯定就在甲板上了。这么早，估计还没起床。呃...真不想打扰她，可我这腿脚... 没法自己走回去啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2447
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_ea0ca57d:

    # "Leaning your weight to help keep Samuel up, you reach out and knock loudly on the door. You hear a muffled grumble, followed by some faint shuffling, before the door slowly opens; a cheetah face peeking out from the crack."
    "你侧身扶着Samuel，伸手用力敲门。你听到门内传来含糊的嘟囔声，夹杂着窸窸窣窣的动静。过了一会儿，门缓缓打开，一张猎豹的脸——确切地说，是猎豹兽人的脸——从门缝里探了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2454
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_fd904d95:

    # "Rajeeyah notices you first, confusion evident in her eyes at the sight of you disturbing her so early in the day. It's not until Samuel clears his throat that her focused gaze shifts to him, instantly softening at the sight of him."
    "Rajeeyah 先注意到了你，一大早就被一个陌生人打扰，她眼中带着明显的困惑。直到 Samuel 清了清嗓子，她才把注意力转到他身上，眼神瞬间柔和了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2458
translate Chinese day2_samuel_injured_5b0605c9:

    # "Rajeeyah notices you first, confusion evident in her eyes at the sight of a stranger disturbing her so early in the day. It's not until Samuel clears his throat that her focused gaze shifts to him, instantly softening at the sight of him."
    "Rajeeyah 先注意到了你，一大早就被一个陌生人打扰，她眼中带着明显的困惑。直到 Samuel 清了清嗓子，她才把注意力转到他身上，眼神瞬间柔和了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2477
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_03424892:

    # r "Sam! You're hurt? What happened? No, never mind that. Tell me as I work. Both of you come in now."
    r "Sam！你受伤了？怎么回事？算了，先别说这个了，你一边处理伤口一边告诉我。你们两个都进来吧！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2479
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_1a92f38a:

    # "The cheetah swings the door open wide, allowing you room to usher Samuel through the doorway and into the feline's private quarters."
    "猎豹一把推开门，让出空位，方便你扶着 Samuel 通过门口，进入这只猎豹的私人房间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2488
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_332a0b59:

    # "While not an infirmary, the shelves of ingredients and tools show the cheetah is still quite prepared for most anything. High railings made sure nothing could fall even with the heaviest swaying of the ship. Very practical."
    "虽然这里不是医务室，但架子上琳琅满目的药物和工具表明，猎豹已经为各种突发情况做好了准备。高高的栏杆确保即使在船剧烈摇晃时，东西也不会掉下来，真是周到。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2492
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_65c9303c:

    # r "Seat him on that stool over there, and get that clothing out of the way."
    r "让他坐到那边那个凳子上，把伤口附近的衣服弄开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2500
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_7feeabd3:

    # "You guide Samuel to the little stool near the back of the room as requested, though the mention of clothing brings you to a pause. The maned wolf has his paw pressed firmly to the outside of his upper thigh, which means his pants will need to come down..."
    "你按照她的指示，扶着 Samuel 走到房间后方的小凳子旁。但听到要“弄开衣服”，你停下了动作。这只鬃狼正用爪子紧紧按着大腿上方，这意味着需要把他的裤子褪下来……"

# game/script day2.rpy:2507
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_f80f1a83:

    # s "Ya wish, don't you? You keep your paws to yourself."
    s "你想得美！把你的爪子放老实点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2511
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_633be757:

    # s "You keep your paws to yourself."
    s "手放老实点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2513
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_58173afd:

    # "Samuel admonishes you with a faint tease in his voice."
    "Samuel 略带戏谑地数落你一句。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2515
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_563ade22:

    # s "I'm not that helpless."
    s "我可没那么没用。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2519
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_c61a201d:

    # "The maned wolf huffs out as he begins reaching for the edge of his shirt."
    "他哼了一声，就开始伸手去拉衬衫的下摆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2528
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_da832e25:

    # "Shifting uncomfortably in the seat, Samuel manages to work his shirt up and the side of his pants down just enough to bare the wound to the open air. Revealing the deep gash surrounded by blood-matted fur."
    "Samuel 在座位上不安地挪动着，好不容易才把衬衫向上撸起，裤子也向下褪开一些，总算让伤口露了出来。那是一道很深的裂口，周围的毛都被血-染得一绺一绺的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2535
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_f4ccc069:

    # "Tsking under her breath, Rajeeyah moves close, kneeling to get a better look at the wound. She reaches a paw out, not to touch the injured spot, but to offer a comforting pat on Samuel's side."
    "Rajeeyah 低声啧了一下，凑近身子，跪下来仔细查看伤口。她伸出一只爪子，没去碰伤处，只是在 Samuel 身侧轻轻拍了拍，以示安慰。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2537
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_dd1032c0:

    # r "Hmm. It's a deep gash, but nothing too nasty. I'd say you're lucky, Sam."
    r "嗯，伤口挺深，但也没什么大不了的。我说你挺幸运的，Sam。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2539
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_4d42dd04:

    # "She speaks in a warm tone, just the faintest bit of playfulness to dull the edge of her professionalism."
    "她语气温和，带着一丝俏皮，冲淡了那种公事公办的味道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2541
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_ddca4afe:

    # "Glancing over at you, Rajeeyah lifts a paw to point at the wall near the door."
    "Rajeeyah 瞥了你一眼，抬起爪子朝门口附近的墙壁指了指。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2543
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_572f2c7b:

    # r "Go ahead and gather some things for me, would you? There's a small box on the shelf near the door. Fetch me that and a couple of clean cloths folded near the foot of the bed."
    r "你去帮我拿点东西，行吗？门口架子上有一个小盒子，拿过来。还有床脚那叠着几块干净布，也拿两块来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2545
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_f145f483:

    # "You immediately turn, scanning the area until you spot the mentioned box. It's exactly where Rajeeyah said it would be, and you retrieve it quickly."
    "你立刻转身，四下寻找，很快就找到了她说的那个盒子。位置分毫不差，你赶紧取了过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2549
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_c576fe78:

    # "With the box in hand, you then notice the neatly folded cloths near the foot of the bed. They are meticulously arranged, reflecting Rajeeyah's organized nature. You pick up a couple of the clean cloths and hand the gathered supplies to Rajeeyah, who takes them with a nod of appreciation."
    "拿着盒子，你又注意到床脚边叠得整整齐齐的布。叠放得一丝不苟，很符合 Rajeeyah 做事的风格。你拿起两块干净的布，把东西交给 Rajeeyah，她点点头表示感谢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2554
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_60ac70df:

    # "Before the cheetah doctor can make any further requests, three sharp knocks resound through the room, drawing everyone's attention to the door. It swings open, revealing Arthur practically filling the doorway with his imposing presence."
    "还没等这位猎豹医生再吩咐什么，房间里突然响起了三声清脆的敲门声，所有人的目光都转向了门口。门一下被推开，Arthur 高大的身影几乎堵住了整个门。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2570
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_ebf90e3c:

    # "Feeling slightly awkward, you shift your gaze away from the sight of Samuel tending to his wound and divert your attention to the nearby shelves, pretending to be captivated by the assortment of vials and medical tools on display."
    "你觉得有点尴尬，赶紧把视线从 Samuel 的伤口上移开，装作对旁边架子上摆着的那些药瓶和医疗器械很感兴趣的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2572
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_cdbdffd2:

    # "Rajeeyah's sweet laughter lightens the atmosphere, and you can't help but crack a faint smile in response."
    "Rajeeyah 甜美的笑声让气氛轻松了不少，你也忍不住露出了一丝微笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2574
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_78aea454:

    # r "Go ahead and gather some things for me, would you? There's a small box on a shelf near the door. Fetch me that and a couple of clean cloths folded near the foot of the bed."
    r "去帮我拿点东西，行吗？门口架子上有一个小盒子，拿过来。还有床脚那叠着几块干净布，也拿两块来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2576
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_a0acd0a4:

    # "Rajeeyah requests, her focus on Samuel's injury never wavering."
    "Rajeeyah恳切地说道，她的目光始终没有离开Samuel的伤势。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2578
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_9560ce36:

    # "You nod, grateful for something to do to occupy yourself in this moment of vulnerability. Your eyes dart around the room, scanning the area until you spot the mentioned box near the door. It's exactly where Rajeeyah said it would be, and you retrieve it quickly."
    "你点点头，能有事情做让你心怀感激，好冲淡这脆弱时刻带来的不适。你环顾四周，很快便找到了Rajeeyah所说的箱子，它就在门边，你迅速取了回来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2582
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_c576fe78_1:

    # "With the box in hand, you then notice the neatly folded cloths near the foot of the bed. They are meticulously arranged, reflecting Rajeeyah's organized nature. You pick up a couple of the clean cloths and hand the gathered supplies to Rajeeyah, who takes them with a nod of appreciation."
    "拿着盒子，你又注意到床脚边叠得整整齐齐的布。叠放得一丝不苟，很符合 Rajeeyah 做事的风格。你拿起两块干净的布，把东西交给 Rajeeyah，她点点头表示感谢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2587
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stitch_60ac70df_1:

    # "Before the cheetah doctor can make any further requests, three sharp knocks resound through the room, drawing everyone's attention to the door. It swings open, revealing Arthur practically filling the doorway with his imposing presence."
    "还没等这位猎豹医生再吩咐什么，房间里突然响起了三声清脆的敲门声，所有人的目光都转向了门口。门一下被推开，Arthur 高大的身影几乎堵住了整个门。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2596
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_334f06f9:

    # a "Samuel, I heard a report of the incident. Seems unlike you to be caught off guard like that."
    a "Samuel，我听说了这次的事故报告。以你的身手，不该这么容易着了道啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2598
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_55bf3b57:

    # a "I'll expect to hear your side of it once you're patched up."
    a "等你包扎好了，我要听听你自己的说法。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2602
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_6a108d8a:

    # s "Jeez, don't be too concerned about my well-bein' in all of this."
    s "哎哟喂，各位就不能先关心关心我的死活吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2606
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_a11622de:

    # "Arthur's eyes widen as he realized just how he sounded to Samuel."
    "Arthur意识到自己刚才的语气不太对，吃惊地睁大了眼睛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2608
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_ab78e1a4:

    # a "My apologies. Of course. I hope you are doing well, Samuel. Is it bad?"
    a "抱歉，当然。我希望你没事，Samuel。伤势很严重吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2612
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_857ab168:

    # r "He'll be fine, Officer."
    r "他没事，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2616
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_04d828a5:

    # "Arthur's gaze fixes on Samuel before shifting to you, his eyes silently studying you for a tense moment before he speaks again."
    "Arthur先是看了看Samuel，然后把目光转向你，沉默地审视着你，气氛顿时变得紧张起来，过了一会儿他才再次开口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2618
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_01471dc0:

    # a "You."
    a "你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2620
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_d505a14f:

    # a "Step into the hallway with me, I'm sure Rajeeyah can do her job without your assistance for a moment."
    a "你跟我到走廊上来一趟，我相信Rajeeyah一个人也能做好，不需要你帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2632
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_90c11a86:

    # "Apprehension fills you as you follow Arthur into the dimly lit corridor. The ship's lanterns cast flickering shadows along the polished wood, creating an aura of seriousness around the officer. As you walk, you're far too aware of the ship's subtle movements beneath your feet, which only adds to your nervousness."
    "你心里一沉，跟着Arthur走进昏暗的走廊。船上的煤油灯在打磨光滑的木板上投下摇曳的阴影，让长官的身影显得更加严肃。走廊里很安静，你格外留意着脚下船身那不易察觉的晃动，心里也越发忐忑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2634
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_f84d7783:

    # a "How come it's you again?"
    a "怎么老是你？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2638
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_125e3d4d:

    # "Arthur states, stopping and turning to face you."
    "Arthur停下脚步，转过身来面对你，语气不悦地说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2640
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_2b6e3a14:

    # "You nod, trying to maintain composure under his scrutinizing gaze."
    "你点点头，努力在他审视的目光下保持冷静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2644
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_bf4a55ff:

    # a "On your arrival, you nearly caused an accident with the crew loading the ship."
    a "你刚来的时候，差点害得装货的船员出事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2647
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_12b15e1c:

    # a "Then you go on and show clear disrespect towards your superiors."
    a "之后你又对上级表现出明显的不敬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2649
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_ec9dada8:

    # "He continues, his tone measured."
    "他语气平缓地继续说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2653
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_a6e891fb:

    # a "And then today, you're involved in a mishap that puts one of my crew members in harm's way. I've known Samuel for a long time. He's not one to be careless. So, tell me, how did he manage to get hurt?"
    a "今天，你又卷入了一场事故，害得我的一个船员受了伤。我认识Samuel很久了，他做事一向很小心。所以，你来告诉我，他到底是怎么受的伤？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2655
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_b21ce276:

    # "You recount the events leading up to the accident, making sure to leave nothing out, but you can sense that Arthur is probing for something more. His eyes lock onto yours, searching for any signs of deception."
    "你一五一十地讲述了事故的经过，尽量不漏掉任何细节，但你能感觉到Arthur似乎想从你这里套出更多的话。他紧紧地盯着你，想从你的脸上找到一丝说谎的蛛丝马迹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2657
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_cecda4aa:

    # p "It was just an accident, sir."
    p "只是个意外，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2661
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_5d7349d7:

    # a "Accidents do happen, that is true. Even to seasoned sailors."
    a "意外是难免的，即便是老水手也一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2663
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_5f673f88:

    # "Arthur acknowledges, but his expression remains stern."
    "Arthur承认道，但他的表情依然严肃。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2665
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_330b3828:

    # a "But I've been around long enough to know that sometimes, they're more than just accidents."
    a "但我见过的事多了，有些时候，事情可没那么简单。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2667
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_4f96a108:

    # "You feel a pang of unease at his insinuation, but you maintain your composure, not wanting to give away any false guilt."
    "他的话让你感到一阵不安，你努力保持镇定，不让自己露出任何马脚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2669
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_e327d879:

    # a "Remember, this ship runs on precision and discipline. One small mistake can lead to disaster. I'll be keeping a close eye on things."
    a "记住，这艘船靠的是精确和纪律，一个小小的失误都可能酿成大祸。我会密切关注的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2671
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_37ab1902:

    # "You nod, acknowledging his words, but you can't help but feel a sense of suspicion lingering in the air."
    "你点点头，表示明白了他的意思，但空气中那股挥之不去的怀疑意味仍然让你感到不安。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2673
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_c4eeef4c:

    # p "...Yes, sir."
    p "...是，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2675
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_6e9246d7:

    # a "Now, return to your duties. I need to inform the captain of the incident and everything I've gathered. We'll discuss this more later."
    a "现在，回去干你的活吧。我得把这件事，还有我了解到的情况，都告诉船长。之后我们会再详细谈谈的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2679
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_75755b0d:

    # "He concludes, dismissing you with a curt nod before swiftly turning in place and heading down the narrow corridor."
    "他说完，朝你微微颔首，然后立刻转身朝狭窄的走廊走去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2681
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_4083cf4d:

    # "Left to your thoughts, you can't shake the nervousness and doubt that lingers within you. Not even one full day has passed, and you've already witnessed a new friend get hurt, and now you're being questioned as if you had something to do with it."
    "独自一人，心中的紧张和怀疑挥之不去。这才不到一天，就亲眼看到一个新朋友受伤，现在还被当成嫌疑犯一样审问。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2683
translate Chinese day2_arthur_incident_talk_ba9efc5a:

    # "With a heavy sigh, you head back toward Rajeeyah's quarters. Might as well check on Sam again before you return to the deck."
    "你重重地叹了口气，朝Rajeeyah的房间走去。 反正回甲板前再去看看Sam也好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2695
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_2cbd0ad9:

    # s "Ya heard him. I'll be right back."
    s "你都听见了，我马上就回来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2697
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_f7929f52:

    # s "Keep doing what you're doing. If you need more water, just pull it up with the bucket I used."
    s "继续干你的活。要是水不够，就用我刚才用的那个桶打水。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2699
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_5e909c41:

    # p "Got it."
    p "知道了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2701
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_9fdfacdf:

    # s "Just be careful not to let go of it. It's quite the harsh pull when it catches the water."
    s "小心别松手，那桶吃水的时候拉力可大了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2703
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_1eaeeb8a:

    # s "And it's not easy to get it out again either."
    s "而且想再把它弄上来也不容易。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2707
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_60abfa1e:

    # s "So just... don't make a fool of yourself and end up empty-handed."
    s "所以...别傻乎乎的，最后空手而归。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2709
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_02beac90:

    # j "Will keep it in mind."
    j "我会记住的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2711
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_b774e75d:

    # sailschwartz "Are you coming?"
    sailschwartz "你来不来？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2716
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_1563e5c3:

    # s "Yes, yes. Don't rush so much, it's bloody mornin'."
    s "来啦来啦。 别催这么急，这他妈才早上！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2718
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_f317516f:

    # "And so the three of you are left to yourselves, as Samuel follows the sailor across the deck of the ship."
    "于是，你们三个就只剩下彼此了，Samuel跟着那个水手穿过船的甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2725
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_66f7dfb0:

    # p "It sounded urgent... I wonder what's going on."
    p "听起来挺急的...不知道发生了什么事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2727
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_81e13bc1:

    # p "Hopefully nothing major."
    p "希望没什么大事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2731
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_49eae2f2:

    # w "Didn't you listen? It's nothing exciting, just a sheet that's worn through."
    w "你没听见吗？ 没什么好兴奋的，就是后桅纵帆磨破了。 "

# game/script day2.rpy:2733
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_a900a151:

    # w "You're not missing out."
    w "你没什么好错过的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2735
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_5b6ef162:

    # "Wolf huffs annoyedly and stays focused on his work."
    "Wolf恼怒地哼了一声，继续埋头干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2737
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_9a4763f4:

    # p "I guess, I just..."
    p "我只是想..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2739
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_4f7d9e86:

    # w "Just get on with it, will you? Can't believe that you really just never can be quiet."
    w "你能不能赶紧干活？ 真不敢相信你这家伙就不能安静一会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2741
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_a4b5f117:

    # "The glare of the Wolf meets your eyes, his patience wears thin already."
    "Wolf怒视着你，耐心已经耗尽。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2743
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_05019be9:

    # "You lower your head and focus on your work as you're told, every now and then you glance back aft of the ship and wonder if you should've asked to go with Samuel."
    "你低下头，按照吩咐认真工作，时不时回头看看船尾，琢磨着自己是不是也该要求和Samuel一起去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2745
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_9adfd82f:

    # j "It's just a-"
    j "只是个..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2749
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_d41bab03:

    # w "Oh, bloody hell-"
    w "哦，该死-"

# game/script day2.rpy:2751
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_e3c9aaf3:

    # j "Just don't listen then if it's so much trouble!"
    j "要是嫌烦就别听！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2755
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_bc74fd8e:

    # "Julian snaps back at Wolf and demonstratively runs his holystone across the deck."
    "Julian顶撞了Wolf一句，然后故意用磨石在甲板上用力摩擦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2759
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_167ed5f1:

    # j "See? I'm working.{w} Still working."
    j "看到没？我在干活呢。{w} 一直在干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2763
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_66f7dfb0_1:

    # p "It sounded urgent... I wonder what's going on."
    p "听起来挺急的...不知道发生了什么事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2765
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_81e13bc1_1:

    # p "Hopefully nothing major."
    p "希望没什么大事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2767
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_b7d57745:

    # w "Nothing as exciting as it sounds, I'd assume."
    w "我猜，肯定没听起来那么有趣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2769
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_a900a151_1:

    # w "You're not missing out."
    w "你没什么好错过的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2773
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_ec85f752:

    # "He stays focused on his work as if trying to tell you that you should do the same."
    "他继续专注于他的工作，好像在暗示你也该这么做。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2775
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_ada972d5:

    # p "It doesn't have to be exciting, I just..."
    p "不一定非得有趣，我只是..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2777
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_64af6af9:

    # "He looks over at you tiredly, and you're not quite sure if it's the early hour of the day or you that's the cause for his expression."
    "他疲惫地看了你一眼，你也不知道是因为时间太早还是因为你，他才露出这副表情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2779
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_a82c7883:

    # w "Things on a ship are always wearing out. They'll just replace something as they'll do hundreds of times in the future."
    w "船上的东西就是坏得快，过阵子他们肯定又要换新的了，这种事以后还多着呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2781
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_5b888ff7:

    # w "Just get on with it."
    w "赶紧干活吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2783
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_b23d423a:

    # "You focus on your work as you're told, every now and then glancing back aft of the ship, wondering if you should've asked to go with Samuel."
    "你按吩咐埋头干活，时不时回头看看船尾，有点后悔没跟Samuel一起去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2787
translate Chinese day2_stay_and_work_with_wolf_and_julian_9d44489b:

    # j "It's just the spanker." nointeract
    j "那只是后桅帆。" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:2799
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_7980d583:

    # p "Right. Of course."
    p "对，当然。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2803
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_29eb5bcc:

    # "Julian immediately sees through the lacking conviction in your voice."
    "Julian一下就听出你没底气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2805
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_a4782113:

    # "He points towards the stern and the mess of rigging between you and the sky."
    "他指着船尾，还有你和天空之间乱糟糟的那些绳索。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2807
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_6b2d83f9:

    # j "It's the big one at the rear, by the way."
    j "顺便说一句，就是船尾最大的那块帆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2809
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_8d52e813:

    # p "Of course! Like I said!"
    p "当然！我就是那么说的！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2811
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_fe206dbe:

    # "You try to weasel your way out of admitting that you had no idea what it was."
    "你试图蒙混过关，不承认自己根本不知道那是什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2815
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_6e0c441a:

    # j "It's fine that you don't know."
    j "你不知道也没事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2817
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_54c25a3c:

    # j "Why would you, after all? Growing up how you did.{w} Chances are I'd be stumped if you start talking about anything about having a homestead."
    j "毕竟你从小就没接触过这些。{w} 要说起农场上的事儿，我肯定也一窍不通。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2819
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_ab3d4455:

    # p "I guess..."
    p "我想也是……"

# game/script day2.rpy:2823
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_80eb21e8:

    # "You answer quietly and push ahead on the deck."
    "你小声回答，继续在甲板上往前走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2827
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_233929fc:

    # j "The mainsheet is probably worn through, not the sail itself."
    j "他们说，大概是主帆缭绳磨损了，不是帆本身的问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2829
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_a7a62215:

    # j "At least that's what they said."
    j "至少他们是这么说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2834
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_7e26563f:

    # "He gives a friendly smile as he explains further. Making a gesture with his hand to illustrate his next words."
    "他友好地笑着，用手势比划着，进一步解释。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2837
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_e694ec14:

    # "He continues with a little hand gesture to illustrate his next words."
    "他继续用手势比划着，进一步解释。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2839
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_be6c75be:

    # j "The one connected to the boom of it."
    j "就是连接到横杆上的那根绳子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2841
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_ef017f71:

    # p "Oh, yes, those I know, don't worry."
    p "哦，对，那个我知道，别担心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2843
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_9ebc0def:

    # p "I'm not THAT clueless."
    p "我还没那么笨。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2847
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_77500788:

    # j "Just wanting to make sure I don't leave you stupid."
    j "我只是不想让你啥都不懂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2849
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_0cb53fc3:

    # "You laugh briefly."
    "你笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2851
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_fdc6fd84:

    # p "Thanks. I guess?{w} I said I'm not that clueless."
    p "谢谢啊。算是吧？{w} 我说了我没那么笨。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2853
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_d283146e:

    # j "Well, but do I know that?"
    j "呵，这我可说不准。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2855
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_26760961:

    # "He chuckles with a teasing smile across his snout."
    "他带着一丝戏谑的笑容轻声笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2859
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_e3359ebd:

    # j "From what I heard though, they lengthened the boom on this ship a while ago."
    j "不过，我听人说，这船的横杆前段时间加长了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2861
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_b4c1fc34:

    # j "My father mentioned it."
    j "我父亲提起过。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2863
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_d0e8901a:

    # p "Oh? And that means?"
    p "哦？那意味着？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2867
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_45f2bdbc:

    # j "That the boom is lon-"
    j "意味着横杆更-"

# game/script day2.rpy:2871
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_d93e3d93:

    # w "He knows that, goddamnit..."
    w "他心里清楚，真是见鬼..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2873
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_fdc3f3a4:

    # "Julian snaps his head towards Wolf as he gets interrupted."
    "Julian被打断，猛地扭头看向Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2875
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_8ae271da:

    # w "He wants to know what it means more broadly."
    w "他是想知道这往大了说意味着什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2879
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_f636b3e9:

    # "You nod as Julian's eyes find you again."
    "你点点头，Julian又看向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2881
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_b77f275f:

    # j "That it's an old enough ship to be re-rigged. And that it most likely requires a lot of upkeep."
    j "意思是这艘船够老了，得重新上索具了。而且肯定得花不少功夫维护。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2883
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_e765d66c:

    # p "How old is it? To tell you the truth, I don't really know that much about it..."
    p "它有多老？说实话，这方面我还真不太懂..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2885
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_e9bd17dd:

    # w "You just signed up on a whim, didn't you?"
    w "你就是一时兴起才来的吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2887
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_cd690351:

    # "It's still difficult for you to read Wolf's tone. But you nod."
    "我还是摸不准Wolf的语气，不过你还是点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2889
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_9912993c:

    # p "More or less, yes..."
    p "差不多，算是吧..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2895
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_bd5b8688:

    # j "Honestly kind of what I expected from you."
    j "果然不出我所料。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2899
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_00828241:

    # p "Hey! What's that supposed to mean?!"
    p "喂！你这话什么意思？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2901
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_addbb5f5:

    # "Chuckling again, he raises his hands towards you in a defensive shrug."
    "他又笑了笑，举起双手，耸了耸肩，表示无辜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2903
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_aa2e7b3b:

    # j "Nothing, nothing! It just..."
    j "没，没什么！我就是觉得..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2905
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_66fca0d0:

    # p "Just what?"
    p "觉得什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2907
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_e50985d2:

    # j "From everything you've mentioned so far, it sort of seems like you jumped in headfirst."
    j "听你说了这么多，感觉你就是一股脑扎进来的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2909
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_62ff2028:

    # "Of course, you suppose he isn't wrong."
    "说的也是，你心想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2911
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_da9820a9:

    # p "I figured that as long as I knew which way was wet..."
    p "我寻思着，只要知道哪边是水就行了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:2915
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_3d50ecb6:

    # "Julian laughs"
    "Julian乐了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2917
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_0b9283df:

    # j "Well, that's a start."
    j "嗯，这倒是个开始。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2920
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_bc13e0b8:

    # j "That's one way of deciding which ship to work on."
    j "选船还挺别致。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2924
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_3e004083:

    # j "But no, I don't know the exact date she was built, but apparently she's older than me at least."
    j "其实我也不知道确切的建造日期，但它肯定比我老。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2926
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_66c7a7d8:

    # j "So over two decades? Maybe three?"
    j "那起码二十多年了？没准三十年？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2928
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_67d7c365:

    # j "And since we might need to tack later, they're probably in a rush to get that sorted out."
    j "之后说不定还得抢风，他们可能正赶着把这些搞定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2930
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_58dc8203:

    # "Wolf interrupts once again."
    "Wolf又不耐烦地打断了对话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2932
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_b34370f0:

    # w "Will you two get back to it? I didn't realize that I signed up to do the work of you two as well."
    w "你们俩能不能干点正事？我可不是来替你们干活的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2934
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_38fa14c0:

    # "Julian shakes his head and goes back to focus on the scrubbing, as do you."
    "Julian摇摇头，回去专心擦洗，你也跟着埋头苦干。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2936
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_7508391f:

    # p "It's not going to be a bad thing that she's older, is it?"
    p "船老一点，应该没啥事儿吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2938
translate Chinese day2_pretend_to_know_what_that_means_a94d8c49:

    # j "No, she's in good knack. My father wouldn't let me on here otherwise."
    j "没事，船况好着呢。不然我老爹也不能让我上来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2943
translate Chinese day2_the_who_610a830d:

    # p "Who's that?"
    p "你老爹是谁？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2947
translate Chinese day2_the_who_3a1634a7:

    # "You pick up Wolf's snort of laughter, so quiet that you almost miss it."
    "你听见Wolf嗤笑了一声，声音小得差点没听见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2950
translate Chinese day2_the_who_01ae182c:

    # "Julian grins and points towards the stern and the mess of rigging between you and the sky."
    "Julian咧嘴一笑，指着船尾，还有你和天空之间那堆乱七八糟的索具。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2952
translate Chinese day2_the_who_a581cd24:

    # j "\"The what.\" The big sail at the rear."
    j "“啥？”是船尾那张大帆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2956
translate Chinese day2_the_who_fd5f55ba:

    # p "Oh."
    p "哦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2958
translate Chinese day2_the_who_7a93bc2d:

    # "You feel rather stupid not knowing something probably so obvious, however Julian doesn't seem to mind."
    "你觉得自己真蠢，这么明显的东西都不知道，不过Julian好像没当回事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2960
translate Chinese day2_the_who_79c9adad:

    # "Peeking over your shoulder you look at it and try to figure out just where the damage is on the sail."
    "你探头看了看那张帆，想看看到底是哪儿坏了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2962
translate Chinese day2_the_who_2ff20970:

    # p "It looks fine from here, doesn't it? {w}It doesn't look worn at all..."
    p "从这儿瞧着挺结实的，不是吗？{w}看着一点都没磨损呢……"

# game/script day2.rpy:2964
translate Chinese day2_the_who_9cf54515:

    # j "The mainsheet is."
    j "是主帆缭绳。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2966
translate Chinese day2_the_who_5459911e:

    # j "You listened to them, didn't you? They mentioned it."
    j "你听他们说过的，对吧？他们提过的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2968
translate Chinese day2_the_who_d6b51ec3:

    # p "Oh, right."
    p "哦，对。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2970
translate Chinese day2_the_who_78c93abd:

    # "You chuckle defensively."
    "你有点不好意思地笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2972
translate Chinese day2_the_who_e3359ebd:

    # j "From what I heard though, they lengthened the boom on this ship a while ago."
    j "不过，我听人说，这船的横杆前段时间加长了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2974
translate Chinese day2_the_who_f8ec752e:

    # j "This ship wasn't designed for it. That's what my father said, anyway."
    j "我爸说了，这船本来就不是为它设计的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2976
translate Chinese day2_the_who_2bc87766:

    # p "That sounds bad?"
    p "听着不太妙啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2984
translate Chinese day2_the_who_6a85fcb3:

    # w "Not having doubts about your adventure, are you?"
    w "怎么着，开始对你的冒险有疑问了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2986
translate Chinese day2_the_who_13c2bef6:

    # "You look over to Wolf and see his smirk across his face and you start to feel a knot form in your stomach."
    "你瞥了Wolf一眼，看到他脸上那抹坏笑，胃里顿时开始打结。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2988
translate Chinese day2_the_who_a0f927e1:

    # "Is it something you should be worried about?!"
    "这事儿是不是我该担心的啊？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:2992
translate Chinese day2_the_who_ca9868e8:

    # "Julian rolls his eyes at Wolf's comment."
    "Julian冲着Wolf的玩笑翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:2994
translate Chinese day2_the_who_fb6ee57c:

    # j "Let me guess, next you're going to start going on about pirates and ghost ships?"
    j "我猜猜，你接下来是不是要扯什么海盗和幽灵船了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:2998
translate Chinese day2_the_who_a3c7237b:

    # "Wolf glares balefully at Julian, who offers a characteristically wry smile back."
    "Wolf狠狠地瞪了Julian一眼，Julian则回了他一个标志性的嘲讽笑容。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3000
translate Chinese day2_the_who_0dc2ad74:

    # j "Anyway, feel free to ignore him. It's perfectly safe.{w} Just means that the blocks weren't designed for that much sail and it wears out the sheet."
    j "别理他。绝对安全。{w} 就是说那些滑轮不是给这么大的帆设计的，会磨损缭绳。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3005
translate Chinese day2_the_who_523092d3:

    # j "Or do you think my old man would have left me on this thing if it wasn't?"
    j "不然你以为我老头子会放心把我扔在这艘船上？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3011
translate Chinese day2_the_who_6a85fcb3_1:

    # w "Not having doubts about your adventure, are you?"
    w "怎么着，开始对你的冒险有疑问了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3013
translate Chinese day2_the_who_13c2bef6_1:

    # "You look over to Wolf and see his smirk across his face and you start to feel a knot form in your stomach."
    "你瞥了Wolf一眼，看到他脸上那抹坏笑，胃里顿时开始打结。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3015
translate Chinese day2_the_who_a0f927e1_1:

    # "Is it something you should be worried about?!"
    "这事儿是不是我该担心的啊？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:3019
translate Chinese day2_the_who_66cbd998:

    # j "It's safe.{w} Just means that the blocks weren't designed for that much sail and it wears out the sheet."
    j "它是安全的。{w} 就是说那些滑轮不是给这么大的帆设计的，会磨损缭绳。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3022
translate Chinese day2_the_who_66cbd998_1:

    # j "It's safe.{w} Just means that the blocks weren't designed for that much sail and it wears out the sheet."
    j "它是安全的。{w} 就是说那些滑轮不是给这么大的帆设计的，会磨损缭绳。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3024
translate Chinese day2_the_who_2f6b4ba6:

    # j "But replacing things is just part of life at sea."
    j "不过在海上，更换零件也是家常便饭。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3026
translate Chinese day2_the_who_67d7c365:

    # j "And since we might need to tack later, they're probably in a rush to get that sorted out."
    j "之后说不定还得抢风，他们可能正赶着把这些搞定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3028
translate Chinese day2_the_who_7b770136:

    # p "You really know a lot about all this."
    p "你懂的真不少啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3030
translate Chinese day2_the_who_ead625c3:

    # p "Did you learn it from your father? Appears like he taught you a lot."
    p "跟你爸学的？看来他教了你挺多东西啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3032
translate Chinese day2_the_who_b5f6463c:

    # "A moment of silence settles between the two of you. And you realize that you may have sounded a bit too enthusiastic asking that question."
    "你们俩之间突然安静了下来。你意识到自己刚才问得可能有点太热情了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3034
translate Chinese day2_the_who_50c5614e:

    # "You notice that his expression changes slightly and feel the need to quickly append something. Anything."
    "你注意到他的表情稍微变了变，赶紧想补救两句，说点什么都行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3036
translate Chinese day2_the_who_a685af4b:

    # p "I just mean, that you maybe wouldn't...{w}Sorry, I was just impressed by it."
    p "我就是说，你可能不会……{w}抱歉，我就是觉得你挺厉害的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3038
translate Chinese day2_the_who_7e2cf219:

    # j "It's fine."
    j "没事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3042
translate Chinese day2_the_who_8765d09b:

    # j "He just was very proud when we finally had a ship for me to sign up to. After everything."
    j "他只是特别自豪，终于有艘船能让我加入了。 经历了那么多事之后。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3044
translate Chinese day2_the_who_1bcd62e8:

    # j "It still wasn't joining the navy, ya know? Like he did. But..."
    j "不过我还是没去海军，你知道吧？ 没像他那样。 但是……"

# game/script day2.rpy:3046
translate Chinese day2_the_who_47a70cb8:

    # "Julian shrugs dismissively and concentrates more on the work again while talking."
    "Julian不屑地耸耸肩，又埋头干活，嘴里还不停地说着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3048
translate Chinese day2_the_who_73551dc4:

    # j "Finally his son's \"becoming a real man\" at sea. Conway this, Conway that, being trained under a former military officer."
    "终于他儿子要在海上“成为真正的男子汉”啦。 Conway号长，Conway号短，说是在前军官手下训练。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3050
translate Chinese day2_the_who_068bfe1d:

    # "Is he mimicking his father's tone dismissively, or do you detect an actual bit of pride in his own accomplishments?"
    "他是在学他爹那副不屑一顾的腔调，还是说，你真觉得他对自己那点成就挺自豪的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3052
translate Chinese day2_the_who_fec26038:

    # j "How she sailed to India, even the Americas!"
    j "听说她还航行到过印度，甚至美洲！"

# game/script day2.rpy:3056
translate Chinese day2_the_who_0a03bcbd:

    # p "And I assume you just more or less nodded along?"
    p "我猜你就是嗯嗯啊啊地应付过去了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3058
translate Chinese day2_the_who_1e1f469a:

    # j "Yes..."
    j "嗯..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3062
translate Chinese day2_the_who_b34370f0:

    # w "Will you two get back to it? I didn't realize that I signed up to do the work of you two as well."
    w "你们俩能不能干点正事？我可不是来替你们干活的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3065
translate Chinese day2_the_who_d0e00096:

    # j "Sorry, of course."
    j "抱歉，当然。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3069
translate Chinese day2_the_who_7af0eb75:

    # "Julian picks up his pace a little and you follow suit."
    "Julian加快了脚步，你也赶紧跟上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3073
translate Chinese day2_the_who_c21d5be7:

    # w "Thank you. Much prefer to get this over sooner rather than later. {w}Instead of us all gossiping like maids at market."
    w "谢谢。我宁愿早点把这事儿做完，省得拖拖拉拉的。{w}跟一群在菜市场嚼舌根的娘们儿似的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3075
translate Chinese day2_the_who_6e8d27d0:

    # j "I guess I could do without them tearing us a new one right the first day as well."
    j "谁想第一天就被他们穿小鞋啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3079
translate Chinese day2_the_who_45e38fc2:

    # w "At least on that we're on the same page."
    w "至少这点上咱俩想到一块儿去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3081
translate Chinese day2_the_who_6688c4fd:

    # p "See? Maybe you'll become great friends after all."
    p "怎么样？说不定你们之后能成为好哥们儿呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3085
translate Chinese day2_the_who_e3ef35d7:

    # "Julian returns with a chuckle."
    "Julian轻笑一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3087
translate Chinese day2_the_who_75a7e1e9:

    # w "Don't get ahead of yourself."
    w "别自作多情了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3095
translate Chinese day2_the_who_0e374e22:

    # "Julian picked up his pace a little and you follow suit."
    "Julian加快了脚步，你也赶紧跟上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3097
translate Chinese day2_the_who_42e6224a:

    # p "I guess we should."
    p "看来咱们得抓紧了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3103
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_605a8c47:

    # "The three of you make fairly decent progress. It's nothing glamorous, but then, it doesn't have to be."
    "你们三个干活效率还挺高。虽然没什么光彩的，但也犯不着追求那些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3105
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_98c0a793:

    # "You might even feel useful, especially knowing that it's not just busywork."
    "你甚至可能觉得自己有点用处，特别是知道这不只是打发时间的闲差事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3109
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_9cca3559:

    # "Still, when some movement in your periphery catches your attention, you look over at once. Someone is walking towards you."
    "突然，眼角的余光瞥到有人影晃动，你立刻转头看去。 有人正朝你们走过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3111
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0dcbcb11:

    # "For a fraction of a second you think it might be Samuel coming back, but the fuzzy silhouette at the corner of your eye is much too tall for that."
    "一瞬间，你还以为是Samuel回来了，但眼角那模糊的身影，个头高太多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3113
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_898d4bf2:

    # "However once you look you realize it's the passenger from yesterday. {w}Nomax was his name?"
    "定睛一看，原来是昨天遇到的那位乘客。{w} 好像叫Nomax？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3115
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_63af32cf:

    # j "Isn't that?... From yesterday?"
    j "那位不是……昨天见过的吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3117
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_131244d1:

    # "Julian looks at you to get confirmation that he isn't mixing anyone up and you nod in return."
    "Julian看着你，想确认他没记错人，你也点点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3119
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_3b88c420:

    # p "Yes."
    p "是的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3121
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_d6a2f1cd:

    # p "Appears that he's feeling better today."
    p "看来他今天精神不错啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3125
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a9797106:

    # j "So no entertainment for us today?"
    j "这么说，今天没好戏看了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3127
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_6429cd2f:

    # p "That's just mean, Julian."
    p "Julian，你可真刻薄。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3129
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_58790238:

    # j "Hey, you gotta admit that it was pretty funny."
    j "嘿，你不得不承认，昨天那事儿确实挺逗的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3132
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0b2056f1:

    # w "It kind of was, yeah. I'm with the lizard."
    w "确实有点。我站蜥蜴人那边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3134
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_273d9ccb:

    # j "See? You're just bound to have to live with it if you stick out in some way on a ship like this."
    j "看到没？在这种船上，只要你稍微有点不一样，就注定要被人指指点点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3138
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a242b1d1:

    # p "Don't I know that..."
    p "我太清楚了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:3142
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0d4e1c3c:

    # w "Is that where the Runt moniker comes from?"
    w "这就是‘矮冬瓜’这个外号的来由？"
    # 译注：承接前一日Arthur给James起的贬损外号Runt（矮冬瓜）。

# game/script day2.rpy:3144
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_27de2bf4:

    # "You lift your hand to rub the backside of your head."
    "你抬手挠了挠后脑勺。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3146
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_d88b7a87:

    # p "Look, you remember how there was a commotion shortly before I came up to you two yesterday?"
    p "听着，你们还记得昨天我过去找你们之前，那场闹剧吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3148
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_92b229b8:

    # p "That might have been caused by me.{w} Arthur did not appreciate it."
    p "那可能是我惹出来的。Arthur可不买账。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3150
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_85a058f2:

    # w "Of course..."
    w "当然……"

# game/script day2.rpy:3154
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_87270876:

    # j "How in the world did you manage that?"
    j "你究竟是怎么搞的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3156
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c6773349:

    # "Julian gives you an inquisitive look."
    "Julian一脸好奇地看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3158
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_be951255:

    # p "You know that crane they had?...I may have stood underneath it..."
    p "就是他们用的那个起重机……我可能不小心站它底下去了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:3160
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a9e344dd:

    # p "By accident of course."
    p "当然是纯属意外。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3162
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_eb82ad2e:

    # p "I just was a little distracted."
    p "我就是有点走神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3166
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_88eac2be:

    # j "Can't blame Arthur there. I felt like it might have been you when you waltzed up the gangway a minute later."
    j "这事儿不能怪Arthur。一分钟后，你大摇大摆走上舷梯的时候，我就觉得肯定是你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3168
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_5b4406c7:

    # j "At least now I have the confirmation."
    j "至少现在实锤了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3170
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b3dd3cd5:

    # j "You really are the greenest of greenhorns."
    j "你真是菜鸟中的菜鸟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3172
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b69100bd:

    # "Julian says with a laugh and gives you a playful nudge against the shoulder."
    "Julian笑着轻轻推了你肩膀一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3174
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_94deed1b:

    # j "Did you prepare at all for this?"
    j "你有为当水手做过什么准备吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3178
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_aae508d7:

    # p "Not really? I mean... how would I?{w} On a farm."
    p "真没有。我是说……在农场里，我能准备啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3180
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_cbc623cb:

    # w "I didn't exactly prepare either, so he's not alone."
    w "我也没怎么准备，所以他不孤单。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3182
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c4bd88de:

    # j "Yeah, but see, you feel like you just get stuff done."
    j "是，但你看，你就是那种能摆平事儿的人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3184
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_7c413876:

    # j "Intimidatingly so, with an air of being an asshole, but you do."
    j "虽然拽得二五八万似的，但不得不承认，你就是能摆平。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3186
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_93f44a2b:

    # "Wolf snarled yet let it peter out into a low, almost imperceptible grumble."
    "Wolf嘟囔了一声，但声音越来越小，最后小声嘟囔了几句，声音小的几乎听不见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3191
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0b2056f1_1:

    # w "It kind of was, yeah. I'm with the lizard."
    w "确实有点。我站蜥蜴人那边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3193
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_273d9ccb_1:

    # j "See? You're just bound to have to live with it if you stick out in some way on a ship like this."
    j "看到没？在这种船上，只要你稍微有点不一样，就注定要被人指指点点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3197
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_40090fdc:

    # p "Well, I'll try my best to avoid that then..."
    p "好吧，那我尽量不给人那种感觉..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3199
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_970ea0da:

    # j "Didn't Arthur call you Runt? I'm not sure if you're doing the best job at avoiding it."
    j "Arthur不是喊你矮冬瓜来着吗？我看你这想甩脱外号的劲头可不太灵验。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3201
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_d559df2b:

    # p "We just started off on the wrong foot, that's all."
    p "我们只是开头不太顺利，仅此而已。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3205
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_aef3394f:

    # "You answer defensively and push the holystone along one of the planks."
    "你辩解道，一边沿着一块甲板推动着磨石。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3207
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_23288473:

    # j "Made an ass out of yourself, just like I said."
    j "让你自己丢人现眼，跟我说的一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3209
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_6b848c0c:

    # p "Shut up..."
    p "闭嘴..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3216
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0b2056f1_2:

    # w "It kind of was, yeah. I'm with the lizard."
    w "确实有点。我站蜥蜴人那边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3218
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_273d9ccb_2:

    # j "See? You're just bound to have to live with it if you stick out in some way on a ship like this."
    j "看到没？在这种船上，只要你稍微有点不一样，就注定要被人指指点点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3222
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_40090fdc_1:

    # p "Well, I'll try my best to avoid that then..."
    p "好吧，那我尽量不给人那种感觉..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3224
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_bf912615:

    # w "Didn't Arthur call you a Runt?"
    w "Arthur不是喊你叫矮冬瓜吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3226
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_d559df2b_1:

    # p "We just started off on the wrong foot, that's all."
    p "我们只是开头不太顺利，仅此而已。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3231
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_2c45611f:

    # n "Good morning, Gentlemen."
    n "早上好，先生们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3233
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_7b67567a:

    # "The voice interrupts the three of you."
    "这个声音打断了你们三个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3237
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_e3b84f93:

    # "You turn to face him and see the painted dog standing tall next to the three of you."
    "你转过身，看到那个脸上涂了油彩的狗，高高地站在你们旁边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3239
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_271e766c:

    # p "Hello, sir."
    p "您好，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3241
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_8317c1c8:

    # j "Good morning, sir."
    j "早上好，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3245
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_f111d407:

    # n "If I am not mistaken you are the one I met yesterday, am I correct?"
    n "如果我没记错，您就是昨天见到的那位吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3249
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_fe767df3:

    # "He looks down at you with a pleasant smile as you sit up on your knees."
    "您半跪起身，他面带微笑地看着您。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3251
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_5c235325:

    # p "Indeed, sir. Are you feeling better today?"
    p "的确是，先生。您今天感觉好些了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3253
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_3bc5056b:

    # "He nods briefly before looking out at sea."
    "他微微点头，然后望向大海。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3257
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a6b24742:

    # n "So far so good.{w} I figured I would try to take in the air, as it were..."
    n "目前还不错。{w} 我寻思着出来透透气..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3259
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0fa17698:

    # n "The breeze of the morning...get out of the dank cabin."
    n "吹吹早上的海风...总比待在又闷又潮的船舱里强。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3261
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a1cb0bcf:

    # n "I believe they call this \"getting your sea legs,\" do they not?"
    n "他们管这叫“海上腿”，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3265
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_3fc18d24:

    # n "Something I am sure you all managed much more gracefully."
    n "我看各位肯定比我适应得快多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3269
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_01a825e2:

    # n "Thank you again for yesterday."
    n "再次感谢您昨天出手相助。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3271
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_ae6285ff:

    # "You wave him off with a quick gesture of your hand."
    "您摆摆手，示意他别放在心上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3273
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_8a006ff0:

    # p "Don't mention it."
    p "小事一桩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3277
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_644a85bd:

    # j "Come the first storm, we'll all be feeling differently, I expect..."
    j "等真遇上风暴，恐怕就不是现在这感觉了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3279
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c4ff39fd:

    # "Julian interjected with a subtle laugh."
    "Julian笑着插了一句。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3284
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_56e3d082:

    # n "Ah..."
    n "啊..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3286
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_40dc8f79:

    # "If it were possible for the painted dog to turn green, you think he might well do so."
    "他脸色难看死了，跟抹了颜料似的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3288
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a6f375a3:

    # "He certainly doesn't appear to appreciate having that potential scenario brought to his attention."
    "显然，他不太想听到这种可能会发生的情况。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3290
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_040031f5:

    # n "I hope we can avoid those..."
    n "希望我们能避开那些..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3294
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_fabc71ef:

    # n "Who are these other two gentlemen, Mr. [family_name]?"
    n "这两位先生是？[family_name]先生？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3296
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_3bca5f1b:

    # "Your ears perk up as you quickly introduce both Julian and Wolf."
    "您赶紧把Julian和Wolf介绍了一下，同时竖起耳朵听着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3298
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_117f8015:

    # p "We're all the new crew, so of course we got settled with this."
    p "我们都是新来的，所以就一起住这儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3300
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_e20e3f2b:

    # n "I see. Well, Julian, Wolf, it has been a pleasure meeting you two as well, however I do not want to keep you from your work."
    n "我明白了。那Julian、Wolf先生，很高兴认识你们，我就不打扰你们工作了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3302
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0e8bf55e:

    # n "Pretend I am not here."
    n "当我不存在就好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3304
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_272cf999:

    # j "I don't think anyone minds the distraction, sir."
    j "先生，我想大家都不介意休息一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3306
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_01018c3e:

    # w "I don't know about that..."
    w "那可说不定..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3311
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_8b4fd366:

    # j "Well, Wolf might, but he can just pick the other side of the deck if it's a problem."
    j "嗯，Wolf也许会，不过他要是嫌吵，可以去甲板另一边待着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3313
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_948f1d65:

    # "Wolf huffs annoyedly but continues with his work."
    "Wolf不耐烦地哼了一声，继续干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3317
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b4e9a6e9:

    # n "My apolog-"
    n "我抱..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3320
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_f99780f0:

    # j "Don't mind him. He's just playing it up to be the big bad wolf."
    j "别理他。他就是装装样子，假装自己是只大灰狼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3322
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_2e70f3f5:

    # j "All bark, as they say."
    j "全是只会叫唤的货，他们就是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3324
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_fb252e8b:

    # w "Will you just keep your mouth shut, lizard?"
    w "你能不能闭嘴，你这蜥蜴崽子？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3328
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_00e4b1fa:

    # j "See?"
    j "怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3330
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0a79aeab:

    # "Julian chuckles confidently."
    "Julian自信地笑着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3334
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_9ce82994:

    # n "I...well, I guess the tone between sailors is supposed to be rough, so you three have that one down already."
    n "我...嗯，我猜水手之间就该这样说话，看来你们三个倒是挺适应的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3339
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_67c7a8f0:

    # p "That's one way of putting it."
    p "这倒是种说法。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3341
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_23525f5c:

    # "Nomax clearly looks a little uncomfortable in his position, appearing to feel as if he's the one causing the tension between Julian and Wolf."
    "Nomax看起来有点如坐针毡，似乎觉得自己是造成Julian和Wolf之间紧张关系的人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3343
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b5da6628:

    # "And his solution to it seems to be to shift the conversation in another direction."
    "而他解决这个问题的方法似乎是将话题转移到另一个方向。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3347
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_8988d64b:

    # n "Oh—Uh, did you know we have a piper aboard?"
    n "噢——呃，你们知道咱们船上有位横笛手吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3351
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_ea034391:

    # n "I could have sworn I heard one, anyway, when I was taking tea..."
    n "说起来，我喝茶的时候，我发誓我听到过。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3355
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_9c3db070:

    # w "Did you? {w}Imagine that."
    w "是吗？{w}真想不到。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3359
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_3384db10:

    # n "I did. The march of the British grenadiers, I believe."
    n "是的。我相信是大不列颠掷弹兵进行曲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3363
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_cc6ed45a:

    # "You notice the surprise in Julian's eyes as he realized that Nomax had recognized it."
    "你注意到当Julian意识到Nomax认出它时，他眼中闪过一丝惊讶。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3367
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_856fd580:

    # j "It was, yes."
    j "没错，是它。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3369
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_ab648e0a:

    # "Nomax picks up on the excitement of the lizard as well and manages to put two and two together."
    "Nomax也察觉到了蜥蜴的兴奋，他也品出点味道来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3371
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_acd9bfcc:

    # n "Was it you who played it?"
    n "是你演奏的吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3373
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c16ed10e:

    # n "It is an older piece, I am surprised that you would know it."
    n "这是一首比较老的曲子，没想到你还懂这个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3375
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_33f0252e:

    # n "I enjoyed your rendition of it. Rather more spirited than they would play it in the Army."
    n "我很喜欢你的演奏。比那些当兵的老爷们吹得带劲多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3379
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_7a8c3b02:

    # j "Yes. Well—it's not my fife. It's his."
    j "知道啊。不过——那横笛可不是我的，是他的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3383
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_944aa159:

    # j "But it was me who played it."
    j "但演奏它的人是我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3385
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c27d297b:

    # "The tip of Julian's tail flickers across the deck as he points in Wolf's direction."
    "Julian的尾巴尖在甲板上轻弹，指向Wolf的方向。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3387
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c5f4535f:

    # n "Two musicians then?"
    n "那么，是两位音乐家吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3389
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_cd1c9c64:

    # "He smiles down at Julian."
    "他微笑着看着Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3391
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_d4ac3cbe:

    # n "It really was nice to hear."
    n "真的很好听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3393
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_184a33b1:

    # n "Though an odd choice for you to know how to play, I have to admit."
    n "说实话，真没想到你还会这个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3395
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_98de3433:

    # n "Though I do rather prefer the Lilliburlero March when it comes to marching pieces if I am honest."
    n "要我说啊，行军乐里我更喜欢《莉莉布莱罗进行曲》。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3397
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_de55ace0:

    # n "Nothing against your playing of course, it was quite wonderful, but the Lilliburlero March has such an interesting history to it."
    n "当然，我并不是反对你的演奏，你的演奏非常精彩，但《莉莉布莱罗进行曲》有着非常有趣的历史。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3399
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_080ae3ee:

    # n "A rather exquisite dance piece that found its way into the military. Written by Henry Purcell a hundred years ago."
    n "一首非常精致的舞曲，后来被用于军事。由亨利·珀塞尔一百年前创作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3403
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_71b3f77b:

    # n "He had a few other really quite wonderful compositions, the Dido and Aeneas opera is probably my favorite..."
    n "他还有其他一些非常棒的作品，《狄多和埃涅阿斯》歌剧可能是我最喜欢的......"

# game/script day2.rpy:3405
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_12e7d2e7:

    # n "Or perhaps King Arthur...or..."
    n "或者也许是《亚瑟王》......或者......"

# game/script day2.rpy:3409
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_81881757:

    # "His ears flick up stiffly as he realizes the lack of reply from you or the others."
    "当他发现你和其他人都没有回应时，耳朵一下子警觉地竖了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3413
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_965cc19d:

    # n "Pardon me, I may have gotten a bit carried away."
    n "抱歉，我可能有点说嗨了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3417
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_d2913281:

    # n "Well, I guess the tone between sailors is supposed to be rough, so you three have that one down already..."
    n "得了吧，我寻思水手之间不就该这样粗声粗气的嘛，那你们三个倒是挺入戏的..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3422
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_67c7a8f0_1:

    # p "That's one way of putting it."
    p "这倒是种说法。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3424
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_50811f66:

    # "Nomax clearly looks a bit uncomfortable in his position, as if he was the one causing the tension between Julian and Wolf."
    "Nomax 看起来明显有些不自在，好像是他让Julian 和 Wolf 之间关系这么僵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3426
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a73a8bac:

    # "His solution seems to be a change of topic."
    "他好像想换个话题来着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3430
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_34780490:

    # n "So, will it be like this for you all the way to Morocco?"
    n "咱们这一路到摩洛哥，都得这么过？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3434
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_9780a3e3:

    # w "The pleasure of each other's company while we do the exact same shit every day, you mean?"
    w "你是说，每天干着同样的破事儿，还得强颜欢笑，享受彼此的陪伴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3438
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_228e3b68:

    # n "Well..."
    n "那个..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3440
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c3c20bae:

    # w "Yes. It will be like this until the deck is cleaned. {w}So it can start to get dirty again."
    w "没错。甲板不刷干净就得一直这样。刷干净了，又等着它脏回去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3442
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_9c59d96d:

    # "He looks towards Nomax with the same degree of respect he accords you and Julian."
    "他对Nomax 的尊重，和你与Julian 没什么两样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3447
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_24bb781f:

    # w "Do you want to try?"
    w "要不你来试试？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3449
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_9d652c19:

    # n "Er, I would, but-"
    n "额，我是想试试，可..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3451
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_2780a11a:

    # "Julian interjects, stepping in to save the painted dog."
    "Julian 打断了他的话，像个英雄一样站了出来，想要拯救这只“彩绘狗”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3453
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b1921f0e:

    # j "But he's not being paid for it like we are."
    j "他可不像咱，干这活儿还有钱拿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3458
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c263fc1e:

    # w "I suppose. It's not like it's worth much."
    w "我寻思也是。反正也不值几个钱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3464
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_57f4e780:

    # "Julian laughs."
    "Julian 笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3466
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_abc3d4b8:

    # j "Did everyone memorize our itinerary except me?"
    j "不是吧，就我一个人没记住咱们的行程？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3468
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_af049f1b:

    # w "Imagine wanting to know what we were all in for..."
    w "竟然有人想知道接下来要遭什么罪..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3472
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a179f8f9:

    # j "It isn't like we have any choice in it, is it?"
    j "反正又由不得咱们，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3476
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_5d66f3db:

    # w "Isn't it? Could always jump ship."
    w "怎么由得了？大不了跳船呗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3478
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c9ed8430:

    # "You don't get the sense that he's truly serious, as opposed to just his typical dour self."
    "你感觉他不是在开玩笑，只是单纯的阴阳怪气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3480
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0c7f6854:

    # w "Hmm. And lose the experience of working with you lot at such meaningful business, though..."
    w "嗯... 错过和你们这群人一起干大事的机会，那可不行..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3482
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_11ca546e:

    # "He trails off, with just a whisker's worth of mirth behind his thin, sardonic smile, and then repeats himself."
    "他声音渐弱，嘴角勾起一丝嘲讽的笑意，带着一丝不易察觉的愉悦，然后又重复了一遍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3484
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_34f6ee88:

    # w "Could always jump ship."
    w "大不了跳船呗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3488
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a8adf2bd:

    # w "But, yes, it will be like this."
    w "不过，没错，日子就这么过了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3490
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_3d759ecb:

    # j "And cleaning the bilge."
    j "还有清理污水。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3492
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_08b7595d:

    # w "Right."
    w "是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3494
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_9b90a14d:

    # j "And mending the rigging."
    j "还有修理帆缆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3496
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_9efb4b57:

    # w "Yes."
    w "是的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3498
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_ac48007a:

    # j "And standing watch at night when it's freezing."
    j "还有在寒夜里值班。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3502
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_63bdc9fd:

    # w "Oh, that one's not so bad."
    w "嗨，那活儿还成。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3506
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0a6d0ccb:

    # "Wolf brushes at the fur of his arm, to drive the point home. Julian rolls his eyes."
    "\"真是的。\" Wolf掸了掸胳膊上的毛，像是要借此强调什么。Julian听罢，翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3508
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_6d6978a9:

    # j "It will pass the time until port, at least."
    j "至少，这样能熬到靠岸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3513
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b16a985a:

    # p "What about you, sir?"
    p "\"你呢，先生？\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3517
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_83cafdcd:

    # n "How am I passing the time?"
    n "\"我？打发时间？\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3521
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_7450f643:

    # "You find yourself curious, and nod. He's not swabbing the deck, to be sure, but..."
    "你忍不住好奇，点了点头。他肯定不是在擦甲板，不过..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3523
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_bf8eee73:

    # n "Preparing myself for my destination, mostly. Studying what is already known about the plant life. {w}Thinking about how best to begin my research. {w}When I am feeling well enough to do so..."
    n "\"我主要是在为即将到达的目的地做准备，研究当地的植物。{w} 也在考虑该如何着手研究。{w} 等我身体好些了再说吧......\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3525
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_851f2d0c:

    # "The painted dog realizes that this sort of 'work' is a far cry from that of a deck gang."
    "这位“彩绘狗”也明白，他做的这活儿，跟甲板上的苦力们可没法比。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3529
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_f5a40ac7:

    # "He gives a gentle, self-deprecating smile."
    "他略带歉意地笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3531
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_3949edf2:

    # n "I know it does not seem like it, but I will be as happy as you to be back on dry land for a bit."
    n "\"我知道这听起来有点奇怪，不过能早点回到陆地，我肯定跟你一样高兴。\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3535
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_84dbc9e6:

    # "The painted dog stays for a bit of small talk, beyond that, but he seems to have places to be."
    "“彩绘狗”又闲聊了一会儿，但似乎还有事要忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3537
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_728d100a:

    # "Or he wants to let you get back to work without the distraction, for your own benefit."
    "也可能他是体谅你，想让你抓紧时间干活，别被他耽误了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3541
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_e5602dcf:

    # "After he's bid you farewell, you get back to scrubbing the deck."
    "他跟你告别后，你就回去擦甲板了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3547
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_feb8f97a:

    # "The morning wears on slowly, until the sound of urgent footsteps draws your attention."
    "上午的时间过得很慢，一阵急促的脚步声突然引起了你的注意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3551
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_700ce207:

    # "You turn to see a sailor running towards you."
    "你回头一看，是个水手正朝你跑过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3553
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_667dfe42:

    # "A more experienced deckhand by the looks of it."
    "看样子是个老水手了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3555
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_270d0c38:

    # sailmullein "Oi!"
    sailmullein "喂！"

# game/script day2.rpy:3559
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_fdc85a4f:

    # sailmullein "One of you. We need a hand!"
    sailmullein "\"你们几个，过来搭把手！\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3561
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_91279ca1:

    # "The three of you look at one another as if to figure out who needs to go."
    "你们三人面面相觑，不知道该谁去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3563
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a6f3dd88:

    # "Wolf shrugs, and turns back to his work, having no interest in volunteering."
    "Wolf耸耸肩，转头回去干自己的活儿，压根儿没想帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3567
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_f8d2feb2:

    # sailmullein "Quick-like, eh?"
    sailmullein "\"麻利点，成不？\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3569
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_7413364e:

    # sailmullein "C'mon, now. You do talk, don't you?"
    sailmullein "\"我说，哥们儿，你倒是吱一声啊？\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3571
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_ced59206:

    # "You're the first one to speak."
    "你第一个开了口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3573
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_ea4b12b7:

    # p "Yes, sir? What do you need?"
    p "\"怎么了，长官？要我们帮什么忙？\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3579
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_572e1677:

    # "You get to your feet as you answer, feeling the tingling in your legs as they finally get proper blood flow again after kneeling down for such a long time."
    "你一边回答，一边站起身。长时间跪着，腿都麻了，这会儿才缓过来点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3581
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_51e526ad:

    # sailmullein "Come along then."
    sailmullein "\"跟我来。\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3583
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_7ea61e49:

    # "He beckons you towards the ship's interior and immediately starts to move towards it quickly."
    "他朝船舱里一指，自己也赶紧走了过去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3592
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_03bfb80e:

    # "You hurry as you try to catch up, weaving around some of the barrels stored up here and down the stairs."
    "你连忙跟上，绕过堆在甲板上的几个木桶，下了楼梯。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3594
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_f518e3b3:

    # p "What's going on, sir? Why the hurry?"
    p "\"出什么事了，长官？这么着急？\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3596
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_ca091cac:

    # sailmullein "Don't \"sir\" me; we're not in the bloody Navy."
    sailmullein "\"别叫我长官，这儿又不是海军。\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3598
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b59d0287:

    # sailmullein "Cor, not like y'look like you'd know. Came on at the last stop, didn't you?"
    sailmullein "\"嘿，看你这样儿，啥都不懂。上次靠岸才上船的吧？\""

# game/script day2.rpy:3600
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_3a5003da:

    # p "Yes sir-"
    p "是的，先生-"

# game/script day2.rpy:3602
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b14f0999:

    # p "-uh. Yes. Sorry. I'm new, yes. Is it the mainsheet?"
    p "-呃，对，对不起，先生。我是新来的。那是主帆索吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3604
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0ca94153:

    # "The sailor stops in his tracks and gives you a questioning look."
    "水手停下脚步，疑惑地看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3606
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_7a2689bc:

    # sailmullein "What do you know about that?"
    sailmullein "你懂多少？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3608
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_78d515fa:

    # p "Uh. Just that it was worn."
    p "呃，只是它磨损了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3610
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_5f925fee:

    # "Your answer doesn't appear to have satisfied his curiosity."
    "他似乎对你的回答不太满意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3612
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_445d7afe:

    # p "Another sailor mentioned that it needed mending. I heard the..."
    p "另一位水手说要修理。我听到..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3614
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_adf5722f:

    # "You try to remember what Julian said, uncertain why the sailor is looking at you the way he is."
    "你努力回忆Julian说了什么，但搞不懂水手为什么那样看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3616
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_177fffee:

    # p "With the new sail. The sheets get worn more than usual on the blocks. Samuel went to go help with that while we were all swabbing the deck. But he went by himself. I didn't go."
    p "换了新帆之后，滑轮那里的帆脚索比平时更容易磨损。当时大家都在擦甲板，Samuel就自己去帮忙了...我没去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3620
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_8e3621b2:

    # "You trail off, realizing how obvious of a statement it is."
    "你声音越来越小，意识到自己说了句废话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3622
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_fcc0fd21:

    # p "Anyway..."
    p "算了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3624
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_69de6dec:

    # "The sailor stares at you for a few seconds."
    "水手盯着你看几秒钟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3626
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_326576c5:

    # sailmullein "Why would I care about that? I don't care about what you know about the sail, I mean if you know anything of value. S'pose that was lucky of you to not go."
    sailmullein "我管你知不知道帆的事儿，我在乎的是你有没有什么有用的消息。你没去真是走运。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3630
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_3e94d53e:

    # sailmullein "Poor bastard."
    sailmullein "可怜的家伙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3632
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_7171d29e:

    # p "Me?"
    p "我？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3634
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_0bd888a2:

    # sailmullein "Not you."
    sailmullein "不是你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3636
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_2158c760:

    # sailmullein "Samuel."
    sailmullein "Samuel。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3638
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_a076ef6f:

    # sailmullein "Our surgeon needs someone to help her keep clean water and bandages around and whatever else she needs while she patches him up."
    sailmullein "我们的医生需要人帮忙，准备干净的水、绷带，还有其他包扎用的东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3642
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_987f4789:

    # "He starts walking again, obliging you to follow along."
    "他继续往前走，你也只好跟上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3644
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_814615ad:

    # sailmullein "They mentioned that you were free and we need the experienced crew up top with the spanker reefed the way it is."
    sailmullein "他们说你闲着，现在上面要收斜桁帆，需要有经验的水手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3646
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b4a4bf8b:

    # sailmullein "Now someone else has to go fix it and well, any of you can fetch water and hold bandages as well as anyone."
    sailmullein "现在得找人去修，反正你们谁都能打水、递绷带，谁去都一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3650
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_2de94246:

    # "Your steps lead you down further into the ship, down the stairs from the commons area."
    "你跟着他，一路下楼，更深入船舱，离开了上面的公共区域。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3652
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_efb9b601:

    # p "Wait. Is he-"
    p "等等。他-"

# game/script day2.rpy:3654
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_c344da0b:

    # p "Is he hurt?"
    p "他受伤了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3656
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_1c027ca4:

    # sailmullein "Were you not paying attention?"
    sailmullein "你没注意听吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3658
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_6c1d3529:

    # "He stops at one of the doors in the dark bowels of the ship."
    "他在船舱黑暗深处的一扇门前停了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3660
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_b2b95bcb:

    # sailmullein "Just get in and Rajeeyah will get you sorted. I'll have to get to the others again."
    sailmullein "进去吧，Rajeeyah会安排你的。我得去看看其他人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3664
translate Chinese day2_nomax_morningwalk_4c00c26f:

    # "With equally hurried steps he makes his way up the stairs again and leaves you alone in front of the door."
    "他同样匆忙地再次走上楼梯，把你独自留在门前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3706
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_139cfc61:

    # s "Ya heard him. I be right back."
    s "听见了吧？我很快回来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3708
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_f7929f52:

    # s "Keep doing what you're doing. If you need more water, just pull it up with the bucket I used."
    s "继续干你的活。 要是水不够，就用我刚才用的那个桶打水。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3710
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_5e909c41:

    # p "Got it."
    p "知道了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3712
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_9fdfacdf:

    # s "Just be careful not to let go of it. It's quite the harsh pull when it catches the water."
    s "小心别松手，那桶吃水的时候拉力可大了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3714
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_1eaeeb8a:

    # s "And it's not easy to get it out again either."
    s "而且想再把它弄上来也不容易。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3716
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_60abfa1e:

    # s "So just... don't make a fool of yourself and end up empty-handed."
    s "所以...别傻乎乎的，最后空手而归。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3718
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_02beac90:

    # j "Will keep it in mind."
    j "我会记住的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3720
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_b774e75d:

    # sailschwartz "Are you coming?"
    sailschwartz "你来不来？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3722
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_1563e5c3:

    # s "Yes, yes. Don't rush so much, it's bloody mornin'."
    s "来啦来啦。 别催这么急，这他妈才早上！"

# game/script day2.rpy:3724
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_f317516f:

    # "And so the three of you are left to yourselves, as Samuel follows the sailor across the deck of the ship."
    "于是，你们三个就只剩下彼此了，Samuel跟着那个水手穿过船的甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3733
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_109350a7:

    # "For another minute or two you continue to work with the others while you think of a way to get out of the rest of this morning's work."
    "又过了一两分钟，你一边继续干活，一边琢磨着怎么才能溜掉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3735
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_d2a1b6ec:

    # "With Samuel gone, you feel a little bolder about trying to get out, but then again, even he mentioned that it's not too uncommon to trade some rations or booze for work."
    "Samuel走了，你感觉想开溜的胆子都大了一点，不过话说回来，他都说了，用口粮或者酒来换班干活，这儿挺常见的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3737
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_3e55971f:

    # "If only you knew more of the crew...{w} That'd make it easier to know who to bribe."
    "要是我对船员们再熟点就好了……{w}这样也知道该去贿赂谁。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3739
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_6e672e0a:

    # "Or is that guy even worth it in the first place?"
    "或者说，那家伙到底值不值得我去贿赂呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3741
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_214b1181:

    # "He seemed nice enough..."
    "他看起来人模人样的……"

# game/script day2.rpy:3743
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_be4cbf21:

    # p "Julian?"
    p "Julian？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3745
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_0dbbaaf6:

    # "The lizard perks up and looks over at you."
    "那只蜥蜴抬起头，朝你这边看了过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3747
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_aa6c6d0d:

    # p "I'm going to find someone who'll cover for me for the rest of the shift."
    p "我打算找个人帮我把剩下的班顶了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3751
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_6dd92db8:

    # j "Oh? On your first shift?"
    j "哦？你第一个班就要翘？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3753
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_3069689c:

    # j "You were the one who's all pumped up about it, so what's with your excitement about getting to work on a ship?"
    j "之前是谁信誓旦旦的，一说能上船干活就兴奋得不得了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3755
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_5d9dca3e:

    # "You give him a quick wave and stand up slowly, feeling the warm tingle of blood rushing through your legs after so long on your knees."
    "你朝他挥挥手，慢慢站起来，感觉到跪了这么久，血液涌上双腿，暖洋洋的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3757
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_3b513cfa:

    # "The sun warms your face and you stretch your back for good measure."
    "阳光照在脸上，你伸了个懒腰，舒展了一下后背。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3759
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_9d22179a:

    # p "It's not that I'm not enjoying this, but do you remember the guy from yesterday?"
    p "我不是不喜欢这份活儿，但你还记得昨天那家伙吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3761
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_bec66910:

    # "Julian eyes you inquisitively."
    "Julian好奇地盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3763
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_6e490534:

    # j "You have to be more specific than that, man..."
    j "你得说清楚点啊，老兄……"

# game/script day2.rpy:3765
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_49d04ffb:

    # j "This is a ship full of almost nothing but guys..."
    j "这艘船上几乎全是男的……"

# game/script day2.rpy:3767
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_ac187781:

    # p "The seasick one."
    p "就是那个晕船的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3771
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_890bf4b7:

    # j "Ah, that guy. Yes, what about him?"
    j "啊，你说他啊。怎么了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3773
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_d7f10c59:

    # p "We just were talking a bit and, well, I thought I'd say hello again."
    p "我们之前聊了几句，嗯，我想着再去跟他打个招呼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3775
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_4897c836:

    # j "This early in the morning?{w} Sure, I'm not your superior, just make sure that we're not left to do your part, too."
    j "一大清早的？{w}行吧，我也不是你上司，别让我们还得帮你干活就行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3779
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_bf7ca11c:

    # j "Unless-"
    j "除非——"

# game/script day2.rpy:3781
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_e2df3679:

    # "Julian's voice rises to an almost sing-song tone as he stretches the word."
    "Julian的声音提高了，带着点唱腔，故意把音拉长。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3783
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_054fa38b:

    # j "I might just have another gear in me if you'll make sure to pay it back in the next port?"
    j "下个港口你要是能请我喝一杯，我就更有干劲了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3785
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_a1f1da05:

    # p "I assume you mean paying it back in rum?"
    p "你说的是朗姆酒吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3787
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_a239184e:

    # "Julian makes sure to exaggerate his nod, stopped only by a sudden realization."
    "Julian使劲儿点头，突然意识到什么，停了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3789
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_b74d69ab:

    # j "Or, well, you know. Whatever they have here."
    j "或者，你知道的，他们这儿有啥都行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3791
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_dd24e722:

    # j "Surely they have something to get drunk on here, don't they?"
    j "他们总有酒喝吧，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3793
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_b4c5101e:

    # p "I would assume so?"
    p "应该有吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3795
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_b2f24d62:

    # "You both look at each other with a similarly questioning expression."
    "你们俩面面相觑，一脸疑惑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3797
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_231f5ff1:

    # p "So you're not even happy with what we get here on the ship? You really are a spoiled brat."
    p "怎么，你连咱们船上的配给都看不上？你还真是个被宠坏的小少爷。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3799
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_449e7e60:

    # "Well...it would solve that particular problem and you wouldn't have to look for anyone else to do it."
    "嗯……这倒也是，这样你就不用找别人来顶班了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3804
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_2b7a6690:

    # j "I'd take that, too. But spending some time hanging out with you sounds like a better option. {w}And for free to boot? It's not even a close contest."
    j "我也想去。不过跟你一起闲逛瞧着更有意思。{w}更别说还一分钱不花？这根本就不用挑嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3808
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_9d6f5bb2:

    # "You laugh in return and lean against the nearby mast while you think about it."
    "你笑着回应，一边思考一边靠在旁边的桅杆上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3814
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_28fd5288:

    # j "Brat? You're one to talk, wanting to short change me with the bottom-of-the-barrel stuff they have here!"
    j "小屁孩？你还敢说我，想拿这里最次的东西来糊弄我！"

# game/script day2.rpy:3816
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_9d1c5256:

    # j "I know what my time is worth and some proper stuff will be a much better motivator."
    j "我可知道我的时间有多值钱，想让我好好干，不得来点儿好东西？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3820
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_042e3cb7:

    # "You shake your head and lean against the nearby mast while you think about it."
    "你摇摇头，一边思考一边靠在旁边的桅杆上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3824
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_4bec5a5b:

    # p "So some drinks together at our next stop?" nointeract
    p "那下次靠岸的时候一起喝几杯怎么样？" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:3838
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_31a90cd2:

    # p "Deal."
    p "成交。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3842
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_6df6fc28:

    # "You hold out your hand to Julian, who immediately grasps it firmly."
    "你向Julian伸出手，他立刻紧紧地握住了你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3846
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_1a8ec167:

    # j "Sweet!"
    j "太棒了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:3848
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_36e1be17:

    # "He exclaims with an excited flick of his tail against the ship's railing."
    "他兴奋地用尾巴拍打着船的栏杆，叫道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3852
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_b9316528:

    # j "I'm looking forward to it! Just wandering around the city and finding the most run-down place imaginable."
    j "我可太期待了！就在城里瞎转悠，找那种你能想到的最破烂的地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3854
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_cd560dd3:

    # j "They always have the best stuff!"
    j "只有那种地方才有好东西！"

# game/script day2.rpy:3856
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_6bf23991:

    # p "I'm not quite sure if I'd go that far.{w} Can't we just go somewhere normal?"
    p "我不太想去那么离谱的地方。{w} 咱们就不能去个正常的酒吧吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3858
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_5e9b8922:

    # p "I'd rather not get beaten up or robbed..."
    p "我可不想挨揍或是被抢..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3860
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_db952eed:

    # p "You'll get drunk on what other places have as well."
    p "一般的酒吧也能把你灌醉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3862
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_8f74b4b1:

    # j "What? Don't be such a wuss."
    j "怎么，你怕了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3868
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_9385acc6:

    # j "I told you how great I am with clippers, didn't I?"
    j "我跟你说过我用剪子有多厉害了吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:3870
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_1c433d44:

    # "He beams at you with a grin."
    "他咧开嘴，对着你笑得合不拢嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3872
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_07e8b1f3:

    # j "They'll rue the day where they decided to mess with us!"
    j "他们总有一天会后悔惹到咱们的！"

# game/script day2.rpy:3874
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_26b6e2b4:

    # p "See? This is exactly why I don't want to go there..."
    p "瞧瞧？这就是我不想去那种地方的原因..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3876
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_cfda7a2f:

    # p "Because you're just talking out of your arse. {w}No, we're not going to the seediest bar we can find."
    p "因为你纯粹是在胡吹大气。{w}不行，咱们才不去什么能找着的最下作的烂酒馆呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3880
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_1cc60120:

    # p "It's not about being a wuss. You're just talking out of your arse. {w}So no, we're not going to the seediest bar we can find."
    p "这不是胆小认怂的事儿，是你纯粹在扯淡。{w}所以免谈，咱们绝不去什么最下作的烂酒馆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3883
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_fe328493:

    # p "Or well, you can if you want. But then you're going without me."
    p "呃，你要是想去，你就自己去吧。反正我是不去的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3885
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_d6afd736:

    # p "I don't even want to know where you got that idea from..."
    p "我真不知道你这主意是从哪儿冒出来的..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3887
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_979cfdfa:

    # j "That's what the soldiers used to say."
    j "当兵的以前也常这么说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3891
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_92c58fe7:

    # j "Perfect. I'll remember to bug you when the time comes."
    j "好极了。到时候我肯定缠着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3895
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_2c8df838:

    # j "And of course I'll be nice enough to not just ask for the most expensive stuff they have lying around."
    j "放心，我肯定不会一上来就点他们店里最贵的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3897
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_7f55f3b5:

    # "His smile widens a little more into what could almost be a grin."
    "他的笑容更灿烂了，简直要咧到耳根子了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3899
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_057e3958:

    # p "You can bet your scaley ass that I'd tell you to get lost. It's only half a shift at best, so you get half a shift's worth!"
    p "我敢打赌，你要是想用半个班的工资就想让我把你当大爷伺候，我肯定让你滚蛋！"

# game/script day2.rpy:3903
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_5067ada9:

    # p "Won't just let you drink like a king for that."
    p "没门儿，想用这么点儿钱就喝得像个国王。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3905
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_173d746c:

    # j "You're driving such a hard bargain."
    j "你可真会砍价。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3908
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_4a17f233:

    # j "But fine.{w} Then get your ass out of here before you start complaining about me holding you up or something."
    j "行吧。{w} 那就赶紧滚蛋，省得你回头又抱怨我耽误你事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3910
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_5576e3f4:

    # j "I'll make sure I pick things up a bit and cover for you, and make sure Samuel knows as soon as he gets back."
    j "我会尽量多干点，帮你把班顶了，回头 Samuel 一回来我就跟他说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3912
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_fb789bda:

    # p "I hope he doesn't mind me not bringing in someone else..."
    p "希望他不会怪我没找其他人吧..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3914
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_0f03397e:

    # j "Well, if we get this done, we get this done. That's what matters, not with how many we do it."
    j "哎，能把活儿干完就行。重要的是把事儿办成，又不是人越多越好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3916
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_9668e80d:

    # p "That's what I'm worried about. That you won't make it."
    p "我就是担心这个，怕你搞不定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3920
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_0f69cc7c:

    # "The lizard shoos you away with several flicks of his hand."
    "那蜥蜴不耐烦地挥挥手，把你轰走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3922
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_ff80cf23:

    # j "Well, then get on with it and don't keep holding me up here any longer."
    j "行了行了，赶紧干你的去，别在这儿耽误我工夫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3924
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_4a6e248c:

    # "The hand gestures turn into a proper shove against your leg from the lizard, and you are unceremoniously ushered on your way."
    "那蜥蜴直接踹了你一脚，毫不客气地把你赶走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3945
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_e4bdea92:

    # p "Sorry Julian, but I have to watch my budget."
    p "抱歉啊 Julian，我得看紧点预算。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3947
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_f5a68d6e:

    # p "I didn't expect to go partying first thing...{w} so I didn't bring anything to cover that."
    p "我又没想着一来就开趴...{w} 也没带什么能挡酒的玩意儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3949
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_ff8e8ee7:

    # "Julian's shoulders slump down before he picks up his holystone again to continue with his work."
    "Julian 耸拉着肩膀，又捡起磨石，继续干活了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3951
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_94285da7:

    # j "I understand."
    j "我知道了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3953
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_d0bec5e2:

    # j "Just make sure that you send someone to help us up here then."
    j "记得回头派个人上来帮帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3955
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_302937c6:

    # p "Will do. See you later."
    p "没问题。回头见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3957
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_09f7e7e1:

    # "You turn with some hesitation and make your way to the stairs."
    "你犹豫了一下，转身朝楼梯走去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3961
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_3e8a22ba:

    # "You scan the area for any signs of Arthur but the air appears to be clear.{w} Samuel mentioned that ducking work like this is possible, but you don't know if Arthur views it the same..."
    "你四下看了看，没发现 Arthur 的踪影，周围好像没人。{w} Samuel 倒是说过能偷偷溜走，就是不知道 Arthur 是不是也这么想..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3963
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_911beb2d:

    # "Probably best to be careful."
    "还是小心点好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3967
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_08de896c:

    # "Your steps take you below deck, the bright sunlight disappears and your eyes take a second or two to adjust to the darkness down here."
    "你走下甲板，明亮的阳光消失了，眼睛适应了一下这下面的黑暗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3977
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_1d42439c:

    # "Things were still fairly quiet down here, but the first of the crew were getting up and enjoying their time off between shifts."
    "下面还挺安静的，不过已经有第一批水手起来了，正享受着换班后的休息时光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3979
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_380a3491:

    # "Good. Just means you have to find someone to cover for you..."
    "不错。就是说你得找个人替你顶班..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3981
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_5a6e7ba0:

    # "If only you knew any of them."
    "要是认识他们就好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3985
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_323e3c60:

    # "You scan across a few faces but of course none of them ring any bells."
    "你扫了几眼，愣是没瞅见一个眼熟的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3987
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_59fdbf28:

    # "No need to wait any longer, you won't get to know them any more by standing here."
    "别站着了，站在这儿也认识不了谁。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3989
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_a912f51a:

    # "Your pick falls on a middle-aged lynx who appears to be nursing a piece of the same stale bread you had yourself."
    "你挑了个中年猞猁，正啃着一块跟你早上吃的一样硬的面包。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3994
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_e7834aed:

    # p "Good morning. Sorry to interrupt, uh..."
    p "早上好。打扰一下，那个..."

# game/script day2.rpy:3996
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_60636220:

    # "He looks up at you with some confusion and is clearly not fully awake yet."
    "他一脸懵地抬起头，显然还没睡醒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:3998
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_e7b972cd:

    # "You can see it in his face that he's trying to place your face but not a single memory comes to mind."
    "你看他那表情，估计是在努力回忆你是谁，结果啥也没想起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4000
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_95d4520c:

    # p "One of the new recruits, don't think we've met yet."
    p "新来的，咱们还没见过吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4002
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_df8e0ec3:

    # "He nods with a raised eyebrow and some clarity returns to his gaze."
    "他挑了挑眉毛，点了点头，眼神也清醒了些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4006
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_10c23e99:

    # lynx "What is it, kid?"
    lynx "小子，啥事儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4008
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_7b9cae44:

    # "His hand runs through the fur at the back of his neck as he waits for you to answer."
    "他等着你回答，一边挠了挠后脖颈上的毛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4010
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_a9a3a5cb:

    # p "I'm looking for someone to do the rest of my shift for me in exchange for some booze."
    p "我想找个人顶替我剩下的班，换点酒喝。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4012
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_78490b84:

    # p "Any interest?"
    p "有兴趣没？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4016
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_ca87c385:

    # "His hand wanders from the nape of his neck to his beard, running along the length of it as he studies you for a moment."
    "他的手从后脖颈一路摸到胡子上，上下打量着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4018
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_df77744a:

    # lynx "It's your first day and you've already had enough?"
    lynx "第一天就想撂挑子？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4020
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_70c983ef:

    # p "It's...{w} it's not that. I just need a few extra hours off right now."
    p "不...不是你想的那样。我只是现在需要请几个小时假。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4022
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_4178940e:

    # lynx "Just the rest of this shift then?"
    lynx "就剩下这个班了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4024
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4028
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_45263d59:

    # lynx "Ah fuck it, might as well. Not much going on this early anyway."
    lynx "算了算了，反正现在也没啥事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4030
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_0e99f166:

    # lynx "Where to then? Cleaning the deck, I suppose?"
    lynx "那是去哪儿？打扫甲板，是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4032
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_fabb4b93:

    # "You nod again."
    "你再次点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4034
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_371030af:

    # p "Yeah, just up on deck with a black wolf and a lizard. Just let them know you're there for me."
    p "没错，就在甲板上，跟黑狼和蜥蜴那俩家伙说一声，就说你是替我来的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4036
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_58c39e9e:

    # p "You really are a savior! Thank you so much. What's your name by the way?"
    p "你真是我的救命恩人！太谢谢你了。顺便问下，怎么称呼？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4040
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_13d66f7e:

    # k "Don't praise me too highly. Konrad, pleasure to meet you."
    k "别这么夸我。Konrad，很高兴认识你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4060
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_df47d4df:

    # "Your attention gets caught by something in your peripheral vision."
    "你的眼角余光瞥到了什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4062
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_979fa6be:

    # "It's Konrad! The lynx friend of Samuel, sitting on a chair and eating what appears to be the same stale bread you had earlier."
    "原来是Konrad！Samuel的那位猞猁朋友正坐在椅子上，嘴里嚼着瞧上去跟你先前吃的一模一样的硬面包。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4064
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_89e53c4d:

    # "You are saved!"
    "这下有救了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:4066
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_a93275e3:

    # "With brisk steps you make your way over to him."
    "你快步朝他走去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4070
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_ebf23db6:

    # p "Good morning. Konrad, wasn't it?"
    p "早上好。 Konrad，是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4072
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_4de147fe:

    # "He looks up at you with some confusion, obviously not fully awake yet."
    "他有些困惑地抬头看着你，显然还没完全清醒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4074
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_5dc51d00:

    # "His hand runs through the fur on the back of his neck before things click into place."
    "他挠了挠后脖颈上的毛，这才反应过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4078
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_537f98d5:

    # k "Oh. Yes, still yours truly."
    k "哦。对，还是我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4080
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_0fb1ac1f:

    # k "What is it? You look so excited about it."
    k "什么事？看把你高兴的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4082
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_b63ae577:

    # "Immediately upon hearing that you notice your tail swaying about and you rein it in."
    "听到这话你立刻注意到自己的尾巴在摇，赶紧把尾巴压下去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4084
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_89601ec0:

    # p "Oh, you might actually be a bit of a savior."
    p "噢，你还真称得上是我的大救星。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4086
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_0b989e76:

    # k "Now you're just building expectations I can't possibly live up to."
    k "别抱太大期望，我可不一定能帮上忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4088
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_5f5ae4da:

    # k "What's the issue?"
    k "怎么了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4090
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_8941410b:

    # p "You wouldn't be looking to earn an extra ration of alcohol, would you?"
    p "要不要考虑挣点额外的酒水配额？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4092
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_a2585d83:

    # p "I need someone to cover for me for the rest of this shift. Would you be up for it?"
    p "我想找个人顶替我剩下的班，你愿意来吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4097
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_8742aa50:

    # "He laughs heartily and gets up from his chair, grabbing the piece of bread to take another bite from it."
    "他爽朗地大笑，从椅子上起身，抓起面包又啃了一口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4099
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_449d81e9:

    # k "Does the bear shit in the woods?"
    k "这还用问吗？熊当然在树林里拉屎！"

# game/script day2.rpy:4101
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_2795d3a4:

    # p "That's a...yes?"
    p "这不是...明摆着吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4105
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_a666195d:

    # k "Where else would it? Sure, half a shift for that?{w} I can't not rob you blind if you come to me with your reticule open like that."
    k "不在那儿拉在哪儿拉？就为了这点事要我跑半天？{w} 你都这样大摇大摆地把钱袋子敞开了送到我面前，我能不狠狠宰你一笔吗。 "

# game/script day2.rpy:4107
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_2746c7d0:

    # k "Just point me where to and I'll get you sorted, lad."
    k "你说去哪儿，我保证给你办妥，小兄弟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4109
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_9d39fb5f:

    # p "Sure thing, just..."
    p "行啊，我这就..."

# game/script day2.rpy:4132
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_f375ade9:

    # "You are pretty sure that you're standing in front of the door to his cabin."
    "你非常确定自己正站在他的船舱门口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4134
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_4869cbd8:

    # "Not with complete certainty, but you think you remember seeing him enter yesterday after dinner."
    "虽然不敢百分百肯定，但你记得昨天晚饭后，是看到他进了这个房间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4136
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_8c7e6a68:

    # "It's not the most luxurious looking thing, a simple wooden door that you're sure leads to an equally simple storage room behind it, where they've probably just put up a crude bed."
    "这可不是什么豪华舱房，就是一扇简陋的木门，你敢肯定后面也是个简陋的储物间，估计就随便搭了张床。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4138
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_fed67d52:

    # "These ships were never meant to carry passengers with any degree of luxury, it is simply a way for the owner to make some extra income whenever there is some space left unoccupied."
    "这些船本来就不是给乘客提供什么享受的，船东只是想在有空地方的时候，稍微赚点外快。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4140
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_9b82cbc1:

    # "The door was relatively hidden away, in a small nook leading to another officer's cabin."
    "这扇门藏得挺深，在一个通往其他官员船舱的角落里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4142
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_b3f59c9b:

    # "You wonder if he's even awake at this point, or if all your effort has been for naught...{w} but there's only one way to find out."
    "你暗想他眼下到底醒没醒，或者自己这一通折腾是不是全白费了……{w}不过要想弄明白，法子只有一个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4144
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_74bc4232:

    # "You lift your hand to knock on the door and give the rickety thing a good knock."
    "你抬手敲了敲那扇破门，咚咚作响。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4148
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_ab7b4d80:

    # "To your surprise however, the door isn't even locked and swings back from the force of your knock."
    "谁知道门竟然没锁，直接被你敲开了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4152
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_0ebeeac4:

    # "You couldn't even react in time to pull it closed again, and instead it swung open enough to give you a glimpse inside."
    "你都没来得及拉住，门就这么敞开了，让你一下看清了里面的景象。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4163
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_9e10c999:

    # n "WHAT IN THE...?!"
    n "我靠...这是什么鬼？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:4165
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_5c9615a1:

    # "You stand there in stunned silence, your brain just ticking away as it tries to figure out what to do as you stare at the naked canine right in front of you."
    "你愣在原地，脑子飞速运转，看着眼前这个赤身裸体的家伙，不知道该怎么办才好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4168
translate Chinese day2_sneak_off_to_nomax_b97f4d74:

    # n "What are you-? Close the door!" nointeract
    n "你干什么呢？！还不快关门！" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:4190
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a5b7fcc9:

    # p "I just—Um... I...Okay!"
    p "我只是——呃……我……好啦！"

# game/script day2.rpy:4192
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9641f37f:

    # "You hurry and take a step forward as your brain short-circuits for a moment, following your plan to talk to him first and foremost."
    "你赶紧往前一步，脑子有点短路，但还是想着先跟他好好谈谈。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4194
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1babfb0a:

    # "You do have to be in the cabin to do that after all, and you can't do that if you're outside! So you hurriedly step into the cabin and push the door closed behind you."
    "毕竟得进了船舱才能谈，站在外面算怎么回事！所以你赶紧钻进船舱，顺手把门关上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4199
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_410ba8f3:

    # "As you do so, you notice that the door doesn't have a lock...no wonder that it just got pushed open by you."
    "这时你才发现，这门根本没锁...怪不得你一推就开了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4201
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_98aa35e1:

    # "Instead, it is simply held in place by the friction of the door frame when closed..."
    "门关上后，仅仅是靠门框的摩擦力卡住而已..."

# game/script day2.rpy:4205
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_87aeaecf:

    # n "I did not mean like that!"
    n "我可不是那个意思！"

# game/script day2.rpy:4207
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_f2184d83:

    # p "Ummm... I just wanted to talk and see how you are after yesterday?"
    p "呃...我就是想来和你聊聊，问问你昨天怎么样了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4209
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_2ae32c50:

    # p "But you seem..."
    p "可是你现在这幅样子..."

# game/script day2.rpy:4211
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_de1814c5:

    # "You try hard, but it's difficult not to let your eyes wander down his body."
    "你拼命忍住，但还是忍不住往他身上瞟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4213
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_de465a43:

    # "It's a small cabin and he's just...{w} right there."
    "舱室这么小，而他就...{w} 站在那里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4215
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5674962d:

    # "It's impossible not to look."
    "根本没法不看啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4217
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7bae7163:

    # "Sometimes linger."
    "甚至还想多看两眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4219
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c0ad8a8d:

    # n "Are you listening?"
    n "你在听吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4224
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ab9ca76c:

    # "His voice carries a flustered tone as you two talk past one another, and he finally manages to cover himself with a crumpled piece of clothing held in front of his crotch."
    "你们俩在那各说各的，他都有点慌了，最后手忙脚乱地抓起块皱巴巴的布遮住下面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4231
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4db2e619:

    # n "Are you though?"
    n "是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4233
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_0b90df44:

    # n "Evidently you are not.{w} With you being in here."
    n "我看你根本没听进去吧。{w} 人都站这儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4235
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5a4d8e07:

    # p "It's too late now, isn't it? Going out isn't going to make me see any less at this point."
    p "现在是不是有点晚了？都看到了，出去还能少看点啥啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4239
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7d23ce6c:

    # "The blush across his snout gains renewed vigor."
    "他脸上的红晕更浓了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4241
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ba5df4f7:

    # p "I didn't realize the door couldn't be locked. My apologies."
    p "我不知道这门没法锁，不好意思啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4243
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_621b353c:

    # n "And you thought it best to {i}step in{/i} instead of just closing it again?"
    n "所以你觉得直接{i}进来{/i}，比再关上门更好？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4245
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_909b6597:

    # "You rub the back of your head and take a quick glance back at the door behind you."
    "你挠了挠后脑勺，赶紧回头看了一眼门。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4247
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_8a21fd69:

    # p "I-...well, look, I didn't expect to be greeted with this today either."
    p "我...好吧，我说，我今天也没想到会看到这场景啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4249
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e7bc0771:

    # p "I wanted to come and talk to you and it just, you know, was difficult to think things through in the moment."
    p "我就是想来跟你聊聊，你知道的，当时脑子有点乱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4251
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a3ca825d:

    # p "So I just...{w} stepped in."
    p "所以我就...{w} 进来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4257
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a0547a3d:

    # "Nomax sighs and sits down on his bed, taking the time to wrap and fasten the piece of garment around his waist properly."
    "Nomax叹了口气，坐到床上，慢吞吞地把那块布裹好，系在腰上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4259
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ba6ba141:

    # n "You have certainly woken me up now."
    n "你这下是真把我吵醒了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4261
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a8557d5c:

    # n "Jeez..."
    n "哎..."

# game/script day2.rpy:4265
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4441ff82:

    # p "I'm sorry. I really didn't mean to intrude on you like this."
    p "对不起，我真不是故意要这么打扰你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4267
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4190e90c:

    # "He shakes his head and looks at you."
    "他摇摇头，看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4269
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_f693a930:

    # n "Well, you are here now, I guess.{w} Why did you want to talk?"
    n "行吧，你都进来了，说吧，{w} 想聊什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4271
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7db1a2e5:

    # "With the situation somewhat calmed you take the moment to let your attention wander around the room."
    "看他冷静下来了，你这才开始打量这房间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4273
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_77f9aa04:

    # "The cabin is sparsely furnished, the bed, with Nomax on it, a simple table and chair, with his clothes folded over the backrest."
    "房间里没啥家具，一张床Nomax正坐在上面，一张简简单单的桌子和椅子，衣服叠在椅背上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4275
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1e3ff4ce:

    # "And on the table is a small bucket with a few plants growing from it, alongside a few of what must be his books and some pencils."
    "桌上放着个小桶，里面种了几棵植物，旁边是一些应该是他的书和铅笔。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4277
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ac6d5d9d:

    # p "I felt that yesterday was cut a bit too short for us, and I wanted to get to know you better."
    p "我觉得昨天咱俩聊得太短了，想多了解你一些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4284
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7d23ce6c_1:

    # "The blush across his snout gains renewed vigor."
    "他脸上的红晕更浓了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4288
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1281ddc6:

    # p "You know, before you held that up."
    p "就是...在你亮出那玩意儿之前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4290
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_cfcad1c2:

    # "You nod at the piece of clothing with a cheeky grin."
    "你对着那块布努了努嘴，带着点坏笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4292
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_8c897d3c:

    # n "I am sorry?"
    n "我很抱歉？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4295
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9e816634:

    # n "{cps=5000}I am sorry?{/cps}" nointeract
    n "{cps=5000}我很抱歉？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:4300
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_267045b6:

    # p "Well, without that. The sight was much more enticing."
    p "没那玩意儿挡着的时候，风景更好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4305
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_40f8c3a3:

    # p "I was just pulling your ear."
    p "我跟你开玩笑呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4309
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5c152304:

    # "You smirk confidently at the painted dog, feeling that some cogs are slowly starting to turn for him."
    "你对着Nomax自信地笑了笑，感觉他好像有点开窍了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4311
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_54345bef:

    # "It empowers you to keep pushing for more."
    "这让你更想得寸进尺了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4315
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_3f8d9abd:

    # "He tries to evade your gaze, looking over to the table instead."
    "他躲闪着你的目光，转头看向了桌子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4317
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c9360109:

    # p "Go on."
    p "说下去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4319
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_16a4a032:

    # n "Did you not come here to talk?"
    n "你来这儿难道不是为了说话？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4321
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_63d274b4:

    # p "Sure. But you don't need this to talk though, do you?"
    p "当然。不过，说话用得着这个吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4323
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_8f0834c8:

    # p "And I'd enjoy my time so much more in return."
    p "作为交换，我也会更开心的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4325
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_50f6c052:

    # p "So? What are you waiting for?"
    p "所以呢？还愣着干嘛？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4327
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e5664601:

    # "Silence reigns for a few seconds as you let your suggestion linger between the two of you."
    "空气安静了几秒，你的话语在我们之间回荡。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4329
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5b9c98c4:

    # "There is no immediate protest."
    "他没有立刻反对。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4331
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ea4c4c2f:

    # "In fact, there is no protest at all."
    "实际上，他什么都没说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4342
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_77bc534d:

    # "Instead, Nomax obeys your wish and you get to watch as he puts the crumpled piece of garment back on the chair."
    "Nomax 听从了你的话，你看着他把那件皱巴巴的衣服扔回椅子上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4344
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_fce8db65:

    # p "There you go."
    p "“那就好。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:4346
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_569d3aec:

    # p "Much better, don't you think?"
    p "这样好多了，你说对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4348
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_78d653f7:

    # "Still you get no answer."
    "他依然沉默不语。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4350
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9bf3dd62:

    # p "You're so quiet. Maybe you did actually need it to talk?"
    p "你安静得过分了。 难道说你还真得靠那玩意儿才能开口说话？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4352
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e38f3372:

    # n "I am just...{w} still getting used to my bad choices."
    n "我只是...{w} 还在适应自己做的蠢事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4354
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_88cd95c7:

    # "His ears fold down slightly as he notices your eyes once again lingering between his legs, this time around without any attempt on your part to hide what you're doing."
    "他注意到你又盯着他的裤裆看，而且这次你连装都不装了，耳朵便微微耷拉了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4356
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_004ad45c:

    # p "Bad choices? I told you you look good."
    p "选得不好？我只是觉得你穿这身挺好看的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4360
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_05963d2f:

    # "With the situation somewhat calmed, you take the moment to let your attention wander around the room."
    "眼看情况缓和了些，你便开始四处打量这间屋子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4362
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_77f9aa04_1:

    # "The cabin is sparsely furnished, the bed, with Nomax on it, a simple table and chair, with his clothes folded over the backrest."
    "房间里没啥家具，一张床Nomax正坐在上面，一张简简单单的桌子和椅子，衣服叠在椅背上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4364
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1e3ff4ce_1:

    # "And on the table is a small bucket with a few plants growing from it, alongside a few of what must be his books and some pencils."
    "桌上放着个小桶，里面种了几棵植物，旁边是一些应该是他的书和铅笔。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4366
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_40cf9021:

    # n "Well, you got what you wanted, I guess.{w} What did you want to talk about?"
    n "好吧，我想你得偿所愿了。{w} 你打算跟我聊些什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4368
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ac6d5d9d_1:

    # p "I felt that yesterday was cut a bit too short for us, and I wanted to get to know you better."
    p "我觉得昨天咱俩聊得太短了，想多了解你一些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4370
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_b58a5fed:

    # p "I didn't expect to get to know you {i}that{/i} well, but I'm not complaining in the slightest."
    p "我真没想到会同你发展得{i}这般{/i}深入，不过我可半点没有抱怨的意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4372
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_2dd5e61f:

    # "Once again your words cause the blush on his muzzle to redden."
    "你这么一说，他脸上的红晕又深了几分。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4375
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_35ddfc2a:

    # p "I'd be lying if I said it wasn't a pleasant sight, though."
    p "要我说，这幅景象还真挺赏心悦目的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4379
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_3f8d9abd_1:

    # "He tries to evade your gaze, looking over to the table instead."
    "他躲闪着你的目光，转头看向了桌子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4381
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_63a01c4c:

    # n "You are a real joker."
    n "你还真会开玩笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4383
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ec1a203c:

    # p "How could I not? It's already a ridiculous situation.{w} Might as well lean into it, right?"
    p "我有什么办法？情况都已经这么离谱了。{w} 不如就顺着来呗，你说对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4385
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_12757582:

    # n "Not my first instinct I have to admit."
    n "说实话，我一开始可没这么想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4389
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_701a9799:

    # p "Perhaps Julian's rubbing off on me already."
    p "可能我已经开始受 Julian 影响了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4391
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a30f8be7:

    # n "Who?"
    n "谁？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4393
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_32c413b6:

    # p "Oh right, um, just another one of the new sailors on the ship."
    p "哦，没事，额，他也是船上的新水手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4395
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_39ca4ea6:

    # p "His sense of humour is, well. Sometimes he can push it a bit too far."
    p "他的幽默感嘛，嗯... 有时候确实有点过头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4397
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7b3f8bf7:

    # n "Sounds like it might have."
    n "听起来确实是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4402
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_b3f6e3db:

    # "Nomax sighs and sits down on his bed, taking the time to properly wrap and fasten the piece of garment around his waist."
    "Nomax叹了口气，一屁股坐在床上，然后才慢条斯理地把那块布裹在腰上系好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4404
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4fb52ead:

    # "For a fraction of a second your disappointment shines through, as you had really hoped he would take it off again."
    "你露出了一丝失望，看来你还真挺希望他再脱一次的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4406
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7782f0c6:

    # p "He's not so bad. Maybe I can introduce you two sometime."
    p "他人还不错。 哪天介绍你们认识？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4408
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_2d0396e2:

    # n "As long as you don't bring him in first thing in the morning before I have had a chance to put some clothes on."
    n "只要别在我还没穿好衣服的一大早就把他带来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4410
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_566de9c5:

    # n "You really could not have waited until the next time you saw me around the ship?"
    n "你不能等下次在船上碰面的时候再说这些吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4412
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_05963d2f_1:

    # "With the situation somewhat calmed, you take the moment to let your attention wander around the room."
    "眼看情况缓和了些，你便开始四处打量这间屋子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4414
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_77f9aa04_2:

    # "The cabin is sparsely furnished, the bed, with Nomax on it, a simple table and chair, with his clothes folded over the backrest."
    "房间里没啥家具，一张床Nomax正坐在上面，一张简简单单的桌子和椅子，衣服叠在椅背上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4416
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1e3ff4ce_2:

    # "And on the table is a small bucket with a few plants growing from it, alongside a few of what must be his books and some pencils."
    "桌上放着个小桶，里面种了几棵植物，旁边是一些应该是他的书和铅笔。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4418
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_80a31478:

    # p "I could have. But..."
    p "我当然可以。 但是..."

# game/script day2.rpy:4420
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_cb545972:

    # p "I just felt that yesterday was cut short for us, and I wanted to get to know you a little better."
    p "我只是觉得昨天时间太短暂了，想多了解你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4422
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1b6cd89a:

    # p "And Julian would appreciate the sight though, I'm pretty sure."
    p "而且我敢肯定，Julian肯定喜欢看你那样的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4424
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e6486532:

    # n "I am sure he would have, but I am not sure if my goal for this journey was to be in everyone's wet dreams."
    n "那他肯定喜欢，但我的目标可不是出现在每个人的性幻想里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4430
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d277e3a6:

    # "You begin to feel that you have him on a tighter leash than you expected."
    "你开始觉得你好像把他管得有点紧了，比你预想的还要紧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4432
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_90265bb1:

    # "Certainly way beyond anything you expected just a few minutes ago."
    "当然，这和你几分钟前想的可不太一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4434
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_8e7db81f:

    # p "You appear to have a pretty cosy corner to call your home for the journey."
    p "看来你还真找到了一处舒适的小窝，能让你在这趟航行里安身。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4436
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a229a328:

    # p "Not exactly the height of luxury, but at least it's your own space."
    p "算不上什么极致奢华，但至少是你自己的地盘。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4438
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7f997b0d:

    # "The potted plants catch your attention and you walk over to the table to have a closer look."
    "桌上的盆栽植物吸引了你的目光，你走上前去想要仔细端详一番。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4442
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_8e7db81f_1:

    # p "You appear to have a pretty cosy corner to call your home for the journey."
    p "看来你还真找到了一处舒适的小窝，能让你在这趟航行里安身。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4444
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a229a328_1:

    # p "Not exactly the height of luxury, but at least it's your own space."
    p "算不上什么极致奢华，但至少是你自己的地盘。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4448
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c2df4bb9:

    # n "That is one way of putting it. A dump might be another."
    n "这话说得好听。 说难听点，就是个垃圾场。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4450
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9205b1ee:

    # n "Stuffed into some unused cargo space."
    n "被塞在没用的货舱里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4452
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_dcf3c230:

    # n "All that is missing is a rat to share the room with if you ask me..."
    n "依我看，就差一只老鼠来和你同居了......"

# game/script day2.rpy:4454
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_2bb4d383:

    # p "At least you have a room and some privacy."
    p "至少你还有个房间，能有点私人空间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4456
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_f57c63cc:

    # n "We saw how that privacy worked out, did we not?"
    n "咱们不是已经见识过这“私人空间”了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4458
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_3ad267a2:

    # n "Not even a damned lock on the door..."
    n "连个该死的锁都没有......"

# game/script day2.rpy:4460
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_af1b81ef:

    # p "Is it that bad?"
    p "有这么糟糕吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4462
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4f6d5216:

    # "He sighs audibly."
    "他长长地叹了口气，叹得很明显。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4464
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9990a9b6:

    # n "Seasick yesterday, the prospect of being in this claustrophobic cabin for how long? {w}Two months?"
    n "昨天还在晕船，接下来还得在这间逼仄幽闭的舱房里闷上多久？{w}整整两个月？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4466
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_998c2c0a:

    # p "It's a ship. What did you expect?"
    p "这是在船上，你还想怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4468
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_65d961c8:

    # n "Just... {i}anything{/i} would have been nice."
    n "随便什么都好啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4470
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4958708f:

    # n "But I guess I am not valuable enough to my patron to bother about a decent cabin."
    n "看来我在赞助人眼里还不够重要，连个像样的房间都不给安排。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4472
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_207ee395:

    # p "This is a cargo ship. I don't think there {i}are{/i} any decent cabins, unless perhaps you're the captain."
    p "这是一艘货船，估计除了船长，谁也捞不着好房间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4474
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c17d5a4a:

    # "The potted plants catch your attention and you walk over to the table to get a closer look and steer the conversation in a different direction."
    "桌上的盆栽植物吸引了你的视线，你踱步凑近细看，顺势把话头引向别的方向。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4476
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5ec0b6e9:

    # p "Did you bring them?"
    p "你带来的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4479
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5f3754a4:

    # n "The plants?"
    n "这些花花草草？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4481
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_3b88c420:

    # p "Yes."
    p "是的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4483
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_2119db88:

    # n "So you want to talk about plants. Like this?"
    n "所以你想聊植物？ 像现在这样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4485
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_48bc6658:

    # p "Why not? Or do you want me to make your balls the topic of the conversation again?"
    p "为什么不呢？还是说你又想让我把你的蛋蛋拿出来当话题了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4487
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_34c3b4fd:

    # "He swallows and a few moments pass before he speaks."
    "他咽了口唾沫，沉默了一会儿才开口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4489
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e61b9f75:

    # n "I am curious to see how they fare on the journey."
    n "我很好奇它们在路上的情况。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4491
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_dc620129:

    # p "Your balls or the plants?"
    p "你的蛋蛋还是植物？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4493
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_40d86018:

    # "You ask with a stupid grin and promptly get an-"
    "你傻笑着问，结果立马得到一个——"

# game/script day2.rpy:4497
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_12e34419:

    # n "Idiot..."
    n "蠢货..."

# game/script day2.rpy:4499
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d23eb2b5:

    # "thrown right back at you."
    "反击。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4502
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d97f4d42:

    # n "The plants? Yes.{w} I am curious to see how they fare on the journey."
    n "植物？是的。{w} 我很好奇它们在路上的情况。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4504
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c78c29c9:

    # n "They need very little water and when I can I put them out into the sun."
    n "它们不需要太多水，而且我也会尽量把它们放在阳光下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4506
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ee473aca:

    # p "What for?"
    p "做啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4508
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_891f88c5:

    # "You notice that he steps up next to you and gently lifts one of the leaves with his finger."
    "你注意到他走到你身边，用手指轻轻抬起一片叶子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4510
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_385dbe67:

    # "His fur looks so well-groomed up close."
    "近距离看，他的毛发打理得真好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4514
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c45ba798:

    # n "Simply my own curiosity, and it gives me something to draw while I'm out here."
    n "只是我自己的好奇心，而且这样我在这儿的时候也能画点东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4516
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_46bbdc19:

    # n "Not too many plants around otherwise."
    n "不然的话，周围也没什么植物了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4518
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_db760e31:

    # p "That's true. So you are an artist as well?"
    p "说的也是。所以你也是个艺术家？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4522
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_05574df1:

    # "He shrugs his shoulders and picks out one of the books on the table, one of the two that don't appear to have anything written on the cover."
    "他耸耸肩，拿起桌上的一本书，是那两本封面上什么都没写的书中的一本。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4524
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c9c1ac41:

    # n "I would not go that far. I am a botanist first and foremost, but documentation is part of it."
    n "我倒不至于那么说。我首先是个植物学家，但记录是工作的一部分。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4526
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_44cc374a:

    # n "I could write down what I notice, but often it is better to have a drawing of it."
    n "我可以写下我的观察，但通常还是画出来更好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4528
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e85c52f6:

    # n "It is easier for me to remember if I take the time to draw it and make sure it is right."
    n "如果我花时间画下来，并确保画得准确，我就更容易记住。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4530
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_f17dbaa0:

    # n "It just forces you to look more carefully."
    n "这能迫使你观察得更仔细。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4534
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_3dd509ad:

    # "He opens the book with his thumb and flicks through some blank pages before coming to one with a drawing of the plants on the desk."
    "他用拇指翻开书，翻过几页空白页，然后停在了一页画着桌上植物的图画上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4536
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4cc06cf8:

    # "It is dated to yesterday."
    "日期是昨天。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4540
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_0f379b52:

    # "You flip through some of the pages to find similar drawings, often with notes next to them."
    "你翻阅了一些页面，发现了很多类似的绘画，旁边通常还附有笔记。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4542
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_be49527d:

    # "He wasn't exactly the next Michelangelo, but his drawings really do look quite nice, and you recognize some plants you've seen before."
    "他算不上是下一个米开朗琪罗，但他的画确实很好看，而且你认出了一些你以前见过的植物。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4544
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_3e8dd2f6:

    # "{i}Craterellus cornucopioides{/i}, trompette de la mort."
    "{i}Craterellus cornucopioides{/i}，trompette de la mort（死亡号角菌，灰酱油小喇叭菌）."

# game/script day2.rpy:4546
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a73e522e:

    # "You stop at the page with some rather rough looking dark plants."
    "你停在了一页画着一些看起来相当粗糙的黑色植物的页面上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4548
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_462dbff5:

    # n "Trumpet of the dead. They do look a bit like trumpets sticking out of the ground. Decaying, rotting trumpets with their unappealing colour and how wrinkled they are."
    n "死亡喇叭菌。它们看起来确实有点像从地里伸出来的小号。腐烂的，正在腐烂的小号，颜色不吸引人，而且皱巴巴的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4550
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_3c6bfd3c:

    # p "They do look rather ominous... sounds like a very appropriate name."
    p "它们看起来确实很不祥……听起来是个很贴切的名字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4552
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1843239c:

    # n "Perfectly edible, actually."
    n "实际上，它们完全可以食用。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4554
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_140687d6:

    # p "Yummy...{w} Not sure if they'd be my first choice."
    p "真好吃……{w} 但我不确定它们是不是我的首选。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4558
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ccc7e325:

    # n "Do not knock them until you try. They taste quite alright."
    n "不尝尝怎么知道呢。它们的味道其实还不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4560
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_b3e63089:

    # n "And safe to pick. Nothing looks quite like them. At worst you will pick one of its brethren, which are also edible."
    n "而且可以放心采摘。它们长得和别的都不太一样，很好辨认。最坏的情况，你也就是摘到一些同类的品种，也都是能吃的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4568
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c54e1363:

    # "After a few more pages, you come across one that has been torn out of the book."
    "又翻了几页，你发现有一页被人从书上撕掉了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4570
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_515b75cb:

    # p "Why did you tear that one out?"
    p "你干嘛把这页撕了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4572
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_0db99eba:

    # n "It didn't fit the book."
    n "它跟这本书不是一路的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4574
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e098c55d:

    # p "How so?"
    p "怎么说？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4576
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_89760cf3:

    # n "It was model drawing.{w} I only had the book with me at the time, and wanted to keep it cleanly about plants."
    n "那是张人体素描。我当时就带着这本书，就想着书里只放植物相关的画，干净点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4578
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_793a8f2c:

    # p "Oh, what a shame. I would have loved to see that."
    p "哎，那可太可惜了，我还挺想看看的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4584
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_0bcdd6ee:

    # "He chuckles in response and your eyes are drawn downwards once again."
    "他轻笑了一声，你的目光又不自觉地落了下去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4588
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_fff26d43:

    # "He chuckles in response."
    "他轻笑了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4590
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_98b889ff:

    # n "Because of the art or because you just like looking at naked men?"
    n "因为喜欢画，还是单纯喜欢看男人裸体？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4594
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_94f0f17a:

    # p "And who is it again who isn't currently wearing {i}anything{/i}?"
    p "某人现在又是{i}光溜溜{/i}的，是谁害的啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4598
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_6d52d51a:

    # n "You made me take it off again."
    n "还不是你，又让我给脱了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4600
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_31f0c914:

    # "You push your luck further and place your palm on the small of his back, feeling the fur and giving him an encouraging squeeze as you answer."
    "你更是得寸进尺，直接把手放在他后腰上，摸着毛发，还带着暗示地捏了捏，然后才回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4602
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_18791d44:

    # p "And you went along a little bit too readily, don't you think?"
    p "你也太配合了吧，不觉得吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4604
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5abd8276:

    # p "Not to mention peeking with excitement earlier."
    p "还有刚才，那么兴奋地偷看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4606
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_aa91c996:

    # "His fur feels as soft as it looked, and the subtle shiver that runs through him wasn't enough to pull your hand back again."
    "他的毛发摸起来和看起来一样柔软，那一丝细微的颤抖根本不足以让你把手抽回来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4608
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_13bb063b:

    # "You can feel the muscles move underneath as his tail swings behind him."
    "你能感觉到他尾巴在他身后摇动，带动着身下的肌肉也跟着动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4610
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_301e0285:

    # "Getting bolder still, you trail further down. First over the bump at the base of his tail, then one by one you thread your fingers underneath it."
    "你更加放肆起来，继续向下摸索。先是摸过他尾巴根部那块凸起的骨头，然后一根一根地把手指插到他尾巴下面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4615
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_8395cb3e:

    # p "And who is it again who is currently barely wearing anything?"
    p "某人现在又是几乎什么都没穿，这又是谁的错？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4619
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d87e418a:

    # n "You are the one who barged in."
    n "还不是你，自己闯进来的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4621
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_8c8e5b79:

    # "You push your luck a little further and place your palm on the small of his back, feel the fur and give him an encouraging squeeze as you answer."
    "你更是得寸进尺，直接把手放在他后腰上，摸着毛发，还带着暗示地捏了捏，然后才回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4623
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_faff7e1a:

    # p "And you haven't got dressed yet, even though you have all the time in the world."
    p "明明有的是时间，到现在还光着呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4625
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_aa91c996_1:

    # "His fur feels as soft as it looked, and the subtle shiver that runs through him wasn't enough to pull your hand back again."
    "他的毛发摸起来和看起来一样柔软，那一丝细微的颤抖根本不足以让你把手抽回来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4627
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_13bb063b_1:

    # "You can feel the muscles move underneath as his tail swings behind him."
    "你能感觉到他尾巴在他身后摇动，带动着身下的肌肉也跟着动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4629
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1db88ebf:

    # "Getting bolder still, you trail further down. First over the bump of the base of his tail, and then over the fine fabric that covers his waist."
    "你更加放肆起来，继续向下摸索。先是摸过他尾巴根部那块凸起的骨头，然后摸过盖在他腰间的薄薄的布料。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4633
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_cc066c5c:

    # "One digit at first but soon after you slide your hand under it and get a feel of the underside of his tail."
    "先是一根手指探了过去，然后很快你就把手滑到布料下面，感受着他尾巴下侧的触感。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4638
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7642c8c1:

    # "The soft, thick fur on the underside of his tail warmly fills the gaps between your fingers."
    "他尾巴下侧柔软而浓密的毛发，温暖地填充着你的指缝。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4640
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_91410886:

    # "He tenses noticeably, you feel his rump suddenly firm in the palm of your hand."
    "他身体明显一僵，你能感觉到手掌下他的臀部肌肉瞬间绷紧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4642
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9b230143:

    # p "And so all of these drawings are plants you grew yourself?"
    p "这么说，这些画上的植物都是你自己种的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4644
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_69d5a523:

    # "He struggles to answer immediately, his eyes wide as he tries to adjust to your boldness in simply groping him like this."
    "他一时语塞，没能立刻回答，瞪大了眼睛，似乎还没适应你这么直接的上下其手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4646
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d374dd7f:

    # n "I-"
    n "我..."

# game/script day2.rpy:4650
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_2ecefd37:

    # n "Ah!"
    n "啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:4652
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_70833702:

    # "The tips of your fingers find the little dimple of bare flesh underneath his tail."
    "你的指尖找到了他尾巴下，那块嫩肉上微微凹陷的地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4663
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_02bcbfb4:

    # p "Ah?"
    p "嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4667
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_02bcbfb4_1:

    # p "Ah?"
    p "嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4671
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e9ba5c6f:

    # "His tail curls over your hand as he attempts to hide what you're doing."
    "他连忙用尾巴卷住你的手，想藏住你的动作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4673
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_afbed831:

    # n "Not...not all of them.{w} But some, yes."
    n "不...也不是全部。{w} 但有些，是的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4675
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_61ed3faa:

    # n "Many I found in the wild. And they were just too irresistible-"
    n "很多都是我在野外遇到的，它们实在太迷人了。-"

# game/script day2.rpy:4677
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_aff28e72:

    # p "Sounds strangely familiar..."
    p "这话听着怎么这么耳熟……"

# game/script day2.rpy:4679
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_6101044f:

    # "You answer with a grin that spreads across your features, and you feel, rather than hear, his response as another shiver runs through his body."
    "你咧嘴一笑，他似乎也感觉到了你的笑容，浑身又是一阵颤栗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4681
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ebf8d009:

    # n "-too irresistible not to draw. Just beautiful specimens."
    n "- 实在是太诱人了，忍不住想画下来。都是绝美的素材。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4683
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c3769c0f:

    # "You lean in close over his shoulder and repeat yourself."
    "你凑到他耳边，又重复了一遍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4685
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_31c9938d:

    # p "Sounds strangely familiar.{w} You don't happen to do self portraits by any chance?"
    p "听着真耳熟。{w} 你不会是给自己画过自画像吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:4687
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_334217d5:

    # p "Nude ones, of course."
    p "当然是裸体的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4689
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_13595ca8:

    # p "So that I can stare whenever I want."
    p "这样就能随时欣赏了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4691
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ddb4d6cb:

    # "You hear him take a deep breath."
    "你听见他倒吸了一口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4693
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a44e0dea:

    # n "You{w} can look right now if you like."
    n "你{w} 现在想看也可以。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4704
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_902bcf67:

    # "An offer you won't refuse, and you look down at his length more brazenly."
    "这个提议你当然不会拒绝，更加肆无忌惮地打量起他的下身。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4708
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_0e23c566:

    # n "And take it off."
    n "然后脱掉它。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4720
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d2e41f40:

    # "An offer you don't need to hear twice. Your free hand undoes the hastily tied knot of the fabric around his waist, and without any ceremony it falls in a heap on the floor below."
    "这提议正中下怀。你空着的手解开他腰间随意系着的布条，那东西便迫不及待地落到地上，堆成一团。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4722
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_0ff9d3ce:

    # "With the annoying clothes out of the way, you take in his length with a brazen look."
    "碍事的衣服一脱，你便肆无忌惮地将他从头到脚打量个遍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4724
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_6640150a:

    # "Unsurprisingly, it looks very canine-like, a light pink coloured rod protruding from his sheath."
    "果不其然，真像条小狗-，一根淡粉色的肉棒从包皮里探出头来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4726
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_31b49eeb:

    # n "Touching, too."
    n "摸起来肯定也很棒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4728
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_dde99176:

    # n "If you like."
    n "如果你喜欢的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4730
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a7702fdb:

    # "He whispers in a hushed tone."
    "他压低声音说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4734
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_48a877ed:

    # "A gasp from his lips announces the arrival of your fingertips as you gently drag the tip of your fingers along the underside of his penis."
    "你的指尖轻轻滑过他肉棒的下侧，他便忍不住倒吸一口凉气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4736
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_c2ac2f94:

    # "His flesh feels slick to the touch and before long you wrap your whole hand around it."
    "他的肉体触手湿滑，没过多久，你就用整只手掌握住了它。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4738
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4b811565:

    # "Each gentle pump causes Nomax to melt ever so slightly until you notice his stance is becoming a little unsteady. A slight wobble of the leg, his knees bending ever so lightly."
    "你温柔地撸动着，Nomax也渐渐瘫软下来，直到你发现他站都站不稳了。腿开始打颤，膝盖也微微弯曲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4742
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1f32f09b:

    # p "Let's sit down on the bed."
    p "咱们到床上去吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4744
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_6e8ecefc:

    # "He nods in return and you are the first one to move over, watching as he follows, his length bounces awkwardly with his steps, each one clacking his claws as his paws settle on the floor."
    "他点头回应。你先一步挪到床边，看着他跟过来，那玩意儿随着他的脚步一晃一晃的。他的爪子踩在地板上，发出“咔哒咔哒”的声响。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4748
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d67168e6:

    # "Immediately you return to cupping him between his legs, fingers wrapping around his balls as he scoots closer to you."
    "你迫不及待地回到正题，手掌托住他的下身，手指轻轻握住他的睾丸，他也顺势向你靠拢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4750
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_8279fff9:

    # "You notice that his eyes keep going down to your own crotch, as if he's trying to find the right words to ask you something."
    "你注意到他的眼睛一直盯着你的胯部，似乎想问你些什么，却又难以启齿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4759
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_270bc98f:

    # "To make it easier for him, you undo your belt and the buttons on your breeches, giving him the view he seems to want so badly"
    "为了让他能更痛快点，你解开腰带，松开马裤的扣子，让他一览他心心念念的风景。"

# game/script day2.rpy:4761
