    "他听话地放下擦拭身体的毛巾，张开双腿，让你最后再好好欣赏一番。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5068
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ff8ac405:

    # n "I do not have a mirror, so I cannot make you one."
    n "我没有镜子，变不出来给你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5070
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_14625e38:

    # p "A pity..."
    p "真可惜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5072
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7c9ea580:

    # n "Stared enough? Would you be so kind as to give me my clothes?"
    n "看够了没？劳驾把我的衣服递给我好吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5074
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a417f87c:

    # n "I feel a bit underdressed."
    n "我感觉穿少了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5076
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_df2e8920:

    # p "You're starting to feel that {i}now{/i}?"
    p "你{i}现在{/i}才觉得？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5080
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_6e601948:

    # n "No, I have been since you opened the door, but it is getting late enough that I should better go and rectify it."
    n "不，你开门的时候我就觉得了，现在不早了，我最好还是去穿好衣服。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5084
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_6da78233:

    # "First his undergarments and breeches, then a white shirt, and to top it all off he put on his black suit again."
    "他先穿上内衣和马裤，然后是白衬衫，最后又套上了那身黑西装。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5088
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_6109b959:

    # "It takes a little while, but soon enough he looks as neat as he did yesterday."
    "折腾了一会儿，他又变得像昨天一样整洁体面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5090
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_88c38d29:

    # p "Well, you don't have to, around me at least. I appreciate it when you're underdressed. Or maybe you could wear a revealing plant dress to suit your profession."
    p "至少在我面前，你没必要这么讲究。我就喜欢你衣衫不整的样子。或者你可以穿那种能衬托你职业的，暴露点的植物装。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5092
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_39319be1:

    # n "Very funny."
    n "真有意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5098
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_b7c1757e:

    # p "If I'm ever lost in the woods and at the risk of starvation, I'll try to remember your words."
    p "要是我哪天在森林里迷路，快饿死了，我一定记住你今天说的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5102
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_df1e9d3e:

    # "You turn another page and there is a colourful watercolour drawing of some blackberries still on the branch, and even a little bird on the next page."
    "你翻过一页，是彩色的水彩画，画的是几颗还挂在枝头的黑莓，下一页甚至还有一只小鸟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5104
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7cd0aac5:

    # p "And you really think it's so bad here?"
    p "你真觉得这地方有这么糟糕吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5106
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_53c1cef0_1:

    # n "Yes."
    n "是的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5108
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_46fc1766:

    # p "Compared to you, I've spent the night out in the communal area, sleeping in a hammock."
    p "我跟你说，我之前还在公共区域睡过吊床呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5110
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_6af4189c:

    # p "Do you think we've got it any better?"
    p "你觉得我们又能好到哪儿去？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5114
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_bc79199c:

    # n "Do you mind giving me my pants over there? I feel a bit underdressed, to be honest."
    n "你能把那边我的裤子递给我吗？说实话，我感觉有点衣衫不整。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5116
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a7661c91:

    # "You look at what he's pointing at and reach for the lump of white cloth."
    "你顺着他指的方向看过去，伸手去拿那团白布。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5118
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_424eead7:

    # p "Do you have to? I kind of prefer you like this."
    p "非得这样吗？我倒是挺喜欢你现在的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5122
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a265c0c0:

    # n "I am sure you do."
    n "我肯定你喜欢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5124
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_0e6e0f97:

    # "You smile at him as you hand him his clothes."
    "你笑着把衣服递给他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5126
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_12c47dfa:

    # p "I very much do."
    p "我是相当喜欢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5128
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_15db4cd0:

    # p "And it helps that you are quite good-looking."
    p "主要是你长得也好看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5130
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9f77d0c8:

    # n "Is this your way of flirting?"
    n "你这是在调情吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5132
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_94a6d39f:

    # n "Just barging in before people are dressed and then sweet-talk them?"
    n "先是闯进没穿好衣服的人的房间，然后甜言蜜语？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5134
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9c53c1d2:

    # p "Well... {w}is it working?"
    p "嗯...{w}这招管用吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5136
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_b95c4f6e:

    # p "Or do I have to adjust my method? More barging? Maybe look at you less overtly?"
    p "要不我换个方法？再多闯几次？或者...少盯着你看？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5138
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_62be40be:

    # p "If you have any suggestions, I'll gladly take them on board."
    p "要是有什么建议，我一定洗耳恭听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5144
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_50d5ad4d:

    # "He takes his underwear and just holds it for a few seconds before putting it down again."
    "他拿起内裤，捏在手里犹豫了几秒，又放下了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5146
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ff131be8:

    # n "What the hell am I doing?... {w}Fine."
    n "我到底在干什么？...{w}算了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5148
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_a7b1555b:

    # "Your tail sways rather excitedly behind you as you hear his decision, and you can't help but take another more blatant look at the canine."
    "听到他这么说，你的尾巴在你身后兴奋地摇摆起来，你忍不住又一次明目张胆地打量起这只犬科动物。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5150
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e7d1c55a:

    # "The fur looks well cared for, rather soft to the touch most likely...not that you have had the chance to try yet."
    "这身毛看起来打理得真不错，摸起来肯定也挺软……当然，你还没机会摸过呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5156
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e1d2c08f:

    # "Your eyes wander down the curve of his belly and to the small bump in the white cloth he has wrapped around his waist, and with your memories from earlier you try to mentally make the cover disappear."
    "你的目光顺着他腹部的曲线向下，落在他腰间白布下的隆起，回忆起之前的事情，你试图在脑海中让那块布消失。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5158
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_169c7f32:

    # p "The right thing. At least from my biased point of view."
    p "这是正确的选择。至少从我个人的角度来看是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5160
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_798185a8:

    # p "Do you think you have another stupid decision in you and will take those off as well?"
    p "你是不是打算再做个傻决定，把那玩意儿也脱了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5162
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_045aa9f1:

    # p "Or am I pushing it?"
    p "还是我操之过急了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5166
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_70a7fcc9:

    # "You ask with a teasing smile and turn another page. Then another one, and you stumble over a torn page in the sketchbook."
    "你带着戏谑的笑容问道，然后又翻了一页。又翻了一页，你注意到素描本里有一页被撕掉了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5170
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_613b48b1:

    # n "You are..."
    n "你是……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5172
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4c0fbba7:

    # "You raise a brow at the pause in his words."
    "听到他话语中的停顿，你挑了挑眉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5174
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_fe3deabc:

    # p "But you're thinking about it anyway, aren't you?"
    p "但你还是在想，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5176
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_aa26a747:

    # n "It would not help me feeling underdressed."
    n "这样只会显得我穿得更少了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5178
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d5913d17:

    # p "That's the whole point."
    p "这不就是目的吗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5180
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9377c39c:

    # "You can feel the gears turning for him, you are pushing, but apparently not too far."
    "你能感觉到他脑子里的齿轮在转动，你正在逼迫他，但显然还没过火。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5184
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ded6b838:

    # "His fingers find the piece of garment around his waist and you get your wish."
    "他的手指找到了腰间的衣物，你如愿以偿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5193
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_bafd58f4:

    # "After it slides over his hips and down to the floor, you once again share the room with the naked painted dog."
    "在那块布料滑过他的臀部，掉到地板上之后，你再次和那个赤裸的彩绘犬共享一室。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5195
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_fce8db65_1:

    # p "There you go."
    p "“那就好。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:5197
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_913a6d4b:

    # "You tap the torn page with your finger to try and get his attention back to it."
    "你用手指敲了敲那页被撕掉的纸，想把他的注意力拉回来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5199
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_19c17a55:

    # p "You didn't like the drawing on this page?"
    p "你不喜欢这页上的画吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5203
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_76390332:

    # n "Oh is that what we're doing now? Plants talk with the naked botanist?"
    n "哦，我们现在要做什么？植物和裸体植物学家聊天？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5205
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_cfe27e5d:

    # "You playfully poke your tongue out at him."
    "你调皮地朝他吐了吐舌头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5207
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_af579382:

    # p "What's wrong with that? It's pretty cute."
    p "那有什么不好？挺可爱的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5209
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_83b2490b:

    # n "Not quite the choice of words I would use. Awkward might be more like it."
    n "我可不会这么说。应该说……挺尴尬的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5211
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1da35e88:

    # n "But no. It was not a botanical drawing, so I tore it from the book to keep it as one theme."
    n "不是的。那不是植物学绘画，所以我把它从书里撕下来，想保持一个主题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5213
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_e095194a:

    # p "That's exactly why it's cute. Watching you squirm and simply...watching everything."
    p "正因为如此才可爱。看着你局促不安的样子，只是……看着一切。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5215
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5a3e2196:

    # "You emphasise your words with an obvious lingering look at him."
    "你用明显的、恋恋不舍的目光看着他，强调你的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5219
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7961fdf9:

    # p "Would it be too cheesy if I said that you're like my plant?"
    p "如果我说你像我的植物一样，会不会太俗气了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5223
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_8297e062:

    # "He bursts out into a sudden laugh, his chest moving with the rhythm of his laughter."
    "他突然 burst out into a sudden laugh 爆发出一阵大笑，胸膛随着笑声的节奏而起伏。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5225
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_ddea254b:

    # n "Oh dear. It {i}is{/i} absolutely cheesy,{w} but no, the drawing just did not fit."
    n "哦，天哪。这{i}确实{/i}非常俗气，{w}但不是的，那幅画就是不合适。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5229
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_46a570c0:

    # n "I want to keep the sketchbook as one theme and had to get rid of that one.{w} It does not look great to have a torn page though..."
    n "我想保持素描本的主题一致，所以不得不除掉那张。{w}不过，有一页被撕掉了，看起来不太好......"

# game/script day2.rpy:5231
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5dda272c:

    # n "Not sure if it was the right decision."
    n "不知道是不是正确的决定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5233
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_6ed46250:

    # p "Why didn't it fit? You've already got plants in here, animals too, it couldn't have been that out of place, could it?"
    p "为什么不合适？你这里已经有植物了，也有动物，它不应该那么不搭调吧，难道不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5237
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_cc558f4c:

    # "He shrugs and turns the page to open up the view onto the next drawing."
    "他耸耸肩，翻过一页，露出下一幅画。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5239
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_56574fb2:

    # n "It was a life drawing, and turning the page to see that among the flora and fauna just felt odd."
    n "那是张人体素描，翻过去看到它混在一堆动植物画作里，感觉真别扭。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5241
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_b1e58e3e:

    # n "I really like this one. The brush was just really nice and look at the way it left these streaks here."
    n "我特别喜欢这张。这用笔真是绝了，你看它在这儿留下的笔触。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5243
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9ac6e449:

    # "You lift the book up to look at it closer and you see the texture he mentioned at the end of the brush strokes, which gives the drawing an even more textured feel."
    "你拿起书凑近了看，能看到他说的笔触末梢的纹理，让这画更有感觉了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5245
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_cb69423c:

    # p "Life drawing, huh. Can I persuade you to do one for me?"
    p "人体素描，嗯？要不要我给你画一张？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5249
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_41012998:

    # "He tilts his head, the ears on his head bobbing gently."
    "他歪了歪头，头上的耳朵微微颤动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5251
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_11c0d891:

    # n "A drawing of you?"
    n "画我？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5253
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_4c196757:

    # n "I suppose I could, at least it would be something to do on th-"
    n "我想我可以试试，好歹能打发点时间……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5255
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_34205a8f:

    # p "I meant of you."
    p "我是说画你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5257
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d355ffe4:

    # n "Me?"
    n "我？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5259
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_7f77655f:

    # p "Sure. A sultry nude to remember you by."
    p "没问题。一张风骚的裸体画，好让你记住我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5265
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1095ef2b:

    # n "I... I do not think I have a mirror."
    n "我…我好像没有镜子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5267
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1b1072ee:

    # p "I'll be happy to take a non-mirror approximation."
    p "画张不照镜子的也行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5269
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_d3101e91:

    # n "You really are a greedy one."
    n "你可真够贪心的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5273
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_838a66db:

    # "You grin at him and put the book back on the table."
    "你冲他一笑，把书放回桌上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5275
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_f53c7827:

    # p "You just never say no; I'm just taking my chances."
    p "你是从来不拒绝人啊，我就是试试看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5277
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_f1e5ce0b:

    # "In return he stays quiet for a few long moments before he speaks again."
    "他听了沉默了片刻，才又开了口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5279
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_465f836f:

    # n "At least you are doing your bit to make this trip a little less miserable."
    n "好歹你也做了点好事，让这趟差事没那么难熬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5281
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_66b0997e:

    # p "Oh, so what we're doing here is the pleasant part?"
    p "噢，所以说跟你待着是件美差了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5285
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_1520f3f0:

    # p "Perhaps I'll have to make sure I come by more often in the mornings."
    p "看来我以后得常来你这儿串串门了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5287
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_0fb6914c:

    # "You dare and plant your palm firmly in the fur of his rump and feel your fingers combing through it."
    "你胆子真大，一把按在他屁股上，还挠了挠。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5295
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_24796dbe:

    # n ". . ."
    n ". . ."

# game/script day2.rpy:5297
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_b1482a2b:

    # p "Not a no. Again."
    p "这不就是答应了吗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5299
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_5ebbde70:

    # p "I can't wait for the drawing then. I'm sure it'll be fantastic."
    p "那我可太期待你的画了，肯定棒极了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5303
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_40ddc24a:

    # n "I will at least give it a try."
    n "我至少会试试看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5305
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_86140f22:

    # n "But no promises.{w} I have to feel that I like it enough myself."
    n "但不敢保证啊。{w} 我得自己满意才行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5307
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_0eb3f5ec:

    # n "Drawing people is difficult. Very difficult for me."
    n "画人太难了，对我来说尤其难。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5309
translate Chinese day2_nomax_entered_9b98e79b:

    # n "Another thing where plants just speak to me more, I suppose."
    n "我还是更喜欢画植物，可能它们比较能和我交流吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5323
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_a1307376:

    # "With a quick pull you close the door again, slamming it shut forcefully enough that the wooden planks of it rattle from the impact."
    "你一把拉上门，砰的一声，震得木板都嗡嗡作响。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5325
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_b086589b:

    # "A few heads turn your way and you awkwardly try to defuse their suspicions by raising your hand apologetically. It appears to be enough and one by one they go back to whatever they were doing before."
    "有几个人朝你看来，你不好意思地举起手，想让他们别多想。 看来这招管用，他们就又各自忙活去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5327
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_4667ac6e:

    # "Once the initial shock has passed, you move closer to the door and try to talk to Nomax through it."
    "缓过神来之后，你走到门边，隔着门想和Nomax搭话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5329
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_21fcb9ee:

    # p "My sincerest apologies! I didn't realize the door was open and you were..."
    p "真不好意思！我没注意到门是开着的，而且你正在…"

# game/script day2.rpy:5331
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_f5120f85:

    # p "Never mind."
    p "没事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5333
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_2fca5eec:

    # "No answer at first, just some muffled sounds make their way through, barely audible over the waves that travel along the hull of the ship."
    "起初没有任何回应，只有一些含糊的声音传过来，几乎无法听到，因为海浪拍打着船体。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5335
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_bef5816c:

    # n "Do not worry.{w} Just give me a moment."
    n "别急，{w} 稍等片刻。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5337
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_33b71c4f:

    # "You're doing just that, and waiting a little longer doesn't sound like much of a problem."
    "你已经等了，再多等一会儿也没什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5339
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_0c119af9:

    # "Your attention wanders across the deck until you hear the scraping of wood against wood, and the door to Nomax's room opens again."
    "你的注意力在甲板上游移，直到你听到木头摩擦的声音，Nomax的房门再次打开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5348
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_56dd7c7e:

    # "This time the painted dog greets you in a much more appropriate attire, even if he still looks as flustered as before."
    "这一次，这位彩绘狗穿着得体多了，尽管他看起来仍然像之前一样慌乱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5350
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_283d9614:

    # p "Sorry again... I didn't-... and the door just-"
    p "再次抱歉……我不是故意的……门它自己就……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5352
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_36b06c27:

    # "You stumble over your own words as you try to make up for your mistake, but he waves you off with a shake of his head and beckons you inside."
    "你语无伦次地想要解释，但他摇摇头，示意你进去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5356
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_0350bacd:

    # n "Do not fret, it was not your fault. Come on in, I assume you did not just plan to stand at the door?"
    n "别放在心上，又不是你的错。进来吧，你总不是打算一直站在门口吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5358
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_3058191f:

    # "Happy to accept the offer, you step into the African Wild Dog's cabin, his scent immediately filling your nostrils."
    "你欣然接受，走进这只非洲野犬的小屋，他的气味立刻充满了你的鼻腔。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5360
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_0cd4b54e:

    # "It was a tiny room, no windows, a small rickety bed, a table and a simple chair, and not much room to stand between them."
    "房间很小，没有窗户，一张摇摇晃晃的小床，一张桌子和一把简陋的椅子，几乎没有落脚的地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5362
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_c0104a33:

    # "No wonder it smells so much like him after he slept in here."
    "怪不得屋里都是他的味道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5364
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_e43c6ceb:

    # "If anything it was a rather pleasant smell compared to some of the others present on a ship like this."
    "跟船上其他的味道比起来，这味道还算好的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5369
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_689f8925:

    # "He shuts the door behind you when you come in and demonstratively moves it open and shut without actually opening any mechanism."
    "你进来后，他关上了身后的门，还比划着来回开关了几下，但实际上并没有碰到任何机关。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5371
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_4f6c69a5:

    # n "It does not actually close, there is no lock or anything on this thing. It is just held by friction and I have to hope that I will not become people's entertainment while I sleep."
    n "这玩意儿根本关不紧，上面连个锁都没有。就靠摩擦力撑着，我只能祈祷睡觉的时候别成了别人的笑柄。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5373
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_be85343a:

    # p "No lock at all? Strange."
    p "竟然没锁？真离谱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5375
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_a5577da2:

    # n "I assume this is just a cargo hold that they repurposed into this cabin..."
    n "我猜这儿就是个货舱改的……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5379
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_73e23985:

    # n "Stuffed in an unused hold. Just my luck, is it not?"
    n "被塞进一个废弃的货舱。真他妈倒霉，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5381
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_f04286c2:

    # n "All that is missing is a rat to share the room with, if you ask me."
    n "要我说，就差一只老鼠来作伴了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5383
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_d4d7cefe:

    # p "It's not the most luxurious room, I'll give you that, but at least you have a room and some privacy."
    p "我承认，这地方算不上豪华，但好歹你也有个房间，能有点隐私。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5385
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_9e17371b:

    # n "We just saw how that privacy worked out, did we not?"
    n "咱们刚才不是才见识了这隐私是怎么一回事吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5387
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_8ca11a58:

    # n "Not even a bloody lock on the door..."
    n "门上连个破锁都没有……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5389
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_041c63bf:

    # p "You don't sound particularly happy with your lot..."
    p "听你这口气，好像对现状不太满意啊……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5393
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_4f6d5216:

    # "He sighs audibly."
    "他长长地叹了口气，叹得很明显。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5395
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_9990a9b6:

    # n "Seasick yesterday, the prospect of being in this claustrophobic cabin for how long? {w}Two months?"
    n "昨天还在晕船，接下来还得在这间逼仄幽闭的舱房里闷上多久？{w}整整两个月？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5397
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_e4924859:

    # p "It's a ship, though. What did you expect?"
    p "这可是艘船啊，你还想怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5401
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_65d961c8:

    # n "Just... {i}anything{/i} would have been nice."
    n "随便什么都好啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5403
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_8793275a:

    # n "But I suppose I am not valuable enough to my patron to warrant a decent cabin."
    n "看来我在我的赞助人眼里还不够重要，没资格住好点的船舱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5405
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_eb9a4c63:

    # p "This is a cargo ship. I don't think there {i}are{/i} decent cabins, unless perhaps you're the captain."
    p "这可是货船，除了船长，估计没人能住上像样的船舱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5407
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_41debae0:

    # p "I spent the night in a hammock in the open. It can't be that bad to have your own room."
    p "我昨晚还在露天吊床上睡了一夜呢，有个自己的房间总比那强吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5409
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_1af25aea:

    # n "Just not used to conditions like this, I guess."
    n "就是不太习惯这种环境，可能吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5412
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_4d47b261:

    # n "{cps=5000}Just not used to conditions like this, I guess.{/cps}" nointeract
    n "{cps=5000}就是不太习惯这种环境，可能吧。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:5416
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_65219b88:

    # p "It's not exactly the height of luxury when you travel by ship."
    p "坐船旅行本来就不是什么享受。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5418
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_ce922d26:

    # p "But you should have expected that."
    p "你应该早就料到了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5420
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_38ef0500:

    # n "I suppose..."
    n "我也这么觉得..."

# game/script day2.rpy:5422
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_5f7bef87:

    # "He crosses his arms over his chest."
    "他抱起胳膊，一脸不悦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5424
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_c149285a:

    # n "That does not mean I have to like it, though."
    n "但这不代表我就得喜欢它。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5426
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_08741c65:

    # n "And I do not."
    n "而且我才不喜欢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5432
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_075066ab:

    # n "I would not put it like that..."
    n "我倒不会这么说..."

# game/script day2.rpy:5434
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_373817b0:

    # p "But you are the one who is complaining."
    p "但现在抱怨的人明明是你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5436
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_d3576bc2:

    # n "And I have no right to do so?"
    n "难道我连抱怨两句都不行吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5438
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_5f7bef87_1:

    # "He crosses his arms over his chest."
    "他抱起胳膊，一脸不悦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5440
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_0fd5f34e:

    # p "Of course you can. But it makes you sound spoiled if everyone else just gets on with it."
    p "当然可以抱怨。但大家都好好的，就你事儿多，显得你很矫情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5442
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_b9caadb3:

    # p "Just don't let the others know. I don't think they'd really appreciate having a runt around."
    p "可千万别让其他人知道。我猜他们大概不会乐意见到一个矮冬瓜成天晃荡。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5446
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_84e3c49f:

    # n "A runt? Really?!"
    n "矮冬瓜？不至于吧？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5448
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_4915784d:

    # "He glares at you and you shake your head in return."
    "他瞪了我一眼，我也毫不示弱地瞪了回去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5450
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_44ac4b62:

    # p "I'm not the one complaining about every little thing."
    p "我可不像你，屁大点事儿都要抱怨。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5452
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_c1bc16d9:

    # p "Being understanding is one thing, but come on, at some point you have to toughen up a bit too."
    p "体谅你是一回事，但你也得稍微坚强点吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5454
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_aaf5eed7:

    # p "You've got your own cabin, for crying out loud."
    p "你都有单独的船舱了，还想咋样啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5456
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_c9ec5d38:

    # "You hear him exhale loudly through his nose."
    "我听到他从鼻子里重重地哼了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5458
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_b4d0eaee:

    # n "Well, thank you very much."
    n "哦，是吗，真是谢谢您嘞。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5460
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_7e06015f:

    # n "Just what I thought I was missing today. Someone to-"
    n "我还以为今天少了点什么呢。原来是少了个人来——"

# game/script day2.rpy:5462
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_b5dda70f:

    # p "To what? To just agree with your whining?"
    p "来附和你一起抱怨吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5464
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_59b9ffaa:

    # "His eyes meet yours as you interrupt him, his eyebrows furrowing with intent."
    "我打断了他，他的目光和我撞在一起，眉毛也拧了起来，好像要说什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5466
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_e0b49e56:

    # p "I mean that seriously. You're going to the other side of the planet, across oceans."
    p "我是说真的。咱们可是要去地球另一端，要跨越大洋的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5468
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_e3d08ef0:

    # "You walk over to his table to look at some of the books on it. Two of them appear to have completely blank covers."
    "我走到他桌边，想看看他都带了什么书。有两本封面居然是空白的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5470
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_935c23da:

    # p "Of course that's not going to be easy."
    p "这趟肯定不容易。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5472
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_35424913:

    # p "You've been here less than a full day and you're whining into the first set of ears you can find."
    p "你来这才多久啊，就开始逮着人抱怨了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5476
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_c8c2338d:

    # "His expression softened, but there was still disappointment in his eyes."
    "他脸色缓和了一些，但眼神里还是带着失望。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5478
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_d82f4400:

    # n "But I..."
    n "但是我……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5480
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_62d88922:

    # "You hear the clack of his claws on the floor as he steps up to the table next to you."
    "我听到他走过来时，爪子在地板上发出“咔哒咔哒”的响声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5482
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_e587d8c1:

    # n "Maybe I should have stayed home."
    n "我可能真该留在家里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5486
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_15f842ca:

    # n "I would already be served breakfast now if I had."
    n "要是在家，这会儿早吃上早饭了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5490
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_b728ecf3:

    # "He reaches for one of the blank books you were looking at and flicks it open."
    "他拿起我刚才看的那本无字书，翻开了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5494
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_2f14318a:

    # "The book opens to a page with a dilligently drawn representation of some kind of plant that you don't know enough about to identify."
    "书页上画着一种植物，画得很细致，但我也不认识。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5496
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_3071f953:

    # p "Did you draw them?"
    p "你画的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5500
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_a012c470:

    # n "These?"
    n "“这身？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:5502
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_2f53585c:

    # "He taps the book again."
    "他又敲了敲书。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5506
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_c82f73c4:

    # n "Yes, it's part of documenting them."
    n "是啊，这也是记录工作的一部分。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5508
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_7db5f96f:

    # "He wasn't exactly the next Michelangelo, but his drawings do look really quite nice, and you spot the little note that denotes the name of the plant as well."
    "他也不是什么米开朗基罗，不过画得确实挺不错，而且你看，这儿还标着植物的名字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5510
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_3e8dd2f6:

    # "{i}Craterellus cornucopioides{/i}, trompette de la mort."
    "{i}Craterellus cornucopioides{/i}，trompette de la mort（死亡号角菌，灰酱油小喇叭菌）."

# game/script day2.rpy:5512
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_fd86e610:

    # p "So you even have something to keep you occupied, and you're still moaning?"
    p "所以你有事做还抱怨？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5514
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_107437d5:

    # n "I do not know if you have noticed, but there is a distinct lack of plants around here, apart from the few I brought along."
    n "你没注意到吗？除了我带来的这几棵，这儿都没什么植物。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5516
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_4e1d18ad:

    # "He points to a small pot with a few green stems and leaves growing out of the top."
    "他指着一个小盆，里面冒出了几根绿色的茎和叶子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5518
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_5b469922:

    # p "So? Just draw something else for a while.{w} You will survive."
    p "那又怎样？先画点别的呗，又死不了人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5520
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_51ddc7bf:

    # p "We'll have stops along the way to break up the monotony, too. I think it's all just piling up right at the beginning for you."
    p "路上我们也会停靠休息，不会一直这么闷。我觉得你就是还没适应，一下子都堆到一块儿去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5524
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_230ae65d:

    # "Nomax's shoulders slump, and he lets out a long sigh."
    "Nomax的肩膀垮了下来，长叹了一口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5526
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_866f8321:

    # n "You are probably right.{w} I have just been building this up so much over the past few weeks, finally being able to go to a new, largely untouched area, and just having all the time in the world to devote to my studies."
    n "你说的对。过去几周我一直在期待这件事，想着终于能去一个全新的、基本没被人涉足过的地方，可以全身心投入研究。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5531
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_9f0914de:

    # "He flicks through the pages of the book, but in the end lands back on the same page from before."
    "他翻着书页，最后又翻回了之前那一页。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5533
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_656a9568:

    # n "Maybe find a whole new species to bring back. The respect of colleagues, invitations to universities..."
    n "说不定能发现一个新物种带回去呢。到时候，同事们的敬佩，大学的邀请……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5535
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_8a03a529:

    # n "Perhaps I just let that dream cloud the reality and forgot what it actually entails."
    n "也许我就是让梦想冲昏了头脑，忘了现实是什么样子的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5537
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_c069128a:

    # n "That it simply would be a fun trip. Sipping wine on the deck of a ship while being ferried along..."
    n "本以为会是一次轻松愉快的旅行。在甲板上喝着小酒，一路晃悠过去……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5541
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_31231eb2:

    # p "You really are spoiled."
    p "你还真是身在福中不知福。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5543
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_7f149a66:

    # "You add in a more playful tone this time."
    "这次你用了更俏皮的语气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5549
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_1935f71a:

    # p "Is that why you came? To come back home with a great discovery?"
    p "你来这儿就是为了带个大发现回去？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5551
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_95d4c320:

    # p "To be showered with laurels?"
    p "好接受众人的鲜花和掌声？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5553
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_49c9d990:

    # p "It'd probably be hypocritical of me to say your aspirations are wrong, given that I'm here for reasons not much different."
    p "我要是说你的想法不对，那就太虚伪了，毕竟我来这儿的目的也差不多。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5555
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_5fcf1277:

    # p "We're both just dreamers in a sense."
    p "从某种意义上说，我们都是梦想家。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5557
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_641c181d:

    # p "What does your patron do anyway to allow you to do this?"
    p "你的资助人是做什么的，能让你这么自由？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5562
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_6f2f22ae:

    # "The African wild dog picks up his cup on the table and fills it with water from a can before sitting down on the bed to drink."
    "非洲野犬拿起桌上的杯子，从罐子里倒了些水，然后坐在床上喝了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5564
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_f3d4e01a:

    # n "Oh, she runs several botanical pharmacies and as I mentioned yesterday just sees my work as an opportunity to find the next big thing."
    n "哦，她开了几家植物药房，就像我昨天说的，她觉得我的工作能帮她找到下一个爆款。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5566
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_33404596:

    # n "But with new medicinal effects of mercury, sulphur and the like popping up left, right and centre, she needs something to top those."
    n "但现在各种汞、硫磺的新疗效层出不穷，她得找点更厉害的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5568
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_fa1f8d9a:

    # "He shrugs and takes another sip."
    "他耸耸肩，又喝了一口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5572
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_eaf768e1:

    # n "Some kind of miracle cure, and unknown lands in Africa promise just that."
    n "某种奇迹疗法，而非洲的未知之地就预示着这种可能。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5574
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_9c874737:

    # p "But you're going to her estate, aren't you? Not exactly uncharted lands."
    p "但你要去的是她的庄园吧？那可不是什么无人区。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5578
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_393bf74f:

    # n "I am not going to stay in one place. It is just where I am going to live and sleep."
    n "我又不会一直待在一个地方。那只是我睡觉的地方而已。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5580
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_538c57e1:

    # n "But beyond that, I'll be free to roam and pursue my task."
    n "不过这样一来，我就可以自由自在地四处逛荡，追寻我的目标了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5582
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_92a2d821:

    # n "And sure, she has built a residence there because she has too much money for her own good, but we still know very little about these lands."
    n "她在那儿置办家产，还不是因为钱烧得慌。不过说真的，咱们对那片地界儿还真没啥了解。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5584
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_2d0f59e6:

    # "You pick up the book and show him the illustration of the strange-looking black mushroom."
    "你拿起那本书，指给他看那张怪模怪样的黑蘑菇插图。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5586
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_c0fb3eba:

    # p "And you're going to look for stuff like this?"
    p "所以你就是想找这种玩意儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5588
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_25b4cd0e:

    # p "This one looks rather ominous...a very fitting name, too, judging by its appearance."
    p "这玩意儿看起来真不吉利……不过看它这长相，名字倒是挺搭的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5590
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_1d5c1f81:

    # p "Very reminiscent of death, rather than a blooming plant."
    p "与其说是花，倒不如说是死神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5594
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_ba3b8f30:

    # n "It is actually a perfectly edible mushroom."
    n "其实这蘑菇完全能吃。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5596
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_140687d6:

    # p "Yummy...{w} Not sure if they'd be my first choice."
    p "真好吃……{w} 但我不确定它们是不是我的首选。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5598
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_1b975b10:

    # n "Do not knock them before you try them. They taste quite alright."
    n "别没吃过就说不行。味道还真不赖。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5600
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_9b4ec757:

    # n "And safe to pick. Nothing looks quite like them. At worst, you will pick one of its bretheren, which are edible just the same."
    n "而且采摘起来很安全，长成这样的就它独一份。就算最倒霉，你也就采到它亲戚，味道一样好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5602
translate Chinese day2_nomax_notentered_950a31f7:

    # p "Strange..."
    p "真够奇怪的……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5609
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_563ad719:

    # p "How did you end up doing what you're doing anyway?"
    p "你咋就干上这一行了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5611
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_b5ce6c2a:

    # p "Dedicating your time to plants I mean. Isn't it a bit, pardon me, boring? A tree is a tree. Flowers don't exactly do anything exciting."
    p "我是说，你把时间都花在这些花花草草上。说句不好听的，你不觉得有点闷吗？树就是树，花又不会搞什么大新闻。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5613
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_7181a250:

    # p "I guess they look nice, sure."
    p "它们是挺好看的，这我承认。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5615
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_2e88a858:

    # p "But why not go for animals, become a doctor, or study military tactics?"
    p "你干嘛不去研究动物，当个医生，或者学点兵法啥的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5621
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_20e61213:

    # "Nomax walks over to the little potted plants he has brought with him and picks them up, inspecting them closely enough that his black snout almost touches the leaves."
    "[name]走到他带来的那些小盆栽旁边，拿起来仔细端详，黑鼻子都快贴到叶子上了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5623
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_9bf68bd1:

    # n "Because they are as exciting as any of the subjects you have in mind.{w} Just because they're not causing explosions on a battlefield, or hunting their prey, does not mean they are not exciting."
    n "因为它们跟你想的那些玩意儿一样，刺激着呢！{w} 别以为它们不会在战场上搞爆炸，也不会捕猎，就觉得它们没劲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5625
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_2f373dc6:

    # n "Your life depends on these wonderful things, you should not just dismiss them. Just think of the wonders they are."
    n "你的命可都靠这些宝贝疙瘩撑着，别那么不当回事儿。好好想想它们有多神奇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5627
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_82762d82:

    # n "Jan van Helmont has measured the mass of the soil in which these plants are growing, and as you will see when they grow, very little if any of the soil will disappear."
    n "[name]测过这些花花草草底下的土有多重，等它们长大了你就知道了，土可没少多少。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5629
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_2b219dfb:

    # n "Yet with a bit of luck we will end up with an abundance of green leaves."
    n "要是运气好，咱们就能收获一大堆绿叶子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5631
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_4db529ac:

    # "He reaches out with his fingertips to gently tug at one of the leaves."
    "他伸出手指，轻轻地拽了拽一片叶子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5633
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_f53a56d7:

    # n "Now these are not particularly tasty, I have tried, but think about what you eat. The things that sustain you simply appear as if out of thin air."
    n "这玩意儿吃起来味道一般，我试过了。不过想想你吃的那些东西，那些养活你的玩意儿，就好像是从空气里变出来的一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5635
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_ab3d4455:

    # p "I guess..."
    p "我想也是……"

# game/script day2.rpy:5637
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_79969748:

    # n "Your family has a farm, do they not?"
    n "你家里不是有个农场吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5639
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_f2631a0b:

    # n "How could you not be fascinated by them?"
    n "你怎么可能对它们不着迷呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5641
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_b18a3110:

    # n "You saw it all first hand year after year as you grew up."
    n "你从小到大，一年又一年，亲眼看着它们长大。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5643
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_6925ae6c:

    # p "Are you forgetting the part where I'm currently trying to escape that whole part of my life?"
    p "你忘了我现在正想方设法逃离那段日子了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5645
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_fbf3d3e6:

    # "You study the plants from a distance, trying to see what he sees in them, but it is difficult to get beyond the idea that they are just... well... plants."
    "你远远地打量着那些植物，想看看他到底发现了什么，可你还是觉得它们不过就是……植物而已。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5647
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_3dc88cca:

    # p "I don't exactly have the greatest affinity for it, otherwise I might have stayed."
    p "我对那玩意儿真没啥感情，不然我早留下来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5651
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_7c303122:

    # n "What about your clothes then? Linen? Soap? The oils of plants.{w} This very ship! That is taking you on your desired adventure away from home!"
    n "那你穿的衣服呢？亚麻的吧？肥皂呢？还有植物油！{w} 还有咱们坐的这条船！它正带着你离开家，去追寻你梦寐以求的冒险！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5653
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_b7292f6c:

    # p "Sure, but that's just using them to make something useful. From what I gather you don't do that."
    p "话是没错，可那只是用它们做点有用的东西。可我听你的意思，你不是这么玩的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5655
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_41b4e4c6:

    # n "I do not. At least not like that. But if you know them, and know them deeply, you may learn what little tricks they have up their sleeves."
    n "我确实不是。起码不是那样。不过你要是懂它们，往深了懂，说不定就能摸清它们藏着掖着的小秘密。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5657
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_fe3949ea:

    # n "And perhaps it means discovering some use for them, but that is secondary to me."
    n "也许还能发现它们的其他用途，但对我来说，这都是次要的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5659
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_378cea59:

    # n "I am just fascinated by them, whether they are useful or not. They are all useful in their own way, even if they don't benefit us directly."
    n "我就是对这些植物着迷，有没有用都一样。 它们都有自己的价值，就算不能直接帮到我们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5661
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_52af1f7e:

    # n "And it is a shame that so little thought is given to them nowadays, when it is really us who live in their world, and not the other way around."
    n "现在都没什么人关心它们了，真是可惜。 毕竟，真正活在它们世界里的是我们，而不是反过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5663
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_37cbedc6:

    # p "I suppose I've never really looked at it that way."
    p "我... 好像还真没这么想过。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5665
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_af4b5a02:

    # "He puts the plants back on the table and settles down in the chair."
    "他把植物小心地放回桌上，然后一屁股坐在椅子里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5669
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_699e766a:

    # "A soft creaking goes through the room as his weight settles on the wood."
    "随着他身体的重量压在木椅上，房间里发出轻微的吱嘎声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5671
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_009e8ae3:

    # n "Perhaps in time you will."
    n "也许过段时间你就会明白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5675
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_0ef3ecef:

    # n "Maybe in the next harbor I can see if I can make you your own little pot to look after for the duration of the journey?"
    n "要不这样，下个港口我看看能不能给你也做一个小花盆，让你在接下来的航程里照顾着玩？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5677
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_e0d7abdc:

    # "His tail flicks excitedly behind him as he suggests it."
    "他兴奋地提出了这个建议，尾巴在身后摇个不停。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5679
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_67368ce4:

    # n "It would be really fun to see what I can find over there, too."
    n "看看我能在那里发现什么新奇玩意，也肯定特别有意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5682
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d64d63ca:

    # n "Maybe it will light a spark for you just the same! What do you say?" nointeract
    n "说不定也能一样点燃你的兴趣呢！ 怎么样？" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:5690
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_299dd862:

    # n "Oh, that is wonderful!"
    n "哇，那真是太棒了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5696
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_8aa3ace6:

    # "Nomax lights up with joy and immediately begins to rummage for one of his books."
    "Nomax 听了高兴得手舞足蹈，立马就开始翻箱倒柜地找书。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5700
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_799b9356:

    # "It is a small booklet that he finds, and armed with the quill, he quickly makes a note of what you assume you two have just agreed on."
    "他找到了一本小册子，拿起羽毛笔，飞快地记录着你们俩刚刚敲定的事情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5702
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d4e09126:

    # p "I'm happy to at least try. But don't be disappointed if I don't enjoy it as much as you do."
    p "我倒是挺乐意试试的。 不过我可不敢保证会像你一样喜欢，别抱太高期望啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5704
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_9657e017:

    # "You try to temper his expectations."
    "你想给他降降温，免得期望太高。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5706
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_4d897119:

    # p "Or that they'll survive..."
    p "也不知道它们能不能活下来......"

# game/script day2.rpy:5708
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_332d0362:

    # p "But maybe it'll be fun."
    p "也许会挺有意思的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5710
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_b284ee91:

    # n "You grew up on a farm. I am sure you have a feeling for them, and they will not just immediately die on you."
    n "你可是农场里长大的，我敢肯定你对植物有感觉，它们肯定不会立刻就死在你手里的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5716
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_4a54e37a:

    # "He pauses for a second and puts the quill down after finishing his note."
    "他停顿了一下，写完笔记后放下了羽毛笔。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5718
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_cff845be:

    # n "At least I hope so. I am not quite sure what kind of flora they have over there."
    n "但愿如此吧。 我也不太清楚那边都有什么植物。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5720
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_7ebb516f:

    # n "But it is a dry place, is it not? They must have something sturdy enough to survive even the clumsiest paws, surely!"
    n "不过那地方挺干燥的，是吧？ 它们肯定有什么足够结实的品种，就算是最笨手笨脚的爪子也能养活！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5724
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_0810f4e8:

    # n "And you can keep me informed how well it is going. It might make the dull days a little more interesting, do you not think?"
    n "你还可以随时跟我说说情况怎么样了。 这没准能给这枯燥的航行添点乐趣，你说是不是？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5726
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_0e50683b:

    # p "I suppose so. And if all else fails, I still have you to swoop in and save them."
    p "应该吧。 如果真不行，不还有你嘛，到时候你来救它们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5728
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_79090a3d:

    # p "A hero with big ears fluttering in the wind."
    p "一位长着大耳朵在风中招摇的大英雄。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5732
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_1e7ee9cf:

    # n "I will have you know that they're strong enough not to flap in the wind. Unless we are talking about a proper storm?"
    n "我跟你说，我的耳朵可结实着呢，不会被风吹起来的。 除非是遇上真家伙，暴风雨啥的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5736
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_73f615f8:

    # p "I have the feeling that you won't do any swooping during a storm either, truth be told."
    p "说实话，我感觉就算真遇上暴风雨，你也不会去救花的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5740
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_6958afba:

    # p "If anything, I'm surprised you're as chipper as you are today."
    p "要说啊，我倒是挺惊讶你今天居然这么高兴的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5743
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_9e5cf7a5:

    # p "If anything, I'm surprised at your turnaround, and how chipper you are sounding."
    p "要说啊，我更惊讶你的转变，听你说话都感觉精神焕发了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5745
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_330af960:

    # p "Maybe the earlier problems are already forgotten?"
    p "难道之前那些烦心事都忘了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5749
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_66518a11:

    # "He crosses his arms demonstratively and leans back in his chair, laying one leg over the other."
    "他故意交叉双臂，往椅子里一靠，一条腿还搭在另一条腿上，真够臭屁的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5751
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_7aac4145:

    # n "I am not doing too badly, am I? I mean, it would be nicer if this place did not reek as it does."
    n "我做得还行吧？我是说，要是这鬼地方没有这么臭，那就更好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5755
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_bb102d6b:

    # p "In the cabin's defence, we haven't exactly helped the issue."
    p "说句公道话，这屋子变成这样，咱俩也有责任。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5759
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_e8bd926d:

    # n "Not quite, not quite!"
    n "差远了，差远了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5761
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_f6b66520:

    # "His head tips back as he laughs."
    "他笑着，头往后仰。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5765
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_4ed2b1f9:

    # n "A little sweat mixing with the fanciful odor of ripe mold."
    n "一丝汗味混杂着一股熟透了的霉味儿，那叫一个销魂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5767
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d0f37f15:

    # n "But I would also be happy if the door would be able to close properly."
    n "不过，要是这门能好好关上，我就谢天谢地了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5770
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5321f668:

    # n "Or if the door would be able to close properly."
    n "或者说，如果这门它能好好关上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5772
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_25ec8bac:

    # n "Or if the bed did not hurt my neck when I sleep in it."
    n "再或者，如果我睡在这床上，脖子不会疼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5774
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_eeb94c55:

    # n "But if you look past those things, then yes, maybe I am not doing so badly after all."
    n "要是你能忍受这些，那好吧，也许我确实还不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5784
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_956de112:

    # n "You do not have to try and mask it if it is not your thing."
    n "如果你真不喜欢，不用勉强。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5786
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_641e0c1c:

    # n "I can live with a simple \"no.\""
    n "我一句“不”就够了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5788
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_77925cee:

    # "You lower your ears and look away."
    "你耷拉下脑袋，眼神也躲开了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5790
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_aff3d2e6:

    # p "Sorry, I just..."
    p "抱歉，我就是..."

# game/script day2.rpy:5792
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_93d2bff2:

    # p "You were just so into it that I didn't have it in me to turn you down like that."
    p "你刚才那么投入，我实在不好意思直接拒绝你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5794
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_e1a36cb3:

    # n "Well, you know it for next time, I suppose."
    n "好吧，下次你就知道了，就当长个教训。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5804
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5936cd4a:

    # n "I...{w} I understand."
    n "我...{w} 我明白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5806
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_913fc37d:

    # n "You are working here after all, so the last thing you probably need is even more things to worry about."
    n "毕竟你在这儿干活，最不需要的就是再给自己添堵了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5808
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5e88503d:

    # p "I really appreciate the offer, though."
    p "不过，我还是非常感谢你的好意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5812
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5e01daee:

    # p "I just don't think it's for me. Don't get me wrong, it's a pleasure to hear you talk about it, you obviously enjoy what you're doing."
    p "我只是觉得这事儿不适合我。你别误会，我喜欢听你聊这些，看得出来你是真心喜欢这份工作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5814
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_71b859fb:

    # p "But I just don't think it's my cup of tea when I have to do it myself, if that makes sense?"
    p "但如果让我自己上手，我就敬谢不敏了，你能明白我的意思吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5818
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_89dadc4c:

    # n "I suppose it is only fair, after I emptied my stomach all over your passion yesterday."
    n "毕竟我昨天刚吐了你一地，也算是扯平了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5820
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_3eb7ca04:

    # "His laughter briefly fills the cabin."
    "他的笑声在小屋里回荡。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5824
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_cb789ca3:

    # n "So I guess we are in similar positions."
    n "所以我觉得咱俩现在也算是难兄难弟了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5828
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_caddd314:

    # p "Hey, I think you missed with most of it yesterday. It was really good form with an impeccable arch."
    p "嘿，我觉得你昨天吐歪了，大部分都吐偏了。不过那姿势真不错，弧线简直完美。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5830
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_4bd8bc06:

    # "You tease back jokingly, eliciting another laugh from the painted dog."
    "你笑着回怼，引得这只“彩绘狗”又是一阵大笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5832
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_87818ca4:

    # n "Oh, I do not know about that. I saw the streak running down the hull."
    n "哎呦，那可说不定。我可是看到船壳上那道痕迹了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5834
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_269d9297:

    # p "Did you? I didn't want to inspect it too closely for obvious reasons, so I just gauged it from afar."
    p "是吗？我不太想仔细看，原因你也懂，所以就远远地瞄了一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5838
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_6958afba_1:

    # p "If anything, I'm surprised you're as chipper as you are today."
    p "要说啊，我倒是挺惊讶你今天居然这么高兴的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5841
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_9e5cf7a5_1:

    # p "If anything, I'm surprised at your turnaround, and how chipper you are sounding."
    p "要说啊，我更惊讶你的转变，听你说话都感觉精神焕发了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5843
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_330af960_1:

    # p "Maybe the earlier problems are already forgotten?"
    p "难道之前那些烦心事都忘了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5847
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_66518a11_1:

    # "He crosses his arms demonstratively and leans back in his chair, laying one leg over the other."
    "他故意交叉双臂，往椅子里一靠，一条腿还搭在另一条腿上，真够臭屁的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5849
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_7aac4145_1:

    # n "I am not doing too badly, am I? I mean, it would be nicer if this place did not reek as it does."
    n "我做得还行吧？我是说，要是这鬼地方没有这么臭，那就更好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5853
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_bb102d6b_1:

    # p "In the cabin's defence, we haven't exactly helped the issue."
    p "说句公道话，这屋子变成这样，咱俩也有责任。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5857
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_e8bd926d_1:

    # n "Not quite, not quite!"
    n "差远了，差远了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5859
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_f6b66520_1:

    # "His head tips back as he laughs."
    "他笑着，头往后仰。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5863
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_4ed2b1f9_1:

    # n "A little sweat mixing with the fanciful odor of ripe mold."
    n "一丝汗味混杂着一股熟透了的霉味儿，那叫一个销魂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5865
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d0f37f15_1:

    # n "But I would also be happy if the door would be able to close properly."
    n "不过，要是这门能好好关上，我就谢天谢地了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5868
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5321f668_1:

    # n "Or if the door would be able to close properly."
    n "或者说，如果这门它能好好关上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5870
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_25ec8bac_1:

    # n "Or if the bed did not hurt my neck when I sleep in it."
    n "再或者，如果我睡在这床上，脖子不会疼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5872
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_eeb94c55_1:

    # n "But if you look past those things, then yes, maybe I am not doing so badly after all."
    n "要是你能忍受这些，那好吧，也许我确实还不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5881
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_8c897d3c:

    # n "I am sorry?"
    n "我很抱歉？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5883
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_95750b51:

    # p "I think you heard me well enough with those ears."
    p "我看你耳朵挺灵的，肯定听得一清二楚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5885
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_be5ca6f4:

    # "You draw your lips into a grin."
    "你咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5887
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_2f341b07:

    # p "I'll try my hand at the plants, and for my efforts I'll get some more time to appreciate you in all your..."
    p "我来摆弄摆弄这些花花草草，作为回报，我就能有更多时间好好欣赏你那..."

# game/script day2.rpy:5889
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5cbe9750:

    # "A few moments pass as you search for something that will fit and sound as sexy as you want it to sound."
    "你绞尽脑汁，想找个既贴切又够味儿的词儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5891
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_da11f129:

    # p "...flowering...glory?"
    p "...怒放的...风华？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5895
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_7af7ce3e:

    # n "My flowering glory?"
    n "我的怒放的风华？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5897
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5c3fe79a:

    # n "That is what you came up with?"
    n "你就憋出这么一句？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5899
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_8dba9ccd:

    # "You rub the back of your head."
    "你揉了揉后脑勺。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5901
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_2bc3b7ce:

    # p "See, it's very difficult to think of something on the spot!"
    p "哎，这种时候现想词儿，太难为人了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5903
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_79f80843:

    # p "I'll get some more time to appreciate you ...erm... dropping your leaves?"
    p "要不，我多花点时间欣赏你...呃...落英缤纷？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5908
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5a33cdd1:

    # "Nomax sits down on the chair and looks for one of his books."
    "Nomax 一屁股坐在椅子上，开始翻箱倒柜找他的书。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5910
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_7dc42c5f:

    # n "Got there in the end, did we not?"
    n "怎么样，这不还是让我想出来了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5915
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_eeb732e5:

    # "He finds the small booklet he was searching for and, armed with the quill, makes a quick note. You assume of just what you two agreed on."
    "他找到了那本小册子，拿起羽毛笔刷刷几笔，飞快地记着什么。估计是把咱俩说好的事儿给记下来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5917
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d06f018a:

    # p "It's very clever, actually, because of how artists use leaves in their paintings and sculptures to cover certain things."
    p "其实这主意挺妙的，毕竟艺术家们不就喜欢用树叶在画里遮遮掩掩的嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5921
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d128b29f:

    # n "No, no, I get it, do not worry. Your wordplay is not going unappreciated."
    n "明白明白，您放心。您这文字游戏，我肯定捧场。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5923
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5e03f934:

    # n "It just does not have quite the same impact after you stumbled the first time."
    n "就是头一次就磕巴了，后面再来就总觉得差了点儿意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5925
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_3a67c649:

    # p "You know, I am rather surprised that you're as chipper as you are today, given how you started this journey."
    p "说真的，想想你这一路是怎么过来的，今天还能这么乐呵，我都有点儿刮目相看了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5929
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_e8ad7bdb:

    # "He crosses his arms demonstratively and leans back in the chair, laying one leg over the other."
    "他也来了劲儿，夸张地抱起胳膊，往椅子背上一靠，翘起了二郎腿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5931
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_e61dbc28:

    # n "Not doing too bad, am I? I mean it would be nicer if this cabin would not reek as it does."
    n "我这表现还行吧？要不是这破屋子臭烘烘的，就更好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5933
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_bb102d6b_2:

    # p "In the cabin's defence, we haven't exactly helped the issue."
    p "说句公道话，这屋子变成这样，咱俩也有责任。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5937
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_e8bd926d_2:

    # n "Not quite, not quite!"
    n "差远了，差远了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5939
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_f6b66520_2:

    # "His head tips back as he laughs."
    "他笑着，头往后仰。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5943
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_4ed2b1f9_2:

    # n "A little sweat mixing with the fanciful odor of ripe mold."
    n "一丝汗味混杂着一股熟透了的霉味儿，那叫一个销魂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5945
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d0f37f15_2:

    # n "But I would also be happy if the door would be able to close properly."
    n "不过，要是这门能好好关上，我就谢天谢地了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5947
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d6d2ea6e:

    # n "Or if the bed didn't hurt my neck when I sleep in it."
    n "还有这张床，睡得我脖子都快断了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5949
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_eeb94c55_2:

    # n "But if you look past those things, then yes, maybe I am not doing so badly after all."
    n "要是你能忍受这些，那好吧，也许我确实还不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5955
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_89483a7f:

    # "A voice from outside the cabin startles you, followed by an urgent knock on the cabin wall."
    "突然，屋外传来一声叫喊，吓我一跳，紧接着就是一阵急促的敲门声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5958
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_ba3c4199:

    # "Initially it wasn't clear to you, but when the voice called out again you realized that it sounded exactly like Konrad."
    "一开始我还没听出来，后来那人又喊了一声，我才听出来，是 Konrad 的声音！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5961
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d8d45e07:

    # sail "Oi! You in there?!"
    sail "喂！里面有人吗？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5967
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5a74b18a:

    # "The canine's eyes widen and he quickly leans over to whisper to you."
    "这狗东西眼睛瞪得老大，赶紧凑过来跟我咬耳朵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5969
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_35bc0700:

    # n "Quick, keep him busy while I throw something on!"
    n "快，你先拖住他，我得赶紧套件衣服！"

# game/script day2.rpy:5973
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_8b98e2d7:

    # "Nodding quickly you respond to Konrad and lean against the door to keep it shut."
    "我赶紧点点头，应付着 Konrad，身子死死地抵着门，不让他进来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5975
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_a99094dc:

    # p "Konrad? Yes, sorry it's cramped in here and we have the chair at the door."
    p "Konrad？啊，不好意思，屋里头太挤了，我们把椅子堵在门后面了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5979
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_176e967b:

    # "Nodding quickly you respond to the sailor and lean against the door to keep it shut."
    "我赶紧点点头，应付着 Konrad，身子死死地抵着门，不让他进来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5981
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_91ede5a1:

    # p "Yes? Sorry it's cramped in here and we have the chair at the door."
    p "啊，不好意思，屋里头太挤了，我们把椅子堵在门后面了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5983
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_e1f3cf8d:

    # p "What do you need?"
    p "你有啥事儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:5987
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_0dcc4870:

    # "You manage to keep him busy for a while until Nomax manages to put on his clothes again. Not quite as neatly as usual, but it'll do to keep him decent."
    "总算把你支走了，Nomax 也手忙脚乱地穿上了衣服。虽然没平时那么利索，但好歹能遮住点儿丑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5990
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_e7d4eb72:

    # "Nomax looks at you with a confused expression, not sure what to make of it. He gets up from his chair and opens the door."
    "Nomax神色困惑地看着你，一时有些吃不准该如何回应。他从椅子上站起身，顺手拉开了舱门。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5997
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_56cb05ab:

    # "As expected, it reveals Konrad standing right in front of it, looking up at the painted dog."
    "不出所料，门外正站着Konrad，抬眼打量着眼前的非洲野犬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:5999
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_66e1a0e3:

    # "His eyes immediately shift away from Nomax and find you instead."
    "他的目光随即从Nomax身上移开，落在了你的脸上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6001
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_0aa0e77a:

    # n "What can I hel-"
    n "我能帮您..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6003
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_f39ea7e0:

    # k "Oi, there y'are! Knew I saw you go in here."
    k "哎哟，找到你了！我就说肯定看到你溜进来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6005
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d4903de7:

    # p "Konrad?"
    p "Konrad？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6007
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_14c3e5d9:

    # k "Ye, the one and only. Come with me, you're needed. Hop, hop!"
    k "没错，如假包换。跟我走一趟，有事需要你帮忙。快点！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6011
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_dbc50238:

    # p "What? But didn't you take over my shift?"
    p "啥？不是你顶了我的班吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6013
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_74e31540:

    # k "Look, lad, I need you to get a move on. NOW!"
    k "我说，小子，赶紧麻溜儿的！现在就走！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6016
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_a0ecdbfb:

    # p "What? What's wro-"
    p "怎么... 什..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6018
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_a04eb7cb:

    # k "Lad, I need you to get a move on. NOW!"
    k "我说，小子，赶紧麻溜儿的！现在就走！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6020
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_20dadc32:

    # n "What is going on, if I may ask?"
    n "请问，这是出什么事儿了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6022
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_f700063a:

    # "Konrad's voice makes it clear that he's not joking around and you jump to your feet."
    "Konrad的语气可不像是在开玩笑，你赶紧站了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6024
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_ee8a0283:

    # "He's already on his way and you follow with a last nod to Nomax."
    "他已经抬脚走了，你朝Nomax最后点了点头，赶紧跟了上去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6026
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d6475f3b:

    # p "It must be urgent. Excuse me, but I have to go, Nomax."
    p "肯定是有急事。不好意思啊，Nomax，我得先走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6028
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_7f4f52b0:

    # n "I{w}, sure. Yes, of course."
    n "我... 没事，你忙吧。当然了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6036
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_f3da756b:

    # "He leads you down the stairs further into the bowels of the ship with a hurried step, and you stay glued along, clinging to the wooden beams to make sure you don't stumble on the way down."
    "他带着你匆匆忙忙地沿着楼梯往下走，往船舱深处去。你紧紧地跟在他身后，死死抓住木梁，生怕一脚踩空。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6038
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_22a63a8c:

    # p "Will you finally tell me what's going on?"
    p "你总该告诉我发生什么事了吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6042
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_0f9f20e8:

    # "As the door opens it reveals who the voice belongs to. An older, bearded Lynx who looks up Nomax."
    "门打开了，一个上了年纪，留着络腮胡的山猫探出头来，先是看了看Nomax。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6044
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_4346c76d:

    # "Then he spots you, his eyes darting back and forth between the two of you for a moment."
    "然后他注意到了你，目光在你俩之间来回转悠。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6046
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_16890981:

    # lynx "Who's Mr. [family_name]?"
    lynx "哪位是[family_name]先生？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6048
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_2633b081:

    # lynx "You're needed.{w} Urgently."
    lynx "需要你，十万火急。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6050
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_8604ad13:

    # "Nomax steps aside to open the view to you."
    "Nomax闪身让开，让你露出身形。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6052
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_0b07ced4:

    # p "That's me, yes. What is it? Who are you?"
    p "我就是，怎么了？ 你是哪位？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6054
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_97641b30:

    # lynx "Lad, I need you to get a move on. NOW! I'll tell you on the way."
    lynx "小子，我需要你赶紧动起来！现在就走！路上我再跟你细说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6056
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_20dadc32_1:

    # n "What is going on, if I may ask?"
    n "请问，这是出什么事儿了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6058
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_ae29ba54:

    # "His voice makes it clear that he's not joking around and you jump to your feet."
    "他的语气听上去可不像是在开玩笑，你立马站了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6060
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_6d061ab3:

    # "The lynx already sets into motion and you tag along with one last nod towards Nomax."
    "那只山猫已经开始行动了，你朝Nomax点了点头，赶紧跟了上去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6062
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_d6475f3b_1:

    # p "It must be urgent. Excuse me, but I have to go, Nomax."
    p "肯定是有急事。不好意思啊，Nomax，我得先走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6064
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_7f4f52b0_1:

    # n "I{w}, sure. Yes, of course."
    n "我... 没事，你忙吧。当然了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6074
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_db97bef5:

    # "He leads you down the stairs further into the bowels of the ship with a hurried step, and you stay glued to him, clinging to the wooden beams to make sure you don't stumble on the way down."
    "他带着你匆匆忙忙地沿着楼梯往下走，往船舱深处去。你紧紧地跟在他身后，死死抓住木梁，生怕一脚踩空。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6076
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_b9d041c9:

    # p "Are you going to tell me what's going on?"
    p "你就不能告诉我到底发生了什么事吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6078
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_5408f788:

    # k "Yes, the name's Konrad."
    k "没错，我叫Konrad。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6080
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_3ea3ab87:

    # k "It's Samuel.{w} He's been injured and we need someone to assist."
    k "是Samuel。他受伤了，我们需要人手帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6082
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_9f51185b:

    # "A cold shower runs down your spine when you hear what he says."
    "听到他说的，你感觉一股寒意如坠冰窟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6084
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_1027bf2e:

    # "Samuel?!{w} Injured?!"
    "Samuel？！{w} 他受伤了？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6086
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_53ae1c25:

    # p "Sam?! What happened?!"
    p "Sam？！ 到底怎么回事？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6088
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_c866b222:

    # k "Don't get the flutters. It's nothing life-threatening. Our surgeon's already taking care of him."
    k "别紧张，没啥大不了的。 咱们的医生已经去处理了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6090
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_8b5de62b:

    # k "That's not why it's a rush. Spanker's fucked up, and they need my ass up there to help sort it out."
    k "烦的是另外一件事儿。是后桅斜桁纵帆（Spanker）出了问题，他们非得我过去帮忙才行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6092
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_a3834e20:

    # p "Couldn't you have led with that? Goddamn...{w} At least he's alright, that's a relief."
    p "你就不能先说重点吗？ 真是的...{w}  谢天谢地，他没事就好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6094
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_35eecd61:

    # "The tension in your body eases when you hear that Sam is all right. Soon enough Konrad drops you off in front of a cabin door and pats on the shoulder to urge you forward."
    "听说Sam没事，你总算松了口气。 没过多久，Konrad就把你送到一个船舱门口，拍拍你的肩膀示意你进去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6096
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_70366444:

    # k "Sorry, lad. Just in here, I'll have to get up again, so treat 'im well, will ya?"
    k "不好意思啊，兄弟。 我还得再跑一趟，你好好照顾他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6098
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterchoice_247448dd:

    # "With similar urgency, he leaves you standing alone outside the door, his footsteps quickly fading into the distance as he makes his way up the stairs."
    "他撂下这句话，就急匆匆地走了，脚步声很快消失在楼梯上传来的嘈杂声中。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6115
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_c90d2156:

    # "You knock softly on the door, two short taps that are met with a momentary pause before a response rings out."
    "你轻轻地敲了两下门，过了一会儿，里面才传来回应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6117
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_91b79bf5:

    # r "Come in."
    r "请进。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6129
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_ef6b52b5:

    # "As you open the door, you step into the cabin and find Samuel seated near the back wall. He leans against a table, his face showing signs of discomfort, but there's also a hint of relief in his expression as he sees you."
    "你推门走进船舱，看到Samuel靠坐在里面的墙边。 他倚着桌子，脸上有些难受，但看到你的时候，还是露出了一丝欣慰。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6135
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_767e5f2a:

    # r "Ah, you're back. I hope things went well out there?"
    r "呦，你回来啦。 外面一切都还顺利吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6137
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_72d86380:

    # "You nod in response, still feeling uneasy after talking with Arthur. Rajeeyah, perceptive as ever, seems to pick up on your emotions."
    "你点点头，和Arthur聊过之后，心里还是有点没底。 Rajeeyah还是一如既往地敏锐，似乎察觉到了你的情绪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6141
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_ec3b7a20:

    # r "Is everything alright? You seem a bit tense."
    r "没事吧？ 你看起来有点紧张啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6143
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_c70f4e75:

    # "The concern is evident in her voice."
    "她的声音里充满了关切。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6145
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_205ae5e4:

    # p "It's nothing, just... still getting used to everything."
    p "没事，就是...还在慢慢适应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6147
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_13bc0733:

    # "You reply, trying to downplay your worries."
    "你含糊其辞地回答，想尽量掩饰自己的担忧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6151
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_1915f6bc:

    # "Rajeeyah gives you a reassuring nod."
    "Rajeeyah放心地点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6153
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_36e294bb:

    # r "If you say so."
    r "随你便吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6155
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_90eaf892:

    # r "It's natural to feel overwhelmed at first. But don't worry, you'll settle in soon enough. Now, if you don't mind, could you fetch that bottle from the shelf over there?"
    r "刚开始不适应是正常的。 别担心，很快就好了。 没事的话，能帮我把那边架子上的瓶子拿过来吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6161
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_daa78d8b:

    # "Samuel manages a faint grin."
    "Samuel勉强笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6165
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_515cdb78:

    # s "Hey, thanks for coming. Guess who's gonna have a new scar."
    s "嘿，谢谢你来看我。 猜猜谁又要多一道新疤啦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6167
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_4895b52a:

    # "You chuckle softly, glad to see Samuel being taken care of. Rajeeyah looks up from her work and smiles warmly as you enter."
    "你轻轻笑了笑，看到Samuel被照顾得很好，你也觉得安心多了。 你进来的时候，Rajeeyah抬起头，对你露出了温暖的笑容。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6169
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bde0fdd7:

    # r "We're just finishing up here. Despite how he acted, Samuel's not actually losing his leg. He'll be fine with a few days of rest."
    r "我们快弄完了。 虽然他说的轻松，但Samuel的腿没事，休息几天就好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6171
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_503c550f:

    # p "How is he doing?"
    p "他现在怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6175
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_53f901f0:

    # "Rajeeyah finishes wrapping the freshly stitched wound with a bandage."
    "Rajeeyah用绷带包扎好新缝合的伤口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6177
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_ae08f96d:

    # r "He's tough-"
    r "他很坚强——"

# game/script day2.rpy:6179
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_9bc992ef:

    # s "Thanks mum, but I can speak. It's fine, just a scratc-"
    s "谢谢老妈，我能自己说。 没事，就蹭破点皮——"

# game/script day2.rpy:6181
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_e0a63328:

    # r "But you're {i}you{/i}, Samuel, and you'd call losing both your legs just a scratch."
    r "你啊，{i}你{/i}就是这样，Samuel，就算断了两条腿，你也会说只是蹭破了点皮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6183
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_57977689:

    # "Rajeeyah turns back to reply to you."
    "Rajeeyah转过身来，对你说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6187
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_2c2fc060:

    # r "He's tough. Not THAT tough..."
    r "他很硬气，但也没那么硬..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6189
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_53ec9221:

    # "She emphasizes it and turns to Samuel for a brief tease before she continues on."
    "她强调了一下，转向Samuel，略带戏谑，然后继续说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6193
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_7bb9ddb2:

    # r "But it'll take some time for him to fully recover, however he'll be up and about before long, I'm sure."
    r "不过他得好好养一阵子才能完全恢复，但我保证，他很快就能活蹦乱跳的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6195
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_ee6f92f4:

    # p "Is there anything I can do to help?"
    p "我能做点什么来帮忙吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6197
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_13fbc9c8:

    # "You ask, eager to be of assistance."
    "你急切地问道，很想帮上忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6199
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_91071496:

    # "Rajeeyah glances at a nearby shelf and then back at you. "
    "Rajeeyah瞥了一眼附近的架子，又看向你。 "

# game/script day2.rpy:6201
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_4190e826:

    # r "Actually, yes. Can you fetch that bottle from the shelf over there? It will help with the pain."
    r "说起来，还真有。你能把那边架子上的那个瓶子拿来吗？能缓解疼痛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6211
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_79ce832a:

    # "Curious, you retrieve the bottle as instructed and bring it to Rajeeyah. She takes it from you with a grateful smile."
    "你好奇地按她说的取来了瓶子，递给Rajeeyah。她带着感激的微笑接过瓶子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6213
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_2e3b15bb:

    # r "Thank you. This should do the trick."
    r "谢谢你，这下应该管用了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6218
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_50e9c474:

    # "Rajeeyah simply takes the bottle and hands it to Samuel."
    "Rajeeyah接过瓶子，直接递给了Samuel。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6222
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_a910c1d1:

    # "Samuel turns the unmarked bottle in his paws before uncorking it, and to his pleasant surprise, the aroma of rum fills the air. A faint chuckle escapes him."
    "Samuel用爪子转动着这个没有标签的瓶子，拔开瓶塞，一股朗姆酒的香气扑面而来，让他喜出望外，忍不住轻笑一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6226
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_2659295c:

    # s "Well, that's a welcome surprise. Always the best part about being sick, Rajeeyah."
    s "哇哦，真是个惊喜。果然还是生病的时候最棒，Rajeeyah。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6228
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_7c2757de:

    # s "You really know how to treat a weary sailor well."
    s "你可真懂得怎么伺候咱这疲惫的水手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6232
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_00c44141:

    # "The maned wolf tips the bottle back for a long sip, almost immediately looking much better than he'd been a minute ago."
    "这匹鬃狼仰头猛灌了一口，几乎立刻就比刚才精神多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6234
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_b3250148:

    # r "You know Sam..."
    r "你了解Sam的..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6236
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_bc93f5f5:

    # r "These stories about rowdy sailors, who live for nothing but grog and chasing women?"
    r "那些关于成天嚷嚷，除了酒和女人啥也不要的粗俗水手的故事..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6238
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_7ade592b:

    # "Samuel lifts the bottle away from his lips and tips his head to the side."
    "Samuel放下瓶子，歪着头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6242
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_d4f3f7b3:

    # s "Whaddabout 'em?"
    s "咋了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6244
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_501aa1ff:

    # r "Somehow you manage to tick all those boxes and none of them at the same time."
    r "不知怎么的，你这家伙，好的坏的全占了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6246
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_7933a41a:

    # s "Well, I wouldn't chase ya, first of all.{w} You'll just leave me trailing a mile behind in a heartbeat. Darn cheetahs."
    s "哎，反正我是不会追你的。{w} 你这该死的猎豹，一眨眼就能把我甩到一英里开外。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6248
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_d7a1ca2b:

    # "She couldn't help but chuckle."
    "她忍不住咯咯地笑了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6254
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_a1aee91f:

    # s "And the rum? I have to play up my toughness for the greenhorn there, don' I?"
    s "还有朗姆酒？我不得在那愣头青面前装装样子，是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6256
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_cfea1bf4:

    # s "Else he'll run wild. Obey nobody."
    s "不然他还不翻了天，谁的话都不听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6258
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_f304a972:

    # "A moment of silence falls across the room before Samuel laughs and breaks it."
    "屋里安静了一会儿，Samuel的笑声打破了寂静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6262
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_e6ab8912:

    # s "Nah, he's good company, Raj. Today I really just like the rum."
    s "别瞎说，他人挺好的，Raj。我今天就是馋这口朗姆酒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6267
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_8f105c6a:

    # s "Fucking leg still hurts like crap and the sweet, sweet taste of Mother Rum is as if she's blowin' the pain away."
    s "奶奶的，腿还是疼得要命，这朗姆老娘的味道，简直是吹走了我所有的痛苦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6269
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_e91534ce:

    # r "You're welcome. Just make sure that Mother Rum won't be blowing you a massive hangover right alongside, will you?"
    r "不客气。你可悠着点喝，别让朗姆老娘在吹走痛苦的同时，也给你吹来个宿醉大礼包。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6272
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_a1aee91f_1:

    # s "And the rum? I have to play up my toughness for the greenhorn there, don' I?"
    s "还有朗姆酒？我不得在那愣头青面前装装样子，是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6276
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_183849ee:

    # r "Do you?"
    r "你会吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6278
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_d7ee8cbe:

    # s "Maybe a little bit. But he's been fine so far."
    s "也许会有一点吧。不过他现在还挺好的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6280
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_76b76c82:

    # p "Trying my best."
    p "我尽力了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6282
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_e5a5acd9:

    # s "Appreciate the rum either way though."
    s "不管怎么说，这朗姆酒我先干为敬了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6284
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_44001238:

    # r "You're welcome. Just don't overdo it, okay?"
    r "不客气。 悠着点喝，知道吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6288
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_dec0717c:

    # r "Perce downed half a bottle and looked like a wreck yesterday."
    r "Perce昨天喝了半瓶，看起来惨不忍睹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6294
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_a960038c:

    # r "He did sleep pretty firmly, though."
    r "不过，他的确睡得很死。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6296
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_b2957524:

    # s "The hangover couldn't have been that bad then. Are you sure he had one? And it wasn't just because, y'know, his hand's all fucked up, as is his head?"
    s "宿醉肯定没那么严重吧。你确定他是宿醉？还是因为，你知道的，他手和脑袋都伤着了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6298
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_ce12fb62:

    # "Samuel waves off the concerns with a brief flick of the wrist."
    "Samuel不以为然地挥了挥手，打消了这些担忧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6300
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_42892beb:

    # r "He did in fact mention it."
    r "他的确是这么说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6306
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_26bfc545:

    # "As Rajeeyah continues to chat with Samuel, you take a moment to observe the surroundings. The cabin is well-organized, with shelves of various ingredients and tools neatly arranged. It's clear that Rajeeyah is well-prepared for her work."
    "Rajeeyah继续和Samuel聊着，你抽空观察了一下四周。小屋收拾得井井有条，架子上整齐地摆放着各种原料和工具。很明显，Rajeeyah为工作做足了准备。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6308
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_c7e23bf5:

    # r "You should be returning to your duties, no? New as you are, you won't be getting much leeway during Arthur's shift."
    r "你该回去当值了吧？你新来的，Arthur当班的时候可没多少空闲给你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6310
translate Chinese day2_samuel_recovery_bottle_b4ac3546:

    # "The cheetah's words jolt you from your thoughts. You immediately frown, despite knowing that Rajeeyah is correct."
    "猎豹的话把你从思绪中拉回现实。你立刻皱起了眉头，尽管Rajeeyah说得没错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6325
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_5355bc4d:

    # "Rajeeyah purses her lips in thought before simply shrugging."
    "Rajeeyah沉思着抿了抿嘴唇，然后耸了耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6329
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_e3200996:

    # r "That's fine. Just know it's your choice if you're questioned about it. You can always tell them you were helping out though, I'll do you a small favor this one time."
    r "没事。要是有人问起来，你自己担着。不过你也可以说是在帮忙，这次我可以破例帮你一把。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6331
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_65368713:

    # "The cheetah's smile is warm and inviting. Almost motherly."
    "猎豹的笑容温暖又亲切，几乎像个母亲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6333
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_a3ff4c38:

    # r "Just a few minutes though. He's fine now, but he does need his rest."
    r "就几分钟。他现在没事了，不过确实需要休息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6335
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_531cf443:

    # s "I'll get plenty soon enough."
    s "我很快就能好好休息了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6337
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_e66c041e:

    # "Samuel chimes in, punctuating his words with another swig of rum."
    "Samuel插嘴道，又灌了一口朗姆酒，以此来强调他的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6341
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_0307211d:

    # r "Didn't I just say something about that, Sam?"
    r "我刚才是不是才说过这事儿，Sam？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6345
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_bb331b9b:

    # s "Oh, come on. Ya just said how well Perce was sleeping. I'm just going after my idols."
    s "哎，别这样嘛。你刚说Perce睡得有多香。我这叫致敬我的偶像。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6347
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_8fd4e14c:

    # r "Perce? Your Idol? Last I heard you two don't even get along well."
    r "Perce？你的偶像？我记得你们俩关系不怎么样啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6351
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_5f8c176d:

    # s "Well, I just made up with him. Maybe you should bring me another bottle, who knows which other broken friendships will get mended?"
    s "嗨，我刚跟他和好。要不你再给我来一瓶？说不定还能修复其他破裂的友谊呢！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6353
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_1016c3fc:

    # r "I have to account for those, you know?"
    r "我得记账的，你懂吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6355
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_014ed8e8:

    # "The cheetah points at the bottle in Samuel's paw."
    "猎豹指了指Samuel爪子里的酒瓶。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6359
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_786399cf:

    # r "I don't think the Captain's going to appreciate me getting half his crew black-out drunk."
    r "船长可不会喜欢我把他一半的船员灌到不省人事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6361
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_ac57a691:

    # "Rajeeyah rolls her eyes but says nothing else, giving you space to chat for now."
    "Rajeeyah翻了个白眼，没再说什么，让你有空间可以聊会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6365
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_22019631:

    # p "I think one bottle will be enough, Sam."
    p "一瓶就够了，Sam。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6367
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_b77b3599:

    # p "Though if the boredom gets too bad, I can always help you hobble up deckside. Just let me know."
    p "要是实在无聊，我随时可以扶你一瘸一拐地去甲板上。 跟我说一声就行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6371
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_ff4b9b4b:

    # s "A little rest will do me good I suppose. Been meaning to find time for a break. Woulda been better if it didn't include harming my pristine fur."
    s "我想好好休息一下也好。一直想找时间歇歇。要不是伤了我这身光鲜亮丽的毛，那就更好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6373
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_b9e37842:

    # "You feel warmth in your snout as the maned wolf winks at you over his bottle of rum."
    "你感到鼻头一热，鬃狼隔着朗姆酒瓶朝你眨了眨眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6377
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_0e02f0e4:

    # s "But, ya should get goin'. She's right, y'know. Don't want to slack off too much. Making a good impression now will pay off in the long run, I promise."
    s "不过，你还是赶紧去忙吧。她说的对，别太偷懒。现在好好表现，以后好处少不了你的，我跟你保证。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6379
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_fec82943:

    # "You know he's right, but that doesn't mean you want to leave. Still, with only a bit of hesitation, you nod your head and move to the door."
    "你知道他说得对，但你还是不想离开。不过，你略作犹豫，还是点了点头，走向门口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6381
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_77cd7c2c:

    # p "I'll come check on you later. And thanks for taking care of him, Rajeeyah."
    p "我待会儿会来看你的。Rajeeyah，谢谢你照顾他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6385
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_42e63a65:

    # "The maned wolf raises his bottle in a toast to your departure, causing the cheetah to shake her head with a laugh."
    "鬃狼举起酒瓶，朝你的背影示意，惹得猎豹笑着摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6387
translate Chinese day2_samuel_stay_fe4bf870:

    # r "Of course. It is my job, after all. Take care and if you need help with a tour later, I might have some time to show you around."
    r "当然。毕竟这是我的工作。保重，之后如果你们需要向导，我可能抽得出空带你们逛逛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6395
translate Chinese day2_duty_calls_40cf2bea:

    # "Despite wanting to stay to help and make sure Samuel's okay, you know it's not the right call. Turning to head for the door, you pause long enough to peek over your shoulder at the cheetah and maned wolf."
    "虽然你想留下来帮忙，确保Samuel没事，但你知道那样不合适。你转身走向门口，还是忍不住回头瞥了一眼猎豹和鬃狼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6397
translate Chinese day2_duty_calls_8fbf2ce9:

    # p "Make sure he gets as much rest as he needs, alright?"
    p "记得让他好好休息，知道吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6401
translate Chinese day2_duty_calls_6a4372d1:

    # "The cheetah nods and smiles politely."
    "猎豹点点头，礼貌地笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6403
translate Chinese day2_duty_calls_88eadd43:

    # r "Of course. I know how to handle this one. He'll be forced to rest more than he thinks he needs."
    r "放心吧。我懂怎么对付他。我会让他休息得比他自己认为的还要多。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6405
translate Chinese day2_duty_calls_c277d473:

    # "Samuel simply raises his bottle in a toast to no one."
    "Samuel只是举起酒瓶，对着空气敬了一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6409
translate Chinese day2_duty_calls_2db0457b:

    # s "As long as ya bring me more of these, I'll stay on my butt for as long as you want me to."
    s "只要你们再给我来点这好东西，要我老老实实待多久都行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6411
translate Chinese day2_duty_calls_cf9ce4a0:

    # "You shake your head and laugh as you leave Rajeeyah's room, closing the door behind you as you head for the stairwell up to the deck."
    "你摇了摇头，笑着离开了Rajeeyah的房间，关上门，朝通往甲板的楼梯走去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6424
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_17ee7ec3:

    # "Leaving Rajeeyah's quarters, you ascend the narrow stairs back to the bustling deck."
    "你离开Rajeeyah的房间，沿着狭窄的楼梯回到喧闹的甲板上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6430
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_fc9f585a:

    # "The salty breeze hits your face, immediately helping to ease the lingering tension that had been building up inside. As your eyes adjust to the sunlight, you spot Wolf and Julian a short distance away."
    "咸湿的海风扑面而来，瞬间缓解了你内心积攒的紧张。你的眼睛适应了阳光，发现Wolf和Julian就在不远处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6432
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_6e2e91ec:

    # "Wolf is leaning against the ship's railing, his arms crossed and his gaze fixed on the horizon. Julian stands nearby, fidgeting with a piece of rope."
    "Wolf靠在船舷上，双手抱胸，目光凝视着地平线。Julian站在一旁，不安地摆弄着手里的绳子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6434
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_2cdd53a7:

    # "As you approach, Julian notices you first and gives you an enthusiastic wave."
    "你走过去的时候，Julian先发现了你，热情地向你挥了挥手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6436
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_c68ed384:

    # j "Hey, how'd it go down there? Is Samuel gonna be alright?"
    j "嘿，下面怎么样了？Samuel没事吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6438
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_75173a0f:

    # "Wolf shifts his gaze toward you, his expression guarded."
    "Wolf转过头看着你，神情有些戒备。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6440
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_9374c6e3:

    # w "Yeah, what's the news?"
    w "对啊，情况咋样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6442
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_115aa354:

    # "You offer a nod, acknowledging their curiosity."
    "你点点头，示意自己明白他们的好奇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6444
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_a1b6726c:

    # p "You know about it already?"
    p "你们已经知道了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6446
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_feb4638c:

    # j "News travels fast on a tightly packed ship. And even as the new guys it's difficult not to hear it if something's off."
    j "消息在这种拥挤的船上传得飞快。就算咱们是新来的，要是有啥不对劲，也很难听不见风声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6448
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_0f409399:

    # p "Well, so far, so good. Sam's not in danger as far as I can tell at least."
    p "嗯，目前看来一切都好。至少据我所知，Sam没有生命危险。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6450
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_51adbb31:

    # p "It could have been much worse and Rajeeyah is taking good care of him."
    p "情况本来可能会更糟，而且Rajeeyah正在悉心照料他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6454
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_5b5ac7e4:

    # "They both stare at you questioningly, before Wolf nods his head; already piecing together the information."
    "他们疑惑地看着你，然后Wolf点了点头，似乎已经明白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6456
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_e1adc27e:

    # "Julian, on the other hand, seems to have trouble, furrowing his brows before finally speaking up."
    "另一方面，Julian好像有点懵，皱着眉头，半天才开口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6458
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_54bc036b:

    # j "Rajeewho? ...Oh wait. Probably someone patchin' him up, right?"
    j "Rajeewho？...哦，等等。是给他包扎的那个谁吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6462
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_bef5b764:

    # "You look at the lizard with a confounded look across your features."
    "你一脸迷惑地看着这只蜥蜴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6464
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_c76c3c08:

    # p "You've already forgotten?"
    p "你这就忘了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6466
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_602fb465:

    # p "Yesterday. Dinner."
    p "昨天，晚餐的时候啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6470
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_4adfbddc:

    # "You reach up with your hand and give Julian a playful smack on his forehead, which causes him to take a step back in recoil."
    "你抬手轻轻拍了一下Julian的额头，他吓得往后退了一步。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6472
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_14ebc491:

    # p "Cheetah, tall, ship's surgeon, having me in tow? Getti-"
    p "猎豹，那个高个子船医，拉着我干嘛？搞..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6476
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_ea37ef28:

    # j "Hey! Yes, yes, I remember. No need for physical violence."
    j "哎！记得记得，别动手啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6480
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_0e451a7a:

    # "You can only shake your head and laugh."
    "你无奈地笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6482
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_28692a47:

    # p "Yes. She's the ship's doctor. Real good at it too."
    p "对，她是船上的医生，医术是真的高明。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6486
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_6e59069e:

    # j "That's good to hear."
    j "那就好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6490
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_c4d3a535:

    # "Ready to get your mind off the morning's events, you're quick to change the subject. You move up close to Wolf, giving him a pat on the shoulder."
    "你急着把早上的事儿抛到脑后，赶紧岔开话题。你走过去拍了拍Wolf的肩膀。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6492
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_f32b1468:

    # p "So, how was deck scrubbing duty? Julian here seems to have survived."
    p "怎么样，擦甲板的活儿还顺利吗？Julian看起来还活着呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6496
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_6d150b42:

    # "Wolf's lips twitch into something resembling a smirk."
    "Wolf嘴角抽动了一下，露出了一丝像是嘲讽的笑容。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6498
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_5f8400a8:

    # w "Barely. He got close to me throwing him overboard once or twice."
    w "勉强活着。他差点没忍住把我扔海里一两次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6502
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_c75db608:

    # w "But survived is the right word for it. He was practically dead as soon as you left. We still got plenty more wood to polish at a later time."
    w "可不是，他你一走就差点断气了。以后还有他擦木头的时候。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6506
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_d8f38db4:

    # j "I'm sure you know aaaaall about polishin' wood, eh?"
    j "哎呦，说起“擦木头”，你肯定门儿清，是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6508
translate Chinese day2_on_your_way_back_03250874:

    # "That, of course, was a phrase Julian couldn't just let slide by."
    "这话Julian当然不能忍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6523
translate Chinese day2_wolf_flirt_6884d78d:

    # "You remark, a playful glint in your eyes as you turn your attention to Wolf."
    "你转过头，眼里闪着坏笑，看向Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6528
translate Chinese day2_wolf_flirt_11eec319:

    # w "Oh, do I now? You've got quite the imagination."
    w "呦，是吗？你可真能想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6530
translate Chinese day2_wolf_flirt_469caad0:

    # p "It's what my dad always said about me."
    p "我爸一直都这么说我的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6532
translate Chinese day2_wolf_flirt_0ce1b702:

    # p "A very imaginative boy."
    p "说我是个想象力丰富的孩子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6536
translate Chinese day2_wolf_flirt_d04ab49a:

    # w "Well, you sure can leave me out of your wild imaginations."
    w "得了吧，别把我扯进你那些乱七八糟的幻想里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6540
translate Chinese day2_wolf_flirt_532e1152:

    # "Julian chuckles at your exchange, clearly entertained by the back-and-forth."
    "Julian被你们逗得直乐。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6542
translate Chinese day2_wolf_flirt_2edae38c:

    # j "Looks like we've got some quality entertainment on this ship."
    j "看来咱们船上不缺乐子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6548
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_b41f0375:

    # "As Julian's teasing words hang in the air, you decide to turn it on Julian instead."
    "听着Julian的玩笑话，你决定反过来调侃他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6550
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_1938cd6f:

    # p "How about you worry less about his polishing and more about your own, Julian."
    p "你还是少操心他的事儿，多担心担心你自己吧，Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6554
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_051e377d:

    # "Wolf's guarded expression cracks slightly, and a ghost of a grin appears on his face."
    "Wolf脸上那副谨慎的表情终于有了一丝松动，嘴角也闪过一丝不易察觉的笑容。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6556
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_101eda46:

    # j "Oh I will have you know that my polishing technique is known far and wid-"
    j "跟你说，我的抛光技术可是远近闻..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6560
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_39327c78:

    # j "Wait."
    j "等等。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6562
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_0508a589:

    # j "Forget what I said, I didn't think that one through."
    j "忘了我刚才说的话，我没过脑子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6567
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_b25af01a:

    # "You laugh, and even Wolf couldn't quite manage to keep a chuckle down, his crossed arms bobbing along."
    "你乐出了声，Wolf也终于没忍住笑了出来，交叉着的胳膊也跟着一抖一抖的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6569
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_e9198ec2:

    # p "I have no doubt that you're quite well known for it, Julian."
    p "我当然相信你在这方面肯定很出名，Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6571
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_aead8bb8:

    # p "The polishing, I mean."
    p "我说的是抛光技术。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6573
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_14199d71:

    # p "Of the deck."
    p "甲板的抛光技术。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6575
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_57b88c75:

    # w "Of course. The deck."
    w "当然，甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6579
translate Chinese day2_julian_work_26e3ab71:

    # j "Damn right it is!"
    j "可不是嘛！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6590
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_57580fe4:

    # "The faint grin on Wolf's face vanishes as quickly as it appeared. With a snort, he reaches out and gives Julian a light slap on the back of the head."
    "Wolf脸上浅浅的笑容瞬间消失。他哼了一声，伸手 হালকা打了一下 Julian 的后脑勺。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6592
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_d2de98a4:

    # w "Less talk and more work."
    w "少废话，干活！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6596
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_87357aaf:

    # j "Did I put a target on my back today, or why are you all hitting me?!"
    j "我今天是不是出门没看黄历，怎么都打我？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6598
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_88d74e30:

    # w "We still got more to do and the sooner we're done, the sooner I can ditch you for some peace and quiet."
    w "咱们还得干不少活呢，越早干完，我就能越早甩开你们，清静清静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6600
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_0405aaf9:

    # j "Maybe if you didn't keep smacking me, I wouldn't get dazed and could actually concentrate on working. Ever had that thought?"
    j "也许你们要是不老打我，我也不会晕头转向，就能好好干活了。就没这么想过？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6604
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_93f307a6:

    # p "The slaps are to get you back on track, Julian. We've just seen what's going to occupy your mind if we don't give it a good old-fashioned whack from time to time."
    p "拍你是为了让你回到正轨，Julian。要是不时不时敲打敲打你，你脑子里指不定在想什么呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6606
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_87b87901:

    # "The lizard grumbles, reaches for the holystone you had left behind earlier and lobs it at you in a smooth arc."
    "那蜥蜴嘟囔着，拿起你之前落下的圣石，朝着你那边抛了过去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6608
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_4d48a136:

    # "Your eyes widen as you scramble to catch it before it hits you, and you just about manage to do it. And all of it without breaking any fingers!"
    "你眼珠子都快瞪出来了，赶紧伸手去接，总算没让它砸到，而且手指头一根没断！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6612
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_28c1020a:

    # j "Well, if you're so eager to work, then get to it."
    j "行啊，既然你这么想干活，那就麻溜的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6614
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_f7786845:

    # j "Although our shift is almost over anyway and they're delaying the tack as well. They said they'd fix the spanker first."
    j "反正咱们也快下班了，而且他们也拖着不让转向。说是要先修好后桅帆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6616
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_47a6a4a7:

    # p "Understandable."
    p "understandable。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6620
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_ff36d48d:

    # "You settle down on the deck to pick up where you left off earlier."
    "你回到甲板上，安静下来继续干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6622
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_174a3797:

    # w "See? He gets how this works. Now will you get going, fish scales?"
    w "看到了吧？他知道该怎么做。你还不快去干活，鱼鳞怪？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6626
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_ef68a42e:

    # j "I'm not a fish! Their scales are entirely different from mine."
    j "我不是鱼！我的鳞片和鱼的完全不一样！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6629
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_6c03a57f:

    # p "I can confirm that. They're much nicer to the touch."
    p "我可以作证，鱼鳞摸起来舒服多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6633
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_37ad3664:

    # "Wolf just looks at you blankly for a few seconds before he starts working again."
    "Wolf 茫然地看了你几秒钟，然后又回去干活了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6638
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_b493dd7d:

    # w "I don't even want to know how you got to know that..."
    w "我甚至都不想知道你是怎么知道的……"

# game/script day2.rpy:6644
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_e4e0d5a8:

    # j "What? Do you mean, you don't want to come and be part of our sex parties?"
    j "怎么？你是说，你不想来参加我们的性爱派对吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6646
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_ad3b10b0:

    # p "Jul- WHAT?" with vpunch
    p "" with vpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:6648
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_b621f4d9:

    # p "WE DID NOT!"
    p "我们才没有！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6652
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_45ca0e4f:

    # "Wolf looks at the two of you, the blank expression now fading to one of at least some degree of disbelief."
    "Wolf 看着你们两个，茫然的表情总算是有了一丝不相信。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6654
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_9e86d55a:

    # w "I..."
    w "我……"

# game/script day2.rpy:6656
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_6f437b58:

    # w "Didn't I {i}just{/i} say that I do not care to know how yo-"
    w "我{i} 刚 {/i}才是不是说过我不想知道你们是怎么……"

# game/script day2.rpy:6658
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_0631e20b:

    # p "WOLF! WE DIDN'T!"
    p "Wolf！我们没有！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6662
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_b95f7f0b:

    # "With a simple shake of his head, Wolf brings his focus back to the work on the deck."
    "Wolf 摇了摇头，把注意力转回到甲板上的活儿上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6664
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_fcd6ada6:

    # w "Not my business what you two get up to."
    w "你们两个要干什么，我管不着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6668
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_5d88054c:

    # "Julian just stands there with a grin on his face, clearly proud of himself to get you flustered. He leans down on your shoulder and whispers to you."
    "Julian 站在那儿，脸上带着得意的笑容，显然很得意能让你慌了神。他凑到你肩膀旁，小声说："

# game/script day2.rpy:6670
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_eb01d07d:

    # j "We could, though."
    j "其实，咱们也可以试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6672
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_72d13411:

    # "The flush of heat on your snout was instantaneous, and you don't react out of fear of drawing Wolf's attention."
    "你瞬间就觉得脸上发烫，但又怕引起 Wolf 的注意，所以不敢动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6676
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_dfb11ad1:

    # "You turn to Julian with an expression that asks him what the hell he is thinking. The lizard simply curls his lips into a gentle smile and adds a quiet:"
    "你转向 Julian，脸上写满了“你到底在搞什么鬼”的表情。那蜥蜴只是嘴角一弯，露出一个温柔的微笑，轻声说道："

# game/script day2.rpy:6678
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_5e7ccf6f:

    # j "You're pretty cute, I'm just saying."
    j "我只是觉得你挺可爱的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6683
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_a2a463b7:

    # "Before he steps past you, his hand slides gently from one shoulder to the other as he joins the two of you in swabbing the deck."
    "他与你擦肩而过，手掌轻柔地从你的一侧肩膀滑到另一侧，加入了你们擦洗甲板的行列。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6685
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_42a26db9:

    # "You let his words simmer in your mind, glancing across to him every now and then as you're left to your own thoughts with his offer."
    "你任由他的话在脑海中回荡，时不时地瞥他一眼，思绪随着他的话语蔓延开来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6687
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_538d552d:

    # "The thought of him crosses your mind...{w} Nude...{w} Just how soft some of his other parts must be."
    "关于他的念头一闪而过……{w} 裸体的样子……{w} 他其他的地方，得有多软啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6691
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_68437491:

    # j "We could invite Wolf, too."
    j "我们可以把 Wolf 也叫上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6693
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_14560bad:

    # "Julian says after he spots you deep in thought, louder this time."
    "看到你陷入沉思，Julian 提高了嗓门。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6697
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_97f1310f:

    # "The black wolf looks around in confusion, unsure of what he is being dragged into."
    "黑狼 Wolf 困惑地四处张望，不知道自己被卷进了什么事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6699
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_7dcf718e:

    # w "What?"
    w "啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6701
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_74ab911c:

    # p "WHAT?!"
    p "什么鬼？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6705
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_34130f54:

    # j "Oh, nothing.{w} Nothing..."
    j "哦，没事儿。{w} 没事……"

# game/script day2.rpy:6707
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_27665703:

    # "Julian chuckles, having an absolute blast teasing you, it seems. He gives his holystone a skilful toss in the air, with enough spin to send it turning around itself several times before catching it with ease."
    "Julian 咯咯地笑着，似乎乐此不疲地戏弄着你。他熟练地将磨石抛向空中，转了好几圈，然后轻松地接住。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6711
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_d7d35c84:

    # w "Well, if it's nothing, then get your {i}apparently{/i} well-used ass in motion to help us."
    w "行了，没事就让你那{i}好像{/i}很忙的屁股动起来，帮我们干活！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6715
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_cc006779:

    # j "Wolf! My well-used ass?"
    j "Wolf！我的屁股很忙？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6719
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_6c66a8a4:

    # j "Please, between me and him it should be clear who would be rai-"
    j "拜托，我和他之间，难道还不够明显吗，谁更该被..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6721
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_cee8d16f:

    # p "WE DID NO-{nw}"
    p "我们什么都没-{nw}"

# game/script day2.rpy:6725
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_857e4204:

    # w "Julian!"
    w "Julian！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6727
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_96681e5f:

    # "Wolf lays the palm of his hand over his face in an attempt to escape the situation."
    "Wolf 捂住了脸，想逃离这个尴尬的局面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6729
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_1879e943:

    # w "I {i}do not{/i} need the details."
    w "我{i}不想{/i}听细节！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6733
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_f7cb2b3a:

    # j "Then you better watch your tongue, old man. Fine, you may rest your old, weary bones and watch me demolish this deck!"
    j "老家伙，你最好注意你的措辞。行了，你就在那儿歇着吧，看着我把这甲板擦干净！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6735
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_6707d09e:

    # "Julian stretches, a few squats follow, with the Lizard showing off that he is capable of holding rather good form for them!"
    "Julian 伸了个懒腰，做了几个深蹲，那蜥蜴好像在炫耀他深蹲姿势有多标准！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6739
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_0c7b0430:

    # "Wolf wanted to sigh in annoyance, but he just couldn't hold in his chuckle, breaking his stern facade."
    "Wolf 本想恼火地叹气，但他还是忍不住笑出了声，打破了自己严肃的伪装。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6741
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_d21828c2:

    # w "How on earth did I deserve you two? Can anyone tell me? All I wanted was a quiet voyage. What I get is the one ship on which the king's jester has apparently decided to join the crew."
    w "我上辈子是造了什么孽，这辈子要碰上你们两个？谁能告诉我？我只想安安静静地航行一次。结果呢，我上的这条船，国王的小丑Julian 竟然也跑来当船员了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6746
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_6db0ce12:

    # p "It was just out of idle curiosity."
    p "我只是出于一时好奇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6748
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_668354c2:

    # w "I {i}just{/i} said I don't want to know."
    w "我{i}说了{/i}我不想知道！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6750
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_6f5058b4:

    # "Wolf waves you off."
    "Wolf 摆摆手，让你走开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6752
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_e4031628:

    # p "I'm just saying that it's nothing weird or anything...well...maybe a little bit, but it's Julian who was involved, so of course it would be."
    p "我只是想说这没什么奇怪的……好吧……也许有一点点吧，但这事儿 Julian 也掺和了，那肯定就跑不了他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6756
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_3da0e0d3:

    # j "Hey, why is it my fault again?"
    j "嘿，怎么又怪我了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6758
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_087b41eb:

    # p "Because it usually is. {w}You just can't behave."
    p "因为通常就是你的错。{w} 你就不能安分点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6762
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_e39717a5:

    # j "Just because you two old, cranky grandpas can't keep up with my youthful vigour."
    j "还不是因为你们两个老家伙跟不上我这年轻人的活力。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6764
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_40ca716d:

    # w "Well, use your youthful vigour and get your ass in motion to help us."
    w "好吧，那就用你的活力，让你那该死的屁股动起来，帮我们干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6768
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_0cb0e6f2:

    # j "Alright Gramps, you may rest your old bones. Let me handle this."
    j "行啦老寿星，您那把老骨头且歇着吧。这事儿包在我身上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6770
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_6707d09e_1:

    # "Julian stretches, a few squats follow, with the Lizard showing off that he is capable of holding rather good form for them!"
    "Julian 伸了个懒腰，做了几个深蹲，那蜥蜴好像在炫耀他深蹲姿势有多标准！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6774
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_a070839f:

    # "Wolf wanted to sigh in annoyance, but he just couldn't hold in chuckle, breaking his stern facade."
    "Wolf本来想翻个白眼，但还是没忍住，噗嗤一声笑了出来，绷不住他那严肃的假面了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6776
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_d21828c2_1:

    # w "How on earth did I deserve you two? Can anyone tell me? All I wanted was a quiet voyage. What I get is the one ship on which the king's jester has apparently decided to join the crew."
    w "我上辈子是造了什么孽，这辈子要碰上你们两个？谁能告诉我？我只想安安静静地航行一次。结果呢，我上的这条船，国王的小丑Julian 竟然也跑来当船员了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6782
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_961bfa67:

    # w "Are you sure about that? {w}We could test it, you know. Just one throw and we'll see how well you do in the water."
    w "你确定？{w}要不咱试试？就扔你下去一次，看看你在水里扑腾得怎么样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6784
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_e91e52d9:

    # "Wolf mimes a quick two-handed throw to accompany his words."
    "Wolf一边说着，一边比划了个双手扔东西的动作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6788
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_0f239e10:

    # "Julian just looks at him for a few moments in silence, the tip of his tail flicking through the air."
    "Julian沉默地盯着他看了几秒，尾巴尖儿在空中甩来甩去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6792
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_db800bba:

    # j "No, no. You know what? I'd rather stay here on board. It's just something I set myself as a goal at the start of the journey."
    j "不不不。你知道吗？我还是更想待在船上。这可是我这次出海给自己定的目标。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6794
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_9746d2ff:

    # w "Well, then get your ass in motion and work for your ambitions."
    w "行了，别磨蹭了，赶紧动起来，为了你的目标努力吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6796
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_7a279342:

    # j "All right Gramps, you may rest your old bones. Let me handle this."
    j "好了，老头子，歇着吧。这事儿我来搞定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6798
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_6707d09e_2:

    # "Julian stretches, a few squats follow, with the Lizard showing off that he is capable of holding rather good form for them!"
    "Julian 伸了个懒腰，做了几个深蹲，那蜥蜴好像在炫耀他深蹲姿势有多标准！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6802
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_a070839f_1:

    # "Wolf wanted to sigh in annoyance, but he just couldn't hold in chuckle, breaking his stern facade."
    "Wolf本来想翻个白眼，但还是没忍住，噗嗤一声笑了出来，绷不住他那严肃的假面了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6804
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_d21828c2_2:

    # w "How on earth did I deserve you two? Can anyone tell me? All I wanted was a quiet voyage. What I get is the one ship on which the king's jester has apparently decided to join the crew."
    w "我上辈子是造了什么孽，这辈子要碰上你们两个？谁能告诉我？我只想安安静静地航行一次。结果呢，我上的这条船，国王的小丑Julian 竟然也跑来当船员了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6814
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_21db46be:

    # "Before you even have the time to start, you hear the bell ring out to signal the end of the morning shift."
    "还没等你开始，就听见钟声响了，上午的活儿算是干完了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6818
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_da59cd0b:

    # "Julian's face becomes playfully pouty and he crosses his arms over his chest before bursting into a carefree laugh."
    "Julian撅起嘴，装出一副委屈巴巴的样子，然后“噗嗤”一声笑了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6820
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_d212c35b:

    # j "And I was just about to start!"
    j "我这正要开始呢！"

# game/script day2.rpy:6824
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_77ef2820:

    # j "Oh well, I won't be complaining about some time off."
    j "算了算了，能摸鱼我还不乐意？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6831
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8d009fa8:

    # "Before you can chime in on the lizard's charming lack of work ethic, Julian pipes up again."
    "还没等你吐槽这蜥蜴一点上进心都没有，Julian又嚷嚷起来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6835
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_728f9747:

    # j "Oh, I almost forgot."
    j "哎哟，我差点忘了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6837
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_49b08294:

    # "He glances to the side at Wolf and quickly corrects himself."
    "他瞟了眼旁边的Wolf，赶紧改口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6839
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_00a2b5e0:

    # j "We almost forgot. Speaking of getting beaten up.{w} Arthur came stompin' out here. Real grumpy and unpleasant. Thought he was gonna throw me overboard, I swear! Ended up tellin' us to let you know to report to him at the helm the moment we saw you."
    j "是我们差点忘了。说起挨揍，{w}Arthur气势汹汹地跑过来了，那脸色臭的，跟谁欠他钱似的。我发誓他当时真想把我扔海里！最后他让我们一看到你就立刻去船舵那儿找他报道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6841
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_87a04906:

    # "Wolf only nods in agreement."
    "Wolf只是点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6845
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_10bb2ab5:

    # w "Fun talk with the officer, huh? Someone's getting special treatment."
    w "跟长官谈话很愉快嘛，是不是？有人被特殊关照了哦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6849
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_fd2228c1:

    # p "Hopefully it won't be too special. It hasn't been the smoothest time with him for me so far..."
    p "希望别是什么“特殊”关照才好。我和他相处得一直不太顺..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6851
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8459a919:

    # p "But in any case, thanks for the heads up. Hm... I guess I better just get it out of the way now, shouldn't I?"
    p "哎，不管怎么说，谢了啊。嗯...看来我还是赶紧去解决了吧，你说呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6854
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_0fded0de:

    # p "Special treatment...right..."
    p "特殊关照...呵呵..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6856
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8b4b50f8:

    # p "He already took me aside and chewed my ear off when I was down there just now."
    p "我刚才在下面的时候，他已经把我叫过去臭骂一顿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6858
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_7087b6ff:

    # p "He really must have it out for me..."
    p "他肯定是跟我过不去了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6860
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_0bc5e120:

    # j "He doesn't appear like the most pleasant guy, no."
    j "他的确看起来不是什么好相处的人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6862
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_95fe90ea:

    # j "No idea how Sam manages to get along with him so well."
    j "真不知道Sam是怎么跟他处得那么好的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6864
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_2de2e921:

    # p "Hm...Well, I guess I better just get it out of the way now, shouldn't I?"
    p "嗯...好吧，看来我还是赶紧去解决了吧，你说呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6868
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_298be78d:

    # w "Or jump overboard."
    w "实在不行就跳海。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6870
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_a0fd05c4:

    # "Wolf's eyes soften and his lips twitch. His teasing almost appears like a threat."
    "Wolf眼神柔和下来，嘴角微微抽动。他的玩笑听起来倒像是一种威胁。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6874
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_36bc8085:

    # j "He's got a point. When was the last time you fully bathed? But no, don't wait. You get in trouble, we're gonna get in trouble and I'm not ready for that. That hard stare from him today was more than enough for me."
    j "他说得对。你上次好好洗个澡是什么时候了？得了，别拖了。你惹了麻烦，我们也跑不了，我可不想再经历一次他今天那种死亡凝视了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6878
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_9771d872:

    # "You roll your eyes and step away from the railing. With a casual wave over your shoulder, you leave the two of them behind and begin making your way along the length of the ship's deck towards the helm."
    "你翻了个白眼，从栏杆旁走开。你漫不经心地朝他们挥挥手，然后转身沿着甲板朝船舵的方向走去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6883
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_5ce20cd9:

    # "The rhythmic creaking of the ship's structure beneath you and the distant sound of waves crashing against the hull meld with the sounds of the various crew activities happening around you, a gentle reminder that ship life goes on regardless of your own personal story."
    "船身有节奏的嘎吱声，远处海浪拍打船体的声音，还有水手们忙碌的喧嚣，所有这些声音交织在一起，提醒着你：不管你有什么烦心事，船上的日子总要继续。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6885
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8c3710af:

    # "It's a comforting thought, one that helps ease the nervousness building in your belly as you approach the helm."
    "这个想法让人心里踏实，也帮你缓解了走向舵轮时心里越来越紧张的感觉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6889
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_887ed86c:

    # "Nearing your destination, you notice Arthur standing there, his gaze fixed out to sea. The wind tugs at his coat and hair, giving him a fitting air of authority and sternness. He looked all the part of the officer that he was."
    "快到地方的时候，你看到Arthur站在那里，目光凝视着远方。海风吹拂着他的外套和头发，更显出他的威严和冷峻。他浑身上下都透着一股军官的派头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6891
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_546b0da7:

    # a "Mr. [family_name]."
    a "[family_name]先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6893
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8e5de291:

    # "Arthur calls out, his deep voice carrying over the sounds of the ship."
    "Arthur喊道，他低沉的声音压过了船上的喧嚣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6895
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_aa235a12:

    # "You glance up and meet his gaze, feeling a slight nervousness that wells up within you. Making your way up the steps to the helm, you stand beside the towering figure of the horse."
    "你抬起头，与他对视，一丝紧张感也冒了出来。你走上舵轮，站在高大的雕像旁边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6897
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_10cca7e7:

    # p "Sir."
    p "先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6899
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_a9e8f047:

    # "You respond, giving a respectful nod."
    "你恭敬地点了点头，回答道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6903
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8a6c7586:

    # "Arthur's eyes shift from the horizon to you, his expression serious."
    "Arthur的目光从远处移到你身上，表情严肃。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6905
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_c4729057:

    # a "I trust Rajeeyah managed to finish patching Samuel up after I left?"
    a "我相信我走后，Rajeeyah已经把Samuel处理好了吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6907
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_b2c856c0:

    # p "Yes, sir."
    p "是的，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6909
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_b1834a80:

    # "You confirm, with a straightforward answer."
    "你用一个直截了当的回答确认道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6911
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_e11a6ea0:

    # "A flicker of emotion crosses Arthur's face, a hint of softness in his eyes."
    "一丝情绪掠过Arthur的脸庞，他的眼中闪过一丝温柔。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6915
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_d530e354:

    # a "Good. Samuel's a valuable member of this crew. It saddens me to see him hurt."
    a "很好。Samuel是船上不可或缺的一员，看到他受伤我很痛心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6917
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_7833fbae:

    # "You offer a sympathetic nod, acknowledging his sentiment."
    "你同情地点点头，表示理解。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6919
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_f2fcd513:

    # a "However..."
    a "但是......"

# game/script day2.rpy:6923
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8168040d:

    # "Arthur's voice turns sharper, and he turns to fully face you."
    "Arthur的声音变得尖锐起来，转过身，完全面向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6925
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_2c2d324a:

    # a "I can't help but wonder about the circumstances of his injury."
    a "我很想知道，他到底是怎么受的伤。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6927
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_42aae539:

    # "Confusion tugs at your features as Arthur's tone shifts."
    "Arthur语气一变，你也感到有些困惑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6929
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_d6ac3a8a:

    # p "I'm sorry, sir?"
    p "您说什么，长官？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6933
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_2d4b840d:

    # "The horse offers nothing but a sigh at your question. Instead of answering, Arthur makes a motion for you to follow him, leading the way down from the helm and toward the edge of the ship, providing a modicum of privacy for the conversation."
    "船首像只是叹了口气，并没有回答你的问题。Arthur示意你跟着他，然后带头从舵轮上下来，走到船边，找了个僻静的地方谈话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6935
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_9c140cd7:

    # a "This feels different."
    a "这感觉不一样了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6937
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_380160ee:

    # "He emphasizes, after a quick check to be sure no crew member was listening in."
    "他强调道，并且迅速扫视了一下四周，确保没人偷听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6939
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_a9226564:

    # p "I'm not sure I'm following entirely, sir."
    p "长官，我不太明白您的意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6941
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8ebcedfe:

    # a "I've been observing you, recruit. Your presence seems to coincide with trouble more often than not."
    a "新兵，我一直在观察你。你总是和麻烦脱不了干系。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6944
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_6e07de8e:

    # a "In fact, it has been difficult not to be confronted with your transgressions."
    a "事实上，你的过犯总是摆在眼前，想不注意都难。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6946
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_a08098b6:

    # a "And I'm starting to wonder..."
    a "我开始怀疑..."

# game/script day2.rpy:6950
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_bf11e342:

    # a "If there might be more to it."
    a "事情可能没那么简单。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6982
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8a6c7586_1:

    # "Arthur's eyes shift from the horizon to you, his expression serious."
    "Arthur的目光从远处移到你身上，表情严肃。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6984
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_a2d260c6:

    # a "I was told you were checking on Samuel. Was he doing well?"
    a "我听说你在查看Samuel的情况。他没事吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:6986
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_b2c856c0_1:

    # p "Yes, sir."
    p "是的，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6990
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_a108c20c:

    # "You confirm, wanting to give a straightforward answer."
    "你确认道，想要给出一个直截了当的回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6992
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_7a78c823:

    # "A flicker of emotion crosses Arthur's face, a hint of sadness in his eyes."
    "一丝情绪掠过Arthur的脸庞，他的眼中闪过一丝悲伤。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6996
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_d530e354_1:

    # a "Good. Samuel's a valuable member of this crew. It saddens me to see him hurt."
    a "很好。Samuel是船上不可或缺的一员，看到他受伤我很痛心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:6998
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_7833fbae_1:

    # "You offer a sympathetic nod, acknowledging his sentiment."
    "你同情地点点头，表示理解。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7000
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_046884db:

    # a "But..."
    a "但是..."

# game/script day2.rpy:7002
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8168040d_1:

    # "Arthur's voice turns sharper, and he turns to fully face you."
    "Arthur的声音变得尖锐起来，转过身，完全面向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7006
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_87a162f0:

    # a "I can't help but wonder about the circumstances of his injury. This... It feels different."
    a "我总觉得他受伤的原因有些蹊跷。这...感觉不太对劲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7008
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_42aae539_1:

    # "Confusion tugs at your features as Arthur's tone shifts."
    "Arthur语气一变，你也感到有些困惑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7010
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_258a4171:

    # p "Different, sir?"
    p "不对劲，长官？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7012
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_2d4b840d_1:

    # "The horse offers nothing but a sigh at your question. Instead of answering, Arthur makes a motion for you to follow him, leading the way down from the helm and toward the edge of the ship, providing a modicum of privacy for the conversation."
    "船首像只是叹了口气，并没有回答你的问题。Arthur示意你跟着他，然后带头从舵轮上下来，走到船边，找了个僻静的地方谈话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7014
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_8289aefe:

    # a "Different."
    a "是的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7016
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_380160ee_1:

    # "He emphasizes, after a quick check to be sure no crew member was listening in."
    "他强调道，并且迅速扫视了一下四周，确保没人偷听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7020
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_e2cdf8fd:

    # a "I'll be to the point, Mr. [family_name]. You were not present during the incident today, correct?"
    a "我直说了，[family_name]。今天事发时你不在现场，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7022
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_20be8da3:

    # "You shift uncomfortably at the question, glancing momentarily to the side before finding Arthur's gaze with your own."
    "你不安地动了动，目光闪躲了一下，然后才敢直视Arthur。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7024
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_561d8dbb:

    # p "Yes sir. I was attending to my own duties at the time and only heard about it later."
    p "是的长官。当时我正在处理自己的事务，事后才听说了这件事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7026
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_88f50489:

    # "The horse nods, his lips twitching faintly at the side, a hint of something unreadable crossing his otherwise stoic expression."
    "他点点头，嘴角不易察觉地抽动了一下，面无表情的脸上闪过一丝难以捉摸的神色。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7028
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_0eb59cec:

    # a "I see. It isn't every day that a seasoned veteran of my crew is injured so easily. I understand accidents, but I don't believe Samuel one to make such a simple mistake."
    a "我明白了。我手下的老兵轻易受伤，这很不寻常。我能理解意外，但我不认为Samuel会犯这种低级错误。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7030
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_bf2199d3:

    # "Arthur pauses long enough for his words to sink in."
    "Arthur停顿了片刻，似乎要让这些话给你留下深刻印象。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7032
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_49258928:

    # a "Humor me, would you? What exactly were you doing at the time of the incident?"
    a "请你如实相告，当时你到底在做什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7035
translate Chinese day2_julian_arthur_886c68a0:

    # a "{cps=5000}Humor me, would you? What exactly were you doing at the time of the incident?{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}请你如实相告，当时你到底在做什么？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:7053
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_0b4f7c0e:

    # p "Forgive me, sir, but why are you so interested in my whereabouts in relation to Samuel's injury?"
    p "请原谅我的冒昧，长官，您为何对我和Samuel受伤一事相关的行踪如此感兴趣？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7057
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_b99260a8:

    # "Arthur's gaze narrows at your bold question, and for a moment, the air feels tense. Then, unexpectedly, the faintest glimmer of admiration surfaces in his eyes."
    "Arthur的目光因为你大胆的问题而变得锐利起来，空气仿佛凝结了一般。但转瞬间，他的眼中又闪过一丝赞赏。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7061
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_b30df323:

    # a "Observant, aren't you?"
    a "观察力很敏锐嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7063
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_d5cfbb84:

    # "You hold his gaze, your determination evident."
    "你迎着他的目光，眼神坚定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7067
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_fa181493:

    # p "I've been nothing but honest about my intentions here, sir. I'm here to work hard and learn. I don't want to be caught up in any misunderstandings."
    p "我一直都很坦诚，长官。我来这里是为了努力工作和学习，不想卷入任何误会。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7069
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_94b737f9:

    # "The horse studies you for a few long moments before finally letting out a soft sigh. His stern demeanor softens, though his eyes stay on you."
    "他盯着你看了一会儿，这才微微叹了口气，神情缓和了下来，但目光依旧紧紧地锁定着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7071
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_087f0b9e:

    # a "You're new here, and I've seen my share of new recruits with secrets and ulterior motives. It's my duty to ensure the safety of this crew."
    a "你是新来的，我见多了带着秘密和小心思的新兵。我有责任确保船员安全。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7073
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_67bfe0d8:

    # "You quickly nod, acknowledging the officer's point."
    "你连忙点头，表示明白长官的意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7075
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_99b2b251:

    # p "I appreciate your point of view, sir, but I'm just a new crew member. All I want is to do my duties and learn to be better. If I can do anything to put your mind at ease about me, please let me know."
    p "我明白您的意思，长官，但我只是个新船员。我只想做好自己的工作，努力提升自己。如果我能做些什么让您对我放心，请尽管吩咐。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7079
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_1b1bdda9:

    # "Arthur studies you in silence, his head tilting ever so slightly in thought. It's a few long moments before he finally responds."
    "Arthur沉默地打量着你，微微歪着头，似乎在思考。过了好一会儿，他才开口说道："

# game/script day2.rpy:7081
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_c3ed124f:

    # a "I will keep that in mind, Mr. [family_name]. I'm impressed you were willing to stand up for yourself. Confidence like that is rare in new crew members."
    a "我会记住的，[family_name]。你很勇于为自己辩解，这让我印象深刻。像你这样有自信的新船员可不多见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7087
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_53b02a60:

    # a "However, as much as I admire your confidence, I still need to know what you were up to during the incident."
    a "不过，就算我很欣赏你的自信，我还是要知道事发时你到底在做什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7089
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_4fea9bc5:

    # p "Our passenger, Nomax, required my presence."
    p "我们的乘客Nomax需要我的照料。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7091
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_d21319e8:

    # "Arthur raises a brow, waiting patiently for you to continue your explanation."
    "Arthur扬起眉毛，耐心地等着你继续解释。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7093
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_9e46b767:

    # p "So I assisted him with his seasickness."
    p "我在帮他缓解晕船。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7095
translate Chinese day2_arthur_bold_144ad920:

    # a "Is that so? I shall have a word with him. Just for completeness' sake."
    a "是吗？我会找他核实一下，以确保事情的完整性。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7106
translate Chinese day2_arthur_scrub_22b6fe40:

    # "Arthur's expression doesn't seem to change. He's silent for a moment of thought, stern gaze locked directly with yours."
    "Arthur面无表情，沉默片刻，严厉的目光紧紧地盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7108
translate Chinese day2_arthur_scrub_44e9ea65:

    # a "Of course. I assume Wolf and Julian will vouch for you? It's rather difficult to trust the word of those that haven't proven themselves yet, wouldn't you agree?"
    a "当然。Wolf和Julian能为你担保吗？毕竟，难以信任来历不明的人，你说对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7111
translate Chinese day2_arthur_scrub_fc41870f:

    # a "{cps=5000}Of course. I assume Wolf and Julian will vouch for you? It's rather difficult to trust the word of those that haven't proven themselves yet, wouldn't you agree?{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}当然。我猜 Wolf 和 Julian 会替你说话吧？ 毕竟，信任一个还没证明过自己的人，总让人觉得为难，你说对吧？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:7121
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_them_99bb5e8c:

    # p "Julian and Wolf might be new, but they're giving their all. I am too. They were working hard and I believe they'd confirm my presence there."
    p "Julian 和 Wolf 也许是新来的，但他们都在尽力。我也是。他们工作很卖力，我相信他们会证明我当时也在场。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7123
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_them_8de83381:

    # "Arthur's brow furrows slightly, his suspicious demeanor intensifying momentarily."
    "Arthur 微微皱眉，神色间更多了几分怀疑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7125
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_them_c9d94937:

    # a "You have a lot of faith in them for someone who's only been here a day."
    a "你才来一天，就这么信任他们？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7127
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_them_d46302c8:

    # p "That's true, sir, but trust has to start somewhere."
    p "是的，长官，但信任总得从某处开始。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7129
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_them_6e228668:

    # "You couldn't help but put emphasis on those last words as you meet the officer's gaze without flinching."
    "你情不自禁地加重语气，直视着军官的眼睛，毫不退缩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7131
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_them_a6677d49:

    # p "Honestly, I would prefer to keep my head down and do my part. If there's a misunderstanding, I am more than happy to clear it up, sir. Have I done something wrong?"
    p "说实话，我只想安分守己，做好我的工作。如果有什么误会，我很乐意解释清楚，长官。 是我做错了什么吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7135
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_them_a2c77d64:

    # "The horse's gaze finally softens, eyes drifting away from your feline features and out toward the water."
    "他的眼神终于柔和了下来，不再盯着你那猫一样的五官，而是望向了远方水面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7137
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_them_ff4666e4:

    # a "You've done nothing yet, recruit. I keep a tight ship and I make sure every angle is covered when an incident occurs. I am just covering one of those angles now."
    a "你还没做什么，新兵。我对手下的船只管得很严，一旦出了事，每个细节都要查清楚。 我现在只是在按流程办事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7143
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_a188f43d:

    # "You only nod to the officer's question, suppressing the momentary frustration bubbling within you."
    "你点点头，算是回答了长官的问题，心里压着一股挥之不去的挫败感。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7145
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_3fb0f932:

    # "Arthur's eyes seem to bore into yours, his scrutiny unnerving."
    "Arthur 的眼神仿佛要看穿你，他的审视让你感到不安。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7147
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_b736ebf5:

    # a "It is a difficult situation for me. Relying on the words of those still untested."
    a "这让我很为难。 毕竟要仰仗几个未经考验的人的说辞。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7149
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_70aa6562:

    # "You resist the urge to fidget beneath his unrelenting gaze, doing your best to maintain composure."
    "你努力克制住想要在他那毫不放松的注视下动来动去的冲动，尽力保持冷静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7153
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_6a5a09f7:

    # p "I understand, sir. Though I'm sure others in the crew saw us working. Actions speak louder than words, right?"
    p "我明白，长官。 不过我相信船上其他人也看到了我们一起干活。 事实胜于雄辩，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7155
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_3070e783:

    # "For a moment the horse seems about ready to yell at you, his brow furrowing and nostrils flaring. Then, with a slow exhale, Arthur's demeanor suddenly softens."
    "那一瞬间，Arthur 似乎就要冲你吼出来，他眉毛紧锁，鼻孔一张一张的。 随后，他缓缓地吐出一口气，神情也突然缓和了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7159
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_ea04baa3:

    # a "I know it can be hard to believe, but I do know how hard it can be to start at the bottom of the ranks."
    a "我知道这话说出来你可能不信，但我很清楚从底层做起有多难。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7161
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_d94641c2:

    # "You take in a breath, ready to say something, but find yourself at a loss for words at the sudden change the conversation took."
    "你倒吸一口气，正要说些什么，却发现话题的突然转变让你一时语塞。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7163
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_4a2ed103:

    # a "I don't take something like Samuel's injury lightly. It's easy to brush off as an accident, but I have to consider every option. You've given me your answer, and I will respect it for now, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "Samuel 受伤这件事，我不会轻易放过。 虽然很容易当成意外处理，但我必须把所有可能性都考虑进去。 既然你已经给出了你的说法，我暂且保留意见，[family_name] 先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7165
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_a780f881:

    # "The imposing horse finally lets his gaze drift to the side, back towards the helm of the ship."
    "这位气场强大的长官终于把目光移开，重新望向了船舵的方向。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7167
translate Chinese day2_arthur_comply_0c5c277b:

    # a "Keep your nose out of trouble and follow your orders. Do that and do it well and maybe I'll see the potential you can bring to this crew."
    a "别给我惹麻烦，好好听命令。 只要你能做到这两点，并且做得足够好，也许我会看到你身上的潜力。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7173
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_f3203eb3:

    # p "Sir, I was with our passenger, Nomax. I'm sure you've met him by now."
    p "长官，我当时和我们的乘客 Nomax 在一起。 我相信你已经见过他了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7175
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_d678f2f7:

    # "The horse's stern look holds on your gaze, annoyance evident in his features."
    "长官依旧用严厉的目光盯着你，脸上写满了不悦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7177
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_edc2a4f4:

    # a "I am very aware who is and isn't part of the crew on this ship, yes. What were you doing with him? I find it hard to believe that a new recruit would have any business with a passenger. Especially on his first day."
    a "我当然知道谁是船上的人，谁不是。 你和他在一起做什么？ 我很难相信一个新兵会和乘客有什么交集。 尤其还是在他第一天当值的时候。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7180
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_d1217ea2:

    # a "{cps=5000}I am very aware who is and isn't part of the crew on this ship, yes. What were you doing with him? I find it hard to believe that a new recruit would have any business with a passenger. Especially on his first day.{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}我当然知道谁是船上的人，谁不是。 你和他在一起做什么？ 我很难相信一个新兵会和乘客有什么交集。 尤其还是在他第一天当值的时候。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:7193
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_b753feaf:

    # p "I'm sorry, sir, I was just curious. I should have prioritized my duties."
    p "对不起，长官，我只是有些好奇。 我应该先做好自己的本职工作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7195
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_e8a25a4c:

    # "You admit, your voice carries a tinge of regret. The intensity of Arthur's gaze doesn't waver as he studies you, his skepticism almost palpable."
    "你承认道，语气中带着一丝懊恼。 Arthur 审视着你，目光依旧锐利， 怀疑几乎要凝结成实质。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7197
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_029c2a47:

    # a "Curiosity has its place, recruit. But it should not come at the cost of your responsibilities on this ship. Easily distracted isn't a trait I look for in new crew members."
    a "好奇心是好事，新兵。 但不能因此耽误了你在船上的工作。 我可不喜欢那种容易分心的新船员。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7199
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_d7318549:

    # "Embarrassment washes over you as his words reach your ears. Subconsciously, you lower your tail, letting the tip curl in around your lower leg."
    "他的话让你感到一阵难堪。 你下意识地垂下了尾巴，尾尖蜷缩着，绕在了小腿上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7201
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_540f16c6:

    # p "You're right, sir. I made a mistake, and I apologize for that. I won't let it happen again."
    p "您说得对，长官。 我犯了个错误，我为我的行为道歉。 我保证不会再有下次了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7203
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_a450d753:

    # "Arthur's eyes narrow slightly as he sighs."
    "Arthur 叹了口气， 微微眯起了眼睛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7205
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_7115ca0b:

    # a "You should be well aware that neglecting your duties is a serious matter. Should I consider keeping a closer eye on you, or do you think you can manage the tasks assigned to you?"
    a "你应该很清楚，玩忽职守可不是小事。你说，我是不是该盯紧你点儿？还是说，你觉得自己能搞定分给你的那些活儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7207
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_50c95dd7:

    # "His words stir a memory from your past, a lecture from your father for a similar matter. The memory paints your snout with a renewed flush of embarrassment, which you struggle to hide."
    "他的话让你想起了以前老爹因为类似的事儿训你时的情景。这回忆搞得你脸上又是一阵发烧，怪不好意思的，你赶紧想藏起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7209
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_ee7f427c:

    # p "No, sir. I promise it won't happen again. I won't let my curiosity get the better of me next time."
    p "不会了，先生。我保证不会再有下次了。下次我一定管好自己的好奇心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7213
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_95057517:

    # "Arthur's demeanor seems to soften, just a fraction, his rigid stance relenting slightly."
    "Arthur的态度好像稍微缓和了一点，原本绷得紧紧的姿势也稍微放松了些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7215
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_apology_898a2947:

    # a "Very well. I assume our passenger won't hesitate to vouch for your whereabouts. I intend to have a word with him."
    a "很好。我想那位乘客肯定会很乐意替你证明你当时在哪儿。我打算找他聊聊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7221
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_0fe6765a:

    # p "He came over to me and asked for my assistance, sir. I didn't want to turn him away."
    p "他过来找我，说需要我帮个忙，先生。我总不能见死不救吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7223
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_6e6b7dae:

    # "You lie, hoping your expression doesn't betray you."
    "你撒了个谎，心里直打鼓，希望脸上别露馅儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7227
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_86b7fe87:

    # a "He requested your help? What could he possibly have needed from you?"
    a "他找你帮忙？他能有什么事儿需要你帮忙的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7229
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_fe65d095:

    # "You nod quickly, doing your best to continue the fabricated tale."
    "你赶紧点点头，努力把这瞎话继续编下去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7231
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_936428b8:

    # p "Yes, sir. He was having trouble with a personal matter and I was the first crew member he saw. I didn't want to turn him away, considering he's part of this voyage too."
    p "是的，先生。他遇上点儿私事儿，正好我是他第一个碰见的船员。他也是咱们这次出海的一份子，我寻思着不能不帮他一把。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7235
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_e037e6d1:

    # "Arthur's gaze lingers on you, and for a moment, you think you see a flicker of something in his eyes. Perhaps it's surprise or perhaps it's something else entirely."
    "Arthur盯着你看了好一会儿，那一瞬间，你好像看到他眼里闪过一丝什么东西。也许是惊讶，也许是别的什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7237
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_17434b68:

    # a "I see. What sort of trouble? Personal or not, if you were able to assist, I should know. We are not a ship of luxury, but we do our best to accommodate those we let aboard."
    a "我明白了。什么麻烦？不管是不是私事，既然你能帮上忙，我就应该知道。咱们这儿可不是什么豪华游轮，但也得尽力照顾好船上的客人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7239
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_d9fdb3eb:

    # "You pause, eyes widening as you scramble for an appropriate answer."
    "你愣了一下，眼珠子一转，赶紧想个合适的说辞。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7241
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_8f756b68:

    # p "Well, uh.. He had an issue with seasickness. Yes! And he hadn't been able to make it out of his room. He was embarrassed and didn't know what to do with the bucket he'd... used, sir."
    p "嗯... 他晕船了。对！他一直难受得下不了床，又不好意思，不知道该怎么处理他...用过的桶，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7243
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_d7b0d36b:

    # "You're sure Nomax won't be happy to hear of the story you'd constructed about him. You can only hope the dog is quick enough to understand a cover story and play along."
    "你敢肯定，Nomax要是知道你拿他编故事，肯定得跟你急。你只能盼着这狗脑子够灵光，能明白这是在演戏，赶紧配合一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7247
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_61131bb5:

    # "Arthur, for his part, seems to understand entirely. He even smiles ever so slightly."
    "Arthur倒好像是完全明白了，嘴角还微微扬了一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7249
translate Chinese day2_arthur_nomax_lie_030829b9:

    # a "Ah, yes. It can be a difficult situation to overcome. Very well. I assume he'll have no issue vouching for your whereabouts. I'll speak with him after this."
    a "啊，对，这事儿确实挺难受的。好吧。我估计他肯定没问题，能替你证明你当时在哪儿。之后我会找他问问情况。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7258
translate Chinese day2_arthur_end_944b1a1c:

    # "Arthur gives you one last look, his eyes studying your demeanor as if trying to glean something deeper. It's a practiced gaze, one that hints at his experience in evaluating people. The stern atmosphere is broken by his next words."
    "Arthur最后又看了你一眼，眼神在你身上扫来扫去，好像想看穿你似的。这眼神老练得很，一看就是经常跟人打交道。他接下来的话打破了这紧张的气氛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7260
translate Chinese day2_arthur_end_38b97b1d:

    # a "That's all for now. If I have more questions, I will find you. Now, I believe you have an assigned duty to return to? If not, return to Julian and Wolf and help them; I'm sure another set of hands would be appreciated."
    a "今天就先这样吧。如果还有什么问题，我会再来找你。现在，你是不是该回去干你自己的活儿了？要是没事儿，就去帮帮Julian和Wolf，我相信他们肯定欢迎多个人搭把手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7273
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_7e1e5d69:

    # "Your hackles rise, and you shoot a defiant look at Arthur."
    "你顿时火冒三丈，狠狠地瞪了Arthur一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7277
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_fec264ef:

    # p "With all due respect, sir, I didn't cause Samuel's injury or any other trouble. Your observations might be misleading you."
    p "恕我直言，先生，Samuel受伤的事儿，还有其他那些乱七八糟的事儿，跟我一点儿关系都没有。您是不是搞错了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7281
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_7f047b22:

    # "Arthur's eyes narrow further, his voice like ice."
    "Arthur的眼睛眯得更紧了，声音冷得像冰碴子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7283
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_194b01a8:

    # a "I would advise you to watch your tone."
    a "我劝你最好注意一下你的说话语气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7285
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_6bfec695:

    # "You take a deep breath, your frustration evident."
    "你深吸一口气，心里那个窝火啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7289
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_b4789a21:

    # p "I apologize, sir, but it's frustrating to be accused of something I had no part in. I understand you're cautious, but I am no less trying to contribute to the smooth workings of this ship than anyone else on this crew."
    p "对不起，先生，但平白无故被人冤枉，搁谁身上也受不了啊。我知道您谨慎，但要说为这条船尽心尽力，我可不比船上的任何人差。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7291
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_bd392ad9:

    # p "I have left my family and my home behind to come and work on this ship, and I am just as dedicated to her safety as everyone is."
    p "我背井离乡，跑到这条船上来干活，对它的安全，我跟谁都一样上心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7293
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_68b76be5:

    # "He regards you silently, his stern expression unwavering."
    "他一言不发地看着你，表情还是那么严肃。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7295
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_6966b977:

    # p "I've been a part of this crew for a short time, I understand that. But I've already seen how things work. It's a tight-knit group, and I know I need to prove myself."
    p "我上船的时间是不长，这我承认。但我已经摸清楚这儿的门道了。这儿的人都很抱团，我知道我得拿出点真本事才行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7297
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_a28fc4c0:

    # "Arthur's gaze seems to soften slightly, but his skepticism remains."
    "Arthur的眼神好像稍微柔和了一点，但还是有点怀疑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7299
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_49c3b79a:

    # a "Proving oneself goes beyond words, Mr. [family_name]. It's about actions and choices. Accidents can happen, but I won't ignore patterns."
    a "想证明自己，光靠嘴说可不行，[family_name]先生。得看你做的事，做的选择。出意外是难免的，但我可不会放过任何蛛丝马迹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7301
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_0afe8e48:

    # "You fold your ears back as your eyes meet his hard gaze."
    "你感到一阵畏惧，下意识地避开了他那严厉的目光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7303
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_4d05a464:

    # p "Understood, sir. I'll do my best to show you and the crew that I'm here for the right reasons."
    p "明白了，长官。我会尽力向您和各位船员证明，我来这里是真心想为船队效力。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7305
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_4340af96:

    # "Arthur inclines his head, a gesture of reluctant acknowledgment."
    "Arthur微微颔首，勉强算是认可了我的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7307
translate Chinese day2_arthur_defend_66905c14:

    # a "Very well. Just remember, trust is earned."
    a "很好。记住，信任是要靠自己争取的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7313
translate Chinese day2_arthur_meek_386f9d8d:

    # "You lower your gaze under Arthur's scrutiny, feeling a mixture of nervousness and a hint of frustration at being put on the spot. With a meek tone, you respond."
    "Arthur的目光让我感到压力倍增，我低下头，被他当场质问，心中难免有些沮丧。我用略带顺从的语气回答道："

# game/script day2.rpy:7315
translate Chinese day2_arthur_meek_3791e467:

    # p "I'm just trying to learn and do the best at my role here, sir."
    p "长官，我只是想多学点东西，尽我所能完成我的职责。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7317
translate Chinese day2_arthur_meek_c4a65511:

    # "Arthur's gaze remains focused on you, his brow slightly furrowed as if assessing your sincerity. After a moment of silence, he lets out a soft sigh."
    "Arthur依然紧盯着我，眉头微微皱起，似乎在评估我的诚意。沉默片刻后，他轻轻叹了口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7321
translate Chinese day2_arthur_meek_f6c1b342:

    # a "It's good to be eager to learn. Just make sure you're in the right places at the right times."
    a "渴望学习是好事。但你要确保自己出现在该出现的地方，做该做的事情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7323
translate Chinese day2_arthur_meek_7098a039:

    # "His words carry a subtle undertone, leaving you with the sense that he's not entirely convinced. You nod in understanding, feeling a bit uncertain about his response."
    "他的话里带着一丝警告的意味，我能感觉到他并没有完全信任我。我点点头表示明白，心里却有些忐忑不安。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7325
translate Chinese day2_arthur_meek_dab82789:

    # a "Keep your wits about you, and keep your nose out of trouble. As I told you earlier, I will be keeping a close watch after today."
    a "保持警惕，别惹麻烦。正如我之前所说，从今天起我会密切关注你的一举一动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7329
translate Chinese day2_arthur_meek_47ebfcf2:

    # "You feel some bit of ease knowing he's not directly accusing you, though you can't shake the feeling that you have a rather large target on your back now."
    "他并没有直接指责我，这让我稍微松了一口气，但我总觉得现在自己已经成了大家怀疑的对象。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7335
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_cae35b46:

    # "You straighten your posture, meeting Arthur's gaze with a confident expression."
    "我挺直腰板，用充满自信的目光迎向Arthur。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7337
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_a08466c0:

    # p "Sir, I understand the importance of safety, and I appreciate your concern. I want to clarify that I had no involvement in what happened to Samuel. I was merely an observer, trying to learn from a more experienced crew member."
    p "长官，我明白平安航行的重要性，也感谢您的关心。我想澄清一点，Samuel的遭遇与我无关。我当时只是一个旁观者，想向前辈们学习经验。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7339
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_01ad64f8:

    # "Arthur's stern expression remains, but there's a slight hint of approval in his eyes at your assertiveness."
    "Arthur严厉的表情依旧没有缓和，但他的眼神中似乎流露出了一丝对我这份决然的赞许。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7341
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_a6639630:

    # a "Observing. Learning. That's good. Just remember, every action has consequences on a ship."
    a "观察，学习，很好。记住，在这条船上，任何行为都会带来相应的后果。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7345
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_cb46bda5:

    # a "Grave consequences in some cases."
    a "某些情况下，会造成严重后果。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7347
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_82d68997:

    # a "We may very well have been lucky today that Sam still has both his legs. Anything could have been different and the sheet might have snapped right through it."
    a "今天咱们算是走运，Sam还保住了两条腿。但凡有一点差池，那帆脚索没准就直接把他腿给绞断了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7351
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_8daa4afd:

    # "You nod, acknowledging his point."
    "你点点头，表示明白。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7355
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_e7a87b62:

    # p "Absolutely, sir. I have no intention of jeopardizing the safety of anyone on this ship, least of all Samuel."
    p "当然，先生。我绝不会做任何危害船上安全的事，更别说是Sam了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7358
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_fc8c5e9f:

    # p "Absolutely, sir. I have no intention of jeopardizing the safety of anyone on this ship."
    p "当然，先生。我绝不会做任何危害船上安全的事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7360
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_3dda9184:

    # "He gives a curt nod in return."
    "他简短地点头回应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7362
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_cbfbb54e:

    # a "Very well. Keep your focus on your duties, and we won't have any issues. I'll be looking more into the incident as I can."
    a "很好。做好你的本分，别出什么岔子。我会尽快深入调查这件事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7364
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_589aab88:

    # "You take a step back, the weight of his words sinking in."
    "你后退一步，他的话让你感到压力。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7366
translate Chinese day2_arthur_respect_e21d4035:

    # "It's clear that Arthur's suspicions have eased somewhat, but there's still an air of caution around him. You're determined to prove your dedication and integrity to the crew, even if it means working twice as hard."
    "Arthur的怀疑明显减轻了些，但还是对你有所保留。你下定决心要向大家证明你的忠诚和为人，就算要付出双倍的努力也在所不惜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7374
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_f8169177:

    # "Your frustration boils over, and you can't hold back the surge of anger that courses through you."
    "你再也压不住满腔的怒火，挫败感瞬间爆发。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7376
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_e3553f8b:

    # p "I won't have my every move questioned just because I am apparently an easy target for it!"
    p "别以为我好欺负，就对我的一举一动指手画脚！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7378
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_2389e4a6:

    # p "I won't be pushed around and be given responsibility for something I haven't done!"
    p "我绝不会任人摆布，更不会替我没做过的事背黑锅！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7380
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_315b2df4:

    # "You retort, your voice edged with bitterness."
    "你带着苦涩反驳道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7382
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_f7dcff9a:

    # "Arthur's stern expression doesn't waver, but you can sense a flicker of something in his eyes."
    "Arthur依旧面无表情，但你察觉到他眼中闪过一丝异样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7384
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_3eb70db8:

    # a "This isn't a place for the faint of heart, lad. We can't afford to let just anyone on board without ensuring their loyalty and dedication."
    a "这地方可不是给胆小鬼预备的，小子。没确认忠诚之前，我们不能随便让什么人都上船。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7388
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_ec9b92fc:

    # p "Loyalty? Dedication? I came here to work hard and to contribute."
    p "忠诚？奉献？我来这儿是想卖力干活，有所贡献的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7390
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_0207751d:

    # "You shoot back, your words laced with defiance."
    "你顶了回去，话里带着刺儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7392
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_9a60079b:

    # p "But if that's not enough for you, if I'm constantly going to be treated like some potential threat, then maybe I'm better off finding a crew that trusts and respects its members."
    p "可要是这还不够，要是你一直把我当成眼中钉，那我不如另找一帮信任和尊重彼此的家伙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7396
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_0234ff62:

    # "As you turn on your heel, ready to storm away and leave the conversation behind, Arthur's voice slices through the air, cutting off your retreat."
    "你一转身，想甩手走人，把这事儿抛在脑后，Arthur的声音却像刀子一样划破空气，拦住了你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7400
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_5aef610d:

    # a "Hold."
    a "等等。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7404
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_f6e73797:

    # "You pause, your back still turned to him, frustration and anger simmering just below the surface."
    "你停下脚步，依然背对着他，沮丧和怒火在心头翻涌。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7406
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_ced0ffcb:

    # a "I'm not blind to your feelings."
    a "我不是感觉不到你的心思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7408
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_6f7ca939:

    # "Arthur's voice is firm, tinged with a hint of anger."
    "Arthur的声音很严肃，带着一丝怒气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7410
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_efceec46:

    # a "But make no mistake, you do not get to turn your back on an officer while on this ship."
    a "但你给我搞清楚了，在这条船上，你没资格背对着你的长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7412
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_021da96e:

    # "Despite your anger, a part of you is relieved that he's not simply letting you go. You slowly turn back to face him, your arms crossed defensively."
    "就算你现在很生气，可心里也松了一口气吧，因为他没有直接放你走。你缓缓转过身，面对着他，双手抱臂，摆出防御的姿态。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7414
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_335b71e3:

    # a "Your eagerness to leave at the first sign of difficulty doesn't exactly paint you as dedicated..."
    a "一碰到点麻烦就想着开溜，可看不出你有多尽心尽力..."

# game/script day2.rpy:7416
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_a63cc716:

    # "Arthur's words remain unyielding, his gaze piercing."
    "Arthur依旧语气强硬，目光如炬，毫不退让。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7418
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_545a532d:

    # a "Not to mention your apparent insubordination towards me. You do know that it is not tolerated around here, nor on any other ship, don't you?"
    a "更别提你明目张胆地违抗我。你该知道，这种行为在这里，还有任何其他的船上，都是绝不容忍的，明白吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7420
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_a34534f3:

    # "Your jaw clenches while you listen and you counter with a quieter voice that is no less defiant."
    "你听着他的训斥，紧咬牙关，压低声音回敬道，但语气里依旧带着不服。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7422
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_5424aaf7:

    # p "I just won't tolerate being treated unfairly."
    p "我就是受不了不公平的待遇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7424
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_12d67120:

    # "Arthur's stare narrows, his eyes locking onto yours, the tension between you palpable."
    "Arthur目光如炬，死死地盯着你，空气中弥漫着剑拔弩张的气氛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7426
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_9d9f0a2c:

    # a "There is no concept of 'fair' here. You get what you've earned. Furthermore, you haven't been officially accused of anything. Keep that in mind. I have my thoughts, but that's an entirely separate matter."
    a "这里没有“公平”可言。你想要什么，就自己去挣。还有，你还没被正式指控任何罪名。记住这点。我心里怎么想，那是另一码事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7430
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_f2fcd513:

    # a "However..."
    a "但是......"

# game/script day2.rpy:7434
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_1a14502a:

    # a "I have not forgotten your assistance yesterday. Consider yourself lucky to escape the lashes today."
    a "我还没忘了你昨天帮的忙。今天饶你一顿鞭子，算你走运。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7436
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_313b0b59:

    # a "It would...{w} perhaps make too much of a scene.{w} Bring unease to the crew. But I will keep my eyes on you, boy."
    a "要是闹起来……{w} 恐怕会不太好看。{w} 让船员们人心惶惶。但我会好好盯着你的，小子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7438
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_d6560126:

    # a "You can be very certain of that."
    a "你最好记住这一点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7440
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_f4d4ad58:

    # "A heavy silence descends, the gravity of his words lingering in the air. Your anger begins to ebb, a sigh of surrender escaping your lips as you let the tension dissipate in a long breath."
    "一片死寂，他的话语如千斤巨石压在心头。你胸中的怒火也渐渐平息，如释重负地叹了口气，长长地吐出一口气，放松下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7442
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_21fd23ea:

    # "You rather not push your luck any further with the threat of lashes looming over your head."
    "脑袋上还悬着鞭刑的威胁，你最好别再火上浇油了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7444
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_f2d1f71a:

    # p "Understood, sir."
    p "明白了，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7446
translate Chinese day2_arthur_abandon_632c9101:

    # "You concede, your voice carrying a mixture of resignation and compliance."
    "你妥协了，语气中带着几分无奈和顺从。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7454
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_f8169177:

    # "Your frustration boils over, and you can't hold back the surge of anger that courses through you."
    "你再也压不住满腔的怒火，挫败感瞬间爆发。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7456
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_e3553f8b:

    # p "I won't have my every move questioned just because I am apparently an easy target for it!"
    p "别以为我好欺负，就对我的一举一动指手画脚！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7458
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_2389e4a6:

    # p "I won't be pushed around and be given responsibility for something I haven't done!"
    p "我绝不会任人摆布，更不会替我没做过的事背黑锅！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7460
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_315b2df4:

    # "You retort, your voice edged with bitterness."
    "你带着苦涩反驳道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7462
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_f7dcff9a:

    # "Arthur's stern expression doesn't waver, but you can sense a flicker of something in his eyes."
    "Arthur依旧面无表情，但你察觉到他眼中闪过一丝异样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7464
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_3eb70db8:

    # a "This isn't a place for the faint of heart, lad. We can't afford to let just anyone on board without ensuring their loyalty and dedication."
    a "这地方可不是给胆小鬼预备的，小子。没确认忠诚之前，我们不能随便让什么人都上船。"

