    # a "Not to mention your apparent insubordination towards me. You do know that it is not tolerated around here, nor on any other ship, do you?"
    a "更别提你对我公然的抗命。你应该知道，这种行为在这里，乃至任何船上，都是绝不容许的，明白吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7498
