# game/script day2.rpy:7504
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_9d9f0a2c:

    # a "There is no concept of 'fair' here. You get what you've earned. Furthermore, you haven't been officially accused of anything. Keep that in mind. I have my thoughts, but that's an entirely separate matter."
    a "这里没有“公平”可言。你想要什么，就自己去挣。还有，你还没被正式指控任何罪名。记住这点。我心里怎么想，那是另一码事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7506
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_86c3c68b:

    # a "Consider this your last warning. You are lucky that we aren't on a navy ship or I would have had you whipped already."
    a "记住，这是最后一次警告。幸好我们不是在海军的船上，不然你早就挨鞭子了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7508
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_c001b090:

    # a "You see, I can understand a misstep.{w} Men away from their homes, confined on this ship. However, I will not tolerate anarchy on this vessel."
    a "你要知道，一时糊涂，我可以理解。{w} 大家背井离乡，困在这条船上。但是，我绝不允许在这艘船上出现任何混乱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7510
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_1e684d43:

    # a "Have I made myself clear?"
    a "我说清楚了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7512
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_cafe857f:

    # "He silently looks at you, judging your reaction with an intense glare. You can see the flick of his tail behind him every now and then as you consider your words."
    "他一言不发地盯着你，用犀利的目光审视着你的反应。你斟酌着字句，眼角瞥见他身后的尾巴不时地抽动一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7516
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_f2d1f71a:

    # p "Understood, sir."
    p "明白了，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7518
translate Chinese day2_angered_arthur_0d01a965:

    # "You concede with careful consideration as you realize that you should not push your luck."
    "你再三思量后选择了退让，知道自己不该再冒险了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7524
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_f8169177:

    # "Your frustration boils over, and you can't hold back the surge of anger that courses through you."
    "你再也压不住满腔的怒火，挫败感瞬间爆发。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7528
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_e3553f8b:

    # p "I won't have my every move questioned just because I am apparently an easy target for it!"
    p "别以为我好欺负，就对我的一举一动指手画脚！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7530
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_2389e4a6:

    # p "I won't be pushed around and be given responsibility for something I haven't done!"
    p "我绝不会任人摆布，更不会替我没做过的事背黑锅！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7532
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_315b2df4:

    # "You retort, your voice edged with bitterness."
    "你带着苦涩反驳道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7534
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_ea127c62:

    # "Arthur scans you thoroughly, his features harden considerably."
    "Arthur狠狠地审视着你，脸色一下子就沉了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7538
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_63c9f7ff:

    # a "Silence!"
    a "安静！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7542
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_c77880db:

    # "You freeze instantly, your heart skips a beat at the sudden outburst."
    "你瞬间僵住，突如其来的怒吼让你心跳都漏了一拍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7544
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_f26b7907:

    # "He turns to face you. A heavy step brings him closer, forcing you to crane your neck further back to look up at him."
    "他转过身，沉重的脚步声逼近，你不得不仰起头才能看他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7546
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_2ee1cccb:

    # a "Who in the seven seas do you think you are?!"
    a "你算老几？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7548
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_edddd07e:

    # a "Hah?!"
    a "哈？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7552
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_0043b6f7:

    # a "Answer me!"
    a "回答我！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7556
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_48e3d684:

    # "Answering becomes almost impossible with the lump that is stuck in your throat. You swallow hard and clear your throat."
    "你哽住了，几乎说不出话，只能用力吞咽，清了清嗓子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7558
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_e45d19ed:

    # p "S-Sir, I...{w} I simply won't stand fo-"
    p "长...长官，我... 我实在忍不......"

# game/script day2.rpy:7560
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_1cb2d1c4:

    # a "You won't stand for what?"
    a "忍不了什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7562
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_abb7e518:

    # a "Your utter incompetence?"
    a "忍不了你彻底的无能？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7564
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_6c2b5269:

    # a "Your complete lack of discipline?"
    a "还是你完全缺乏纪律？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7566
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_09db9eaf:

    # a "Huh?"
    a "Huh？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7568
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_8e886375:

    # a "Come on! Talk!"
    a "快说！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7570
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_ba2b5d6b:

    # p "My-... I..."
    p "我...我......"

# game/script day2.rpy:7572
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_8de54771:

    # a "My-, my-, muh-, mah. What's wrong, sailor?"
    a "我...我... 呃... 嘛... 怎么了，水手？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7574
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_d79ad8b3:

    # "A cold shiver runs down your spine as you struggle to get your thoughts in order."
    "一股寒意顺着你的脊椎爬了上来，你拼命地组织着思绪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7578
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_29b191c9:

    # a "I shouldn't have been so lenient with you, you know. I had a feeling about you right from the start, but I thought better of it."
    a "我真不该对你心慈手软，你知道吗。一开始我就觉得你不对劲，还总想着往好处想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7580
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_5fc60191:

    # a "Thought that maybe that feeling was wrong."
    a "以为也许是我看走了眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7582
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_46401318:

    # a "Saw a boy with an eagerness and a sense of what a privilege it is to be, and work on a ship like this."
    a "以为你是个渴望上进，也明白在这船上干活是多大荣幸的小子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7584
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_1c1633cb:

    # "His broad hand reaches out to you, grasps the underside of your chin and forces you to look up at him properly, without any chance of avoiding eye contact."
    "他粗壮的手一把抓住你的下巴，强迫你抬起头，不让你有丝毫回避。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7586
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_477e63ce:

    # a "Clearly however, it wasn't."
    a "看来，是我错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7588
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_1ac68c21:

    # a "See, I can understand a misstep.{w} Men away from their homes, confined for months."
    a "听着，一时犯错我可以理解... 男人们背井离乡，一困就是几个月。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7590
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_425d4109:

    # a "And yet, in the space of a day, you managed to insult hundreds of years of naval order several times over."
    a "可你倒好，一天之内，三番五次地挑战海军的规矩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7592
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_89f93bcf:

    # "With his other hand Arthur gestures to two nearby crew members, and without question they step close to you on Arthur's command."
    "Arthur朝附近的两个船员使了个眼色，他们立刻靠了上来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7594
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_66a74a8f:

    # a "Prepare him for 12 right away, and gather the rest of the crew..."
    a "准备行刑！先打十二鞭！把其他人都叫过来..."

# game/script day2.rpy:7617
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_9cd683d4:

    # "You find yourself with your shirt stripped, and your arms tied securely to the rigging. The crew, Arthur and Rajeeyah foremost, surround you."
    "你发现自己已经被剥光了上衣，双手紧紧地绑在帆缆上。船员们围了上来，Arthur和Rajeeyah也在人群最前面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7619
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_a68d5be8:

    # "You do spot Julian, Samuel and Wolf among them as well, looking at you in concerned silence."
    "Julian、Samuel和Wolf也在人群里，他们正一脸担忧地看着你，沉默不语。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7621
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_a762eea1:

    # "Arthur steps forward, hands clasped behind his back as he speaks in a calm but stern tone."
    "Arthur背着手，向前走了一步，语气平静却严厉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7623
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_33f86e18:

    # a "Mr. [family_name]. As a result of your repeated acts of disobedience to your superior officers, you are hereby sentenced to 12 lashes."
    a "[family_name]先生。由于你多次违抗上级命令，现判处你十二鞭刑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7625
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_1bcef5cc:

    # a "The things that hold this small wooden world together are hard work and discipline. I expect you, as I expect everyone, not to question my authority or that of any other officer."
    a "维系这条船的，是努力和纪律。我希望你，也希望所有人，都不要质疑我和任何长官的权威！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7627
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_04250838:

    # a "And I cannot afford to allow anarchy to reign on this ship."
    a "我绝不允许这艘船上出现任何混乱！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7629
translate Chinese day2_pre_lashing_e197a85c:

    # a "Do you have any last words before we begin?"
    a "行刑之前，你还有什么要说的吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7657
translate Chinese day2_lashing_apologize_30b32938:

    # p "I'm sorry, Doctor."
    p "医生，我很抱歉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7661
translate Chinese day2_lashing_apologize_bcd0acf7:

    # p "It won't happen again, sir."
    p "长官，我保证不会再犯了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7663
translate Chinese day2_lashing_apologize_8cd3347c:

    # "You state with quiet submission, your ears drooping as you await the pain to come."
    "你低声下气地认错，耷拉着耳朵，等待着痛苦降临。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7665
translate Chinese day2_lashing_apologize_80799543:

    # a "Very well."
    a "好吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7671
translate Chinese day2_lashing_quiet_dcd87472:

    # "You say nothing, just shake your head and tuck your tail between your legs in preparation for the sentence."
    "你一言不发，只是摇着头，夹紧尾巴，准备挨鞭子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7673
translate Chinese day2_lashing_quiet_80799543:

    # a "Very well."
    a "好吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7681
translate Chinese day2_lashing_aa1de0f8:

    # p "The mere defence of myself against unfounded accusations should not be grounds for punishment, and you know that as well as I do, officer."
    p "长官，仅仅因为我为自己辩解，反驳那些莫须有的指控就要受罚，这说不过去吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7685
translate Chinese day2_lashing_1742d163:

    # "Arthur doesn't answer immediately. Instead, he let the tense silence linger, nothing but the sound of the waves lapping against the ship's hull and the wind in the sails filling your ears."
    "Arthur没有立刻回答，空气仿佛凝固了一般，只剩下海浪拍打船舷和风吹过船帆的声音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7687
translate Chinese day2_lashing_a050a029:

    # a "Make it 24..."
    a "改成二十四下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7691
translate Chinese day2_lashing_1019a393:

    # "Your eyes shoot open as you hear the extension of your sentence, and you turn your head over your shoulder to try and face him."
    "听到加刑，你猛地睁大了眼睛，扭过头想看看他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7693
translate Chinese day2_lashing_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p "啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7697
translate Chinese day2_lashing_aaaf8b2b:

    # "The boatswain holding the Cat o' Nine Tails and Rajeeyah both give Arthur a questioning look."
    "水手长拿着九尾鞭，和Rajeeyah都疑惑地看向Arthur。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7699
translate Chinese day2_lashing_d9eed6df:

    # r "Sir, do we rea-"
    r "船长，我们真的要..."

# game/script day2.rpy:7703
translate Chinese day2_lashing_fd9c3650:

    # a "You heard me."
    a "照我说的做！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7708
translate Chinese day2_lashing_5fd336b2:

    # "Without raising further questions the boatswain steps up to Arthur and raises his hand in a salute."
    "水手长不再多问，走到Arthur面前，举手敬礼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7713
translate Chinese day2_lashing_57e0ebd6:

    # "The boatswain who held the Cat o' nine tails steps up to Arthur and raises his hand in a salute."
    "拿着九尾鞭的水手长走到Arthur面前，举起手敬礼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7715
translate Chinese day2_lashing_ee9ae433:

    # bw "Permission to carry on, sir."
    bw "听候指示，长官！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7717
translate Chinese day2_lashing_73d72d78:

    # a "Do your duty."
    a "执行命令！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7719
translate Chinese day2_lashing_445ef965:

    # "Arthur's gaze shifts to Rajeeyah, who spoke up to give her expected assessment as the ship's surgeon."
    "Arthur的目光转向船医Rajeeyah，等待她像往常一样对你的身体状况进行评估。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7721
translate Chinese day2_lashing_7304dae2:

    # r "He is in good enough condition to begin, Officer."
    r "长官，他现在的身体状况可以行刑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7723
translate Chinese day2_lashing_b4addc90:

    # "The boatswain reaches over your shoulder and slips a thick piece of leather into your maw, which you gladly and firmly bite down on."
    "水手长绕到你身后，将一块厚厚的皮革塞进你嘴里，你迫不及待地咬紧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7725
translate Chinese day2_lashing_2127a51d:

    # "You feel your muscles tremble as you cling to the rigging, your paw growing numb."
    "你死死抓住绳索，感到肌肉止不住地颤抖，爪子也渐渐麻木。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7727
translate Chinese day2_lashing_a2d01a72:

    # "Time stretches out while you wait for the first impact to come, and you're left with little information to go on, simply looking out at the open sea."
    "等待第一鞭落下，时间变得无比漫长，你无所适从，只能茫然地望着大海。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7729
translate Chinese day2_lashing_6189aaf5:

    # "Not a murmur from the assembled crowd, no countdown to give you any indication."
    "围观的人群鸦雀无声，没有任何预兆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7731
translate Chinese day2_lashing_de854545:

    # "All that you hear was the shuffle of rope against itself before the first blow comes crashing down on your exposed back."
    "紧接着，你只听见绳索摩擦的嗖嗖声，第一鞭便狠狠地抽在了你裸露的背上！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7735
translate Chinese day2_lashing_709a8b9c:

    # "Smack!!!" with hpunch
    "啪！！！" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:7739
translate Chinese day2_lashing_b5f56d87:

    # "Pain surges through you in an instant, you throw your body forward in an attempt to escape it."
    "剧痛瞬间席卷全身，你本能地向前挣扎，想要逃离这可怕的痛苦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7741
translate Chinese day2_lashing_5d59ea83:

    # bw "One."
    bw "一。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7748
translate Chinese day2_lashing_709a8b9c_1:

    # "Smack!!!" with hpunch
    "啪！！！" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:7750
translate Chinese day2_lashing_6d9e44fc:

    # "The second one wasn't any easier. The blow set your back on fire again before the pain from the first one had any chance to subside."
    "第二鞭同样不好受，还没等第一鞭的痛楚消散，新的火焰又在背上燃烧起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7752
translate Chinese day2_lashing_2a417751:

    # "You let out a pitiful whine, muffled by the leather strap, and tuck your tail in a little further."
    "你呜咽一声，这可怜的哀鸣被嘴里的皮子死死闷住，尾巴也夹得更紧了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7754
translate Chinese day2_lashing_19cdad9a:

    # bw "Two."
    bw "二。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7761
translate Chinese day2_lashing_709a8b9c_2:

    # "Smack!!!" with hpunch
    "啪！！！" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:7763
translate Chinese day2_lashing_7d92f580:

    # bw "Three."
    bw "三。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7765
translate Chinese day2_lashing_93904460:

    # "Rajeeyah's head comes into view briefly as she leans over to be able to check your condition before giving a sober assessment."
    "Rajeeyah 探身查看你的情况，脑袋在你眼前晃了一下，随后冷静地判断道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7767
translate Chinese day2_lashing_47ced3fc:

    # r "He's able to proceed, sir."
    r "“他可以继续了，先生。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:7769
translate Chinese day2_lashing_4d13914f:

    # "Without any hesitation, the fourth lash follows."
    "没有任何犹豫，第四鞭随即落下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7779
translate Chinese day2_lashing_709a8b9c_3:

    # "Smack!!!" with hpunch
    "啪！！！" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:7781
translate Chinese day2_lashing_6bc57f58:

    # bw "Four."
    bw "四。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7783
translate Chinese day2_lashing_97b0e620:

    # "Red streaks criss cross your back and your fur stains crimson with blood as it seeps from your body."
    "鲜红的血痕交错在你背上，渗出的血液将你的毛皮浸染成血色。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7785
translate Chinese day2_lashing_e87d8750:

    # "Even now, not a word from the assembled crowd breaks the tension. Everyone simply watches with rapt attention as your punishment is carried out."
    "即使是现在，围观的人群依旧鸦雀无声，所有人都全神贯注地看着你受刑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7787
translate Chinese day2_lashing_584299db:

    # "The remaining lashes simply blur into constant fiery pain as you endure them. You're not even sure if you fainted during the last few."
    "剩下的鞭子抽打在你身上，只剩下如同火焰般灼烧的剧痛。最后几鞭，你甚至不确定自己是不是已经疼昏了过去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7813
translate Chinese day2_lashing_035ee24b:

    # "Pain surges through you, and in an instant the world around you goes black."
    "剧痛瞬间席卷全身，你眼前一黑，失去了知觉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7845
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_fb8072d0:

    # a "Regardless of the situation, I want you to know that I take the safety of this crew seriously."
    a "无论如何，我希望你们明白，我非常重视全体船员的安全。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7847
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_447ebbfe:

    # "Arthur's voice carries a note of stern authority."
    "Arthur 的声音里带着不容置疑的威严。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7849
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_09b13463:

    # a "Keep your focus on your duties, and we won't have any issues. Now, get back to your work."
    a "都给我专注于自己的工作，别给我惹麻烦。现在，滚回去干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7851
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_0844673e:

    # "His words hang in the air for a moment, a weighty reminder of the expectations thrust upon you the moment you came aboard. As Arthur turns to return to his post, you're left with a swirling ache in the pit of your belly."
    "他的话在空气中回荡着，沉重地提醒着你自从登上这条船开始，肩上所背负的期望。Arthur 转身回到岗位，你却觉得心里头没来由地涌上一股难受劲儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7855
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_cfd68fbe:

    # "With a sigh, you steel yourself to heed Arthur's advice and return to your duties. Determined to keep your focus and prove your dedication, you turn away from your view of Arthur retaking his spot at the helm and head back across deck."
    "你叹了口气，强迫自己听从 Arthur 的劝告，回到自己的岗位上。你下定决心要集中精力，证明自己，于是转过身，不再看 Arthur 回到舵边的身影，径直走向甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7857
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_eeb27188:

    # "Your steps lead you back to Julian and Wolf who were still more or less dutifully swabbing the deck, having made quite some progress since you left them earlier."
    "你回到 Julian 和 Wolf 身边，他们还算老实地擦着甲板，自从你离开后，他们已经擦了不少地方了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7861
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_aaf3833f:

    # "You walk past them to grab your holystone before you join up with them again."
    "你从他们身边走开，去拿你的擦洗石，然后回来和他们汇合。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7866
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_18406b81:

    # j "Yo, made it back?"
    j "哟，回来了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7873
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_79a618ef:

    # "Just in time for the ship's bell to signal the end of the morning shift."
    "正好赶上敲钟，上午的活儿结束了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7877
translate Chinese day2_arthur_talk1_end_304c1527:

    # j "Of course. You've got impeccable timing... Ah well, certainly not going to complain about a break."
    j "那是，你掐点儿可真准……好吧，能歇会儿当然好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7890
translate Chinese after_morningshift_24d92373:

    # j "Do you two have any plans for it?"
    j "你们俩有什么打算？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7892
translate Chinese after_morningshift_f01aae4a:

    # w "Staying as far away from you as possible, does that count as a plan?"
    w "离你越远越好，这算计划不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7896
translate Chinese after_morningshift_31a4b415:

    # j "So you're just going to stay on at the head all day and watch the others take a dump?"
    j "所以你打算一整天猫在船头，看别人拉屎？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7898
translate Chinese after_morningshift_f140e3a4:

    # w "Gladly, if those are my two options."
    w "如果只有这俩选择，我宁愿那样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7900
translate Chinese after_morningshift_a4515c74:

    # p "We didn't have to help with the tack right now, did we? Because of the damage?"
    p "现在不用帮着弄索具吧？因为坏了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7905
translate Chinese after_morningshift_717331e4:

    # "Julian leans against the shroud at the side of the ship, holding on to one of the ratlines that run across horizontally."
    "Julian 靠在船舷边的护索上，手扶着横向的梯绳。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7907
translate Chinese after_morningshift_adae45c4:

    # j "Correct. I suppose we'll have to do that later, when they've got things back in order again."
    j "对。估计得等他们安排好了再说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7909
translate Chinese after_morningshift_3319aa4a:

    # j "And Wolf, we're going to be here for another what? Almost 2 months? Do you really want to hide away every time we have a break?"
    j "还有 Wolf，咱们还得在这儿待差不多两个月吧？ 你真打算每次休息都躲着啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7911
translate Chinese after_morningshift_2d6a691b:

    # j "Come on, you play dice?"
    j "玩两把骰子不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7915
translate Chinese after_morningshift_2b5908f4:

    # w "With you?"
    w "跟你？"

# game/script day2.rpy:7917
translate Chinese after_morningshift_01780fdd:

    # "Wolf raises a brow, but doesn't immediately dismiss the suggestion."
    "Wolf 挑了下眉毛，没直接拒绝。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7921
translate Chinese after_morningshift_d2a9328b:

    # j "With me."
    j "我带了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7923
translate Chinese after_morningshift_2aacef13:

    # j "I brought some with me. No bets or anything, just for the sake of it."
    j "我带了点东西。不赌钱，就图一乐。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7928
translate Chinese after_morningshift_8e1220ac:

    # "The lizard waits patiently for his answer, and Wolf does take his sweet time with it."
    "蜥蜴耐心等着他回话，而Wolf慢条斯理的，一点也不着急。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7932
translate Chinese after_morningshift_b0ca20f1:

    # "He takes the holystones from you and Julian, placing them neatly in the bucket before he hauls it off to a safe place to the side and ties it securely."
    "他从你和Julian手里接过{a=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holystone}圣石{/a}(船上清洁甲板用的磨石)， 整齐地码进桶里，然后把桶拖到一旁的安全地方，牢牢地系好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7936
translate Chinese after_morningshift_437beb54:

    # w "You know what, lizard? Fuck it, maybe you have a point. I haven't had a good game in a long while and I think I could use one."
    w "诶我说，蜥蜴？算了，爷们儿，没准你说的对。老子是真他娘的很久没好好玩一场了，是该放松放松。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7938
translate Chinese after_morningshift_79da71c6:

    # w "Count me in."
    w "算我一份。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7942
translate Chinese after_morningshift_4c5c0073:

    # "Julian balls a fist in celebration and points at you to see if you're in as well."
    "Julian兴奋地挥了挥拳头，又指了指你，问你参不参加。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7962
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_ae45ed71:

    # "You consider your options for a moment or two, but figure that Samuel would probably just like a bit of peace and quiet for his recovery right now."
    "你琢磨了一下，觉得Samuel现在可能只想安安静静地养伤。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7964
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_f6b0a05f:

    # p "Sure, I'm in."
    p "行，算我一个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7968
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_18eb7fc2:

    # "Once more Julian's fist of joy appears, overjoyed that he manages to convince not just one but both of you!"
    "Julian又兴奋地挥起了拳头，能说服你们俩加入，他真是太高兴了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:7972
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_348dc065:

    # "The three of you head for the stairs, past members of the other half of the crew who are preparing to take over."
    "你们仨朝楼梯走去，路过几位正准备接班的船员。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7984
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_1cd7ef5e:

    # "With half the crew busy it's easier to find a table than during dinner time. You three secure one that's held aloft by ropes to counteract the sway of the ship, the surface of which is rather crudely finished wood."
    "船上一半的人都在忙，现在找桌子比晚饭那会儿容易多了。你们仨找了张用绳子吊着的桌子，用来抵消船的摇晃，桌子是木头的，表面打磨得很粗糙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7986
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_74e5cb0e:

    # j "I'll be right back, just going to get the dice."
    j "我去去就来，去拿骰子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7990
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_845ece7c:

    # "He spins around, his tail almost slapping you as he does, and off he goes to where he's stored his belongings."
    "他转过身，尾巴差点抽到你，然后一溜烟跑去拿他的东西了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7994
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_d9abec82:

    # "You hold onto the rope of the swinging table and slide yourself along the bench on the opposite side of the table from Wolf."
    "你抓住摇摇晃晃的桌子上的绳子，让自己沿着长凳滑到Wolf的对面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7996
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_6a16faa8:

    # "The black canine rests both his arms on the table and looks after Julian. Soft blue light comes streaming in through the port opening to give his side a rather beautiful soft sheen, along with a refreshing bit of breeze from outside."
    "黑毛狗把胳膊肘撑在桌子上，看着Julian。柔和的蓝色光线从舷窗照进来，给他那一侧镀上了一层好看的光晕，还带着外面清爽的微风。"

# game/script day2.rpy:7998
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_416e34dd:

    # "Something that is desperately needed below deck."
    "这玩意儿在下层甲板可是稀罕货。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8000
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_046ffac4:

    # "The silence between the two of you lasts for a while until you break it to try to ease the awkwardness."
    "你们俩沉默了一会儿，你率先打破沉默，想缓和一下气氛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8002
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_5b69ec3a:

    # p "Wasn't so bad then, was it?"
    p "其实也没那么糟，你说是不是？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8004
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_69734da3:

    # w "What was?"
    w "什么没那么糟？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8006
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_a3afb922:

    # "Wolf answers without taking his eyes off of Julian at the back of the deck."
    "Wolf眼睛盯着甲板后方的Julian，头也不回地问道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8008
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_4fb2ee73:

    # p "The morning shift, I mean."
    p "我说的是早班那会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8010
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_11b72522:

    # "The canine simply stays quiet and doesn't engage with your small talk beyond a brief glance at you."
    "那狗只是闷不吭声，除了瞥了你一眼，根本不想搭理你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8014
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_66efbd99:

    # "You let your claws trail through the rough grain of the table while you wait, and thankfully soon enough the sound of Julian's voice breaks the awkward wait, as he sits down beside you on the bench."
    "你百无聊赖地用爪子在桌子粗糙的纹路上划拉着，谢天谢地，没过多久Julian的声音就打破了这尴尬的沉默，他一屁股坐在了你旁边的长凳上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8018
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_70824d78:

    # j "Found 'em."
    j "找到了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8022
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_39b04c70:

    # "He casually flicks a small leather pouch onto the table, which lands with the rattle of the dice inside."
    "他随手一甩，一个小皮袋就扔到了桌上，里面传来骰子碰撞的声响。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8026
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_36e0823c:

    # j "Any preference for a game? Hazard? Raffle?"
    j "想玩什么？掷骰子？抽奖？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8028
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_de847be3:

    # w "Hazard has my vote."
    w "我选掷骰子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8030
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_5992b075:

    # j "Sure, Hazard's good."
    j "行啊，掷骰子不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8034
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_df44f476:

    # "You nod in agreement and watch as Julian picks two dice from the pouch. They were simple wooden dice, no paint, not even to mark the carved pips. They look like they could have even been made by Julian himself."
    "你点点头表示同意，看着Julian从袋子里摸出两颗骰子。就是简简单单的木头骰子，没上漆，甚至连点数都是随便刻的。看着就像Julian自己做的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8038
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_88f20f28:

    # "He set them in front of Wolf, who is happy enough to start with the first roll."
    "他把骰子递给Wolf，Wolf看起来很乐意先来一把。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8042
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_b0ee12de:

    # j "A bit of a gambler then, Wolf?"
    j "看来你也好赌，Wolf？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8044
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_042c800f:

    # j "Is that what brought you here? Gambling debts that left you in nothing but rags?"
    j "你来这是因为赌债缠身，输得一干二净？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8046
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_02a33352:

    # p "Come on, rags? It's a normal shirt."
    p "别闹了，一贫如洗？我这只是普通的衬衫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8064
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_265b8113:

    # "The dice land on 6 as Wolf rolls his main, accompanied with a scoff at Julian's comment coming from the canine."
    "Wolf掷出主点，骰子停在了6上。他对Julian的评价嗤之以鼻，那声音听起来就像是从狗嘴里发出来的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8066
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_5f099db4:

    # w "I don't really care what fancy boy thinks about how I dress, and I'm not stupid enough to get caught up in games to that degree, no."
    w "我才懒得管那些花花公子怎么看我穿衣服，而且我也没那么蠢，不会沉迷到那种赌博里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8071
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_a452b17f:

    # w "But betting on a good bottle of wine as the sun sets behind the tree line?"
    w "要说在夕阳西下的时候，赌一瓶好酒？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8073
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_2049af0f:

    # w "Now those are some memories."
    w "那倒真是些美好的回忆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8075
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_c70af399:

    # w "Naturally I won that bet. Maybe if I hadn't, I wouldn't remember it so fondly."
    w "那次我当然赢了。也许要是输了，我就不会这么津津乐道了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8090
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_b8cac094:

    # "Another roll follows, a chance 10 at first, sending him hunting for another 10 now, though the next roll comes up as an 8."
    "紧接着他又掷了一次，第一次是个机会点10，他想着再来一个10，结果下次却掷出了个8。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8092
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_487d22dc:

    # j "Well, no such luck just yet, it seems."
    j "看来这次没那么走运。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8094
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_ce6344cd:

    # p "What wine was it?"
    p "那是什么酒？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8100
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_80b939e8:

    # "Wolf scoops up the dice again to prepare for the next roll."
    "Wolf又抓起骰子，准备下一次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8102
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_99ec705e:

    # w "Fuck if I know.{w} All I know is that it tasted good and got me drunk."
    w "我他妈的哪儿记得。{w}我就记得那玩意儿好喝，能把我灌醉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8104
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_7cf27b24:

    # j "Such a connoisseur. If you could bet on expensive wine, you must have done pretty well back then."
    j "真是个懂酒的。要是能赌得起好酒，那你那时候肯定混得不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8106
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_2725f3c2:

    # "The dice roll again with a hollow wooden clacking."
    "骰子再次滚动，发出空洞的木头撞击声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8111
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_19f7d70e:

    # w "If you take me for one then, I honestly don't know what to tell you, and... well, I had my ways."
    w "你要是觉得我是那种人，那我真不知道该说什么了，反正... 我有我的门道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8118
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_b7a47ae9:

    # j "Had your ways? I suppose I'm not the only one who breaks into someone's food stock to gorge myself all night long."
    j "你的门道？难道不是只有我才会偷偷摸摸地溜进别人的食物仓库，然后吃个通宵吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8124
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_9bed021b:

    # w "Nothing ever that childish, no."
    w "我才没那么幼稚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8131
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_7a5406cf:

    # "10! Much to Wolf's delight."
    "10点！Wolf 高兴坏了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8133
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_dc96e24f:

    # w "There we go. Maybe we should bet something after all if it's going to go like this."
    w "这就对了。要是这样下去，咱们还是赌点什么吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8135
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_5588a6c7:

    # p "Not me. I've got nothing to bet."
    p "我可没钱，赌不起。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8137
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_9815e2f2:

    # j "Let's keep it friendly for now. Maybe another day, when your luck is worse."
    j "先玩着吧。等你哪天运气更差了再说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8143
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_323d30bf:

    # "Wolf chuckles and collects the dice again. This time, however, he pushes them across the table to you instead."
    "Wolf 笑了笑，又拿起骰子。但这次，他把骰子推到了你这边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8158
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_5f851738:

    # "You take them and roll for your main. Twice in a row you come up with invalid rolls until you manage to roll an 8."
    "你拿起骰子，掷主点。连续两次都没掷出有效点数，最后才掷出了一个8。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8160
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_dae114f1:

    # w "What did Arthur want from you anyway, [name]?"
    w "Arthur 到底想从你这里得到什么，[name]？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8162
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_35a85b72:

    # "Wolf lifts a paw to rest his head on his knuckles as he watches you roll."
    "Wolf 抬起一只爪子，把头支在指关节上，看着你掷骰子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8164
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_f1cde9bb:

    # p "Ah... just...{w} I don't know, he just seems to see me connected to all problems somehow."
    p "啊... 只是...{w}我也不知道，他好像觉得所有的问题都跟我有关。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8166
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_310a513e:

    # p "Like I'm the cause of everything that goes wrong."
    p "就好像我是所有倒霉事的罪魁祸首。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8168
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_1fd6ba92:

    # "A subtle, what you assume may be a sympathetic growl comes from him in response."
    "作为回应，他发出了一声低沉的、听起来像是带着同情的呜咽。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8170
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_86447fc0:

    # j "I don't like him."
    j "我不喜欢他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8174
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_037146cd:

    # p "I don't think he's bad, I just can't quite make heads or tails of what he is on about..."
    p "我倒不觉得他是个坏人，就是完全摸不着头脑他到底在说些什么……"

# game/script day2.rpy:8178
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_aa5116c3:

    # p "I just can't quite make heads or tails of what he is on about..."
    p "我就是完全摸不着头脑他到底在说些什么……"

# game/script day2.rpy:8182
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_b458e964:

    # p "I agree..."
    p "我同意……"

# game/script day2.rpy:8184
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_1df5c814:

    # p "I'm not quite sure how he made it to where he is today."
    p "我真不太确定他是怎么走到今天这个位置的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8186
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_2d9b49a7:

    # j "My father told me a little bit about him."
    j "我父亲跟我稍微提过他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8188
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_65ea72d4:

    # j "He was a Captain in the military. Very well regarded and my old man was over the moon that I would learn under him."
    j "他以前是军队里的上尉，备受推崇，我父亲高兴坏了，我能在他手下学习。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8190
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_4e0792f1:

    # "Julian rests his head on the palm of his hand."
    "Julian把头靠在手掌上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8192
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_7ada6671:

    # j "So he has the credentials."
    j "所以他资历是够的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8194
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_fd7cf8b0:

    # j "But from everything I've seen so far I'm not sure if they aren't different Arthurs they're talking about."
    j "但从我目前看到的一切，我不确定他们说的和我们认识的Arthur是同一个人吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8196
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_76390622:

    # "Wolf reaches across the table and gives your paws a light nudge with his own."
    "Wolf隔着桌子用他的爪子轻轻推了推你的爪子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8198
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_ac66ca0b:

    # w "Roll the stupid dice, will you?"
    w "扔了你那臭骰子，快点！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8200
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_5d8cb10d:

    # j "Hey, my dice are not stupid. Be careful what you say, or you won't be allowed to use them anymore!"
    j "嘿，我的骰子才不蠢。说话小心点，不然以后不让你用了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8206
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_cfabe4ee:

    # "You do as you are told and try to de-escalate the moment by throwing your next roll..."
    "你按吩咐做了，并试图通过投掷你的下一次骰子来缓和气氛……"

# game/script day2.rpy:8208
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_742b71d6:

    # "But no luck, nor do you have much on the roll after that."
    "但没那个运气，而且在那之后的投掷也没什么好结果。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8210
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_faa96453:

    # w "As if that's a threat.{w} I've got all the winning cards in my hand here, lizard. Either I get to enjoy some dice, or I get to enjoy peace and quiet while you're busy far away from me."
    w "好像那是什么威胁似的。{w} 我告诉你，我手里的牌全是赢牌，蜥蜴。要么我玩玩骰子，要么你给我滚远点，让我清静清静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8212
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_3a7a518b:

    # "The smirk on Wolf's face was impossible to miss, his head tilted in your direction to give you a good chance to see the teeth gleaming past his lips."
    "Wolf脸上那抹得意洋洋的笑容，想忽略都难，他还把头朝你的方向倾斜，让你能清楚地看到他咧嘴露出的獠牙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8214
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_d510c476:

    # w "Certainly better cards than you, boy. One more roll, let's see if you've got it or if perhaps Arthur's right and we'll have to start avoiding you."
    w "肯定比你强，小子。再来一轮，看看你行不行，还是说Arthur说对了，我们得开始躲着你点了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8216
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_660f0d0f:

    # j "He'll get it this time."
    j "他这次肯定行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8218
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_002097bf:

    # w "Oh, he absolutely will not, lizard."
    w "哦，他绝对不行，蜥蜴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8220
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_904480f9:

    # "You pick up the two dice again and let them go for your third, and potentially last, roll."
    "你再次拿起两颗骰子，掷出你的第三次，也可能是最后一次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8240
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_23242b8a:

    # "No luck today..."
    "今天手气不好……"

# game/script day2.rpy:8242
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_de374c97:

    # "With a sigh you slump together on the bench and push the dice over to Julian."
    "你叹了口气，无力地瘫坐在长椅上，把骰子推给Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8248
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_6cea6ab6:

    # w "You are out. And you wonder why Arthur is after you."
    w "你输定了。怪不得Arthur要找你算账。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8250
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_1ddcd51d:

    # "Wolf teases you with the same smirk still present from before."
    "Wolf用和之前一样得意的笑容取笑你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8270
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_3ca8b3f5:

    # "Luck is on your side after all!"
    "看来好运最终还是站在你这边了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8272
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_7c78dc92:

    # "You smirk back at Wolf and pass the dice over to Julian."
    "你对Wolf露出一个得意的笑容，然后把骰子递给Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8278
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_9458be1b:

    # p "There's a lot of luck bundled up in this cat, I'll have you know."
    p "这只猫可是身怀很多好运的，我得让你知道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8280
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_59b0236e:

    # p "Maybe I'll have to watch you instead, and try to avoid you crossing my path."
    p "也许我得盯着你才行，免得撞上你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8282
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_c007b6f0:

    # j "Isn't that saying about black cats?"
    j "难道说的不是黑猫吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8284
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_e061b512:

    # "You can barely contain your wide grin as you try to make sure not to stumble over your words and mess up the next sentence."
    "你咧着嘴，笑容都快藏不住了，就怕一紧张说错话，把下一句也搞砸了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8286
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_473c464a:

    # p "Well, perhaps I wouldn't have confused it if he wasn't such a pussy cat and bet against me."
    p "哼，要不是他这个怂包跟我对着干，我也不会弄混了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8290
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_256a59dd:

    # "Wolf raises his hands defensively and leans back on the bench."
    "Wolf 举起双手，做了个投降的姿势，往长椅后背上一靠。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8292
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_2968d6e7:

    # w "Whoa, whoa, when did you grow some teeth?"
    w "哟，什么时候长本事了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8294
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_0142be3c:

    # w "Don't get cocky now just because you've won out once. Rest assured, I still have plenty of instinct left when it comes to fighting cats if I have to start teaching you some manners."
    w "别赢了一次，尾巴就翘上天了。放心，要是我真想教你点规矩，收拾你这只猫，我还是绰绰有余的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8296
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_1b1e3e70:

    # "Wolf teases you with the smirk still present from before, and as always it is difficult to judge just how serious he is about it."
    "Wolf 还是那副欠揍的笑容，让人摸不清他到底是不是认真的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8298
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_008d6bb9:

    # w "Come on Jules, your turn."
    w "到你了，Jules。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8300
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_876dd880:

    # "Julian stops in his tracks and scans Wolf with a questioning look."
    "Julian 停下脚步，狐疑地打量着 Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8302
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_1567f1c8:

    # j "Did you...?"
    j "你...？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8304
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_ef4c984b:

    # w "Don't make it weird right away, will you?"
    w "别一上来就这么不正经，行不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8319
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_34603473:

    # "You look back and forth between the two of them until the sound of the dice draws your attention.{w} It takes a second try, but in the end Julian lands on a 7 for his main."
    "你在他俩之间来回打量，直到骰子落桌的声音才吸引了你的注意。{w} 扔了第二次，Julian 总算是掷出了 7 点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8321
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_b3a06566:

    # w "Well, let's see how your luck stacks up to his."
    w "呵，让我看看你的狗屎运能比他好到哪儿去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8323
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_6e653164:

    # j "7 is my lucky number, so I don't have any doubt."
    j "7可是我的幸运数字，我对自己有信心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8328
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_c5375a63:

    # "His scale-covered hands reach for the dice again as he prepares for the next roll."
    "他那双布满鳞片的手再次伸向骰子，准备开始下一轮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8348
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_db89dd19:

    # "The throw sends the dice across the table, one of them with so much momentum that it was sent right off the table."
    "骰子飞过桌面，其中一颗力道太大，直接飞了出去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8350
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_1788579a:

    # "You try to catch it in mid-flight, but all you manage to do is knock it back into the air in an even wider arc."
    "你想在半空中抓住它，结果却把它碰得飞得更远。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8352
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_438492f3:

    # w "Was that enough to get you over excited? With a little more feeling next time."
    w "这样就让你欲火焚身了？下次再投入点感情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8364
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_c3e185f0:

    # "You go after the die and get down on your knees to collect it, and in the process apparently provide the two of them with a pretty pleasant sight."
    "你连忙去追骰子，跪在地上捡了起来，结果好像让他们俩饱览了一番风光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8366
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_790a8424:

    # j "Maybe I should toss them on the deck a little more often if you go after them so eagerly."
    j "看来我得经常把骰子扔到甲板上，你才会这么起劲地去捡。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8368
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_947d2c97:

    # "Wolf joins the appreciation with a chuckle, and when you turn around to hand the die back you notice both eyes trained firmly on you."
    "Wolf 笑着加入了欣赏的行列。你转过身，想把骰子递还回去，却发现他们俩的目光都直勾勾地盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8373
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_60335f6d:

    # p "Aren't you two a curious bunch?"
    p "你们俩还真是好奇宝宝。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8375
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_04b75b80:

    # j "I just had to make sure you wouldn't nick my die. Wolf though, he was staring at your ass."
    j "我只是怕你顺走我的骰子。至于 Wolf，他盯着你的屁股呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8377
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_f6bdb51a:

    # "Teeth fletch past the wolf's lips as he quietly turns to Julian, giving him a cold glare."
    "Wolf 静静地转向 Julian，冷冷地瞪了他一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8379
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_2234086b:

    # p "I guess that's fine? What am I gonna do... Tell him off?"
    p "就这样吧？我还能咋办... 骂他一顿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8381
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_5b5eecc4:

    # "You motion to Wolf who sat there, looking like a fitting degree of annoyance and anger was bubbling just beneath the surface."
    "你朝着坐在那里的 Wolf 努努嘴，他看起来像是怒火中烧，但又极力压制着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8383
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_6af2d881:

    # j "Is that the trick? Be gruff all the time and then I get to stare at your backside all I want?"
    j "这就是秘诀？只要一直装作凶巴巴的样子，就能随便盯着你的屁股看？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8385
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_0bf62ff4:

    # "You sit back down with a shrug and give the die back to Julian, who immediately goes for a repeat roll with a little more feeling this time."
    "你耸耸肩，坐回原位，把骰子还给 Julian。他立刻又带着更多的感情掷了一次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8387
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_a88fbeb7:

    # p "Works for him.{w} For you though I do like your cute approach."
    p "他吃这套。{w} 但我更喜欢你这可爱的小模样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8398
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_9ab3ecaf:

    # "You go after the die and get down on your knees to collect it, and in the process apparently provide the two of them with a pretty good sight."
    "你连忙去追骰子，跪在地上捡了起来，结果好像让他们俩又饱览了一番风光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8400
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_790a8424_1:

    # j "Maybe I should toss them on the deck a little more often if you go after them so eagerly."
    j "看来我得经常把骰子扔到甲板上，你才会这么起劲地去捡。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8402
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_43dec8d0:

    # "When you turn around to hand the die back you notice Julian's eyes trained firmly on you."
    "你转过身，想把骰子递还回去，却发现 Julian 的目光也直勾勾地盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8408
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_ca9faf84:

    # p "Aren't you a curious one."
    p "你还挺好奇的，嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8410
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_732edbd5:

    # j "I just had to make sure you wouldn't nick my die. Not my fault that you pick things off the ground with your tail raised so invitingly high."
    j "我只是想看看你小子会不会顺走我的骰子。谁让你撅着个屁股捡东西，尾巴还抬那么高，怪我咯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8412
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_5dd8d85b:

    # "Unable to avoid it you feel a faint hint of warmth flush across your snout."
    "你觉得脸上有点发烫，忍不住咧了咧嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8414
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_2f237e15:

    # w "You better not start talking about polishing wood again."
    w "你可别又开始没完没了地聊你的木头了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8416
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_2ca05f46:

    # w "I already have more thoughts about the two of you in my mind than I ever wanted to have."
    w "关于你俩的那些事儿，我脑子里想的已经够多了，真不想再多想了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8418
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_4f1392d7:

    # "You sit back down and give the die back to Julian, who immediately goes for a repeat roll with a little more feeling this time."
    "你坐回原位，把骰子还给Julian，他立刻又抓起骰子，这次更带劲儿地扔了出去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8429
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_d6e05db0:

    # "You go after the die and get down on your knees to collect it from the deck, and in the process apparently provide the two of them with a pretty good sight."
    "你去捡骰子，干脆跪在甲板上捡，结果倒是让他们俩饱览了一番风光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8431
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_55286957:

    # "When you turn around to hand the die back you notice Wolf's eyes trained firmly on you."
    "你转过身递回骰子，发现Wolf正两眼放光地盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8437
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_ca9faf84_1:

    # p "Aren't you a curious one."
    p "你还挺好奇的，嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8439
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_170f8a0c:

    # "A confident smirk spreads across Wolf's features as he watches you walk back to the table."
    "Wolf看着你走回桌边，脸上露出一个意味深长的笑容。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8441
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_12e178c3:

    # w "You take the opportunities you're given."
    w "机会来了就要抓住。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8443
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_4f1392d7_1:

    # "You sit back down and give the die back to Julian, who immediately goes for a repeat roll with a little more feeling this time."
    "你坐回原位，把骰子还给Julian，他立刻又抓起骰子，这次更带劲儿地扔了出去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8445
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_fea1d347:

    # p "Very wolf-like of you."
    p "真有狼性。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8456
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_d6e05db0_1:

    # "You go after the die and get down on your knees to collect it from the deck, and in the process apparently provide the two of them with a pretty good sight."
    "你去捡骰子，干脆跪在甲板上捡，结果倒是让他们俩饱览了一番风光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8458
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_02a27e79:

    # "When you turn around to hand the die back you notice Julian's eyes trained firmly on you. You return a questioning look to him as you sit back down and hand him the die."
    "你转过身递回骰子，发现Julian也正盯着你。你疑惑地看着他，坐回座位，把骰子还给他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8464
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_584258bd:

    # j "Just making sure you wouldn't nick my die."
    j "确认你没想偷我的骰子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8466
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_cc826fef:

    # p "I'm pretty sure you'd notice if the one die that dropped down went missing."
    p "少了一个骰子，我保证你能立刻发现。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8468
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_0de7b976:

    # "With both dice at his disposal Julian goes for a reroll, this time with less force to avoid a repeat of before."
    "拿回两个骰子，Julian再次掷出，这次他小心翼翼的，免得又飞出去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8483
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_dc81cab5:

    # w "A four? Well so much for your lucky number..."
    w "四点？ 看来你的幸运数字也不怎么样嘛..."

# game/script day2.rpy:8488
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_1f77094f:

    # "Julian immediately leans over the table to collect the dice again with an uncharacteristic grumble coming from him."
    "Julian立刻 наклоняется 过桌子，一把抓回骰子，嘴里不爽地嘟囔着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8490
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_d240e941:

    # j "You just wait, it's just charging and lulling you into a false sense of security."
    j "你等着吧，它这叫蓄势待发，让你放松警惕。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8492
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_8a69d0c6:

    # j "And then when the time is right, luck {i}STRIKES{/i}."
    j "等时机一到，好运就{i}砸{/i}你头上了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8494
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_fe6c7a83:

    # "The dice roll again and..."
    "骰子又开始转动了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:8509
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_51d54f72:

    # w "Twelve..."
    w "十二点..."

# game/script day2.rpy:8511
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_76e15e05:

    # w "Not much signs of your luck so far, is there?"
    w "看来你的好运还没来啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8513
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_65389062:

    # w "You sure you don't feel like betting something? Because I do rather feel like pulling something from your pockets."
    w "你真不打算赌点什么？ 我倒是挺想从你口袋里掏点东西出来的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8515
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_c7dc0fd3:

    # "The teasing smirk on Wolf's muzzle showed its full effect, with Julian thinking long and hard if he should push for a bet."
    "Wolf那副戏谑的表情让Julian陷入了沉思，认真考虑要不要加注。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8517
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_a17a1bf2:

    # j "The fife?"
    j "横笛？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8519
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_21de255a:

    # "Wolf recoils on the bench."
    "Wolf在长凳上猛地往后一缩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8521
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_76dd818c:

    # w "Fuck no!"
    w "别他妈想！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8523
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_7dc8f3ca:

    # w "I'm not putting up a gift as a wager, buy your own damn thing."
    w "我才不拿礼物当赌注，自己买去！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8525
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_678fec11:

    # p "Do we really want to start involving valuables? I thought we decided on it being just for fun..."
    p "咱们真要动真格的了？ 不是说好了随便玩玩吗..."

# game/script day2.rpy:8527
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_d27bd418:

    # j "Just don't get involved then. I have to teach him a lesson though, how about a favor then? The winner gets to have one favor to call up from the loser."
    j "不想玩就别掺和。我非得给他点教训，要不这样，咱们赌个忙怎么样？ 谁赢了就能让输的人帮他做一件事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8529
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_476391f2:

    # j "A dare or something, as long as no valuables are involved.{w} Sounds harmless enough to get you in as well?"
    j "打个赌什么的，只要不涉及贵重物品。{w} 应该没什么坏处，你也一起来怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8531
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_c4fa8cdb:

    # w "A dare? You really are a damn child, you know that?"
    w "打赌？你真是个幼稚鬼，知道吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8533
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_552498b8:

    # "Wolf leans back, raises his paws and shrugs dismissively."
    "Wolf向后一靠，抬起爪子，不屑地耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8535
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_4b1d8acb:

    # w "Fine, have it your way."
    w "好吧，随你便。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8537
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_6bc72b63:

    # "Julian turns to you to search for your answer with a glint of a smirk that suggests that he already has {i}something{/i} planned..."
    "Julian转向你，脸上带着一丝意味深长的笑容，好像已经{i}有{/i}什么计划了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:8539
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_38976cfb:

    # "Should you really get involved?..."
    "你真要掺和进去？……"

# game/script day2.rpy:8541
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_4ff76dec:

    # p "Not sure we can really have a fair bet with three of us. Do we just just pick our numbers and go for one roll? And the winner is on whichever the number belongs to that it lands on?"
    p "咱们三个人，这赌局真能公平吗？随便挑几个数，然后一掷定胜负？骰子停在谁的数上，就算谁赢，怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8543
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_4dd469bd:

    # w "Sounds good enough to me."
    w "听起来不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8545
translate Chinese day2_julian_wolf_dice_56cc7e4d:

    # j "Sounds good. What do you say, are you in, [name]?"
    j "行啊。你呢，[name]，要不要加入？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8573
translate Chinese day2_agreed_to_bet_6d76513c:

    # p "Count me in. I'll even be the one who only gets three of the possible numbers.{w} Some risk just adds to the fun, plus I'll win anyway, so what does it matter?"
    p "算我一个。我来选那三个数最少的一档。{w} 风险越大才越好玩，反正我肯定赢，怕什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8575
translate Chinese day2_agreed_to_bet_0843a33c:

    # "Julian responds with a playful push against your shoulder and a welcoming laugh."
    "Julian笑着推了你的肩膀一下，表示欢迎。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8577
translate Chinese day2_agreed_to_bet_f9e85301:

    # j "As if. But it's cute that you actually believe you're going to win."
    j "是吗？你还真觉得自己能赢啊，真有意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8579
translate Chinese day2_agreed_to_bet_4836094a:

    # j "Right, so do you want 2, 3 and 4?"
    j "行，那你要2、3、4？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8581
translate Chinese day2_agreed_to_bet_1a6dc7b7:

    # j "I'll go for 5, 6, 7, and 8, and Wolf gets the rest up to 12?"
    j "我要5、6、7、8，剩下的到12都归Wolf怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8583
translate Chinese day2_agreed_to_bet_c7e528ea:

    # "Both you and Wolf give him an affirmative nod and with a last glance he makes sure neither you, nor Wolf, have anything more to say before he rolls the dice across the table with a flick of his wrist."
    "你和Wolf都点点头表示同意。他最后扫了你和Wolf一眼，见你们都没意见，手腕一抖，骰子就飞过桌面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8585
translate Chinese day2_agreed_to_bet_6fecedea:

    # "With something on the line, all of a sudden they appear to roll in that much more of a dramatic fashion, dancing from one of their edges to the next until"
    "好像下了注之后，这骰子也跟着变得更有戏剧性了，在桌面上从一个边跳到另一个边，直到——"

# game/script day2.rpy:8638
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_cf237a8e:

    # "You decide you'd rather not put anything on the line so early on."
    "你觉得这么早就冒险不太好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8640
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_09b51faf:

    # p "No, no thanks. Someone has to stay neutral to keep you two from tearing each other apart."
    p "不，不用了，谢谢。总得有个人保持中立，免得你们俩打起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8642
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_e11d0647:

    # "Julian laughs while Wolf rolls his eyes. The lizard then runs the dice between his hands with a little flourish."
    "Julian笑了，Wolf则翻了个白眼。然后那蜥蜴耍了个花招，在手中转着骰子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8646
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_0f51545b:

    # j "Sounds like someone is afraid of these lucky hands! But come on, [name], are you really so scared of owing me a favor? I wouldn't ask you to do anything {i}too{/i} humiliating."
    j "听起来有人是怕了这双手气啊！ 拜托，[name]，你真就这么怕欠我人情？我保证不会让你做{i}太{/i}难堪的事情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8651
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_840b8f60:

    # w "Liar."
    w "骗人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8655
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_3b871130:

    # j "You quaking in your boots too, Wolf? Why even play against me, then?"
    j "Wolf，你也怂了？那你还跟我赌个什么劲儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8657
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_2dbc4f97:

    # w "For the look on your face when you lose."
    w "就为了看你输的时候是什么表情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8661
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_39e13517:

    # j "It's cute of you to actually believe you're going to win. I didn't know you did cute."
    j "你还真觉得自己能赢啊，真有意思。 没想到你还有可爱的一面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8666
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_856a8707:

    # j "Are you ready, then? Do we want to split the numbers for this roll?"
    j "准备好了吗？ 这次要分一下数吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8668
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_d51aa8e9:

    # j "I get 5 through 9, and you get the first and last three. Sounds good? You got the advantage that way."
    j "我拿5到9，你拿前三个和后三个，怎么样？ 这样你比较占便宜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8670
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_2c19b6fb:

    # "Wolf nods, fixing the lizard with his usual impassive look. Julian sighs theatrically, then turns to look at you."
    "Wolf点点头，还是那副面无表情的样子。 Julian夸张地叹了口气，然后转头看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8672
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_8459cf54:

    # j "Well, well, Mr. Neutral, do your best to keep the hound off me when he loses, alright? And keep your eyes on my hands. You just might learn something if you're brave enough to play next time."
    j "我说中立先生，到时候这猎犬要是输了，你可得拉住他，别让他找我麻烦。还有，好好盯着我的手，下次有胆子玩，没准能学到点东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8674
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_c2a392be:

    # "He flicks his wrist a few times, smirking."
    "他得意地笑了笑，抖了抖手腕。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8676
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_1074d8cb:

    # p "Keep talking like that and I'll let him have you."
    p "你再说，我就放Wolf咬你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8678
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_1859d9b4:

    # "Julian holds a hand to his chest in mock offense. Wolf huffs."
    "Julian装出一副受伤的样子，捂住了胸口。Wolf哼了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8680
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_fbbdc29f:

    # "Then, their gazes turn to one another. Julian straightens out, running a finger over a die, while Wolf meets his eyes. A sudden tension is in the air. The game is on."
    "随后，他们的目光交汇。Julian挺直腰板，手指拨动着骰子，Wolf也紧紧盯着他。空气中顿时充满了火药味，游戏开始了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8684
translate Chinese day2_declined_bet_cd6272df:

    # "With a flick of his wrist, Julian rolls the dice. The dance of tumbling edges linger on the table until..."
    "Julian手腕一抖，骰子便飞了出去。它们在桌面上翻滚飞舞，最终..."

# game/script day2.rpy:8724
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_c964bf61:

    # "... they land on [number]."
    "...停在了[number]点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8728
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_7667b6bb:

    # "The dice have hardly stopped before Julian slaps the table, jubilant. He stands, raising his arms to the air." with vpunch
    "骰子还没完全停稳，Julian就兴奋地一拍桌子，站起身来，高举双臂。" with vpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:8730
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_07c66fe8:

    # j "What did I tell you?! Witness the favorite of Lady Luck, gentlemen!"
    j "我早怎么跟你们说的？！都给我看好了，幸运女神的宠儿在此！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8732
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_76911c0d:

    # "Julian takes his seat again, arms folded and face smug. Wolf groans, placing his face in his hands. You can almost imagine him seeing his life flash before his eyes now that he owes Julian a favor. The canine then looks up at you."
    "Julian得意洋洋地坐了回去，双手抱胸，Wolf痛苦地呻吟一声，捂住了脸。他欠了Julian一个人情，估计现在眼前都开始走马灯了。随后，他抬起头，看向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8734
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_33f829c5:

    # "It's hard to tell if he's blaming you for this or envying you for not owing Julian any favors."
    "真难说他是在怪你让他欠了人情，还是在嫉妒你没掺和进来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8736
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_65612ebe:

    # p "Don't worry, Wolf. If Jules takes it too far, I'll allow you to toss him around. Savage him a little, even."
    p "别担心，Wolf。要是Julian敢得寸进尺，我就让你把他扔着玩。甚至可以揍他一顿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8741
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_fc98d993:

    # j "Whoa, whoa, whoa! I am a reasonable and even-handed man. I would never do something so crass as to humiliate my opponent after I've bested them! That's why my request is simple."
    j "喂喂喂！我可是个通情达理，甚至很-公平的人。我才不会那么low，赢了就羞辱对手！所以我的要求很简单。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8745
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_e8620e43:

    # "Julian then leans over the table, looking positively fiendish."
    "说着，Julian凑近了桌子，一脸坏笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8747
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_b5a7b713:

    # j "Wolf? Say something you {i}like{/i} about me."
    j "Wolf？夸我两句。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8752
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_f0ee0608:

    # "Silence reigns. You don't know if this is the real request or not. And judging by how Wolf scrutinizes Julian, he doesn't either."
    "现场一片寂静。你也不知道他是不是认真的。看Wolf那审视的眼神，估计他自己也不确定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8754
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_769a2898:

    # w "Are you fucking with me, lizard?"
    w "你他娘的耍我呢，蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8759
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_f5f7c621:

    # "Said lizard is leaning back now, beaming. He shifts one leg over another, then puts his hands in his lap, as if he is some dignified lady hearing out a suitor."
    "那只蜥蜴现在往后一靠，脸上堆满了笑容。他翘起二郎腿，双手放在膝盖上，活像个等着求婚的贵妇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8761
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_24011436:

    # j "Of course not! I am completely, one hundred percent serious."
    j "当然不是！我可是认真的，百分之百的认真。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8765
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_1549c942:

    # j "Because you, unlike {i}some{/i} people..."
    j "因为你嘛，和 {i}某些{/i} 人不一样..."

# game/script day2.rpy:8767
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_d567a612:

    # "He gives you a long look, as if to leave zero doubt who he was talking about."
    "他狠狠地瞪了你一眼，好像生怕你不知道他指的是谁。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8769
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_da494d09:

    # j "Don't appreciate me for my beautiful body and charming personality. So I want to hear one thing you do like."
    j "别光盯着我英俊的皮囊和迷人的性格看。说说看，你到底喜欢我哪一点？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8771
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_99547b8e:

    # "You have to appreciate Julian's ingenuity (and his beautiful body and charming personality). It was the perfectly crafted request; nothing too outrageous, but something the big fuzzball would struggle with."
    "你不得不佩服Julian的鬼点子（还有他那英俊的皮囊和迷人的性格）。这要求提得真是绝了，既不过分，又能让那只大毛球为难。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8775
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_9ed27bdf:

    # j "Because you, unlike some people, don't appreciate me for my many good features. So I'd like to hear at least one thing you do like."
    j "还不是因为你，不像某些人，光看到我的优点。所以，赏个脸，说说你喜欢我哪一点呗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8777
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_acb2cdc7:

    # "You appreciate Julian's ingenuity. It is the perfectly crafted request: Nothing too outrageous, but something the big fuzzball would struggle with."
    "你是欣赏Julian的鬼点子的。这要求提得真是绝了：既不过分，又能让那只大毛球为难。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8779
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_dee2979f:

    # p "Harsh, Julian. Harsh."
    p "Julian，你也太狠了吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8781
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_e71a314d:

    # "Wolf looks like he is still considering tossing Julian overboard. Eventually, he grunts, straightening out from a slouch."
    "Wolf看起来还是想把Julian扔下海喂鱼。最后，他咕哝了一声，从懒散的姿势中直起身子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8785
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_560f33ba:

    # w "Fine. You won. I keep my word."
    w "行吧，你赢了。我说话算话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8787
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_fc452f26:

    # "He then stares at Julian for a good little while, scrutinizing him to find a single thing to like about him. In response, Julian just keeps sitting pretty, or the best he can with the swaying of the ship."
    "接着，他盯着Julian看了半天，像是要把他从头到脚扫描一遍，好找出哪怕一丁点儿能喜欢的地方。Julian呢，就那么搔首弄姿地坐着，或者说，在船摇摇晃晃的情况下，他也就只能做到这样了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8789
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_1e16297c:

    # "Wolf grimaces."
    "Wolf皱起了眉头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8793
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_789a2c2c:

    # "He looks at you."
    "他看向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8795
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_3af5ee70:

    # w "Can't you help me out here? You've got a brain, unlike him."
    w "你就不能帮帮忙？你又不是像他一样没脑子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8797
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_5d9ec442:

    # "You hold up your hands."
    "你举起了双手，表示无奈。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8799
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_2e3505b1:

    # p "Sorry, I'm neutral here. Can't give you an unfair advantage."
    p "抱歉，我得保持中立。不能给你开后门。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8801
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_e3481d94:

    # "Wolf grunts."
    "Wolf 哼了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8803
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_31789c19:

    # "After another round of staring at Julian, Wolf finally answers:"
    "又盯着 Julian 看了半天，Wolf 才慢吞吞地说："

# game/script day2.rpy:8807
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_416782c3:

    # w "I like it when you sleep, because you don't talk."
    w "我喜欢你睡觉的时候，起码你闭嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8811
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_c9108713:

    # j "Oh, come on, that's not something you like about me. That's liking an absence of me, it doesn't count."
    j "别闹，那算什么喜欢我啊。你喜欢的根本是没我的状态，不算数。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8815
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_91181f1b:

    # w "I don't know then, damn it. Why do you assume there {i}is{/i} something I like about you, lizard?"
    w "我哪知道，见鬼。你凭什么觉得我就{i}一定{/i}得喜欢你，你这只蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8819
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_409b9f40:

    # j "Well, you agreed to this, for one. Playing Hazard and then the wager. And you said my name earlier."
    j "算啦，最起码你答应了玩牌，还跟我打了赌。而且你之前还叫了我的名字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8823
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_ca1bc00a:

    # "Julian counts on his fingers as he goes, then gets to the third and hesitates, trying to think of another reason."
    "Julian 掰着手指头数，数到第三个的时候卡住了，拼命想再找个理由。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8825
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_ef45bac2:

    # j "And... Well... There just has to be something."
    j "还有……肯定还有什么来着……"

# game/script day2.rpy:8827
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_491877c9:

    # p "You can think of something, Wolf. Our Julian isn't totally unlikable."
    p "你想想啊，Wolf。我们家的 Julian 又不是完全一无是处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8829
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_94c0cd3b:

    # w "'Our'? You can keep him."
    w "“我们家的”？送你了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8831
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_edb2cc72:

    # j "Cruel!"
    j "没人性啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8836
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_047c971e:

    # "Wolf then returns to staring at Julian, looking for the slightest detail to approve of."
    "接着 Wolf 又开始盯着 Julian 猛看，想从他身上找出一丁点儿优点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8838
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_eefddbf4:

    # "Eventually, he just sighs, resting his head on the table for a moment. A finger pushes a die around, watching it roll. Then, suddenly, he sits up straight. Something occurs to him, and he looks conflicted on whether to say it or not."
    "最后，他叹了口气，把脑袋往桌上一趴。一根手指拨弄着骰子，看着它滴溜溜地转。突然，他一下子坐直了。他好像想到了什么，又有点犹豫要不要说出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8842
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_2c6e100b:

    # w "You played my fife. I guess that's something you did, not something about you."
    w "你吹过我的横笛。不过这只是你做过的事，跟你人没关系。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8844
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_dd2d5b95:

    # "He thinks for a moment. Julian looks like he wants to say something, but for once, doesn't."
    "他在那儿琢磨着。Julian 看起来想说什么，破天荒地没吱声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8846
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_617f4c77:

    # w "You are very skilled. Talented. And you've helped me and him out a lot instead of holding that over us. Mostly."
    w "你手艺不错。挺有天赋的。而且你帮了我和他不少忙，也没拿这事儿压着我们。起码大部分时候是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8848
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_6a08ba8d:

    # w "It's the first time in a long time I've heard that fife play actual music. And I... appreciate that."
    w "我也好久没听过那支破笛子能吹出像样的调子了。我……挺感谢你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8850
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_61150f9c:

    # w "There, Julian. Are you happy?"
    w "行了吧，Julian。你满意了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8854
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_09ccb658:

    # w "You are skilled. You know a lot of shit. You're too pushy sometimes, but you've been helping me and him out a lot with this ship stuff. So I like that you're smart."
    w "你手艺好。懂的乱七八糟的东西也多。有时候是挺爱管闲事的，不过这段时间你一直在帮我和他处理船上的事儿。所以我喜欢你脑子好使。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8856
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_61150f9c_1:

    # w "There, Julian. Are you happy?"
    w "行了吧，Julian。你满意了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8858
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_07a30698:

    # "Said lizard looks like he wants to say something, but for once, doesn't."
    "那只蜥蜴好像想说点什么，难得的闭上了嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8862
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_bf9f20ac:

    # "Julian smiles, but not in that insufferable way he usually does."
    "Julian 笑了，不过这次不是他平时那种让人讨厌的假笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8864
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_3b22ec77:

    # j "Yes. Thank you, Wolf."
    j "嗯。谢了，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8868
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_c01af2dc:

    # "Then it goes right back into being a smirk."
    "然后他又露出了那种欠揍的笑容。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8870
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_c11a58f2:

    # j "The first of many things you'll come to like about me, I'm sure!"
    j "这只是个开始，以后你会喜欢上我更多地方的，我保证！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8872
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_f31657cb:

    # w "Don't count on it."
    w "想都别想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8874
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_c8085389:

    # "You laugh with Julian."
    "你和 Julian 一起笑了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8876
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_ede72822:

    # p "Well, you managed it, Wolf. I knew there had to be something. Even if it did look like you were pulling teeth."
    p "厉害了，Wolf。我就知道你肯定能说出点什么。虽然看着跟要了你的命一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8878
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_4452ae10:

    # w "He didn't say I had to like it."
    w "他又没说我非得喜欢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8880
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_nobet_ed88fd2d:

    # j "Next time I will!"
    j "下次一定！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8887
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_c964bf61:

    # "... they land on [number]."
    "...停在了[number]点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8891
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_641a5911:

    # "Julian leans over the table, staring at the dice as if they're lying to him. After a moment, he slinks back into his seat, throwing his hands in the air with a theatrical sigh."
    "Julian俯身在桌子上，盯着骰子，好像它们在对他撒谎。过了一会儿，他一下瘫回座位，夸张地叹了口气，手也无力地挥了挥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8895
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_87f5a8b5:

    # j "It seems like Lady Luck is setting up my dramatic comeback. Well, Wolf, you win. A deal is a deal; I am at your mercy. How does this general handle the vanquished?"
    j "看来幸运女神要助我绝地反击了。好吧，Wolf，你赢了。一言既出驷马难追；我任你处置。将军会怎么处置手下败将呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8897
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_aab5ef80:

    # "Wolf glares at Julian as the lizard mimics handing over his sword. The canine's gaze lingers, thinking, then his eyes narrow."
    "Wolf瞪着Julian，旁边的蜥蜴模仿着交出剑的动作。Wolf的目光停留了片刻，像是在思考，然后眯起了眼睛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8901
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_55e2118f:

    # "Julian tries to act casual, as if he is graciously waiting for Wolf's decision, but the long silence begins to get to him. His smile fades and then turns into a frown, before he looks at you."
    "Julian试图装作若无其事的样子，仿佛在耐心地等待Wolf的决定，但漫长的沉默让他开始坐立不安。他的笑容逐渐消失，转为愁眉苦脸，然后看向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8903
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_a280b74f:

    # j "Look at the way he's staring at me! I'm doomed."
    j "看看他盯着我的样子！我完蛋了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8905
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_ae0a7a33:

    # p "I'm sure Wolf won't kill you. He'll just think of the best way to make you suffer."
    p "我相信Wolf不会杀了你的。他只是在想怎样才能让你更痛苦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8909
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_585b6115:

    # j "But that's worse!"
    j "但那样更糟！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8911
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_f8cc794a:

    # p "Sorry, Julian, you agreed to the bet."
    p "没办法，Julian，是你自己答应打赌的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8915
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_ae5f5b79:

    # "Julian pouts, resigned to his fate."
    "Julian撅着嘴，认命了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8919
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_9b96e242:

    # "You're not totally willing to abandon him, however."
    "但你并不完全想抛弃他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8921
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_90c42390:

    # p "You could go easy on him, Wolf."
    p "Wolf，你对他手下留情点儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8923
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_d0344f0c:

    # "The canine speaks without breaking eye contact with Julian."
    "Wolf说话时眼睛仍然盯着Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8925
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_24898f12:

    # w "Why?"
    w "为什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8927
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_b7143dce:

    # p "This is the first game, we can keep it friendly until we're all settled, right? Besides, he's not {i}that{/i} bad..."
    p "这只是第一局，我们可以在大家都安顿好之前保持友好，对吧？而且，他也没{i}那么{/i}坏..."

# game/script day2.rpy:8931
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_df5f0b44:

    # "Julian perks up at you defending him. He gives you a smile, then turns to Wolf with pleading eyes."
    "Julian因为你帮他说话而高兴起来。他对你笑了笑，然后转向Wolf，用恳求的眼神看着他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8933
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_fd4b7b4d:

    # w "Nah. He agreed, just like you said."
    w "不行。他自己同意的，就像你说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8935
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_c71dbbd6:

    # w "I've decided. Lizard?"
    w "我决定了。蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8940
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_9b2e7aab:

    # "Julian shifts forward in his seat, looking equally curious and apprehensive."
    "Julian向前探了探身子，看起来既好奇又忐忑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8942
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_17697de5:

    # j "What is it?"
    j "什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8946
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_e0aa9b15:

    # w "Shut up for the next day. Not a noise until this time tomorrow."
    w "明天这个时候之前，闭嘴。一天之内不许发出任何声音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8950
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_c9fcda5e:

    # j "What? You can't be serious!" with hpunch
    j "什么？你不是认真的吧！" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:8954
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_038b122b:

    # "Wolf holds a finger in front of his snout, shushing Julian."
    "Wolf把一根手指竖在鼻子前，示意Julian安静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8958
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_0e09d8d9:

    # "Julian opens and closes his mouth a few times, then stops, frowning. Wolf holds a hand up to his ear, before turning to you."
    "Julian张了几次嘴，又闭上，皱着眉头。Wolf把手放在耳边，然后转向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8962
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_dec8c805:

    # w "Hear that? Sweet silence."
    w "听到了吗？多么美妙的安静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8964
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_1289a17a:

    # "You laugh at Julian's misfortune while the lizard mouths along with Wolf's words in a ridiculous, exaggerated way."
    "你嘲笑着Julian的不幸，而蜥蜴以一种滑稽、夸张的方式无声地模仿着Wolf的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8966
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_2c4f24d6:

    # "In response, Wolf just closes his eyes, shutting Julian out totally. The canine sighs, satisfied."
    "作为回应，Wolf只是闭上眼睛，完全把Julian隔绝在外。他心满意足地叹了口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8968
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_965d0567:

    # p "Usually, it's 'cat got your tongue', but I guess the wolf took yours this time, huh?"
    p "一般都说猫叼走了舌头，看来这次是狼叼走了你的舌头，嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:8970
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_nobet_f59177fb:

    # "You smirk, while Julian just folds his arms over his chest and rolls his eyes."
    "你得意地笑了笑，而Julian只是双手抱胸，翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8976
translate Chinese day2_player_win_c964bf61:

    # "... they land on [number]."
    "...停在了[number]点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8980
translate Chinese day2_player_win_49f1513c:

    # "Lucky you!"
    "多亏了我！/算你走运！"

# game/script day2.rpy:8982
translate Chinese day2_player_win_3eba3e55:

    # "With a jubilant smile you lean back, hands behind your head as you bask in the moment."
    "你兴高采烈地靠在椅背上，双手枕在脑后，沉浸在这美好的时刻。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8984
translate Chinese day2_player_win_58546e1a:

    # p "What was that again?{w} Good try though, Jules, but perhaps you should switch up your lucky number."
    p "刚才说啥来着？{w} 不错啊，Jules，不过你也许该换个幸运数字了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8988
translate Chinese day2_player_win_afe27ef7:

    # "He waves you off and dejectedly lets his head drop."
    "他不耐烦地挥挥手，沮丧地垂下了头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8990
translate Chinese day2_player_win_06950a52:

    # j "Yeah, yeah, just rub it in."
    j "行了行了，你就可劲儿地笑话我吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8992
translate Chinese day2_player_win_a8690c3e:

    # j "You got lucky once, don't think too highly of it.{w} However, a deal is a deal."
    j "你不过是瞎猫碰上死耗子，别太把自己当回事儿了。{w}  不过，说定了就是定了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:8996
translate Chinese day2_player_win_708f74c2:

    # "He turns to the side, grabbing his dice as he looks over at you."
    "他转过身，拿起骰子，打量着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9000
translate Chinese day2_player_win_1ecba510:

    # j "So, you got anything in mind for us? Hit us with your best shots!"
    j "怎么样，有什么好主意没？拿出你的看家本领来！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9002
translate Chinese day2_player_win_361b6e5b:

    # w "Or your worst."
    w "或者最烂的也行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9004
translate Chinese day2_player_win_837fd76f:

    # "You sit back and think. You hadn't really considered what to do if you won until now. A few possibilities rush into your mind..."
    "你往后一靠，开始琢磨。之前你还真没想过，万一赢了该怎么办。几个想法一下子冒了出来……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9013
translate Chinese day2_player_win_d3f70d80:

    # p "Julian, you seem like the guy that's been involved in a lot of stupid or funny things. Or both. Tell us one."
    p "Julian，我看你小子肯定没少经历蠢事和趣事。要不，说一个来听听？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9015
translate Chinese day2_player_win_02ae56f7:

    # j "I'm not sure if that's a compliment, but I'll take it as one. Hm, though, funny or stupid..."
    j "我都不知道这算不算夸我，不过我就当是夸我了吧。 呃，不过，说有趣的还是说蠢事呢……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9017
translate Chinese day2_player_win_4f2be625:

    # p "Or both."
    p "或者两者都有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9019
translate Chinese day2_player_win_971656bc:

    # w "Mostly stupid, I think."
    w "我想大概蠢事居多吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9021
translate Chinese day2_player_win_d5405c88:

    # "Julian quiets down, thinking.."
    "Julian安静下来，开始回忆……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9025
translate Chinese day2_player_win_ffba422c:

    # "The lizard then perks back up, looking between you and Wolf with a smile."
    "接着，那蜥蜴又来了精神，笑眯眯地看看你，又看看Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9027
translate Chinese day2_player_win_7152cb79:

    # j "I think I've picked something sufficiently entertaining and high brow for you two gentlemen!"
    j "我跟你们说，我选的这个故事啊，肯定够你们俩乐呵的，而且绝对够高雅！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9031
translate Chinese day2_player_win_e7fdcd08:

    # "You laugh a little while Wolf just scoffs."
    "你忍不住笑了出来，Wolf则是不屑地哼了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9033
translate Chinese day2_player_win_e5db152b:

    # p "Yup, just a regular few gentlemen around the table, all of us as high class as can be."
    p "可不是嘛，几个正经老爷们儿围着桌子，一个个装得人模狗样的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9037
translate Chinese day2_player_win_8aecc5f7:

    # "Julian nods along, then crosses his arms theatrically, suddenly looking serious and deep in thought."
    "Julian点点头，然后夸张地抱起胳膊，突然一本正经，陷入沉思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9039
translate Chinese day2_player_win_a7494583:

    # j "I'll bring you back to four years ago: an incredible caper, a plan that was in the works for weeks, the culmination of diligent long hours of work..."
    j "我要带你们回到四年前：那可是一场惊天大冒险，一个策划了好几个礼拜的计划，是我们辛辛苦苦的结晶……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9043
translate Chinese day2_player_win_e51feb0e:

    # "Wolf groans."
    "Wolf翻了个白眼，哼唧了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9045
translate Chinese day2_player_win_f4198355:

    # w "Get on with it. Stop grandstanding or we'll be here til dinner."
    w "赶紧说！ 别卖关子了，不然咱们晚饭都吃不上了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9047
translate Chinese day2_player_win_c17d9d60:

    # j "It's my story, Wolf, I get to tell it how I tell it!"
    j "这是我的故事，Wolf，我想怎么讲就怎么讲！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9049
translate Chinese day2_player_win_eae1a4ac:

    # j "Anyway, where was I? Yes, we had planned it all, and it worked swimmingly. Me and a gaggle of the other officers' kids sneaked to designated locations, under a trickle of light from the half moon, and took important things from each..."
    j "算了，我讲到哪儿了？ 对了，我们把一切都计划好了，而且进展非常顺利。 我和一群军官家的熊孩子们偷偷摸摸地溜到指定的地点，借着半隐半现的月光，把他们各自的宝贝都偷了出来……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9051
translate Chinese day2_player_win_92034f3f:

    # "He counts on his fingers as he lists them."
    "他掰着手指头开始数。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9053
translate Chinese day2_player_win_471462eb:

    # j "Grog. Tobacco and a pipe. Oil. Food, of course. A few instruments. And lastly... a musket, with shot and powder."
    j "朗姆酒。 烟丝和烟斗。 油。 吃的，那肯定少不了。 还有几样乐器。 最后…… 还有一支滑膛枪，带着弹药和火药。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9055
translate Chinese day2_player_win_874c5b11:

    # "You glance at Wolf, who is looking at the lizard incredulously."
    "你瞥了Wolf一眼，他正一脸难以置信地看着那蜥蜴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9057
translate Chinese day2_player_win_fc952200:

    # w "Drunk kids and a gun. Great combination."
    w "喝醉的熊孩子加枪，简直是作死啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9061
translate Chinese day2_player_win_89088885:

    # j "I know, right?"
    j "我说是不是？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9063
translate Chinese day2_player_win_ba45b231:

    # "Wolf rolls his eyes."
    "Wolf又翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9065
translate Chinese day2_player_win_be475ffd:

    # p "Anyway... What was this all for, Jules?"
    p "话说回来…… Jules，你们这到底是图啥啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9067
translate Chinese day2_player_win_4fd80bde:

    # j "A party, of course. Our party."
    j "当然是聚会了。我们自己的聚会。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9069
translate Chinese day2_player_win_a53d2dc2:

    # j "Living in the military is... stifling. Even when you're not in it, if you're around it, you're expected to hold up certain standards."
    j "在军队里生活简直…太压抑了。就算你没参军，只要身处那种环境，就得遵守那些条条框框。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9071
translate Chinese day2_player_win_c06e0a7b:

    # "He sounds bitter. Then he realizes he's getting a bit too serious, so he straightens out and brightens."
    "他听起来有点不爽。然后意识到自己好像太严肃了，赶紧打起精神，装出高兴的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9073
translate Chinese day2_player_win_0c68ce62:

    # j "That's why we wanted to do something on our own terms! Something fun and just for us. We figured we could get in a little bit of trouble for taking stuff, but it would be worth it."
    j "所以我们才想自己搞点事情！弄点开心的，只属于我们自己的乐子。我们当时想着，拿点东西可能会惹麻烦，但绝对值得。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9075
translate Chinese day2_player_win_3695c31b:

    # j "We would have control for that night. No discipline or anything."
    j "那天晚上，我们就是自己的主人。不用管什么纪律，什么规矩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9079
translate Chinese day2_player_win_0066c183:

    # "You listen in. Wolf is too, despite not looking at Julian. The canine's eyes are focused outside, but his ears twitch as the lizard speaks."
    "你仔细听着。Wolf也在听，虽然眼睛盯着外面，但那蜥蜴一说话，他的耳朵就动个不停。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9081
translate Chinese day2_player_win_de9655d2:

    # p "Sounds like a much-needed break for all of you. I can't imagine what growing up under that is like."
    p "听起来你们都挺需要放松一下的。我真没法想象在那种环境下长大是什么感觉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9085
translate Chinese day2_player_win_f6f74ab7:

    # j "Well, it produced the man you see in front of you, so it can't have been all terrible!"
    j "嗨，至少也造就了你眼前的我，总不至于全是坏处吧！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9087
translate Chinese day2_player_win_96114ea2:

    # "He laughs."
    "他笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9091
translate Chinese day2_player_win_50a95f46:

    # j "Anyway, where was I? Gathering everything went fine, as we all knew the place well. We snuck off a good distance away, struggled to set a fire for what felt like an hour, and then we started having fun."
    j "话说回来，我刚才说到哪儿了？总之，我们都熟门熟路，东西弄得很顺利。我们偷偷跑到离营地挺远的地方，费了九牛二虎之力才把火点着，感觉都快一个小时了，然后才开始玩起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9093
translate Chinese day2_player_win_4c137224:

    # j "Unsurprisingly, it took us very little to get drunk. Just one tot of grog had most of us swaying around, barely able to stand. We were laughing, struggling to light pipes or play music. With fire in my belly, I declared that I wanted to try firing the musket."
    j "结果不出所料，我们没喝多少就醉了。一小杯格罗酒下肚，我们大部分人都开始摇摇晃晃，站都站不稳了。我们一边笑，一边费劲地点烟斗、弄音乐。我当时喝得有点上头，就嚷嚷着要试试开枪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9095
translate Chinese day2_player_win_51bdf65b:

    # p "Did you even know how?"
    p "你会开吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9097
translate Chinese day2_player_win_ebff7b6b:

    # j "Of course not! But I had seen plenty of drilling, so I thought I could, you know, figure it out. Maybe I could have if I was sober."
    j "当然不会啦！不过我看过不少操练，就想着应该能…摸索出来吧。要是我没醉说不定还真行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9099
translate Chinese day2_player_win_a8334251:

    # "He then begins to mime his actions as he describes them:"
    "接着，他一边说一边开始比划："

# game/script day2.rpy:9101
translate Chinese day2_player_win_982b92ea:

    # j "I was leaning on the musket because I could barely stand, I poured in some powder from a horn, then took a minute to get the ramrod into the barrel. I've never missed a hole so many times in my life."
    j "我当时都快站不稳了，只能靠着枪。我从药盒里倒了点火药进去，然后费了好半天才把通条塞进枪膛里。我这辈子都没这么难对准过一个洞。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9103
translate Chinese day2_player_win_bef3d286:

    # j "I then try to shoulder it, trip a little, and then aim at a little sapling... And bam!"
    j "然后我就想扛起枪，结果绊了一下，对着一棵小树苗就…砰！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9105
translate Chinese day2_player_win_8d995714:

    # "He spreads out his hands, then shakes his right hand vigorously."
    "他摊开双手，然后使劲甩着右手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9109
translate Chinese day2_player_win_d502cd5c:

    # j "I way overfilled it with powder; some had spilled out onto my hand and caught the spark as well. Damn thing kicks me to the ground and nearly bursts, and my hand and arm get burned."
    j "我火药装太多了，都洒到手上了，结果火星子也给引着了。那玩意儿直接把我崩倒在地，差点炸膛，我的手和胳膊也烧伤了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9111
translate Chinese day2_player_win_936de098:

    # j "I'm sprawled out there, yelling, everyone is laughing, and the sapling is still there, mocking me."
    j "我就那么趴在地上，鬼哭狼嚎的，其他人都在那儿笑，那棵小树苗还在那儿，好像在嘲笑我一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9113
translate Chinese day2_player_win_bd4d37ca:

    # "You tilt your head, concerned."
    "你有点担心地歪了歪头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9115
translate Chinese day2_player_win_51821ef9:

    # p "Were you... alright? That doesn't sound pleasant."
    p "你…没事吧？听着可不太妙啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9117
translate Chinese day2_player_win_59c79d6b:

    # w "He's lucky he's alive, the idiot. Could have exploded in his face."
    w "他能活着就不错了，真是个白痴。差点就在脸上炸了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9121
translate Chinese day2_player_win_5adb3225:

    # "Julian stares at his hand. It seems fine now, at least. After a moment, he looks up at you and smiles."
    "Julian盯着自己的手。现在看起来好像没事了。过了一会儿，他抬头看着你，笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9123
translate Chinese day2_player_win_94d5d65d:

    # j "Oh, you know, it was just a burn. Wolf is right for once, though, it could have popped."
    j "哎，没事，就是烧了一下。不过Wolf难得说对一次，当时是真有可能炸膛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9127
translate Chinese day2_player_win_8fe8e4f5:

    # p "What happened next?"
    p "后来呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9129
translate Chinese day2_player_win_83dda5ac:

    # j "Well, something we stupidly didn't think about. Think about it this way: You're a soldier in a fort, it's the middle of the night, and you hear a shot in the distance."
    j "后来嘛，就发生了我们傻了吧唧没想到的事情。你想想，你是个堡垒里的士兵，半夜三更的，你听到远处传来一声枪响。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9131
translate Chinese day2_player_win_4d34ba35:

    # p "They'd go investigate."
    p "肯定得去看看啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9133
translate Chinese day2_player_win_fcceffc0:

    # j "Yeah."
    j "可不是嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9137
translate Chinese day2_player_win_6d08972d:

    # "He sits back down, but this time on the table, leaning his head on the rope. Wolf gives him an annoyed look as the lizard swings closer, tail brushing against the canine."
    "他又坐回桌子上，不过这次是坐在桌子边上，头靠在绳子上。Wolf有点不爽地看着他，因为那蜥蜴越靠越近，尾巴都扫到他了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9141
translate Chinese day2_player_win_38080b0f:

    # j "We didn't think of that because we were dumb kids. And me, I didn't think my dad would be the one to lead some men out to check on it. The damn workaholic."
    j "我们当时就是群蠢孩子，压根没想那么多。而且我做梦都没想到，带队出来查看情况的人会是我爸。真是个工作狂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9143
translate Chinese day2_player_win_55d885a5:

    # j "So, he finds all of us. He finds me sprawled out in the dirt, crying because my hand was burned. One of the other kids must have told him what happened. I just remember being hauled up to my feet by him grabbing my shirt."
    j "所以，他把我们都揪了出来。他发现我瘫在地上哭，因为手被烧伤了。肯定是其他小孩告诉他发生了什么。我只记得他一把抓住我的衣领，把我拽了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9145
translate Chinese day2_player_win_4ea41efb:

    # "By now, his showman's flair has died out. Julian flatly recounts the events, looking off in the distance as he rests his head against the rope holding the table up."
    "现在他没了那股表演劲儿，只是有气无力地讲着事情的经过，头靠在撑桌子的绳子上，眼睛望着远处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9147
translate Chinese day2_player_win_7c26224d:

    # j "He figures that I'm one of the ringleaders that inspired everyone there to disobedience. I wasn't really coherent enough to argue with him, still drunk and in a bit of shock from everything happening."
    j "他觉得我是带头闹事的人。我当时喝得晕乎乎的，再加上出了这么多事，脑子有点懵，根本没法跟他争辩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9149
translate Chinese day2_player_win_143f934c:

    # j "Then, he grabs a gun from one of the men he rode out with. Says he'll show me how to use it, that I need to know how when I join up. And that I need to be disciplined. So he grabs me and walks me through it, forces me to do it despite the burn on my fingers and hand. It... took a while."
    j "然后，他从跟着他来的一个人手里抢过一把枪，说要教我怎么用，还说以后要加入他们，必须学会。还得好好管教我。接着他就抓住我，一步步地教我，完全不顾我烧伤的手指和手掌，硬逼着我做。这事儿... 搞了好久。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9153
translate Chinese day2_player_win_7e98ecfb:

    # "Julian then realizes just how dreary he sounds as both you and Wolf just stare at him. He tries to laugh it off, smiling wide."
    "说到这儿，Julian才意识到自己语气有多沉重，你和Wolf都直勾勾地盯着他。他想用笑来掩饰过去，咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9155
translate Chinese day2_player_win_713e140e:

    # j "Well, you know, it was stupid kid stuff. I got drunk and fell on my ass and got in trouble for it all. Embarrassing!"
    j "嗨，你知道的，小孩子不懂事嘛。我喝醉了，摔了个狗啃泥，结果惹了一堆麻烦。丢死人了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9160
translate Chinese day2_player_win_b2448ae3:

    # "He laughs again. It's a nervous chuckle."
    "他又笑了，这次是尴尬的干笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9162
translate Chinese day2_player_win_d632120f:

    # p "Uh... I'm sorry that happened to you, Julian. That sounds awful."
    p "呃…Julian，对不起啊，你碰上这种事。听着真糟心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9164
translate Chinese day2_player_win_420423d5:

    # "Wolf looks unsure, but does speak up after a moment."
    "Wolf看起来有点犹豫，但还是开了口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9166
translate Chinese day2_player_win_f7deb93d:

    # w "Yeah. That sounds like it was bad."
    w "嗯。听起来确实很糟糕。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9172
translate Chinese day2_player_win_3e667a79:

    # "Julian's smile falters, but then he stands up, returning to the bench next to you."
    "Julian的笑容僵了一下，但还是站起来，回到你旁边的长椅上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9174
translate Chinese day2_player_win_81a7bf9e:

    # j "Oh, it's no big deal. I'm sorry to the both of you, I could have chosen a better story! That one wasn't as fun as I remembered."
    j "没事没事，小事一桩。抱歉啊，我不该讲这个故事的！没我想象的那么好玩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9176
translate Chinese day2_player_win_14eae234:

    # p "Yeah, it wasn't. Are you alright?"
    p "一点都不好玩。你没事吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9178
translate Chinese day2_player_win_ae8b1dbe:

    # j "Who, me? Of course!"
    j "我？当然没事！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9180
translate Chinese day2_player_win_2437ff23:

    # "He points at himself with both thumbs, then tugs on the plackets of his shirt. He beams, but is still a little embarrassed."
    "他用两个大拇指指着自己，然后拉了拉衬衫。他咧着嘴笑，但还是有点不好意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9182
translate Chinese day2_player_win_d48ac34a:

    # j "Anyway, there's still Wolf, right?"
    j "话说回来，还有Wolf呢，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9184
translate Chinese day2_player_win_0c973585:

    # p "If you're sure you're okay."
    p "如果你确定你没事的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9186
translate Chinese day2_player_win_029b13d3:

    # "Wolf looks deep in thought, staring at Julian. His look is less hostile than usual. Maybe he feels bad for the lizard? Wolf furrows his brow and shakes his head. He suddenly turns to you."
    "Wolf陷入了沉思，盯着Julian看。他的眼神少见的没什么敌意，也许是觉得这蜥蜴有点可怜？Wolf皱着眉头，摇了摇头，突然转过头问你："

# game/script day2.rpy:9188
translate Chinese day2_player_win_1262f94b:

    # w "What do you have for me?"
    w "你想让我做什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9199
translate Chinese day2_player_win_0a11c055:

    # p "Well, maybe I have something simple in mind..."
    p "行吧，没准我心里有个简单的想法……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9201
translate Chinese day2_player_win_d1d87288:

    # "You turn to look Julian in the eye, giving him a toothy, suggestive grin."
    "你转过身，盯着Julian的眼睛，坏笑着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9203
translate Chinese day2_player_win_92ad0182:

    # p "Hey, Jules. Is it true what they say about lizard guys?"
    p "嘿，Jules。他们说的那种事，你们蜥蜴人是不是都那样啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9208
translate Chinese day2_player_win_6a88fa30:

    # "The lizard looks confused until you slide closer and tap his hip."
    "蜥蜴先是一脸懵，直到你凑过去拍了拍他的屁股。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9210
translate Chinese day2_player_win_1509227f:

    # j "Oh, down there?"
    j "哦，是说那儿吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9214
translate Chinese day2_player_win_82bf20a6:

    # "Wolf groans at your flirtatious display, running his hands over his face."
    "Wolf受不了你这轻浮的样子，捂住了脸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9220
translate Chinese day2_player_win_efdd347e:

    # "Julian smiles, placing his hand on your thigh."
    "Julian笑了，把手放在你的大腿上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9222
translate Chinese day2_player_win_ccdf60d4:

    # j "Oh, I don't know what you're talking about. You'll have to show me, point at exactly what you want to know about, huh?"
    j "哎呦，我不知道你在说什么呀。那你得好好给我指教指教，指指你到底想知道什么地方，嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9224
translate Chinese day2_player_win_5aa19942:

    # p "Well-"
    p "这个嘛..."

# game/script day2.rpy:9228
translate Chinese day2_player_win_6c912158:

    # "Before you can say anything further, you are interrupted by Wolf."
    "话还没说完，就被Wolf打断了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9232
translate Chinese day2_player_win_2870f1e4:

    # w "Stop that. Seeing you two flirt is bad enough, I don't want to see you feel each other up."
    w "别闹了。看你们俩调情就够烦的了，别在我眼前动手动脚的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9236
translate Chinese day2_player_win_b4bae03d:

    # j "Oh, come on, Wolf... Going to turn down a show? Or is it just that you want to join in, hm?"
    j "哎哟，Wolf...想错过这场好戏？还是说你也想加入我们，嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9240
translate Chinese day2_player_win_29f74877:

    # "Wolf is silent for just a moment too long. He then glares at the both of you."
    "Wolf沉默了片刻，时间长得有点尴尬。然后他怒视着你们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9242
translate Chinese day2_player_win_fdca6c52:

    # w "Are you insane, lizard?"
    w "你他妈疯了吗，蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9246
translate Chinese day2_player_win_bbb77500:

    # "Julian grins, then turns to you, wrapping an arm around your shoulders, draping himself over you."
    "Julian笑着，转过身来，胳膊一伸，直接赖在你身上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9248
translate Chinese day2_player_win_94de864d:

    # j "Hmm... It seems like he didn't say no, [name]."
    j "看来他也没说不行，[name]。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9250
translate Chinese day2_player_win_e7aed3d9:

    # "You smirk, leaning into Julian and running a hand over his chest."
    "你得意地朝他一笑，靠向Julian，在他胸口轻抚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9252
translate Chinese day2_player_win_26d93dbf:

    # p "Yeah, noticed that too. Have anything to say to us, Wolf?"
    p "没错，我也发现了。有什么想对我们说的吗，Wolf？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9254
translate Chinese day2_player_win_5e47cb3c:

    # w "Fuck {i}off{/i}, both of you!"
    w "你们两个都给我滚{i}开{/i}！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9258
translate Chinese day2_player_win_b7cef2e3:

    # "You and Julian laugh as you disentangle from one another, but you give Wolf a wink as you do."
    "你和Julian笑着分开，还不忘朝Wolf抛了个媚眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9262
translate Chinese day2_player_win_f373a298:

    # "He breaks eye contact with you for just a moment."
    "他飞快地避开了你的目光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9266
translate Chinese day2_player_win_b912e6e5:

    # w "No. Fuck off, lizard."
    w "不行，蜥蜴，滚一边去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9270
translate Chinese day2_player_win_234f6cad:

    # p "Fine, fine. Jules?"
    p "好吧好吧。Jules？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9274
translate Chinese day2_player_win_15f1fa7e:

    # "Julian turns back as you give him another suggestive little smile. Your hand presses against his stomach, sliding very, tantalizingly low."
    "你带着暗示的笑容看着Julian，他转过身来。你的手按在他的肚子上，一路向下，极尽挑逗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9278
translate Chinese day2_player_win_2ff925f2:

    # p "You can demonstrate the answer to me later."
    p "这个答案，你晚点可以亲自演示给我看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9282
translate Chinese day2_player_win_9937f8ca:

    # "You hear the lizard swallow and see him sit up just a bit straighter. You cherish your victory over him in that moment."
    "你听到那蜥蜴咽了口唾沫，身子也坐直了些。你得意于你此刻的小小胜利。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9286
translate Chinese day2_player_win_53707a43:

    # j "Oh, yes, that sounds... very good to me."
    j "哦，是吗，听起来...真是太棒了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9290
translate Chinese day2_player_win_a5d62e96:

    # w "Enough. I don't want to know a god damn thing about what the two of you get up to together."
    w "够了！我他妈一点也不想知道你们两个会搞出什么屁事来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9295
translate Chinese day2_player_win_1293dc32:

    # "Julian frowns a bit, considering for a moment before speaking."
    "Julian皱了皱眉，思考了一下才开口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9297
translate Chinese day2_player_win_d875411c:

    # j "Well, yeah, I suppose. Assuming you mean the thing about our stuff being internal."
    j "嗯，对，大概是吧。如果你说的是我们内部的构造。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9299
translate Chinese day2_player_win_2aa4bea0:

    # "You deflate a bit at him no-selling your attempt at being flirty."
    "你看他压根没把你这挑逗当回事儿，有点泄气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9301
translate Chinese day2_player_win_8231aff3:

    # p "Oh. Well, uh. That's interesting. I was curious."
    p "哦。好吧，呃...挺有趣的。我就是好奇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9305
translate Chinese day2_player_win_0da56f50:

    # j "It's not really that different in function to external ones, in my experience. Gives us a slight advantage in a fight, though!"
    j "依我看，功能上其实和外置的没啥区别。不过，在战斗中确实能给我们带来一点优势！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9307
translate Chinese day2_player_win_d94d2113:

    # "Wolf grumbles at that."
    "Wolf嘟囔了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9309
translate Chinese day2_player_win_efef6115:

    # p "Well, thank you for the answer, Jules."
    p "好吧，谢谢你的解答，Jules。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9311
translate Chinese day2_player_win_136c381a:

    # j "No problem. For further anatomy questions, the doctor might know more."
    j "不客气。要是想了解更多解剖学问题，可以去问医生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9313
translate Chinese day2_player_win_bf156f64:

    # w "Enough talk about anatomy. You're hard enough to look at with clothes, don't need to know more."
    w "都说了别再聊什么解剖学了！你穿衣服我都嫌碍眼，更别说其他的了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9315
translate Chinese day2_player_win_1270982e:

    # w "Let's get back to the game. What do you have for me, cat?"
    w "先回到游戏上来吧。你有什么情报，猫？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9320
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ee112304:

    # "You scratch at your chin."
    "你挠了挠下巴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9322
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_84b2eb63:

    # p "It's more difficult for you, Wolf. I just don't know as much about you."
    p "这对我来说更难，Wolf。我不够了解你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9328
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_bba4069f:

    # j "It's an unfair advantage."
    j "这对我来说信息不对等。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9332
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_34d05ab1:

    # w "You don't need to know anything about me to ask for a favor."
    w "你不需要了解我任何事也能请我帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9334
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_59fbe793:

    # p "It makes it easier to know what you're okay with!"
    p "这样我就更容易知道你的底线了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9336
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_3229c2ef:

    # w "Just don't ask for anything weird and you'll be fine."
    w "只要你别提什么过分的要求就行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9338
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_67f3a734:

    # "You sit back for a moment and think. First you scrutinize Wolf, but when he gives you a look, you just stare at the table as you think instead."
    "你往后一靠，开始琢磨。你先是仔细观察Wolf，但他瞪了你一眼，你赶紧把目光移到桌子上，专心思考。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9354
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_1e80f56a:

    # "You're a bit indecisive today. You look at Julian, then Wolf, unsure. Eventually, you just turn to the lizard."
    "你今天有些拿不定主意。你一会儿瞅瞅Julian，一会儿瞧瞧Wolf，拿不准该选谁。最后，你还是转向了那只小蜥蜴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9356
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_8c4e41a2:

    # p "Hey, Jules. If you won, what would you want from Wolf?"
    p "嘿，Jules。要是你赢了，你想让Wolf干点啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9360
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_8f5da14a:

    # "Julian immediately looks excited, giving Wolf a devious little look."
    "Julian顿时两眼放光，冲着Wolf飞去一个不怀好意的小眼神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9365
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c8793841:

    # "The canine looks much less enthused, glaring at you."
    "灰狼脸上的兴致可就差远了，狠狠瞪了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9367
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_3893b948:

    # w "You can't be serious."
    w "你没开玩笑吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9369
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_797c8d16:

    # p "Sorry, Wolf. Couldn't think of anything."
    p "抱歉啦Wolf，我自己实在想不出要啥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9373
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_5bc439e3:

    # w "He cannot speak."
    w "他现在不准开口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9375
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_fcaf0e2e:

    # "Julian frantically mimes the act of writing."
    "Julian手忙脚乱地做起凌空写字的滑稽动作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9377
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_4a995c66:

    # p "I'll grant him to speak, but only for the duration of this favour."
    p "我特许他开口，不过仅限于提这个要求的当口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9379
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_970ad37b:

    # "Wolf looks like he wants to argue with that, to yell at you to pick anything else, but he just sighs, sitting back and looking annoyed."
    "Wolf看上去很想出声反驳，甚至想冲你咆哮让你换个别的要求，但最终只是长叹一声，背靠在椅背上一脸不爽。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9381
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_0aaefa6f:

    # j "Oh, come on, Wolf. Don't you trust me? I've been nothing but reasonable and even-handed with you."
    j "哎呀得了吧Wolf。难道你还不信我吗？我平时待你可向来合情合理、公道得很。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9385
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_e26fc203:

    # w "No. Without the cat's help you would have never touched that fife."
    w "少来。要是没有猫崽子搭手，你这辈子都休想碰那根横笛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9387
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_44c30ab0:

    # j "Then I know how to pick my friends and that says a lot about me!"
    j "那证明老子交朋友眼光独到，这本身就说明我很有人格魅力！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9391
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_f53ed799:

    # w "No. You and him kept pushing me about my fife."
    w "不。你跟他之前老追着我问横笛的事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9393
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_fc278230:

    # j "Well, we're not asking about it now, are we?"
    j "可我们眼下又没提那茬，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9395
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_83f02db1:

    # j "Look, my request is simple."
    j "听好了，我的要求简单得很。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9399
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_e8620e43:

    # "Julian then leans over the table, looking positively fiendish."
    "Julian随即探身趴在桌上，神色显得格外狡黠不怀好意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9401
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_b5a7b713:

    # j "Wolf? Say something you {i}like{/i} about me."
    j "Wolf？说句你{i}喜欢{/i}我身上的优点来听听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9403
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_f0ee0608:

    # "Silence reigns. You don't know if this is the real request or not. And judging by how Wolf scrutinizes Julian, he doesn't either."
    "全场登时鸦雀无声。你吃不准这到底算不算正经要求。而且看Wolf死死打量Julian的架势，他显然也摸不着头脑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9405
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_769a2898:

    # w "Are you fucking with me, lizard?"
    w "你拿老子寻开心呢是吧，蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9410
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_8b8d7755:

    # "Said lizard was leaning back now, beaming. He shifted one leg over another, then put his hands in his lap, as if he was some dignified lady hearing out a suitor."
    "那只蜥蜴这会儿身子往后一靠，笑逐颜开。他一条腿翘到另一条腿上，双手叠放在大腿上，摆出一副端庄名媛听求婚者表白的做派。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9412
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_24011436:

    # j "Of course not! I am completely, one hundred percent serious."
    j "怎么可能！我百分之百是认真的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9414
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c1988389:

    # "Wolf then turns to glare at you."
    "Wolf随即扭过头狠狠瞪向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9416
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c6ffbb65:

    # w "This is {i}your{/i} fault."
    w "这全怪{i}你{/i}惹的祸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9418
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_fc1331e3:

    # "You hold up your hands placatingly."
    "你赶紧举起双手作安抚状。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9420
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_32c63756:

    # p "Oh, come on, Wolf, surely it's not that bad?"
    p "哎呀得了吧Wolf，总不至于真有那么要命吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9422
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_9ce3d28f:

    # "You both turn back to Julian, who is beaming and looking at the two of you with bright eyes. He flutters them at you."
    "你们俩齐刷刷回头看向Julian，只见他满面春风，两眼放光地望着你俩，还故意冲你们眨巴着睫毛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9424
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_83d4981b:

    # p "Well, maybe so..."
    p "好吧，搞不好还真有那么要命……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9426
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_cd88fbb2:

    # j "Hey!"
    j "喂！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9430
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_2e7b50a8:

    # "You grin at him. Meanwhile, Wolf looks like he is still considering tossing Julian overboard rather than dealing with this. He does eventually just give a little grunt, straightening out from a slouch."
    "你冲他咧嘴笑了笑。与此同时，Wolf脸上的表情看上去就像是在认真琢磨到底是把Julian直接扔下船去痛快、还是在这儿听他胡闹。他最终只是闷哼了一声，直起刚才耷拉着的腰背。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9432
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_560f33ba:

    # w "Fine. You won. I keep my word."
    w "成。愿赌服输，我说话算话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9436
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_9fc6c99b:

    # "He then stares at Julian for a good little while, as if scrutinizing him to find a single thing to like about him. In response, Julian just keeps sitting pretty, or the best he can with the swaying of the ship."
    "他随即直勾勾地盯着Julian端详了老大一会儿，仿佛在竭力搜寻对方身上哪怕有一星半点值得夸奖的地方。而Julian则兀自端坐得像副画儿似的，至少在颠簸摇晃的船舱里极力保持着淑女端庄。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9438
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_5c7743d0:

    # "After a while, Wolf finally answers:"
    "过了好半天，Wolf终于憋出了一句："

# game/script day2.rpy:9440
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_81b84110:

    # w "I like it when you sleep because you don't talk."
    w "我挺喜欢看你睡着的时候，因为那时候你闭嘴不说话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9444
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c9108713:

    # j "Oh, come on, that's not something you like about me. That's liking an absence of me, it doesn't count."
    j "哎呀行行好吧，那哪儿算得上是喜欢我身上的优点啊。你那是喜欢我不存在的时候，这不算数！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9448
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_91181f1b:

    # w "I don't know then, damn it. Why do you assume there {i}is{/i} something I like about you, lizard?"
    w "那我他妈哪儿知道。你怎么就咬定老子身上{i}能有{/i}喜欢你的地方，蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9452
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_409b9f40:

    # j "Well, you agreed to this, for one. Playing Hazard and then the wager. And you said my name earlier."
    j "首先，你答应玩这场骰子了啊。玩了英国骰子还立了赌注。而且你先前还叫出了我的名字。"
    # 译注：Playing Hazard指英国古典双骰赌博游戏‘哈萨德’（Craps的前身）。

# game/script day2.rpy:9456
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ca1bc00a:

    # "Julian counts on his fingers as he goes, then gets to the third and hesitates, trying to think of another reason."
    "Julian一边数着手指头一边数落，数到第三根时停住了，搜肠刮肚地想找别的理由。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9458
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ef45bac2:

    # j "And... Well... There just has to be something."
    j "还有……呃……反正肯定能找出来的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9460
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_491877c9:

    # p "You can think of something, Wolf. Our Julian isn't totally unlikable."
    p "你肯定能想出来的，Wolf。咱们的Julian其实也没那么讨人嫌嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9462
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_94c0cd3b:

    # w "'Our'? You can keep him."
    w "‘咱们的’？你要想要自个儿留着去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9464
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_edb2cc72:

    # j "Cruel!"
    j "真无情！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9466
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_047c971e:

    # "Wolf then returns to staring at Julian, looking for the slightest detail to approve of."
    "Wolf接着又盯紧了Julian，试图抓出哪怕最细微的一丁点顺眼之处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9470
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_903b6dcb:

    # "Eventually, he just sighs, resting his head on the table for a moment. Then, suddenly, he sits up straight. Something occurs to him, and he looks conflicted on whether to say it or not."
    "折腾到最后，他长叹了一口气，把脑袋无力地往桌板上磕了一会儿。突然，他猛地挺直了身子。脑子里似乎掠过了什么念头，神情在说与不说之间挣扎踌躇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9474
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_2c6e100b:

    # w "You played my fife. I guess that's something you did, not something about you."
    w "你吹过我的横笛。我猜这算你干过的事，不完全算你身上的特质。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9476
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_dd2d5b95:

    # "He thinks for a moment. Julian looks like he wants to say something, but for once, doesn't."
    "他思忖了片刻。Julian张嘴似乎想抢白几句，但这回难得地忍住了没吭声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9478
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_617f4c77:

    # w "You are very skilled. Talented. And you've helped me and him out a lot instead of holding that over us. Mostly."
    w "你的手艺确实过硬。很有才华。而且你帮我和他搭了不少手，也没拿这事儿跟我们显摆邀功。大体上是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9480
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_6a08ba8d:

    # w "It's the first time in a long time I've heard that fife play actual music. And I... appreciate that."
    w "这也是很长一段时间以来，我第一次听见那根横笛吹出真正悦耳的乐曲。我……挺受用的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9482
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_61150f9c:

    # w "There, Julian. Are you happy?"
    w "行了吧，Julian。满意了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9486
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_09ccb658:

    # w "You are skilled. You know a lot of shit. You're too pushy sometimes, but you've been helping me and him out a lot with this ship stuff. So I like that you're smart."
    w "你确实有本事。肚子里装了不少真家伙。有时候确实招人嫌又爱逼人，但你在船上的活计上帮了我和他老大忙。所以，我挺佩服你脑子好使。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9488
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_61150f9c_1:

    # w "There, Julian. Are you happy?"
    w "行了吧，Julian。满意了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9490
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_07a30698:

    # "Said lizard looks like he wants to say something, but for once, doesn't."
    "只见那只蜥蜴张了张嘴好像想反驳两句，但这回破天荒地闭了嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9494
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_bf9f20ac:

    # "Julian smiles, but not in that insufferable way he usually does."
    "Julian嘴角泛起了微笑，但并非以往那种惹人生厌的得意神气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9496
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_3b22ec77:

    # j "Yes. Thank you, Wolf."
    j "满意了。谢谢你，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9500
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c01af2dc:

    # "Then it goes right back into being a smirk."
    "随后那抹笑意迅速又变回了平日里的玩世不恭坏笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9502
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c11a58f2:

    # j "The first of many things you'll come to like about me, I'm sure!"
    j "这准保只是你往后喜欢上我的头一桩优点，我敢打包票！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9506
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_f31657cb:

    # w "Don't count on it."
    w "你少做梦了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9508
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c8085389:

    # "You laugh with Julian."
    "你跟着Julian一块儿哄笑起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9510
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ede72822:

    # p "Well, you managed it, Wolf. I knew there had to be something. Even if it did look like you were pulling teeth."
    p "不管怎么说，你总算憋出来了，Wolf。我就知道肯定能找出来。哪怕你刚才的架势跟生生拔牙一样痛苦。"
    # 译注：pulling teeth是经典英语谚语，比喻如拔牙般费劲而痛苦。

# game/script day2.rpy:9512
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_4452ae10:

    # w "He didn't say I had to like it."
    w "他又没规定我必须乐意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9514
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ed88fd2d:

    # j "Next time I will!"
    j "下回我就加上这条！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9518
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_e44e329a:

    # w "Maybe next time you'll actually be the one winning."
    w "下回没准你才是赢的那一个呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9520
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_dcfeea65:

    # "Wolf turns to look at you."
    "Wolf转过头看向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9522
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_840f8514:

    # w "Have something next time."
    w "下回自个儿想好要啥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9524
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_bcd25ea7:

    # j "By all means, keep letting me get what I want!"
    j "随你们便，反正多让我得逞几次我举双手赞成！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9526
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_aa09e863:

    # p "Well, there's still Wolf's left..."
    p "那个，不是还剩Wolf的那份嘛……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9528
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_43730e9e:

    # w "What? That was the lizard's favor?"
    w "啥？刚才那出不是替小蜥蜴要的人情吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9530
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_aa0c5ccc:

    # w "We're done here, then."
    w "那就到此为止吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9534
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_e4d1815a:

    # p "Yeah, I think we are. That means back to silence for you, or what do you say, Julian?"
    p "对啊，我想就到这儿了吧。那意味着你又得闭上鸟嘴了，你意下如何，Julian？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9538
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_eabb0d99:

    # "The lizard glares at you."
    "小蜥蜴没好气地瞪了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9540
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_431c4054:

    # p "Sounds like we're done.."
    p "看来咱们谈妥了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9544
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_328ae1c8:

    # p "Um, yes. I guess so."
    p "呃，对。我想也是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9550
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_7eddadde:

    # "You turn your head back to Wolf, giving his body a long look."
    "你转过头，又把Wolf从头到脚打量了一遍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9552
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_5b46d769:

    # "Your eyes go over Wolf, looking over what you can see with his baggy, simple clothes. Muscular arms, broad shoulders, and intimidating scars contrast his impressively fluffy fur and intense, beautiful eyes. His stoic expression only makes him more intriguing."
    "你的目光在Wolf身上游走，将他包裹在宽松便服下的身躯尽收眼底。结实的手臂、宽阔的肩膀，还有那一道道骇人的伤疤，与他蓬松柔软的毛发和深邃迷人的双眼形成了强烈的反差。他那副冷峻禁欲的表情，更让人觉得神秘莫测。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9554
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_4934edfd:

    # "You look so hard you even notice a bit of his shirt that's beginning to fray."
    "你观察得极其仔细，甚至发现他的衬衫边角都开始脱线了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9556
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_519a4fa8:

    # "You then lean forward, resting your head on your hand propped up by an elbow."
    "你身子往前一探，手肘支在桌上，用手托着腮帮子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9558
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_f9d49a20:

    # p "Sooo... Wolf. You're older than me and Julian."
    p "所以…… Wolf。你比我和 Julian 都年长。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9562
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_dd895211:

    # "Wolf quirks an eyebrow at that, tilting his head."
    "Wolf闻言，挑了挑眉毛，微微歪头，似乎有些不解。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9564
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_3ac00444:

    # p "Means you have a lot of intimate experience, right?"
    p "那岂不是说，你经验很丰富？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9568
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_34024ed2:

    # "If anything, Wolf looks more confused. Julian, however, is taken aback."
    "Wolf听了这话，反而更加疑惑。一旁的Julian却大吃一惊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9574
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_1510e61f:

    # j "What? You're shooting your shot {i}again{/i}?"
    j "什么？你贼心不死，{i}又{/i}想勾搭他？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9576
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_d85565d9:

    # p "Shush!"
    p "嘘！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9578
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_5ca17fd9:

    # j "I really underestimated you, [name]. You're secretly as horny as they come, huh?"
    j "[name]，我真是小看你了。没想到你骨子里这么好色啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9582
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_6c0a93a5:

    # j "You're trying to flirt with {i}Wolf{/i}?"
    j "你想泡{i}Wolf{/i}？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9584
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_dc488277:

    # p "Shush! Not if you ruin it like this!"
    p "别拆台啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9586
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ce4f6ded:

    # j "I don't think he can flirt, man. Like, physically incapable of it. Has he even had sex?"
    j "我觉得他根本就不会调情，老兄。感觉他生理上就不行。你说他有没有过性生活啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9591
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_d9acc350:

    # "Wolf glares at the both of you."
    "Wolf 怒视着你们俩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9593
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_3c179b06:

    # w "Shut the fuck up, lizard."
    w "给老子闭嘴，蜥蜴佬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9595
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_b1dfad00:

    # w "As for you, cat... I'm not going to answer that. Come up with something else."
    w "至于你，小猫咪……这个问题无可奉告。换个问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9598
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_9a3b5cb0:

    # w "{cps=5000}As for you, cat... I'm not going to answer that. Come up with something else.{/cps}" nointeract
    w "{cps=5000}至于你，小猫咪……这个问题无可奉告。换个问题。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:9602
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_12f050ed:

    # p "Well... What if you told me in private? Without Julian?"
    p "要不……你私底下告诉我？就我们俩的时候？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9604
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_bc36beed:

    # "You panic."
    "你慌了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9606
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_f188d082:

    # p "Uh, I can mend your shirt! I noticed it's fraying a bit. Right there."
    p "呃，我可以帮你缝衬衫！我看到你这儿有点脱线了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9608
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_70450111:

    # "Wolf looks down at where you gesture, feeling the beginnings of a tear. He then looks back at you."
    "Wolf顺着你指的方向看了看，摸了摸那处快要撕裂的口子，然后又抬眼看向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9612
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_5695fa12:

    # j "So, you're saying you want to see him shirtless?"
    j "所以，你是想看他脱衣服？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9614
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_92e71158:

    # p "Not helping, Jules!"
    p "Jules，你越帮越忙！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9623
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_d2196e5d:

    # "Wolf stares at you for a while, ignoring Julian. Eventually, he shrugs."
    "Wolf盯着你看了半天，完全无视了Julian，最后耸耸肩，说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9627
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_6a8b8eab:

    # "Julian clearly can't believe that you even asked it."
    "Julian显然不敢置信你居然真的敢提这个问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9629
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_9c536618:

    # "Wolf stares at you for while. Eventually, he shrugs."
    "Wolf盯了你好一阵子。最后，他耸了耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9631
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_d3256a81:

    # w "Sure. Just so you can fix this, though."
    w "行吧。不过你得保证能摆平这事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9635
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_dbe62733:

    # j "You see? What were you thinking, of course he wouldn't-"
    j "你看吧？你到底怎么想的，他肯定不会…"

# game/script day2.rpy:9641
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_fb8475e2:

    # j "Wait, what?!"
    j "等等，什么？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9645
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_7a534fbb:

    # "You also ignore Julian, nodding at Wolf."
    "你也没搭理Julian，只是朝Wolf点点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9649
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_6f131c1e:

    # "You have never seen Julian's eyes become that large. He must not believe what he's hearing."
    "你这辈子从没见过Julian的眼睛能瞪得这般老大。他八成不敢相信自个儿的耳朵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9653
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_65b7337b:

    # p "Alright. Uh, thank you."
    p "好吧，呃，谢了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9657
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_63d49c1b:

    # j "You two are actually going to do this? What the hell? Am I hallucinating?"
    j "你们俩真要这么干？ 搞什么啊？我是在做梦吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9659
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ca6530c1:

    # w "On one condition. You tell the lizard nothing about what happens."
    w "有个条件，你别跟那只蜥蜴透露半个字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9661
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_d8a3ffd9:

    # p "Of course."
    p "当然。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9665
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_a362b381:

    # j "Oh my god.{w} You bastard!{w} You two are going to get up to so much!"
    j "老天！{w}你这混球！{w}你们两个肯定要搞出大新闻！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9669
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_cd7d2c6d:

    # j "Don't you want to combine our things? We can learn so much from each other!"
    j "要不咱们一起合作呗？咱们可以互相学习啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9673
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_4309ad3a:

    # w "No."
    w "不行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9677
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_2a30b737:

    # j "But-"
    j "但是——"

# game/script day2.rpy:9679
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_2f56fbd1:

    # p "Shush, Julian."
    p "闭嘴，Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9681
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_dc55d576:

    # j "Oh my god. You really are horny."
    j "我的天。你可真够饥渴的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9683
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_aa0c5ccc_1:

    # w "We're done here, then."
    w "那咱们就到此为止了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9685
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_675d3507:

    # p "Yep."
    p "那是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9689
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_36bd1091:

    # "Julian pouts."
    "Julian撅起了嘴，一脸不高兴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9691
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_b0cda00d:

    # p "That's it, then."
    p "那就先这样吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9702
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_42d0d45b:

    # "After what Julian says, Wolf simply stands up and walks away, leaving you two."
    "Julian说完，Wolf二话不说就起身走了，把你俩扔在那儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9704
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_65b8cce5:

    # p "Wolf, wait, I'm-"
    p "Wolf，等等，我…"

# game/script day2.rpy:9706
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_4cca5e5a:

    # "You try to call after him, but he's already gone."
    "你想叫住他，但他头也不回地走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9708
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_47c57d40:

    # "You sigh, running your hands over your face, upset."
    "你叹了口气，烦躁地用手捂住了脸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9712
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_116db6b4:

    # p "Fuck me. I fucked it all up."
    p "我真是个蠢货，全搞砸了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9716
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_d8084df0:

    # "Julian pats your shoulder."
    "Julian拍了拍你的肩膀安慰道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9718
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_6c41fba4:

    # j "There, there. You got pricked by brambles in the briar brush. It's to be expected."
    j "没事没事，你只是不小心被刺丛划到了而已，很正常。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9722
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_26334c70:

    # "You just lay your head on the table, until the ship sways it out from underneath you, and you fall to the floor in a heap. You look like the mess you feel like."
    "你直接把头埋在桌子上，结果船一晃，桌子也跟着挪开，你一下子摔到了地上，狼狈极了，简直就像你现在的心情一样糟糕。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9726
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_505ae736:

    # "Julian pulls you up, but it's just the two of you now."
    "Julian把你扶了起来，现在只剩下你俩了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9728
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_97c3daf0:

    # p "How will I talk to him after this? If he even spends another minute around us."
    p "出了这事儿，以后还怎么跟他说话啊？他还会愿意跟我们待在一块儿吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9730
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_edfbf94d:

    # j "You'll manage. You'll have to, we're stuck on a ship together."
    j "总会有办法的。必须得有，咱们现在可是在一条船上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9732
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_dd6abc6f:

    # "You just nod along, drained."
    "你有气无力地点点头，随声附和着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9735
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_1cd01281:

    # p "Wait, you're not free to speak just because he's not around!"
    p "等等，可别以为他不在场你就能自由开口说话了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9737
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_76fe1131:

    # j "! ! !"
    j "！！！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9745
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_32e03241:

    # p "Alright, alright, never mind that, then. I'll think of something else."
    p "好吧好吧，先别管这个了，我再想想别的办法。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9759
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_1e80f56a_1:

    # "You're a bit indecisive today. You look at Julian, then Wolf, unsure. Eventually, you just turn to the lizard."
    "你今天有些拿不定主意。你一会儿瞅瞅Julian，一会儿瞧瞧Wolf，拿不准该选谁。最后，你还是转向了那只小蜥蜴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9761
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_8c4e41a2_1:

    # p "Hey, Jules. If you won, what would you want from Wolf?"
    p "嘿，Jules。要是你赢了，你想让Wolf干点啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9765
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_8f5da14a_1:

    # "Julian immediately looks excited, giving Wolf a devious little look."
    "Julian顿时两眼放光，冲着Wolf飞去一个不怀好意的小眼神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9770
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c8793841_1:

    # "The canine looks much less enthused, glaring at you."
    "灰狼脸上的兴致可就差远了，狠狠瞪了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9772
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_3893b948_1:

    # w "You can't be serious."
    w "你没开玩笑吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9774
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_797c8d16_1:

    # p "Sorry, Wolf. Couldn't think of anything."
    p "抱歉啦Wolf，我自己实在想不出要啥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9778
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_5bc439e3_1:

    # w "He cannot speak."
    w "他现在不准开口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9780
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_fcaf0e2e_1:

    # "Julian frantically mimes the act of writing."
    "Julian手忙脚乱地做起凌空写字的滑稽动作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9782
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_4a995c66_1:

    # p "I'll grant him to speak, but only for the duration of this favour."
    p "我特许他开口，不过仅限于提这个要求的当口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9784
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_970ad37b_1:

    # "Wolf looks like he wants to argue with that, to yell at you to pick anything else, but he just sighs, sitting back and looking annoyed."
    "Wolf看上去很想出声反驳，甚至想冲你咆哮让你换个别的要求，但最终只是长叹一声，背靠在椅背上一脸不爽。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9786
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_0aaefa6f_1:

    # j "Oh, come on, Wolf. Don't you trust me? I've been nothing but reasonable and even-handed with you."
    j "哎呀得了吧Wolf。难道你还不信我吗？我平时待你可向来合情合理、公道得很。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9790
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_e26fc203_1:

    # w "No. Without the cat's help you would have never touched that fife."
    w "少来。要是没有猫崽子搭手，你这辈子都休想碰那根横笛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9792
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_44c30ab0_1:

    # j "Then I know how to pick my friends and that says a lot about me!"
    j "那证明老子交朋友眼光独到，这本身就说明我很有人格魅力！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9796
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_f53ed799_1:

    # w "No. You and him kept pushing me about my fife."
    w "不。你跟他之前老追着我问横笛的事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9798
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_fc278230_1:

    # j "Well, we're not asking about it now, are we?"
    j "可我们眼下又没提那茬，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9800
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_83f02db1_1:

    # j "Look, my request is simple."
    j "听好了，我的要求简单得很。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9804
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_e8620e43_1:

    # "Julian then leans over the table, looking positively fiendish."
    "Julian随即探身趴在桌上，神色显得格外狡黠不怀好意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9806
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_b5a7b713_1:

    # j "Wolf? Say something you {i}like{/i} about me."
    j "Wolf？说句你{i}喜欢{/i}我身上的优点来听听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9808
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_f0ee0608_1:

    # "Silence reigns. You don't know if this is the real request or not. And judging by how Wolf scrutinizes Julian, he doesn't either."
    "全场登时鸦雀无声。你吃不准这到底算不算正经要求。而且看Wolf死死打量Julian的架势，他显然也摸不着头脑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9810
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_769a2898_1:

    # w "Are you fucking with me, lizard?"
    w "你拿老子寻开心呢是吧，蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9815
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_8b8d7755_1:

    # "Said lizard was leaning back now, beaming. He shifted one leg over another, then put his hands in his lap, as if he was some dignified lady hearing out a suitor."
    "那只蜥蜴这会儿身子往后一靠，笑逐颜开。他一条腿翘到另一条腿上，双手叠放在大腿上，摆出一副端庄名媛听求婚者表白的做派。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9817
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_24011436_1:

    # j "Of course not! I am completely, one hundred percent serious."
    j "怎么可能！我百分之百是认真的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9819
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c1988389_1:

    # "Wolf then turns to glare at you."
    "Wolf随即扭过头狠狠瞪向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9821
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c6ffbb65_1:

    # w "This is {i}your{/i} fault."
    w "这全怪{i}你{/i}惹的祸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9823
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_fc1331e3_1:

    # "You hold up your hands placatingly."
    "你赶紧举起双手作安抚状。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9825
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_32c63756_1:

    # p "Oh, come on, Wolf, surely it's not that bad?"
    p "哎呀得了吧Wolf，总不至于真有那么要命吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9827
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_9ce3d28f_1:

    # "You both turn back to Julian, who is beaming and looking at the two of you with bright eyes. He flutters them at you."
    "你们俩齐刷刷回头看向Julian，只见他满面春风，两眼放光地望着你俩，还故意冲你们眨巴着睫毛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9829
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_83d4981b_1:

    # p "Well, maybe so..."
    p "好吧，搞不好还真有那么要命……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9831
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_cd88fbb2_1:

    # j "Hey!"
    j "喂！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9835
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_2e7b50a8_1:

    # "You grin at him. Meanwhile, Wolf looks like he is still considering tossing Julian overboard rather than dealing with this. He does eventually just give a little grunt, straightening out from a slouch."
    "你冲他咧嘴笑了笑。与此同时，Wolf脸上的表情看上去就像是在认真琢磨到底是把Julian直接扔下船去痛快、还是在这儿听他胡闹。他最终只是闷哼了一声，直起刚才耷拉着的腰背。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9837
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_560f33ba_1:

    # w "Fine. You won. I keep my word."
    w "成。愿赌服输，我说话算话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9841
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_9fc6c99b_1:

    # "He then stares at Julian for a good little while, as if scrutinizing him to find a single thing to like about him. In response, Julian just keeps sitting pretty, or the best he can with the swaying of the ship."
    "他随即直勾勾地盯着Julian端详了老大一会儿，仿佛在竭力搜寻对方身上哪怕有一星半点值得夸奖的地方。而Julian则兀自端坐得像副画儿似的，至少在颠簸摇晃的船舱里极力保持着淑女端庄。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9843
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_5c7743d0_1:

    # "After a while, Wolf finally answers:"
    "过了好半天，Wolf终于憋出了一句："

# game/script day2.rpy:9845
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_81b84110_1:

    # w "I like it when you sleep because you don't talk."
    w "我挺喜欢看你睡着的时候，因为那时候你闭嘴不说话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9849
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c9108713_1:

    # j "Oh, come on, that's not something you like about me. That's liking an absence of me, it doesn't count."
    j "哎呀行行好吧，那哪儿算得上是喜欢我身上的优点啊。你那是喜欢我不存在的时候，这不算数！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9853
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_91181f1b_1:

    # w "I don't know then, damn it. Why do you assume there {i}is{/i} something I like about you, lizard?"
    w "那我他妈哪儿知道。你怎么就咬定老子身上{i}能有{/i}喜欢你的地方，蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9857
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_409b9f40_1:

    # j "Well, you agreed to this, for one. Playing Hazard and then the wager. And you said my name earlier."
    j "首先，你答应玩这场骰子了啊。玩了英国骰子还立了赌注。而且你先前还叫出了我的名字。"
    # 译注：Playing Hazard指英国古典双骰赌博游戏‘哈萨德’（Craps的前身）。

# game/script day2.rpy:9861
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ca1bc00a_1:

    # "Julian counts on his fingers as he goes, then gets to the third and hesitates, trying to think of another reason."
    "Julian一边数着手指头一边数落，数到第三根时停住了，搜肠刮肚地想找别的理由。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9863
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ef45bac2_1:

    # j "And... Well... There just has to be something."
    j "还有……呃……反正肯定能找出来的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9865
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_491877c9_1:

    # p "You can think of something, Wolf. Our Julian isn't totally unlikable."
    p "你肯定能想出来的，Wolf。咱们的Julian其实也没那么讨人嫌嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9867
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_94c0cd3b_1:

    # w "'Our'? You can keep him."
    w "‘咱们的’？你要想要自个儿留着去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9869
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_edb2cc72_1:

    # j "Cruel!"
    j "真无情！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9871
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_047c971e_1:

    # "Wolf then returns to staring at Julian, looking for the slightest detail to approve of."
    "Wolf接着又盯紧了Julian，试图抓出哪怕最细微的一丁点顺眼之处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9875
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_903b6dcb_1:

    # "Eventually, he just sighs, resting his head on the table for a moment. Then, suddenly, he sits up straight. Something occurs to him, and he looks conflicted on whether to say it or not."
    "折腾到最后，他长叹了一口气，把脑袋无力地往桌板上磕了一会儿。突然，他猛地挺直了身子。脑子里似乎掠过了什么念头，神情在说与不说之间挣扎踌躇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9879
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_2c6e100b_1:

    # w "You played my fife. I guess that's something you did, not something about you."
    w "你吹过我的横笛。我猜这算你干过的事，不完全算你身上的特质。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9881
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_dd2d5b95_1:

    # "He thinks for a moment. Julian looks like he wants to say something, but for once, doesn't."
    "他思忖了片刻。Julian张嘴似乎想抢白几句，但这回难得地忍住了没吭声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9883
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_617f4c77_1:

    # w "You are very skilled. Talented. And you've helped me and him out a lot instead of holding that over us. Mostly."
    w "你的手艺确实过硬。很有才华。而且你帮我和他搭了不少手，也没拿这事儿跟我们显摆邀功。大体上是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9885
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_6a08ba8d_1:

    # w "It's the first time in a long time I've heard that fife play actual music. And I... appreciate that."
    w "这也是很长一段时间以来，我第一次听见那根横笛吹出真正悦耳的乐曲。我……挺受用的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9887
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_61150f9c_2:

    # w "There, Julian. Are you happy?"
    w "行了吧，Julian。满意了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9891
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_09ccb658_1:

    # w "You are skilled. You know a lot of shit. You're too pushy sometimes, but you've been helping me and him out a lot with this ship stuff. So I like that you're smart."
    w "你确实有本事。肚子里装了不少真家伙。有时候确实招人嫌又爱逼人，但你在船上的活计上帮了我和他老大忙。所以，我挺佩服你脑子好使。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9893
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_61150f9c_3:

    # w "There, Julian. Are you happy?"
    w "行了吧，Julian。满意了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9895
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_07a30698_1:

    # "Said lizard looks like he wants to say something, but for once, doesn't."
    "只见那只蜥蜴张了张嘴好像想反驳两句，但这回破天荒地闭了嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9899
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_bf9f20ac_1:

    # "Julian smiles, but not in that insufferable way he usually does."
    "Julian嘴角泛起了微笑，但并非以往那种惹人生厌的得意神气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9901
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_3b22ec77_1:

    # j "Yes. Thank you, Wolf."
    j "满意了。谢谢你，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9905
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c01af2dc_1:

    # "Then it goes right back into being a smirk."
    "随后那抹笑意迅速又变回了平日里的玩世不恭坏笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9907
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c11a58f2_1:

    # j "The first of many things you'll come to like about me, I'm sure!"
    j "这准保只是你往后喜欢上我的头一桩优点，我敢打包票！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9911
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_f31657cb_1:

    # w "Don't count on it."
    w "你少做梦了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9913
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_c8085389_1:

    # "You laugh with Julian."
    "你跟着Julian一块儿哄笑起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9915
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ede72822_1:

    # p "Well, you managed it, Wolf. I knew there had to be something. Even if it did look like you were pulling teeth."
    p "不管怎么说，你总算憋出来了，Wolf。我就知道肯定能找出来。哪怕你刚才的架势跟生生拔牙一样痛苦。"
    # 译注：pulling teeth是英语谚语，比喻如拔牙般费劲而痛苦。

# game/script day2.rpy:9917
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_4452ae10_1:

    # w "He didn't say I had to like it."
    w "他又没规定我必须乐意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9919
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_ed88fd2d_1:

    # j "Next time I will!"
    j "下回我就加上这条！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9923
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_e44e329a_1:

    # w "Maybe next time you'll actually be the one winning."
    w "下回没准你才是赢的那一个呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9925
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_dcfeea65_1:

    # "Wolf turns to look at you."
    "Wolf转过头看向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9927
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_840f8514_1:

    # w "Have something next time."
    w "下回自个儿想好要啥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9929
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_bcd25ea7_1:

    # j "By all means, keep letting me get what I want!"
    j "随你们便，反正多让我得逞几次我举双手赞成！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9931
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_aa09e863_1:

    # p "Well, there's still Wolf's left..."
    p "那个，不是还剩Wolf的那份嘛……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9933
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_43730e9e_1:

    # w "What? That was the lizard's favor?"
    w "啥？刚才那出不是替小蜥蜴要的人情吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9935
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_aa0c5ccc_2:

    # w "We're done here, then."
    w "那咱们就到此为止了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9939
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_e4d1815a_1:

    # p "Yeah, I think we are. That means back to silence for you, or what do you say, Julian?"
    p "对啊，我想就到这儿了吧。那意味着你又得闭上鸟嘴了，你意下如何，Julian？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9943
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_eabb0d99_1:

    # "The lizard glares at you."
    "小蜥蜴没好气地瞪了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9945
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_431c4054_1:

    # p "Sounds like we're done.."
    p "看来咱们谈妥了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:9949
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_question_328ae1c8_1:

    # p "Um, yes. I guess so."
    p "呃，对。我想也是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9955
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_eac56423:

    # p "Well... You're so serious and unflappable, Wolf. Has anything stupid and silly happened to you?"
    p "我说，你平时这么冷静沉着的，Wolf。 难道就没碰上过什么傻事糗事？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9959
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_3da070fe:

    # w "Beyond meeting you two?"
    w "比认识你们俩还离谱的事？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9961
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_aa4b2ca1:

    # p "Of course!"
    p "那当然！"

# game/script day2.rpy:9967
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_00c9f32a:

    # j "Not too original, are you?"
    j "你这家伙，一点新意都没有啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9969
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_3fe04e9e:

    # p "Shush, you."
    p "嘘，小声点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9973
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_c04d1982:

    # w "Well... Let me think."
    w "让我想想啊......"

# game/script day2.rpy:9975
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_531f4ec2:

    # "He is silent for a while, folding his arms over his chest as he looks out to the sea. Eventually, he shrugs, turning his head to you."
    "他沉默了一会儿，抱起胳膊，眺望着大海。 过了好一会儿，他才耸耸肩，转过头看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9979
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_289d5cd8:

    # w "Fell through a floor once."
    w "有一次，我掉进地板里了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9983
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_49fa7142:

    # "You look at him, expecting more. He just returns the stare."
    "你看着他，还想听更多。 他却只是盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9985
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_86e2a679:

    # p "...Is that it?"
    p "...就这？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9987
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_adc3e2cf:

    # "He nods."
    "他点点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9989
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_d2a192d6:

    # p "How did it happen?"
    p "怎么回事啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9991
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9995
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_5820203b:

    # w "Stepped on the floor and it broke."
    w "踩在上面，地板就塌了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:9997
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_a66671a2:

    # p "And were you okay after you fell?"
    p "掉下去之后，你没事吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:9999
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_b5e37073:

    # "He nods again."
    "他又点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10003
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_74e1e237:

    # j "Give it up, [name]. He wouldn't break under torture, that one. Nothing interesting to share."
    j "算了吧，[name]。 他啊，硬骨头一个，严刑拷打都撬不开他的嘴。 肯定没什么有意思的事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10005
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_0248fc0b:

    # "You huff, feeling a challenge now."
    "你撇撇嘴，这下倒激起了我的好胜心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10007
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_551613b5:

    # p "Well, why choose this story, Wolf? What made you think it was worth telling me?"
    p "哎，那你干嘛要说这个故事啊，Wolf？ 你觉得这事儿有什么好跟我说的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10009
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_f3b5304c:

    # w "Fell through a floor. You wanted silly, that's silly, isn't it?"
    w "掉进地板里了。 你不是要听傻事吗，这难道还不够傻？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10011
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_f864cea0:

    # p "Uh... Inherently? A little, I guess."
    p "嗯... 勉强算吧，大概。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10013
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_c8530a7e:

    # w "There you go."
    w "“那就好。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:10015
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_c43c34f1:

    # p "Was there anyone with you? Did they see you and laugh or something?"
    p "当时有人在你旁边吗？ 他们有没有看到然后嘲笑你？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10017
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_b53c4532:

    # w "Nope. Was alone."
    w "没，就我一个人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10019
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_a25d1b00:

    # p "Did you fall into something?"
    p "你掉进什么东西里面了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10021
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_4633632e:

    # w "Another floor."
    w "另一层地板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10023
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_2f96667c:

    # "You just look at him, stymied."
    "你彻底无语了，就那样看着他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10025
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_c4c57dc8:

    # p "Well... That's all I got, I guess."
    p "好吧... 看来就只有这些了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10030
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_3f89f98f:

    # "Julian laughs at your misfortune, patting your shoulder reassuringly."
    "Julian在一旁幸灾乐祸地笑着，拍了拍你的肩膀安慰你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10034
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_b9963edf:

    # j "Oh, you got off so easily, Wolf. I wouldn't have wasted my question like that!"
    j "哎哟，Wolf，你这可太轻松了。 要是我问，肯定不问这种没劲的问题！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10036
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_088a9ac1:

    # "The canine just shrugs."
    "这位老兄只是耸了耸肩，一脸无所谓。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10040
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_2922f1cf:

    # w "Are we done here?"
    w "我们到此为止了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10042
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option1_b8aa792f:

    # p "I guess."
    p "知道了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10052
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_114e2840:

    # "You think for a little bit, then shrug."
    "你稍作思索，然后耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10054
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_31f266d4:

    # p "Hey, Wolf. If you won, what would you ask from Julian?"
    p "嘿，Wolf。如果你赢了，想让Julian做点啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10058
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_776bbd3b:

    # j "What?! Come on, you've got to be joking!"
    j "什么？！ 别开玩笑了，成吗！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10060
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_bacd3ad4:

    # "You smirk at him."
    "你对他假笑了一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10062
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_a2bf2408:

    # p "What? I just thought it'd be funny."
    p "怎么了？我只是觉得挺好玩的嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10066
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_e89a3bd0:

    # j "Well, I'm not laughing!"
    j "我一点都不觉得好笑！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10068
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_a1abfeb3:

    # w "I am."
    w "我倒是觉得挺好笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10070
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_4578e19b:

    # "Wolf is not laughing."
    "Wolf可没笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10072
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_da427394:

    # "The canine in question is staring at Julian, evaluating the lizard who fidgets a little under the glare."
    "那只狗东西正盯着Julian，打量着这个在注视下有点局促不安的蜥蜴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10074
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_7059285c:

    # w "You've got to shut up for the next day. Not a noise until this time tomorrow."
    w "你从现在开始给我闭嘴，明天这个时候之前都不许出声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10080
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_4295f6a9:

    # j "What? You can't be serious!"
    j "什么？你不是认真的吧！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10082
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_038b122b:

    # "Wolf holds a finger in front of his snout, shushing Julian."
    "Wolf把一根手指竖在鼻子前，示意Julian安静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10086
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_e8e622cb:

    # "Julian opens and closes his mouth a few times, then stops, frowning. Wolf holds a hand up to his ear, before looking to you."
    "Julian张了几次嘴，又闭上，皱着眉头。Wolf抬手放在耳边，朝你示意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10090
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_dec8c805:

    # w "Hear that? Sweet silence."
    w "听到了吗？多么美妙的安静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10092
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_3e5f7491:

    # w "Thank you for making the smart choice. Benefits us both."
    w "感谢你做出的明智选择。这对我们都有好处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10094
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_1289a17a:

    # "You laugh at Julian's misfortune while the lizard mouths along with Wolf's words in a ridiculous, exaggerated way."
    "你嘲笑着Julian的不幸，而蜥蜴以一种滑稽、夸张的方式无声地模仿着Wolf的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10096
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_2c4f24d6:

    # "In response, Wolf just closes his eyes, shutting Julian out totally. The canine sighs, satisfied."
    "作为回应，Wolf只是闭上眼睛，完全把Julian隔绝在外。他心满意足地叹了口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10098
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_965d0567:

    # p "Usually, it's 'cat got your tongue', but I guess the wolf took yours this time, huh?"
    p "一般都说猫叼走了舌头，看来这次是狼叼走了你的舌头，嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10100
translate Chinese day2_player_win_wolf_option2_f59177fb:

    # "You smirk, while Julian just folds his arms over his chest and rolls his eyes."
    "你得意地笑了笑，而Julian只是双手抱胸，翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10126
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_c964bf61:

    # "... they land on [number]."
    "...停在了[number]点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10130
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_de07df9d:

    # "Julian firmly smacks the table with his open palm in jubilation, a broad smile crossing his snout."
    "Julian得意洋洋地用手掌狠狠地拍了一下桌子，一张大大的笑容爬上了他的蜥蜴脸上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10132
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_ed92dbb8:

    # "The impact of it sends the dice rattling on its surface and almost tipping one of them over."
    "这一拍，桌上的骰子都响了起来，差点把一个给掀翻。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10134
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_a642b109:

    # j "That's it. I knew I could rely on lady luck."
    j "就是这样。我就知道关键时刻还得靠幸运女神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10136
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_8d5699d1:

    # "Wolf dejectedly rests his jaw on his hand, looking at the still dice for a few seconds longer before leaning back on the bench."
    "Wolf无精打采地用手托着下巴，盯着那几颗一动不动的骰子看了几秒钟，然后往长椅背上一靠。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10141
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_315bfeb2:

    # w "Well, I guess it was a good try."
    w "好吧，看来我们尽力了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10143
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_f97dd71b:

    # p "Yeah, congratiulations, Jules. I guess that means you got a favor from us two."
    p "是啊，恭喜你了，Jules。看来这次你欠了我们俩一个人情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10145
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_ba334433:

    # p "Well, just let me know whenever you have something in mind."
    p "行，只要你想到了什么，随时吱声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10151
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_8ecac0d1:

    # "Without a moment's hesitation, the lizard reaches for one of the dice and gives it a good, hard flick with his index finger. Sending it flying off the table in the same manner as the first time."
    "那蜥蜴毫不犹豫地拿起一颗骰子，用食指狠狠一弹。“嗖”地一下，又像上次那样飞离了桌面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10153
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_0b1fc354:

    # "The wooden clacking disappears in the distance as it lands somewhere among the nearby barrels once again."
    "木头撞击的咔哒声消失在远处，骰子再一次落在了附近的桶子堆里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10157
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_8ae96b44:

    # "You watch the path of the die before turning your attention back to Julian.{w} The smile on his face widens until his teeth peek past his lips."
    "你看着骰子的轨迹，然后把视线转回到Julian身上。{w}他咧开嘴，笑得都露出牙了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10159
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_5107fdc4:

    # j "{i}Oops{/i}{w}, how clumsy of me."
    j "{i}哎呦{/i}{w}，真是不小心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10161
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_159127d8:

    # j "Would you be a dear and pick it up again?"
    j "你能帮帮忙，再捡回来呗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10165
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_e8d94030:

    # "Your eyes narrow as you look suspiciously at the lizard, before you slowly rise from the bench and get to your feet."
    "你眯起眼睛，一脸狐疑地看着那蜥蜴，然后慢慢地从长凳上站了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10167
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_c6696949:

    # p "This is the favor? To collect the die off the ground again?"
    p "这就是你说的帮忙？就为了让我再捡个骰子？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10171
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_b775dc35:

    # "Julian nods in return and sends you on your way with an aloof flick of his wrist. You scoot out from between the bench and the table and walk over to the barrels, searching for exactly where the stupid thing landed in the first place."
    "Julian点点头，手腕一甩，像赶苍蝇似的打发你走。你从长凳和桌子中间挤出来，走到那些木桶旁边，开始找那个倒霉玩意儿到底滚哪儿去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10173
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_cc82e4bf:

    # "After a short search you locate it hidden in a gap between two of them."
    "费了点功夫，总算找到它了，卡在两个木桶的缝里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10175
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_cfef39ae:

    # p "I assume you're after the whole \"tail raised high\" thing from before, aren't you?"
    p "怎么，还想看我再来一次“尾巴翘上天”是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10180
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_f0c826e3:

    # "Another affirmative nod comes your way as you look over your shoulder."
    "你回头看了一眼，他又点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10182
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_2834cffe:

    # w "You really are a lost cause..."
    w "你真是没救了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:10186
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_cf7e0888:

    # j "Just because I appreciate a good view when I get one? Just look at him."
    j "我就欣赏欣赏风景不行吗？你看看他那德行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10192
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_a6606b5a:

    # "You're on your knees just as before, more theatrically if anything, to play up the stupidity of the favor."
    "你还是像刚才那样跪在地上，甚至更夸张了，就为了显得这忙帮得有多蠢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10196
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_b55390a8:

    # "Wolf rests his forehead in his hand, trying to look as inconspicuous as possible while he watches the absurdity unfold..."
    "Wolf单手扶额，努力装作若无其事的样子，看着这出闹剧..."

# game/script day2.rpy:10198
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_d7e3416b:

    # j "And now drop the breeches."
    j "现在，把裤子脱了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10200
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_18d9acea:

    # "In an instant, Julian finds both you and Wolf looking at him with wide-eyed astonishment."
    "一瞬间，Julian就看到你和Wolf都瞪大了眼睛，一脸懵逼地看着他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10202
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_05febb9e:

    # p "You can't be serious..."
    p "你开玩笑的吧..."

# game/script day2.rpy:10204
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_3f534883:

    # j "I very much am. If you just do it the same way as before, it wouldn't be much of a favor, would it?"
    j "我可没开玩笑。要是你还像刚才那样，那算哪门子帮忙，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10206
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_226ad658:

    # j "I thought you looked great down there the first time, but I reckon it would look even better without your breeches in the way."
    j "我就觉得你刚才那样挺好看的，不过要是没那条裤子挡着，肯定更好看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10208
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_f0d3c493:

    # j "Sooooo... ?"
    j "所以... 到底怎么样啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10210
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_44f0193d:

    # "He points at you and signals for you to get on with your task."
    "他指指你，示意你赶紧干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10212
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_6c4defe9:

    # "He can't be serious..."
    "他不可能来真的吧..."

# game/script day2.rpy:10214
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_e4dbbc41:

    # "You can't be serious about actually considering it, can you?"
    "你不会真打算照做吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10216
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_f4d03108:

    # p "Right here?"
    p "就在这儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10218
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_0add4a52:

    # j "Right here. Half the crew are busy anyway, most of the other half have probably gone back to sleep."
    j "就在这儿。一半的船员都忙着呢，剩下的一半估计都回去睡觉了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10220
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_cda490b6:

    # j "We're most likely one of the few dumb enough to stay up after taking the morning shift."
    j "咱俩大概是少数几个上了早班还傻了吧唧没睡觉的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10222
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_b33af7df:

    # "Julian cranes his neck to scan the surroundings before he continues."
    "Julian伸着脖子四处张望，然后压低声音说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10224
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_edb448c9:

    # j "Don't think anyone will see, so now's your chance."
    j "应该没人会看见，现在是机会。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10226
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_b1cebd24:

    # "That darn lizard..."
    "真他娘的是个色蜥蜴... "

# game/script day2.rpy:10228
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_f54e89d0:

    # "But a bet is a bet..."
    "但愿赌服输..."

# game/script day2.rpy:10230
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_d03bfe39:

    # "Fuck it."
    "豁出去了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10240
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_04ffc64c:

    # "With your knees on the ground and your back to them, you unbuckle your belt, grab the edge of your breeches and pull them down until they fall down fully."
    "你跪在地上，背对着他们，解开腰带，抓住裤腰，直接把裤子褪到了底。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10242
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_ed1ed4e5:

    # "Your long tail snakes out of the hole in them to sway behind you, and for the moment at least, your white shirt gives you a decent amount of cover."
    "你的长尾巴从裤子破洞里钻出来，在你身后摇摇晃晃。还好现在你的白衬衫还算长，勉强遮住了点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10244
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_2bfcba51:

    # "Not for very long though, as the shirt begins to rise over the curve of your rump as you bend over."
    "但这遮挡也维持不了多久，因为你一弯腰，衬衫就开始往上跑，露出了你浑圆的屁股。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10246
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_1f10cd55:

    # "Your white fur catches in the fabric as it is pulled gently against the natural flow. And while you fish for the die, the two guys behind you get the most intimate view of your behind."
    "白色的绒毛被衣料拉扯，逆着毛的走向。你费劲地摸着骰子，而你身后的两个家伙，也得以最近距离地欣赏你的美臀。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10248
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_f5b11ffd:

    # "You could hear a pin drop, nothing but the sound of the sea, the scraping of your fingers across the rough wooden floor, and the slide of the die as you pull it free."
    "周围安静得掉根针都能听见，除了海浪声，就是你的手指在粗糙的木板上摩擦的声音，还有你拔出骰子时，骰子滑动的声音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10250
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_684326a0:

    # "Your ears flush in a bright red, unsure if the silence is making it worse or not."
    "你感到双耳发烫，却又拿不准这尴尬的沉默到底是雪上加霜，还是欲盖弥彰。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10252
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_df0d309a:

    # "With the die in your possession, you raise to your knees again, keeping your back turned to them as you straighten your trousers, tighten your belt and adjust your shirt."
    "捡起骰子，你重新站起身，背过身去，一边整理着裤子，一边拉紧腰带，再把衬衫捋平。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10262
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_d36ef5b5:

    # "Their eyes are firmly trained on you as you turn around, leaving you in no doubt that you have indeed had a rather captive audience for your little performance."
    "你一转过身，就撞上他们直勾勾的眼神，毫无疑问，你刚才那番“小动作”可是被他们看了个一清二楚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10264
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_6db0a3d0:

    # "You walk back over to the bench and wordlessly place the die onto the table, holding your tail out of the way as you scoot back to your old spot and sit down next to Julian again."
    "你一声不吭地走回长凳边，把骰子往桌上一放，然后小心地挪回原来的位置，坐回Julian身边，还不忘把尾巴避开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10268
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_3b000a27:

    # p "Well. That's my favor done.{w} Was it satisfactory?"
    p "好啦，这下可算还清你的人情了。{w} 感觉如何，爷伺候得还满意不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10270
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_3f8795ad:

    # j "Very, although I feel like Wolf got a bit of a free ride."
    j "非常满意！不过我觉得，狼好像白捡了个大便宜啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10272
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_50b9f187:

    # w "You didn't tell me to leave."
    w "我又没说要走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10274
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_06220d46:

    # j "He's not too bad looking, is he?"
    j "说真的，他长得也挺带劲的，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10278
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_9f34f4eb:

    # "The canine simply averts his eyes, looking out of the porthole."
    "狼只是把目光移开，望向舷窗外的大海。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10282
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_8cc7d87e:

    # j "I knew you'd come around, Wolf. See? We have so much to connect over."
    j "我就知道你小子会动心的，狼。怎么样？咱俩还是有不少共同语言的嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10284
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_27712f89:

    # j "Music, dice games, a piece of ass."
    j "音乐，骰子，还有美人屁股。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10286
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_992bb2c6:

    # p "I'm sorry?"
    p "嗯？你说啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10290
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_d42ac75a:

    # j "Right, right.{w} {i}Your{/i} piece of ass."
    j "对，对。{w} 是{i}你的{/i}美人屁股。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10292
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_ca984660:

    # p "You winning was a mistake..."
    p "你赢了，是个错误......"

# game/script day2.rpy:10302
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_c270d969:

    # "Turning on your heel you find Julian's eyes trained on you, leaving you in no doubt that you have indeed had a rather captive audience for your little performance."
    "你一转身，就看到 Julian 正盯着你，你确信无疑，刚才那出“好戏”可是让他大饱眼福了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10304
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_6db0a3d0_1:

    # "You walk back over to the bench and wordlessly place the die onto the table, holding your tail out of the way as you scoot back to your old spot and sit down next to Julian again."
    "你一声不吭地走回长凳边，把骰子往桌上一放，然后小心地挪回原来的位置，坐回Julian身边，还不忘把尾巴避开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10306
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_1220150f:

    # "Wolf can barely look at you, instead looking out at the sea through the porthole."
    "Wolf几乎不敢看你，只是一个劲儿地盯着舷窗外的海面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10308
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_9c7b63ed:

    # p "Well, that's my favor done.{w} Was it satisfactory?"
    p "好啦，这下可算还清你的人情了。{w} 感觉如何，爷伺候得还满意不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10312
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_657e8d0f:

    # j "Very! {w}Wolf, did you even look?"
    j "准得很！{w}Wolf，你刚才到底看没看啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10314
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_8dc18b61:

    # j "I thought you'd appreciate the free ride."
    j "我还以为你会喜欢这种天上掉馅饼的好事呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10318
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_fa0bbc59:

    # w "I can't fucking believe that this is what you went for..."
    w "我真他妈不敢相信，你居然选了这种玩意儿......"

# game/script day2.rpy:10320
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_2fdefc32:

    # j "Why?"
    j "为什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10322
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_31835961:

    # "The canine snaps his head around to face Julian with a quizzical look."
    "Wolf猛地转过头，一脸疑惑地看着Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10324
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_fcc0b15e:

    # w "You ask {i}why{/i}?"
    w "你问{i}为什么{/i}？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10326
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_7978063f:

    # w "You winning was a mistake..."
    w "你赢了，是个错误......"

# game/script day2.rpy:10330
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_b69bbf93:

    # j "Oh, don't be like that. It's all in good fun. Next time around I might not be so lucky."
    j "哎，别这样嘛。大家开心就好。下次说不定就没这么好的运气喽。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10334
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_d9d0c43b:

    # j "Speaking of which, Wolf, your favor is still open... hmmm..."
    j "话说回来，狼，我还欠你一个人情呢…… 唔……"

# game/script day2.rpy:10336
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_a1692689:

    # "Julian slowly lowers his head and looks at the dice for a few moments, until Wolf realizes what he was contemplating."
    "Julian慢慢低下头，盯着骰子看了好一会儿，直到狼明白了他心里打的什么算盘。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10340
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_544167ae:

    # "Promptly, the snarl erupts onto his face as his eyes narrow and lock onto Julian."
    "狼的脸上瞬间布满了怒容，眯起眼睛，死死地锁定住Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10342
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_6d982a69:

    # w "Don't even think about it, lizard! {w}Or you really won't make it until tonight."
    w "你敢！蜥蜴佬！{w} 不然我保证你活不过今晚！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10346
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_04dd9ff4:

    # "Julian leans back and raises his hands disarmingly."
    "Julian向后一靠，举起双手，摆出一副人畜无害的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10348
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_a19e672f:

    # j "Hey, hey, I would never."
    j "哎，别激动，我怎么会呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10356
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_80532bc4:

    # "Julian thinks for a moment, rolling his shoulders. That big smile lingers on his face; he's still enjoying the afterglow of winning."
    "Julian摸了摸下巴，转动着肩膀，脸上还挂着那副得意的笑容，显然还沉浸在胜利的喜悦之中。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10358
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_c0cd4f12:

    # j "Well, seeing as this is the first time of many, I can be merciful. Say, [name], tell me... What do you think about the crew so far? Meet anyone interesting?"
    j "好吧，看在你这是头一回的份上，我可以稍微宽容点。说说吧，[name]，你觉得船上这帮人怎么样？有没有碰到什么有意思的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10360
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_cc41fe1a:

    # w "You're wasting it on that?"
    w "你拿那玩意儿干这事儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10362
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_80e810e4:

    # j "Just you wait for yours, Wolf."
    j "你就等着吧，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10364
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_2bac1717:

    # p "So, just everyone?"
    p "所以，你对所有人都不满意？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10368
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_ceceada0:

    # j "Everyo-"
    j "所有人-"

# game/script day2.rpy:10370
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_a7cf1484:

    # w "One, or we'll still be sitting here come tomorrow..."
    w "一个！不然咱们明天还耗在这儿呢……"

# game/script day2.rpy:10372
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_ae34f3fd:

    # j "But one is barely worth the favor!{w} Let's go with three."
    j "但就一个，也太不值当的了吧！{w} 咱说好了，三个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10374
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_68d16e78:

    # w "One."
    w "一。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10376
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_11a203fb:

    # j "Two?"
    j "两个？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10380
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_c598d863:

    # w "One..."
    w "一个……"

# game/script day2.rpy:10382
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_3520b31c:

    # j "Two."
    j "二。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10384
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_68d16e78_1:

    # w "One."
    w "一。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10386
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_35eae692:

    # j "One"
    j "一个"

# game/script day2.rpy:10390
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_98bd69b5:

    # w "Tw-"
    w "两-"

# game/script day2.rpy:10396
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_cba3b35a:

    # j "Hah!"
    j "哈！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10398
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_9416d3a7:

    # p "You are a god damn idiot..."
    p "你他妈真是个蠢货……"

# game/script day2.rpy:10402
translate Chinese day2_julian_win_4d225578:

    # w "Fine two, just be quick about it, will ya?"
    w "行行行，两个就两个，麻溜的，成不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10433
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_66ff2849:

    # p "Well, there's Arthur. I had to deal with him today."
    p "说起来，有个Arthur。我今天被他烦死了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10438
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_ba4715dc:

    # j "He seems like a real piece of work to me, like I said earlier. He's been riding your ass the entire time you've been here."
    j "我觉得他就是个事儿逼，我早就看出来了。你来了之后，他就一直盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10445
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_4d7e7820:

    # p "I don't know, it just looks like he cares a lot about getting everything right. I did nearly cause an accident when I first showed up, remember? It's not even been two days. He's just trying to make sure I'm not clumsy or bad luck, I'm sure."
    p "我倒觉得，他就是想把事情做好吧。我刚来那会儿差点出事儿，你们又不是不知道。这才两天不到，他肯定就是想看看我是不是个冒失鬼，或者是个扫把星，我觉得是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10447
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_ef2581ff:

    # "The two of them give you a look."
    "他们两个看了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10449
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_914ea96a:

    # j "He's not here, you know. You don't need to ride him like that."
    j "人都不在这儿，你犯得着这么说他吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10454
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_da6aa24c:

    # "Wolf gives a snort of amusement, which makes Julian grin."
    "Wolf轻蔑地笑了笑，这让Julian露出了笑容。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10456
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_fc91d58a:

    # "You glare at both of them."
    "你怒视着他们两个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10461
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_376f2476:

    # p "I'm serious. I'm just giving him the benefit of the doubt, alright?"
    p "我是说真的！我就是愿意往好处想，行不行？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10463
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_82462aa3:

    # j "Well, however you want to justify it to yourself, man. I just know I would hate the man if I were in your position."
    j "成成成，你想怎么安慰自己都行。反正要是我，早恨死他了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10465
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_04231ef0:

    # w "Get singled out a lot for being a nuisance, lizard?"
    w "你是不是经常因为碍手碍脚被人挑刺儿啊，蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10467
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_2354bbed:

    # j "Ye-No! I'm beloved wherever I go."
    j "是-不！我所到之处都受人爱戴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10469
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_05f44d45:

    # "You roll your eyes."
    "你翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10471
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_81ea0c1e:

    # p "{i}Anyway{/i}, my point is, we've only just started. If he's still like this in a month, I'll complain with the rest of you, alright?"
    p "{i}反正{/i}，我的意思是说，这才哪儿到哪儿啊。要是一个月之后他还这样，我跟你们一块儿骂他，行了吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10473
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_4881b137:

    # j "How honorable and even-handed of you. You're a valiant soul, Mr. [family_name], like the knights of old."
    j "哎呦喂，您可真是太高尚、太公正了！您就是个圣人，[family_name]先生，跟古代的骑士老爷似的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10509
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_2e34a8ae:

    # p "Yeah, it's really annoying. The only thing I've done so far is scrubbed the deck, right? And he's acting like I nearly sunk the ship. He's out there, stalking around, and every time I see him looking over at me it's like he caught me in the act."
    p "可不是嘛，烦都烦死了。我到现在就擦了个甲板，你说他至于吗？搞得我好像差点把船给弄沉了似的。一天到晚在那儿晃悠，我一看见他瞅我，就感觉自己干了什么坏事儿被抓包了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10511
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_4bf07774:

    # p "It's ridiculous!"
    p "简直离谱！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10516
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_47b93409:

    # "You catch yourself before you start to yell. Judging by the looks Julian and Wolf are giving you, though, you did get a bit animated."
    "你及时憋住了要喊出来的话。不过，看Julian和Wolf的表情，你刚才确实有点来劲了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10520
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_425d01a6:

    # "You sheepishly shift back on the bench while the lizard gives you a grin."
    "你不好意思地在长凳上蹭了蹭，那蜥蜴却冲你咧着嘴笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10524
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_6ef904de:

    # j "My, my, the cat has claws after all."
    j "哟，看不出来啊，这猫也有伸爪子的时候。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10528
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_df729252:

    # "You give him a playful shove as he laughs. He then gives you a sympathetic nod."
    "你笑着 হালকা 推了他一把。他回过头来，带着点同情点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10532
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_12e43de7:

    # j "I'd feel the same way in your position, though. Being the designated target of an officer's ire isn't fun. They'll blame you for anything."
    j "我要是你，我也一样憋屈。谁乐意当官老爷的出气筒啊。什么事儿都往你身上赖。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10534
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_04231ef0_1:

    # w "Get singled out a lot for being a nuisance, lizard?"
    w "你是不是经常因为碍手碍脚被人挑刺儿啊，蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10536
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_2354bbed_1:

    # j "Ye-No! I'm beloved wherever I go."
    j "是-不！我所到之处都受人爱戴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10538
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_f0bc84f7:

    # "Wolf gives Julian a look, which the lizard ignores."
    "Wolf瞥了Julian一眼，那蜥蜴压根儿没搭理他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10540
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_d183da57:

    # j "My point is, you have my sympathy. And we'll help you out if Arthur ever starts trying to accuse you of anything, right, Wolf?"
    j "所以说，我是挺同情你的。要是Arthur敢没事找事儿，我们肯定帮你，是吧，Wolf？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10546
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_09dbb708:

    # "Wolf glares at Julian, but then hesitates."
    "Wolf瞪了Julian一眼，但又犹豫了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10550
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10554
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_e6ada114:

    # "Julian turns back to look at you, opening his mouth to say something, before he whips his head back to Wolf."
    "Julian转头看着你，刚要开口，又猛地把头扭向Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10556
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_4377f4f7:

    # j "You didn't say no?"
    j "你没说不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10558
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_ba13a923:

    # w "Don't make a big deal of it, lizard."
    w "别在这儿瞎咋呼，蜥蜴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10562
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_b6668f7d:

    # j "I don't know how you did it, [name], but you've tamed him already."
    j "我真不知道你是怎么做到的，[name]，这么快就把他给驯服了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10564
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_ad8d22cf:

    # "Wolf glares at Julian but doesn't rise to the bait."
    "Wolf狠狠地瞪着Julian，但没接茬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10600
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_0dcd5bef:

    # w "Leave me out of this."
    w "别扯上我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10602
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_b5f4b915:

    # "Julian turns to look at you, shaking his head."
    "Julian转过头看着你，摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10604
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_0e4cec04:

    # j "Well, I will, anyway."
    j "没事儿，反正我会帮你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10606
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_arthur_ad8d22cf_1:

    # "Wolf glares at Julian but doesn't rise to the bait."
    "Wolf狠狠地瞪着Julian，但没接茬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10640
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_66a46b6d:

    # p "Well, there's you, Jules."
    p "还有Jules你呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10645
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_4a5af60d:

    # j "Oh? Paying your respects? Or shall it be pure, base flattery?"
    j "哦？这是来表忠心了？还是想拍马屁啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10648
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_9cf5fa03:

    # j "{cps=5000}Oh? Paying your respects? Or shall it be pure, base flattery?{/cps}" nointeract
    j "{cps=5000}哦？这是来表忠心了？还是想拍马屁啊？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:10654
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_494c53da:

    # p "You're definitely an interesting man. Who knew the loudest mouth this side of the world would be joining us for our voyage? I hope they hauled you onboard with the rest of the luggage with pride."
    p "你这人真有意思。谁能想到，咱船上竟然来了个大喇叭？我希望他们把你当行李一样，光荣地抬上船的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10656
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_de5defe9:

    # "You share grins with Julian. Wolf just shakes his head."
    "你和Julian会心一笑。Wolf只是摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10658
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_cb55d5aa:

    # w "Christ, don't become as bad as the lizard."
    w "老天，可别学那蜥蜴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10663
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_81663207:

    # "Julian laughs, then wraps an arm around your shoulders."
    "Julian笑着，一把搂住你的肩膀。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10665
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_77b409e0:

    # j "Oh, he's not like me just because he can say more than a sentence, Wolf. He still has much to learn from the true master."
    j "嗨，他可不是会说几句话就跟我一样了，Wolf。他得跟真正的大师好好学学。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10669
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_1511252d:

    # "Wolf looks to strongly consider just walking away then and there. You give him a break, turning away to face Jules."
    "Wolf看起来真想直接走人。你赶紧给他个台阶下，转头面向Jules。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10673
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_0951e325:

    # p "Alright, but seriously, Julian, it's been a good time. I like having you around. You're fun, even if Wolf would rather die than admit that."
    p "好啦，说真的，Julian，跟你在一起挺开心的。我喜欢你这家伙，挺逗的，就算Wolf死也不肯承认。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10675
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_449a98d7:

    # "Wolf nods, folding his arms over his chest. Immediately, Julian's head swivels to the canine."
    "Wolf点了点头，抱起胳膊。Julian立刻转头看向他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10677
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_f7737c37:

    # j "Oh? Does that mean you agree and you just aren't admitting your deeply held love for me?"
    j "哟？那就是说你承认了，只是不好意思承认你深深地爱着我？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10681
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_fd18da1a:

    # w "What? No!"
    w "啥？不要！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10683
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_c225b0fa:

    # j "Too late, Wolf, I have seen the hidden depths of your appreciation of me thanks to Mr. [family_name]!"
    j "晚啦，Wolf，多亏了[family_name]先生，我已经看穿了你对我隐藏的爱意！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10687
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_f513fc29:

    # "Wolf just sighs rather than rise even further to the bait. Julian then turns back to you."
    "Wolf只是叹了口气，没再搭理Julian的挑逗。然后Julian转过身来对你说："

# game/script day2.rpy:10691
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_9655ac4b:

    # j "Well, flattery will get you far, friend..."
    j "呦，甜言蜜语很管用啊，朋友..."

# game/script day2.rpy:10699
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_1eec2897:

    # j "And you're not too bad yourself, you know."
    j "你也不赖嘛，别装了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10703
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_5d8f511b:

    # p "Oh, I know."
    p "那是当然。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10707
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_a747bc79:

    # "To emphasize his intent, Julian slides the arm that isn't around your shoulders to your chest. You can feel the warmth of his palm and the texture of his scales through your shirt."
    "为了表示他的心意，Julian把没搂你肩膀的那只手滑到你的胸口。隔着衬衫，你都能感觉到他手心的温度和他鳞片的质感。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10709
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_86e6a1f8:

    # "He leans in. You feel the heat of his breath tickling the fur around your neck."
    "他凑了过来，呼吸的热气拂过你脖子上的绒毛，痒酥酥的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10711
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_7f876807:

    # j "You're cute. You're fun to be around. If you'd like to, I haven't planned anything for the evening yet."
    j "你挺可爱的，跟你待在一块儿也挺有意思。要不，今晚一起玩？我还没安排什么活动呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10713
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_136dac2b:

    # "You hope your flush isn't as fierce as it feels on your face. A few thoughts rush through your mind at Julian's touch and closeness, about how he must feel in other places and how he would look. Nude. And free to your hands."
    "你感觉脸上滚烫滚烫的，真希望脸上的红晕没那么明显。Julian的触碰和靠近让你浮想联翩，忍不住开始想象他身体其他部位的触感，还有他赤身裸体的样子。完全坦诚地暴露在你面前，任你摆布..."

# game/script day2.rpy:10717
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_2ba8ce5b:

    # "Wolf interrupts your train of thought with an annoyed grunt."
    "Wolf不耐烦地嘟囔了一声，打断了你的思绪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10719
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_0abe38a9:

    # w "Fuck off and flirt somewhere else. Finish these favors already so I can get the image of you two out of my head."
    w "滚一边儿去亲热。麻溜儿把手头的活儿干完，我好把你们俩的腻歪样儿从脑子里踢出去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10723
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_df4bc6a8:

    # j "Is it really such an unwelcome image, Wolf?"
    j "怎么，看不得我们这样啊，Wolf？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10725
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_92df58a1:

    # "The lizard teases. The canine just glares at him."
    "蜥蜴人调侃道。那只犬科动物只是狠狠地瞪了他一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10727
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_c8a2d349:

    # "You feel mortified and embarrassed as Julian slips away. He winks at you and you smile shakily in response."
    "Julian离开时，你感到一阵羞愧和尴尬。他朝你眨了眨眼，你有些不自然地笑了笑作为回应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10766
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_76593e03:

    # j "And I'm sure we'll get along just fine on this voyage, friend."
    j "我看这次航行，咱们肯定能相处得很愉快，朋友。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10770
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_d17aa706:

    # "He pats your shoulder with hand snaked around your back, then pulls away."
    "他用绕在你背后的手拍了拍你的肩膀，然后抽身离开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10772
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_12bad19e:

    # j "You see how easy it is, Wolf? Why can't you be agreeable like him?"
    j "看看，多简单，Wolf？你咋就不能像他一样好说话呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10776
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_a6aa4ecf:

    # "Wolf shakes his head, grumbling to himself."
    "Wolf摇了摇头，嘟嘟囔囔地抱怨着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10778
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_31b6c148:

    # w "All I wanted was a quiet voyage. Instead I'm stuck with the dumbass duo."
    w "我只想安安静静地度过这次航行。结果倒好，跟你们这俩蠢货搅和到一块儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10780
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_50b2347e:

    # p "We're your dumbass duo, Wolf. We're all friends here. Isn't that right, fellow dumbass?"
    p "咱们可是你的“最佳损友”二人组，Wolf。咱们都是朋友嘛。你说对吧，蠢哥们儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10782
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_d35110fb:

    # "Julian nods sagely."
    "Julian煞有介事地点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10784
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_c202a8a2:

    # j "Indeed, valiant dumbass. We could even expand our ranks to a trio, should he wish it."
    j "没错，英勇的蠢哥们儿。如果他愿意，咱们完全可以扩招到三人行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10788
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_985570fc:

    # "Wolf glares daggers at the both of you as you break into laughter."
    "你们的笑声让Wolf怒火中烧，狠狠地瞪着你们俩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10827
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_ade269cb:

    # p "Sorry, Julian, no flattery here. Instead, I have to tell you something."
    p "抱歉了，Julian，我这儿没啥好听的。不过，有件事我得跟你说说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10832
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_eef1b47c:

    # "That catches the lizard off guard. He tilts his head, curious."
    "蜥蜴人有些措手不及，好奇地歪了歪头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10834
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_46abc89f:

    # j "And what's that?"
    j "什么事儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10836
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_8106611b:

    # p "That I like you, but you could be a bit more considerate."
    p "我是挺喜欢你的，但你也稍微考虑一下别人的感受呗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10838
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_22b03b52:

    # "Julian is surprised, struck speechless for a moment. Evidently, he expects haranguing from Wolf, but not you."
    "Julian愣住了，一时语塞。很明显，他以为你会像Wolf一样指责他，没想到你会这么说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10840
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_b11ee19d:

    # p "I mean, the entire thing with Wolf's fife. Even if you can play it, it's his, right? It doesn't give you a claim to it or anything."
    p "我是说，就拿Wolf的横笛来说吧。就算你会吹，那也是他的东西，对吧？这并不能让你为所欲为。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10844
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_824815d1:

    # j "That was a joke-"
    j "我只是开个玩笑——"

# game/script day2.rpy:10846
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_a0caaf26:

    # p "Even so! He clearly cares for it!"
    p "就算只是玩笑！他也明显很在意那支横笛！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10848
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_36fa9ef6:

    # "The air is tense now that you've gotten serious. Wolf watches with curiosity."
    "你一认真起来，气氛就变得紧张了。Wolf好奇地看着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10852
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_8911e564:

    # p "Would you apologize to him for that?"
    p "你打算为此向他道歉吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10856
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_03077242:

    # "Blindsided and unwilling to look like an implacable jerk, Julian hesitantly nods, then looks to Wolf."
    "Julian有点懵，又不想显得太绝情，犹豫了一下，还是点了点头，看向Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10858
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_d12136ab:

    # j "Uhhh... I'm sorry I was pushy earlier about your fife, Wolf?"
    j "呃...Wolf，之前我不该对你的横笛那么凶，对不起啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10862
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_09c9364b:

    # "Wolf is just as confused as Julian, but then he smiles just a hint as the lizard apologizes."
    "Wolf跟Julian一样摸不着头脑，不过看到这家伙道歉，还是微微一笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10864
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_049ea31e:

    # w "You're right. You were being a jackass."
    w "你说的没错，你刚才就是个混球。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10868
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_7d7595ca:

    # "He's a little bit less sure of how to feel when looking at you."
    "他看着你，有点不知道该摆出什么表情好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10870
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_1b68a649:

    # w "And thank you for getting the lizard to say sorry?"
    w "还有，谢了，你居然能让这家伙道歉？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10874
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_925b6df1:

    # "You nod at both of them."
    "你朝他们俩点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10876
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_3602bc74:

    # p "There we go. We cleared the air, I hope."
    p "这就对了嘛，希望这事儿就这么翻篇了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10878
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_julian_6c7c2ac8:

    # "They're both silent. It's a bit awkward now, but not hostile. It looks like Julian was surprised into actually thinking."
    "两人都没说话。气氛是有点尴尬，但没那么剑拔弩张了。看来Julian是真的被你说动，开始动脑子了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10916
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_e82c2a6c:

    # j "What about the passenger? I heard you went into his {i}cabin{/i}..."
    j "那个乘客呢？我听人说你进了他的{i}船舱{/i}..."

# game/script day2.rpy:10918
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_d172955c:

    # p "Oh, yeah? You implying anything by that, Jules?"
    p "哟，怎么着？Jules，你这话里有话啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10922
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_7028beb8:

    # j "Just that you're a real Casanova, by the sound of it. I want the details."
    j "听你这么说，你还真是个情圣。快跟我说说细节。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10925
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_7e924608:

    # j "{cps=5000}Just that you're a real Casanova, by the sound of it. I want the details.{/cps}" nointeract
    j "{cps=5000}听你这么说，你还真是个情圣。快跟我说说细节。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:10929
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_613f9a03:

    # p "Oh, calm down. We didn't do anything scandalous like you're assuming. We talked about his interest in botany and his drawings."
    p "哎，冷静点。我们可没做什么你以为的那些见不得人的事。我们就是聊了聊他对植物学的兴趣，还有他的画。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10933
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_43dc34cc:

    # "Julian gives you a skeptical look. Your tone isn't terribly convincing, it seems."
    "Julian一脸怀疑地看着你，看来你这番说辞没什么说服力啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10935
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_bac15e89:

    # j "Oh, really? You ran off on your first day, called in a favor, just to talk to someone about... botany?"
    j "真的假的？你第一天就开溜，还动用关系，就为了跟人聊...植物学？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10937
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_2d71ed8e:

    # p "Yes, really. I was just curious about what he's doing on the ship! He's on the way to the Cape for botanical reasons."
    p "真的！我就是好奇他在船上干什么！他去海角是为了研究植物！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10939
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_050aac56:

    # j "Botanical reasons."
    j "研究植物？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10941
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_e36c1e60:

    # p "Yes. Botanical reasons."
    p "没错，研究植物。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10945
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_2d791260:

    # "Silence reigns for a moment. You can hear the swaying of the water outside, the occasional thump of a wave hitting the hull. All the while, Julian stares at you, studying you."
    "沉默了一会儿。能听到外面的海水晃荡，偶尔有海浪拍打船体的闷响。Julian就这么盯着你，打量着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10947
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_951e6c2e:

    # j "You're a terrible liar, you know. Right, Wolf?"
    j "你撒谎的水平也太差劲了。你说是不是，Wolf？"

# game/script day2.rpy:10949
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_12fe2aa9:

    # w "I'm staying out of this. I don't care what he did with who."
    w "这事儿我可不掺和。我才懒得管他和谁干了什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10951
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_6c297b04:

    # p "Yeah, look, Wolf doesn't care, right? You shouldn't either, Jules. We didn't do anything."
    p "听见没，Wolf都不在意，对吧？Jules，你也别瞎操心了。我们真没做什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10953
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_38f4e8a8:

    # j "You're getting worse at it! Doubling down and insisting only makes you even more guilty."
    j "你这谎撒得更烂了！越是强调就越显得心虚！"

# game/script day2.rpy:10963
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_6639750e:

    # "He slides across the bench to get closer to you, glaring."
    "他在长椅上挪了挪屁股，凑近你，恶狠狠地瞪着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10965
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_cd439978:

    # j "I'm calling it in. My favor is telling me what you really did."
    j "我要用那个人情了，让人家告诉我你到底干了什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10967
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_93fd34ba:

    # "Wolf rolls his eyes while you panic a little."
    "你有点慌，Wolf在一旁翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10974
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_24c24493:

    # w "I don't want to hear it."
    w "我才不想听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10976
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_c235f9b7:

    # j "Then you can leave while he tells me. If he has any integrity, he will."
    j "那你就可以走了，让他来告诉我。他要是个爷们儿，就会说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10980
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_87e01580:

    # "Julian stares at you, close enough you can feel his breath on your face. Wolf stalks off, standing across the deck."
    "Julian盯着你，近得你都能感受到他的呼吸。Wolf走开了，站在甲板的另一边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10982
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_c0470eb2:

    # "You crack. Julian's got you figured out."
    "你露馅了。Julian把你给看穿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10984
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_e1448519:

    # p "Look, Jules... Wolf doesn't want to hear anything. I can tell you about it later."
    p "喂，Jules... Wolf不想听这些。我回头再跟你说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10988
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_7f1fa356:

    # "The lizard gives you an appraising look as he considers."
    "蜥蜴上下打量着你，像是在盘算着什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10997
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_4109125f:

    # "He grins suggestively."
    "他坏笑着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:10999
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_a1b761c8:

    # j "You'll tell me {i}all{/i} the details? While we're alone together?"
    j "你要把{i}所有{/i}细节都告诉我？就咱俩单独的时候？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11001
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_1a53720a:

    # j "Angling for a second conquest, Mr. Tomcat?"
    j "怎么，想来第二发，情圣先生？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11003
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_822c8918:

    # "There's a rush of heat to your face as your back stiffens at the sudden implication."
    "这话里头的暗示意味让你瞬间僵住，脸上刷地一下就热了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11005
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_f42d5d9a:

    # p "No! I mean... Well, I wouldn't mind it, but, uh, no?"
    p "没！我不是... 就是，我倒是不介意，但是，呃，不要？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11009
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_f3bca174:

    # "Julian laughs at just how flustered you get. You are very aware of how close he is, how his breath is tousling your fur, and how suggestive his little smirk is."
    "Julian看你慌得一批，忍不住笑了出来。你感觉他离你超近，呼吸都吹到你毛上了，还有他那个意味深长的笑容，真是..."

# game/script day2.rpy:11011
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_85095a06:

    # j "Later, then. You can tell me everything. Then maybe you could demonstrate a few things, huh?"
    j "那回头再说。你得把所有事都告诉我。然后...是不是还得给我“演示”一下啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11013
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_6625c8be:

    # "You nod very rapidly."
    "你狂点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11015
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_f735a7a2:

    # p "Yeah, I'll demonstrate. Definitely. Let's do it. Uh, the talk, not..."
    p "对，我“演示”。必须“演示”。咱们开始吧。那个，是说谈话，不是..."

# game/script day2.rpy:11017
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_afe76e76:

    # j "Oh, don't worry, I'm sure we'll find the time."
    j "哎哟，放心，时间嘛，挤挤总会有的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11022
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_2f99682d:

    # "He then slides away, giving you a moment to recompose yourself as he calls Wolf over."
    "说着他就溜开了，让你缓口气，然后把Wolf叫了过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11058
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_064adae3:

    # j "I'm not letting you weasel out of it. I called it in, I want to hear it."
    j "我跟你说，想都别想蒙混过关。我点的，我就要听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11060
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_8c2ccd62:

    # "You take a deep breath."
    "你深吸一口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11062
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_39de0e45:

    # "For a moment, you consider just telling Julian here and there. But you can't betray Nomax like that so casually; it could come back to bite you. You'll just have to lie again, even if Julian can see through it."
    "有那么一瞬间，你考虑直接在这里告诉Julian。我跟你说，这事儿要是穿帮了，有你好看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11064
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_b80fff7f:

    # "You sit up straight."
    "你坐直了身体。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11066
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_ca6b11e4:

    # p "Well, I didn't lie when I said we talked about his botany and things. That part is, uh, entirely true. And it is... {i}entirely{/i} what we did! We talked about why he was here, and where he is going! I went over because I was curious, is all."
    p "哎，我说我们聊了植物学啥的，那可没瞎说。那部分，那是{i}真{/i}的！而且...我们{i}就{/i}聊了这些！就说了他来这儿干嘛，要去哪儿！我就是好奇，过去看看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11070
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_73a210d8:

    # "Julian frowns at you."
    "Julian皱着眉头看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11072
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_37c64756:

    # j "Are you just not going to tell me, then?"
    j "这么说，你是不打算告诉我了呗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11074
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_7ad63a82:

    # p "What are you talking about? I'm telling you right now, ha ha!"
    p "我说啥呢？我这不告诉你了吗，哈哈！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11076
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_e2f24928:

    # "You enunciate that laugh just a bit hard. It sounds as fake as could be."
    "你这笑声，那是干巴巴的，一听就是装的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11078
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_0e81ac9f:

    # "Julian looks at you, disappointed. He can see that you won't tell him no matter what now, even though you both know you're lying."
    "Julian一脸失望地看着你。他知道你死也不会说了，虽然咱俩都知道你在扯谎。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11080
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_de7b4e57:

    # p "Well! Let's get Wolf back."
    p "好吧！我们把Wolf叫回来吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11082
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_185867ea:

    # j "Yeah, I suppose so."
    j "嗯，我想也是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11084
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_2a359cea:

    # "It's the most down you've seen Julian in your time here. A shame, but you just can't tell him."
    "这段时间，就没见过Julian这么蔫儿过。可惜是可惜，但真没法跟他说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11088
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_93dcb7d2:

    # "Wolf returns, settling down at his bench, either ignoring or not noticing the slightly awkward air."
    "Wolf回来了，在他长凳上坐下，好像根本没察觉到这微妙的气氛，或者干脆就是装没看见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11122
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_0b1890d5:

    # p "What? We just talked."
    p "什么？我们就是聊了聊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11126
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_515df1ef:

    # "Julian looks at you skeptically. You just return the look."
    "Julian一脸怀疑地看着你，你也毫不示弱地瞪了回去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11128
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_9411f45d:

    # j "Really? Just talked?"
    j "真的？就是聊了聊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11130
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_111a0fe3:

    # p "Yeah. He does something called botany; he showed me some drawings of plants."
    p "是啊。他搞什么植物学研究，给我看了些植物图。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11132
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_d8772969:

    # "The lizard scrutinizes you, but you are telling the truth."
    "那只蜥蜴盯着你，不过你说的倒是实话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11134
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_cbedb8b5:

    # j "God, what kinda man goes into another man's private cabin and doesn't fuck him? That's so boring."
    j "天啊，什么人才会进了别人的船舱，却什么都不做？真没劲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11138
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_ba45b231:

    # "Wolf rolls his eyes."
    "Wolf又翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11140
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_beccec7f:

    # j "I mean, yeah, no one's as great as I am, but... Really? Took out a favor just to chat?"
    j "我承认，没人比得上我，但是... 真的假的？费了个人情，就为了唠嗑？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11144
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_675d3507:

    # p "Yep."
    p "那是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11146
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_5119dbbe:

    # "Julian is genuinely baffled by you."
    "你可把Julian搞糊涂了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11148
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_ff6e897a:

    # j "Well, alright, I guess."
    j "好吧，随便你吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11185
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_ba36fe45:

    # p "Nope. We're not talking about this. I'll tell you about something else, but not this."
    p "这事儿没得聊。换个话题，这个免谈。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11187
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_386916ed:

    # "Julian is excited at the scent of scandal, but you give him a look. You are not budging from this."
    "Julian闻到了八卦的味道，兴奋得很，但你一个眼神瞪了过去。你在这事上绝不让步。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11191
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_3bd6d251:

    # "After a moment, he shrugs, getting the message you're putting down."
    "他愣了一下，耸耸肩，明白了你的意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11193
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_46dd0710:

    # j "Alright, alright, forget I asked about him."
    j "好吧好吧，当我没问。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11197
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_60d8dec2:

    # "Wolf just smirks, impressed at your ability to steer Julian."
    "Wolf在一旁得意地笑着，佩服你转移话题的本事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11199
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_nomax_9d615ec6:

    # p "So..."
    p "所以..."

# game/script day2.rpy:11237
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_af40be47:

    # p "The ship's doctor, Rajeeyah? I've not met a doctor like her before. She seems to really know her stuff."
    p "船医Rajeeyah？我从没见过这样的医生，感觉她真的很专业。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11239
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_0260e9fb:

    # w "So, the doctor's a woman."
    w "噢，医生是个女的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11241
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_6541143d:

    # "You and Julian both turn to look at Wolf. The canine grunts."
    "你和Julian都转头看向Wolf。Wolf哼了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11243
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_092904a4:

    # w "Heard women weren't allowed on ships, is all."
    w "我就听说过女人不能上船。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11245
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_90838788:

    # p "I can't say I've ever heard that, but I've never really spent much time with sailors before now."
    p "我倒是没听过这种说法，不过以前也没怎么和水手们打过交道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11247
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_1ece933e:

    # j "Obviously they're allowed on ships. How do you think they get women to America or India? They just swim over?"
    j "瞎说，当然能上船。不然怎么把女人运到美洲和印度？让她们游过去啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11249
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_011718fd:

    # j "It's considered bad luck by some superstitious types, though. I think it goes back to ancient times. Something about mad storm gods or tempting bored men to sin, as if they don't just make do."
    j "有些{a=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sailors%27_superstitions}迷信{/a}的人觉得不吉利。好像是古代传下来的说法，什么触怒了风暴之神，或者说女人会引诱水手们犯罪，好像他们自己没辙似的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11253
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_66460432:

    # "Wolf rolls his eyes at Julian's sarcastic response, but listens to the rest. Afterwards, he shrugs, apparently satisfied."
    "Wolf对Julian的挖苦翻了个白眼，但还是听完了。然后耸耸肩，看来是满意了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11257
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_6048f8e1:

    # p "Interesting, I guess. I never would have thought about it. I guess sailing is just men's work and people try to justify it after the fact."
    p "有意思，我都没想过这事儿。估计是人们觉得航海是男人的事，然后事后找补理由吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11259
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_66808a88:

    # "Julian shrugs."
    "Julian耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11261
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_3dd4c530:

    # j "Who knows why people say anything? Not every sailor believes that a woman will curse a ship, but enough do that there's probably at least a few on this ship."
    j "谁知道人们说那些话是图什么？不是所有水手都信女人会给船带来厄运，但信的人肯定也不少，这条船上估计就有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11263
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_4ef075b9:

    # p "Wonder if they'd get upset when Rajeeyah treats them."
    p "不知道Rajeeyah给他们看病的时候，他们会不会不乐意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11265
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_3c9ca2f2:

    # j "Sailors love to be cared for by doctors, so I doubt it. You wouldn't believe the number of men I saw around my dad that were convinced they were sick and dying just because they got a headache or a little nauseous."
    j "水手们可喜欢被医生照顾了，我跟你说，我小时候见我爸那些病号，一个个明明只是头疼脑热，就觉得自己要死了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11269
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_f263c03d:

    # "Julian plays it up a little. He stands and hunches over, turning his voice a little gruff and shifting his accent northern as he talks."
    "Julian开始演了起来，站起身，弯着腰，把嗓子压低，还带上了北方口音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11273
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_00db90a0:

    # j "Let me see the doctor, I daren't think I'll survive the night, I've got a toothache after I bit into hardtack!"
    j "哎哟喂，快叫医生来，我啃了块硬饼干，牙疼得厉害，怕是活不过今晚了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11277
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_d95d791a:

    # "You laugh at Julian's display. Wolf gives a little snort, even as he fiddles with the dice to pretend he wasn't listening in."
    "你被Julian逗笑了。Wolf也轻蔑地哼了一声，虽然他还在摆弄骰子，装作没在听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11281
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_f4b2635c:

    # "Julian sits back on the bench, smiling."
    "Julian往长椅后一靠，咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11283
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_023792b1:

    # j "I swear that I'm not even exaggerating that much."
    j "我发誓我说的都是实话，一点没夸张。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11285
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_6bad8520:

    # p "Well, Rajeeyah seems like a good doctor. Enough to reassure me, at least."
    p "好吧，Rajeeyah医生看起来挺靠谱的。 至少能让我安心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11287
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_1c31b40a:

    # j "See? You're already becoming like them: You're thinking about the doctor and being under her care. Me? I'll just never get sick or hurt. All that worrying about sickness just makes you sick."
    j "看吧？你这就开始变得跟他们一样了：满脑子都是医生，想着怎么接受治疗。 我？我才不会生病受伤呢。 整天担心生病，反而更容易生病。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11289
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_8f440f1a:

    # w "Stop talking so people will stop wanting to hurt you, then."
    w "少说两句，别人才不会想揍你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11291
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_7d330c2e:

    # j "Are you talking about yourself or the crew?"
    j "你在说你自己，还是说船员们？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11293
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_63ca1e35:

    # "Wolf shrugs."
    "Wolf耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11295
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_rajeeyah_cef7df34:

    # w "Both."
    w "都有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11333
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_c57a0551:

    # p "Well, what about Samuel? All three of us have been around him."
    p "那Samuel呢？咱们三个可都跟他接触过。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11335
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_cee625d5:

    # "Julian shrugs and Wolf doesn't respond."
    "Julian耸耸肩，Wolf没吭声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11337
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_6a53e492:

    # j "What about him? Seems like he's good at his job, I suppose."
    j "他怎么样？ 我觉得他工作能力挺强的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11340
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_ecc4cd1a:

    # j "{cps=5000}What about him? Seems like he's good at his job, I suppose.{/cps}" nointeract
    j "{cps=5000}他怎么样？ 我觉得他工作能力挺强的。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:11344
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_a1776346:

    # p "I mean, yeah, he's good. Really good, even. He's so confident about things it makes me feel more assured about it, I guess."
    p "我是说，对，他的确很厉害。 甚至可以说非常优秀。 他对一切都充满自信，这让我感觉也更有底气了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11348
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_6ffc5d50:

    # "Julian gives you a look."
    "Julian意味深长地看了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11350
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_15dd2d27:

    # j "We've been here for a day and you're already crushing on a guy?"
    j "咱们才来一天，你就看上人家了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11352
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_3c3844af:

    # p "No! What the hell are you getting that from? I'm just saying he's been a good teacher so far."
    p "哪有！ 你瞎说什么呢？ 我只是觉得他目前为止是个好老师。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11356
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_7133b101:

    # "Julian laughs at your slightly defensive reaction. Wolf just scoffs."
    "你略带防备，Julian笑得更开心了。 Wolf只是嗤之以鼻。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11358
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_32043f2c:

    # j "Sure, man, sure."
    j "得了吧，你就装。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11362
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_6fdd61ab:

    # p "Oh, calm down. You're being so childish now."
    p "哎哟，别闹了。 你幼稚不幼稚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11364
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_07220d08:

    # w "Now?"
    w "我幼稚？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11366
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_1f51dc97:

    # "You give an annoyed sigh. Julian just keeps grinning."
    "你烦躁地叹了口气，Julian还在那儿乐。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11368
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_4213e0fe:

    # j "Look, don't worry, it's no big deal. I can help you make the match, yeah? Seal the deal."
    j "听着，别担心，没啥大不了的。 我可以帮你牵线搭桥啊，怎么样？ 包你成。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11372
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_3b3d525b:

    # "You put your face in your hands for a moment while the lizard laughs. You glare at him over your fingers."
    "你捂住脸，那只蜥蜴还在一边笑。 你从指缝里狠狠地瞪了他一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11374
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_8a668338:

    # p "Julian, please shut up. I don't have a crush and don't want any help with Sam. Alright?"
    p "Julian，求你闭嘴吧。 我对他没意思，也用不着你帮我和Sam牵线。 听懂了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11379
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_cc80ebbf:

    # j "Sure, sure, fine. You can deal with your own problems, I see how it is."
    j "行行行，知道了。 你要自己解决问题，我懂了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11381
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_1066e4ec:

    # "You groan. Wolf gives you a sympathetic look."
    "你叹了口气。 Wolf同情地看了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11383
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_435488bf:

    # w "Now you know how I feel."
    w "现在你总算知道我的感受了吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11418
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_440d524e:

    # p "Yeah, I guess we haven't really had a ton of time to get to know the guy. Feels experienced, though, like we weren't the first ones he shepherded."
    p "唉，确实，咱们还没来得及好好了解他。 不过感觉他经验很丰富，好像不是第一次带新人了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11420
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_a6c5c653:

    # j "Definitely not his first. All the more shame he'll probably be recuperating for a bit, but hell, we'll learn somehow."
    j "肯定不是头一回了。 可惜的是他可能得休息一阵子才能恢复，不过没事，我们总能学会的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11422
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_8419d775:

    # w "He's tough."
    w "他不好惹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11424
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_40304276:

    # p "What makes you say so?"
    p "你怎么看出来的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11428
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_59112b35:

    # "Wolf hesitates, then gestures towards his left cheek."
    "Wolf犹豫了一下，指了指自己的左脸颊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11430
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_cd369337:

    # w "He's got a scar there. Looks like it's from a fight."
    w "他脸上那道疤，像是干架留下的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11432
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_99b8c6c1:

    # p "Really? How can you tell?"
    p "真的？你怎么知道的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11434
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_63ca1e35:

    # "Wolf shrugs."
    "Wolf耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11436
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_be00bf1c:

    # w "Experience."
    w "经验之谈。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11440
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_c5f2a21c:

    # j "Oh, mysterious! Is our Wolf a delinquent after all?"
    j "哦，深藏不露啊！我们的Wolf难道以前是个小混混？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11444
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_41cf9fc3:

    # "The canine grunts."
    "那家伙哼了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11446
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_024ec823:

    # w "Shut it, lizard, or you'll see just how experienced I am."
    w "给我闭嘴，臭蜥蜴，不然让你知道老子有多厉害。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11450
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_29de0abd:

    # "Julian grins and begins to respond, but you interrupt him."
    "Julian咧嘴一笑，刚想回话，就被你打断了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11454
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_87195088:

    # p "Thanks, Wolf. That's interesting, I wouldn't have noticed it."
    p "谢了，Wolf。挺有意思的，我都没注意到。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11456
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_f1da597a:

    # "Wolf nods."
    "Wolf点点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11460
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_63ca1e35_1:

    # "Wolf shrugs."
    "Wolf耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11462
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_bc238d5e:

    # j "Helpful."
    j "真是热心。 (可以理解为反讽)"

# game/script day2.rpy:11464
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_3c953dd7:

    # w "I've said my piece. Take it or leave it."
    w "该说的我都说了，信不信由你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11468
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_551257f0:

    # j "There's nothing to take or leave!"
    j "根本就没什么信不信的！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11470
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_c734ce10:

    # w "Not my problem."
    w "关我屁事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11474
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_5f8ab110:

    # "You interrupt whatever comeback Julian has."
    "你打断了Julian的反驳。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11476
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_8541d003:

    # p "Thanks, Wolf."
    p "谢了，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11478
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_373d7266:

    # p "Hopefully, he won't be out for too long. I doubt Arthur will just let us sit back and relax while Sam's recuperating."
    p "希望他别休息太久。我估计Sam康复期间，Arthur不会让我们闲着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11480
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_a3951420:

    # j "Yeah, he'll probably put us with another experienced sailor like Konrad."
    j "是啊，说不定会安排另一个像Konrad一样有经验的水手带我们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11482
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_168dd8eb:

    # p "Not a big deal then, I guess."
    p "那也没什么，我猜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11484
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_44acfd75:

    # w "It's happening. Better to not worry about the details."
    w "要来了。想再多也没用。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11486
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_samuel_21066343:

    # "You shrug. That is true, you guess, no need to be anxious over your fate; you'll find out in a few hours."
    "你耸耸肩。也对，想那么多也没用，几个小时后就知道了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11524
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_c355a800:

    # p "Well, what about Wolf?"
    p "那Wolf呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11526
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_efe1a1d6:

    # "Wolf's ears perk up when you say his name, but doesn't respond. Julian tilts his head, giving you a look."
    "听到你叫他的名字，Wolf的耳朵动了一下，但没吭声。Julian侧着头，意味深长地看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11528
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_56e65f03:

    # j "What about him? He's just a grouch."
    j "他怎么了？不就是个闷葫芦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11531
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_a144c02f:

    # j "{cps=5000}What about him? He's just a grouch.{/cps}" nointeract
    j "{cps=5000}他怎么了？不就是个闷葫芦。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:11535
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_019020ed:

    # p "Well, he's interesting, don't you think? Someone so quiet and tightly-wound like him, it just makes me curious."
    p "你不觉得他挺有意思的吗？像他这种沉默寡言又很警惕的人，让人很好奇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11539
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_922ac936:

    # "That finally gets Wolf to look you in the eye."
    "这句话终于让Wolf抬头看了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11541
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_0ef5a379:

    # w "I'm not interesting."
    w "我没劲透了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11543
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_3ffa9f76:

    # j "I'll say. What, you think he's a mystery to solve or something? His parents, wolves, named him, a wolf, Wolf.{w} We're probably the most exciting his life has been since he got that fife."
    j "可不是嘛。怎么，你还当他是待解的谜团不成？他爹妈是狼，给他起了个狼名，就叫Wolf。自从他有了那根破笛子，咱们可能就是他这辈子最刺激的事儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11545
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_ad694770:

    # p "Well, maybe... I just know things about you, Julian. I only know about the fife with Wolf."
    p "好吧，也许... 我只是知道关于你的一些事情，Julian。关于Wolf，我只知道那根横笛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11549
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_a3b72f1b:

    # "The canine shrugs."
    "那只狼耸了耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11551
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_fc35ffd2:

    # w "Maybe I just don't care to talk the ear off of everyone I meet."
    w "也许我只是不想跟遇到的每个人都喋喋不休。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11553
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_2f9bb749:

    # j "This is how I know you're a farm boy, [name]. You haven't met enough people to know that some just aren't that interesting."
    j "我说你小子就是个乡巴佬，[name]。见的人太少，不知道有些人就是这么无聊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11555
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_ad2fc5f2:

    # "Wolf keeps his eyes on you for that exchange, then looks away after Julian finishes speaking. He looks out through the port opening, letting you see the light dancing over his fur again."
    "Wolf在这次交流中一直盯着你，然后在Julian说完后移开了视线。他看向舷窗外，让你再次看到光线在他皮毛上跳动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11557
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_5a9296fc:

    # "It shows just how complex his dark fur truly is, the subtle gradient that you don't normally see until you look for it in good light."
    "这才能看出来他那身黑毛有多讲究，那种细微的渐变，得在光线好的时候仔细看才能发现。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11559
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_2e29c1f4:

    # "You realize you're starting to stare and shake your head."
    "你意识到你开始盯着他看了，摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11561
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_62208427:

    # p "Well, I guess you're right, Julian. Curiosity is historically not a good trait for cats, anyway."
    p "好吧，我想你是对的，Julian。无论如何，从历史上看，好奇心对猫来说都不是一个好特性。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11565
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_b6e9b93b:

    # "The lizard gives a snicker at that, while Wolf's eyes dart back to yours for just a moment."
    "这只蜥蜴对此嗤笑了一声，而Wolf的目光只是瞬间回到了你的身上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11569
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_b16617aa:

    # "You aren't going to get anything from him, best to move on, you suppose."
    "你从他那里什么也得不到，最好是继续前进，你觉得。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11606
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_5b496607:

    # p "You're right, but I've never met such a perfect grouch before. You're grouchy in all things, Wolf."
    p "没错，不过我还真没见过你这么天生的牢骚鬼。你浑身上下都写满了‘不爽’，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11610
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_77419ba8:

    # "He glares at you."
    "他怒视着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11612
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_d66a04d5:

    # p "See? Giving me a grouchy look, even."
    p "看吧？这不就赏我一个臭脸了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11617
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_4a63b5c7:

    # "Julian laughs at that, while Wolf rolls his eyes."
    "Julian对此一笑置之，而Wolf翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11621
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_df7481f8:

    # j "Don't worry, Wolf. You're our grouch."
    j "别介意，Wolf。你就是我们专属的牢骚鬼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11625
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_169b703a:

    # w "I don't want to be anything of yours, lizard."
    w "我不想成为你们任何人的什么东西，蜥蜴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11627
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_bd4418ba:

    # j "Oh, you wound me! You're my fellow dice player, at least!"
    j "哦，你伤到我了！你至少是我的骰子游戏伙伴！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11629
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_a0f2ee2d:

    # w "Not for long at this rate."
    w "照这个速度，也当不了多久了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11631
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_10ae1e08:

    # p "Can't you lighten up even a little, Wolf? We're going to be stuck together for a while, and like Julian said earlier, you can't just sit in a corner on your own the entire time."
    p "你就不能稍微放松一点吗，Wolf？我们要被困在一起一段时间，而且就像Julian早些时候说的那样，你不能一直独自坐在角落里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11635
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_cdea9506:

    # w "If the alternative is you two needling me, the corner is becoming more and more inviting."
    w "如果另一种选择是你们两个不停地烦我，那角落正变得越来越有吸引力。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11639
translate Chinese day2_tell_julian_about_wolf_17dab285:

    # "You and Julian laugh at that, despite Wolf's tone being entirely serious. You decide to not provoke him any more."
    "尽管Wolf的语气完全是认真的，但你和Julian还是笑了出来。你决定不再招惹他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11679
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_ca4807a5:

    # p "Well what did you have in mind for Wolf then?"
    p "那么你对Wolf有什么想法？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11683
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_aa9fb995:

    # p "Anyways, did you have anything in mind for Wolf, Jules?"
    p "无论如何，你对Wolf有什么想法，Jules？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11687
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_06261e77:

    # j "Yes, actually. Something very simple."
    j "是的，实际上。一些非常简单的事情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11691
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_34bcf93d:

    # "He stares intently at Wolf, leaning forward over the table. The canine frowns, but doesn't look away."
    "他目不转睛地盯着Wolf，身子越过桌子向前倾。那狼皱着眉头，也没躲开他的目光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11693
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_4b6e18c4:

    # j "One simple request for you, Wolf: I want you to say something you like about us. One thing for each."
    j "我对你有一个简单的要求，Wolf：我希望你说一些你喜欢我们的地方。每个人一个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11695
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_78e2b8d9:

    # "You and Wolf are both silent at that. His eyes narrow at Julian, as if waiting for a punchline. The lizard continues to stare."
    "你和Wolf都沉默了。他眼神紧盯着Julian，好像在等他憋什么坏屁。那蜥蜴还在一边盯着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11697
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_769a2898:

    # w "Are you fucking with me, lizard?"
    w "你他娘的耍我呢，蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11701
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_dd5ea5ba:

    # j "No, I'm completely serious."
    j "不，我是完全认真的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11703
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_efe968fa:

    # "The two are silent again. The boat shifts and Julian sinks forward as the table he's leaning on sways with it, but quickly pulls back to look Wolf in the eye."
    "两人再次沉默。船晃动着，Julian向前倾倒，因为他靠着的桌子也随之摇晃，但他迅速拉回来，看着Wolf的眼睛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11707
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_1549c942:

    # j "Because you, unlike {i}some{/i} people..."
    j "因为你嘛，和 {i}某些{/i} 人不一样..."

# game/script day2.rpy:11709
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_d567a612:

    # "He gives you a long look, as if to leave zero doubt who he was talking about."
    "他狠狠地瞪了你一眼，好像生怕你不知道他指的是谁。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11711
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_da494d09:

    # j "Don't appreciate me for my beautiful body and charming personality. So I want to hear one thing you do like."
    j "别光盯着我英俊的皮囊和迷人的性格看。说说看，你到底喜欢我哪一点？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11713
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_eb2f33b0:

    # "You appreciate Julian's ingenuity (and his beautiful body and charming personality). It is the perfectly crafted request: Nothing too outrageous, but something the big fuzzball would struggle with."
    "你很欣赏Julian的聪明才智（还有他那漂亮的肉体和迷人的个性）。这主意真是精心设计的：既不算太过分，又能让这大毛球挠头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11717
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_9ed27bdf:

    # j "Because you, unlike some people, don't appreciate me for my many good features. So I'd like to hear at least one thing you do like."
    j "还不是因为你，不像某些人，光看到我的优点。所以，赏个脸，说说你喜欢我哪一点呗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11719
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_acb2cdc7:

    # "You appreciate Julian's ingenuity. It is the perfectly crafted request: Nothing too outrageous, but something the big fuzzball would struggle with."
    "你是欣赏Julian的鬼点子的。这要求提得真是绝了：既不过分，又能让那只大毛球为难。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11721
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_dee2979f:

    # p "Harsh, Julian. Harsh."
    p "Julian，你也太狠了吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11725
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_248954bb:

    # "Wolf stays silent for a bit, thinking. His shoulders slump and he sighs."
    "Wolf沉默了一会儿，盘算着。他耸了耸肩，叹了口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11727
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_560f33ba:

    # w "Fine. You won. I keep my word."
    w "行吧，你赢了。我说话算话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11731
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_fe227a2c:

    # "He stares at Julian for a while, as if scrutinizing him to find a single thing to like about him. In response, Julian sits prettily, or the best he can with the swaying of the ship."
    "他盯着Julian看了半天，好像想把他从头到脚扫描一遍，看看能不能找到一丁点儿能喜欢上的地方。Julian也摆足了架势，努力在摇摇晃晃的船上保持优雅。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11735
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_1e16297c:

    # "Wolf grimaces."
    "Wolf皱起了眉头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11737
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_605d87b0:

    # "He then turns to you."
    "然后他转向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11741
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_9cf1d0f0:

    # w "I'll start with you. It'll be easier."
    w "我先从你开始吧，简单点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11747
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_518c68d4:

    # j "Oh, just because you can compliment his ass now?"
    j "哦，就因为现在你能夸他屁股了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11749
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_e4493847:

    # j "I see how it is."
    j "我懂了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11751
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_76725401:

    # w "I swear..."
    w "我发誓..."

# game/script day2.rpy:11753
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_9d7d902c:

    # "Wolf responds with a thinly concealed snarl."
    "Wolf低声咆哮了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11762
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_02a74ebf:

    # w "I like that you are considerate. Definitely more than the lizard. You get on my nerves a lot less."
    w "我喜欢你比较体贴，肯定比那蜥蜴强多了。而且你也没那么烦人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11764
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_42842e43:

    # w "You being around is... tolerable, most of the time."
    w "你在的话... 大部分时候还算能忍受。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11766
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_387fe98d:

    # "You give Julian a look, unable to believe the words coming out of Wolf's mouth. You then turn back to the canine and beam."
    "你看了Julian一眼，简直不敢相信这话是从Wolf嘴里说出来的。然后你转过头，对着Wolf灿烂一笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11768
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_c888834d:

    # p "Thank you, Wolf! You're tolerable, too. Enjoyable, even."
    p "谢啦，Wolf！你也挺让人能忍受的，甚至还挺让人愉快的！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11772
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_5dd693e7:

    # "The canine scoffs, then looks away from you."
    "那只犬科动物嗤之以鼻，然后把目光从你身上挪开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11776
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_6d1f6712:

    # j "Wow, Wolf, I didn't know you had it in you! Surely you can come up with something just as lovely to say about me!"
    j "哇哦，Wolf，真没想到你还有这一面！你也夸夸我呗！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11780
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_d3a4fc0b:

    # w "Don't bet on it."
    w "想都别想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11782
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_5fc36138:

    # j "We already did, didn't we?"
    j "不是已经夸过了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11784
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_f2dbb5ba:

    # "Wolf glares at him."
    "Wolf狠狠地瞪了他一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11788
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_063d2fb1:

    # w "I like that you're less annoying than the lizard."
    w "我喜欢你比那只蜥蜴不那么烦人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11790
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_f3b3ff5e:

    # p "Thanks, Wolf, how considerate of you."
    p "多谢夸奖，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11792
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11797
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_d9ecd383:

    # j "Enough about him, let's hear about me, huh?"
    j "别光说他了，也说说我呗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11799
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_31789c19:

    # "After another round of staring at Julian, Wolf finally answers:"
    "又盯着 Julian 看了半天，Wolf 才慢吞吞地说："

# game/script day2.rpy:11801
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_416782c3:

    # w "I like it when you sleep, because you don't talk."
    w "我喜欢你睡觉的时候，起码你闭嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11805
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_c9108713:

    # j "Oh, come on, that's not something you like about me. That's liking an absence of me, it doesn't count."
    j "别闹，那算什么喜欢我啊。你喜欢的根本是没我的状态，不算数。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11809
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_91181f1b:

    # w "I don't know then, damn it. Why do you assume there {i}is{/i} something I like about you, lizard?"
    w "我哪知道，见鬼。你凭什么觉得我就{i}一定{/i}得喜欢你，你这只蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11813
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_409b9f40:

    # j "Well, you agreed to this, for one. Playing Hazard and then the wager. And you said my name earlier."
    j "算啦，最起码你答应了玩牌，还跟我打了赌。而且你之前还叫了我的名字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11817
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_ca1bc00a:

    # "Julian counts on his fingers as he goes, then gets to the third and hesitates, trying to think of another reason."
    "Julian 掰着手指头数，数到第三个的时候卡住了，拼命想再找个理由。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11819
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_ef45bac2:

    # j "And... Well... There just has to be something."
    j "还有……肯定还有什么来着……"

# game/script day2.rpy:11821
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_491877c9:

    # p "You can think of something, Wolf. Our Julian isn't totally unlikable."
    p "你想想啊，Wolf。我们家的 Julian 又不是完全一无是处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11823
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_94c0cd3b:

    # w "'Our'? You can keep him."
    w "“我们家的”？送你了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11825
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_edb2cc72:

    # j "Cruel!"
    j "没人性啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11827
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_047c971e:

    # "Wolf then returns to staring at Julian, looking for the slightest detail to approve of."
    "接着 Wolf 又开始盯着 Julian 猛看，想从他身上找出一丁点儿优点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11831
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_214dd445:

    # "Eventually, he just sighs, resting his head on the table for a moment. A finger pushes a die around. Then, suddenly, he sits up straight. Something occurs to him, and he looks conflicted on whether to say it or not."
    "最后，他叹了口气，把头在桌子上靠了一会儿。一根手指无意识地拨弄着骰子。突然，他直起身子，似乎想到了什么，但又有点犹豫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11837
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_2c6e100b:

    # w "You played my fife. I guess that's something you did, not something about you."
    w "你吹过我的横笛。不过这只是你做过的事，跟你人没关系。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11839
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_dd2d5b95:

    # "He thinks for a moment. Julian looks like he wants to say something, but for once, doesn't."
    "他在那儿琢磨着。Julian 看起来想说什么，破天荒地没吱声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11841
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_617f4c77:

    # w "You are very skilled. Talented. And you've helped me and him out a lot instead of holding that over us. Mostly."
    w "你手艺不错。挺有天赋的。而且你帮了我和他不少忙，也没拿这事儿压着我们。起码大部分时候是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11843
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_6a08ba8d:

    # w "It's the first time in a long time I've heard that fife play actual music. And I... appreciate that."
    w "我也好久没听过那支破笛子能吹出像样的调子了。我……挺感谢你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11845
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_61150f9c:

    # w "There, Julian. Are you happy?"
    w "行了吧，Julian。你满意了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11849
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_09ccb658:

    # w "You are skilled. You know a lot of shit. You're too pushy sometimes, but you've been helping me and him out a lot with this ship stuff. So I like that you're smart."
    w "你手艺好。懂的乱七八糟的东西也多。有时候是挺爱管闲事的，不过这段时间你一直在帮我和他处理船上的事儿。所以我喜欢你脑子好使。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11851
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_61150f9c_1:

    # w "There, Julian. Are you happy?"
    w "行了吧，Julian。你满意了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11853
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_07a30698:

    # "Said lizard looks like he wants to say something, but for once, doesn't."
    "那只蜥蜴好像想说点什么，难得的闭上了嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11857
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_1acad627:

    # "Julian is smiling, but not in that insufferable way he usually does."
    "Julian在微笑，但不是平时那种令人讨厌的假笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11859
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_3b22ec77:

    # j "Yes. Thank you, Wolf."
    j "嗯。谢了，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11863
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_c01af2dc:

    # "Then it goes right back into being a smirk."
    "然后他又露出了那种欠揍的笑容。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11865
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_c11a58f2:

    # j "The first of many things you'll come to like about me, I'm sure!"
    j "这只是个开始，以后你会喜欢上我更多地方的，我保证！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11867
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_f31657cb:

    # w "Don't count on it."
    w "想都别想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11869
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_c8085389:

    # "You laugh with Julian."
    "你和 Julian 一起笑了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11871
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_ede72822:

    # p "Well, you managed it, Wolf. I knew there had to be something. Even if it did look like you were pulling teeth."
    p "厉害了，Wolf。我就知道你肯定能说出点什么。虽然看着跟要了你的命一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11873
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_4452ae10:

    # w "He didn't say I had to like it."
    w "他又没说我非得喜欢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11875
translate Chinese day2_after_julian_crew_questioning_ed88fd2d:

    # j "Next time I will!"
    j "下次一定！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11882
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_c964bf61:

    # "... they land on [number]."
    "...停在了[number]点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11888
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_9cb03d17:

    # "Julian leans over the table and stares at the dice as if the faces are lying to him. After a moment, he slinks back into his seat, throwing his hands in the air with a theatrical sigh."
    "Julian猛地趴在桌子上，死死盯着骰子，好像它们说了谎一样。过了一会儿，他又像演戏一样，夸张地叹了口气，瘫回了座位上，双手一摊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11892
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_3e2dbe71:

    # j "It seems like Lady Luck is setting up my dramatic comeback. Well, Wolf, you win. A deal is a deal; we are at your mercy. How does this general handle the vanquished?"
    j "看来幸运女神要让我来一出王者归来了。好吧，Wolf，你赢了。君子一言，驷马难追，现在我们都听你的。大将军打算怎么处置我们这些手下败将啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11894
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_aab5ef80:

    # "Wolf glares at Julian as the lizard mimics handing over his sword. The canine's gaze lingers, thinking, then his eyes narrow."
    "Wolf瞪着Julian，旁边的蜥蜴模仿着交出剑的动作。Wolf的目光停留了片刻，像是在思考，然后眯起了眼睛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11898
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_55e2118f:

    # "Julian tries to act casual, as if he is graciously waiting for Wolf's decision, but the long silence begins to get to him. His smile fades and then turns into a frown, before he looks at you."
    "Julian试图装作若无其事的样子，仿佛在耐心地等待Wolf的决定，但漫长的沉默让他开始坐立不安。他的笑容逐渐消失，转为愁眉苦脸，然后看向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11900
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_416ed27a:

    # j "Look at the way he's staring at me! We're both doomed."
    j "看看他那眼神！我们俩都完蛋了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11904
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_ae0a7a33:

    # p "I'm sure Wolf won't kill you. He'll just think of the best way to make you suffer."
    p "我相信Wolf不会杀了你的。他只是在想怎样才能让你更痛苦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11906
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_c9168db0:

    # j "What about you?"
    j "你呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11910
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_d703b83c:

    # p "Oh, I'll be fine. He likes me."
    p "我没事，他喜欢我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11914
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_8a6d2f69:

    # p "Oh, I'm sure he's saving his best for you. I'm getting off easy."
    p "哦，我敢肯定他会把最好的“礼物”留给你的，我这算是逃过一劫了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11918
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_d9cb43a2:

    # "The lizard gives you a playful shove."
    "那只蜥蜴轻轻推了你一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11920
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_db5476ac:

    # j "You're very helpful. Great at cheering up the man facing execution."
    j "你可真会安慰人。真有你的，安慰一个要被处决的家伙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11922
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_a7d16a61:

    # "Wolf rolls his eyes as you laugh. The canine leans back, satisfied."
    "你笑了，Wolf翻了个白眼。那家伙满意地往后一靠，咧着嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11924
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_c71dbbd6:

    # w "I've decided. Lizard?"
    w "我决定了。蜥蜴？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11928
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_9b2e7aab:

    # "Julian shifts forward in his seat, looking equally curious and apprehensive."
    "Julian向前探了探身子，看起来既好奇又忐忑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11930
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_17697de5:

    # j "What is it?"
    j "什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:11934
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_67ebee7c:

    # w "Shut up for a day. Not a noise until this time tomorrow."
    w "闭嘴一天。明天这个时候之前都别出声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11938
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_4295f6a9:

    # j "What? You can't be serious!"
    j "什么？你不是认真的吧！"

# game/script day2.rpy:11940
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_1480a717:

    # "Wolf holds a finger in front of his snout, shushing Julian.."
    "Wolf嘘了一声，用手指挡在 Julian 鼻子前面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11944
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_0e09d8d9:

    # "Julian opens and closes his mouth a few times, then stops, frowning. Wolf holds a hand up to his ear, before turning to you."
    "Julian张了几次嘴，又闭上，皱着眉头。Wolf把手放在耳边，然后转向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11948
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_dec8c805:

    # w "Hear that? Sweet silence."
    w "听到了吗？多么美妙的安静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11950
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_1289a17a:

    # "You laugh at Julian's misfortune while the lizard mouths along with Wolf's words in a ridiculous, exaggerated way."
    "你嘲笑着Julian的不幸，而蜥蜴以一种滑稽、夸张的方式无声地模仿着Wolf的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11952
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_e9286d2f:

    # "Wolf just ignores him, still looking at you."
    "Wolf直接无视他，仍然看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11956
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_abd36458:

    # w "As for you..."
    w "至于你嘛..."

# game/script day2.rpy:11960
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_09ab45b0:

    # "He taps the desk as he thinks again, but it doesn't last nearly as long. He just shrugs a little."
    "他又敲了敲桌子，想了想，不过这次没想多久，耸耸肩就完事了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11968
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_30e402d3:

    # w "Give me half of your dinner tonight."
    w "给我今晚你晚饭的一半。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11974
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_3d40901c:

    # w "Give me your dinner tonight."
    w "今晚你的晚饭都归我了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11976
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_19daac29:

    # "You groan at the thought of missing out on food."
    "一想到没得吃，你就开始抱怨。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11978
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_8be9deb1:

    # p "Fine, you got it. A deal's a deal."
    p "好吧，给你就是了。一言为定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11984
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_dc733f96:

    # "Julian looks between the two of you, astonished. He then pouts. Wolf is relishing the silence from Julian, leaning back with a toothy smirk."
    "Julian 惊讶地看着你们俩，然后撇起了嘴。Wolf得意洋洋地享受着 Julian 的沉默，咧嘴一笑，靠在了椅背上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11986
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_e9e4b590:

    # p "Hey, you got off easy, Jules. You just have to not talk. I'm the one going hungry."
    p "嘿，你小子已经很轻松了，Julian。你只要闭嘴就行。饿肚子的人可是我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:11988
translate Chinese day2_wolf_win_431bbc63:

    # w "Much harder ordeal for him."
    w "这对他来说可真是个折磨。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12001
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_7a345936:

    # "The lizard is still pouting at you as he collects his dice. He makes sure to tap them noisily on the table a few times in protest."
    "小蜥蜴一边收起骰子，一边气鼓鼓地冲你撇着嘴。他特意把骰子在桌板上敲得砰砰响，以此表达抗议。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12005
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_0af48a24:

    # "The lizard is still pouting at the two of you as he collects his dice. He makes sure to tap them noisily on the table a few times in protest."
    "那蜥蜴佬还撅着嘴，收起骰子的时候，故意在桌子上“咚咚咚”敲了几下，表示抗议。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12011
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_f9a4e9a7:

    # p "Oh, poor Julian, reduced to making noises this way. Unable to grace us with his thespian's speech."
    p "哎哟，可怜的Julian，居然沦落到用这种方式哼哼唧唧。没法让我们欣赏他那雄辩的口才了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12013
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_69d7cfe8:

    # w "His what?"
    w "他的什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12015
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_e5be37c7:

    # p "It means an actor, I think."
    p "我猜，是演员的意思吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12017
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_331d35f3:

    # "Julian looks between the two of you, exasperated. Wolf ignores him."
    "Julian 无奈地看着你们俩。Wolf无视他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12019
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_68570cfd:

    # w "Don't take up his mantle of saying words no one knows. I just want to have one normal day without it."
    w "别跟他学，说那些谁都听不懂的词。我就想安安静静地过一天。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12021
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_9f9a518c:

    # p "Alright, alright, fair enough. Well, what now?"
    p "好吧好吧，有道理。那现在呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12025
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_d0205712:

    # "Wolf shrugs. You stand up and the other two follow."
    "Wolf耸耸肩。你站起来，另外两个人也跟着站起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12027
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_6598340d:

    # p "Well, we can try to figure out what we'll do without Samuel, I suppose."
    p "唉，要不咱们琢磨琢磨，没了 Samuel，以后该咋办。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12029
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_ed13538d:

    # "Julian gestures out the door then holds his fingers in front of his face, blowing air."
    "Julian 指着门外，然后把手指放在他的脸前，吹气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12031
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_2f94feee:

    # p "A whistle?"
    p "吹口哨？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12033
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_f4c66de1:

    # w "Come on. Let's go topside, get some fresh air. Might see someone we can ask."
    w "走吧。我们去甲板上，呼吸点新鲜空气。或许能看到我们可以问的人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12037
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_032c5e95:

    # "Julian makes the gesture again, but realizes neither of you understand what he is getting out. He lets out a frustrated sigh, but follows behind you."
    "Julian 又比划了一下，结果发现你们还是不明白他想表达什么。他只好沮丧地叹了口气，跟在你们身后。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12039
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_6a0cabeb:

    # p "Well, how are you enjoying your silence, Wolf?"
    p "怎么样，Wolf，享受你的沉默吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12041
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_da71917e:

    # "The canine looks back at Julian and then shrugs."
    "那只犬科动物回头看了看 Julian，然后耸了耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12043
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_d53be803:

    # "Another attempt at small talk foiled by the great Wolf. You continue striding on in silence while Julian trails behind the both of you, arms folded over his chest."
    "伟大的Wolf又一次破坏了闲聊的尝试。你继续沉默地往前走，Julian 抱着胳膊，闷闷不乐地跟在你们俩身后。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12047
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_865f0b2c:

    # "Before you can get back on the deck, however, you are intercepted by a looming figure in the darkness."
    "结果还没等你回到甲板上，就被一个黑影给拦住了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12051
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_af7fbee2:

    # "Arthur looks down at you, silhouetted by the light coming from the stairwell. His broad form is unmistakable, as is his posture."
    "Arthur居高临下地看着你，楼梯间的光映出他高大的轮廓。他那宽阔的身材，还有那站姿，绝不会认错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12053
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_589e4888:

    # a "Landsmen."
    a "旱鸭子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12055
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_12bc6391:

    # "He's greeting the three of you, but his eyes are focused on you. Again. You resist the urge to sigh."
    "他这话像是对你们三个说的，但眼神却又落在了你身上。又来了。你忍住没叹气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12057
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_97956cca:

    # p "Hello, sir. Can we help you?"
    p "“你好，先生。有什么能帮您的吗？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12059
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_71522d42:

    # a "You can, yes. You were in the passenger's quarters. As we talked about earlier I wanted to hear what he has to say to your story, and since you are off-duty, well you might as well come along."
    a "“当然有。你之前在乘客舱。就像之前说好的，我想听听他对你那故事的看法。反正你现在也没当班，不如一起过来。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12061
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_088cc9d7:

    # p "Er... Yes, sir."
    p "“呃... 是，先生。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12065
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_b33d52a2:

    # "Suddenly, Arthur's gaze turns from you, his brow furrowing in confusion. When you look behind you, Julian is gesturing something, arms waving this way and that while pointing at you. It's... difficult to decipher."
    "Arthur突然把目光从你身上移开，困惑地皱起眉头。你回头一看，Julian正手舞足蹈地比划着什么，还指指点点，让人摸不着头脑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12067
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_d6b2ca8d:

    # a "Is there an issue?"
    a "“有什么问题吗？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12069
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_85ecbc97:

    # w "He can't talk."
    w "“他不能说话。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12071
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_24eda930:

    # "You glance at Wolf. You're not helping when you only say that!"
    "你白了Wolf一眼，“说了等于没说！”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12073
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_f86fa3da:

    # p "It's from a bet, sir. Can't speak for the rest of the day."
    p "“他跟人打了赌，先生。今天剩下的时间都不能说话。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12075
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_b3f81638:

    # "Arthur just stares at you, then glances back to Julian, who is nodding."
    "Arthur只是盯着你，然后又看了看点头的Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12077
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_4f31f4e8:

    # a "I would hope that matters of import supersede a mere bet."
    a "“我希望你们分得清轻重缓急，别拿这种无聊的赌注当回事。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12079
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_93b31478:

    # p "I think he has the discretion for that, sir. Whatever it is must be unimportant."
    p "“我觉得他心里有数，先生。肯定不是什么要紧事。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12083
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_b6e1f142:

    # "You glare pointedly back at the lizard, who meets your gaze, then nods to Arthur."
    "你狠狠地瞪了那只蜥蜴一眼，他也看着你，然后朝Arthur点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12085
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_a885a756:

    # "Arthur shakes his head."
    "Arthur摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12089
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_e97d41e5:

    # a "As you two were."
    a "当我没说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12091
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_c15f832e:

    # "He turns back to you."
    "他转过身来看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12093
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_899d9afe:

    # a "And you? With me."
    a "“你，跟我来。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12099
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_634b9bb4:

    # "You wave off Wolf and Julian, following Arthur to Nomax's cabin door."
    "你朝Wolf和Julian挥挥手，示意他们不用管，然后跟着Arthur走到Nomax的船舱门口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12105
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_b475110e:

    # "The door swings open shortly after Arthur knocks on it, revealing the familiar painted dog behind it."
    "Arthur敲门后，门很快就打开了，露出了那张熟悉的彩绘狗的脸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12107
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_0eecffef:

    # n "Gentlemen? How may I help you?"
    n "“先生们？有什么能为你们效劳的吗？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12114
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_a3ba1242:

    # "Your walk is silent. You keep glancing back at Jules to ensure he isn't trying to signal something to you, but he seems to have accepted his lot in life for the moment."
    "一路上谁也没说话。你时不时回头看看Jules，生怕他憋着什么坏，但他好像已经认命了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12126
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_270e9029:

    # "When the three of you finally get above deck, however, you and Wolf are at a bit of a loss on who to grab and ask. You don't see Arthur around and you aren't familiar with anyone in the other shift."
    "好不容易三个人上了甲板，你和Wolf又傻眼了，不知道该找谁问。Arthur不见人影，其他班次的人你们也不熟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12128
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_9c1e6149:

    # "After a few moments, you start to walk towards another sailor, only for Julian to sigh loudly."
    "过了会儿，你刚想找个水手问问，Julian就重重地叹了口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12130
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_6387aa23:

    # "You look back at him and he shakes his head."
    "你回头看着他，他摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12132
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_e1666f96:

    # "And so, this is how you navigate the deck. You look at someone and then Julian sighs. Several of the men give you strange looks, but it works. And since it's helping you out, Wolf doesn't get testy about the sighs."
    "于是，你们就靠这招在甲板上瞎转悠——你看谁，Julian就叹气。不少人觉得你们莫名其妙，但这招还挺管用。而且Wolf看这法子确实有用，也就没计较Julian老叹气了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12134
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_8d11510e:

    # "Finally, you find someone that Julian nods at. Speaking to him, you find out that he's the boatswain, and figure out the assignments you three will have while Samuel is out."
    "终于，你们找到了一个Julian点头认可的人。跟他一聊才知道，他是水手长，你们也总算搞清楚了Samuel不在的时候，你们三个的任务安排。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12140
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_89e0f88d:

    # "You laze around for a while, feeling bad for yourself. You ruined something that was meant to be fun for him! You assumed he liked you more than he does! And now, you've got nothing for it."
    "你一个人在那儿瞎转悠，越想越难受。好好的事儿，让你给搅和了！还自作多情，以为人家多喜欢你呢！结果呢，啥也没捞着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12142
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_c1925663:

    # "Maybe you've permanently ruined the relationship."
    "也许你把这段关系彻底搞砸了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12144
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_9e9c1969:

    # "You sigh, holding your face in your hands."
    "你叹了口气，双手捂住了脸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12148
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_0a58a72d:

    # j "Ah, come on, cheer up... You know Wolf, he's a grouch. I'm sure I've annoyed him worse than you ever will."
    j "得了吧，开心点……你又不是不知道Wolf那家伙，一天到晚拉着个脸。我敢说我惹他烦的次数肯定比你多多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12150
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_3d547b83:

    # p "Do you really think that or are you being nice?"
    p "你真这么觉得？还是在安慰我呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12154
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_6cfd4a85:

    # j "Yes?"
    j "是？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12156
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_867b1d8d:

    # "Despite everything, you laugh at him."
    "明知道闹成这样，你还是被他逗笑了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12158
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_4892cc35:

    # p "Well, thank you, Jules. Guess I can't mope forever. Is it our watch yet?"
    p "谢了，Jules。行吧，我也不能一直愁眉苦脸的。到点儿咱们去值班了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12160
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_aaaa276a:

    # j "Well, I didn't hear the bell yet. Must be coming up soon, though. Here, follow me, we'll get you some fresh air and then we can go ask the boatswain what to do next. You know, with Samuel hurt."
    j "我还没听到铃响呢。不过也快了吧。走，跟我先去透口气，然后咱去找水手长问问接下来该做啥。Samuel受伤了，总得安排安排。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12162
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_cb149884:

    # p "Uh, sure. I trust your knowledge of procedure here."
    p "成，我信你，这方面你熟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12166
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_cf1c9a8b:

    # "You begin the trek up towards the deck."
    "你开始往甲板方向走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12168
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_abab48f3:

    # p "So... which one of us should get him when we find out?"
    p "待会儿找到他，你说谁去跟他说这事儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12172
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_b916550a:

    # j "Good question! I'll bother him for you. Since it seems you can't handle a single failure."
    j "问得好！我去烦他。不就一次没弄好么，瞧你那样儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12174
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_f52ba867:

    # "He grins, elbowing you playfully."
    "他笑着，轻轻用胳膊肘捅你一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12178
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_bf6fed80:

    # "You elbow him back, rolling your eyes."
    "你翻了个白眼，也用胳膊肘顶回去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12182
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_da32114c:

    # p "Oh, shush, Jules. It's not that, it's that we—I—will be stuck with him. I hate it when there's unspoken stuff between me and someone else, you know?"
    p "好啦别嚷嚷了，Jules。真不是你想的那样，主要是咱们——或者说我——接下来得一直跟他低头不见抬头见。我最讨厌跟人之间藏着掖着、心怀芥蒂了，懂吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12184
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_dd8ffc04:

    # p "And everything is unspoken with Wolf."
    p "可跟Wolf之间，什么都是不明说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12186
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_cf21de9a:

    # j "Yeah, yeah, I'm just making fun of you. Things will be fine, I'm sure, just give it time."
    j "知道啦知道啦，我就是逗你玩呢。放心吧，会好的，时间长了就没事儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12190
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_d15b60ff:

    # "Your clever response is interrupted by a sudden looming figure in the darkness."
    "你本想回他两句，结果突然冒出来个黑影，打断了你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12195
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_af7fbee2_1:

    # "Arthur looks down at you, silhouetted by the light coming from the stairwell. His broad form is unmistakable, as is his posture."
    "Arthur居高临下地看着你，楼梯间的光映出他高大的轮廓。他那宽阔的身材，还有那站姿，绝不会认错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12197
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_589e4888_1:

    # a "Landsmen."
    a "旱鸭子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12199
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_74bd2d94:

    # "He's greeting the two of you, but his eyes are focused on you. Again. You resist the urge to sigh."
    "他是在跟咱俩打招呼，可是眼睛又盯上你了。真是够了。你努力忍住没叹气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12201
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_97956cca_1:

    # p "Hello, sir. Can we help you?"
    p "“你好，先生。有什么能帮您的吗？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12203
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_47db52b3:

    # a "You can, yes. You were in the passenger's quarters. As mentioned earlier I want to go and talk with him, and since you are off-duty you may as well come along."
    a "可以。你之前在旅客舱。我刚才就想说了，我想去跟他聊聊，你反正也没事儿，一起去吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12205
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_088cc9d7_1:

    # p "Er... Yes, sir."
    p "“呃... 是，先生。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:12207
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_bb7bcde3:

    # "Julian opens his mouth to say something, then closes it. Arthur looks at him."
    "Julian张了张嘴，又闭上了。Arthur看着他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12209
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_51db051f:

    # a "What is it, landsman?"
    a "你想说啥，新来的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12211
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_0d105d8a:

    # j "Do you think this will take long, sir? We were finding out our duties for the next watch now that Samuel's hurt."
    j "先生，您看这事儿得多久啊？Samuel伤了，我们还等着去领下班儿的活儿呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12213
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_661791fd:

    # "Arthur blinks, as if he hadn't considered that."
    "Arthur眨了眨眼，好像根本没考虑到这茬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12215
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_1f803da8:

    # a "It will take as long as it takes. You can go to the boatswain and figure out a new assignment. I will send him along when we are done. Understood?"
    a "该多久就多久。你们去找水手长，让他给你们派个新活儿。完事儿我让他去找你们。明白了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12217
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_79db1639:

    # j "Yes, sir."
    j "是的，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12221
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_c0dc9879:

    # "Julian then begins to walk up the stairs, but he turns back to give you a sympathetic look before he vanishes into the light of day."
    "Julian开始上楼，不过在身影消失在甲板上的光亮中之前，回头同情地看了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12223
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_5f582811:

    # a "Now, with me. Tell your story promptly and with no delay and you'll have time left in this watch."
    a "跟我走吧。麻溜儿把事儿说清楚，磨磨唧唧的这班儿就别想闲着了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12225
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_b2c856c0:

    # p "Yes, sir."
    p "是的，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12227
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_1cf98911:

    # "The two of you march the rest of the way in silence. Before long, you've returned to Nomax's cabin."
    "俩人一路沉默，总算到了Nomax的房间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12233
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_b475110e_1:

    # "The door swings open shortly after Arthur knocks on it, revealing the familiar painted dog behind it."
    "Arthur敲门后，门很快就打开了，露出了那张熟悉的彩绘狗的脸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12235
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_0401bed5:

    # n "Gentlemen? How may I help?"
    n "两位有何贵干？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12249
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_bb3e68c8:

    # p "Oh, it just needs time? Thank goodness, that's the one thing we have in abundance here. I'm glad it's that simple."
    p "噢，只要时间够长就行？谢天谢地，这船上别的没有，就是时间多。这么简单我就放心了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12251
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_681e3962:

    # "You sigh."
    "你叹了口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12253
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_6cd7f64f:

    # p "Well, I guess you're right. Nothing to be done for now. We just gotta continue living on."
    p "好吧，我想你是对的。现在就只能这样了。咱们还是得继续过日子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12257
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_03b8fe78:

    # j "That's what I'm talking about. To continued living!"
    j "我说的就是这个。为了继续活下去！"

# game/script day2.rpy:12259
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_569519a0:

    # p "Are you toasting? We don't even have drinks."
    p "你在敬酒吗？咱们又没酒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12261
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_7558663b:

    # j "Well, no, but they're good words to live by, don't you think?"
    j "嗨，这话说得在理，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12263
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_e065d3cb:

    # "Your back and forth continues as the two of you report to the boatswain as Julian suggested. You figure out what you're to do while Samuel is hurt."
    "你们一边斗嘴，一边按Julian说的去向水手长报道。你们得安排好Samuel受伤期间的工作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12273
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_4532a34e:

    # p "Alright, that was fun! I'm glad you have those dice, Jules, it'll definitely give us something to do."
    p "真有意思！幸好你带了骰子，Jules，肯定能打发时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12277
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_97f34791:

    # j "Of course, I bring the fun as always."
    j "那是，我出马，肯定少不了乐子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12281
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_075674c5:

    # w "Better than staring at latrines."
    w "总比盯着茅房强。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12283
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_794c8249:

    # j "Only the highest of compliments from you, Wolf."
    j "Wolf，你能这么夸我，真是荣幸之至。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12287
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_ca1d6954:

    # "The three of you stand one by one. You stretch a little, rolling your shoulders and leaning one way then the other with your legs."
    "你们三个一个接一个地站起身。你稍微伸展了一下，转动肩膀，活动腿脚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12291
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_59f72ab0:

    # p "How long was that? Hard to tell down here."
    p "过了多久了？这鬼地方很难说清时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12293
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_ae5603b0:

    # j "Think we've still got some time left before the next watch. We can get some fresh air, maybe find the boatswain and figure out what we'll be doing next? With Samuel being hurt, I mean."
    j "估计离下次值班还有点时间。咱们去透透气，顺便找水手长问问，搞清楚接下来干啥？Samuel受伤了嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12295
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_11dc74f8:

    # w "Figure that out and find me. I'm going to rest until then."
    w "你们先去打听，然后来找我。我先眯一会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12297
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_3a098a82:

    # p "Sure. See you later, Wolf."
    p "好嘞。回头见，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12302
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_b1901382:

    # "The canine just nods before stepping out, no doubt searching for some corner to nap in."
    "那家伙点点头就走了，肯定是找地儿打盹去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12306
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_5e6c3dab:

    # j "And the wolf takes a catnap, huh?"
    j "狼也打盹儿，哈？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12310
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_65f5f9c1:

    # "You roll your eyes at the lizard as you head up to the deck with him."
    "你朝那蜥蜴翻了个白眼，就和他一起往甲板走去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12312
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_8ce0e180:

    # p "I hate that term. How did we become associated with being so lazy?"
    p "我最烦别人这么说。我们怎么就和懒划上了等号？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12316
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_8aac844e:

    # j "Well, you did shirk work on your first day here..."
    j "你第一天就偷懒来着..."

# game/script day2.rpy:12318
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_6b634a63:

    # p "Shut up, that doesn't count. There was a good reason for that-"
    p "别提了，那不算！那是有原因的-"

# game/script day2.rpy:12320
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_2df42737:

    # "You are interrupted by turning the corner into a large shape in the dimness of the under deck."
    "你在昏暗的下层甲板转角处，突然撞见一个高大的身影，打断了他的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12325
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_ec49994f:

    # a "A good reason? I would like to hear it, then."
    a "有什么原因？我还真想听听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12327
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_0fd18524:

    # "You damn near jump out of your skin as the imposing figure turns out to be Arthur. Thankfully, Julian is spooked as well, so you aren't entirely embarrassed by it."
    "你差点没被Arthur吓死，好在Julian也被吓了一跳，不然你就更尴尬了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12331
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_1b7d5a7b:

    # p "Uh, excuse me, sir?"
    p "呃，长官？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12333
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_5551c226:

    # a "Your reason for being in the passenger's cabin. As we discussed earlier, I would like to talk with our passenger, and figured since you're off-duty you may as well come along."
    a "你出现在乘客舱的原因。之前不是说好了吗，我想找乘客聊聊，看你现在没值班，就让你也一起来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12335
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_7bada59b:

    # "He turns to look down at Julian."
    "他转头看向Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12337
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_22c1b132:

    # a "As you were. I am borrowing him for the moment."
    a "你忙你的去吧。我借用他一会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12339
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_62e20441:

    # j "Yes, sir. I'll find you after this, [name]."
    j "是，长官。之后我去找你，[name]。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12344
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_8ac5770e:

    # "Julian continues walking past Arthur. When he's behind the horse, he gives a mocking expression at the officer while you're still looking. Then, the lizard's gone, leaving you alone."
    "Julian继续往前走，经过Arthur身后时，你还看着呢，他朝那军官做了个鬼脸。然后，那蜥蜴就溜了，留下你一个人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12346
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_67341620:

    # p "Well, sir-"
    p "长官-"

# game/script day2.rpy:12348
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_12224ea4:

    # a "Come. I will hear your version of the story with the passenger present."
    a "来吧。我会当着乘客的面听你怎么说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12350
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_4e440233:

    # "And then the two of you are returning to Nomax's cabin. When you arrive at the door, you feel a sense of anxiety creeping up."
    "然后你们俩就回Nomax的舱房。到了门口，你开始觉得有点不对劲，心里发毛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12356
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_b475110e_2:

    # "The door swings open shortly after Arthur knocks on it, revealing the familiar painted dog behind it."
    "Arthur敲门后，门很快就打开了，露出了那张熟悉的彩绘狗的脸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12358
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_0401bed5_1:

    # n "Gentlemen? How may I help?"
    n "两位有何贵干？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12372
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_bbd3ceef:

    # j "Maybe there was a particularly famous lazy cat in some old story. Or maybe cats just are lazy."
    j "也许在一些古老的故事里有一只特别有名的懒猫。或者也许猫就是懒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12374
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_980faf41:

    # p "I'm not."
    p "我不是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12378
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_69248b8e:

    # j "Oh, of course not. You're the hardest working cat ever. Surely they'll write ballads of you and you'll be as remembered as King Arthur."
    j "哦，当然不是啦！你可是最勤劳的猫了。说不定以后还有人为你写歌，让你像Arthur王一样名垂青史呢！"

# game/script day2.rpy:12380
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_50a26dcc:

    # p "Ha, ha, very funny."
    p "哈哈，真有趣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12384
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_6efc5592:

    # j "I am, thank you."
    j "那是当然，多谢夸奖。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12386
translate Chinese day2_dice_outro_d9f83ea4:

    # "Your back and forth continues as the two of you report to the boatswain. You figure out what you're to do while Samuel is hurt."
    "你们一边斗嘴，一边去向水手长报到。你也弄明白了Samuel受伤期间你该顶替他做什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12413
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_fa9f1f11:

    # "You shake your head in response."
    "你摇摇头回应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12415
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_9fd2bf77:

    # j "No?"
    j "没有吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12417
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_77930504:

    # p "I think I'll check on Samuel again, see how he's doing. But you two enjoy yourselves."
    p "我想我再去看看Samuel怎么样了，看看他情况如何。但你们两个玩得开心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12419
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ecfd9b10:

    # j "Fair enough. You can find us if you want to join in later."
    j "好吧。如果你想加入，可以来找我们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12421
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d951ffa6:

    # "The three of you make your way to the stairs, past members of the other half of the crew getting ready to take over."
    "你们三个人走向楼梯，经过另一半正在准备接班的船员。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12425
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8673a737:

    # j "You were there for it, right? How bad is it?"
    j "你当时也在场，对吧？情况有多糟？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12427
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5d7becb5:

    # p "The injury?"
    p "伤势？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12431
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5f44fe57:

    # "Julian nods and takes the first few steps down the wide stairwell, the shade of the lower deck soon enveloping him."
    "Julian点点头，走下宽阔的楼梯，下层甲板的阴影很快笼罩了他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12433
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_7c630f2f:

    # p "Nothing major, thankfully. The doctor didn't appear concerned, and Samuel was in good spirits."
    p "谢天谢地，没什么大不了的。医生看起来并不担心，而且Samuel精神状态很好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12435
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ce786ffd:

    # p "I'd say we were lucky."
    p "我想我们很幸运。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12437
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_52f94413:

    # j "If it was a sheet that tore, then yes. Very."
    j "要是撕的是帆，那可就真是万幸了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12439
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c7479dc4:

    # j "These things are under so much tension that they are able to snap bones in half. It must have only grazed him."
    j "这些东西承受着很大的张力，能够把骨头折断。肯定只是擦伤了他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12443
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ed4eec1c:

    # j "You were down to see him, weren't you? How is he doing?"
    j "你下去看过他，不是吗？他怎么样了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12447
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5f44fe57_1:

    # "Julian nods and takes the first few steps down the wide stairwell, the shade of the lower deck soon enveloping him."
    "Julian点点头，走下宽阔的楼梯，下层甲板的阴影很快笼罩了他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12449
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_009c0c1c:

    # p "He appears to be in good spirits and the surgeon didn't look too concerned about it either."
    p "他看起来精神状态很好，而且外科医生看起来也不太担心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12451
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_91123bb7:

    # p "So I think he'll be up soon again.{w} I hope."
    p "所以我认为他很快就会好起来的。{w} 我希望如此。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12455
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_7e4a711b:

    # w "What did Arthur want from you anyway?"
    w "Arthur到底想从你这里得到什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12457
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5e98feaf:

    # "The canine's voice comes from behind as he follows the two of you down the stairs, and you turn to look back over your shoulder."
    "你们俩下楼的时候，那条狗在后面问，你回过头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12459
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_73f98413:

    # p "Ah... just...{w} I don't know. He seems to think I'm at the center of it all."
    p "啊...只是...{w} 我不知道。他似乎认为我处于一切的中心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12461
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_6c62a4a7:

    # p "As if I'm causing everything that goes wrong."
    p "好像我导致了一切不顺。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12475
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_7b18cc40:

    # "Wolf simply responds with a thoughtful grumble. The three of you turn left as you reach the bottom of the stairs, where Wolf settles down at one of the hanging tables that was now free with half the crew being busy."
    "Wolf只是若有所思地咕哝了一声作为回应。你们三人在楼梯底部左转，Wolf在其中一张悬挂的桌子旁安顿下来，现在由于一半的船员都在忙碌而空闲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12477
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_3742289f:

    # "You stand at the head of it, holding onto the ropes that keep it level despite the swaying of the ship, while Julian grabs his dice."
    "你站在桌子前，抓住绳索，尽管船在摇晃，也要保持桌子的水平，而Julian拿起他的骰子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12481
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_86447fc0:

    # j "I don't like him."
    j "我不喜欢他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12485
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_bf4b77d6:

    # p "I don't think he's that bad. I just don't know what he's on about..."
    p "我不认为他有那么糟糕。我只是不知道他在说什么..."

# game/script day2.rpy:12487
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8cfb5cf0:

    # p "Do you think I'm causing problems?"
    p "你觉得我是在给大家添麻烦吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12489
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_7414a63a:

    # j "Not really. Probably the opposite. Out of the three of us new recruits, I'd say you're the most enthusiastic."
    j "倒没有。可能正好相反。要说咱们这三个新来的，我觉得你数你最积极。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12493
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_3fa48663:

    # p "I just don't understand what he's on about."
    p "我就是搞不懂他到底想说什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12497
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_b458e964:

    # p "I agree..."
    p "我同意……"

# game/script day2.rpy:12499
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f482ee7b:

    # p "Makes you wonder how he ever made it to officer acting like that."
    p "真不知道他这种人是怎么混上军官的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12501
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ce4a1279:

    # p "... Well, whatever. It's only my first real day. I'm sure I can make a better impression if I want to. For now, I'll get going. I'll see you around."
    p "... 算了，没事。今天才是我第一天当差。我想好好干的话，肯定能让大家刮目相看。先这样，我溜了，回头见！"

# game/script day2.rpy:12510
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0ab8c6fa:

    # "You let go of the ropes and make your way further into the body of the ship, down another set of stairs, descending into the stuffier air of the ship's depths."
    "你松开绳子，往船舱里走去，又下一层楼梯，空气也变得更加闷热。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12512
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d448cada:

    # "Not the most pleasant area to be in... but few places are in the cramped lower decks."
    "这地方可不怎么样……不过在这拥挤的下层船舱里，也没啥好地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12514
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f6d24b9d:

    # "Weaving your way past some of the crew, you make your way to Rajeeyah's cabin, where you'd last seen Samuel. Muffled voices from within make you slow your approach, ears perking at the sounds."
    "你挤过几个船员，朝Rajeeyah的舱房走去，你上次见到Samuel就在那儿。舱房里传来含糊不清的声音，你放轻脚步，竖起耳朵听了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12516
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_57458dab:

    # "You know you should knock and announce your presence, but you can't help yourself. You lean in close and press an ear to the door, hearing the muffled speech become slightly clearer."
    "你本该敲门打个招呼，但还是没忍住。你悄悄凑到门边，把耳朵贴在门上，想听清楚他们在说些什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12518
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_dae3f4db:

    # r "{alpha=0.3}... I'll just leave it sitting while I get them, sure. Nothing can go wrong with that plan.{/alpha}"
    r "{alpha=0.3}……我先把东西放那儿，等我去拿，肯定没问题。这计划万无一失！{/alpha}"

# game/script day2.rpy:12520
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c9df044a:

    # s "{alpha=0.3}What? Why would it?{/alpha}"
    s "{alpha=0.3}什么？能有啥问题？{/alpha}"

# game/script day2.rpy:12522
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_1d7e540e:

    # r "{alpha=0.3}Yes, Hannah, you know this ship well.{w} The Conway.{w} Famously known for the restraint of her crew when it comes to rations left unattended.{/alpha}"
    r "{alpha=0.3}是是是，Hannah，你最了解这条船了。{w}Conway号嘛。{w}船上的水手看到吃的没人管，那叫一个克制！{/alpha}"

# game/script day2.rpy:12524
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_095bced0:

    # r "{alpha=0.3}No, no. They can very well wait until I'm done. I'm not their mum.{/alpha}"
    r "{alpha=0.3}不用，不用。他们爱等多久等多久，我又不是他们老妈子。{/alpha}"

# game/script day2.rpy:12526
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_fe9253aa:

    # "The laughter of Samuel echoes from inside the room. You hesitate, unsure if you should leave or not before you finally decide to knock."
    "房间里传来了Samuel的笑声。你犹豫了一下，不知道该不该走，最后还是决定敲门。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12530
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_3f51d873:

    # p "Hey, it's me, [name]. I figured I'd see if you're doing any better.{w} May I come in?"
    p "嘿，是我，[name]。我来看看你好点没。{w}我可以进来吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12532
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d9b2a6b4:

    # "A brief silence follows before you get your answer from Samuel."
    "沉默了一会儿，Samuel回话了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12534
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_98b4bfbc:

    # s "Yeah, sure. Come on in."
    s "行啊，进来吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12538
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_1fffd394:

    # "The door clicks out of its lock as you press on the handle, and the view into the familiar room greets you once again."
    "你按下门把手，门锁咔哒一声开了，熟悉的房间又出现在眼前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12550
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f963687c:

    # "You step in and close the door behind you, carefully easing it back into its lock."
    "你走进房间，关上身后的门，小心地把门锁好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12552
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_83c4acc7:

    # "Your gaze falls on Samuel, lingering on the maned wolf for a little too long before you finally remember to look over at Rajeeyah with a nod of greeting."
    "你的目光落在Samuel身上，盯着那头maned wolf看了好一会儿，才想起朝Rajeeyah点点头，打个招呼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12554
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_731a0105:

    # s "Already missing me? How on fire is the ship with me down here?"
    s "这么快就想我了？我不在的时候，船烧得有多旺啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12556
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0eab2e44:

    # p "Very on fire."
    p "可旺了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12558
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_de3ee119:

    # p "Konrad's ordering Julian and Wolf to try and roll it out as we speak."
    p "Konrad正让Julian和Wolf赶紧想办法灭火呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12560
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a8dfd16c:

    # p "I got... err..."
    p "我...呃..."

# game/script day2.rpy:12562
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f4747898:

    # "You look around the room, trying to find something to make your dumb joke land. Your gaze finds the bottle of rum from earlier. An easy target."
    "你环顾四周，想找个话茬接上。你的目光落在了之前的朗姆酒瓶上，这不就是现成的吗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12564
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0f8bb0ed:

    # p "...I've been told the only thing that could possibly put it out is your rum."
    p "......我听说，想灭火，只能用你的朗姆酒了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12569
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_51637d95:

    # "Rajeeyah chuckles softly, stepping up between you and the bottle."
    "Rajeeyah轻笑一声，走到你和酒瓶中间，挡住你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12571
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a1357b36:

    # r "I'm afraid I'll have to defend my patient's belongings. He's in pain and needs it. You'll have to make do without it, I'm afraid."
    r "恐怕我得保护我病人的东西。他难受着呢，就指着这个了。你就别想了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12573
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_7bc8f6bc:

    # "You laugh at Rajeeyah's retort, smiling as your gaze shifts from her, to Samuel and back again."
    "你笑着回应Rajeeyah，目光在她和Samuel之间来回移动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12575
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_6e765357:

    # "With the mood seeming relatively light, you decide to sate the curiosity from your eavesdropping."
    "看气氛还不错，你决定问问刚才偷听到的事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12577
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_08833da7:

    # p "So... Who's Hannah?"
    p "所以…... 到底谁是Hannah？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12581
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_896c5f6b:

    # p "Was there someone else here just a moment ago? Who were you talking to?"
    p "刚刚这儿有人吗？你在跟谁说话？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12583
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0d9ea869:

    # "The cheetah's expression immediately hardens. An icy stare piercing you where you stand."
    "母猎豹的表情瞬间变得凶狠，眼神冰冷地盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12585
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_af2d2f36:

    # r "Were you listening in on us?"
    r "你在偷听我们说话？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12587
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8ea6c249:

    # "You immediately feel regret in asking the question. Rajeeyah's gaze is unrelenting, making it hard to look her in the eye. You immediately shift your view to Samuel for support."
    "问完你就后悔了。Rajeeyah的眼神咄咄逼人，你都不敢和她对视，赶紧看向Samuel，想让他帮着说句话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12591
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_49c2024c:

    # p "It was an accident! I was just coming to check on Samuel and heard you talking as I approached the door. I thought I heard you mention someone named Hannah?"
    p "我不是故意的！我就是来看看Samuel，走过来的时候听见你们在说话，好像提到了一个叫Hannah的人？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12593
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8419800c:

    # "Samuel's eyes widen. An odd look of surprise crosses his face, one that seemed far too out of place on the maned wolf. He quickly looks to Rajeeyah, silently pleading for her assistance."
    "Samuel瞪大了眼睛，脸上露出了惊讶的表情，在他这只鬃狼脸上显得格格不入，眼神疯狂暗示Rajeeyah救场。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12601
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_fd33550d:

    # r "{cps=*0.3}You must have mish-{nw}{/cps}"
    r "{cps=*0.3}你一定是听-{nw}{/cps}"

# game/script day2.rpy:12603
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_adf66950:

    # s "Yes.{w} Hannah."
    s "对，{w} Hannah。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12607
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_71473f82:

    # "Rajeeyah is clearly taken by surprise when Samuel interrupts her."
    "Samuel突然插话，Rajeeyah明显愣了一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12609
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_683464af:

    # r "Samuel?"
    r "Samuel？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12613
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_eb1e554b:

    # s "What? He is a snoopy lil' bastard, but if he heard it he heard it."
    s "他就是个多管闲事的家伙，听都听见了，还能怎么样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12617
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_39bb8b9e:

    # r "I should have been more careful, I'm sorry."
    r "怪我没注意，抱歉啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12621
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ddd4e368:

    # s "Rajeeyah."
    s "Rajeeyah。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12623
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5ec734db:

    # s "It could have been worse, honestly. I don't know him that well, but so far, he's proven himself one of the good ones. He's here checking on me, isn't he?"
    s "说实话，这事儿也不算太坏。我不太了解他，但他这人还不错，他这不是特意来看我的吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12625
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_bf70cadd:

    # "Cautiously, you make your way to where Samuel's lying, sure that Rajeeyah will pounce on you at any moment. The cheetah's gaze, if anything, has only grown sharper."
    "你小心翼翼地走到Samuel旁边，生怕Rajeeyah突然扑上来。母猎豹的眼神，感觉更犀利了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12627
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_23c8474f:

    # p "So... Hannah?"
    p "所以……Hannah？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12629
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_32394614:

    # "You repeat, still unsure of the situation. It felt like there was a piece of the puzzle you were missing, and it was that piece that had Rajeeyah on edge."
    "你又问了一遍，还是没搞清楚状况，总感觉缺了点什么，Rajeeyah好像就在意这个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12631
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_cee1a8ba:

    # "Samuel searches for his words for a good long while before answering, his fingers playing with the edge of the blanket."
    "Samuel支吾了半天，手指无意识地抠着毯子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12633
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a68abfaf:

    # s "Please keep using Samuel, if ya don't mind."
    s "以后叫我Samuel就行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12635
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d567f39d:

    # "You give Samuel a confused tilt of the head, unsure of what he meant... until it hits you like a rock to the back of the head."
    "你一脸懵逼地看着Samuel，完全没明白他啥意思…...突然灵光一闪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12637
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_7a725df3:

    # p "Oh... OH! I uh... I see. I uhm..."
    p "哦…...我、我好像懂了…..."

# game/script day2.rpy:12639
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2d2e5d25:

    # "You swallow nervously, darting your gaze from Samuel's calm, understanding look to Rajeeyah's narrowed glare."
    "你紧张地咽了口唾沫，眼神在淡定的Samuel和眼神不善的Rajeeyah之间来回游移。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12641
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5dc761a9:

    # p "So you're a...?"
    p "所以你是……那啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12646
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_7232d7f5:

    # "Samuel rolls his eyes before offering you a soft punch in the arm, the movement causing him to wince slightly from his wound."
    "Samuel翻了个白眼，抬手轻轻给了你一下，结果扯到伤口了，疼得他直咧嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12648
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_384f1057:

    # s "I know you're dumb, but I don't think you're that dumb. The answer is yes."
    s "我知道你脑子不好使，但也不至于这么蠢吧。没错，就是你想的那样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12652
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_af668e89:

    # "You reach up to rub your arm as you stare at the maned wolf questioningly."
    "你揉着胳膊，一脸疑惑地看着他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12656
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_09d3333b:

    # p "I can keep my muzzle shut. I don't need any more trouble. I guess I just don't know what to make of it."
    p "我肯定不会瞎说，不想惹麻烦。就是……有点懵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12658
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2d0f61fc:

    # p "Or rather the why?"
    p "主要是……为啥啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12661
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_7e47d8a5:

    # r "You must have misheard."
    r "你肯定听错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12663
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8bfb6f0a:

    # "The cheetah's voice has a finality to it. A tone that could make anyone shut up and stop asking questions."
    "这猎豹的嗓音，简直是一锤定音，谁听了都得闭嘴，屁都不敢多放一个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12665
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_57fb83d7:

    # "You have no intention of fighting with Rajeeyah. You look back to the door, considering a safe retreat."
    "你压根不想跟 Rajeeyah 吵，回头瞅着门，琢磨着怎么才能安全溜走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12667
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2ef3a58b:

    # s "Look. Just... come over here a moment."
    s "喂，我说...你过来一下成不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12669
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_bf70cadd_1:

    # "Cautiously, you make your way to where Samuel's lying, sure that Rajeeyah will pounce on you at any moment. The cheetah's gaze, if anything, has only grown sharper."
    "你小心翼翼地走到Samuel旁边，生怕Rajeeyah突然扑上来。母猎豹的眼神，感觉更犀利了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12673
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8fed058e:

    # "A tense quiet fills the room as you stop near the maned wolf. Samuel shifts on the bed, tugging at the edge of the mattress with his claws, obviously considering what to say."
    "你走到那只鬃狼旁边，房间里顿时安静得让人心里发毛。Samuel 在床上不安地动弹着，爪子抠着床单，显然是在措辞。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12675
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_6230916d:

    # s "Can I trust you to not let this get out, [name]?"
    s "我能信得过你，不会把这事儿捅出去吗， [name]?"

# game/script day2.rpy:12679
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5708e5e8:

    # r "Samuel...?"
    r "Samuel...？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12681
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_b31785a3:

    # s "What? He's not stupid, Rajeeyah. I'd rather get an assurance than just hoping he understands."
    s "啥？他又不傻，Rajeeyah。我宁可他保证，也比干等着他自己琢磨明白强。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12685
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_27f9d45d:

    # "You find both their eyes trained on you while you answer."
    "你一开口，就发现他们的眼珠子都直勾勾地盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12687
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2d70fd1f:

    # p "I'm not sure what I'm supposed to keep quiet, if I'm being honest."
    p "说实话，我压根儿不知道你们想让我瞒着啥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12691
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_711ec90d:

    # "Samuel actually laughs at that, a sound that ends with a sharp grunt as the movement aggravates his wound."
    "Samuel 听了这话，居然笑了出来，结果一笑牵动了伤口，疼得他倒吸一口凉气，哼唧了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12695
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ddd11452:

    # s "Look you're not that dumb. You heard her talk to someone named Hannah. You didn't see anyone leave the room. You'll put it together on your own if I gave you enough time, right?"
    s "别装了，你又不傻。你听见她跟一个叫 Hannah 的人说话，又没看见谁走出这屋，给你点时间，你自己也能捋清楚，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12699
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d567f39d_1:

    # "You give Samuel a confused tilt of the head, unsure of what he meant... until it hits you like a rock to the back of the head."
    "你一脸懵逼地看着Samuel，完全没明白他啥意思…...突然灵光一闪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12701
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ebb8c9e8:

    # p "Oh... OH! I uh.. I see. I uhm..."
    p "哦... 哦！我...我好像明白了...呃..."

# game/script day2.rpy:12703
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2d2e5d25_1:

    # "You swallow nervously, darting your gaze from Samuel's calm, understanding look to Rajeeyah's narrowed glare."
    "你紧张地咽了口唾沫，眼神在淡定的Samuel和眼神不善的Rajeeyah之间来回游移。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12705
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5dc761a9_1:

    # p "So you're a...?"
    p "所以你是……那啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12709
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_dcac03fd:

    # "The maned wolf rolls his eyes and simply shrugs."
    "鬃狼翻了个白眼，耸耸肩，一副无所谓的德行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12711
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d6815912:

    # s "Yes. And with that, I think I need the rest of that rum."
    s "没错。这么说来，剩下的朗姆酒，我得干了它。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12713
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_e518159e:

    # p "I can keep my muzzle shut. I've had enough trouble today already. I guess I just don't know what to make of it."
    p "我能管住自己的嘴。我今天倒霉事儿已经够多了，就...就这事儿，我实在有点懵，不知道该怎么想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12715
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2d0f61fc_1:

    # p "Or rather the why?"
    p "主要是……为啥啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12721
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f261a2e5:

    # "Rajeeyah finally stops her threatening gaze long enough to grab a stool and pull it over. She carefully adjusts her dress as she settles down in her seat, carefully crossing one leg over the other."
    "Rajeeyah总算停下了她那吓人的眼神，抓起一个凳子拉了过来。她小心地调整了一下裙子，优雅地坐下，一条腿叠在另一条腿上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12725
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_6255fe4e:

    # r "You never stopped to wonder why there are no women on this ship? Or any ship for that matter."
    r "你就没想过这条船上为什么没有女人吗？或者说，任何船上都没有？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12727
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_cb0a1570:

    # p "I guess I never did, no. It's just a man's job I suppose."
    p "我想我真没想过，可能这就是男人的活儿吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12729
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_911113d2:

    # "Even just saying these words feels awkward with the two of them being right there... as if you're attacking their mere presence."
    "只是说这些话，我都觉得浑身不自在...... 感觉像是在冒犯他们两个的存在似的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12731
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_29bd8c67:

    # p "Tough conditions. Hard work..."
    p "条件艰苦，工作又累......"

# game/script day2.rpy:12735
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_eaddd299:

    # r "Maybe so.{w} But that's not what I mean. Sailors are a superstitious lot, not to mention how steeped in tradition this occupation is. We'd have a mutiny before we left harbor if they knew they had a woman on the crew."
    r "也许吧。{w}  但我不是那个意思。水手们都很迷信的，更别说这行有多讲究传统了。要是让他们知道船上有女人，咱们还没出港就得哗变。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12737
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c24b0413:

    # p "I guess, but what about you?"
    p "我是明白了，那你自己呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12741
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_aa11053d:

    # r "I'm the ship's surgeon and don't touch anything in their domain. I assume that is good enough to assuage their beliefs."
    r "我是船上的医生，又不碰他们管辖的那些东西。我觉得这样应该就足以打消他们的顾虑了吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12743
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2bb87208:

    # "She crosses her arms and tips her head back, looking up at the ceiling."
    "她抱起胳膊，头向后仰，望着天花板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12747
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_16da4090:

    # r "But even then, I'm only here because of Arthur. We have a bit of history together, and he had enough influence to calm their concerns."
    r "其实，我能来这儿，还得感谢Arthur。我们之间有点交情，而且他也有足够面子摆平那些家伙的担忧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12749
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2a6fc527:

    # p "But Samuel's been on this ship for years, right? They'd still have problems after all of that?"
    p "可是Samuel在这船上待了好几年了吧？这么长时间了，他们还是会有意见？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12753
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_b8323db2:

    # s "I'm in no rush to find out, man.{w} This ship and the crew mean too much for me to risk that, y'know?"
    s "我可不想冒这个险，兄弟。{w}  这艘船和这帮兄弟伙对我太重要了，我不能拿这个冒险，懂吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12755
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_4ae099f4:

    # s "Could ya hand me the rum, Raj?"
    s "嘿，Raj，把朗姆酒递给我呗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12760
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_9a462545:

    # "You nod in understanding and watch as Rajeeyah reaches back, grabbing the bottle by the neck and swinging it around to the maned wolf. Samuel quickly uncorks the bottle and lifts it back for a heavy gulp."
    "你点点头表示明白，看着Rajeeyah往后一伸手，抓住瓶颈，甩给了那个长着鬃毛的家伙。Samuel麻利地拔开瓶塞，仰头猛灌了一口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12764
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5e959ae6:

    # r "Is the pain coming back?"
    r "疼劲儿又上来了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12766
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_85652ec7:

    # "With [his] lips sealed to the bottle, Samuel isn't able to answer and shakes [his] head instead, sending [his] braided hair swaying from left to right."
    "Samuel嘴都怼到瓶子上了，没法说话，只能摇摇头，辫子也跟着甩来甩去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12768
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_88111c93:

    # "[He] takes another hefty swig before finally lowering the bottle down to speak."
    "他又猛灌了一口，这才放下瓶子，开了口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12770
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5b8914e9:

    # s "Calming the nerves, Raj."
    s "冷静一下神经，Rajeeyah。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12774
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_352eb28c:

    # p "I'm sorry. Really, trust me, you don't have to worry about me spilling it to anyone."
    p "对不住啊。真的，信我，我绝对不会跟别人瞎说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12776
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d4af6ab7:

    # "Samuel nods [his] appreciation and hands the bottle over to you."
    "Samuel点点头，表示谢意，然后把瓶子递给你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12780
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ba607ee9:

    # s "I appreciate it. Want a sip?"
    s "谢了。来一口不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12793
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8313c4c1:

    # "Taking the bottle in paw, you bring it up for a single swallow, letting the alcohol's burn hit the back of your throat and quickly warm your belly."
    "你用爪子接过瓶子，抿了一小口，让酒精的辛辣感直冲嗓子眼，然后一股暖意瞬间涌上心头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12795
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_e6242fd8:

    # "When you bring your head back down you spot Rajeeyah next to you with her paw held in front of her eyes."
    "你一抬头，就看见Rajeeyah就在你旁边，不好意思地用爪子遮住了眼睛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12797
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_7937ddc6:

    # "It wasn't enough to make you feel completely calm, given the situation, but it helps. You offer the faintest smile to Rajeeyah and tip the bottle towards her."
    "就着现在这情况来说，这口酒还不足以让我完全冷静，但多少有点用。你朝Rajeeyah勉强一笑，示意她要不要来一口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12801
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_833630cc:

    # r "Oh, no thank you. I try not to drink the heavier stuff. I would prefer not to drink any at all, mind you, but I'll take grog over getting sick from stale water."
    r "哎，不用了。我尽量不喝烈酒。要是能不喝最好，不过比起喝不干净的水生病，我宁愿来点兑水的朗姆酒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12805
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ed6eaea8:

    # s "She just makes sure us poor victims of happenstance are well supplied."
    s "她呀，就是怕咱们这些倒霉蛋儿缺了啥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12809
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_72c0d9a2:

    # "Samuel adds with a laugh and holds out [his] hand for you to give [him] the bottle again. [He] quickly recorks the rum and stashes it down at the side of the bed."
    "Samuel笑着接话，朝你伸出手，示意你把酒瓶给他。他赶紧把朗姆酒塞好，藏到床边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12814
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_55e8be7f:

    # r "Someone has to, right? Not like you'll be walking anywhere soon, let alone up to get a drink."
    r "总得有人管这事儿不是？你现在这情况，别说起来弄酒了，下地都费劲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12818
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8989c94c:

    # s "Ya clearly haven't seen my determination to get ahold of good alcohol."
    s "看来你是没见过老子想搞到好酒的决心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12822
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_47dd389b:

    # r "Just don't make it a habit of sharing it, yes? You know I'm in charge of keeping track of inventory. You're lucky that I didn't see your transgression just now or I would have to report you for disciplinary measures."
    r "分酒喝这种事，可别养成习惯啊。你知道的，我可是管着仓库的。这次算你走运，没让我撞见，不然我肯定要上报，让你受处分。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12824
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f76b5f93:

    # r "Not to mention that it would reflect badly on me if I didn't have the medications under my supervision under control."
    r "更何况，要是让我管的药出了问题，我也得跟着倒霉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12831
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0f8fd326:

    # "One gulp, then another, and a third one follows. Each one brings the sharp burn of alcohol to the back of your throat."
    "一口，又一口，再来一口。每一口都像火烧一样，辣的嗓子冒烟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12835
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_e5eec6ea:

    # "When you bring your head back down, you're faced with Samuel's outstretched hand asking for the bottle back."
    "你一抬头，就看见Samuel伸着手，要拿回酒瓶。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12839
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_dad70004:

    # s "I said a sip, not the whole bottle!"
    s "我说的是抿一小口，不是让你当水喝！"

# game/script day2.rpy:12841
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_cd0f53bf:

    # s "Fuckin' hell. Ya not even supposed to get any, man. What do you think they'll do when you're stumbling around three sheets to the wind on deck?"
    s "该死的。本来就不该给你喝的，老兄。你想想，要是你喝的烂醉如泥，在甲板上晃来晃去，他们会怎么收拾你？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12843
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_10fec275:

    # s "The sip was a courtesy."
    s "刚才让你喝一口，那是客气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12847
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_82a71601:

    # "You apologize and hand the bottle back. [He] immediately pushes the cork back in and stashes the bottle down beside the bed."
    "你赶紧道歉，把酒瓶还了回去。他赶紧把瓶塞塞回去，又把酒瓶藏到床边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12849
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_200a8ab5:

    # "With another apology, you quickly change the topic back."
    "你又道了声歉，赶紧把话题岔开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12855
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_15aae595:

    # "You wave off the offer and thank Samuel for it."
    "你摆摆手，谢绝了Samuel的好意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12857
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_745d7bfd:

    # p "I prefer not to."
    p "我还是不喝了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12861
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_1cea50fa:

    # s "Fair enough. More for me, won't complain about that."
    s "那感情好，省的跟我抢了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12865
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_25cd6da7:

    # s "See, Raj? You got someone else on the crew that don't like to drink."
    s "你看，Rajeeyah？咱船上又多了一个不喜欢喝酒的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12869
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_91115fcc:

    # "With you not wanting any, Samuel pushes the cork back into the bottle and stashes it down next to the bed."
    "看你不想喝，Samuel就把瓶塞塞回瓶子，又藏回床边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12874
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5582b557:

    # "The cheetah gives a soft chuckle in response."
    "猎豹听了，轻轻一笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12878
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a3800c6b:

    # r "At least I won't have to fear you trying to wrangle some hard liquor out of me for our dinner."
    r "这么说，我总算不用担心你为了晚饭跟我抢酒喝了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12882
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d74dc825:

    # "Samuel's ears perk up right away as [he] tries to piece things together."
    "Sam立刻竖起了耳朵，似乎想把事情拼凑起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12884
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_024211bd:

    # s "Dinner? What did I miss?"
    s "晚餐？我错过了什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12888
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_789fc7d2:

    # r "Oh, our Casanova here practically stumbled over himself yesterday to invite me to dinner."
    r "哎哟，咱们这位情圣昨天为了邀请我吃晚饭，差点没把自己给绊倒喽。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12890
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2744a7bc:

    # "Casanova? Really? Now would be a great time for the ground to open up and swallow you whole."
    "情圣？真的假的？要是有个地缝让我钻进去就好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12894
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d94ebce2:

    # s "Dinner? First day here and you're already securing dates?{w} Man, leave some of that energy for the rest of us!"
    s "晚餐？第一天就约上了？{w} 哥们儿，给兄弟们留点机会啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:12896
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_01bd3a45:

    # p "It's not like that. I just figured it'd be nice to eat together after helping."
    p "不是你们想的那样。我就是觉得帮完忙一起吃个饭挺好的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12898
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_534db064:

    # s "Is that a blush on your snout?"
    s "你是不是脸红了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12900
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_78e25cb2:

    # r "It is."
    r "的确晚了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12902
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0cc36cc1:

    # p "It is not."
    p "才没有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12904
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_79218ad3:

    # "It was."
    "刚才可能有一点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12906
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c00908f2:

    # "You quickly change the topic of the conversation!"
    "你赶紧岔开了话题！"

# game/script day2.rpy:12910
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_9aef4d78:

    # r "I appreciate the company.{w} We can hold long talks about the distinguished tastes of water."
    r "我很珍惜这份情谊。{w} 我们可以好好探讨一下水的各种微妙滋味。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12912
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_4eef52dd:

    # r "Though it does make it easier to know that you're telling the truth when you come in crying for the stuff because you're in pain."
    r "不过说真的，看你疼得哭爹喊娘要水喝的时候，就知道你没撒谎。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12915
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_cb38ca36:

    # p "So, really nobody else knows?"
    p "这么说，真就没人知道了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12921
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_b373ac57:

    # "With the bottle out the way, Samuel slumps into the bed, crossing [his] arms behind [his] head, sinking back into the mattress."
    "Sam把酒瓶挪开，一下瘫倒在床上，双手枕在脑后，陷进了床垫里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12923
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c5b897c1:

    # s "It is somehow still a well-kept secret. The only other person who knows is Arthur."
    s "不知道怎么的，这件事居然一直瞒得挺好。唯一知道的另一个人是Arthur。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12925
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_b1c98a75:

    # p "That Arthur?{w} He has no problem with it?"
    p "那个Arthur？{w} 他没说什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12927
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_433a7581:

    # s "The very same. Yeah, he sees no issue with it.{w} Good sailor's a good sailor in his eyes."
    s "就是他。是啊，他压根不在意。{w} 他觉得，好水手就是好水手，其他的无所谓。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12929
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_b0cb3452:

    # p "Konrad, Bandile? None of them?"
    p "Konrad，Bandile？他们也不知道？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12933
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8df27e94:

    # s "God, no. Konrad would probably throw me overboard himself."
    s "别提了！Konrad知道了，说不定会亲手把我扔海里喂鱼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12935
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_1772ad19:

    # "Your eyes widen at the revelation. He isn't the type to go that far, is he?"
    "你吃惊地睁大了眼睛。他不是那种会做得这么绝的人吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12937
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2df7cf45:

    # "At least to you, he's been pleasant enough."
    "至少在我看来，他一直挺好说话的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12939
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_25aee808:

    # s "Now, don't get me wrong. He's grand company but..."
    s "你别误会啊，他人是不错，可..."

# game/script day2.rpy:12941
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a09446ff:

    # s "He's a navy guy down to the bone. After enough cannonballs get shot at ya head, you cling to whatever superstitions see you through it."
    s "他可是个彻头彻尾的海军。脑袋上挨的炮弹多了，就只能死死抓住那些能保命的迷信了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12945
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5c5d5772:

    # s "I don't blame him, judging by what he's told me over the years."
    s "听他这些年说的那些事儿，我也理解他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12947
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c67b755e:

    # "You take a moment to think, your eyes finding the wooden floor at your feet."
    "你沉默了一下，目光落在了脚边的木地板上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12949
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_b92e3ecd:

    # p "I see what you mean."
    p "我懂你的意思了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12951
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_55b5702b:

    # p "So you've managed to keep it under wraps for all these years? On this cramped ship? How?"
    p "这么说，这些年你一直瞒着大家？在这艘小破船上？怎么做到的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12956
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_3425fcde:

    # "A quiet chuckle comes from the maned wolf, the blanket shifting as [he] lifts a knee and plants [his] foot against the mattress."
    "那匹长着鬃毛的狼轻声笑了笑，抬起一条腿，脚掌抵在床垫上，身上的毯子也跟着动了动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12958
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8917b475:

    # s "Ya learn to deal with it. Nobody looks too closely when you're taking a shit-"
    s "你得学会适应。反正大家伙儿拉屎的时候，谁也不会盯着你看——"

# game/script day2.rpy:12962
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a7caf4ad:

    # r "Samuel, please."
    r "Samuel，饶了我吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12966
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c750d4f2:

    # s "What? He asked."
    s "什么事？他问。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12970
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_9f248aea:

    # r "And you go on and describe {i}that{/i} of all things?"
    r "你居然要细讲{i}那个{/i}？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12974
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_4c0a7e5e:

    # s "Well, if {i}someone{/i} wouldn't have interrupted, then I would have gone on and mentioned other things as well."
    s "好吧，要不是{i}有人{/i}打断，我还能接着说其他的呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12978
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_b4d9f13e:

    # "The cheetah gives a dismissive wave of her hand, allowing Samuel to continue."
    "母猎豹不耐烦地挥挥手，示意Samuel继续。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12983
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ef69b5c1:

    # s "Wear loose clothes. Always sleep with a shirt on... though that can be a pain in the ass given how hot this thing gets below deck."
    s "穿宽松点的衣服。 睡觉最好穿件衬衫......不过你知道的，甲板下热得要命，可能会有点麻烦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12985
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_19841b27:

    # s "Ya get the idea."
    s "你懂的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12987
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_91405e20:

    # p "And would you prefer me to keep using Samuel, even in private?"
    p "你是不是希望我以后都叫你Samuel，哪怕私底下也这么叫？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12991
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0e982a21:

    # "The maned wolf simply shrugs."
    "鬃狼耸耸肩，没说话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12993
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_aba4fef6:

    # s "Honestly? I don't mind one or the other. It may as well be my real name after five years of everyone calling me Samuel.{w} Besides, Samuel's a fine name, isn't it?"
    s "说实话？我都行。反正大家都叫我Samuel叫了五年了，{w} 就当是真名了吧。再说，Samuel这名字也挺好的，你说呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:12997
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_cfc482b6:

    # s "I wouldn't have chosen it if I didn't like it, after all."
    s "要是不喜欢，我才不会选呢，是吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:12999
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_512f3927:

    # "[He] adds with a gentle smile before you can answer."
    "她不等你回答，就带着一丝温柔的笑意说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13003
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_72b550f5:

    # p "It is, and I won't run the risk of mixing them up, I guess."
    p "也是，这样我就不会搞混了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13005
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_e5a631ce:

    # s "I would rather prefer if you could avoid that, yes."
    s "你最好还是别那样，我不太喜欢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13012
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_83976b02:

    # "Another set of knocks interrupts your conversation, and Samuel snaps [his] head towards the door."
    "又一阵敲门声打断了咱们的谈话，Samuel立刻看向门口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13014
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2e91e5b3:

    # s "I'm quite popular today it seems.{w} Come in."
    s "我今天还挺受欢迎的嘛。{w} 请进。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13020
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0eb84773:

    # "The door opens to reveal the dark corridor outside the cabin. Arthur stands in front of it, bathed in warm candlelight."
    "门开了，外面是昏暗的走廊。 Arthur站在门口，被温暖的烛光笼罩着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13022
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f729a9f5:

    # s "How long have {i}you{/i} been standing there. You're not spying on us too, are you?"
    s "你在那儿站多久了？ 别告诉我你也在偷听？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13028
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c4a6590d:

    # "Arthur steps in and gives Samuel a questioning look at the way in which he is being greeted."
    "Arthur走了进来，看到Samuel这打招呼的方式，疑惑地看了看他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13030
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_bcb05048:

    # a "Spying?"
    a "偷听？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13034
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_fbe09ae3:

    # s "Ah, it's nothing, sir. Just a little joke since Mr. [family_name] here took-"
    s "没事儿，长官。 就是[family_name]先生他刚才——"

# game/script day2.rpy:13036
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_e62463d3:

    # "Oh God, stop it, Samuel!"
    "哎呀，别说了，Samuel！"

# game/script day2.rpy:13038
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_10050a1b:

    # "With an urgent look, you attempt to silence Samuel without arousing Arthur's suspicion, as the last thing you want is for Arthur to grow even more suspicious of you."
    "你赶紧示意Samuel住嘴，生怕引起Arthur的怀疑，毕竟你最不想看到的就是Arthur对他疑心更重。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13040
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5d670d96:

    # s "- a little longer to knock on the door, it turns out."
    s "——敲门敲得慢了点儿，就这么回事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13044
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_e12b3670:

    # "The officer takes in the information quietly, cocking his head to the side before slowly pivoting to you."
    "军官听完，安静地歪了歪头，然后缓缓地转向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13046
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_883e0f18:

    # a "Did he now?"
    a "这样啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13052
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_921752e9:

    # r "All in good fun, sir."
    r "开个玩笑，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13054
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_1ec79633:

    # "Rajeeyah interrupts, sensing your concern."
    "Rajeeyah赶紧插话，看出了你的担心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13061
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_66eb8c96:

    # a "Quite curious, indeed. I've actually come here because of him, but one thing at a time. How are you holding up, Samuel?"
    a "真有意思。 我来找他的确有事，但咱们得一件一件说。 Samuel，你现在感觉怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13063
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_2a239aa1:

    # s "It's nothing, sir. She took excellent care of me, of course. Stitched me up, provided me with plenty of pain relief. I expect to be back on my feet shortly."
    s "没事，长官。 她把我照顾得很好。 给我缝了针，还给了我很多止疼药。 我很快就能下地走路了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13067
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f52740c5:

    # "Arthur nods appreciatively to Rajeeyah, who in turn mirrors the gesture."
    "Arthur赞许地向Rajeeyah点了点头，Rajeeyah也回以同样的动作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13069
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8791295e:

    # a "I would have expected nothing less from you. You have my gratitude."
    a "我就知道你一定能做到。非常感谢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13073
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_d4c57707:

    # r "My pleasure, sir. While Samuel certainly shows enthusiasm for his return, I must ensure that he stays put as long as is necessary to prevent the wound from reopening during action."
    r "这是我的荣幸，先生。虽然Samuel看起来很想尽快重返岗位，但我必须确保他能好好休养，避免在行动中伤口复发。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13077
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0bc01e42:

    # a "I understand. You do have the final say in the matter, of course, Doctor."
    a "我明白。当然，医生，这件事最终还是你说了算。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13082
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a1d6b404:

    # a "Oh, before I forget."
    a "哦，对了，差点忘了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13086
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_6dfd7004:

    # "The inquisitive expression of his softens as he reaches into the back pocket of his coat and pulls out a book to hand to Samuel."
    "他脸上疑惑的表情舒缓下来，从外套的后口袋里掏出一本书，递给Samuel。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13090
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_87108ab5:

    # "Samuel takes the book and briefly inspects the embossed title on the cover before Arthur continues."
    "Samuel接过书，简单地看了看封面上的烫金书名，Arthur接着说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13092
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c274c355:

    # a "From the Captain's library. Much of it is naval history, which, if I remember correctly, you're not too keen on, but I recalled seeing a few that weren't."
    a "从船长室的书库里拿的。大部分是航海史，我记得你不太喜欢，不过我还是找到了一些其他的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13096
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_1b39a6b0:

    # "The maned wolf turns a few pages in the book and looks up at the horse."
    "那匹鬃狼翻了几页书，抬头看向那匹马。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13100
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ecb1bdde:

    # a "Robinson Crusoe. It might make confinement here a little less boring and help with your reading."
    a "《鲁滨逊漂流记》。希望能让你在禁闭期间不那么无聊，也能帮你打发时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13102
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_4c7f7797:

    # s "Thank you, sir. I appreciate it."
    s "谢谢您，先生。非常感谢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13107
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c6167d00:

    # p "My apologies for interrupting, sir. But you mentioned coming down here for me?"
    p "打断一下，很抱歉，先生。您刚才说来这儿是为了我？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13109
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5a32a239:

    # "Arthur takes a step back from the bed and gives Samuel a final nod of encouragement before turning to you and clearing his throat, his voice losing any lingering softness."
    "Arthur从床边退后一步，最后鼓励地向Samuel点了点头，然后转向你，清了清嗓子，语气也变得严肃起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13111
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ddecc5ff:

    # a "Yes. I have."
    a "是的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13113
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_31318e87:

    # a "Julian mentioned that I would be able to find you down here. I wanted to pick you up to meet our passenger, as discussed earlier."
    a "Julian说我在这能找到你。我想带你一起去见见那位乘客，之前我们说过的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13117
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_35204700:

    # "You shift uncomfortably on Samuel's bed, leaning forward as you meet his eyes."
    "你在Samuel的床上挪动了一下身体，略微前倾，看着他的眼睛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13119
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_676a98d5:

    # p "You want me to come along for that, sir?"
    p "先生，您是说要我一起去？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13121
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_4fed8af3:

    # a "Yes. You don't seem busy by the looks of it, so I might as well have you come along and Sir Nomax can corroborate your story directly."
    a "是的。看你好像也没什么事，不如一起去，让Nomax爵士直接确认一下你之前说的事情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13123
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_fe8cc993:

    # a "Or would that give you cause for concern?"
    a "还是说，你觉得这样会有什么问题？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13125
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0cbb3b33:

    # p "I—well, sir, I shouldn't think so, no."
    p "我——回长官，我想应该不至于吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13127
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_91ac28d6:

    # a "Very well, on your feet then, Mr. [family_name].{w} I assume you two have no urgent need for him?"
    a "很好，那就起来吧，[family_name]先生。我想他们两个没什么要紧事需要你帮忙吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13129
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_bcee3943:

    # "Both Samuel and Rajeeyah shake their heads in response, and not wanting to cause any more commotion, you get up from the bed and follow Arthur out of the room and through the ship."
    "Samuel和Rajeeyah都摇了摇头。你不想再惹麻烦，便从床上起身，跟着Arthur走出房间，穿过船舱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13139
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ae7a7311:

    # a "Now then, would you kindly enlighten me as to what they meant by you spying on them?"
    a "现在，能不能请你告诉我，他们说的你监视他们，到底是怎么回事？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13141
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_3336a7a8:

    # "An icy chill runs down your spine as his calm yet penetrating words hit you. You quicken your step to catch up with him as you answer."
    "Arthur平静但极具压迫感的话语让你感到一阵寒意。你加快脚步跟上他，一边回答道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13143
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_ca822e5a:

    # p "It wasn't intentional. I was on my way down to see how Samuel was doing and I overheard a few sentences when I knocked on the door."
    p "我不是故意的。我只是想来看看Samuel的情况，敲门的时候无意中听到了几句话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13145
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_e7e3f019:

    # a "And now, why is it you again who has accusations leveled against themself?"
    a "怎么又是你惹麻烦？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13147
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5c53666b:

    # p "Sir, I'm sure it was not an accusation made by Samuel, but merely mentioned in jest."
    p "先生，我相信Samuel不是有意指责，只是随口说说而已。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13151
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_6942a760:

    # "The two of you come to a halt in front of the passenger's cabin, Arthur's heavy footsteps stop, and with a few quick, gentle knocks he announces the two of you to your guest inside the cabin."
    "两人走到乘客舱门口停下，Arthur也停下了沉重的脚步，他轻轻地敲了几下门，示意里面的客人，他们已经到了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13155
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_1578e666:

    # "You hear some shuffling behind the door, but before it opens, Arthur turns back to you and gives you an unmoving look."
    "你听到门后传来一阵窸窣声，但门打开之前，Arthur转过头，面无表情地看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13157
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_1be214a5:

    # a "Maybe it was. Maybe it wasn't. If it was one incident, perhaps, but it is always you who it seems to stick to. {w}One after the other..."
    a "兴许是，兴许不是。若只是一桩偶发事故倒也罢了，可偏偏每次惹祸上身的总少不了你。{w}接二连三……"

# game/script day2.rpy:13163
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_681cea19:

    # "The door swings open behind him while you are still talking, and a lingering silence spreads between the three of you. Nomax welcomes nothing but Arthur's back, and you swallow your words as his eyes bore into you."
    "你还在说话，他身后的门却突然敞开，一股尴尬的沉默在你们三人之间蔓延。Nomax 除了 Arthur 的背影什么都没看到，你注意到 Arthur 的目光，便咽回了即将说出口的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13165
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0eecffef:

    # n "Gentlemen? How may I help you?"
    n "“先生们？有什么能为你们效劳的吗？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:13167
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_c337f825:

    # "Arthur's eyes leave you as he turns to answer, his voice changing to something softer as he begins to speak to the passenger."
    "Arthur 转过身去回答问题，目光从你身上移开，声音也变得柔和，开始和那位乘客交谈。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13177
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_933d5096:

    # "A soft scratching makes your ears swivel in its direction. Both Samuel and Rajeeyah turn toward the door as well as the sound catches their attention."
    "一阵细微的抓挠声传来，你立刻转头。Samuel 和 Rajeeyah 也同样被这声音吸引，看向了门口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13179
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a420fde6:

    # s "I'm quite popular today, aren't I? Can you open the door Raj, sounds like someone wants to be let in."
    s "我今天这么受欢迎吗？Raj，开下门呗，听着像是有谁想进来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13184
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_09540066:

    # p "Um, let in?"
    p "嗯？进来？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13188
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_e121cf4f:

    # "You're not sure just who you're expecting that would need to be let in, but first things first, and you watch as Rajeeyah leans over in her chair to grab the door handle and give it a strong enough tug that it springs out of its latch."
    "你也不知道是谁要进来，不过还是先看看情况再说。你看到 Rajeeyah 从椅子上探过身子，一把拉开门闩，门便吱呀一声打开了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13190
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_fc00792e:

    # "The door swings open ever so slightly with a laboured creak, and through the crack slips a small creature. It was hard to make out at first, but as it was bathed in the warm light of the lamp, the shape of the little thing became clearer."
    "门吃力地发出沉重的吱呀声，微微敞开，一个小东西从门缝里溜了进来。一开始还看不清楚，但在灯光的照耀下，它的轮廓逐渐显现。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13192
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_151232b4:

    # "A long-haired tabby cat slips into the room, it's silent steps observed by three pairs of curious eyes."
    "一只长毛虎斑猫悄无声息地溜进了房间，三双好奇的眼睛注视着它。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13196
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_134913a8:

    # "The cat scans the room for a second and stops when it spots you, staring for a moment longer before continuing on its way. An easy hop brings it onto the bed, but as if to tease Samuel, it then turns and hops into Rajeeyah's lap rather than settling down on the bed."
    "猫咪扫视了一下房间，目光落在了你身上，盯着你看了片刻，然后继续往前走。它轻轻一跃跳到了床上，但似乎是故意逗 Samuel 玩，它又转头跳到了 Rajeeyah 的腿上，不肯在床上安顿下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13200
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_92d62207:

    # s "Damn it, Mo. How can ya be so cruel?"
    s "Damn it, Mo。你这家伙也太狠心了吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13202
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f61f7c14:

    # s "I'm the one who's hurt, not her."
    s "哼，受伤的是我，又不是她。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13208
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_86bd26f3:

    # "Rajeeyah laughs softly as she begins to run her paw down along the cat's arched spine, wrapping her fingers around the raised tail to let her hand run all along the length of the fluffy appendage."
    "Rajeeyah 轻轻笑着，用手顺着猫咪拱起的脊背抚摸，手指绕着它翘起的尾巴，一路向下捋着蓬松的尾巴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13210
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_fbb9864e:

    # p "That's Mo?"
    p "这就是 Mo？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13212
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_43faa670:

    # "You ask and gesture to the cat."
    "你指着猫问道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13216
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_21c492fa:

    # r "Yes. The big ol' grouch. Been with us for a while. It's rare that he comes to visit, rarer still that he endures such attention. {w}Usually claws get involved, but he has his moments."
    r "没错，就是这爱抱怨的老家伙。和我们一起生活挺久了。它很少过来串门，更别提忍受别人这样亲近它了。{w}通常早就挠人了，不过它偶尔也会有心情好的时候。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13218
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_8f7c0bd5:

    # r "This looks to be one of them."
    r "今天看来就是了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13220
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_90265c07:

    # r "We don't want the mice and rats eating through all our supplies, do we? No, we don't, and that's why you make sure they don't get out of hand, don't you?"
    r "我们总不能让老鼠把咱们的补给都吃光了吧？当然不行。所以才得确保它们别太放肆，你说对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13224
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_843ef371:

    # r "Our little ferocious hunter."
    r "我们的小猛兽猎人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13226
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a5560c17:

    # "The cheetah speaks with an exaggerated playfulness one would use with a child as she talks to Mo, and pampers the cat with a few gentle scratches behind the cat's ears."
    "Rajeeyah 用哄小孩的夸张语气和 Mo 说话，还在它耳朵后面轻轻挠了几下，宠溺地安抚着它。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13230
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_3512ee8a:

    # p "I take it there's a second one then?"
    p "我猜还有一只猫吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13232
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_3d53d1cb:

    # r "Mhm, Michael, he's black, which makes him even harder to spot in the dim light down here in the ship. Though I suppose you'll have an easier time of it, being a cat yourself."
    r "嗯，是 Michael，它是黑色的，所以在这船舱里光线昏暗，更难发现它了。不过嘛，我想你找它应该更容易，毕竟你自己也是只“猫”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13234
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_77f657a9:

    # "She grabs Mo and lifts him over to the bed again, so that he can sit with Samuel instead."
    "她一把抱起 Mo，又把它放到床上，让它和 Samuel 待在一起。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13236
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a084728e:

    # "But of course, cats being cats, he did a quick U-turn and hopped right back to Rajeeyah."
    "结果呢，猫终究是猫，它立马掉头，又跳回到了 Rajeeyah 身边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13240
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_70951848:

    # r "Oh, don't be like that, Mo."
    r "哎呦，Mo，别这样嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13244
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_9d3f2486:

    # s "Ah, leave him be, I've had enough stitches for one day. If he's not feeling my company right now, I'd rather not risk it."
    s "算了算了，随它去吧，我今天缝的针已经够多了。要是它现在不想让我靠近，我可不想冒险。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13248
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_5b7779a5:

    # "You reach out carefully and let Mo take a few sniffs of your hand before you dare to give him a gentle scratch under his chin, though the grouch quickly makes it clear that he's getting a bit too much attention."
    "你小心翼翼地伸出手，让 Mo 嗅了嗅，才敢轻轻地挠了挠它的下巴。但这爱抱怨的家伙很快就表示，它得到的关注已经够多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13250
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_b239240a:

    # "First he leans away from your hand, and then a second later he jumps off the chair altogether and trots out of the cabin with hasty steps."
    "它先是往后躲了躲，然后下一秒就直接跳下椅子，急匆匆地小跑出了船舱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13252
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_223b2746:

    # s "Yep, that's Mo..."
    s "没错，这就是 Mo..."

# game/script day2.rpy:13256
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_66ed8737:

    # s "Don't take it personally. Michael is the friendlier of the two, if you ever need someone to be there for ya on a bad day."
    s "别往心里去。Michael 比它友善多了，你要是哪天心情不好，它会陪着你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13258
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_bc2a75da:

    # s "Mo, I think, is just too old for all of this and wants to be left alone. Rajeeyah is one of the few people he occasionally seeks out."
    s "我觉得 Mo 只是年纪大了，不想被打扰。Rajeeyah 算是它偶尔会主动亲近的少数人之一。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13260
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_e73c0854:

    # r "Not sure if he actually likes me though... It might just be the smell of blood that interests him..."
    r "不确定他是不是真的看上我了…说不定他只是对我的血腥味感兴趣…"

# game/script day2.rpy:13264
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_902d8f35:

    # s "Maybe he just sees you as the third cat on board.{w} Feline.{w} Occasionally covered in blood.{w} Has he ever seen ya chasing after rats by any chance?"
    s "也许他只是把你当成船上的第三只猫。{w} 猫科动物。{w} 偶尔浑身是血。{w} 他有没有见过你追老鼠？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13268
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_837a967f:

    # "The cheetah laughs and leans back in her chair, bringing up a hand to her chin as she takes a couple of moments to think."
    "母猎豹笑了笑，往后一靠，抬起手托着下巴，像是在思考什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13270
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_cd30e80b:

    # r "I don't think so. I've chased one or two out when they've bothered me during operations, but otherwise I've given up chasing them."
    r "我不这么认为。当它们在行动中打扰我时，我轰走了一两只，但后来就懒得追了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13276
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_f74c84b1:

    # r "Either the cats will get them, or one of you lot. But I think it would look rather unbecoming of me if anyone saw the ship's doctor chasing after them."
    r "要么猫会料理了它们，要么就靠你们了。不过，要是有人看见我，堂堂一个船医追着老鼠跑，那也太有损形象了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13278
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_0124ae1f:

    # r "Besides, I prefer the finer options. Smoking them out is such an elegant solution. We should make a habit of it more often."
    r "而且，我更喜欢优雅的手段。把它们熏出来，这主意多漂亮。咱们以后可以多用用。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13280
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_4ac97a55:

    # "The three of you talked for a while longer, but soon Rajeeyah had to tend to Mr. Blackborow and Samuel wanted to lay down for some sleep."
    "他们三个又聊了一会儿，Rajeeyah不得不去照顾Blackborow先生，而Samuel也想睡会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13282
translate Chinese day2_check_samuel_again_a80e380c:

    # "So you spend the rest of your time off drifting around the deck, trying to recharge, for the next shift will be here soon enough."
    "所以你只好在甲板上晃悠，想赶紧恢复点精神，毕竟下一班岗马上就来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13298
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_c4aadc43:

    # a "Good morning, sir. First mate of the Conway, Sir Arthur Aubrey Hudson. May we come in? I hope we haven't come at an inconvenient time."
    a "早上好，先生。我是Conway号的大副，Arthur·奥布里·哈德森爵士。请问我们可以进来吗？希望没打扰到您。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13300
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_2c030d7d:

    # "The tall canid looks first at Arthur, then past him, scanning you to try and figure out what is going on. After a moment or two of confusion, he steps aside and opens the door for you two."
    "那个高个子的犬科先看了看Arthur，然后又越过他打量着你，似乎想弄明白发生了什么。他愣了一下，然后侧身让开，为你俩打开了门。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13302
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_ae76b048:

    # n "Why yes, come in. Is anything wrong?"
    n "啊，请进请进。出什么事了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13304
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_4e61d921:

    # "The atmosphere in the cabin is very different this time, certainly for you, as the feeling builds that you're being dragged into court."
    "这次进到舱里，气氛很不一样，至少你觉得像是要上军事法庭了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13316
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_36de6ce6:

    # "Arthur ducks through the door and you follow as Nomax steps back into the small cabin and offers you the bed and chair to sit on."
    "Arthur弯腰进了门，你紧随其后。Nomax斯往后退了几步，在狭小的船舱里给他们让出了床和椅子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13318
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_f6440b5f:

    # a "Thank you, but I can manage standing, please, sir, take a seat yourself. {w}No reason to be concerned, I'm just here to ask a few questions with the recruit."
    a "没事儿，我站着就行，您请坐。{w} 别紧张，我就是带这位新水手来问几个问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13320
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_98ce487a:

    # a "You know him, am I right in that assumption?"
    a "您认识他，对吧？我没说错吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13324
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_464b1788:

    # "Nomax gladly accepts the offer and sits down at the far end of the bed. He takes his blanket and folds it neatly in his lap so as not to crumple it unnecessarily and to have a place to rest his arms."
    "Nomax倒是挺痛快，直接在床边上坐下了。他还特意把毯子叠得整整齐齐地放在腿上，免得弄皱了，还能当个垫手的地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13328
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_ee75cc5d:

    # "You follow suit, feeling a little too nervous to stand, and sit down on the chair offered... Although this only made Arthur feel more imposing as he stood by the door with his arms behind his back, blocking any escape from the cabin."
    "你也觉得站着有点发怵，就坐到了他让给你的椅子上……结果Arthur就跟尊门神似的杵在门口，双手往后一背，直接把逃生路线给堵死了，更让人觉得压迫感十足。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13332
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_7da19c14:

    # n "I do, well, only since coming onto the ship but I do. That is correct."
    n "认识，嗯…自从上了船才认识的，不过确实认识。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13334
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_a953775d:

    # "Arthur takes a moment to let the answer sink in, trying to gauge it, or to detect anything odd in either his or your behaviour, but after a few seconds he seems to be satisfied with what he is hearing."
    "Arthur听完，没急着说话，先是琢磨了一下，想看看他和你的反应有没有什么不对劲的地方。过了几秒，他好像觉得没什么问题，这才放下心来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13336
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_9adcbbe2:

    # n "Why, if I may ask? I just-... My sincere apologies, but it just feels like I am being put on the spot here. When you come in here and start to question me like this."
    n "如果可以的话，能问问是为什么吗？我就是……抱歉，我感觉自己像是在接受审问一样。您这样突然进来问我这些问题，我有点不知所措。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13338
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_7ed604a9:

    # "Arthur bows slightly before speaking."
    "Arthur微微鞠了一躬，然后开口说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13342
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_8b3a161a:

    # a "That wasn't my intention. I was just talking to this young recruit this morning and he mentioned you and the reason we have come here is so that I can get your assessment of his statement."
    a "我没那个意思。我今天早上跟这位新来的聊了几句，他提到了您，所以想找您确认一下他说的那些事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13346
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_a1f03728:

    # n "I-... very well, I can do my best to be of assistance. He has not done anything grave, has he?"
    n "我……行吧，我会尽量配合的。他没犯什么大事儿吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13350
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_56942e8d:

    # "Arthur shakes his head and, noticing a misshapen crease in his suit, straightens it out."
    "Arthur摇了摇头，然后伸手把西装上一个不太明显的褶皱给拉平了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13352
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_4bf24be5:

    # a "Not that we know of, no, but well, Mr. [family_name], why don't you start recounting the timeline of events for me and the gentleman?"
    a "应该没啥大事儿，不过，[family_name]先生，您要不先跟我们说说事情的来龙去脉？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13357
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_b848ee15:

    # "You nod, thinking back to yesterday when you first met him, and wondering how to start."
    "你点点头，开始回忆昨天第一次见到他的情景，琢磨着该从哪儿说起。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13366
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_af45429e:

    # "You take a second or two more to collect your thoughts and decide that perhaps yesterday wasn't that important and maybe it's best to leave it out altogether?"
    "你又想了一会儿，觉得昨天的事儿好像不太重要，要不干脆就别说了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13368
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_b2fe842b:

    # p "Well, I met him this morning. A couple of hours ago during the morning shift."
    p "嗯……我是今天早上见到他的，就早班那会儿，大概几个小时前吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13370
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_66774049:

    # "Nomax eyes you with some confusion and you turn your head to Arthur to see if he has anything to say before you continue."
    "Nomax斯一脸疑惑地看着你，你扭头看了看Arthur，想看看他有没有什么要说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13372
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_efaa83da:

    # a "This very morning?"
    a "就今天早上？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13374
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_b42db6b4:

    # "You confirm his question with a little bit of sweat that spreads across the palm of your paws. Slowly Arthur shifts to look at Nomax and waits for his side of this particular story."
    "你一确认他的问题，手心就紧张地渗出了汗。Arthur缓缓转向Nomax，等着他来讲述另一面的故事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13376
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_4d3f2718:

    # n "Well, I- uhm. We met earlier, that is correct."
    n "那个，我……呃。我们早些时候确实碰过面，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13378
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_467d1af8:

    # a "For the first time?"
    a "第一次见面？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13382
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_9de8b304:

    # n "The first time? No, sir, it was yesterday... er...{w} just before dinner, if I remember correctly."
    n "第一次？不，先生，是昨天...嗯...{w} 如果我没记错的话，大概是晚餐之前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13386
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_eb827699:

    # "The horse's sharp gaze switches straight back to you, no words are needed to convey his desire for you to explain yourself."
    "他像马一样锐利的眼神立刻扫向你，无需多言，你明白他要你解释清楚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13388
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_bdafe438:

    # p "Uh-{w} I'm sorry, yes we met very briefly yesterday. My apologies, sir. I thought you were only interested in today's events at the time of Samuel's accident, and didn't assume yesterday to be of any importance."
    p "呃...{w} 抱歉，是的，昨天我们有过一面之缘。很抱歉，先生。我以为您只关心Samuel出事那会儿的事，没觉得昨天的事有什么要紧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13392
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_0ead3aed:

    # a "From now on, I expect you to be thorough and let me decide whether something is of any particular importance or not."
    a "记住，以后给我如实汇报，有没有价值，由我来判断。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13398
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_b3a1d3dd:

    # p "Well, I met the gentleman for the first time yesterday on deck. It was just before dinner, if I remember correctly."
    p "是这样，我昨天第一次在甲板上见到这位先生，就在晚餐之前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13400
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_6a91d0d8:

    # p "He appeared unwell and I wanted to make sure he was all right and didn't need any help."
    p "他当时看起来不太舒服，我就想确认他是不是没事，需不需要帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13402
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_8607bb26:

    # "Arthur looks over at Nomax to see his reaction and he receives a curt nod from the painted dog."
    "Arthur瞥了Nomax一眼，想看看他的反应，那只彩绘狗只是微微颔首。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13404
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_7dfdd0a8:

    # a "So he was unwell. In what way?"
    a "这么说他当时不舒服？具体是什么情况？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13407
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_23adb28f:

    # a "{cps=5000}So he was unwell. In what way?{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}这么说他当时不舒服？具体是什么情况？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:13415
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_dd6de1b5:

    # "You look over at the painted dog before you answer, remembering how he hung over the railing like a pitiful wet dog."
    "你看了看那只彩绘狗才回答，想起他当时像只淋湿的可怜小狗一样趴在栏杆上的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13417
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_8489e31d:

    # p "He must have had trouble adjusting to the movement, and well, hurled his breakfast and lunch and whatever else might have been left in there right out to the fishes, sir."
    p "他大概是晕船了，先生。把早饭、午饭，还有肚子里剩下的东西都吐出来喂鱼了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13421
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_6660c4c9:

    # p "So I went over to help. See if he needed a bucket or something to clean himself up with."
    p "所以我就过去看看能不能帮上忙，比方说，给他找个桶什么的，让他清理一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13423
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_851f36c2:

    # "Nomax's ears fold down as he hears your description of him. Did he look {i}that{/i} bad yesterday?"
    "听到你这么形容他，Nomax的耳朵都耷拉下来了。我昨天看起来{i}有那么{/i}惨吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13425
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_6c84c536:

    # n "I- sir."
    n "我……遵命，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13427
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_475ed2a3:

    # a "Yes? Is something wrong with the description of the events?"
    a "怎么？我的描述有什么不对吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13429
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_228e3b68:

    # n "Well..."
    n "那个..."

# game/script day2.rpy:13431
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_eb32e7c4:

    # "He pauses and lowers his gaze in defeat as a quiet \"no\" crosses his lips, shortly followed by his attempt to save his pride and play down what happened."
    "他犹豫了一下，沮丧地低下头，小声嘟囔了一句“没有”，然后又赶紧找补，想把这事儿说得轻描淡写一点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13433
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_14bb7584:

    # n "It was just, well, It might have been a bit much on my first day at sea, sir. The rocking of the ship did me no good."
    n "只是...嗯，可能第一天出海有点不太适应，先生。船晃得厉害，我实在难受。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13437
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_b7f3d3f7:

    # a "I understand. It happens to even the most experienced sailors."
    a "我明白。就算是老水手也难免会遇到这种情况。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13439
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_01703e52:

    # a "Very well. I appreciate your willingness to assist our passengers."
    a "很好。我很欣赏你热心助人的精神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13447
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_dd6de1b5_1:

    # "You look over at the painted dog before you answer, remembering how he hung over the railing like a pitiful wet dog."
    "你看了看那只彩绘狗才回答，想起他当时像只淋湿的可怜小狗一样趴在栏杆上的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13449
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_2b29296e:

    # p "He looked a tad on the pale side near the railing, and I wanted to see if he was in need of further assistance.{w} However, it appeared that all that was needed was simply someone to take his mind off of the movement of the sea."
    p "他当时靠在栏杆旁边，脸色不太好，我想看看能不能帮上忙。{w} 不过，他好像只是需要有人聊聊天，分散一下注意力，别老想着船在晃。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13451
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_130b27e1:

    # "Nomax nods along in agreement with your description, probably pleased that you kept some of the more... descriptive details under wraps."
    "听了你的描述，Nomax赞同地点点头，估计是庆幸你没把那些更...细节的东西说出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13453
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_bf43f570:

    # "Arthur, however, didn't seem quite so happy, his head tilting to the side as he pokes a little further."
    "不过，Arthur似乎并不太满意，他歪着头，继续追问。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13457
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_e4ba04cc:

    # a "So there was no bucket involved? I want to say that I remember you talking about one earlier."
    a "这么说来，没用到桶？我记得你之前好像提到过。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13459
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_e9e6a2a7:

    # p "I-, er, must have said that I wanted to see if he needed to use a bucket."
    p "我...呃，我应该是说，我当时想看看他是不是需要用桶。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13463
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_8f28195a:

    # "Arthur doesn't seem entirely convinced, but he drops the subject for now."
    "Arthur好像还是不太相信，不过他暂时没再追究。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13465
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_01703e52_1:

    # a "Very well. I appreciate your willingness to assist our passengers."
    a "很好。我很欣赏你热心助人的精神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13473
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_01fa2015:

    # "You look over at the painted dog and do him the favor of leaving out some of the unsavory details."
    "你看了看那只彩绘狗，为了照顾他的面子，没说那些丢人的细节。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13475
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_8c9081c6:

    # p "I met the gentleman on deck yesterday, shortly before dinner. We came to talking for a while before retiring below deck when the dinner bell rang."
    p "我昨天晚餐前不久在甲板上遇到了这位先生。我们聊了一会儿，然后晚饭铃响了，我们才回船舱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13477
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_130b27e1_1:

    # "Nomax nods along in agreement with your description, probably pleased that you kept some of the more... descriptive details under wraps."
    "听了你的描述，Nomax赞同地点点头，估计是庆幸你没把那些更...细节的东西说出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13481
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_8b63bda7:

    # "Arthur, however, didn't seem quite so happy, his head tilting to the side as he prods a little further."
    "Arthur的反应略显不悦，似乎对你的话有所怀疑，他微微歪头，继续追问。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13483
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_2ad50f76:

    # a "Hadn't you mentioned to me earlier that he wasn't feeling well?"
    a "你之前没跟我说过他不舒服吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13485
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_1aac0145:

    # p "I- um, yes, my apologies, I didn't want to put the gentleman on the spot in front of you, sir."
    p "我——呃，是的，十分抱歉，我刚才只是不想当着长官的面让这位先生难堪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13489
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_25f94be3:

    # a "Rest assured, the honored gentleman need not to fear embarrassment about feeling unwell. It is not surprising that someone new to sea should be stricken by it."
    a "请放心，这位先生不必因为感到不适而感到尴尬。对于一个刚接触海上生活的人来说，感到不适并不奇怪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13491
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_63cb865b:

    # a "But even experienced sailors are not immune, and while I appreciate your courtesy to the gentleman, I would prefer you to speak truthfully to me, lad."
    a "但即使是经验丰富的海员也不能幸免，虽然我感谢你对这位先生的礼貌，但我希望你对我实话实说，孩子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13495
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_fd08d5cb:

    # "You return a curt nod to the horse."
    "你对马回了一个简短的点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13497
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_770f00f4:

    # a "And Sir Nomax, I take it that the description of the events corresponds to what you remember?"
    a "那么Nomax先生，我是否可以认为对事件的描述与你记忆中的一致？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13499
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_4e87184f:

    # n "It does indeed, sir."
    n "确实如此，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13501
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_8994cb4f:

    # "He replies with a short and direct answer."
    "他用简短而直接的回答回复。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13503
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_01703e52_2:

    # a "Very well. I appreciate your willingness to assist our passengers."
    a "很好。我很欣赏你热心助人的精神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13509
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_1692c462:

    # a "Please continue."
    a "请继续。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13511
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_dc68912a:

    # "He shifts his weight from one leg to the other as he continues to watch closely as you continue to recall the events."
    "当你继续回忆事件时，他将重心从一条腿移到另一条腿上，同时继续密切注视着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13513
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_6cad1ff4:

    # p "That was all that happened yesterday. We parted ways for dinner and sometime later I went to sleep for the night."
    p "昨天就发生了这些事。我们分头去吃晚饭，过了一段时间后我就睡了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13519
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_e43f6951:

    # p "As you know, I spent some time helping our doctor, then went to eat and to bed."
    p "如您所知，我花了一些时间帮助我们的医生，然后去吃饭睡觉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13521
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_b97fb374:

    # a "I appreciate that you did."
    a "我很感激你这么做。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13525
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_5912b8ab:

    # a "That was when you came up to talk to me, is that right?"
    a "那是您过来和我说话的时候，对吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13527
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_b9825524:

    # p "It is, sir."
    p "是的，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13529
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_7d7220fb:

    # "Arthur's expression doesn't seem to change and he simply lets the quiet of the cabin remain undisturbed as you are forced to remember your blunder from yesterday."
    "Arthur的表情似乎没有变化，他只是让船舱的安静保持不变，因为你不得不回忆起昨天的错误。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13531
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_73b66a0a:

    # "With a twitch of his lips he breaks it off after a short while."
    "他抽动了一下嘴唇，过了一会儿就停止了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13533
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_81ee6c9e:

    # a "I do not think we need to talk about your behaviour yesterday. I still remember it rather vividly."
    a "我认为我们不需要谈论你昨天的行为。我仍然清楚地记得。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13537
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_ac43dc8b:

    # p "Before I went to bed I just had dinner with the rest of the crew. Getting to know some of the people I'll be spending my days with a little better."
    p "在睡觉之前，我和其他船员一起吃了晚饭。更好地了解一些我将与之共度时光的人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13539
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_676d0c4f:

    # a "So about today, how did you meet the gentleman again?"
    a "那么关于今天，你是怎么再次见到这位先生的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13547
translate Chinese day2_nomax_questioning_b165d263:

    # a "{cps=5000}So about today, how did you meet the gentleman again?{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}那么关于今天，你是怎么再次见到这位先生的？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:13587
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_ea831429:

    # "You bring your hands together in your lap and fold your fingers, fidgeting as you answer."
    "你把手放在膝盖上，手指交叠，不安地回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13589
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_02ec2c95:

    # p "Sir, I... I swapped my shift with another crew member because I felt I needed a little more rest."
    p "先生，我...我跟另一个船员换了班，因为我觉得我需要多休息一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13591
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_1a835cfb:

    # p "It being the morning shift, sir."
    p "是早班，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13595
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_78716626:

    # a "You're a farmer's boy, aren't you?"
    a "你不是个农家小子吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13599
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_08b8b1a6:

    # p "Yes, I am."
    p "是的，我是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13601
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_c2644bfc:

    # a "Then getting up early shouldn't be a problem for you, should it?"
    a "那么早起对你来说应该不是问题，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13603
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_f5928b22:

    # p "No, sir."
    p "没有，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13607
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_54b55a3e:

    # a "Let it be known that it is not a good look on your work ethics if you go and weasel yourself out of your shift on your first day, and not only that, but your very first shift, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "[family_name]先生，记住，第一天就想方设法逃避工作，而且还是你的第一个班次，这可不是什么好的职业道德。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13611
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_4397e065:

    # a "Who did take on your shift?"
    a "谁替你顶班了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13615
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_15782529:

    # p "Julian, sir. One of the other new recruits."
    p "是Julian，先生。新来的那些人里头的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13619
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_496105d7:

    # a "Julian, eh? Maybe I underestimated that boy after all."
    a "Julian，是吗？看来我还是小瞧那小子了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13623
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_2363d62f:

    # p "Konrad, sir. He was kind enough to take my place."
    p "是Konrad，先生。他很爽快地答应替我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13625
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_c35e28d9:

    # a "Very well, at least you left your work in capable hands."
    a "好吧，至少你把工作交给了靠谱的人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13629
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_80541836:

    # a "In the future, a little more commitment would do you good, lad. Shirking your responsibilities is not a good look."
    a "以后多用点心，年轻人。逃避责任可不是什么好事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13631
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_f99ca45f:

    # a "And you then used that time off to visit the gentleman?"
    a "然后你就抽出时间去拜访那位先生了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13633
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_785d30de:

    # p "Yessir"
    p "是的，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13638
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_71e5ee54:

    # "You straighten your back and give Nomax a brief glance before you answer."
    "你挺直了腰板，回答之前飞快地瞥了Nomax一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13643
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_27f8073a:

    # p "Well, you see, I finished my work early and it left me with some time to pursue other things. So I figured it best if I go pay him another visit."
    p "是这样，我提前完成了手头的工作，就想着不如去看看他，看看能不能帮上什么忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13645
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_8d79547b:

    # p "See if he needs anything... that sort of thing."
    p "看看他有什么需要的...之类的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13649
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_282642de:

    # a "I didn't realize we offered personal assistants on this ship, Mr. [family_name].{w} I have no objection to taking care of our guests if they're in need of someone, but going after them?"
    a "我不知道我们船上还提供私人助理服务， [family_name].{w} 。照顾客人我没意见，但主动凑上去？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13651
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_c5a2b0a1:

    # p "I'm sorry, it just felt like the right thing to do instead of sitting around doing nothing."
    p "抱歉，我只是觉得与其闲着没事干，不如做点什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13655
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_8f596673:

    # a "I do appreciate you taking the initiative. Just knowing when to apply it is something you will have to learn. You could have gone to anyone on your shift and they wouldn't have minded a helping pair of hands."
    a "你能主动帮忙，我很欣慰。但你得学会在合适的时机使用这份积极性。当时你可以去找任何一个当班的人，他们肯定都欢迎你搭把手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13657
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_ec2317a8:

    # p "Yessir."
    p "是，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13662
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_043cc710:

    # p "Well, you see, I finished my work early and it left me with some time to pursue other things. I thought it would be a good idea, having seen him unwell the day before, to check on him again."
    p "嗯，你看，我提前干完了活儿，就想着做点别的事情。昨天看他不太舒服，我想着再去看看他，应该挺好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13664
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_bc0dd813:

    # p "See how he is doing, if he needs anything... that sort of thing."
    p "看看他情况如何，有没有什么需要的... 之类的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13668
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_7a36dc97:

    # a "I appreciate your thought, but in the future you will only help passengers when necessary. You are a sailor, not their personal butler."
    a "你的好意我心领了，但是以后只需要在必要的时候帮助乘客。你是一名水手，不是他们的私人管家。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13670
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_64cfc1b2:

    # a "Showing initiative is good, and may yet get you far, but just know when to apply it."
    a "有积极性是好事，将来会有好处的，但要知道什么时候该用。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13672
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_ec2317a8_1:

    # p "Yessir."
    p "是，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13676
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_506bd4d0:

    # "You look nervously over at the African wild dog, hoping he will play along with your little white lie."
    "你紧张地瞥了一眼非洲野狗，希望他能配合你这小小的谎言。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13679
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_feab33ad:

    # p "I- um, you see, the gentleman came calling for my help, sir. He... I think he may be shy, and knowing me from the previous day, I was the person he felt comfortable calling for."
    p "我——呃，长官您看，是这位先生主动叫我去帮个忙。他……我猜他可能有点认生，昨天又刚同我相识，所以觉得使唤我比较自在。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13683
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_81155ea7:

    # a "He came calling for help?"
    a "他来找你帮忙？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13685
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_28f05f54:

    # a "So he came on deck to get your attention?"
    a "所以他是跑到甲板上来找你的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13691
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_ebb1b74f:

    # a "He came calling for help?{w} Again?"
    a "他又来找你帮忙？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13693
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_51adfbb9:

    # a "He seems to be having a rather difficult time adjusting to the ship, don't you think?"
    a "他看起来不太适应船上的生活，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13697
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_b812b4e0:

    # a "So to make sure I have it correct, he came on deck to get your attention?"
    a "我确认一下，他是跑到甲板上来找你的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13699
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_ec2317a8_2:

    # p "Yessir."
    p "是，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13703
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_506bd4d0_1:

    # "You look nervously over at the African wild dog, hoping he will play along with your little white lie."
    "你紧张地瞥了一眼非洲野狗，希望他能配合你这小小的谎言。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13705
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_d8f63cb1:

    # p "It was a bit of an odd situation, sir."
    p "这事儿有点蹊跷，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13709
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_61fa598b:

    # "Arthur leans into the conversation, with a hint of curiosity showing on his face."
    "Arthur 凑过来听，脸上带着一丝好奇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13711
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_efa65f49:

    # a "An odd situation?"
    a "蹊跷？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13713
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_b49c16b4:

    # a "Well, don't keep the audience waiting if it's such an oddity."
    a "好吧，如果真这么蹊跷，就别卖关子了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13717
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_161ffa6e:

    # "You nervously fiddle with the hem of your shirt, wondering if this is going a bit too far."
    "你紧张地摆弄着衬衫的下摆，琢磨着这谎撒的是不是有点扯了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13719
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_c34a765e:

    # "It's just the best story you can think of at the moment, so you go with it."
    "实在是当下能想到的最靠谱的理由了，只能这么说了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13721
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_f3b7fa13:

    # p "Yes, odd. {w}Well, you see, we were busy scrubbing the deck and the gentleman must have come out for a morning walk."
    p "是，是挺奇怪的。{w}是这样的，您看，我们当时正忙着擦甲板，那位先生大概是出来溜达。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13726
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_7eb7350e:

    # p "Anyway, he got caught out by the wet planks and I saw his paws lose their footing."
    p "结果一不小心被湿木板给绊了，我眼瞅着他爪子一打滑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13728
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_3c1b1c9b:

    # p "He slipped, sir, most unfortunate. A crash, a yelp, and he was on the ground in a heap."
    p "他就这么滑倒了，先生，真够倒霉的。砰的一声，哎呦一声，就摔了个狗啃泥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13732
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_03243e0e:

    # "You look over at Nomax, and seeing his glasses, quickly add them to the story to try and convince Arthur with the added detail."
    "你瞅了瞅Nomax，注意到他戴着眼镜，赶紧把眼镜也加到故事里，想用更细节的信息来让Arthur相信。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13734
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_5bd0787c:

    # p "We were lucky that the glasses didn't break or fall overboard, sir."
    p "还好眼镜没摔坏也没掉海里，您说是不是，先生？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13736
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_88658850:

    # a "That is most fortunate indeed..."
    a "那可真是太好了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:13738
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_0d3d69e4:

    # "Arthur turns to Nomax and scans him from head to toe for any visible injuries."
    "Arthur 转向 Nomax，上下打量他，想看看他有没有哪里受伤。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13740
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_a8a939f5:

    # a "Are you injured? We do have a doctor on the ship if necessary."
    a "您没事吧？要不要叫船医？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13744
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_ced6b2ec:

    # "A stunned silence fills the room as Nomax just stares back at Arthur for a few seconds, his jaw slightly parted."
    "一阵令人尴尬的沉默充满了房间，Nomax 只是张着嘴，愣愣地看着 Arthur。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13746
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_335d9a1a:

    # "He catches himself early enough so that you don't feel the need to fill in for him."
    "他总算及时回过神来，没让你觉得需要替他圆谎。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13750
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_82ac4813:

    # n "No, no. I appreciate your concern, sir. But... er... I do not think I hurt myself during my... fall."
    n "不，没事没事。谢谢您的关心，先生。就是……呃……我觉着我……摔那一跤，没伤着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13752
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_23525c2b:

    # "Arthur clearly doesn't quite buy into the tale, but he doesn't raise any objections at this point, since Nomax appears to confirm your story."
    "Arthur 显然不太相信这套说辞，但他也没提出什么异议，毕竟 Nomax 看起来像是肯定了你的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13754
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_f011c212:

    # "You swallow hard as you try to steady yourself under the scrutiny, trying your best to catch any fidgeting or any odd behaviour in yourself before it arises."
    "你努力地吞咽了一下，想在审视下稳住自己，竭力掩饰自己的心虚，生怕露出马脚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13757
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_894ee262:

    # "It seems that Arthur believes it so far, which is good, and from the look on his face he wants you to continue."
    "看起来 Arthur 暂时是信了，那就好，而且看他的表情，是想让你继续说下去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13761
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_7ebcd96e:

    # "You glance over to see if Nomax is going to speak out against your little white lie, but other than a disapproving look at you, he remains silent."
    "你瞥了一眼，看看 Nomax 会不会跳出来反驳你这小谎，但他只是不赞同地看了你一眼，没说话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13763
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_58aa2298:

    # "It's just a cover story. He'll understand."
    "这只是个掩饰的说辞。他会理解的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13767
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_207c0e48:

    # a "Well... Quite the morning by the sound of it...{w} Aside from him slipping on the planks, how did the gentleman appear to you this morning?"
    a "哎……听起来真是个多事之秋啊……{w} 撇开他在木板上滑倒的事儿不谈，今天早上，这位先生看起来怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13771
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_7600a351:

    # a "Please continue. How did the gentleman appear to you this morning?"
    a "请继续。今天早上，这位先生看起来怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13773
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_99f315fe:

    # "You swallow again, the question causing memories from earlier to bubble back up. When the door swung open and well... How did you find him?"
    "你又吞咽了一下，这个问题让你回忆起了之前看到的景象。当门猛地打开，然后……你是怎么发现他的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13775
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_6511f2ef:

    # "With little more than his family jewels on his person. {w}Hardly something you can bring up here."
    "几乎是光着出来的。{w} 这事儿可不能在这儿说啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13777
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_beadd104:

    # "You linger on the memory for a moment before pushing it aside, hoping that it won't raise a blush to show through your fur."
    "你沉浸在回忆里片刻，然后赶紧把这些想法甩开，希望别让我臊得毛都红了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13786
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question2_ebf2a459:

    # a "{cps=5000}How did the gentleman appear to you this morning?{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}今天早上，这位先生看起来怎么样？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:13823
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_d35a9728:

    # p "He looked terribly ill. Just pale in the face, and he had..."
    p "他看起来病得厉害。脸色煞白，而且他还……"

# game/script day2.rpy:13827
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_acd37469:

    # "You pause your sentence to look down along your body and run your hands over your chest, trying to convey that he had vomited on himself."
    "你停了下来，低头看了看自己的身体，用手在胸前比划着，示意他吐了自己一身。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13829
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_edfcb47c:

    # p "Rather messy, sir."
    p "可脏了，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13833
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_748d9662:

    # p "He asked me for help with the bucket as he was rather self-conscious about disposing of it himself."
    p "他让我帮他倒呕吐物，因为他自己不好意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13837
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_12aaccb2:

    # p "Of course, we also cleaned up the cabin. It was a sorry sight, and of course I did my best to avoid any embarrassment for the gentleman and helped him along with his, er, accident."
    p "当然，我们还清理了船舱。那场面，啧啧，惨不忍睹。我当然是尽力不让那位先生难堪，帮他收拾了那摊子事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13839
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_dab34f7b:

    # "Did that go a bit too far?"
    "我这么说是不是有点过头了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13841
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_3bfba813:

    # "You're not sure, though you check with Nomax just in case. His ears wilt as he looks at you in utter disbelief, his black lips parting as he finally speaks up."
    "虽然你心里没底，但还是抱着一丝希望问了问Nomax。他听后简直不敢相信，耳朵都耷拉了下来，张了张嘴，这才支吾着说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13843
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_aff54a3a:

    # n "I, er..."
    n "我，这个..."

# game/script day2.rpy:13845
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_6f83c361:

    # a "Yes?"
    a "是？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13847
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_516ab303:

    # "You quickly try to cast a subtle glance at Nomax, urging him to just keep quiet and go along with it!"
    "你赶紧偷偷地瞥了Nomax一眼，示意他别出声，配合一下！"

# game/script day2.rpy:13851
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_5e9b25fb:

    # "Arthur crosses his arms in front of his chest, the uniform straining to wrap itself around his arms."
    "Arthur双手抱胸，制服被他结实的胳膊撑得紧紧的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13855
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_3752a0fb:

    # "Nomax bites his lip and it looks like he understands what's going on. He swallows his pride and plays the role you need him to play right now."
    "Nomax咬了咬嘴唇，似乎明白了什么。他压下心里的不情愿，准备按你说的演下去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13857
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_7a4244b6:

    # n "Nothing, sir."
    n "没事，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13859
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_5e029188:

    # "Your stomach unties itself from the knot it was in a moment ago as you hear him play along with your spiel."
    "听到他接茬往下编，你提到嗓子眼的心总算放下了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13865
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_773f7737:

    # p "I went to fetch his breakfast, but found him asleep when I came in."
    p "我去给他拿早餐，结果进去一看，他还睡着呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13867
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_f6768cef:

    # p "I quietly placed down the breakfast on his table and was just about to leave the room when I heard him stirring behind me."
    p "我就悄悄地把早餐放在桌上，正要走，就听见他那边有了动静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13869
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_39507b4d:

    # p "Turning round, I saw him waking up and asked if it would be all right if I stayed, to which the gentleman agreed."
    p "我回头一看，他醒了，就问他介不介意我留下，那位先生说没关系。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13871
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_af99e129:

    # p "He probably took about 10 minutes to have his breakfast? I did not have a watch with me at the time."
    p "他大概吃了十分钟吧？我当时没带表，没看时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13873
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_fcb8c624:

    # p "Naturally I assisted our passenger by making sure I brought back the utensils as well once he had finished his meal."
    p "吃完后，我自然也帮着把餐具都收拾走了，尽我所能地照顾咱们的乘客。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13877
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_8519f3c4:

    # p "Now I know that perhaps I went a bit far, but at the time I was just doing what I thought was best"
    p "我知道我可能有点越界了，可当时我只是觉得应该这么做。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13881
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_55c8bf1c:

    # a "I didn't realize we offered personal assistants on this ship, Mr. [family_name].{w} I have no objection to taking care of our guests if they're in need of someone, but this is more than what is required of you. You are a sailor first."
    a "我还不知道咱们船上还提供私人助理服务呢，[family_name]先生。{w}  照顾客人我没意见，但这也超出你的工作范围了。你首先是个水手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13883
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_0359c0ee:

    # p "My apologies, it just felt like the right thing to do instead of sitting around doing nothing."
    p "不好意思，长官，我就是觉得闲着也是闲着，不如做点什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13885
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_8f596673:

    # a "I do appreciate you taking the initiative. Just knowing when to apply it is something you will have to learn. You could have gone to anyone on your shift and they wouldn't have minded a helping pair of hands."
    a "你能主动帮忙，我很欣慰。但你得学会在合适的时机使用这份积极性。当时你可以去找任何一个当班的人，他们肯定都欢迎你搭把手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13891
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_c5683197:

    # p "He had just woken up, sir."
    p "他刚醒，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13893
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_39272c01:

    # a "You know this how?"
    a "你怎么知道的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13895
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_d4e0f2b2:

    # p "Well, it was early in the morning hours, of course, but he was... uh, freshly dressed, and he told me as much."
    p "呃，因为当时是早上，而且他...呃，衣服穿得挺整齐的，也是他自己说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13899
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_fe661644:

    # a "And why did he call for you?"
    a "那他叫你干什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13901
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_418b26bc:

    # p "He simply needed some to find out where to get his breakfast and tea, that's all."
    p "他就是想问问在哪儿能弄到早餐和茶，就这些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13903
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_4b8fe6a9:

    # p "I explained it to him and we got to talking as we made our way back to his cabin."
    p "我跟他说了说，然后我们就一起回了他的船舱，路上就聊了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13906
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_77a43800:

    # p "So we got to talking and settled down in his cabin for the morning."
    p "后来我们就聊开了，一上午都在他的船舱里待着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13915
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_57cb8ebc:

    # a "Flirtatious? After slipping and falling?"
    a "调情？摔了个狗啃泥之后？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13917
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_0b5e150d:

    # "You fake a laugh to support your lie, waving off Arthur's question."
    "你干笑了两声，想掩盖过去，摆摆手示意Arthur别问了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13919
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_8be8aaad:

    # p "It perhaps wasn't the grandest entrance, that's true. But he tried his best."
    p "他的出场方式可能的确不怎么体面，不过他已经尽力了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13923
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_47df51ac:

    # p "He was quite flirtatious and seemed to have been a bit smitten with me after yesterday."
    p "他挺会撩的，而且昨天之后好像有点喜欢上我了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13925
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_cc6eaf93:

    # a "Flirtatious, eh?"
    a "撩你？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13927
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_9a21a034:

    # p "But nothing came of it, sir. I came here to work, not to seek engagements like that, thus I turned down the gentleman's advances."
    p "不过啥也没发生，长官。我来这是工作的，不是来搞对象的，所以我拒绝了他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13933
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_ef565d97:

    # n "{i}My{/i} Advances?"
    n "{i}我{/i} 勾引你？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13937
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_5d18b213:

    # n "Flirtatious... Advances?"
    n "调情... 勾引？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13939
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_968dc709:

    # "He expresses his annoyance when he is put on the spot like this, and you quickly jump in to avoid giving him any more time to talk."
    "他被你这么一逼问，显得很不耐烦，你赶紧岔开话题，不给他继续往下说的机会。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13943
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_d3b353b1:

    # p "Advances, yes. No ill will towards your feelings, of course, but my work here on the ship comes first."
    p "要说进一步发展…的确有。当然，我无意冒犯您的感情，不过在下还是以船上的工作为重。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13945
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_b6fca9e8:

    # p "I cannot allow a personal relationship to cloud my judgment, not to mention that a personal connection with one of our passengers would be completely inappropriate."
    p "我不能让私人关系影响我的判断，更何况和一个乘客拉上关系，这说不过去吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13947
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_0c13a2d4:

    # p "But anyway, it wasn't much of anything, Officer. I wouldn't think much of it."
    p "总之，真没什么，长官。您别往心里去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13950
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_db2068ad:

    # "You don't dare look at Nomax right now and all you hear is an exasperated snort as the painted dog crosses his arms and leans further forward on the bed."
    "你现在根本不敢看Nomax，只听见那只花里胡哨的“野狗”不屑地哼了一声，抱着胳膊，在床上扭过身子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13952
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_cb812b29:

    # "Arthur's nostrils flare with a noisy exhale as he follows your recounting of events, his expression as guarded as ever."
    "Arthur听着你的叙述，鼻孔里粗重地喷出一口气，表情还是那么捉摸不透。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13954
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_5c0b5bbf:

    # "Whether he believes you or not? You cannot tell. For now he simply appears to be listening to your story and watching the reactions of both of you."
    "他到底信没信？你看不出来。现在他只是听着你的故事，观察着你们俩的反应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13956
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_606193b7:

    # a "And you stayed with him until you were called to assist with Samuel, right?"
    a "你一直陪着他，直到被叫去帮忙照顾Samuel，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13958
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_faa39ef2:

    # "With something that is as simple to confirm as that, you straighten yourself and nod confidently."
    "这事儿一查就能水落石出，你挺直腰板，自信地点点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13962
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_f1f3df43:

    # "The ship catches a wave and you see Arthur take a step to the side to regain his balance as he speaks."
    "船身一晃，Arthur也跟着踉跄了一下，稳住身形才继续说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13964
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_44864d0d:

    # a "What did you two do in the time between settling into the cabin and leaving to help?"
    a "你们俩从进了船舱到离开去帮忙，这段时间都干了些什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:13968
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_c527ebec:

    # "The brief moment of confidence fades as your eyes flick back over to Nomax for a moment."
    "刚建立起来的一点自信又消失了，你忍不住又瞥了Nomax一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:13970
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_8b62fba0:

    # "If you couldn't mention how he opened the door, then you {i}certainly{/i} can't mention what you did afterwards..."
    "他开门的事儿都不能说，那之后的事{i}更{/i}不能提了…"

# game/script day2.rpy:13978
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question3_92d01f00:

    # a "{cps=5000}What did you two do in the time between settling into the cabin and leaving to help?{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}你们俩从进了船舱到离开去帮忙，这段时间都干了些什么？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:14008
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_0b87d602:

    # p "I had to make sure I stayed with him, sir."
    p "我必须得守着他，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14010
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_e3ba44d4:

    # a "You had to? Why was that?"
    a "必须？为什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14014
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_c6b500c1:

    # p "He had one drink too many, that's why he had such a sick look on his face, and with the rocking of the ship he was just in quite a state..."
    p "他喝大了，所以脸色才那么难看，加上船摇摇晃晃的，他简直难受死了…"

# game/script day2.rpy:14018
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_ba799395:

    # p "He had too much to drink and with the rocking of the ship he was in a rather questionable state."
    p "他喝多了，加上船摇摇晃晃，那状态，啧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14020
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_63baf8b7:

    # p "I couldn't leave him alone and feared that if I did, he might kill himself if he stumbled and hit his head."
    p "我不能让他一个人待着，怕他磕着碰着，一不小心寻了短见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14024
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_d89d847e:

    # a "He was that drunk? First thing in the morning?"
    a "他早上就喝成那样了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14028
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_540cd884:

    # a "We seldom have many passengers aboard this ship, but they are rationed alcohol just like the rest of you."
    a "咱们船上本来就没几个乘客，而且酒精都是定量供应的，跟你们一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14030
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_d3daef97:

    # p "Uh- It wasn't from the ship's alcohol. He brought his own and mentioned that he felt homesick during the night and started drinking"
    p "呃——倒不是偷喝船上的存酒。是他自个儿带上船的私酒，说是昨夜里有些思乡心切，这才忍不住借酒消愁。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14034
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_41d9b71d:

    # p "It's all a bit much for him, you know. The rough bedding, the food, constant swaying, he's just used to a higher standard, I think."
    p "他有点不适应，您也知道。这床铺又硬又糙，吃的也不习惯，还一直晃，他以前的日子，过的比这讲究多了，我想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14036
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_1ef00347:

    # p "So he just needed someone to be there. A pat on the back while the worst of it wears off."
    p "所以他就是需要个人陪着。难受劲儿上来的时候，拍拍他的背。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14040
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_45fa6556:

    # "Arthur inspects the African Wild Dog from afar and takes a curious whiff of the air in the room."
    "Arthur远远地打量着这只非洲野犬，还好奇地在空气中嗅了嗅。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14044
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_9264b184:

    # a "I don't smell any alcohol though, nor does he look like he's in bad shape."
    a "不过我没闻到酒味儿，而且他看起来状态也还行啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14046
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_dfaae962:

    # p "It was the tail end of it. As I said, he drank in the night and it started to wear off while I was keeping him company."
    p "都过去了。我说了，他晚上喝的，我陪着他，酒劲儿就慢慢下去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14048
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_559b7537:

    # a "Hmm..."
    a "嗯……"

# game/script day2.rpy:14050
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_90071125:

    # a "A rather strange situation. I would have thought the gentleman to have a bit more self control, but you do stand by it?"
    a "这事儿有点蹊跷啊。我以为这位先生会比较有自制力，不过你坚持这么说？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14052
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_e39c8077:

    # p "I do, sir."
    p "我坚持，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14054
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_80799543:

    # a "Very well."
    a "好吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14060
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_e44b5016:

    # p "Nothing much, sir."
    p "没什么，先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14064
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_bbec5973:

    # p "I just took the time to get to know him a little better. What brought him to travel, what he plans to do when he gets there. That type of thing."
    p "我只是稍微花时间了解了一下他。比如他为什么会出海，到了目的地有什么打算，就是这些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14066
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_57e01214:

    # p "Did you know that he is a botanist by trade?"
    p "您知道吗？他是个植物学家。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14068
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_34b2c2c2:

    # p "Quite interesting, really. I feel like I should know more about it, coming from a farmer's family, but it was never my thing."
    p "真是挺有意思的。说起来，我毕竟是农家出身，本应该更懂这些，可惜我一直没这方面的兴趣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14070
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_bf21fe6d:

    # "You point to the small plant on the table, softly illuminated by the warm light of the lamp."
    "你指了指桌上那株小植物，灯光暖融融的，温柔地照在它身上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14076
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_b125c03d:

    # "Arthur walks over to it and pulls the pot closer to him to inspect it."
    "Arthur走过去，把花盆拉近了些，仔细端详起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14078
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_12efc4e8:

    # a "I did not."
    a "我还真不知道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14080
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_de51f76c:

    # a "And that is all? Just small talk?"
    a "仅此而已？就只是闲聊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14082
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_483e1748:

    # p "Correct. Simply getting to know the people I'll be spending the next weeks with."
    p "是的。就是想先认识一下，接下来几周要一起共事的人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14084
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_70fa39d4:

    # p "I didn't have any cards with me, otherwise we might have sat down to play a game, but as it was, we just had a nice chat."
    p "我没带纸牌，不然还能坐下来玩两把，可惜没有，就只是聊了聊天。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14086
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_37a67ce6:

    # a "And you stand by it that this is the true account of what happened this morning?"
    a "您确定这就是今天早上事情的全部经过吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14088
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_e39c8077_1:

    # p "I do, sir."
    p "我坚持，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14090
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_80799543_1:

    # a "Very well."
    a "好吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14098
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_cc530866:

    # p "When he was showing me his work, I noticed that it was quite wobbly, and it felt like it might collapse with but a wrong push."
    p "他给我看他弄的东西的时候，我发现那玩意儿不太稳当，感觉轻轻一碰就会塌。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14100
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_f4a16cf7:

    # a "That'd be a job for our carpenter and his mate."
    a "那就该让咱们的木匠和他的助手来处理。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14102
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_3df2caab:

    # p "No, no. Nothing to worry about. That's the reason I stayed here."
    p "不，没事儿，不用担心。我留在这儿就是为了这个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14104
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_d4022908:

    # p "I figured I might as well make myself useful and have a look at it myself. See if I could handle it or if I'd have to call them."
    p "我寻思着，不如自己先看看，能修好就修好，不行再叫他们来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14106
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_f6dfeb27:

    # p "It wasn't quite as easy as it first appeared, but I managed to get it all reattached properly and it's as sturdy as I suppose it was when it was first built, if I do say so myself!"
    p "一开始弄起来是挺费劲的，不过我还是设法把它们全都完美地接了回去，要我说，现在这张桌子结实得跟新的一样！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14108
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_ddd1f818:

    # "You nod your head proudly, back straight, and shoulders back to look suitably confident."
    "你自豪地点点头，挺直腰板，肩膀向后舒展，让自己看起来信心十足。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14112
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_e0b8cd72:

    # "The officer steps further into the room, passes you by, and pushes against the table to test it. And sure enough, it didn't move."
    "军官又往房间里走了几步，从你身边 지나쳐갔다, 然后伸手推了推桌子，想试试它结不结实。 嘿，纹丝不动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14114
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_398e9d05:

    # "Well, it never did...but Arthur doesn't need to know that part, of course."
    "其实吧，那事儿根本没成……当然，Arthur就没必要知道这些细节了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14116
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_de9bf76f:

    # p "See? Not bad, is it?"
    p "瞧，还不错吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14118
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_e580013d:

    # "All you get in return is a snort from the horse as he makes his way back to the door."
    "作为回应，马人长官只是重重哼了一声，便径直朝着门口大步踱去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14120
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_5fb0839b:

    # a "Was that everything then?{w} When you were finished, you were called to see Samuel?"
    a "都讲完了吗？{w} 你完事之后，他们就叫你去见Samuel了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14122
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_ec2317a8:

    # p "Yessir."
    p "是，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14124
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_140f4246:

    # a "And you stand by it that this is the true account of the events of this morning?"
    a "你确定这就是今天早上事情的来龙去脉？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14126
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_e39c8077_2:

    # p "I do, sir."
    p "我坚持，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14128
translate Chinese day2_nomax_question4_80799543_2:

    # a "Very well."
    a "好吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14142
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_69c3aeac:

    # "Arthur's expression softens and he pauses for a few moments. He reaches for the wood frame of the bed and runs his thumb across the grain of it."
    "Arthur的表情缓和了下来，沉默片刻。他抬手轻抚床的木框，指腹摩挲着上面的纹路。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14146
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9b34766b:

    # a "So, you met the gentleman for the first time yesterday, sick on the deck."
    a "所以说，你昨天才第一次见到那位先生，当时他正难受地趴在甲板上？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14150
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9ed02966:

    # a "So, you met the gentleman for the first time yesterday on deck."
    a "这么说，你昨天才在甲板上头一回见到那位先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14154
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_dfe04d67:

    # a "Then come today you decide to trade the remainder of your morning shift to get the time off."
    a "然后今天你就打算把剩下的早班换掉，好腾出时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14158
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_03fd1450:

    # a "Then today you feel so consumed by your work that you finish your task early."
    a "然后今天你又觉得干劲十足，提前完成了活儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14162
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_a2d0c44e:

    # a "Then today he came back to find you, so that you may aid him with his troubles."
    a "然后今天他又回来找你，想让你帮他排忧解难。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14166
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4de73de9:

    # a "Then today the gentleman had an accident while you were out working, slipping on the wet deck."
    a "然后今天，你出去干活的时候，那位先生不小心在湿甲板上摔了一跤。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14170
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_72f5b80c:

    # a "He is still struggling badly with his seasickness, to the point where he... well... makes such a mess that he needs help to clean it up"
    a "他晕船晕得厉害，吐得...哎...那叫一个狼狈，还得人帮忙收拾。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14174
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_8d719088:

    # a "And decide no only to pay him a visit, but to bring his breakfast right along with you, finding him still asleep in his quarters."
    a "你不仅决定去看看他，还顺道把早餐给他带了过去，结果发现他还在自己舱里睡得正香。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14178
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_17391180:

    # a "And you met him shortly after he had woken up according to his accord."
    a "你见着他的时候，他刚按自己的步调醒过来没多久。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14182
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_8cf0d400:

    # a "And find him being rather... well how to put it... forward towards your person."
    a "然后你发现他对你...嗯...有点过于热情了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14186
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0d841ace:

    # a "After which you stayed with him, because he was three sheets to the wind, barely able to stand, and needed a shoulder for support."
    a "后来你一直陪着他，因为他喝得烂醉如泥，都站不稳了，需要人扶一把。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14192
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3ad06559:

    # a "Which wouldn't be unheard of that someone might be rather forward if he had downed a little more than he could handle..."
    a "如果有人喝大了，言语上放肆一点，倒也不是什么新鲜事……"

# game/script day2.rpy:14194
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_dfd6f1cf:

    # a "Still, I would have expected better from someone of his stature. Yet... not the first passenger to proudly display his gentility and end up inexcusably ill-disciplined."
    a "不过，我还以为像他那样有身份的人会更自重一些。 唉...他也算不上是第一个自诩绅士风度，结果却毫无节制，丢人现眼的乘客了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14198
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0c0fcc8f:

    # a "After which you spent the remaining time of the morning shift in the cabin in conversation."
    a "之后你整个上午剩下的时间都在船舱里和他闲聊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14202
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_28fde513:

    # a "After which you spent the remaining time of the morning shift fixing his table."
    a "之后你整个上午剩下的时间都在帮他修桌子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14206
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_dcea30e7:

    # p "I swear that these are the actual events, and if not then Neptune himself shall drag me down."
    p "我发誓这些都是真的，要是有半句假话，就让海王星把我拖下海喂鱼！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14210
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2a9577d5:

    # a "Hm... I would prefer to have that judgment in my own hands, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "哼...我倒宁愿自己来判断，[family_name]先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14222
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_8bdf914f:

    # "Nomax's annoyed snort interrupted the two of you, drawing both your and Arthur's attention to him."
    "Nomax不悦地哼了一声，打断了你们俩，把你们和Arthur的注意力都吸引了过去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14224
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_60ebd571:

    # "Now you have two people glaring at you as Nomax does the same, crossing his arms over his chest, clearly irritated by your story."
    "现在Nomax也和你一样，双手抱胸，一脸恼火地瞪着你，显然对你说的故事很不满。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14226
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6fc5e740:

    # n "Are they though?"
    n "是这样吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14228
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_e358f3d0:

    # a "You don't seem to agree?"
    a "你好像不太同意？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14230
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_d66a0412:

    # n "I do not, sir."
    n "我不同意，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14232
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0017290f:

    # a "Well, speak up then, that is why I brought him here after all. If you do not feel the recruit has been telling the truth, then I would rather like to know."
    a "好吧，那就直说吧，我把他带来这儿就是为了听他说法的。 如果你觉得这位新兵在撒谎，我倒是想听听你的看法。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14234
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_28726fd9:

    # "You feel both heat and cold rushing through your body at the same time as you listen to them."
    "听着他们说话，你感觉自己像是被扔进了冰火两重天，浑身难受。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14236
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6e50caa3:

    # "Fuck.{w} Why did you have to make up parts of it?"
    "操！{w} 你他妈的为什么要添油加醋？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14238
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9c3a929f:

    # "Nothing about your stay was incriminating, what were you afraid of? Why did you have to tell it like you did?"
    "你待着那会儿又没做什么见不得人的事，你怕什么啊？ 为什么非要这么说？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14240
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2d1514af:

    # "If anything now you will just look even more suspicious to Arthur!"
    "这下好了，你在Arthur眼里只会显得更可疑！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14242
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_5b307d39:

    # "And why won't that idiot just go along with it?!"
    "那个白痴怎么就不能顺着我的话说下去呢？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14246
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ead8a645:

    # n "I will. Slipping on deck?!"
    n "我会配合的。“在甲板上滑倒”？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14248
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4657699f:

    # "He shoots you an accusing glare."
    "他狠狠地瞪了你一眼，眼神里充满了指责。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14250
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f11211a4:

    # n "I may not be a seasoned sailor, but I can very well notice when something is slippery and be careful accordingly. In any case, I did not go out on deck today."
    n "我可能不是什么老水手，但我分得清地上滑不滑，也会小心避让。 再说了，我今天压根就没去甲板上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14254
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_34fca4ae:

    # n "Making a mess out of my entire room?"
    n "把我房间里弄得一团糟？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14256
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0b601ea4:

    # n "Did I feel good yesterday? Obviously not, and I am appreciative of the help he provided me. But now this is just going too far."
    n "我昨天感觉好吗？ 显然不好，我也很感谢他给我的帮助。 但现在这事儿扯得也太远了吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14260
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c2927a49:

    # n "Being forward? Flirtatious?"
    n "言语轻佻？举止轻浮？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14262
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0acddfe5:

    # n "Sir I very well know my boundaries and did not come onto this ship to get involved with the crew in such a manner."
    n "先生，我清楚自己的底线，我上这条船可不是为了和船员们搞不正当关系。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14266
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6a757e55:

    # n "And then that ridiculous tale of me needing a shoulder to cry on?"
    n "还有那个更离谱的故事，说我需要一个肩膀来哭？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14268
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_99f7ea28:

    # n "Mr. [family_name] surely must have had a heatstroke, because his story sounds like he was hallucinating."
    n "[family_name]先生肯定中暑了，不然怎么净说胡话呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14275
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_304774e7:

    # n "The story of Mr. [family_name] is patently ridiculous, and I will not stand here and allow this humiliation of my-"
    n "[family_name]先生的故事简直荒唐至极，我绝不会容忍这种对我-"

# game/script day2.rpy:14280
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_73c5069f:

    # p "Well, if you want to tell the truth so badly, I'll tell him then?!"
    p "行，既然你非要我说实话，那我就说了啊！？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14282
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3a03197b:

    # "You burst in mid-sentence to challenge Nomax, only for Arthur to sternly tell both of you to calm down as he regains control."
    "你突然插嘴想跟Nomax争辩，结果Arthur狠狠地瞪了你们俩一眼，让大家冷静下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14284
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1ccced68:

    # "His hand strains where it still grips the wooden board of the bed, his eyes narrowing into a piercing glare."
    "他死死抓住床沿，手背青筋暴起，眼睛也眯了起来，目光像刀子一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14286
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c6eb8ee3:

    # a "I thought we had firmly established that I want nothing but the truth here! My patience is wearing quite thin with you two. Do you take me for some kind of fool?"
    a "我以为我已经说得很清楚了，我只要真相！我对你们两个的耐心已经到极限了。你们是把我当傻子耍吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14288
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1ea9a552:

    # a "I want the whole truth."
    a "我要全部的真相。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14292
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_07b44011:

    # a "Now!" with hpunch
    a "现在！" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:14296
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_665e4b68:

    # "His demand is accompanied by a sudden, noisy equine exhale."
    "他话音刚落，就粗重地喘了口气，像马一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14300
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_cc00c5ff:

    # "Your tongue flicks across your lips, feeling them dry as you try to find the right words."
    "你舔了舔干裂的嘴唇，努力措辞。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14302
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_64b1f6ff:

    # p "As you wish sir. When I entered his cabin I found the {i}gentleman{/i} in a... How can I put it so as not to humiliate him?... A state of undress."
    p "遵命，长官。我进了他的房间，发现那位{i}先生{/i}他... 怎么说才好，才能不让他太难堪呢... 处于衣衫不整的状态。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14304
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_27687fc2:

    # "You try to mimic Nomax's tone for further emphasis on some of the words."
    "你故意模仿Nomax的语气，想让某些词听起来更可笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14306
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4f1cac5a:

    # a "I do not need you to make a theatre of this, Mr. [family_name]. So you found him in a state of undress..."
    a "我不想听你在这儿演戏，[family_name]先生。所以你发现他衣衫不整..."

# game/script day2.rpy:14308
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7ab8c0f1:

    # "He inquires, his eyes drifting from you over to Nomax, whose ears have wilted at your words."
    "他问着，眼神从你身上飘向Nomax，Nomax听了这话，耳朵都耷拉下来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14312
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ddb21446:

    # p "Yes. Naked I mean, sir."
    p "是的，长官。一丝不挂，我是说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14314
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_76db9f65:

    # a "I assumed as much, recruit."
    a "这还用说，新兵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14316
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0d33c59e:

    # n "Sir, I-"
    n "长官，我-"

# game/script day2.rpy:14320
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_419d5750:

    # a "What?"
    a "啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14322
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_18571915:

    # "Arthur snaps at the painted dog, clearly still annoyed that he had been lied to."
    "Arthur冲着那只非洲野犬吼道，显然还在为被骗的事情生气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14326
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1a1a5fb8:

    # a "Is he telling the truth or not? I want a yes or a no, nothing else, none of this childish back and forth."
    a "他到底说的是真话还是假话？我就要一个准话，别跟我在这儿打马虎眼！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14330
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_47994560:

    # "The African Wild Dog lowers his head and simply answers with a weak."
    "那只非洲野犬耷拉着脑袋，有气无力地回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14332
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_aa37de39:

    # n "Yes..."
    n "嗯..."

# game/script day2.rpy:14334
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0a5a4509:

    # a "Wasn't so hard, was it? Go on, recruit."
    a "这不就完了吗？说吧，新兵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14340
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ff41df16:

    # p "We talked for a little while and before long we found ourselves in his bed."
    p "我们聊了几句，然后就滚到他床上去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14346
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ceba9e7b:

    # p "He practically begged me to take him, and well, rest assured, I did."
    p "他简直是求着我上他，那还用说，我当然满足他了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14348
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_711b772c:

    # p "I could hardly refuse such an eager invitation, not from someone who spreads his legs so readily."
    p "面对一个这么迫不及待张开腿的人，我怎么好意思拒绝呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14350
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f4e235a5:

    # "Your words carry a hint of poison. Did Arthur need to know these details? {w}No. But if Nomax couldn't play along with a few white lies then he surely wouldn't mind, would he?!"
    "我这话里带着刺。Arthur需要知道这些细节吗？{w}当然不需要。但Nomax不是不喜欢说实话吗，那他肯定不介意我这么说吧？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14352
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_10f1dbdf:

    # "It was easy to see how flustered it made the painted dog, the flush of red across his shout, the folded ears..."
    "我能清楚地看到那只非洲野犬有多窘迫，他的脸上涨得通红，耳朵也无力地耷拉着……"

# game/script day2.rpy:14354
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ea3e7f7a:

    # "It was one humiliation or the other, and in your opinion he chose poorly."
    "横竖都是丢脸，我觉得他选了个更蠢的方式。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14356
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_23b7ace9:

    # "Your description of the events lingers in a tense silence between the three of you, broken only after several seconds by Arthur's heavy sigh."
    "你们三个人沉默着，我说的话像挥之不去一样，直到Arthur重重地叹了口气，才打破了这份沉寂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14360
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_25b96bd6:

    # a "That's enough. I get the idea."
    a "够了，我明白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14362
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_19245119:

    # a "This may just be the last thing I expected to hear when we walked in here, but he doesn't seem to be protesting. I suppose I've got the truth out of you...{w} for better or worse."
    a "这可能是我进来之后最意想不到的了，不过他好像也没什么反应。看来我总算是从你嘴里套出实话了……{w}不管是不是我想要的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14366
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_47fca229:

    # "Nomax looks up for a moment and certainly appears to think about challenging it, but doesn't seem to dare oppose the officer any further. Instead he just fiddles with one of the cuffs of his suit to avoid having to elaborate any further."
    "Nomax 抬头看了看，好像想顶撞几句，但终究还是没敢吱声。他只是摆弄着西装袖口，想赶紧结束这尴尬的对话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14371
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_68866781:

    # p "We talked for a little while and let's just say that he wasn't in any particular hurry to get dressed, in fact he rather enjoyed a touch or two."
    p "咱们就这么说吧，他当时可一点儿都没着急穿衣服，甚至还挺享受那几下抚摸。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14377
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1f0c5056:

    # p "Well, at least he most certainly didn't complain when I felt under his tail."
    p "反正我摸他尾巴底下的时候，他也没哼一声，肯定很舒服。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14379
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f4e235a5_1:

    # "Your words carry a hint of poison. Did Arthur need to know these details? {w}No. But if Nomax couldn't play along with a few white lies then he surely wouldn't mind, would he?!"
    "我这话里带着刺。Arthur需要知道这些细节吗？{w}当然不需要。但Nomax不是不喜欢说实话吗，那他肯定不介意我这么说吧？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14381
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_71fc4773:

    # "It was easy to see how flustered it made the painted dog, the flush of red across his snout, the folded ears..."
    "那只彩绘犬一下子就慌了神，瞧他，红晕都爬到鼻子上了，耳朵也耷拉了下来..."

# game/script day2.rpy:14383
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ea3e7f7a_1:

    # "It was one humiliation or the other, and in your opinion he chose poorly."
    "横竖都是丢脸，我觉得他选了个更蠢的方式。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14387
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_25b96bd6_1:

    # a "That's enough. I get the idea."
    a "够了，我明白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14389
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_19245119_1:

    # a "This may just be the last thing I expected to hear when we walked in here, but he doesn't seem to be protesting. I suppose I've got the truth out of you...{w} for better or worse."
    a "这可能是我进来之后最意想不到的了，不过他好像也没什么反应。看来我总算是从你嘴里套出实话了……{w}不管是不是我想要的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14393
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_47fca229_1:

    # "Nomax looks up for a moment and certainly appears to think about challenging it, but doesn't seem to dare oppose the officer any further. Instead he just fiddles with one of the cuffs of his suit to avoid having to elaborate any further."
    "Nomax 抬头看了看，好像想顶撞几句，但终究还是没敢吱声。他只是摆弄着西装袖口，想赶紧结束这尴尬的对话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14397
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6d9e794c:

    # "It takes a while for Arthur to digest the new information, tapping his knuckles against the wood of the bed."
    "Arthur一时半会儿还消化不了这新消息，只能用指关节一下一下地敲着床板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14403
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7f9370aa:

    # a "You two ladies better make sure that this cabin is clean enough so that the Virgin Mary won't have to drop her name if she graces us with her presence on this voyage."
    a "你们俩最好把这舱房给我打扫干净了，要不然等圣母玛利亚真来了，都嫌弃得要摘牌子走人！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14405
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c1aa8920:

    # a "Mr. [family_name].{w} I didn't expect much from you, but you've sunk to a new low. You're on this ship to work and learn your trade. Do not shirk your duties to bed down with the first man who offers."
    a "[family_name]先生！{w} 我对你本来就没啥指望，没想到你还能更下作。你上船是来干活学手艺的，不是让你跟个男的就往床上钻，给我注意点！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14407
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ce23140b:

    # a "As for you..."
    a "至于你嘛..."

# game/script day2.rpy:14409
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_902ad8ca:

    # "His gaze shifts over to Nomax, who is still fiddling with the cuff of his suit."
    "军官的目光扫向 Nomax，他还在那儿抠着他的袖口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14411
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_d23b1827:

    # a "Rarely have I seen a passenger who has so little respect for himself. It is high time the honorable gentleman grew a pair. Look at you, sitting here like a child who's just received a beating."
    a "我活这么久，就没见过这么不自重的乘客！我说这位体面的先生，你也该硬气一回了吧！看看你现在这怂样，跟个刚挨了揍的小孩儿似的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14413
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4077f9da:

    # a "But it is always the same with you high and mighty folk, wearing the finest silks, powdering your delicate faces. No wonder the world is going to shit with weak men like you around."
    a "你们这些高高在上的人，不都这样吗？穿着绫罗绸缎，往细皮嫩肉的脸上涂脂抹粉。就因为有你们这些软蛋，这世界才越来越糟！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14415
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1fc59c41:

    # a "Softened by the luxuries of their wealth. No hardship in their lives.{w} Sit up straight and show some dignity, for God's sake!"
    a "被那点儿臭钱养娇了，没吃过一点苦头。{w} 给老子坐直了，有点儿尊严行不行！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14417
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_91fa1af8:

    # a "I've had enough of you two, you're dismissed."
    a "我他妈受够你们俩了，滚吧！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14423
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_38114c21:

    # "Without another word, he turns on his heel and walks out the door, slamming it behind him."
    "军官一句话都没多说，直接转身，砰地一声把门摔上了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14425
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_155c73f0:

    # "There is a tense silence in the cabin as neither of you has the courage to speak, almost half a minute passes with nothing but the sound of the sea against the hull and the footsteps of sailors on the deck above."
    "舱房里气氛紧张得要命，谁也不敢先开口。将近半分钟，只能听见海浪拍打着船身，还有水手们在甲板上走来走去的声音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14429
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4e1de5e4:

    # n "I cannot believe that you told him!"
    n "我真不敢相信你居然告诉他了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14431
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_306574ed:

    # p "Look... all I needed you to do was play along!"
    p "哎...我只是想让你配合一下，演个戏而已！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14433
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4a6fd4cd:

    # n "Play along? With what?! Your efforts to humiliate me in front of everyone on this ship?{w} Well, good going, you are making great progress!"
    n "演戏？演什么？！ 演你当着全船人的面羞辱我吗？{w} 恭喜你，演得真不错啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14435
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2e2ce43a:

    # p "No, that's..."
    p "不，我不是那个意思..."

# game/script day2.rpy:14437
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_831cd3e9:

    # "You let your head drop into your palms as slowly but surely the tension of the interrogation starts to leave your body."
    "你慢慢地把头埋进手掌里，感觉刚才审讯带来的紧张感一点点地从身体里消退。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14439
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b23b8dfe:

    # p "That's not what I meant. I- I'm sorry. I just..."
    p "我不是那个意思。对……对不起，我只是……"

# game/script day2.rpy:14441
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0d1d25b9:

    # p "Fuck. He just has it out for me."
    p "操。他就是逮着我了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14443
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0df85a24:

    # p "He... somehow sees me as the cause of some accidents that have happened."
    p "他...不知道怎么回事，就觉得之前发生的那些倒霉事儿都是我害的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14445
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4fca5df9:

    # p "I don't know. Maybe superstition and he assumes I bring bad luck, or he assumes malice on my part."
    p "我也不知道。可能是他迷信，觉得我带衰，要么就是觉得我不安好心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14447
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_e6ea037b:

    # p "I wasn't even present for the last one, but somehow he still has it in for me... so I thought I could-"
    p "上次那事儿我都没在场，但他还是不依不饶的...所以我就想着..."

# game/script day2.rpy:14449
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_109501e9:

    # n "Could what? Use me for all our entertainment today?"
    n "想着什么？ 想拿我当乐子，取悦大家是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14451
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_5ac37124:

    # "He gestures broadly and delivers his next sentence in a sarcastic, dramatic fashion."
    "他夸张地比划着，用一种又讽刺又做作的语气说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14453
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_eb765238:

    # n "{i}Oh look, the stupid passenger, he would forget to breathe if I would not remind him.{/i}"
    n "{i}哎哟，快看，这位尊贵的乘客，我要是不提醒他，他怕是都要忘了怎么喘气儿喽！{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:14455
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3aa49de1:

    # n "Thanks..."
    n "谢了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:14459
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3b5d2178:

    # n "What were you afraid of? You were with me and that is that. He seemed to be perfectly happy with that."
    n "你怕什么？ 你当时跟我在一起，不就得了。 他当时看起来也没啥意见啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14461
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3a006319:

    # p "I'm sorry. I thought that maybe telling him that you needed my assistance would keep him off my tail. Since he surely wouldn't blame a passenger."
    p "对不起。我就是想着，告诉他你需要我的帮忙，他可能就不会再盯着我了。 毕竟他总不能为难一个乘客吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14463
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_e9383303:

    # p "I... messed up and gone too far. I'm really sorry."
    p "我... 我搞砸了，真的太过分了。对不起，我真的知道错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14465
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_8856a532:

    # n "Well... cannot be taken back I guess."
    n "唉... 看来是没办法挽回了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14467
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_a6bac9b6:

    # n "I think it may be best for you to leave now..."
    n "我想你现在最好还是走吧..."

# game/script day2.rpy:14469
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_dabba5c9:

    # "You quietly stand up from the chair and don't offer any protest to his wish and leave his cabin."
    "你默默地从椅子上起身，什么也没说，顺从地离开了他的船舱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14476
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_a5304b61:

    # n "The story of Mr. [family_name] is patently ridiculous, and I will not stand here and allow my person to be humiliated."
    n "[family_name] 先生的这番说辞简直荒谬至极，我绝不会容忍我的尊严在此受到践踏。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14478
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_45579388:

    # p "Well, if you're so eager to tell the truth, then tell him."
    p "行啊，既然你这么想说实话，那就当着他的面说个清楚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14480
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6251cad8:

    # "You interrupt Nomax to challenge him only for Arthur to sternly tell both of you to calm down as he regains control."
    "你忍不住插嘴反驳 Nomax，Arthur 见状厉声呵斥，让你们两个都冷静点，他要控制局面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14484
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_e8b2daad:

    # "His hand tightens as he grips the wooden bed frame, his eyes narrowing into a piercing glare."
    "他攥紧了身下的木床，眼神也变得凌厉起来，仿佛要刺穿什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14486
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2cfa6558:

    # a "I thought we had firmly established that I want nothing but the truth here! My patience is wearing quite thin with you two. Do you take me for a fool?"
    a "我以为我们早就说清楚了，我只想听实话！我对你们俩的耐心已经快要磨光了。你们是觉得我很好糊弄吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14488
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_63d2dccf:

    # a "Cut these games. You will keep your muzzle shut, Mr. [family_name], and the gentleman will do the talking. I do not want you to interrupt him."
    a "都给我适可而止。[family_name] 先生，你给我闭嘴，让这位先生说。我不希望你再插嘴打断。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14494
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b1597e81:

    # n "As you wish sir. To be quite honest, I cannot quite figure out why Mr [family_name] decided to misrepresent the events of this morning."
    n "遵命，先生。说实话，我实在不明白 [family_name] 先生为什么要颠倒今天早上发生的事实。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14496
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_223a09cc:

    # n "From my perspective, there is nothing to worry about. He simply stopped by to have a conversation with me in my cabin."
    n "依我看，没什么好担心的。他只是来我舱里随便聊了几句。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14498
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_57a21137:

    # "He pauses for a moment and, noticing Arthur's expectant look, begins to fill in his account of events."
    "他停顿了一下，见 Arthur 一脸期待地看着他，便开始补充细节。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14500
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_5297ff32:

    # n "Er, we talked about things regarding my occupation, what brought me on this voyage. That sort of thing."
    n "呃，就聊了些我的工作，还有我为什么会选择出海之类的事。都是些家常。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14502
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2a5050cd:

    # a "And he did not leave the room from the time he came in until he was called to help?"
    a "从他进来之后，直到被叫去帮忙，他都没离开过房间，是这样吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14506
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_a1b5bbc7:

    # n "That is correct, sir. At some point a sailor came along and urged Mr. [family_name] to come with him. Er, I do not know the name of the gentleman, a lynx, a bit stout, full beard."
    n "没错，先生。后来有个水手过来，催 [family_name] 先生跟他走。嗯，我不记得那人叫什么了，是只猞猁，有点壮，留着一脸大胡子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14508
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_58e173a7:

    # a "Mr. Wagner, yes."
    a "Wagner 先生，是吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14510
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ed8a0334:

    # "Arthur pauses for a moment to let the account sink in, while he runs his thumb gently over the board of the bed."
    "Arthur 沉默片刻，似乎在消化他所说的话，同时用拇指轻轻摩挲着床板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14512
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1d0d1a16:

    # a "Very well, then, it sounds as if he really was with you through it all, although he made things more difficult on himself than necessary."
    a "很好，这么说来，他确实是一直和你在一起，只不过是给自己没事找事罢了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14516
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_35780739:

    # n "Correct sir. I do not know why he felt the need to, quite frankly, try to embarrass me in front of you, but I can see how being questioned in this way can make someone nervous."
    n "没错，先生。说实话，我也不知道他为什么非要在您面前让我难堪，不过我也能理解，在这种场合下被盘问，难免会让人紧张。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14520
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_69de6587:

    # p "I-... yes, I'm sorry."
    p "我... 是的，对不起。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14524
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ffc591bc:

    # "Arthur surveys the two of you for a couple more moments, tapping his finger against the wood before he lets go of it and turns to the door."
    "Arthur 又打量了你们一会儿，手指在木头上轻轻敲击，然后松开手，转身朝门口走去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14526
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1154b938:

    # a "Maybe so, in any case I've heard what I needed to hear. Both you, Mr. [family_name], and the gentleman are dismissed."
    a "也许吧，总之，我想听的都听到了。 [family_name] 先生，还有这位先生，你们可以走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14528
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f2963eec:

    # a "Next time, I suggest you simply stick with the truth, recruit. You won't do yourself any favor by trying to pass your problems on to others."
    a "我劝你下次还是老老实实说实话，新兵。想把自己的麻烦推给别人，对你没什么好处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14530
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_5eb4b657:

    # a "Even after what you said, the honorable gentleman here still saw fit to stand in for you.{w} I would say that at least a thank you is in order."
    a "就算在你说了那些话之后，这位先生仍然愿意为你挺身而出。{w} 你至少该说声谢谢吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14534
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_88e1d61c:

    # "With that, he leaves through the door and closes it behind him, leaving you and Nomax alone in the cabin."
    "说完，他就开门走了出去，留下你和 Nomax 独自在船舱里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14536
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_73b166be:

    # "You take a few moments to gather your courage and actually look at the painted dog, first parting your lips first in nothing but silence before you manage to speak a moment later."
    "你深吸一口气，鼓起勇气看向那只彩绘犬，嘴唇动了动，却发不出声音，过了好一会儿才终于开口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14538
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_29bcd5d8:

    # p "I... I'm sorry."
    p "我... 对不起。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14540
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_fda59874:

    # p "I don't know why I felt the need to put you on the spot like that. I guess I really just thought it would be safer. That he wouldn't target you and that if you needed the help, then I'd be fine staying with you all morning."
    p "我也不知道自己当时是怎么想的，竟然让你陷入那种窘境。我只是觉得那样更安全，他不会盯上你，而且就算你需要帮忙，我一早上都陪着你也没关系。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14542
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f4f71b37:

    # p "And... thank you."
    p "还有... 谢谢你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14546
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2de4f9e2:

    # n "I appreciate it."
    n "多谢了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14548
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_cba3ca9f:

    # n "Do not worry too much about it. He seems... intense, so I think I can understand how such a questioning would leave you afraid of saying the wrong thing."
    n "别太放在心上。他那人看起来…有点过头了，所以我觉得我能理解，被他那样盘问一通，你肯定会害怕说错话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14550
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f1032a4c:

    # n "I will not hold it against you."
    n "我不会怪你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14552
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9f7be009:

    # n "What was that all about anyway?"
    n "这到底是怎么一回事？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14556
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9b1b86d4:

    # "You give him a long exhale in response and let yourself drop back against the chair."
    "你长舒一口气，往后一靠，把自己摔进椅子里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14558
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_865b1d95:

    # p "If only I knew. He just... somehow sees me as the cause of some accidents that have happened."
    p "我要是知道就好了。他…他不知怎么就觉得，之前那些意外都是我害的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14562
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4fca5df9_1:

    # p "I don't know. Maybe superstition and he assumes I bring bad luck, or he assumes malice on my part."
    p "我也不知道。可能是他迷信，觉得我带衰，要么就是觉得我不安好心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14564
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f39c989d:

    # p "I wasn't even present for the last one, but somehow he still has it in for me..."
    p "上次出事的时候我根本就不在场，但他还是认准了我…"

# game/script day2.rpy:14566
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_903595e6:

    # "The painted dog turns pale while listening to you."
    "听你这么一说，那只花斑狗脸色都白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14568
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6ff70fa6:

    # n "Accidents?! Are we in danger of sinking?"
    n "意外？！我们是不是要沉了？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14570
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_579d426b:

    # p "No, I don't think so. Just some injuries and the like."
    p "不，应该没那么糟。就是受点伤什么的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14574
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_07659127:

    # n "Oh dear. Nothing serious I hope?"
    n "哎哟。没事吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14576
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_30f386fd:

    # p "No, no. They'll be fine again, nobody's in any danger."
    p "没事没事。他们会好起来的，没人有危险。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14580
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7d510bc6:

    # p "But I'm going to need some time to myself after this ordeal here, if you don't mind."
    p "要是不介意的话，经历了这档子事，我得自己静一静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14582
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ba1659fa:

    # n "That is quite alright."
    n "当然没问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14588
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ce0bd278:

    # a "Can you tell me if his account of events is accurate, sir?"
    a "先生，您能告诉我，他说的那些事，是真是假？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14592
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_597059be:

    # "The painted dog gives you a long look before answering with a sigh."
    "花斑狗盯着你看了半天，叹了口气才回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14594
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_37ddab25:

    # n "Well... by and large it is... correct."
    n "嗯… 大体上… 是真的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14596
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_cafc3b85:

    # "You see how difficult it is for the painted dog to admit to some of tellings you've burdened him with."
    "你看，让你说出这些事，他有多为难。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14598
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_428e2d39:

    # n "It... um, took me a little while to get used to this ship, sir, and Mr. [family_name] helped me through that."
    n "我…嗯，我花了点时间才适应这条船，先生，多亏了[family_name]先生帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14602
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_5e3de563:

    # "Arthur walks over to the table and picks up one of the books on it to read over the cover while he listens."
    "Arthur走到桌边，拿起一本书，翻看着封面，一边听着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14606
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7ce25e53:

    # a "I don't sense much confidence behind your words."
    a "我听不出你这话里有几分底气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14608
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_988f0934:

    # "Arthur's voice is measured, but whenever the officer slows himself down it causes you to shudder in response, feeling that it rarely is a sign of anything good."
    "Arthur的声音很平稳，但这位军官只要一放慢语速，你就会忍不住发抖，总觉得没什么好事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14610
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_dc080153:

    # "Worse, you can't even do anything. You're sure that any attempt to interrupt to right the situation would only make it worse."
    "更糟的是，你什么都做不了。你敢肯定，要是插嘴想把事情说清楚，只会越描越黑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14614
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1caff3fb:

    # "The horse turns the book over as he waits for an answer, casually inspecting the back of it."
    "那匹马翻过书，一边等他回答，一边随手翻看着封底。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14620
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ac202561:

    # n "No sir, I'm... it's just a bit embarrassing. I would have liked to make a better first impression, especially in front of someone with your experience."
    n "不是，先生，我…我就是有点难为情。我本来想给您留个好印象，尤其是在您这样有经验的人面前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14624
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_d27fdeb9:

    # a "Rest assured, you're not the only one who takes a while to get used to life on a ship."
    a "放心，不止你一个人需要时间来适应船上的生活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14626
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0da668cd:

    # a "All I care about is whether Mr. [family_name] is telling me the truth or not. None of what has been said here is going to reflect badly on you, sir."
    a "我只关心[family_name]先生有没有跟我说实话。先生，这里发生的一切都不会影响到你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14628
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_67e11b31:

    # "Nomax nods his confirmation."
    "Nomax点点头，表示肯定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14630
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_496b8ea1:

    # n "Yes, he did tell the truth."
    n "是的，他说的都是实话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14634
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ad344928:

    # a "That's' what I wanted to hear."
    a "我就想听这个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14638
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b407f04a:

    # "He taps the book against his palm before putting it back down on the table."
    "他用书拍了拍手心，然后放回桌上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14642
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_220a2793:

    # n "Are you interested in the book, sir? I would be happy to lend it to you for the remainder of the journey."
    n "先生，您对这本书有兴趣？剩下的路程我可以借给您看看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14646
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_57f556b1:

    # a "I appreciate the gesture, but no, that is not necessary. My specialty doesn't lie in the botanical field."
    a "多谢好意，不过不必了。我的专长可不在植物学上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14648
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_acacf520:

    # a "About all I know about it is that a great many trees of a very particular quality are needed for one of these."
    a "我就知道，要造船，得用好多特殊的好木材。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14652
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c32bfd23:

    # "He taps the wall of the cabin three times with the knuckle of his index finger."
    "他用食指关节敲了三下小屋的墙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14654
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_996a26d6:

    # a "Well, Mr. [family_name]. It sounds like you're telling the truth... For the moment, that is all I needed to hear."
    a "好了，[family_name]先生。听起来你说的都是实话……起码现在是这样，我暂时就想听这些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14658
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3fa1032a:

    # "He says, turning to you before dismissing you both. You rise to your feet to return a formal salute as the horse walks over to the cabin door."
    "他说完，挥手示意让我们走。你起身敬了个礼，那人骑马朝小屋门口走去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14665
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6bbe2c8a:

    # "He has to duck as he exits through it, closing the door quietly behind him, and leaving the two of you alone inside."
    "他弯着腰才出了门，轻轻把门关上，留下咱俩在屋里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14667
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_799838d7:

    # "You feel the weight lift from your shoulders as Arthur is gone, and gone in what appears to be a reasonably decent mood."
    "Arthur一走，你感觉一下子轻松了不少，而且他看起来心情还不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14671
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_e164c7b3:

    # "You sit back in the chair as the tension eases from your body. Your arms fall to either side of the chair, and you breathe deeply."
    "你往椅子上一靠，浑身都放松下来了。双手垂在椅子两边，深吸了一口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14673
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_dd5bdf78:

    # p "Thank you."
    p "谢谢你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14677
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_42b2341b:

    # n "What was that all about, if I may ask?"
    n "我能问问，这到底是唱的哪一出啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14679
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9b763991:

    # p "If only I knew. He just... somehow sees me as the cause of some accidents that have happened and thought he had to interrogate me to see if I was really staying with you earlier."
    p "我要是知道就好了。他就是……也不知道怎么回事，觉得之前出的一些事儿都是我害的，非要审问我，看看我之前是不是真的跟你在一块儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14681
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4fca5df9_2:

    # p "I don't know. Maybe superstition and he assumes I bring bad luck, or he assumes malice on my part."
    p "我也不知道。可能是他迷信，觉得我带衰，要么就是觉得我不安好心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14683
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f39c989d_1:

    # p "I wasn't even present for the last one, but somehow he still has it in for me..."
    p "上次出事的时候我根本就不在场，但他还是认准了我…"

# game/script day2.rpy:14685
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_42eb035d:

    # n "And... you thought the best way to convince him that you are telling the truth is... to make up a whole different story?"
    n "所以……你觉得让他相信你说真话的最好办法，就是瞎编一套别的说辞？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14687
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_414e7326:

    # p "I-... well, I was nervous and... Did you not see him? He's massive, he was in the military I believe, it's not easy to think straight when he's the threat looming over you."
    p "我……哎，我那是紧张嘛，而且……你又不是没看见他，那么大块头，肯定是当过兵的，往你跟前一站，谁能冷静下来啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14689
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_60d5155a:

    # p "I just felt like maybe it would help to give some additional reasons why I was needed. You know, make it sound a bit better than what it actually was."
    p "我就想着，多找点理由证明我留下来是有用的，这样听起来能好听点嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14695
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_e424e3eb:

    # p "Or did you want me to say \"Oh you know, officer, we didn't get up to much, just a bit of fondling under his tail, as you do\"?"
    p "还是你想让我说：“长官，也没干啥，就在他尾巴那儿摸来摸去的，你们懂的”？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14699
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_85137b26:

    # p "Or did you want me to say \"Oh you know, officer, just made sure that he's sitting here with a load inside of him right now\"?"
    p "还是你想让我说：“长官，我就是帮他把肚子里塞满了货”？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14701
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c2d94450:

    # p "\"If you ask nicely, he might bend over and show it to you.\""
    p "“你要是好好求求他，说不定他能弯下腰给你看看。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:14704
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2b48000e:

    # p "Or did you want me to say \"Oh, you know, officer, we didn't get much done, although he did make sure to show me his family jewels when I came in\"?"
    p "还是你想让我说：“长官，啥也没干，不过他倒是让我欣赏了一下他的那玩意儿”？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14706
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_8ac20388:

    # "Nomax averts his eyes from you, the blush under his eyes being quite noticeable."
    "Nomax不好意思地避开了你的目光，眼角的红晕特别明显。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14708
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c8b8b436:

    # n "No... I think it's best we left that out."
    n "还是别说这些了吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14710
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_8251e4af:

    # n "I just would have preferred you to have chosen some half-truths that were not quite so... awkward."
    n "我只是希望你能稍微靠谱点的瞎话，别这么……尴尬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14712
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4be4964c:

    # "You run your fingers through the fur on the back of your neck."
    "你用手指梳了梳后脖颈上的毛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14715
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_fa60e057:

    # p "Well, it was all I could think of so it was either that or having to present your ass."
    p "我也是没办法，要么这样，要么就得卖屁股了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14717
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_71b561e5:

    # p "Which I certainly wouldn't have minded, but I figured you might not want everyone to know.{w} Although, who knows, with how readily you let me have it earlier."
    p "我倒是无所谓，谁让你之前那么容易就范呢。{w}"

# game/script day2.rpy:14719
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c28fb9f8:

    # n "Oh, be quiet."
    n "行了，别出声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14721
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_bc0dc71e:

    # "There's not a hint of actual malice in those words, and they leave you playfully pushing a little further, just like before."
    "这话完全是闹着玩儿的，就跟你之前一样，轻轻推了他一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14723
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2a0326af:

    # p "What? Not enjoying the idea? He might have taken a liking to you and you'd have a repeat of what happened earlier."
    p "怎么，不喜欢这样啊？说不定他也能看上你，到时候你可就得再来一次了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14725
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_84e318e5:

    # p "You didn't complain too much about it then, if I recall correctly."
    p "我记得你当时也没少享受吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14727
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_edd56bd2:

    # n "I... ah, be quiet."
    n "我……唉，快别出声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14729
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_cd4b166f:

    # n "I think it is best if you leave for the moment."
    n "我想你最好现在离开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14731
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ab95f59b:

    # "You burst out laughing but decide not to push it any further, but you've put him through enough with this questioning and you think it's best to leave him alone."
    "你忍不住笑了出来，但还是决定不继续追问下去，你也问了他够多了，觉得还是让他一个人冷静冷静比较好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14733
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_d3ad44fb:

    # p "Fine. You're too easy to tease.{w} I'll leave you be."
    p "好吧，你太不禁逗了。{w} 我不逗你了，让你清静会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14735
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1153dc83:

    # "You get up from the chair and walk over to the door, pull it open and stand in the frame of the door for a moment."
    "你从椅子上起身，走到门口，拉开门，站在门框里，沉默片刻。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14737
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b78b7e39:

    # p "And... thank you for playing along.{w} I appreciate it."
    p "还有……谢谢你配合我演戏。{w} 我很感激。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14745
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_92bc7b10:

    # p "I'll try to remember that for the next time I'm getting questioned, I suppose."
    p "我想我下次被盘问的时候，会记住的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14747
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_8989355e:

    # "You respond with a somewhat awkward laugh which seems to ease some of Nomax's own tension."
    "你有些尴尬地笑了笑，似乎也缓解了Nomax的紧张情绪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14749
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6f74fae1:

    # n "I can well do without another round of questioning. Jeez, sometimes it almost felt like I was the one being interrogated."
    n "我可不想再来一轮盘问了。天哪，有时候感觉像是我在受审一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14751
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c06c36ee:

    # n "I am not a good liar either, so luckily there was nothing more required of me or else the whole thing would have fallen apart."
    n "我也不擅长撒谎，幸好他们没再多问什么，不然我肯定要露馅。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14753
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_78b33855:

    # n "You would have been whipped, I would have been... I do not even know, but probably something terrible,{w} like not getting any dinner tonight."
    n "你肯定要挨鞭子，至于我……我都不敢想，估计也没什么好下场，{w} 比如今晚没晚饭吃。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14755
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7ed09f3f:

    # n "In any case though, I think I have had enough excitement for the moment. Could you be so kind as to leave me alone for the moment?"
    n "总之，今天我已经够刺激的了。能不能请你暂时别来烦我？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14757
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_16fdca96:

    # "Surely you have put him under enough strain with this questioning and he deserves a bit of peace and quiet. You stand up and with typical feline quietness make your way to the cabin exit"
    "确实，你刚才问了他那么多问题，也够他受的了，是该让他好好安静一下。你站起身，像猫一样轻手轻脚地走向船舱出口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14759
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b24bc223:

    # p "I can do that much and... thank you very much for covering for me and my stupid story. I really appreciate it."
    p "我能做的就只有这些了……非常感谢你帮我圆谎，替我这个蠢故事遮掩。我真是太感谢了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14769
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9b6d6aa9:

    # n "No sir, and... to tell the truth, Mr. [family_name] has distorted his recollection of events. I don't mean to accuse him of any wrongdoing, sir, I just want to make it clear that not all of it was expressed as it should have been."
    n "不，先生，而且……说实话，[family_name]先生对事情的回忆有些偏差。我不是要指责他做错了什么，先生，我只是想说明，他说的那些话并不完全属实。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14771
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4ad44612:

    # n "I will still vouch for him being with me during the period in question, but some of his accounts put me in... quite a bad light."
    n "我还是可以担保事发当时他和我在一起，但他说的那些事把我描绘得……非常不堪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14773
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6059aa9f:

    # n "I may have had a difficult time adjusting, but it was not as much of a struggle as the recruit suggests."
    n "我可能确实有些不适应，但也没他说的那么糟糕。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14777
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_a2d0f670:

    # a "So he's not telling the truth?"
    a "这么说，他没说实话？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14781
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b407f04a_1:

    # "He taps the book against his palm before putting it back down on the table."
    "他用书拍了拍手心，然后放回桌上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14785
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_e4cddc23:

    # "You look at Nomax, trying to beg him to just let this go, and he seems to consider it for a moment, but the first words out of his mouth leave your muzzle feeling dry."
    "你看着Nomax，想求他别再追究了，他似乎也犹豫了一下，但他接下来说出口的话却让你觉得嗓子发干。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14787
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_92822a80:

    # n "He is not. At least not fully. He was with me earlier, that I can vouch for, but I did not make such a fool of myself as is being suggested."
    n "他没说实话。至少不完全是。他之前确实和我在一起，我可以作证，但我可没像他说的那么丢人现眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14791
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0fc0fca6:

    # "Arthur's eyes shift from the painted dog to you, his expression ever more serious."
    "Arthur的目光从那只画了妆的狗转向你，表情变得更加严肃。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14793
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0fca7f5f:

    # a "Mr. [family_name]? What do you have to say about it?{w} I warmly suggest that you include an apology in whatever you say next."
    a "[family_name]先生？你有什么要说的？{w} 我强烈建议你接下来要说的话里最好带上道歉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14795
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_403c8571:

    # "You sink into your seat and lower your head as you answer, realising that at this point it's probably best not to try and weasel yourself out of it any more."
    "你一下子瘫坐在座位上，垂下头回答，心想事到如今，再想狡辩也没用了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14797
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f089af5d:

    # p "My apologies, sir. I just thought that maybe it would reflect better on me. It has been a bit difficult for me to feel as though I have been targeted in this way."
    p "对不起，先生。我只是觉得，也许那样能让我脸上好看点。我总觉得他们好像都在针对我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14799
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_afd07bb0:

    # p "And I figured that maybe I could stay things by putting a few flourishes onto the description of today's events..."
    p "我就想着，也许我可以稍微添油加醋地描述一下今天发生的事情，这样就能蒙混过关……"

# game/script day2.rpy:14803
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_10b15480:

    # p "I realize I shouldn't have done that, and for that you have my sincere apologies."
    p "我知道我不该那么做，我真诚地向您道歉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14805
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_44db67b5:

    # p "Although, as you heard from the gentleman, I was with him in the end, albeit under slightly different circumstances."
    p "不过，正如您刚才听到的，我最后还是和他在一起的，虽然情况有些出入。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14807
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ddc547b5:

    # "You shift where you're sitting as a feeling of unease creeps up on you, your tail hugging around your legs."
    "你不安地动了动身子，尾巴也蜷起来抱住了双腿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14809
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_73e6e0a0:

    # a "You've done yourself no favor today, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "[family_name]先生，你今天可真是帮了倒忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14811
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_e2091322:

    # a "Why you felt the need to lie to me I do not know yet, but I will find it out."
    a "我还不知道你为什么要对我撒谎，但我一定会查清楚的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14813
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_49477a2e:

    # a "For now though, luck is on your side..."
    a "不过现在，你走运了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:14815
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0a33f364:

    # a "You are dismissed."
    a "你被解雇了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14827
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7b31e320:

    # a "Can you confirm if his version of events is true, sir?"
    a "长官，您能确认他说的是不是真的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14829
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_5cb9c50c:

    # "The painted dog shoots you a quick glance before answering."
    "那只彩绘犬飞快地看了你一眼，然后回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14833
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b44a2ce6:

    # n "Uhm, yes, Officer. As far as I can tell, his events correspond to what I remember.{w} With a flourish or two, perhaps, but who is not a little overzealous on the first day of such a big change in their life?"
    n "嗯，是的，长官。就我所知，他的说法和我记忆中的一致。{w} 也许是略有夸张，不过，谁在人生迎来重大转折的第一天，不会有点激动呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14837
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b4d38d58:

    # "Arthur walks over to the table and picks up one of the books on it to read over the cover."
    "Arthur走到桌边，拿起一本书，低头看着封面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14841
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0a4f6a22:

    # a "That sounds to me like he wasn't being truthful."
    a "我怎么听着，他好像没说实话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14845
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_988f0934_1:

    # "Arthur's voice is measured, but whenever the officer slows himself down it causes you to shudder in response, feeling that it rarely is a sign of anything good."
    "Arthur的声音很平稳，但这位军官只要一放慢语速，你就会忍不住发抖，总觉得没什么好事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14847
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_dc080153_1:

    # "Worse, you can't even do anything. You're sure that any attempt to interrupt to right the situation would only make it worse."
    "更糟的是，你什么都做不了。你敢肯定，要是插嘴想把事情说清楚，只会越描越黑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14851
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_adc6a75b:

    # "No...{w} You had to hope that Nomax wouldn't mess it up."
    "不……{w} 真希望Nomax别把事情搞砸了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14853
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b3d5fb46:

    # n "No, no, officer. By no means am I suggesting that! He was telling the truth, I was just saying that... uh... He may have put it in a more positive light by not mentioning our singing, yes!"
    n "不不，长官！我可不是那个意思！他说的都是实话，我只是觉得……呃……他可能没提我们唱歌的事儿，把事情往好的方面说了，对，是这样！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14859
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2fe5bfb2:

    # "The painted dog laughs, the tinge of nervousness rather obvious in it."
    "那只彩绘犬笑了，但明眼人都能听出他语气里的紧张。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14863
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_38ec841f:

    # n "We make for an awful, awful duet. Just a terrible day to have these, you know, heh."
    n "我们俩唱得那叫一个难听，真是倒了血霉了，赶上这事儿，您说是不是，嘿嘿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14865
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_d3bc78b9:

    # "He reaches up to his head to wiggle one of his ears in demonstration."
    "演示似的，他抬手晃了晃自己的一只耳朵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14867
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2b9c38d6:

    # n "But fortunately I will not be singing any shanties with the crew now, I do not think. So you will be spared that particular agony."
    n "不过，幸运的是，我想我不会再和船员唱什么海歌了。所以您就不用再遭那份罪了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14869
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_09c93bad:

    # p "My bad, sir. Yes I'd forgotten to mention it. It was so unpleasant that I must have already been doing my best to block it out of my mind."
    p "怪我，长官。对，我忘了说了。那感觉太糟糕了，我肯定是一直在努力把它从脑子里抹掉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14871
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_aed62806:

    # "With Arthur still having the book at hand, Nomax swiftly attempts to switch the subject."
    "Arthur还拿着书，Nomax赶紧岔开话题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14875
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_220a2793_1:

    # n "Are you interested in the book, sir? I would be happy to lend it to you for the remainder of the journey."
    n "先生，您对这本书有兴趣？剩下的路程我可以借给您看看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14881
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1913fd30:

    # "Arthur shakes his head and places it back where he got it."
    "Arthur摇摇头，把书放回原处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14883
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_57f556b1_1:

    # a "I appreciate the gesture, but no, that is not necessary. My specialty doesn't lie in the botanical field."
    a "多谢好意，不过不必了。我的专长可不在植物学上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14885
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_acacf520_1:

    # a "About all I know about it is that a great many trees of a very particular quality are needed for one of these."
    a "我就知道，要造船，得用好多特殊的好木材。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14890
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c32bfd23_1:

    # "He taps the wall of the cabin three times with the knuckle of his index finger."
    "他用食指关节敲了三下小屋的墙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14894
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7bbb2a5d:

    # n "All the more reason to read into it, I say. Maybe it'd dee-"
    n "我觉得啊，咱们更得好好查查。说不定它能..."

# game/script day2.rpy:14898
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c05ca2c9:

    # a "What I would much rather have is a rendition of the song the gentlemen sang."
    a "比起这个，我倒是更想听听两位唱的那首歌。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14900
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_01f42dbd:

    # n "I'm sorry wha-?"
    n "你说啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14902
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_35640559:

    # a "The song, let's hear it."
    a "唱来听听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14904
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7aa8bcb7:

    # p "Er, is this still part of the investigation?"
    p "呃，这还算调查的一部分吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14906
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ec97f77c:

    # a "It is not, this is just for my personal amusement."
    a "不算，我就是想找点乐子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14908
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6dd9c3ed:

    # a "I can hardly turn you two down when you're practically advertising it as the worst singing on this mother earth."
    a "你们都说这是全天下最难听的歌了，我哪好意思不给面子啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14912
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2e2849a5:

    # "You shoot a frown at Nomax, who returns a disarming smile as an apology for getting you into this mess."
    "你皱着眉头瞪了Nomax一眼，他连忙露出一个笑容，想缓和一下气氛，毕竟是你把他拉下水的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14914
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_070f079c:

    # "What song do you even remember the lyrics of? And not just that, but what songs does {i}he{/i} know?!"
    "你还记得啥歌词啊？再说了，{i}他{/i}又会唱啥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14918
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_08707e8a:

    # "You can't believe that after all these questions, the final test appears to be... this."
    "问了这么多问题，你万万没想到，最后的考验竟然是……唱歌。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14920
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_8dd753e8:

    # "You rack your brain to try and imagine what songs someone like him might know."
    "你绞尽脑汁，心想他那种人，到底会唱啥歌啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14922
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_63ede768:

    # p "Oh, er, we sang a few, we could do The Rigs O' Barleeeey?"
    p "哦，呃，我们唱了好几首呢，要不来一首《大麦穗》？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14924
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_d38551b0:

    # "You say, dragging out the end of the sentence as long as you can manage to waste some time, looking over at him to see if he shows any sign of recognizing it."
    "你故意拖长了声音，想拖延点时间，一边说一边偷偷观察他，看他听没听出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14926
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_d0d83340:

    # p "Ooooor uhm, Black-eyed Susan?"
    p "或者……嗯，《黑眼苏珊》？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14930
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_723927ec:

    # "The lights appear to turn on in the painted dog's head as he realizes what you're doing, and he quickly butts in."
    "那只彩绘犬一听，立马明白了你的意思，赶紧插嘴道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14932
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2de013a8:

    # n "Oh, oh, oh! Erm, The Rigs O' Barley! I enjoyed that one."
    n "哦，哦，哦！ 嗯，《大麦地的钻机》！我喜欢这首！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14934
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_376cff0b:

    # "You quietly thank the Lord that he knows one of them and start to lead the two of you into it."
    "你暗自感谢老天，他还记得这首歌，赶紧带着他一块儿吊嗓子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14936
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_66484de6:

    # p "{i}Iiiit was upon a Lammas night,{/i}"
    p "{i}那是在拉马斯节的夜晚，{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:14941
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3a9f96ac:

    # n "{i}When corn rigs are bonie,{/i}"
    n "{i}当玉米田变得美丽，{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:14943
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7fae79b6:

    # p "{i}Beneath the moon's unclouded light,{/i}"
    p "{i}在月亮无云的照耀下，{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:14945
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_d4110f84:

    # n "{i}I held awa to Annie,{/i}"
    n "{i}我奔向了安妮，{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:14947
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_41c3cf92:

    # "You two truly are sounding as awful as previously advertised."
    "你们俩唱得真是名副其实的难听啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14949
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_57997001:

    # "It's like listening to two geese being strangled."
    "简直像在听两只鹅被活活掐死。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14951
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9a0f062b:

    # "Like a rusty door hinge in a storm."
    "就像暴风雨里锈迹斑斑的门轴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14953
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7af69c91:

    # "Like a trombone played by a hiccuping penguin."
    "就像一只打嗝的企鹅在吹长号。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14955
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_c1710169:

    # "Like a flock of seagulls taking yodelling lessons from a mountain goat."
    "就像一群海鸥在跟山羊学约德尔唱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14957
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_edf6334c:

    # "Ahem...{w} Anyway..."
    "咳咳……{w} 算了，不提了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:14959
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1a36a183:

    # "Okay, one more."
    "行吧，最后来一个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14961
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_493ce02e:

    # "Like a symphony of cats, with their tails tied together, while they are surrounded by heaps of tuna just out of reach."
    "就像一群尾巴被绑在一起的猫，周围还堆满了它们怎么也够不着的金枪鱼罐头，发出的交响曲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14963
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_12e1e21d:

    # "But no matter how awful it sounds, you end up getting into the rhythm, swinging your arm to guide yourself as best you can. Although, it didn't make the actual sounds you were making any better."
    "不过，不管你们唱得有多难听，最后我还是被你们带跑偏了，跟着你们一起挥胳膊找调。虽然吧，你们的歌声依旧那么刺耳。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14967
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b8d78e90:

    # n "{i}Tho' three times doubl'd fairly,{/i}"
    n "{i}即使三倍再三倍，{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:14969
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_5426ed31:

    # p "{i}That happy night was worth them a',{/i}"
    p "{i}那快乐的夜晚也值了，{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:14971
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_76d7e15e:

    # n "{i}Amaaaaang the rigs o' barleeeeeey...{/i}"
    n "{i}在……大麦田里……{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:14973
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_662eec23:

    # "Much to the amusement of Arthur, by the looks of it, who even cracks a smile despite his usually serious demeanor."
    "看Arthur那样子，乐得不轻，平时那么严肃的人，都咧嘴笑了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14977
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f3df09da:

    # a "Goodness gracious, both of you truly are dreadful at singing."
    a "我的老天，你们俩唱歌是真要命啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:14979
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_2523c88b:

    # a "I've heard the death rattle of many a chicken coming from the throats of my men, but I don't think there was a single note that you hit between the two of you."
    a "我听过不少弟兄们咽气儿前的动静，可你们俩是一个调都没找着啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14981
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_0c8bd3c5:

    # a "Quite astonishing."
    a "真是开了眼了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14983
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_09a3328e:

    # a "Very well, I've heard enough. It sounds like for the most part he was telling the truth about being with you earlier, you two are dismissed."
    a "行了行了，我听够了。 听起来，他之前说和你们在一块儿的事儿，八成是真的。你们可以走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14989
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_8df3a58b:

    # "He finds the side of the wooden door and pulls it open. Without much ceremony he steps out of the cabin and leaves you both alone in it."
    "他摸到木门边，一把拉开门。 也没什么客套，直接就走出了船舱，把你们俩扔在了里面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14991
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_a236315a:

    # "You feel the weight lift from your shoulders once Arthur is gone, and gone in what appears to be a reasonably decent mood."
    "Arthur一走，你顿时觉得肩上的担子轻了下来，而且看样子他走的时候心情还不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14993
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9e8566f5:

    # "You drop your head into your hands and breathe a long sigh of relief before you look back up at Nomax."
    "你一下子把头埋进手里，长舒了一口气，这才抬起头看向Nomax。"

# game/script day2.rpy:14997
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_07cc20b9:

    # p "Singing? Really?"
    p "唱歌？ 真的假的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:14999
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4dc4cf13:

    # "He reaches up to scratch the fur on the back of his neck."
    "他抬手挠了挠后脖颈。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15001
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_eaaab123:

    # n "I am sorry, I am not a very good liar, nor am I very good at making up stories like that.{w} I just went with the first thing that came to mind."
    n "对不住啊，我不擅长撒谎，也不会瞎编故事。{w} 我就是当时脑子里蹦出来什么就说什么了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15003
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_70066977:

    # p "How is {i}that{/i} the first thing that came to your mind?"
    p "{i}这{/i}是怎么变成你第一反应的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15007
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3402cd16:

    # n "I just told you, I was nervous and am not a good liar. I do not know why it popped into my head, it just did, and I blurted it out because it was all I had."
    n "我不是跟你说了嘛，我紧张死了，又不擅长撒谎。我也不知道怎么的，就突然冒出这个念头，脑子一热就秃噜出来了，当时实在没别的辙了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15009
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_cd8789c9:

    # p "Fine... Fine... At least you knew Rigs O' Barley. That saved us."
    p "好吧……好吧……好在你还懂得《麦田里的嬉闹》，这首曲子可真救了咱们的大急。"
    # 译注：《Rigs O' Barley》为苏格兰诗人罗伯特·彭斯著名民歌《麦田里的嬉闹》。

# game/script day2.rpy:15011
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_31954e4a:

    # n "Do I at least get a thank you?"
    n "好歹也该跟我说声谢谢吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15015
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ca954fb7:

    # p "A thank you?! I just had to sing like I'm a dying cat in front of my officer!"
    p "谢你？！我刚才都得在长官面前像杀鸡一样嚎了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:15017
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_da57a470:

    # p "I think that cancels out any thanks you might have received."
    p "我觉得你那破锣嗓子早就把可能有的感谢都抵消了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15021
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_07feb951:

    # p "Well... thank you."
    p "行吧... 谢啦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15025
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9f7be009_1:

    # n "What was that all about anyway?"
    n "这到底是怎么一回事？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15029
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f784318a:

    # "You give him a long exhale in response and let yourself drop back into the chair."
    "你长叹一口气，算是回应，然后把自己扔回椅子里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15031
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_865b1d95_1:

    # p "If only I knew. He just... somehow sees me as the cause of some accidents that have happened."
    p "我要是知道就好了。他…他不知怎么就觉得，之前那些意外都是我害的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15035
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4fca5df9_3:

    # p "I don't know. Maybe superstition and he assumes I bring bad luck, or he assumes malice on my part."
    p "我也不知道。可能是他迷信，觉得我带衰，要么就是觉得我不安好心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15037
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f39c989d_2:

    # p "I wasn't even present for the last one, but somehow he still has it in for me..."
    p "上次出事的时候我根本就不在场，但他还是认准了我…"

# game/script day2.rpy:15039
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_903595e6_1:

    # "The painted dog turns pale while listening to you."
    "听你这么一说，那只花斑狗脸色都白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15041
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6ff70fa6_1:

    # n "Accidents?! Are we in danger of sinking?"
    n "意外？！我们是不是要沉了？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:15043
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_579d426b_1:

    # p "No, I don't think so. Just some injuries and the like."
    p "不，应该没那么糟。就是受点伤什么的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15047
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_07659127_1:

    # n "Oh dear. Nothing serious I hope?"
    n "哎哟。没事吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15049
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_841173ab:

    # p "No, no. They'll be fine again, nobody's in any danger, don't worry."
    p "没事没事。他们不会有事的，没人会有危险，放心吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15053
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7d510bc6_1:

    # p "But I'm going to need some time to myself after this ordeal here, if you don't mind."
    p "要是不介意的话，经历了这档子事，我得自己静一静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15057
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ac8f6fdf:

    # "You get out of the chair and walk over to the cabin door with typical feline-like softness to your steps."
    "你从椅子上起身，像猫一样轻手轻脚地走到船舱门口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15059
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_29361234:

    # n "Uh, of course, I understand. Your officer seems... intense. I wasn't even accused of anything and I still feel weak in the legs."
    n "嗯，当然，我明白。你们长官... 气场真够强的。我啥也没干都觉得腿软。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15061
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_db4d8eb7:

    # p "That he is... Believe me, it's taken some getting used to. Thank you again."
    p "可不是么... 跟你说，我可是花了好长时间才适应的。再次感谢你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15065
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1b434f4d:

    # "Though before you can leave through the door you hear Nomax raise his voice in the familiar melody."
    "结果你还没走到门口，就听到Nomax扯着嗓子开始唱那熟悉的调调。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15067
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_04d7321d:

    # n "{i}Thooooo' three times doubl'd fairly{/i}"
    n "{i}Thooooo' three times doubl'd fairly{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:15069
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_282c50d8:

    # "Your eyes narrow as you look back at him, a second passes, then another one with the canid looking back at you expectedly."
    "你眯起眼睛回头看他，一秒，两秒... 那只狗狗眼巴巴地望着你，就等你接茬儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15071
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_28ae3cff:

    # "You sigh and humor him, taking a breath and joining in for the end of the song once more."
    "你叹了口气，还是顺着他，深吸一口气，再次加入合唱，把最后一句唱完。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15073
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_5426ed31_1:

    # p "{i}That happy night was worth them a',{/i}"
    p "{i}那快乐的夜晚也值了，{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:15075
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_b0eb0777:

    # n "{i}Amang the rigs o' barley!{/i}"
    n "{i}Amang the rigs o' barley!{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:15079
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f0454c2c:

    # "Whatever tension is left in you is gone in an instant as you erupt in a laugh and Nomax joins shortly afterwards."
    "你身上残留的紧张感瞬间烟消云散，忍不住哈哈大笑起来，Nomax也紧跟着加入了笑声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15081
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_600f4ddb:

    # p "God damn it. Singing! Singing of all things!"
    p "真是见了鬼了。唱歌！竟然要靠唱歌来过关！"

# game/script day2.rpy:15083
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_afdcd8a5:

    # p "You're a bloody idiot!"
    p "你真是个蠢货！"

# game/script day2.rpy:15085
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_5df4305f:

    # n "See? That was not that bad. Just go already. I will see you later, but try not to drag me into any more interrogations, will you?"
    n "怎么样？没那么难吧。赶紧滚吧。回头见，不过你可千万别再把我扯进什么审讯里了，听到没？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15089
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1599b069:

    # "You pull open the door and feel the slightly less stuffy air of the upper deck wash over you."
    "你拉开门，一股稍微没那么闷热的上层甲板空气扑面而来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15091
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_884de0b5:

    # p "I'll try. Thanks again."
    p "我尽量。再次感谢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15103
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ce0bd278_1:

    # a "Can you tell me if his account of events is accurate, sir?"
    a "先生，您能告诉我，他说的那些事，是真是假？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15105
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_52e39f19:

    # n "Mr. [family_name] is telling the truth, Officer. His retelling is pretty much exactly as I remember it."
    n "报告长官，[family_name]先生说的是实话。他说的跟我记得的几乎一模一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15107
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f9a7eeec:

    # "Nomax replies with a nod to emphasize his agreement."
    "Nomax点点头，表示赞同。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15109
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_a4043091:

    # "Arthur waits with a thoughtful hum as he considers the retelling once again, bringing his hand up to scratch an itch at the side of his nose."
    "Arthur若有所思地哼了一声，再次回味着刚才的讲述，抬手挠了挠鼻尖。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15111
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_d58e3212:

    # a "And he didn't leave the cabin at any point?"
    a "他在任何时候都没离开过舱室吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15113
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_94721c7d:

    # n "No, sir. Only once he was called to help by a Lynx fella. Erm, he had a beard, a little on the stocky side, a bit older."
    n "没有，长官。只有一次，他被一个Lynx fella叫去帮忙了。嗯... 那人有胡子，有点壮，年纪也稍微大点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15115
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_a737c22d:

    # a "I see... Thank you for your assistance."
    a "我明白了... 感谢您的协助。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15117
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3316fb48:

    # n "Any time, sir."
    n "随时为您效劳，长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15121
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_32d913a4:

    # "The horse takes a step towards you and with a flick of his wrist tells you to get up from the chair. You obey the command under the creaking sound of the chair as it is released from your weight."
    "那位军官朝你走了一步，手腕一抖，示意你从椅子上起来。你只好服从命令，椅子因为卸下了你的重量，发出了一阵吱嘎声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15125
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_90a02941:

    # a "I've heard what I needed to hear, Mr. [family_name]. You're dismissed."
    a "我已经听完了，[family_name]先生。你可以走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15129
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_a53f3685:

    # "You shift uncomfortably and salute Arthur as he walks back to the door of the cramped cabin."
    "你局促不安地动了动，向Arthur敬了个礼，他转身走回狭窄的房间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15133
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7310e340:

    # p "Sir..."
    p "先生……"

# game/script day2.rpy:15137
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_ae2b23c2:

    # "He stops as you call him, the door pulled wide open."
    "你叫住了他，Arthur停下脚步，门敞开着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15139
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_16018b62:

    # a "Yes, Mr. [family_name]?"
    a "[family_name]先生，还有什么事吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15141
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6dba5f32:

    # p "I hope my honesty here will dispel any assumption that I am out to cause trouble on this ship."
    p "我希望我的坦诚能打消您认为我会在船上惹麻烦的顾虑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15145
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_efbbad4c:

    # "Arthur doesn't answer, he doesn't even look at you, instead all you get in response is a brief twitch of his lips, after which he exits the cabin with the door left slightly ajar."
    "Arthur没有回答，甚至没看你一眼，只是嘴角微微抽动了一下，就离开了房间，门虚掩着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15151
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_3b0d90b0:

    # "You feel the tension leaves your body once Arthur left the room and let yourself sit back down into the chair."
    "Arthur离开后，你如释重负地坐回椅子上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15153
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9f7be009_2:

    # n "What was that all about anyway?"
    n "这到底是怎么一回事？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15155
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_e52e2340:

    # "You give him a long exhale in response before you speak."
    "你长舒一口气，这才开口："

# game/script day2.rpy:15157
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_865b1d95_2:

    # p "If only I knew. He just... somehow sees me as the cause of some accidents that have happened."
    p "我要是知道就好了。他…他不知怎么就觉得，之前那些意外都是我害的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15161
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_4fca5df9_4:

    # p "I don't know. Maybe superstition and he assumes I bring bad luck, or he assumes malice on my part."
    p "我也不知道。可能是他迷信，觉得我带衰，要么就是觉得我不安好心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15163
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f39c989d_3:

    # p "I wasn't even present for the last one, but somehow he still has it in for me..."
    p "上次出事的时候我根本就不在场，但他还是认准了我…"

# game/script day2.rpy:15165
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_903595e6_2:

    # "The painted dog turns pale while listening to you."
    "听你这么一说，那只花斑狗脸色都白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15167
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_6ff70fa6_2:

    # n "Accidents?! Are we in danger of sinking?"
    n "意外？！我们是不是要沉了？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:15169
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_579d426b_2:

    # p "No, I don't think so. Just some injuries and the like."
    p "不，应该没那么糟。就是受点伤什么的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15173
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_07659127_2:

    # n "Oh dear. Nothing serious I hope?"
    n "哎哟。没事吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15175
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_841173ab_1:

    # p "No, no. They'll be fine again, nobody's in any danger, don't worry."
    p "没事没事。他们不会有事的，没人会有危险，放心吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15179
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_7d510bc6_2:

    # p "But I'm going to need some time to myself after this ordeal here, if you don't mind."
    p "要是不介意的话，经历了这档子事，我得自己静一静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15181
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_f51df798:

    # n "Uh, sure, sure. I can imagine that it's been stressful. He seems like an intense guy, I do not envy you."
    n "呃，那是，那是。我能想象到你压力山大。他看起来挺吓人的，我可不羡慕你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15185
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_1cde1949:

    # "You stand up from the chair and walk over to the cabin door, pausing in the doorway you turn around again."
    "你从椅子上站起身，走到门口，停下脚步，又转过身来："

# game/script day2.rpy:15187
translate Chinese day2_nomax_afterquestions_9894f558:

    # p "Thank you. For your help I mean."
    p "谢谢你。谢谢你的帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15216
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_138196bd:

    # "The day passes without much excitement. As the time runs down on the current shift you soon find yourself called up to work again, feeling at least a tinge more confident now as you and the others end up helping with other tasks."
    "这一天平静无波地过去了。时间飞逝，轮班结束，你又被叫去帮忙，这次你感觉自信了不少。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15218
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_b9e7c0e6:

    # "And just like the morning shift, that next shift would be rung out as well and before long you find yourself in the evening hours of the day, leaving you to wonder what to do this evening."
    "和早班一样，很快又到了傍晚，你开始琢磨着晚上该做点什么。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15220
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_dfae2c07:

    # "Or if you should even do anything at all or simply head to bed?"
    "还是说，什么都别做，直接睡觉？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15255
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_e81b178c:

    # "As work comes to a halt you wave off Wolf as your group of sailors lets the others take over. You pull Julian aside, telling him you'd like to take him up on his invitation."
    "收工后，你和Wolf挥手告别，让其他水手接班。你把Julian拉到一边，说想接受他的邀请。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15257
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_f77c8f1a:

    # "The lizard smiles brightly, then it shifts into a suggestive little smirk as he leans into you."
    "Julian灿烂一笑，随即换上一个暗示意味浓厚的得意表情，凑近你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15264
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_f06634da:

    # "It seems with Wolf gone, he feels he's regained his ability to speak:"
    "Wolf一走，Julian似乎就恢复了滔滔不绝的本性："

# game/script day2.rpy:15266
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_90ffef82:

    # j "Oh, you want to get some quiet time together? I just knew you couldn't get enough of me."
    j "哦？想和我单独待会儿？我就知道你离不开我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15268
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_e8f3fffa:

    # p "Don't make me change my mind immediately."
    p "别逼我反悔。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15271
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_80d5bb78:

    # "He turns around with a little twirl, swaying his tail behind him with an inviting sensuality."
    "他转了个圈，骚气地扭动着尾巴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15273
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_8e52e96c:

    # j "Oh, come on... As if you could give {i}this{/i} up."
    j "别装了……你舍得放弃{i}我{/i} ？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15275
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_f18f0740:

    # "You roll your eyes, smiling."
    "你翻了个白眼，笑了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15279
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_4f57084d:

    # p "You should have stayed silent."
    p "你还是闭嘴吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15283
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_fcd038f1:

    # p "I'm just doing it because it's the only thing that will stop you from talking."
    p "我只是想让你闭嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15287
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_792d793f:

    # "Julian turns back to you, holding a hand over his chest and his mouth open with a gasp in mock offense."
    "Julian夸张地捂住胸口，张大嘴，假装受伤。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15289
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_12cb0e1b:

    # j "You are so rude, [name]! Don't tell me you're taking after Wolf and becoming some sort of... crass brute!"
    j "你太没礼貌了，[name]！别告诉我你跟Wolf学坏了，要变成……粗人？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15293
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_34c45057:

    # p "I'm definitely sympathizing with him."
    p "我开始同情Wolf了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15298
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_c4d4b9bd:

    # "The lizard makes a show of rolling his eyes."
    "Julian又翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15300
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_0976c8d8:

    # j "Don't you forget you owe me what happened between you and the passenger, too. You can't renege on that. We live in a society!"
    j "你还欠我关于那个乘客的事儿呢，不许赖账。我们可是生活在社会里的人！"

# game/script day2.rpy:15302
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_8195d372:

    # p "Society? What's that? I thought I was becoming a barbarian brute like Wolf."
    p "社会？那是什么？我还以为我也会像 Wolf 那家伙一样，变成一个粗野的蛮汉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15310
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_503a57a3:

    # j "Forget about Wolf though, what about that passenger you met up with earlier?"
    j "先别管 Wolf 了，之前你遇到的那个家伙呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15312
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_49700793:

    # "Your ears perk up as he brings up Nomax and steps a little closer to you."
    "当他提起 Nomax，还凑近了点，你立刻来了精神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15314
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_11bd6b3c:

    # p "What about him?"
    p "他怎么了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15318
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_10da8469:

    # j "Oh come on. It's the first day of your grand sailing adventure that you've been looking forward to, you finally get to work on a ship like you wanted, and the first thing you do is skirt your duties?"
    j "别开玩笑了。这可是你盼星星盼月亮才盼来的第一次航海冒险，你终于能如愿以偿地在船上干活了，结果你倒好，第一件事就是开溜？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15320
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_046e6a7b:

    # j "You clearly had something in mind when you went to him."
    j "你去找他的时候，肯定在打什么鬼主意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15322
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_a99b13af:

    # j "And I'd say we're getting along pretty well, don't you think?"
    j "我觉得咱俩挺合得来啊，你说是不是？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15324
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_0f790771:

    # p "That sounds like you want me to spill some beans."
    p "听你这意思，是想让我爆点料啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15328
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_23b0dd67:

    # "He theatrically gives a wave of his hand before he leans in even closer."
    "他故作夸张地挥了下手，然后凑得更近了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15332
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_f1f6d1c2:

    # j "So there {i}are{/i} beans to spill."
    j "看来{i}还真{/i}有料可以爆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15334
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_d2ed8dcf:

    # p "That's not what I-...{w} Fine, when we're in a quieter place.{w} But just because it's you."
    p "我不是...哎，{w}好吧，等到了安静的地方再说。{w} 只是看在你的面子上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15338
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_8d220281:

    # "The grin on Julians face is about as wide as it could get and he nods excitedly in return."
    "Julian 脸上乐开了花，兴奋地直点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15343
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_04537e79:

    # j "I knew it!"
    j "我就知道你能行！"

# game/script day2.rpy:15349
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_ace126d7:

    # "You both laugh. Julian then wraps an arm around your shoulders to pull you towards the deck below."
    "你们都笑了。Julian 搂着你的肩膀，把你往下面的甲板上拉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15356
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_45df8039:

    # "You're still not used to the transition from the deck to below. The sound of rolling waves, the hustling and bustling of the crew, the ripple of sails, and the tension of ropes dominates above. There's a breeze that brings the scent of salt to your nose and a constant horizon that keeps you steady."
    "你还是不太习惯从甲板到船舱的转换。在甲板上，是海浪的拍击声，水手们的吆喝，风帆的鼓动，还有绳索绷紧的声音。带着咸味的海风一个劲儿地往你鼻子里钻，一望无际的海平面让你心里踏实。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15358
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_6561635e:

    # "Below, the creaking of wood replaces all other noise. The abundant sunlight is snuffed away and the salty sea breeze is tempered by a hint of stagnation, of the other people around you, old clothes and fur and bodies."
    "到了船舱里，木头吱吱呀呀的声音就盖过了一切。外面的阳光被隔绝，带着咸味的海风也变得有些沉闷，还混杂着汗臭味、旧衣服和动物皮毛的味道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15360
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_badc08aa:

    # "It's not as bad as you would have thought just a few days ago, but it's unique and intense. The sea packs everything tightly together, a bobbing little warehouse on the waves. It's mundane, but still an adventure to you, nothing you've ever seen before. Certainly not another boring harvest day."
    "其实也没你几天前想的那么糟糕，但也算得上是独一份的体验。大海就像一个漂浮的百宝箱，把所有东西都紧紧地塞在了一起。虽然有点平淡，但对你来说仍然是一场冒险，是你以前从未见过的景象。肯定比那些无聊的收割日强多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15362
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_67c1d3ae:

    # "You see the members of your watch trying to relax and pass them by. Makes you remember just how many people are on the {i}Conway{/i}."
    "你看到那些值班的水手们正抓紧时间休息，然后从他们身边走过。这让你想起来，{i}Conway号{/i}号上的人还真不少。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15372
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_374e6b5c:

    # "While you're lost in thought, you realize Julian is leading you to the next deck down. The light becomes even fainter here, enough that he grabs a lantern along the way down, and the beating of waves against the hull is much louder."
    "你正想着，Julian 已经带着你来到了更下面的甲板。这里的光线更暗了，他顺手拿起一盏灯笼，海浪拍打船体的声音也更大了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15374
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_fb291c6e:

    # "It's strange, but in a slightly thrilling way, like when you're a kid and running around in your house in the dark."
    "这感觉有点怪，但又有点刺激，就像小时候在黑灯瞎火的房子里探险一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15376
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_93be4736:

    # p "Where are you taking me, anyway, Jules?"
    p "你到底要带我去哪儿啊，Jules？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15378
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_a7655034:

    # j "Just follow me. I'll tell you more when we're there, alright?"
    j "跟我来就知道了。到了地方我再跟你细说，行不行？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15380
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_5eeb8626:

    # "You pass by fewer people. You wonder if someone will stop you and ask why you're down here, but no one does."
    "路上碰到的人越来越少。你心里嘀咕着会不会有人跳出来问你们来这儿干什么，结果一个都没有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15382
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_73c69150:

    # "After turning a few corners, Julian leads you up to a small room. He holds the door open for you and gestures for you to go inside with the lantern, smiling all the while."
    "绕过几个弯之后，Julian 带你到一个小房间门口。他笑眯眯地扶着门，示意你拿着灯笼先进去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15393
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_6f10ba80:

    # "Julian follows you inside, closing the door behind you. The lantern allows you to see that the narrow room is almost entirely filled by two huge racks on either side with a few straggler crates in the corners."
    "Julian 也跟着走了进来，随手关上了门。借着灯笼的光，你能看到这狭小的房间里几乎堆满了东西，两边是巨大的帆布架，角落里还有几个零星的箱子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15395
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_8f309081:

    # "Each rack has three levels of storage with multiple slats, evenly spaced, with an occasional missing one. Inside are what look like big bundles of cloth."
    "每个架子都有三层，上面隔着几根木条，有的已经掉了。里面放的好像是一捆捆巨大的帆布。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15397
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_32d1953a:

    # j "The sail room."
    j "这是帆布储藏室。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15399
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_38683ab3:

    # "Julian suddenly speaks up, answering your unspoken question."
    "Julian 突然开了口，回答了你没问出口的问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15401
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_f6a6c3ab:

    # j "Well, the secondary one, anyway. Keeps all the sails dry."
    j "嗯，是备用的。专门用来存放干燥的帆布。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15403
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_99832de8:

    # "You turn back to the lizard and give him a little smile."
    "你转头冲着那蜥蜴笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15405
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_8f6d7eaf:

    # p "You're such a know-it-all. I didn't even ask."
    p "你真是个万事通-it-。 我又没问你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15409
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_f7817d4c:

    # "You remember Wolf's wager from earlier... You could have a bit of fun with Julian here."
    "你还记得 Wolf 之前打的赌吗…… 你可以拿 Julian 寻开心了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15422
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_2317a6cb:

    # p "And weren't you supposed to keep quiet for the rest of the day?"
    p "而且，你今天剩下的时间不是应该闭嘴吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15426
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_d2c4bfdb:

    # "Julian gives you a look, then realizes what you're doing and groans."
    "Julian 看了你一眼，随即明白你的意图，发出一声哀嚎。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15430
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_28278555:

    # j "Oh, come on, you can't be serious..."
    j "喔，别这样，你不是来真的吧……"

# game/script day2.rpy:15432
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_a1db4d23:

    # p "An agreement is an agreement, Julian. You can't just lose a wager and then skimp out on it! Honor is what separates us from animals."
    p "说定了就是说定了，Julian。 输了想耍赖可不行！ 荣誉是人与禽兽的区别。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15434
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_c84b9e94:

    # "You give Julian your best teasing grin. He crosses his arms, glaring and frowning intensely at you, but doesn't speak."
    "你朝 Julian 露出一个促狭的笑容。 他抱着胳膊，狠狠地瞪着你，眉头紧锁，但一言不发。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15436
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_5036c0df:

    # p "That's right. Now, where were we?"
    p "这就对了。 咱们刚刚说到哪儿了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15440
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_60d4ab88:

    # "The lizard sighs as he sets down the lantern."
    "蜥蜴放下灯笼，叹了口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15444
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_4914367b:

    # "You decide not to bring it up. After all, you're here to learn some very important lessons."
    "你决定还是别提了。 毕竟，你来这是为了学习重要的知识。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15448
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_214998f2:

    # j "I could tell you were curious, though! After all, isn't that why you're here?"
    j "我早就看出你很好奇了！ 毕竟，你来这儿不就是为了这个吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15450
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_b2ba544f:

    # "He runs his free hand from his thigh to his stomach."
    "他空着一只手，从大腿一路摸到肚子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15454
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_e3fe6375:

    # j "An {i}anatomy{/i} lesson?"
    j "来一堂 {i}解剖{/i} 课？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15456
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_65a055e4:

    # "You laugh, holding your hand to your face and shaking your head."
    "你笑了出来，不好意思地捂住脸，摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15460
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_4c7213da:

    # j "Hey, don't laugh. You're the one this worked on, after all."
    j "嘿，别笑了。 毕竟，被捉弄的人可是你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15462
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_3c199dda:

    # "He gestures to himself."
    "他指了指自己。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15464
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_41323f22:

    # p "You're right, this says much more about me than you."
    p "你说的对，这件事暴露了我更多。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15468
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_f8a3e33d:

    # "The lizard gives you a smile, then sets the lantern down."
    "Julian对你笑了笑，然后放下灯笼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15472
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_6593a116:

    # "You take a seat on one of the crates as Julian secures the light. Once he seems reasonably sure it won't come falling down and set the sails on fire, he steps over to you."
    "当Julian固定好灯时，你在一个板条箱上坐下。一旦他相当确定灯不会掉下来并点燃船帆，他就朝你走过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15482
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_031e1268:

    # "Moving one of the crates, he sits across from you, giving you an intense look."
    "他搬开一个板条箱，坐在你对面，认真地看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15484
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_6c99914e:

    # j "So... tell me all the details. About you and that guy, I mean."
    j "所以……告诉我所有的细节。关于你和那家伙，我的意思是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15488
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_c3c5b2f3:

    # j "And don't give me shit for talking, I want to hear this first! You owe me that much, at least."
    j "别因为我说话而找我麻烦，我想先听这个！你至少欠我这么多。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15490
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_a6bf349d:

    # "You sigh. You did give your word that you would. You'll just have to ensure the lizard doesn't talk about it with anyone else."
    "你叹了口气。你确实答应过。你只需要确保这只蜥蜴不会和别人谈论这件事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15492
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_b7ac261c:

    # p "Well... Where do I begin?"
    p "好吧……我从哪里开始呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15494
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_be70a64e:

    # "You think for a moment, then you shrug."
    "你想了一会儿，然后耸了耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15496
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_d38377f4:

    # p "What do you think happened, Jules? Since you're so interested in it."
    p "你觉得发生了什么，Jules？既然你对它这么感兴趣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15500
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_fda232ef:

    # j "You were so cagey about it, so you obviously did {i}something{/i} with him you want to keep private. Something either very embarrassing or secret happened, and I want to know."
    j "你对此事守口如瓶，所以你显然和他做了 {i}一些事情{/i} ，你想保密。发生了一些非常令人尴尬或秘密的事情，我想知道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15502
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_c6c871a7:

    # p "Will you keep your mouth shut about it?{w} If you promise, I'll tell you everything down to the last detail."
    p "你会对此事闭嘴吗？{w} 如果你答应，我会告诉你所有的细节，直到最后一个细节。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15506
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_e5a6d6cb:

    # "Julian just nods a few times, excited. His tail actively sways through the air as he is entirely focused on you, in rapt attention."
    "Julian兴奋地微微点头。当他全神贯注地看着你时，他的尾巴在空中摇摆。"

