# game/script day2.rpy:15773
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_8c2375a8:

    # j "And that just... was it?! Nothing more?{w} I can't believe it, [name]. You are a lost cause."
    j "结果就... 这样？！没了？！{w} 我简直不敢相信，[name]。你真是个榆木脑袋。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15775
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_54def671:

    # j "I'm betting my life that you could have done more with him!"
    j "我敢拿命打赌，你原本可以和他有更多故事的！"

# game/script day2.rpy:15779
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_3709395d:

    # p "Maybe... but we didn't, so none of that matters."
    p "也许吧... 但我们什么都没做，所以说这些也没用。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15781
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_ff4d2b14:

    # p "He seems cute, getting to know him a bit more closely and getting to see him naked isn't the worst thing in the world, you know?"
    p "认识他，还能有机会看到他裸体，这不挺好的吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15783
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_752378e6:

    # p "First him, now you, who knows who will take their clothes off for me next. Wolf? Do you think maybe Arthur would do it?"
    p "先是他，现在是你，谁知道下一个会为我宽衣解带。Wolf？你说Arthur会脱吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15787
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_5d91a840:

    # "He bursts out into a laugh and catches himself quickly to quiet himself down."
    "他突然爆笑出声，又赶紧压低声音，让自己安静下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15789
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_5a9984ae:

    # j "{i}Arthur?{i}"
    j "{i}Arthur？{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:15791
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_d44fc60c:

    # j "Somehow I feel that is even less likely than Wolf, and {i}that{/i} already sounds impossible."
    j "我觉得这事儿，八成比Wolf还不可能，而{i}那{/i}听起来就跟天方夜谭一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15798
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_b4466543:

    # "Julian stands up with a smooth push off of the crate. He shifts the crate he was sitting on back to where it was, then takes a moment to inhale, then exhale, before standing back in front of you."
    "Julian撑着板条箱，顺畅地站起身。他把坐着的板条箱搬回原位，然后深吸一口气，又缓缓吐出，这才重新站到你面前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15800
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_f379490d:

    # j "But true. I'll be your number two today."
    j "没问题。今天我给你当副手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15802
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_3b30ca04:

    # "The green of his scales and his jacket are illuminated by the flickering firelight, the former glistening with brief reflections of dancing light."
    "闪烁的火光映照在他绿色的鳞片和夹克上，鳞片上闪动着光芒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15806
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_504eda98:

    # "He smiles at you again, but this time there's no humor. It's excitement, a giddiness for what's to come, and a tender affection as he looks down at you. His tail sways behind him, just as eager."
    "他又朝你笑了笑，这次可不是什么玩笑。是兴奋，是对接下来要发生的事情感到头晕目眩，还有他看着你时，眼中饱含的柔情蜜意。他的尾巴也跟着急切地摇摆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15810
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_e5eb4eb8:

    # "Then, his hands go up to his chest. His fingers unbutton his jacket the rest of the way, the gentle rustling of fabric barely audible. He then unloops his belt and tosses it aside, letting his jacket hang free and open."
    "接着，他的手抬到胸前。手指解开夹克剩下的扣子，布料摩擦的细微声响几乎听不见。然后他解开腰带，随手扔到一边，任由夹克敞开着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15812
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_a57fb9a8:

    # "He grabs one of your hands and puts it to his stomach, with only his undershirt between you and his scales."
    "他抓起你的一只手，按在他的腹部，隔在你和他鳞片之间的，只有一件贴身背心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15814
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_4383bb08:

    # "The coolness is a surprise, but the texture is nice, the shirt smoothly gliding over his scales. He guides your hand, letting you feel his taut, slim stomach, before he pulls it to the side and wraps your hand around his waist. You squeeze it suggestively, giving him a toothy little grin."
    "那股凉意让你有些意外，但触感却很棒，背心顺滑地拂过他的鳞片。他引导着你的手，让你感受他那紧绷又精瘦的腹部，然后拉到一旁，环住他的腰。你带着暗示意味地捏了捏，朝他露出一个坏笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15829
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_b8b0944e:

    # "Julian returns the grin, then pulls your hand away. He shrugs his jacket off, letting it slowly slide down his arms, making a little show of revealing his shoulders and the base of his neck."
    "Julian也回你一个笑容，然后抽回你的手。他耸了耸肩，慢条斯理地脱下夹克，故意露出他的肩膀和脖颈。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15831
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_86b055c6:

    # "His collarbone is emphasized with the heavy shadow, letting you see the sharp division between his tender neck and tougher chest, before it's covered by the thin layer of his undershirt. His shoulders are slim, his arms lean, but still taut with some muscle."
    "浓重的阴影突出了他的锁骨，让你能清楚地看到他那柔嫩的脖颈与结实的胸膛之间分明的界限，随后又被薄薄的背心遮盖。他的肩膀窄窄的，手臂也很精瘦，但肌肉依旧紧绷。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15833
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_580793b4:

    # "You lick your teeth, taking in a sharp breath. You're already getting pretty hard."
    "你舔了舔嘴唇，深吸了一口气。你已经有些按捺不住了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15835
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_8d83b72b:

    # p "Fuck me, Jules... I didn't expect you to be such a good tease."
    p "操我吧，Jules... 真没想到你这么会撩人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15839
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_49903c88:

    # "Julian grins and opens his mouth to speak, then seems to remember the exchange you just had. He then promptly pulls his jacket back on with a huff."
    "Julian咧嘴一笑，张开嘴想说话，但似乎又想起了刚才的约定。他随即气鼓鼓地把夹克穿了回去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15843
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_8f6d8a1f:

    # p "Oh, come on, Jules..."
    p "哎，别这样嘛，Jules..."

# game/script day2.rpy:15845
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_52fcc2d6:

    # "He folds his arms over his chest and holds his snout towards the ceiling. He then gives you a quick look, urging you."
    "他双臂抱在胸前，鼻子朝天，然后飞快地瞥了你一眼，催促你继续。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15847
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_32713dab:

    # p "Alright... Please continue? Please?"
    p "好吧... 求你，继续好吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15853
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_766eb8a4:

    # "He seems to accept that. He lets the jacket back down with a victorious little grin."
    "他似乎接受了你的请求，带着一丝小小的得意，又让夹克滑落了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15859
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_6f44bab9:

    # j "Oh, there's a lot about me that'll surprise you."
    j "噢，关于我，能让你惊讶的事情多着呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15861
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_048fd3e8:

    # p "Oh yeah?"
    p "噢，是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15863
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_4e5839e6:

    # j "Patience, kitty. Can't lose my 'good tease' title, now can I?"
    j "耐心点，小野猫。我可不能丢了“调情高手”的称号，你说对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15865
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_b5bdfe60:

    # "You roll your eyes at him."
    "你朝他翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15869
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_4f8f0e21:

    # "Soon enough, you find yourself staring at him, utterly enraptured. He slides his hands down his chest, palms flat, until they find the hem of his undershirt. He pulls it off in one long, slow motion, revealing his stomach, waist, pecs, until he is finally completely free."
    "不一会儿，你就发现自己完全看呆了，眼睛一眨不眨地盯着他。他双手向下抚摸自己的胸膛，手掌贴平，直到摸到背心的下摆。他以一个缓慢而漫长的动作脱掉了背心，露出他的腹部、腰身、胸肌，直至赤裸上身。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15873
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_ee5076ad:

    # "Delicately, he removes a necklace as well, placing it in the growing pile of his clothes."
    "他小心翼翼地取下一条项链，也放在逐渐增多的衣服堆上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15875
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_2922b62b:

    # "Now, all that remains is his pants. He hooks a thumb on one side of the hem, then slowly moves it to the buttons. Your eyes flick between the motions of his fingers as he unbuttons them to his eyes, satisfied at how he has you utterly focused on his every move."
    "现在，就只剩下他的裤子了。他用拇指勾住裤子一侧的下摆，然后缓缓移到纽扣的位置。你的目光随着他手指的动作而移动，看着他解开纽扣，又看看他那得意的眼神，他很满意你完全被他的一举一动所吸引。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15879
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_2fc1918a:

    # "One button goes, then another, and another... until he steps out of one leg in one smooth motion. His other leg steps forward too, leaving him standing right above you, clad only in his undergarments."
    "解开一颗纽扣，又一颗，再一颗......然后他流畅地迈出一条腿。另一条腿也随之迈出，此刻他只穿着内裤，站在你的面前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15886
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_f2c062cc:

    # "He grabs your hands and pulls the last scrap of clothing on his body down with them, letting your hands rub down his leg until he casually kicks them away, leaving him completely nude."
    "他抓住你的双手，一同拉下身上最后一块遮羞布，让你的手在他的腿上摩擦，直到他漫不经心地踢开你的手，彻底一丝不挂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15892
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_56e096a6:

    # "He points at your hands and then gestures down towards his body with a very smug look."
    "他指了指你的手，然后带着一丝自鸣得意的表情，示意你向下看他的身体。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15896
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_lethimundress_2b957ed4:

    # j "Well, explore away, [name]."
    j "好吧，[name]，尽情探索吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15902
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_67475db3:

    # "You reach forward with your other hand, pulling him between your thighs by the grip on his waist. Your hands then meet at his front, tugging the buttons of his pants apart."
    "你伸出另一只手，抓住他的腰，将他拉到你的双腿之间。你的双手在他的身前汇合，解开他裤子的纽扣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15908
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_66ac867e:

    # "Julian gasps, surprised at your sudden advance. He opens his mouth to say something, then seemingly remembers he can't, and begins to glare at you."
    "Julian倒吸一口凉气，显然被你突如其来的举动吓了一跳。他张了张嘴，似乎想说些什么，但随即想起自己不能说话，便开始怒视着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15912
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_57c2a42a:

    # "But you can hear the little hitch in his breathing, the slight quiver of the next inhalation... You can feel the electric thrill traveling through him. You smirk at him, and he looks away sheepishly."
    "但你能听到他呼吸中那细微的停顿，下一次吸气时那轻微的颤抖...... 你能感受到一股电流般的快感正传遍他的全身。你得意地朝他笑了笑，他有些不好意思地移开了视线。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15920
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_f6a92781:

    # j "Feisty! Didn't realize you wanted me this badly."
    j "小野猫！真没想到你这么想要我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15922
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_cbb2b294:

    # "He teases, but you hear a little hitch in his breathing, a thrill going through him at your insistent touch."
    "他调笑着，但你能听到他呼吸中那细微的停顿，以及你这急切的触碰给他带来的颤栗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15924
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_c20cd5a4:

    # p "Guess I'm greedy. Good thing I'll get everything I want from you."
    p "看来我是太贪心了。不过没关系，我想要的一切都会从你身上得到。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15926
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_f77758b1:

    # j "Will you?"
    j "哦？是吗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15928
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_dd2e87ca:

    # p "Mmhm."
    p "呵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15931
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_7d365206:

    # "He tosses away his jacket as you work at his pants, but you interrupt him before he gets to his undershirt."
    "你正要扒他的裤子，他已经把外套扔一边了，但你拦住了他，没让他继续脱内衫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15933
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_69e1bc9c:

    # p "Oh, let me handle that."
    p "让我来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15941
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_4ac8f944:

    # "You then stand up and run your hands under the hem of his undershirt, pulling it up indirectly as you shift your hands up his chest, feeling the pleasingly smooth texture of the scales and the surprising give, soft and malleable under your fingers."
    "接着你站起身，手指探入他内衫下摆，一点点向上撩起。手掌顺着他的胸膛向上游走，感受着那光滑细腻的鳞片，以及出乎意料的柔软和弹性，在你的指尖下温顺地变化着形状。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15943
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_81056b11:

    # "Then comes lifting it over his head. You give him a look, and he readily lifts his arms above him, as well as he can in the small room. Dragging the shirt the rest of the way with one hand, your other lingers at his chest, grabbing at his side, his stomach, and his pectorals, feeling the differences in texture."
    "你示意他抬起胳膊脱内衫。他会意地举起双臂，在这个狭小的空间里尽力配合。你单手将内衫褪去，另一只手却流连在他的胸膛，从侧腹到小腹，再到胸肌，细细感受着每一寸肌肤的纹理。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15947
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_7513111d:

    # "The lizard looks surprisingly bashful at your touch, smiling but doing little else but breathing shallow little breaths as he follows your directions."
    "Julian被你摸得有些不好意思，虽然带着笑，但除了轻微的呼吸，就只是顺从地配合着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15949
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_21a82267:

    # "You toss the undershirt aside. He removes a necklace he's wearing and carefully drops it onto the discarded clothes. The two of you now stand face to face, very close together. You feel his breath on your fur. He swallows."
    "你随手扔掉内衫，他摘下脖子上的项链，小心翼翼地放在一旁。你们面对面站着，近到能感受到彼此的呼吸。你感到他的气息拂过你的毛发，他紧张地咽了口唾沫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15951
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_54cda999:

    # p "What's wrong, Julian? Cat got your tongue?"
    p "怎么，Julian？哑巴了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15957
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_47fa22ab:

    # "He glares at you again, silent."
    "他狠狠地瞪着你，还是不说话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15959
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_6bc6a2d4:

    # p "So pliant. Is it just because you can't talk back or are you enjoying being bossed around?"
    p "真听话。是不能说话，还是就喜欢被人摆布？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15963
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_b3abd199:

    # "He maintains the glare, but his eyes flick away as you stare back with a grin, embarrassed."
    "虽然还在瞪着你，但当你笑着看回去的时候，他还是不好意思地躲开了视线。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15965
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_e96986f8:

    # p "It's cute. You're cute."
    p "真可爱，你这家伙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15967
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_0366762a:

    # "Julian's head whips back."
    "Julian猛地抬起头，瞪着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15969
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_59b0d5f8:

    # j "You-"
    j "你-"

# game/script day2.rpy:15971
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_6f665188:

    # "He catches himself before he says another word. He closes his mouth, opens it again, and then closes it back. Then he looks away again, folding his arms over his chest."
    "话到嘴边又咽了回去。他闭紧嘴巴，又忍不住张开，最后还是闭上。他赌气似的把胳膊抱在胸前，又把头扭到一边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15973
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_9a256d4b:

    # p "What were you saying, Julian? I think I heard something..."
    p "哎呦，刚才想说什么来着，Julian？我好像听见了什么不得了的东西哦？"

# game/script day2.rpy:15975
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_49451740:

    # "He doesn't rise to your goading."
    "他没有上你的当。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15991
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_55008813:

    # "You respond to that by removing his pants and undergarments in one motion, leaving him totally naked in front of you."
    "作为回应，你干脆利落地扒掉了他的裤子和内裤，让他赤条条地站在你面前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:15998
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_13683199:

    # "He turns back in surprise. He just looks down, then at you, then... Nothing. He can't say anything, so he just stares at you while you sit back again on the crate, equally annoyed at and excited by you as he lets out a huff."
    "他愣了一下，猛地转过身，先是看了看自己的下面，又抬头看向你，然后...就没了。他现在什么都说不了，只能瞪着你。而你已经重新坐回了箱子上，带着点恼火，又有点兴奋地看着他，他气得哼了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16002
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_8d3859b9:

    # j "Ha, ha. Very funny."
    j "呵呵，真有意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16004
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_52ab5da0:

    # p "I'm just saying, you're being so obedient. Talk all day but go quiet in bed, huh?"
    p "我是说你这家伙，也太听话了吧？平时不是挺能说的吗，怎么一到床上就哑巴了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16008
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_8d922522:

    # "He opens his mouth to retort, but seemingly can't think of something to say. He closes it."
    "他张开嘴想要反驳，但似乎想不出什么话来。他闭上了嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16010
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_e96986f8_1:

    # p "It's cute. You're cute."
    p "真可爱，你这家伙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16012
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_e9bb0988:

    # "Julian doesn't respond for a moment."
    "Julian沉默了一会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16014
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_helphimundress_85190f30:

    # j "You can't just-"
    j "你不能就这么-"

# game/script day2.rpy:16030
