translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_68bfa04e:

    # "Your arm had instinctively grabbed at his side as you moved in that little rush, and your hand lingered on him. You shift it to his back, sliding down the rougher scales, until you feel where his thigh and rump meet."
    "刚才情急之下，你的手臂本能地抓住了他的腰，手也一直没松开。你把手移到他的背上，沿着粗糙的鳞片向下摸索，直到摸到他大腿和屁股连接的地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16706
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_f43435ff:

    # p "You know, we could do a little more..."
    p "要不，咱们再来点刺激的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16710
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_c6cad1fe:

    # "You're more aware now of his breath mussing up your fur and his hands, similarly planted on you, though one is carrying both of your clothes. He lets them drop before his face moves closer to yours."
    "你现在能更清楚地感觉到他的呼吸拂过你的毛发，他的手也放在你的身上，虽然其中一只还拿着你们的衣服。他扔掉衣服，脸凑了过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16712
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_dc7d97cc:

    # j "Oh yeah?"
    j "噢，是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16714
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_eaf8f83e:

    # "You squeeze at his ass before you lean in to kiss his face, but then, very suddenly, that light returns."
    "你捏了捏他的屁股，然后凑上去想亲他的脸，可就在这时，灯光又回来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16723
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_f7e56f05:

    # "The crewman steps further into the room, enough that you get a better look at him, but thankfully you both stayed behind the racks, keeping you safe from view."
    "那个船员又往房间里走了几步，你也能更清楚地看到他了，幸好你们躲在架子后面，没被发现。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16725
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_d1466a10:

    # "Both Julian and you tense up in your embrace, watching through the slats as the crewman lingers again, before finally retreating, evidently satisfied there is no one hiding in here."
    "你和Julian都紧张地抱在一起，透过架子的缝隙看着那个船员又在房间里转悠了一会儿，最后才离开，显然没发现有人藏在这儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16727
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_0d14a541:

    # j "Fuck, that was close..."
    j "操，好险……"

# game/script day2.rpy:16734
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_e36d1c5d:

    # "He rests his head in the crook of your neck for a moment, before pulling away."
    "他把头靠在你的颈窝里，过了一会儿才抬起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16740
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_74b43d91:

    # j "We'll have to do whatever else you had in mind later. Here, grab your clothes..."
    j "之后你想做什么都可以，来，先把衣服穿上……"

# game/script day2.rpy:16742
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_584c97a7:

    # p "Oh? There's a later now?"
    p "噢？还有“之后”啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16746
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_93b94101:

    # j "Well... I certainly hope so."
    j "嗯……我当然希望有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16750
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_ceb44460:

    # "You laugh softly, and he joins in after."
    "你轻声笑了出来，他也跟着笑了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16755
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_35328223:

    # "The two of you fumble around, trying to get dressed in the dim light and identifying your clothes by feeling alone. You eventually manage, and after what feels like a safe period of waiting, slip out from the sail room and begin to head back up."
    "你们俩手忙脚乱地摸索着，试图在昏暗的光线下穿好衣服，只能靠感觉辨认。好不容易穿戴整齐，在感觉等了足够久后，便从帆室里溜了出来，开始往回走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16757
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_106d5430:

    # j "You know, I'm glad we managed to do that. We'll have to pick a better place, but... I would like it if there was a later, yeah."
    j "你知道吗，我真高兴刚刚我们做了那种事。下次得找个更好的地方，不过...如果还有下次，我肯定还想和你..."

# game/script day2.rpy:16761
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_c2d91ced:

    # p "Hmm... I'll think about it."
    p "嗯...我会考虑考虑的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16765
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_71cb9475:

    # "You tease him. He gives you a surprised look until he reads your smirking expression, then he lightly shoves you towards the wall."
    "你故意逗他。他先是惊讶地看着你，直到发现你脸上带着坏笑，才轻轻地把你推到墙边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16767
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_a4851aa3:

    # j "You jerk. I'm being sincere for once and this is how you treat me!"
    j "你这家伙！我难得这么真诚一次，你就这么对我！"

# game/script day2.rpy:16771
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_afb43223:

    # p "Sincerely breaking the rules, you mean. You forget you're not allowed to talk?"
    p "你是说真心实意地违反规定？你忘了自己现在不能说话了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16775
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_9485fe7e:

    # j "Oh, fuck off!"
    j "滚你的蛋！"

# game/script day2.rpy:16783
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_f312777f:

    # "The two of you laugh again before you climb back up to the decks, returning to the light of the sun just before it sets. It's very nice after the mustiness of the lower decks, the feeling of fresh air in your lungs and tousling your fur, but it's even better to see Julian in the light of day again."
    "你们俩又笑了起来，然后爬回甲板上，赶在日落前重见天日。离开潮湿的下层甲板后，这感觉真是太棒了，清新的空气涌入肺中，吹拂着你的毛发。不过，能再次在阳光下看到Julian，感觉就更好了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16787
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_1d5f573a:

    # "You can truly appreciate his scales here, the angle of the sun causing them to glisten and shine with the light dancing across them. You observe him looking out to the horizon, then up to the sails..."
    "现在你可以好好欣赏他的鳞片了，阳光的角度让它们闪闪发光，光芒在其上跳跃。你看到他凝视着地平线，又抬头看着风帆..."

# game/script day2.rpy:16789
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_f35aeb24:

    # "Then to you, catching you looking."
    "然后他转过头，正好抓到你盯着他看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16793
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_832f8b3b:

    # j "What, is there something on my face?"
    j "怎么，我脸上有东西吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16795
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_8af28f9c:

    # "The question is genuine, a concern if he had missed some sign of the pleasure you two shared. But then he sees your smile and just laughs at you."
    "这个问题是真心实意的，他担心是不是自己错过了什么能表明你们刚刚都很开心的细节。但当他看到你脸上的笑容时，只是笑着摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16799
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_e3ed3d11:

    # "You turn away, shaking your head, but the smile doesn't leave your face."
    "你转过身去，摇摇头，但笑容却怎么也藏不住。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16801
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_Julian_jerkyou_04a6ee6b:

    # "The two of you then return to enjoy your time off, but your thoughts linger on your encounter with Julian all the while."
    "之后，你们各自回去继续享受休息时光，但你满脑子想的都是刚才和Julian的相遇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16818
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a048e7bc:

    # "When you have some free time in the evening you take a moment to arm yourself with a needle and some thread from Rajeeyah."
    "傍晚时分，你抽出空，从Rajeeyah那里拿了针线，准备“武装”自己。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16820
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_dfa15836:

    # "Apparently, next time you should go to the sail maker instead, but she doesn't refuse your request and gives you one of her needles and some thread."
    "她说，下次你应该直接去找帆匠才对，但她还是答应了你的请求，给了你一根针和一些线。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16822
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_7b4cb58f:

    # "With the necessary equipment in hand, you search the ship for Wolf, trying to put yourself in his place when you can't seem to find him right away."
    "拿着这些必要的工具，你在船上四处寻找Wolf，试着站在他的角度思考，想象着如果自己是他，会躲在哪里..."

# game/script day2.rpy:16826
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_1af06a94:

    # "Wondering just where you would spend your time if you were him..."
    "要是我的话，会把时间花在哪里呢..."

# game/script day2.rpy:16836
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a4822f60:

    # "Finally, your search leads you to the bow of a ship, and you spot him, hidden behind some of the cargo stored out here, leaning against the ship's railing."
    "最终，你一路找到了船头，发现了他。他正躲在堆放在这里的货物后面，靠在船舷上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16846
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_2b14bbd7:

    # "He looks as if he might be sleeping, his eyes closed and his arms folded behind his head as a makeshift pillow."
    "他闭着眼睛，双手枕在脑后，看起来好像睡着了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16850
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_703f83ce:

    # "He looks... cute."
    "他看起来...有点可爱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16854
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_05a396ff:

    # "He looks almost... cute."
    "他看起来简直...可爱死了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16856
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_8a8647a4:

    # "Not a description that usually fits him."
    "这可不太像平时会用来形容他的词。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16863
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_d81b85cc:

    # "You approach, careful not to make too much noise, but if he can sleep with the sound of the wind in the sails and the shouts of the working crew, then a few quiet feline steps will probably be no issue."
    "你小心翼翼地走过去，尽量不发出太大的声音。不过，他连风吹动风帆的声音和船员们的叫喊声都能睡着，想必也不会在意你这几声轻微的猫步。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16865
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ece70dec:

    # "After a few steps, the shadow you cast across the deck begins to move across his face, and with it you get the first sign of movement from the canine."
    "走了几步之后，你的身影投在甲板上，阴影开始拂过他的脸庞。这时，你终于看到他动了一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16867
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_59676fd8:

    # w "What do you want?"
    w "你想要什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16869
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_14691c3f:

    # "His voice doesn't carry any malice nor does he make any effort to open his eyes. His tail flicks across the floor and the thick fur of it brushes your own paws for a moment."
    "他的语气听不出任何恶意，也没有要睁开眼睛的意思。他的尾巴在地板上扫来扫去，浓密的毛发时不时蹭过你的爪子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16871
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ffd6d0ae:

    # p "It's me."
    p "是我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16873
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_7876c622:

    # w "I guessed as much. I asked {i}what{/i} do you want, not who you are.{p} The lizard's walk sounds different, and I don't think the maned wolf will be visiting me on deck today."
    w "我早就猜到了。我问的是{i}你{/i}想干什么，不是你是谁。{p} 蜥蜴走路的声音不一样，而且今天鬃狼恐怕是不会来甲板上找我了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16875
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_9d280e0f:

    # p "What about our officer? He might want something from you."
    p "我们的长官呢？说不定他有什么事要找你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16879
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_8772e5a8:

    # "That gets him to lift one eyelid to scan your face."
    "他听了，这才懒洋洋地抬了抬眼皮，扫了你一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16881
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_e9686ba9:

    # w "You do have eyes.{p} He's a horse."
    w "你又不是瞎子。{p}  他可是匹马，长着蹄子的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16883
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_c22c67e8:

    # w "They have hooves."
    w "他们有蹄子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16885
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p ". . ."

# game/script day2.rpy:16887
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a2b09fbf:

    # "A few awkward seconds hang in the air before Wolf repeats himself."
    "空气里弥漫着几秒尴尬，然后 Wolf 又重复了一遍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16889
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_59676fd8_1:

    # w "What do you want?"
    w "你想要什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16891
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_03f3cf9f:

    # "Almost immediately the doubts start to form. Doubts about just how serious Wolf really was when he agreed to it, or if he expected that you would just never follow through and drop the subject."
    "几乎是立刻，疑虑就涌上心头。 Wolf 答应的时候到底是不是认真的？还是说他觉得你根本不会真的去做，然后自己就放弃了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16893
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_5eb6283f:

    # p "Um... Can I sit over there?"
    p "呃……我能坐那儿吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16895
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ad7223c6:

    # "You point right next to him, and for a moment Wolf tilts his head to the side to look at the piece of empty deck you're pointing at."
    "你指了指他身边的位置，Wolf 稍微歪了歪头，看了看你指的那块空甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16897
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_0205dabe:

    # w "You didn't just come over here to sit on the floor.{w} What do you want?"
    w "你跑过来不是就为了坐在地上吧。{w} 你到底想干嘛？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16899
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a14abe6e:

    # "You take a deep breath and realize that there doesn't seem to be any other way but the direct one. You reach into the pocket of your breeches to pull out the bundle of needle and thread you've brought with you."
    "你深吸一口气，心想看来只能开门见山了。你从裤子口袋里掏出带来的针线。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16901
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_787de547:

    # p "I brought a needle and thread.{w} Because of the game before, remember? Where you mentioned that I could mend your shirt."
    p "我带了针线。{w} 之前不是说了吗，我可以帮你补衬衫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16903
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_fe5b1b6f:

    # "He looks at you as unmoved as usual, and as he tends to do, he leaves you to stew in what you said for a moment."
    "他还是一如既往的面无表情，让你自己在那琢磨他这话是什么意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16905
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_0c57c568:

    # "Your torture ends when he replies with a brief:"
    "你的煎熬终于结束了，他简单地回了句："

# game/script day2.rpy:16909
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_9c413ec2:

    # w "Go ahead."
    w "开始吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16911
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_8e4d5102:

    # "That's it? No cussing you out? No sending you away?"
    "就这？没骂我？也没赶我走？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16913
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_dff606d7:

    # "Just \"hey Mr. Wolf, I'd like to see you shirtless, pretty please.\" and he just... agrees without so much as a even single word of protest?"
    "我就说了句“Wolf 先生，我想看看你不穿衬衫的样子，求求了”，他就……这么轻易地答应了？连个“不”字都没说？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16919
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_58a4b81e:

    # "Not that you're one to complain about how smooth it's going. No, you waste no time sitting down next to him and cross your legs, your tail wrapping around them to keep the wandering thing under control."
    "当然，能这么顺利你也没什么好抱怨的。你赶紧在他旁边坐下，盘起腿，把老是乱动的尾巴也缠起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16923
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_093ea3b8:

    # w "Have you ever done this before? Or was this just the first idea you came up with to get me to take off my shirt?"
    w "你以前补过衣服吗？还是说这只是你想让我脱衣服的借口？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16943
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_c0b3b616:

    # p "Of course. My mum taught me one year during the quieter winter months."
    p "当然了。我妈教过我，就在有一年冬天比较闲的时候。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16945
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_f25cb002:

    # p "It would be a bit of a stupid lie, wouldn't it?"
    p "这谎撒得也太蠢了吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16947
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_74dae080:

    # p "You'd find out immediately as soon as I start messing up. I'd like to think I'm a bit smarter than that."
    p "我一动手，你立马就露馅了。我还没那么笨。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16949
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_0509f501:

    # "Wolf scans you intently for a few seconds, testing whether you are lying to him and would crumble under his scrutiny."
    "Wolf 盯着你看了几秒，似乎想看穿你是不是在撒谎，会不会被他吓垮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16953
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_85041677:

    # "Eventually his gaze softens, apparently satisfied with your answer."
    "最终，他的目光柔和了下来，显然对你的回答还算满意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16955
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a3f6eb6a:

    # w "I figured you would be, but..."
    w "我就猜到你会这么说，但是……"

# game/script day2.rpy:16959
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_fffcec2c:

    # "He doesn't finish the sentence, but you assume it would have included Julian as a case study for stupidity somewhere in it.{p}At least in Wolf's eyes."
    "他没说完，但你猜他肯定会拿 Julian 当个反面教材。{p} 至少在 Wolf 眼里，Julian 就是个蠢货。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16964
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ec26f474:

    # p "Well, I haven't... But I've seen my mum do it occasionally."
    p "倒也没自己做过……不过我见过我妈偶尔做。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16968
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_3db1a201:

    # w "And you decided {i}my{/i} clothes were a good place to start learning?"
    w "你就觉得拿{i}我的{/i}衣服练手挺好是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16970
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_e59c3328:

    # "His expression becomes firm as you admit to bending the truth."
    "听你承认说了谎，他脸色一沉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16972
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_eaae1727:

    # p "No, that's not what I meant. I just... well."
    p "不是，我不是那个意思。我就是……"

# game/script day2.rpy:16981
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ef27e4e5:

    # w "Wanted to see me shirtless, I know that. I just don't know if I should be offended that you thought me enough of an idiot to not notice, somehow I thought you were smarter than that."
    w "想看我不穿衣服，我知道。我就是有点生气，你是不是觉得我傻到看不出来？我还以为你挺聪明的呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:16983
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_6e311275:

    # w "What did you think would happen? That I wouldn't realize that the shirt is in worse condition than it is right now?"
    w "你觉得会怎么样？我还能看不出来这衬衫比现在还破吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:16988
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_e05a9913:

    # "You're at a loss for words and think about getting up to apologise and walk away, but before you can do anything a movement catches the corner of your eye."
    "你一时语塞，想道歉走开，可还没来得及，眼角捕捉到一个动作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17001
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_4ae54155:

    # "He sits up straight and begins to pull his shirt free from his belt."
    "他挺直腰板，开始从裤腰里拽衬衫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17009
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_73128d2b:

    # "Your head snaps to him almost by itself as you turn to watch him."
    "你几乎是不由自主地转头看向他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17011
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_7ba7a768:

    # "Well, whether it was planned or not, you are going to get your wish to see a little more of the canine."
    "行吧，不管他是不是故意的，这下你可要大饱眼福了，好好看看这只大狗狗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17015
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ab479761:

    # "The small black band around his upper arm is also quickly undone and placed neatly in his lap before he pulls the plain shirt over his head with practiced ease."
    "只见他迅速解开戴在胳膊上的黑色袖标， аккуратно 地放在腿上，然后极其熟练地一把脱掉了那件素色衬衫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17017
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_d1eced9b:

    # "The fur around his neck catches on the collar of his shirt, giving you the rather adorable-looking view of it all bunched up all around his head."
    "他脖子上的毛被衬衫领子蹭得乱蓬蓬的，堆在脑袋周围，看起来竟然有几分呆萌。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17019
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_14d88279:

    # "Who knew the big, bad wolf could look so silly, even if only for a brief second?"
    "谁能想到，这只凶巴巴的大灰狼，竟然也会有这么傻气的一面，哪怕只是转瞬即逝？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17021
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_91323642:

    # "No laughing now! Keep your cool."
    "别傻笑了！冷静点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17025
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_f725569b:

    # "Silliness is quickly replaced by how good he looks once his shirt is completely off. You hadn't realized him to be that toned underneath his loose shirt..."
    "他脱掉衬衫后，露出的好身材瞬间取代了之前的滑稽感。你这才发现，原来宽松的衣服下面，他的身材竟然这么有料…"

# game/script day2.rpy:17027
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_202048c7:

    # "The black fur shimmers with brilliant blue highlights when the light reflects off of it just right, revealing the dance of shifting muscles when he moves."
    "黑色毛发在光线的照耀下，泛着幽幽的蓝光，随着他的动作，肌肉也随之起伏，充满力量感。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17033
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_32fdda39:

    # "He holds out the crumpled shirt to you and you voicelessly take it, unable to take your eyes off of him."
    "他把揉成一团的衬衫递给你，你魂不守舍地接过来，眼睛根本离不开他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17035
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a91d0517:

    # "Once you do finally manage to tear your eyes away, you begin to unfold it in front of you, and look for the different frayed sections."
    "好不容易才把视线从他身上移开，你连忙展开衬衫，仔细寻找破损的地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17037
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_c618ba8c:

    # p "You know... You do look pretty goo-"
    p "你知道吗…你这样看起来真…"

# game/script day2.rpy:17041
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_7a3fd71a:

    # w "Don't make it weird again."
    w "别破坏气氛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17043
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_91c13e68:

    # w "Just go and fix the shirt, like you said you would."
    w "赶紧去修你的衬衫吧，你不是答应了吗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17045
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_5fe9b171:

    # p "Hey! I didn't make this weird the first time, Julian did."
    p "嘿！一开始搞砸气氛的明明是Julian好不好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17049
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_704cd499:

    # w "You were the one who used {i}both{/i} of your bets to pry for something sexual..."
    w "是你{i}连用{/i}两次机会，迫不及待地想打听那种事…"

# game/script day2.rpy:17053
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_fdf1cd53:

    # w "You were the one who asked about my sex life..."
    w "是你一个劲儿地追问我的私生活…"

# game/script day2.rpy:17055
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ff18bdf2:

    # w "Not that the lizard isn't an idiot, but... "
    w "虽然那只蜥蜴也挺蠢的，但是… "

# game/script day2.rpy:17059
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_1e869955:

    # "He trails off and sighs."
    "他渐渐停止说话，叹了口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17061
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_299f6a33:

    # w "I just want this bet done, alright?"
    w "我只想赶紧结束这场无聊的打赌，成吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17063
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_92698aad:

    # p "All right, I'll keep my muzzle shut."
    p "行行行，我闭嘴还不行吗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17070
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_4fd5da02:

    # "He crumples the shirt into a ball and puts it in his lap, just like the armband before, something you barely notice as your eyes remain glued to Wolf's upper body instead."
    "他像刚才叠袖标一样把衬衫揉成一团，放在腿上。你完全没注意到他的动作，因为你的视线，全都集中在Wolf赤裸的上半身上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17072
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_bd777ec0:

    # p "Why did you..."
    p "你为什么……"

# game/script day2.rpy:17076
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a7d4dfa8:

    # w "A bet is a bet."
    w "打赌就是打赌。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17078
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ac208990:

    # "He answers matter-of-factly."
    "他一本正经地回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17080
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_081338c2:

    # w "It's just my shirt. Gonna be hard enough work where I'll take it off sooner or later anyway..."
    w "不就是件衬衫么。反正干活的时候热了也得脱…"

# game/script day2.rpy:17084
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_5136e3a4:

    # w "The only thing that made it an issue was you two making it weird."
    w "这件事之所以会变得这么奇怪，还不是因为你们两个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17086
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_0df98fc2:

    # p "Hey, Julian made it weird."
    p "明明是Julian先开始的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17090
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_704cd499_1:

    # w "You were the one who used {i}both{/i} of your bets to pry for something sexual..."
    w "是你{i}连用{/i}两次机会，迫不及待地想打听那种事…"

# game/script day2.rpy:17094
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_fdf1cd53_1:

    # w "You were the one who asked about my sex life..."
    w "是你一个劲儿地追问我的私生活…"

# game/script day2.rpy:17096
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_9e90a503:

    # w "Not that the lizard isn't an idiot, but..."
    w "虽然那只蜥蜴也挺蠢的，但是…"

# game/script day2.rpy:17100
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_36bc58c6:

    # p "I guess you're right."
    p "也许你是对的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17102
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_3f22e1f9:

    # "It's a strange feeling having Wolf be so oddly compliant in this situation. You'd expect him to turn you the cold shoulder, perhaps even threaten you, but...{p}This is nice."
    "真奇怪，Wolf居然这么听话。我还以为他会直接给我摆脸色，或者干脆威胁我呢…… 这样挺好的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17104
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_4cb7a710:

    # "You turn your head to catch another glimpse, the soft evening breeze gently moves his deep black fur as Wolf looks up at the sky above the sails."
    "你忍不住转头又瞥了他一眼，轻柔的晚风拂动着他那浓黑的毛发，Wolf正仰头望着船帆上方的天空。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17111
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ae38eb00:

    # "As much as you try to keep your mind from wandering, it was impossible not to imagine him with even less clothing than this. Your thoughts inevitably pull you towards the idea of asking him if you could fix his breeches, too."
    "明明想控制住别胡思乱想，但还是忍不住去想他穿得更少的样子。 甚至冒出了想问他能不能也帮他补补裤子的念头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17118
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_1ceb7e98:

    # "Imagining him agreeing to it in his ragged voice... how he'd step out of them...{p}His backside...{p}His sheath..."
    "想象着他用那沙哑的嗓音答应下来…… 然后慢吞吞地脱下裤子……{p}他的屁股……{p} 还有那玩意儿……"

# game/script day2.rpy:17124
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_e9e37685:

    # "Would he raise his tail when he bends over to step out of them?"
    "他弯腰脱裤子的时候，尾巴会翘起来吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17132
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_91d6fab9:

    # "You shake your head to clear it thoroughly." with hpunch
    "你赶紧摇摇头，把这些乱七八糟的想法甩出去。" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:17140
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_05a201bd:

    # p "You really are in good shape, I did-"
    p "你身材真不错，我…"

# game/script day2.rpy:17142
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_780d619c:

    # w "Didn't I {i}just{/i} tell you not to make it weird?"
    w "我{i}刚{/i}跟你说什么来着？别说些怪话！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17147
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_39028950:

    # p "I'm not going to. I was just saying that your clothes didn't give it away and I was wondering what you were doing before you joined this ship."
    p "我没想说怪话。我就是觉得你身材不像普通的面包师或者小商贩，好奇你上船之前是做什么的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17149
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_b2885ae1:

    # p "Certainly not how the typical baker, or street vendor looks like. Hell, you'd probably put the Royal Guardsmen to shame."
    p "啧，你这身板，皇家卫队都得自愧不如。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17151
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_3e3e8950:

    # w "Odds and ends... Wherever someone was needed, I'd be the one around."
    w "啥都干…… 哪里需要人就去哪儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17153
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_4d95b8af:

    # w "Being on this ship is no different. They needed a pair of hands... I need the money."
    w "在船上也一样，他们缺人手，我缺钱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17157
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_20ef0241:

    # "He shrugs and looks over to check your progress, and having made none yet, you immediately begin and push the needle through the fabric."
    "他耸耸肩，瞥了眼你的进度。 发现你还没开始，你赶紧拿起针线缝了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17161
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_93c15e48:

    # "He shrugs and looks away."
    "他耸耸肩，又把头转了回去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17163
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_d1eee5e8:

    # p "Looks like you weren't afraid to go for the most strenuous day jobs then."
    p "看来你以前没少干力气活啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17165
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ae0299ea:

    # w "I'm a sailor now, am I not?"
    w "我现在是水手了，这你都忘了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17167
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_b25b7521:

    # "You laugh, realizing the obvious answer to your observation."
    "你忍不住笑了出来，答案不是明摆着嘛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17171
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_310ab941:

    # "Another stitch follows as you work your way along the frayed seam, beginning to bring it back together."
    "你一针一线地沿着磨损的缝口缝过去，慢慢地将它缝合。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17175
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_e23ab635:

    # "Soon enough the first one is fixed, you check how the seam looks on the outside as well, before giving it a quick tug to make sure it doesn't fall apart at the first sign of stress."
    "很快，第一个破洞就补好了。 你又翻过来看了看外面的缝线，然后拽了拽，确保它不会轻易崩开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17177
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_2afec19b:

    # "Satisfied with your work, you scan the shirt for other spots and start working on a second developing hole as you come across it."
    "你满意地检查了一下，又开始寻找其他需要修补的地方，然后开始缝补第二个破洞。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17181
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_4a54dddb:

    # p "Being a day labourer must have gotten you around then, if it has taken you all the way to France."
    p "要是跑遍了法国，那你以前肯定没少奔波吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17183
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ddcf4f12:

    # "The canine's ears swivel before he glances over, his silver eyes catching the light for a moment. You catch the slight rise of his lips before he speaks."
    "Wolf的耳朵动了动，然后转过头来，银色的眼睛闪着光。 你注意到他嘴角微微上扬了一下，然后开了口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17185
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_c0ace169:

    # w "Briefly."
    w "简短地。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17187
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_f0fe03a4:

    # "As succinct as ever."
    "还是那么惜字如金。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17189
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_fe43f4b3:

    # p "What brought you there?"
    p "你怎么会去那儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17191
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_8c14847d:

    # w "Work."
    w "为了工作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17193
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_d4baae9c:

    # p "Come on, I know that. Just share a little bit with me, will you?"
    p "别这样嘛，我知道是为了工作。 稍微和我分享一点，行不行？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17197
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_3afc80d8:

    # p "Remember, I'm holding your shirt hostage right now. You better tell me something about yourself or I'll...{w} I don't know, sew some hearts and flowers into it or something."
    p "别忘了，你的衬衫现在还在我手里呢。 你最好老实交代，不然我就……{w} 我也不知道，给你缝点爱心小花什么的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17199
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_f6ec338f:

    # w "I wouldn't do that if I were you."
    w "我劝你最好别。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17201
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_4952562d:

    # p "I'll explain what a joke is some day."
    p "总有一天我会解释什么是笑话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17205
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a67c6ac6:

    # "You lean over and give him a playful push."
    "你凑过去，轻轻地推了他一下，带着点玩闹的意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17207
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_beb6b02e:

    # p "Just tell me, damn it. What's with this secrecy?{w} Are you some {i}assassin{/i} sent to kill a king in a far-off land?"
    p "告诉我，见鬼。到底有什么好隐瞒的？{w} 难道你是被派来刺杀某个遥远国度国王的{i}刺客{/i}？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17209
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_02f8c71f:

    # p "What's the worst that could happen? That everyone finds out how you spent a few weeks picking grapes in a French vineyard?"
    p "最坏又能怎么样？无非是大家发现你曾经在法国的葡萄园里摘过几周葡萄？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17211
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_3dff31c3:

    # p "Oh no, what a tragedy, the wolf has enough dexterity to actually pick the grapes without just crushing them like bugs."
    p "哎呦喂，多大的悲剧啊，这头狼居然有那灵巧劲儿，能好好地摘葡萄，而不是像捏虫子一样把葡萄捏爆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17213
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_20bf9cb2:

    # "Not the worst sight to imagine either you decide as you peek over to him again."
    "你再次偷偷瞥了他一眼，心想，这画面倒也不赖。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17215
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_6cdf83b7:

    # "Raising his arms to pick the grapes, how his shoulders would move, or the tension in his arms as he's carrying a basket that's filled to the brim with them."
    "他举起胳膊摘葡萄时，肩膀会如何牵动，还有他提起装满葡萄的篮子时，手臂上紧绷的肌肉……"

# game/script day2.rpy:17219
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_5ff8059e:

    # p "We are alone. I'll swear secrecy. Whatever horrible, horrible thing you did, I will take to my grave."
    p "只有我们两个。我发誓，绝对保密。不管你做了什么天大的坏事，我都会把它带进坟墓里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17221
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_cf965a26:

    # "You put one hand over your heart and hold the other one up to swear on the spot."
    "你一手按着胸口，一手高高举起，当场发誓。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17223
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_b4625072:

    # p "I'm sure it will be a terrible burden to keep quiet until my death about you working on a French farm. Who knows what horrors you might have wrought? You may have even milked the cows yourself!"
    p "我敢肯定，要我对你在法国农场干活这件事闭口不言直到我死，这绝对是个可怕的负担。谁知道你都干了些什么恐怖的事情？说不定你还亲自挤过牛奶呢！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17225
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_20bf9cb2_1:

    # "Not the worst sight to imagine either you decide as you peek over to him again."
    "你再次偷偷瞥了他一眼，心想，这画面倒也不赖。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17227
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_48fff5b9:

    # "Sitting on the stool, bent over to reach under the cow, what a beautiful arch his back would make... or the tension in his arms as he's carrying the bucket full of milk."
    "坐在小凳子上，弯腰去够母牛的肚子，他的背会弯出一个多么漂亮的弧度……还有他提着装满牛奶的桶时，手臂上紧绷的肌肉……"

# game/script day2.rpy:17229
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_d7657fd7:

    # "If only your family had hired him as a farmhand, perhaps you would have stayed home if you had gotten this sight every day."
    "要是你的家人当初雇他当农场工人就好了，说不定要是每天都能看到这光景，你就会留在家里了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17231
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_b3134a38:

    # w "We were visiting someone."
    w "我们是去拜访别人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17235
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_0a1ba10a:

    # "You wait for a few seconds to see if Wolf will continue, pulling the needle through the fabric once again."
    "你等了几秒钟，想看看 Wolf 会不会继续说下去，同时他再次将针线穿过布料。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17237
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_e6489a63:

    # p "Aaaand? Come on, don't make every conversation with you an ordeal like I'm pulling your teeth."
    p "然、然后呢？拜托，别搞得和你聊个天，跟拔牙似的，这么费劲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17239
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_468b338e:

    # w "There really is nothing more to it. We went there to visit someone. Worked for a while while we were there."
    w "真的没什么了。我们去那里拜访朋友。顺便在那里干了段时间的活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17241
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_f8a82feb:

    # p "Who are we?"
    p "“我们”是指哪些人？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17243
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_d68a7fae:

    # w "A few friends of mine. We traveled together a lot because, well... you get more work when you have a whole team ready that is used to working together."
    w "我的一些朋友。我们经常一起行动，因为，你知道的……有个配合默契的团队，更容易找到活干。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17245
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_f8b37a52:

    # w "But between you and the lizard, they were just looking for one more new worker here."
    w "不过你和lizard蜥蜴，他们只是想再招一个工人而已。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17249
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_8ee97fce:

    # p "You are. Is this going to be another one of those then? Or are you planning to stay at sea for longer?"
    p "你是说你吗。这又要来一遍了吗？还是你打算在海上漂更久？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17253
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_b401e2dc:

    # "He takes a while before answering, leaning against the barrel next to him and turning his head to face you."
    "他沉默了一会儿才回答，靠在身边的木桶上，转头看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17255
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_63e60fc4:

    # w "Probably not. I can't see myself staying here for long.{w} Try to keep that to yourself though, they might treat me differently if they know I plan to bail soon."
    w "大概不会吧。我感觉自己待不长。{w} 你可别到处乱说啊，他们要是知道我打算溜之大吉，肯定会对我另眼相看的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17257
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a5702415:

    # p "So... you will really leave soon?"
    p "这么说……你真的很快就要走了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17259
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸耸肩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17261
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_fa603e59:

    # "Just when you start to grow to like him too..."
    "就在你也开始对他产生好感的时候……"

# game/script day2.rpy:17263
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_9d3e7216:

    # "It takes several moments before you manage to get the next word to cross your lips."
    "你过了好一会儿，才艰难地吐出几个字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17265
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_0fe12cde:

    # p "I... I understand. Don't worry I won't mention it to anyone."
    p "我……我明白了。放心吧，我不会跟任何人说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17267
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_9365b910:

    # p "It's not because of me and Julian, is it?"
    p "是因为我和 Julian 吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17269
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_0e3dcee0:

    # w "No... well, you two aren't helping, but no."
    w "不是……好吧，虽然你们两个也没什么帮助，但主要不是因为你们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17273
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_d2cb21ae:

    # p "I'm helping right now!"
    p "我现在就是在帮忙啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17275
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_35bf1937:

    # "You demonstratively lift up the shirt you're working on to bring in some levity to the situation, even if probably only to yourself."
    "你故意举起手里的衬衫，想让气氛轻松一点，哪怕只是让自己好受点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17277
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_7e51965e:

    # w "Not what I mean."
    w "我不是那个意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17279
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_00cfffb6:

    # p "I know..."
    p "我知道……"

# game/script day2.rpy:17281
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_494a1fe3:

    # w "Besides, you only have yourself to blame for the position you are in right now."
    w "而且，你现在落到这个地步，也是你咎由自取。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17283
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_e2dd13aa:

    # w "I just never stay for very long. This work is no different."
    w "我这人待不长久。干什么都一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17285
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_de99bc7e:

    # w "But what about you?"
    w "那你呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17287
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_7171d29e:

    # p "Me?"
    p "我？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17291
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_7bf36ac0:

    # w "Yes, you're from a farmer's family, aren't you? Taught you to sew, too."
    w "是嘛，你家是农户，对吧？也教你女红了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17293
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ce9fb5e7:

    # "He nods at your paws as you work on the last hole you found."
    "他看着你缝完最后一个破洞，朝你的手点点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17297
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_70181676:

    # w "Yes, you're from a farmer's family, right?"
    w "是嘛，你家是农户，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17299
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_366e87e7:

    # "You can't quite tell if the question stems from genuine interest or if Wolf just wants to avoid being questioned further...{w} Always difficult to tell with him."
    "我也不知道他是真感兴趣，还是 Wolf 只是不想被人继续追问……{w} 真是让人琢磨不透。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17301
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ded389dd:

    # p "Yes. Helped my father, he learned from his father, who learned from his. You get the idea."
    p "是啊。帮我父亲干活，他手艺是他爹教的，他爹又是他爷爷教的。就这么回事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17303
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_11467168:

    # p "My family never knew anything else as far as I know, and I was bound to be settled with it as well."
    p "好像我家里人就没干过别的，我也注定要接手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17305
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_8704a251:

    # p "Just the next in line."
    p "只是个接班的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17307
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_d586a3df:

    # p "I wanted something else, and what could be more {i}something else{/i} than this?"
    p "我就想做点别的，还有什么比当水手更{i}特别{/i}的吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17309
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_51e48b51:

    # "You motion to your surroundings for emphasis with a smile on your face."
    "你笑着，指了指周围，以示强调。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17311
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_932ebd5c:

    # w "Mhmm..."
    w "嗯……"

# game/script day2.rpy:17317
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_dab0c661:

    # "With the last hole repaired, you inspect his shirt one last time, a testing tug, a close look.{p}All done!"
    "补好最后一个洞，你最后检查了一遍他的衬衫，扯了扯，仔细看了看。{p}好啦！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17319
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_485a632d:

    # "You cut the tread with your teeth and proudly raise the shirt in front of you. Giving it one final inspection from a distance."
    "你用牙齿咬断线，自豪地举起衬衫，远远地又检查了一遍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17321
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_978ddcff:

    # p "Looks good to me. That one's gone, the big one... You can still see that it's been tinkered with, but it's much better than before."
    p "我看可以了。那个洞补上了，那个大洞…… 还能看出来修补过的痕迹，不过比之前好多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17323
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_2a9cd084:

    # "You show it off to him too, first the front, then the back."
    "你也向他展示了一番，先是前面，然后是后面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17325
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_f2f4d694:

    # "You don't get a lot of emotion in return, just a simple nod for a job well done."
    "他没什么反应，只是点了点头，表示你干得不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17329
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_cc5b2309:

    # "You hand him his shirt and, fiddling with it until it's the right way round, he puts his first arm in."
    "你把衬衫递给他，他弄正了方向，先把一只胳膊伸了进去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17346
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_01c6a31a:

    # "A knock on the wooden barrels draws your attention away from Wolf and you notice another sailor standing next to you. He is carrying a bundle of hastily rolled up clothes under his arm."
    "一阵敲击木桶的声音让你没再注意 Wolf，你看到另一个水手站在你旁边。他腋下夹着一卷胡乱卷起来的衣服。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17348
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_9ed5daee:

    # sail "Yo, uh, I just saw you stitching his shirt, right?"
    sail "嘿，我刚才看你缝他衬衫来着，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17354
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ea0cee46:

    # p "Uhm, I guess, and you are?"
    p "嗯，算是吧，你是？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17360
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_fe397373:

    # alden "Oh, Alden's the name, I wanted to ask if you could fix some of my stuff as well?"
    alden "哦，我叫Alden，我想问问你能不能也帮我补补衣服？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17362
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p "啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17366
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_66d776f1:

    # "He pats the pile of clothes he is carrying around."
    "他拍了拍怀里抱着的衣服。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17368
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_a5ba6e7e:

    # alden "I messed up in port and forgot to visit the tailor before we left. It's not a lot, just a tear on these trousers, one shirt has... well... it's got a few holes."
    alden "我在港口里弄糟了，忘了走之前找个裁缝。也没多少，就是裤子刮了个口子，还有件衬衫…… 呃…… 破了好几个洞。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17370
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_7508f10d:

    # alden "The other shirt should be quick, though. Torres threw it at me when I mentioned you, he saw some fraying somewhere? I haven't checked it myself."
    alden "另一件应该很快就好。Torres 听我说起你，就把衣服扔给我了，说是有地方磨损了？我还没看呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17372
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_3afd514d:

    # p "Um, I'm not a tailor, though. I just learned the basics from my parents and he just had a-"
    p "那个，我又不是裁缝。我就是跟我爸妈学了点皮毛，他这身也只是——"

# game/script day2.rpy:17374
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_e190af51:

    # "You motion to Wolf, but are interrupted by the other sailor before you can finish your sentence."
    "你指了指 Wolf，但还没说完就被另一个水手打断了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17376
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_0e3fed97:

    # alden "Come on, it's just those three things. And we're working the same ship, can't have your other crew members looking like recently escaped prisoners, can you?"
    alden "我说，就那三件事而已。而且咱们在同一条船上混，你不能让你的船员们看起来像刚从牢里跑出来的一样吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17378
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ddd919f8:

    # alden "I'd do the same for you if the roles were reversed."
    alden "要是咱俩换个个儿，我也一样帮你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17382
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_83941eb4:

    # "You look over to Wolf for help, but all you see is that the second arm slips into the newly fixed shirt, and before you know it, your view of his shapely black chest has been taken away again."
    "你想找 Wolf 帮忙，结果就看到他第二条胳膊也穿进了那件补好的衬衫，还没等你好好欣赏他那精壮的黑胸膛呢，就又给遮住了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17389
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_80ffb024:

    # "With everything tucked neatly back into his belt, he grabs the top of the barrel he is leaning against and pulls himself up onto his paws."
    "把衣服都塞回腰带里之后，他双手撑着身边的木桶，一下就站了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17391
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_dfd227c9:

    # p "I mean, I suppose I could. Wolf, you're going to keep me company?{w} Wolf?{w} What are yo-"
    p "呃，我倒是可以... Wolf，你陪我一会儿？{w} Wolf？{w} 你要... 干嘛..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17393
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_c429520c:

    # w "It's getting a bit too busy for me. I'll get some rest before the next shift."
    w "这儿人太多了，我有点受不了。我得去歇会儿，准备下一班。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17395
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_284b4abe:

    # p "What? You can't just leave now. I've got to sort him out, too."
    p "什么？你现在就想开溜？我还得安顿他呢！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17400
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_b9ccc76c:

    # "One of his ears flicks in disinterest, his broad black paw passes right in front of your face as he carefully steps out of his corner and past you and the other sailor."
    "他不耐烦地动了动耳朵，宽大的黑爪子在你眼前晃了一下，小心翼翼地从角落里走出来，从你和其他水手身边走过。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17405
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_1a0af204:

    # w "That doesn't sound like work I'm needed for."
    w "这种活儿又用不着我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17416
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_1f33b199:

    # "Before long he disappears behind the barrels as he makes his way across the deck. You lean forward to call after him."
    "没一会儿，他就绕到那些桶后面，穿过甲板走了。你往前探身，想喊住他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17418
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_48e0cdf1:

    # p "Wolf! Wait!"
    p "Wolf！等等！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17420
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_62281705:

    # "All you see is his hand raised in a wave."
    "他只是抬手挥了挥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17422
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_7845c201:

    # w "Oh, and thank you."
    w "哦，还有，谢谢你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17426
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ef7239a5:

    # "Both you and the other sailor look after the wolf as he disappears towards the back of the ship."
    "你和另一个水手目送着 Wolf 离开，看着他朝船尾走去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17428
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_bfd652f3:

    # "Well... Looks like you'll be busy during your break..."
    "看来你这休息时间，有的忙喽..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17438
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_842c5d61:

    # w "The bet's done, right? I can put my shirt back on?"
    w "打赌结束了，对吧？我可以把衬衫穿回去了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17440
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_12151e00:

    # p "Would it change anything if I said no?"
    p "我说不行，你能咋地？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17454
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_2ce98c44:

    # "He looks at you wordlessly and grabs his shirt, fiddles with it until it is the right way round before he puts his first arm in."
    "他一句话没说，拿起衬衫，鼓捣了半天分清了正反面，这才把胳膊伸进去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17456
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_768a2b52:

    # p "I appreciate you doing it at all, Wolf."
    p "我很感激你做了这一切，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17460
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ae1c02e2:

    # p "I know you probably don't want me to feel like this and just want to be alone, but it's been nice talking to you, and well, since you don't exactly seem to enjoy having company, I just wanted to make sure that you knew it's appreciated."
    p "我知道你可能不想我这样，只想自己待会儿。不过跟你聊聊天挺开心的。看你也不太喜欢有人陪着，所以我就想让你知道，我挺感谢你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17464
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_527de168:

    # "The second arm follows and before you know it, your view of his shapely black chest is taken from you again..."
    "他第二条胳膊也穿了进去，你还没看够呢，那精壮的黑胸膛就又被遮住了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17468
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_8337703c:

    # w ". . ."
    w ". . ."

# game/script day2.rpy:17470
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_f03f006d:

    # "He looks over to you and for a moment it looks like he is going to say something,{p}but not a word passes his lips."
    "他看了你一眼，似乎想说点什么，{p}但最终还是什么都没说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17477
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_ac3ce3b3:

    # "His arm reaches for the top edge of the barrel beside to him and pulls himself to his paws."
    "他伸手扶住旁边的桶沿，撑着站了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17479
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_dd85419e:

    # w "I think I'll get some rest before the next shift."
    w "我觉得这儿人太多了，我得去歇会儿，准备下一班。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17484
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_wolfshirt_106ab518:

    # "You watch as he walks away, and soon after you get up too, to get some rest yourself."
    "你看着他走开，没过多久，你也起身去休息了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17499
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ade34e6c:

    # "From the comfort of your hammock you watch the wooden planks of the ceiling sway above you. The sound of the waves lapping against the ship's hull provides a soothing soundtrack to your second evening at sea."
    "你舒舒服服地躺在吊床上，看着头顶的木板一下一下地晃。海浪拍打着船身，像是为你这在海上度过的第二天晚上奏响了摇篮曲。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17501
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_b7d3eafb:

    # "The aching of your muscles a constant reminder of what even a day's work here asks of you."
    "浑身酸疼，时刻提醒着你，在这儿干一天活有多累。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17503
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_80253a84:

    # "Not to mention that you still haven't found a good rhythm to get enough sleep..."
    "而且你还是没找到合适的节奏睡个好觉..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17505
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_25ebfe09:

    # "In a few hours you'll be summoned again, and somehow you just can't manage to close your eyes.{w} Even after everything today you feel as awake as if it's the middle of the day."
    "再过几个小时又要被叫起来干活了，可你就是睡不着。{w} 忙活了一天，现在还跟大中午一样精神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17509
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_8a21b415:

    # "You toss and turn in the hammock for a while before you catch a distant but familiar sound, your ears perking up instinctively in the direction of the sound."
    "你在吊床上翻来覆去，好一会儿才听到一个有点耳熟的声音，你立马就支棱起耳朵，朝着声音传来的方向听去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17511
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_dfa46061:

    # "The sound of someone playing the fife?"
    "“有人在吹横笛？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17513
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a945ccab:

    # "You did encourage Wolf that he should take the fife lessons, but he'd never actually do it, would he?"
    "“你确实鼓励过Wolf去上横笛课，但他真的会去吗？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17515
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7e5ef2bb:

    # "Maybe Julian asked nicely enough to be allowed to play again, or maybe someone else on board brought one along?"
    "“也许是Julian好说歹说才被允许再吹一次，或者船上其他人带了横笛来？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17517
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_5893a82f:

    # "Only one way to find out."
    "“去看看就知道了。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17519
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_87cd6d9e:

    # "Sleep appears to be a far cry anyway, so you feel you might as well spend your time doing something instead of just rolling around in your hammock trying to sleep."
    "“反正也睡不着，与其在吊床上翻来覆去，不如起来做点什么。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17521
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_04cd5fdb:

    # "Your paws land softly on the wood as you roll out of the hammock and begin your search for the source of it."
    "“你从吊床上翻身下来，爪子轻轻落在木板上，开始寻找声音的来源。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17525
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c90adaa1:

    # "It grows louder as you make your way to the stairs leading up to the outside deck, the warm evening sun streaming through the opening as you make your way out onto the deck."
    "“你走向通往甲板的楼梯，声音越来越大，温暖的夕阳透过出口洒进来。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17541
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e1a2ef5a:

    # "The sun hangs low enough that you have to shield your eyes as you step out and scan the deck. Towards the bow of the ship you spot the small group and begin to make your way towards them."
    "“太阳西斜，你不得不抬手遮住眼睛，扫视甲板。你看到船头方向有一小群人，便走了过去。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17543
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c386f9fc:

    # "But it is not just Julian and Wolf who you find, there is a third person sitting with them as well. It was difficult to make them out as they were hidden by the foremast, but as you got closer you saw that Bandile had joined them."
    "但聚在一块儿的并不只有Julian和Wolf，旁边还坐着第三个人。刚才被前桅挡着不容易看真切，等走近了你才发现原来Bandile也凑在他们中间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17555
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f28885e0:

    # "He is the first to notices you as you approach, looking up to greet you with a welcoming smile and tips his head to the side so that his ears bob up and down gently."
    "“你走过去的时候，他第一个注意到你，抬头热情地笑着打招呼，歪着头，耳朵也跟着轻轻晃动。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17559
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_eed12c21:

    # b "Hey, [name]. Want to join in and play interpreter?"
    b "“嘿，[name]，要不要来当翻译？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17563
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a1eaad45:

    # "You close the distance and give Julian a soft pat on the shoulder as you come to a halt behind him, towering over the lizard sitting on the crate at your feet."
    "“你走上前去，在Julian身后停下，轻轻拍了拍他的肩膀，居高临下地看着坐在脚边木箱上的蜥蜴。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17567
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_cf4b05dc:

    # "You let your hand wander gently as you use him to steady yourself, feeling the slightly oily surface of thescales of his neck against the tips of your fingers."
    "“你顺势扶住他，手轻轻摩挲着他脖子上略带油腻的鳞片。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17569
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a96e1942:

    # p "Why would you need an interpreter?"
    p "“干嘛需要翻译？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17573
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_cf0aeb2d:

    # "He laughs, still rather confused himself, but beckons you to join in."
    "“他笑了笑，自己也一头雾水，但还是招呼你加入。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17575
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0dd43e06:

    # b "If only I knew. I've asked, but neither of them seem the chatty type."
    b "“我要是知道就好了。我问过了，但他们俩好像都不太爱说话。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17579
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_aa98e7c0:

    # p "Julian, not the chatty typ- oh right... Well this idiot here isn't allowed to talk today. Decided to be irresponsible and started gambling, now look where it got him."
    p "Julian向来不是这种闷葫芦性子——噢对啦……眼前这个蠢材今天被罚不准开口说话。非要手痒跑去聚赌，现在落得这副下场，纯属自讨苦吃。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17592
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_305ad48e:

    # "You look down at Julian with a grin and tap him on the shoulder again, more firmly this time."
    "“你笑着看向Julian，又拍了拍他的肩膀，这次稍微用了点力。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17596
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_eb75b89a:

    # p "The other one can talk, but I guess he's just jealous of Julian's super power of literally not being able to talk to anyone."
    p "“另一个人倒是能说话，但我猜他就是嫉妒Julian这种‘谁都不能跟他说话’的超能力。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17610
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_267f7615:

    # w "Not jealous, just beginning to see my own mistake in not giving you the same punishment."
    w "“不是嫉妒，我只是开始意识到没给你同样的惩罚是个错误。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17614
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_b6593518:

    # w "Not jealous, I'm not annoyed by my own words after all."
    w "“不是嫉妒，毕竟我又没被自己说的话烦到。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17616
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_5385548a:

    # p "See? He can talk."
    p "“看吧？他会说话。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17620
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7e1d1128:

    # p "The other one can talk though, I don't know why he's being so rude.{p}Well, actually I do know why."
    p "“另一个人明明能说话，不知道干嘛这么不客气。{p}嗯，其实我知道为什么。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17632
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_b6c9a82f:

    # p "I heard the fife though, so they just began without saying a single word to you?"
    p "“我听到横笛声了，所以他们一声不吭就开始了？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17634
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_dfcea5dc:

    # b "Depends on what you mean by them beginning. Julian played briefly, but that's all."
    b "“看你怎么理解‘开始’了。Julian只是稍微吹了一下。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17636
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0078e131:

    # p "Oh, we talked earlier about holding a fife lesson, so I assume that's what they're doing, or at least trying to do."
    p "“哦，我们之前说好要上横笛课的，我猜他们现在就是在上课，或者至少是在尝试上课。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17648
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f7ba0f02:

    # "You look down at the lizard for your confirmation and he nods his head."
    "“你看向蜥蜴，想让他确认一下，他点了点头。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17650
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3941c982:

    # p "There we go. Fife lesson it is. Does anyone mind if I join in?"
    p "“果然是横笛课。有人介意我加入吗？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17653
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f328869c:

    # b "Hey, [name]. Do you want to join us?"
    b "“嘿，[name]，要不要加入我们？”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17655
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6793555b:

    # "Both Julian and Wolf look up at you when they realize you're there."
    "“Julian和Wolf这才发现你来了，都抬起头看着你。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:17657
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3c69da27:

    # p "That was the plan, if everyone's alright with me around?"
    p "计划是这样，就看大家伙儿能不能接受我了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17671
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9ec3da25:

    # w "Would it really stop you if I said no?"
    w "要是我说不行，你能听我的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17678
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ce71ef07:

    # p "Of course. If you have something against me being here, I don't mind leaving you all to it."
    p "那当然。如果你们谁对我有意见，我立马走，绝不碍你们的事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17680
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4ed197e1:

    # p "I would like it if I could stay, but not against anyone's will."
    p "我当然想留下，但绝不想惹任何人不高兴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17682
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c629976f:

    # p "Do you have anything against me staying?"
    p "你是不是不想让我留下？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17688
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3e6956dc:

    # "You can see his eyes narrow and the folds of a snarl appear across his muzzle, just short of actually showing teeth."
    "你能看到他眼睛眯了起来，鼻子也皱了起来，像是要龇牙咧嘴地咆哮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17690
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1085c598:

    # w "I do"
    w "我就是不想让你留下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17696
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0e281262:

    # "Well... you said you would honor his wish... Even if it stings...{p} You look over to Julian to search for any help."
    "可是... 你说过会尊重他的意愿... 就算心里不好受...{p} 你转头看向 Julian，希望能得到点帮助。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17700
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4dfae427:

    # "He blinks and gives you a sympathetic shrug to show that it's not his decision to make."
    "他眨巴眨巴眼，无奈地耸了耸肩，意思是这事儿他说了不算。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17704
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4266dce5:

    # j "Sorry, if he doesn't want you here, there's nothing I can do about it. It's his lesson."
    j "抱歉，如果他不想让你在这儿，我也没办法。这是他的功课。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17708
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_247da0fa:

    # "Well... you said you would honor his wish... Even if it stings... You look over to Julian as you search for any help, but all the help you get from him is a noncommital shrug."
    "可是... 你说过会尊重他的意愿... 就算心里不好受... 你转头看向 Julian 寻求帮助，但他只是无所谓地耸了耸肩，一点忙都帮不上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17710
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f592e18d:

    # "He's not going to fight for you to stay."
    "他根本不会帮你争取留下来的机会。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17712
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_74b01ec6:

    # "You can't help but feel deflated, but what can you do? You said you would leave and he told you so... You keep your word and leave the group to their lesson, instead just trying to get some sleep."
    "你心里难免有些失落，但又能怎么样呢？ 你自己说过会离开的，而且他都这么说了... 你只好遵守承诺，离开他们，让他们自己去学习，你则打算找个地方睡一觉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17720
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3e6956dc_1:

    # "You can see his eyes narrow and the folds of a snarl appear across his muzzle, just short of actually showing teeth."
    "你能看到他眼睛眯了起来，鼻子也皱了起来，像是要龇牙咧嘴地咆哮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17724
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4521f9bc:

    # "He wants to say he does, that much you can feel, but he doesn't, and so you join in with them."
    "你能感觉到，他心里是想让你留下的，但他嘴上不说。于是你也加入了他们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17731
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9ac6c5d6:

    # p "Of course not. Come on, you can't seriously tell me to leave..."
    p "别开玩笑了。 拜托，你不会真让我走吧..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17733
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_8f3aa25b:

    # p "I just want to watch, that's no crime, is it?"
    p "我就是想看看，这又没犯法，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17737
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3e6956dc_2:

    # "You can see his eyes narrow and the folds of a snarl appear across his muzzle, just short of actually showing teeth."
    "你能看到他眼睛眯了起来，鼻子也皱了起来，像是要龇牙咧嘴地咆哮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17739
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1f8e6de6:

    # w "Leave."
    w "滚！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17741
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_43cc34db:

    # p "Really?"
    p "真的假的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17745
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a95dd655:

    # "With your arms outstretched, you try to defuse the situation and step forward to take your seat."
    "你张开双臂，想缓和一下气氛，然后往前走想找个地方坐下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17747
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1f8e6de6_1:

    # w "Leave."
    w "滚！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17749
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_309ec43c:

    # p "Oh, don't be like th-"
    p "别这样..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17759
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c63e19b3:

    # "Wolf jumps to his feet before you can finish your sentence and in a flash you feel a harsh pull on your collar. The world fades into a blur for a moment and when you come to, you feel yourself pressed against the mast."
    "你话还没说完，Wolf 猛地跳了起来，你瞬间感到衣领被人狠狠地拽住。眼前模糊了一下，回过神来，你已经被压在了桅杆上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17769
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_8020ac21:

    # b "Ey, Wolf.{w} Easy."
    b "喂，Wolf！{w} 冷静点！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17771
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ae60b3b1:

    # "The sight you have is nothing but black fur, the feeling of his warm breath washing over your bared neck as he pushes close to you, his knuckles pressing firmly against your sternum."
    "你看到的只有一片黑色的毛发，感受到他滚烫的呼吸喷在你裸露的脖子上，他紧紧地逼近，指关节狠狠地抵着你的胸口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17773
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9e133268:

    # "You can only raise your hands defensively as Bandile tries to reign in the canine with a firm undertone in his voice."
    "你只能举起双手自卫，Bandile 则在一旁语气坚定地试图控制住 Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17777
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_990a5680:

    # "Seniority seems to calm things down after a few seconds as the grip on your collar eases."
    "资历老就是管用，几秒钟后，你衣领上的力道就松了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17779
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9e2c8686:

    # "It does get the point across however...{p}You are not wanted here this evening..."
    "但这也让你彻底明白了...{p}今晚这里不欢迎你..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17781
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_97798928:

    # "You know your limits, and they're most certainly reached at this point, so you follow along with Wolf's wish and leave them alone, instead just trying to get some sleep in the time you have left."
    "你知道自己几斤几两，现在这情况明显已经超出你能承受的范围了，所以你还是听 Wolf 的，离他们远点吧，趁着还有时间，赶紧找个地方睡觉去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17786
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1f9dabdc:

    # "You get no complaint from him and wait a moment to see if anyone else has anything against your presence before sitting down with them."
    "他没说什么，你等了一会儿，看看还有没有人反对你留下来，这才放心地和他们坐在一起。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17788
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_165ddc3e:

    # "It does leave you feeling a little unprepared when you see Julian and Wolf sitting on a crate they must have brought down from below. Even Bandile has found a place to sit on the fife rails of the foremast."
    "看到 Julian 和 Wolf 竟然坐在一个不知从哪儿搬来的板条箱上，你心里还是有点不是滋味。 甚至连 Bandile 也在前桅的横木上找到了座位。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17792
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c8f02f01:

    # "Oh well... the floor will do for you."
    "唉...看来只能睡地板了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17804
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f61b8f1d:

    # p "How are they doing? Have they been at each other's throats yet?"
    p "他们怎么样了？已经开始互相开战了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17808
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ecb9e277:

    # b "Nothing yet, why? Should they be?"
    b "还没呢，怎么了？你很希望他们打起来？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17810
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_64710104:

    # p "Oh, they can't stand each other..."
    p "哦，他们俩互相看不顺眼呗..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17814
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_befe474d:

    # p "You went ahead and asked in the end, Wolf?"
    p "Wolf，你还是问了啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17816
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_2785318e:

    # "Apparently you are not to be graced by an answer from him."
    "看来他是不会搭理你了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17820
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_211b9545:

    # p "See? You're not the only one getting the silent treatment..."
    p "看吧？又不是只有你被他无视。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17832
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d6f5c6e7:

    # "You feel Julian tap you on the leg to get your attention. He holds the fife to his lips to mime a brief bout of playing, before pointing it at the canine beside him."
    "你感觉到Julian拍了拍你的腿，想引起你注意。他把横笛放到嘴边比划了几下，又指了指旁边的家伙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17834
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3ff9af19:

    # p "Wolf...{w} Don't you want to allow him to speak for this?"
    p "Wolf...{w} 你不想让他自己说吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17844
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_096e61d9:

    # w "Absolutely not."
    w "绝对不要。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17846
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_cb5c7302:

    # p "How is he supposed to teach you {i}anything{/i} like this?"
    p "这样他要怎么教你{i}东西{/i}啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17850
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0132350d:

    # "Wolf turns to you with a glint of satisfaction in his smirk."
    "Wolf转过头来，冲你得意地笑了笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17852
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_2f0ecc7e:

    # w "He thinks himself clever.{w} He'll find a way."
    w "他觉得自己挺聪明。{w} 他总会有办法的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17864
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6089762b:

    # "Julian taps you again and repeats the gesture, adding himself pointing from his own eyes back to Wolf."
    "Julian又拍了拍你，重复之前的动作，先是指指自己的眼睛，又指指Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17871
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c7a1f7cd:

    # "You sigh through your pursed lips as you're settled with helping these fools navigate their own stubbornness..."
    "唉，看来我真是吃力不讨好，还得帮你们这些犟驴解决问题..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17882
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_cb08a684:

    # "You look at Julian for confirmation and he shakes his head, points more animatedly at Wolf, before miming himself playing the fife again."
    "你看向Julian，想确认一下，他摇摇头，更起劲地指着Wolf，又比划着自己吹横笛的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17884
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6d4a486a:

    # p "So you want {i}him{/i} to play it?"
    p "所以你是想让{i}他{/i}来吹？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17888
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_31b06bea:

    # "This time you get an affirmative nod from him."
    "这回他使劲点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17896
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_faf09599:

    # "You look at Julian for confirmation and he nods his head emphatically."
    "你看向Julian，想确认一下，他一个劲儿地点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17908
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e154c2a4:

    # "Julian leans over to hand Wolf the fife, before leaning back again to watch him have a go."
    "Julian俯身把横笛递给Wolf，然后往后一靠，看他怎么弄。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17924
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9efab905:

    # j "Where have you been? I would have told you if I'd known you were interested."
    j "你跑哪儿去了？早知道你感兴趣我就告诉你了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17928
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a729c691:

    # p "I just jumped out of my hammock.{w} Couldn't sleep and heard your playing just now."
    p "我刚从吊床上爬起来。{w} 睡不着，就听到你刚才的动静了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17930
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1fde3bc3:

    # p "At least I'm assuming it was you, unless you're the world's greatest teacher and you've already got Wolf to play a treat for us."
    p "就算不是你，除非你是神仙下凡，已经教会Wolf，让他给我们露一手了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17935
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1adcd512:

    # j "What do you mean, {i}unless{/i}?{p}I'll get Wolf to play this baby in no time, you'll see!"
    j "你这话什么意思，{i}除非{/i}？{p}我保证很快就能教会Wolf吹这玩意儿，你就瞧好吧！"

# game/script day2.rpy:17945
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1409460c:

    # w "Don't call it a baby... Something about that doesn't sit right with me."
    w "别叫它玩意儿... 听着怪怪的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17947
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_af19914b:

    # b "Instead of talking about what a great teacher you are, you could just get on with it, Jules."
    b "与其吹嘘自己有多厉害，不如赶紧开始吧，Jules。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17951
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bab19521:

    # "Julian hands the instrument back to Wolf, who immediately makes sure to wipe off any spit that might have stuck to it."
    "Julian把乐器还给Wolf，Wolf立马擦掉了可能沾在上面的口水。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17953
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_de963d74:

    # j "Just, hmm... I guess you just go ahead and play whatever you can play? So that I can see what you already know."
    j "嗯... 你随便吹两下，让我听听你都会什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17957
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_cb5c5c3b:

    # "The canine takes the fife and lays it to his lips, looking over at Julian with a hint of uncertainty."
    "那家伙接过横笛，放到嘴边，有些犹豫地看着Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17959
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ef7f93c4:

    # "But instead of trying to play he lowers the instrument again."
    "结果他没吹，又把乐器放下了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17963
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_31f3fada:

    # w "Can I just say that I know nothing instead of making a fool of myself in front of them?"
    w "我能不能直接说我啥都不会，省得在他们面前丢人现眼？"

# game/script day2.rpy:17967
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0ddda0eb:

    # w "The person I got it from never actually managed to sit down with me and, well... I tried, but..."
    w "给我这东西的人一直没空教我，而且...我试过了，但是..."

# game/script day2.rpy:17969
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f9597596:

    # w "I can't even get a proper sound out of it."
    w "我根本就没法让它好好出个声儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17974
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_90e3889a:

    # b "Hey, that makes two of us, mate."
    b "嘿，哥们儿，我也是这么想的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17976
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_23459076:

    # p "Three, you're in good company."
    p "算我一个，你可不是孤单一人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17982
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_13fa2602:

    # "Julian nods and raises both hands as if holding a fife, urging Wolf to do the same."
    "Julian点点头，双手举起，比划着像是在拿横笛，示意Wolf也学着做。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17984
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_079569d4:

    # "The canine needs a moment to understand and brings the instrument to his lips as Julian had just done, his eyes fixed on the lizard to wait for further instructions."
    "这只大狗琢磨了一会儿才明白，学着Julian的样子把乐器凑到嘴边，眼睛直勾勾地盯着蜥蜴，等它 आगे 指示。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17988
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4cf2a216:

    # "The lizard leans forward, points to his snout and slowly pulls the edges of his scaled lips back a little, leaving a small, tightly pursed opening between them at the front."
    "蜥蜴 наклоняется вперед，指了指自己的鼻子，缓缓向后拉扯着它那布满鳞片的嘴唇，在前端露出了一个小小的、紧紧抿着的缝隙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17990
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3d4c29dd:

    # "He makes a point of slowly turning his head. First to the left, then to the right, giving Wolf as full a view as possible, before blowing a sharp stream of air."
    "他还特意慢慢转动脑袋。先往左，再往右，让Wolf能看个 पूरी तरह से，然后猛地吹出一口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:17994
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e4aeba1b:

    # "Wolf tries his best to follow the instructions, moving his lips until he notices Julian's animated approval."
    "Wolf старается 尽力按照指示 움직이다 嘴唇，直到他看到Julian眉飞色舞地表示赞许。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18000
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_2852f06d:

    # j "Well, that's easy then, let's start right from the beginning."
    j "好，那就简单了，咱们从头开始吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18002
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_50c239cd:

    # j "First, put it to your lips like I did before..."
    j "首先，像我这样，把嘴唇贴上去..."

# game/script day2.rpy:18004
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_daa7e5d3:

    # "Julian watches as Wolf raises the instrument again and reaches over to adjust Wolf's grip and positioning of the fife until he is happy with how the canine is holding it."
    "Julian看着Wolf再次举起横笛，然后伸手过去调整他的握姿和横笛的位置，直到满意为止。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18006
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4932ae53:

    # j "Just like that. Remember how you're holding it right now."
    j "就这样。记住你现在的握法。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18008
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c661118e:

    # j "Now, and I know this may be an impossible task to ask of you, but pull your lips back like a smile. You know, the thing you do when you're h-a-p-p-..."
    j "接下来，我知道这可能有点难为你，不过尽量把嘴角往上扬，像微笑那样。就是你感到开心的时候，会露出的表情..."

# game/script day2.rpy:18012
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7c812610:

    # "Wolf's gaze sharpens."
    "Wolf的眼神锐利了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18014
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6a8a8e18:

    # p "Julian..."
    p "Julian..."

# game/script day2.rpy:18018
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_88f4d67e:

    # j "Have you ever seen him smile?{w} Fine, I'm sorry.{p}Corners of your lips back, and a pressed together more sharply at the front..."
    j "你见过他笑吗？{w} 好吧，算我胡说。{p}嘴角向后，嘴唇要往前抿紧..."

# game/script day2.rpy:18020
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_748129da:

    # p "Several times at your misfortune, yes."
    p "倒霉的时候倒是见过几次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18025
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3078c216:

    # "Wolf tries his best to follow the instructions, moving his lips until Julian blurts out his approval."
    "Wolf努力按照指示移动嘴唇，直到Julian出声表示可以了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18035
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1adf5c72:

    # "Both you and Bandile watch closely and Bandile even goes ahead and tries to mimic Julian's directions himself."
    "你和Bandile都仔细地看着，Bandile甚至还抢先模仿Julian的动作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18050
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_8e671ba0:

    # "If both Bandile and Wolf are following along, why not you, too?"
    "既然Bandile和Wolf都学着做了，你怎么不试试？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18052
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1b6a5cfd:

    # "You try to pull your lips back as described until you hope you look about the same as the others."
    "你试着按照他说的向后咧嘴，希望能看起来和其他人一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18056
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_5ee56e7b:

    # "You decide to leave the weird grimaces to the other two and just watch quietly as they try to imitate Julian."
    "你决定把这奇怪的表情留给他们俩，自己在一旁安静地看他们模仿Julian。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18065
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_66cf4a35:

    # "Julian takes a moment to inspect you and Bandile and gives you both a thumbs up, repeating himself by blowing air through his lips to show that you are all ready to actually try and get a note out of the instrument."
    "Julian仔细看了看你和Bandile，然后朝你们竖起大拇指，还吹了口气，示意你们可以试着吹响乐器了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18069
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e6e595e9:

    # "Julian takes a moment to inspect Bandile and gives him a thumbs up, repeating himself by blowing air through his lips to show that they are both ready to actually try and get a note out of the instrument."
    "Julian仔细看了看Bandile，然后朝他竖起大拇指，还吹了口气，示意他们可以试着吹响乐器了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18072
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_15c719bd:

    # j "Like that, yes, yes."
    j "对，对，就这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18076
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9c9299c4:

    # j "And now just try to blow air through it. Probably a bit easier for Wolf to tell if he's doing it right than for you two, given that he'll jus-"
    j "现在试着往里面吹气。考虑到Wolf会...-"

# game/script day2.rpy:18080
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_8e292893:

    # j "And now just try to blow air through it. Probably a bit easier for Wolf to tell if he's doing it right than for you, Bandile, given that he'll jus-"
    j "现在试着往里面吹气。考虑到Wolf会...-"

# game/script day2.rpy:18091
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_5b6257e9:

    # "A rather awkward, misshapen tone of the fife fills the air as Wolf attempts his first note. Clearly sounding like he doesn't quite have the hang of it yet."
    "Wolf尝试吹出第一个音符，但那音调实在难听又跑调。听起来他还没掌握诀窍。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18099
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f1fffa44:

    # "The lizard tilts his head to the side quizzically, trying to figure out what went wrong. He sits up straight, his whole body tensing for a moment, only to show himself exhaling and relaxing."
    "蜥蜴好奇地歪着头，想知道哪里不对。他坐直身体，全身紧绷了一下，然后又呼气放松。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18101
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7583b579:

    # p "I think he wants you to relax, Wolf."
    p "我觉得他是想让你放松点，Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18105
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_172e26ac:

    # j "Try it a bit more relaxed?"
    j "要不试着再放松点？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18112
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0811b25e:

    # "Wolf attempts it once again, although it also just sounds like the tone from before."
    "Wolf又试了一遍，听起来还跟刚才一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18124
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_15c16cb5:

    # "He continues his pantomime, showing himself easing up to deflate even more. Almost crumbling into a lump of lizard on the floor."
    "他继续用手势比划，演示自己放松的样子，甚至都快泄气了，感觉要瘫成地板上一滩蜥蜴了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18135
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_afb9b764:

    # "You get a nod of approval from him as you successfully translate his directions."
    "你成功理解了他的意思，他满意地点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18137
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_82223826:

    # w "I ahn relaksht..."
    w "我…我很放松了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:18139
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_334f8f5f:

    # "Wolf replies, trying not to give up the position of his lips, almost causing you to lose your composure."
    "Wolf回答道，紧紧抿着嘴，差点没把你逗乐。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18149
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_aeb5d85a:

    # w "He can fuck off then! I'm trying." with hpunch
    w "让他滚一边去！我已经在努力了！" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:18151
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ef2fadb4:

    # "Wolf speaks over the fife, careful not to move it from the correct position."
    "Wolf一边吹着横笛，一边没好气地说，尽量不让横笛的位置有偏差。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18159
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7ddd8a5d:

    # "Julian desperately waves his hands in defence as the whites of his eyes find you in an annoyed glare. He repeats the gesture with his eyes closed, trying to look as serene as possible." with dissolve
    "Julian吓得赶紧摆手，眼珠子都快瞪出来了，恼火地看着你。他闭上眼睛又做了个手势，努力装出一副若无其事的样子。" with dissolve

# game/script day2.rpy:18161
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_af56d3a1:

    # b "He wants you to relax even more, I think."
    b "我觉得，他是想让你再放松点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18165
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_653fd2d3:

    # w "Tell him I am relaxed!"
    w "告诉他我放松得很！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18167
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_129ae0b9:

    # b "Julian, he is relaxed."
    b "Julian，他已经放松了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18172
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_483ad7c8:

    # "Julian raises his hands in disbelief and shakes his head quickly. He tries again and closes his eyes, trying to look as calm as possible." with dissolve
    "Julian难以置信地举起双手，飞快地摇了摇头。他再次尝试，闭上眼睛，努力装出平静的样子。" with dissolve

# game/script day2.rpy:18174
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_434de978:

    # b "I think he's trying to show himself relaxing? Maybe he wants you to relax even more?"
    b "我觉得他是在演示自己怎么放松？也许他是想让你更放松一点？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18178
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_62dc2701:

    # "The lizard snaps out of his serene posture and gestures wildly at the rabbit." with hpunch
    "那蜥蜴一改刚才若无其事的样子，冲着兔子一顿比划。" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:18180
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_653fd2d3_1:

    # w "Tell him I am relaxed!"
    w "告诉他我放松得很！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18182
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_129ae0b9_1:

    # b "Julian, he is relaxed."
    b "Julian，他已经放松了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18186
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_eac2331c:

    # j "More relaxed?" with dissolve
    j "还要更放松？" with dissolve

# game/script day2.rpy:18188
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f03b0154:

    # j "Sorry, I've never tried to teach this before."
    j "哎，不好意思，我也是头一回教这个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18192
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_82223826_1:

    # w "I ahn relaksht..."
    w "我…我很放松了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:18194
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_334f8f5f_1:

    # "Wolf replies, trying not to give up the position of his lips, almost causing you to lose your composure."
    "Wolf回答道，紧紧抿着嘴，差点没把你逗乐。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18200
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9683efd8:

    # "The lizard, sunken in thought, crosses his arms for a second before drawing your attention with a bump of his fist."
    "那蜥蜴陷入沉思，抱了会儿胳膊，然后敲了敲拳头，吸引你的注意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18206
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e1f16c52:

    # "He points at Wolf, leans forward and takes the fife from his hands before blowing through his own lips again."
    "他指了指Wolf，凑上前去，从他手里拿过横笛，又自己吹了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18210
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_8d443ddf:

    # w "So you want me to try it without the fife?" with dissolve
    w "你是想让我不用横笛试试？" with dissolve

# game/script day2.rpy:18214
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_381ce655:

    # "Julian nods."
    "Julian点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18218
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_77e8dcc3:

    # "As Wolf does as he is told, Julian holds his hand out in front of him, feeling for the stream of cool air coming out between the canine's lips."
    "Wolf照做了，Julian便把手伸到他嘴边，感受着这犬科动物嘴里呼出的气流。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18222
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_13e38e6f:

    # "He snaps his fingers once he figures out what Wolf is doing wrong and makes a pointing motion going from his mouth and then downwards."
    "他一下子就明白了Wolf的问题所在，弹了下手指，然后做了个手势，示意他把气往下吹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18224
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ad15722e:

    # p "So, try blowing a bit more downward?"
    p "那就是说，往下吹一点试试？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18228
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f80a9322:

    # "Once again you see him nod affirmatively."
    "你又看到他肯定地点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18239
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_32bda8b1:

    # "Wolf brings the fife to his lips again for another try, but as before, without much success."
    "Wolf再次把横笛凑到嘴边，想再试一次，结果还跟之前一样，没什么起色。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18243
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0d0a178c:

    # "Julian pulls back one side of his lips before making the same motion again to emphasize the downward motion of it."
    "Julian撇开一边嘴角，又重复了一遍刚才的动作，强调要往下吹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18248
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_776b9eeb:

    # w "I'm trying, shut up."
    w "我已经在努力了，别吵吵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18250
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_02abda4e:

    # "A soft chuckle escapes you as you watch a very confused Julian spread his arms and look down at you in bewilderment."
    "Julian一脸懵逼地张开双手，茫然地看着你，你忍不住噗嗤一声笑了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18256
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c15cf946:

    # "Several more attempts follow, but each one fails to produce a correct sound. The visible frustration on his face increases with each try."
    "接下来又试了几次，但每次都吹不出正确的调。他越吹越不对劲，脸上的沮丧也越来越明显。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18258
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fe144718:

    # b "Maybe try without the fife? It might just distract you whenever you're not hearing the right tone."
    b "要不，你先别用横笛试试？ 也许听不到准音的时候，它反而会让你更分心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18268
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_83a5a398:

    # "Wolf makes one last frustrated attempt before shoving the fife to the rabbit sitting opposite of him."
    "Wolf 气得又试了一次，还是不行，干脆把横笛塞给坐在对面的兔子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18274
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9138d997:

    # w "Let's see you try it then!"
    w "你行你上啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18276
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7d754adb:

    # "All eyes immediately turn to Bandile, his ears wilting in surprise as he is being cast into the center of attention all of a sudden."
    "大家一下子都看向了Bandile，他被这突如其来的关注吓了一跳，耳朵都耷拉了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18278
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_76cc049e:

    # b "Me? Uh, sure, let's see."
    b "我？ 呃，好吧，我试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18282
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_2b54fab0:

    # "And just like that, with a surprising ease, Bandile manages to produce a perfect tone on his very first try."
    "结果Bandile 居然出乎意料地轻松，第一次就吹出了完美的音调。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18288
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_979992b4:

    # j "Oh, erm... take the fife away for a moment and blow again."
    j "哦，额…你先把横笛拿开，再吹一下试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18290
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d748a777:

    # "The lizard moves his hand around in front of Wolf until he can feel the cold stream of air, snapping his fingers as he apparently has a new idea of what might be causing the misshapen sound."
    "蜥蜴在Wolf面前挥了挥手，直到感觉到有凉风吹过，然后突然打了个响指，好像是找到了声音不对的原因。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18296
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f04a98a6:

    # j "Right, I think you are aiming too high. Try angling it so that you're blowing a little bit more downward instead."
    j "这样，我觉得你找的角度太高了。 你试试往下压一点，冲下吹气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18298
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_80d114db:

    # j "Go on, try it again with the fife."
    j "来吧，用横笛再试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18304
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_721d5282:

    # "You test it yourself by putting your own paw in front of you and moving the airflow up and down your hand."
    "你自己也抬起爪子试了试，感受气流在手上来回移动。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18315
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4eff856a:

    # "Wolf brings the fife to his lips once more for another attempt, but just as before, without a whole lot of success."
    "Wolf 再次把横笛放到嘴边，想再试一次，结果还是老样子，不太成功。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18319
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3945cba8:

    # j "No, down!"
    j "不，往下！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18323
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4a37666b:

    # "Wolf stops his attempt and raises his chops into a snarl."
    "Wolf 停了下来， 龇牙咧嘴地发起狠来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18325
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_681e2707:

    # w "I'm trying, shut up!"
    w "我在试了， 闭嘴！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18330
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c15cf946_1:

    # "Several more attempts follow, but each one fails to produce a correct sound. The visible frustration on his face increases with each try."
    "接下来又试了几次，但每次都吹不出正确的调。他越吹越不对劲，脸上的沮丧也越来越明显。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18334
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_829e68c6:

    # j "No, not like that. Don't move your head."
    j "不，不是那样！ 头别动！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18338
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0c77d2f4:

    # j "Maybe try without the fife? Just feel with your hand where you're blowing. That way the other two can have a go as well."
    j "要不你先别用横笛？ 就用手感觉一下你往哪儿吹气。 这样，他们两个也能试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18342
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_12589b7e:

    # j "Maybe try without the fife? Just feel with your hand where you're blowing. Then Bandile can have a go, too."
    j "要不你先别用横笛？ 就用手感觉一下你往哪儿吹气。 Bandile也能试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18352
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_83a5a398_1:

    # "Wolf makes one last frustrated attempt before shoving the fife to the rabbit sitting opposite of him."
    "Wolf 气得又试了一次，还是不行，干脆把横笛塞给坐在对面的兔子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18359
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a0d66f63:

    # w "Fucking hell, lizard. \"Down, no, down,\" I'm trying!{p}It's not working!"
    w "操，你这蜥蜴！ “往下，不是，往下！” 我他妈在试了！{p} 就是不行啊！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18369
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_917e0f7d:

    # j "Because you're not doing it right!{p}If you did, it would work."
    j "还不是因为你没做对！{p} 你要是做对了， 肯定行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18379
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_8f0bea3d:

    # w "Maybe if you explained it better. Relaxed, down, what am I supposed to do with that?"
    w "你要是能好好说清楚点就好了。 放松，往下， 我到底要怎么做啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18389
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c2de2454:

    # j "Follow the instructions, duh! It's a direction. How much clearer do you want me to be?{p} Dear Lord... I didn't realize you were th-"
    j "照着指示做啊，笨蛋！ 这就是个方向。 你还想让我说多明白？{p}  哎哟，我的天… 我还真没看出来你这么…"

# game/script day2.rpy:18391
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_18b98936:

    # p "Calm down you two..."
    p "你们两个都冷静点…"

# game/script day2.rpy:18402
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d865b731:

    # "The moment is disarmed by the high pitched tone of the fife before either of them can bark out another word at the other."
    "还没等他们互相开骂，横笛突然发出的高音就化解了这场争吵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18404
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_2856bd81:

    # "All eyes immediately turn to Bandile who, without much effort, manages to produce a clean tone at the first attempt."
    "大家立刻看向Bandile， 他毫不费力地第一次就吹出了清晰的音调。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18411
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_528286e5:

    # "He looks just as startled as the rest of you. His eyes wide open as you all stare at him, his expression melting into a smile."
    "他看起来和你们一样吃惊。 你们都盯着他看，他眼睛睁得大大的，表情慢慢变成了微笑。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18417
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_05cdcb6a:

    # b "Hayibo! Not bad, eh?"
    b "Hayibo（南非俚语表惊讶，不敢相信）! 吹得不错嘛，嗯？ "

# game/script day2.rpy:18421
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ed4fb4a6:

    # p "Oh my! First try, Bandile!"
    p "哎呀！ Bandile你第一次就成功了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18423
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6e92ee92:

    # "Julian's thrilled by Bandile's immediate success and gestures for him to do it again."
    "Julian 看到Bandile 这么快就成功了， 特别高兴， 赶紧示意他再来一次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18427
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bc154fbb:

    # "Bandile does just as encouraged and repeats his performance. Once again with success, although the tone does crumble at the end when he trails off."
    "Bandile听话地照做，再次尝试。又一次成功了，不过在结尾渐渐弱下去的时候破音了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18431
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0b807656:

    # p "Are you sure you're not lying to us about this being your first attempt?"
    p "你确定这不是你第一次吹？别是忽悠我们呢吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18435
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_53c58d6d:

    # j "Not bad? You got it on the first try! Do it again!"
    j "不错啊！第一次就成了！再来一个！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18439
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d577eee6:

    # "Bandile does just as he is encouraged to do, and repeats his performance. Once again with success, although the tone does crumble at the end when he trails off."
    "Bandile听话地照做，再次尝试。又一次成功了，不过在结尾渐渐弱下去的时候破音了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18443
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_5ab9478a:

    # j "You're sure you have never done this before?"
    j "你肯定以前没吹过这玩意儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18445
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1f4f7dfe:

    # "He shakes his head, sending his ears weaving from left to right."
    "他摇了摇头，脑袋摇得像拨浪鼓。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18449
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d8185ac3:

    # b "Never. Here you give it a try, [name]."
    b "没吹过。来，[name]，你试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18455
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_dc1418b2:

    # "Next in line to be handed the fife, and after Bandile's immediate success, you can feel the pressure building in your chest."
    "轮到你来试试了，[name]。有了Bandile珠玉在前，你感到胸口一阵压力。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18457
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_b0e3083e:

    # "You feel their eyes on you as you take the metal instrument and bring it to your lips, warm to the touch by now from everyone else. You adjust it, your shoulders and your lips, until you feel like you've got everything in the right position."
    "你拿起这根被大家摸得发热的金属横笛，感觉所有人的目光都集中在你身上。你调整着嘴唇和肩膀，直到找到最合适的位置。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18461
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_76931537:

    # "Your first attempt goes about as badly as expected, and all you produce is the sound of a wet whimper."
    "第一次尝试和你预想的一样糟糕，你只吹出了像小狗一样的呜咽声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18473
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_74cb42d5:

    # "Julian waves briefly to get your attention before reaching for his lips to press them together."
    "Julian挥了挥手，示意你注意，然后抿了抿嘴唇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18477
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3f61d1f9:

    # j "Press your lips together more firmly. {w}Not much, just a little."
    j "嘴唇再压紧一点。不用太用力，稍微用点力就行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18479
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_577c99bf:

    # "He demonstrates on the spot, with two sharp puffs of air in quick succession, and you inhale deeply for another try."
    "他立刻示范了一下，快速地吹出两口气，你深吸一口气，准备再试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18484
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_98065773:

    # "It sounds better, but it's not quite there yet. Julian encourages you to keep going, looking for just the right position to guide the air."
    "听起来好多了，但还不太对。Julian鼓励你继续，帮你找准送气的姿势。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18488
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1c95a287:

    # "You feel the tone shifting until it suddenly falls into place and the same firm high note that Bandile hit before resonates from the instrument."
    "你感觉音调逐渐转变，突然一下子对了，一声音符从长笛中迸发而出，和刚才Bandile吹出的一样高亢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18495
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_960f2a11:

    # b "There you go!"
    b "这就对了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18499
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_487d5639:

    # "The lizard claps applause at your attempt."
    "蜥蜴拍着爪子为你鼓掌。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18501
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_70a2b445:

    # p "Oh, I got it!"
    p "哦，我明白了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18505
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ff9fb189:

    # j "See, not that difficult, is it?"
    j "瞧，没那么难，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18507
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_143063cc:

    # p "It's not that bad, no."
    p "没那么糟糕，不是吗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18517
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_933554db:

    # w "Well, it's very nice that it comes so easily to you all."
    w "哎呦，看来对你们来说，这玩意儿是挺容易的哈。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18519
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9f136f80:

    # p "Come on Wolf, you're only one step away from getting it yourself."
    p "来吧，Wolf，你离成功只有一步之遥了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18532
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bdcde5dc:

    # "You encourage him warmly and reach over to hand him the fife once more."
    "你热情地鼓励他，然后伸手再次将横笛递给他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18547
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fee3bd31:

    # b "Never.{w} First time."
    b "没吹过。第一次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18557
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_70231a27:

    # "He holds the instrument out to you before quickly realising that you don't want to try it yourself and passes it back to Wolf instead."
    "他把横笛递给你，然后很快意识到你并不想自己尝试，又把横笛还给了Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18567
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bf06c0ca:

    # b "Or did you want to have a go as well, [name]?"
    b "或者，[name]，你也想试试？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18569
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_231abcae:

    # "You wave off the offer."
    "你摆摆手拒绝了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18573
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f17aeefe:

    # p "Thanks, but I'm fine."
    p "谢谢，我没事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18575
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_346cd989:

    # j "See? Not so difficult, is it?"
    j "看到没？没那么难吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18577
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1959bee6:

    # b "It's not so bad, no. But maybe I just got lucky."
    b "没那么糟糕，是。不过可能我只是运气好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18581
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a04b59e1:

    # w "Well, it's nice that it comes so easy to you all."
    w "呵，对你们来说倒是挺容易的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18585
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_622ab5bd:

    # b "Don't worry, man. You'll get it yourself in no time."
    b "别担心，伙计。你很快就能掌握的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18589
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d0e774a3:

    # "Bandile encourages him with a gentle smile and reaches over to hand him the fife again."
    "Bandile 带着温柔的微笑鼓励他，再次把横笛递给他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18594
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fff2fdab:

    # "The canine hesitates for a moment before taking the fife again, black fingers wrapping around it as he cradles it in his lap."
    "狼人犹豫了一下，再次拿起横笛，黑色的手指紧紧握住，像宝贝一样捧在膝盖上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18596
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_766ac378:

    # "You can see it in him just how badly he just wants to get up and leave.{p} He always does.{p} If anything, it's a miracle it's gone on for this long."
    "你看他那样子，恨不得立刻起身走人。{p} 他一直都这样。{p} 能坚持这么久简直是奇迹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18600
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4cbb69da:

    # "But to your surprise, he lifts the fife up again and gives it another shot."
    "但出乎你意料的是，他又拿起横笛，决定再试一次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18606
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a7b50b8a:

    # j "And this time try to aim a bit low-"
    j "这次尽量往低处吹——"

# game/script day2.rpy:18608
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7364f2c6:

    # w "I heard you the first time!"
    w "我早就听到了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18612
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6c35f7bb:

    # "Wolf snaps back at Julian, who raises his hands in defense."
    "Wolf 没好气地顶了 Julian 一句，Julian 连忙举起双手，表示投降。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18618
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c7157a6a:

    # "A deep breath fills Wolf's chest and he tries again, just like before however, it only produces the same limp wheeze of air."
    "Wolf 深吸一口气，再次尝试，但和之前一样，乐器里只发出一阵有气无力的嘶鸣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18626
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3595d4a2:

    # "Anticipating that Wolf would want to stop immediately, Julian swiftly signals with his hand for him to continue, while leaning in close to him to reach under his jaw."
    "Julian 猜到 Wolf 肯定想放弃，便迅速打手势示意他继续，同时身体前倾，伸手托住他的下巴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18630
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bd235462:

    # "You notice the surprise in Wolf's eyes, but he continues as Julian wants him to."
    "你注意到 Wolf 眼中闪过一丝惊讶，但他还是按照 Julian 的指示继续吹奏。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18634
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1946b076:

    # "Julian carefully brings his finger to Wolf's lower lip and presses against it with tender precision, causing Wolf to stop immediately."
    "Julian 小心翼翼地将手指放在 Wolf 的下唇上，精准而轻柔地按压，Wolf 立刻停了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18638
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bb437121:

    # w "What are you... ?"
    w "你想干什么……？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18640
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f79815f5:

    # "Julian motions to him more emphatically, hoping to just keep Wolf going."
    "Julian 更用力地示意他，希望 Wolf 坚持下去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18644
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_17e0af5e:

    # j "Keep going."
    j "继续。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18646
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bb437121_1:

    # w "What are you... ?"
    w "你想干什么……？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18648
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ca07d822:

    # j "Just keep going."
    j "别停。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18652
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_59ecc211:

    # "Slowly, Wolf takes another breath and tries again, continuing as Julian gently presses his lower lip to correct his position."
    "Wolf 慢慢地再次深吸一口气，继续尝试，Julian 则轻柔地按压他的下唇，帮他调整口型。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18656
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0618e5f0:

    # "Gradually, the tone from the instrument changes from a weak flutter of air to a note as pure as the instrument intends it to be."
    "渐渐地，乐器发出的声音从微弱的气流变成了一个纯净的音符，如乐器设计之初所期望的那样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18660
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4089fabb:

    # "Julian's finger lingers on the canine's lips for a moment before sliding away, leaving him to play the note himself."
    "Julian 的手指在那狼人的嘴唇上停留了片刻，然后滑开，让他自己吹奏这个音符。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18665
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d3d08f9b:

    # "His ears slowly perk up as the realization comes to him that he's doing it all by himself. Without Julian's help."
    "他慢慢地竖起耳朵，这才意识到自己完全是靠自己做到的。 没有 Julian 的帮助。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18667
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fbc37582:

    # "You can't help but smile yourself, and Bandile even goes so far as to clap at Wolf's success."
    "你也忍不住笑了出来，Bandile 甚至拍手为 Wolf 的成功喝彩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18669
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_81868101:

    # "Julian spreads his arms at his sides with a broad smile, praising Wolf as his efforts finally pay off."
    "Julian 笑着张开双臂，夸赞 Wolf 的努力终于有了回报。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18677
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7c9c52ca:

    # j "Ey! There you go."
    j "哎！ 这就对了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18679
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_07abc139:

    # b "See? You got it! Easy!"
    b "看到没？ 你做到了！ 很简单吧！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18683
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_2a541ca0:

    # "As you watch him, though, you see the unusual softness of his expression fade. A fleeting moment of uncertainty before he looks down at the instrument."
    "然而，当你看着他时，他脸上那不寻常的柔和表情却消失了。 他脸上闪过一丝不易察觉的犹豫，然后低头看着手中的乐器。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18685
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_55916662:

    # p "Well done, man. Going to be playing the first piece in no time."
    p "干得漂亮，伙计。 很快就能吹第一首曲子了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18687
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9e86d55a:

    # w "I..."
    w "我……"

# game/script day2.rpy:18692
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_dcb5a7d5:

    # w "...That's enough for me."
    w "……我今天就到这儿吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18694
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p "啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18696
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0172e530:

    # w "I said that's enough for me—You can keep going.{p}Just put it back with my belongings later."
    w "我说了，我今天就到此为止了——你们爱吹就继续吹吧。{p}完事儿之后记得放回我包袱里就行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18700
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_53be2421:

    # "Julian raises a brow in his apparent confusion."
    "Julian 扬起眉毛，一脸不解。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18702
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6351f23c:

    # b "You want to stop already? Not even going to give it a second or third try?{p}It'd probably be a good idea just to get more comfortable with it."
    b "这就想放弃了？好歹再试试啊。{p}多练练总没坏处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18709
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c8465684:

    # "He lays the fife in your lap and stands up from his crate, leaving the three of you to watch him walk off and down the stairs into the ship."
    "他把横笛放到你腿上，自己从板条箱上站起身，留下我们三个，看着他走开，下楼进了船舱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18711
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_10012e1f:

    # "Julian looks after him for a while before he turns to you, searching for answers."
    "Julian看着他离开了一会儿，然后转向你，寻找答案。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18715
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_477ae573:

    # j "But you just did it once. It would probably be good to see you do it a few more times and help you."
    j "可你才试了一次。最好多看你吹几次，也好好帮帮你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18722
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c8465684_1:

    # "He lays the fife in your lap and stands up from his crate, leaving the three of you to watch him walk off and down the stairs into the ship."
    "他把横笛放到你腿上，自己从板条箱上站起身，留下我们三个，看着他走开，下楼进了船舱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18730
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e594b856:

    # j "What did I do now?"
    j "我又咋了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18732
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_8fa28cdc:

    # "He stares at you in utter confusion and pivots to Bandile when he realizes that you have no more answer to that than he does."
    "他一脸懵地盯着你，发现你也是一头雾水，就转头看向Bandile。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18734
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d47a8a57:

    # p "I don't know, {i}did{/i} you do something?"
    p "我不知道，{i}你{/i}做了什么吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18738
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_14df12f9:

    # j "What?{w} No! All I did was help guide him to get a tone out of it."
    j "啥？{w} 我可没干啥！ 我就是帮他找找感觉，让他能吹出声来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18742
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bbbd7a6c:

    # j "Nothing more. I swear!"
    j "没有更多了。 我发誓！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18744
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_302b349d:

    # b "And he was doing well, too. He ended up with the nicest tone of all of us."
    b "而且他吹得真不错，是咱们几个里音色最好的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18748
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9d502aa4:

    # j "Yeah, he did great."
    j "是的，他做得很好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18750
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_2b5ee97a:

    # "You pick up the fife in your lap and roll it between your fingertips as you turn to look at the back of the deck where he had gone."
    "你拿起腿上的横笛，在指尖转动着，抬头看向他走去的甲板后方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18777
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_92891bf5:

    # "Julian crosses his arms and drops his head in thought. For a second he raises his hand as if to mime something, only to lower it again to think for a little longer."
    "Julian抱起双臂，低下头思考。 有一秒钟，他抬起手，似乎要模仿什么，但又放下来，思考更长时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18781
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_efca7af6:

    # "A second attempt follows, one hand held across in front of him while the other appears to show some kind of pointing motion across it, only for him to shake his head."
    "紧接着是第二次尝试，一只手横在身前，而另一只手似乎在展示某种指向它的动作，但他摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18783
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c384614c:

    # "The same gesture follows, but this time he points more towards his other hand, prodding the back of it with the tip of his claw while he nodded all the while."
    "同样的姿势，但这次他更多地指向他的另一只手，用爪子的尖端戳着它的背面，同时他一直点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18787
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0dcb3b23:

    # j "You're not quite hitting the right angle. You're blowing over the fife."
    j "你没有完全找对角度。 你在朝横笛上方吹气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18791
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3159ccfe:

    # "Wolf pauses and lowers the instrument from his lips in irritation."
    "Wolf停顿了一下，烦躁地把乐器从嘴边放了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18801
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e18784f5:

    # "You punctuate your answer with an exasperated sigh as you have to puzzle out these stupid pantomimes once again."
    "你无奈地叹了口气，不得不再次破解这些蠢透了的哑谜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18803
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_17c2116a:

    # p "Do you want him to... uh..."
    p "你是想让他...嗯..."

# game/script day2.rpy:18805
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4083b39f:

    # "You scratch your head as you struggle to put things together."
    "你挠了挠头，努力把事情拼凑起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18807
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_73448229:

    # p "Don't blow over it, but blow into it?"
    p "不要朝它上方吹气，而是朝里面吹气？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18809
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_623a2e6e:

    # p "Come on, this is getting stupid, just fucking say it."
    p "拜托，这越来越蠢了，直接他妈的说出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18811
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3eb27f7d:

    # p "Wolf, I'm not doing this anymore. Either he gets to talk, or you can translate this crap on your own."
    p "Wolf，我不干了。 要么他来说，要么你自己翻译这些废话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18815
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ab5078c2:

    # w "All right, talk. But only for this lesson."
    w "好的，说吧。 但仅限这次课程。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18821
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a43686c8:

    # "Julian lets out a dramatic sigh as he is released from his shackles."
    "Julian从束缚中解脱出来，发出一声夸张的叹息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18823
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fa35aabe:

    # j "Fucking finally."
    j "他妈的终于。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18825
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_20076c1b:

    # j "Thank you.{w} God."
    j "谢谢你。{w} 天啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18827
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0dcb3b23_1:

    # j "You're not quite hitting the right angle. You're blowing over the fife."
    j "你没有完全找对角度。 你在朝横笛上方吹气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18831
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e18784f5_1:

    # "You punctuate your answer with an exasperated sigh as you have to puzzle out these stupid pantomimes once again."
    "你无奈地叹了口气，不得不再次破解这些蠢透了的哑谜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18833
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_17c2116a_1:

    # p "Do you want him to... uh..."
    p "你是想让他...嗯..."

# game/script day2.rpy:18835
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4083b39f_1:

    # "You scratch your head as you struggle to put things together."
    "你挠了挠头，努力把事情拼凑起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18837
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_beb41655:

    # p "Do you want Wolf to press the fife against his chin more firmly?"
    p "你是想让Wolf更用力地把横笛压在他的下巴上吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18843
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d7d31b4b:

    # "The lizard's expression scrunches up into almost a grimace of disgust at just how wrong you somehow managed to interpret it."
    "那蜥蜴皱着脸，一脸嫌弃，好像在说你怎么能理解成这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18845
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6871dbec:

    # p "Oh for fucks sake! Wolf, just let him talk!"
    p "哦，我的老天！ Wolf，让他说吧！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18847
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3eb27f7d_1:

    # p "Wolf, I'm not doing this anymore. Either he gets to talk, or you can translate this crap on your own."
    p "Wolf，我不干了。 要么他来说，要么你自己翻译这些废话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18851
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ab5078c2_1:

    # w "All right, talk. But only for this lesson."
    w "好的，说吧。 但仅限这次课程。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18857
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a43686c8_1:

    # "Julian lets out a dramatic sigh as he is released from his shackles."
    "Julian从束缚中解脱出来，发出一声夸张的叹息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18859
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fa35aabe_1:

    # j "Fucking finally."
    j "他妈的终于。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18861
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_20076c1b_1:

    # j "Thank you.{w} God."
    j "谢谢你。{w} 天啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18863
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0dcb3b23_2:

    # j "You're not quite hitting the right angle. You're blowing over the fife."
    j "你没有完全找对角度。 你在朝横笛上方吹气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18867
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7b05fc65:

    # p "Oh for fucks sake!"
    p "靠！"

# game/script day2.rpy:18869
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_5d45a031:

    # p "I'm not doing this anymore. Wolf, either he gets to talk or I'm leaving and you can translate this crap on your own."
    p "老子不干了！Wolf，要么让他说话，要么我自己走人，这破事儿你自己翻去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18875
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_413ac3cd:

    # w "Do you have any idea how hard I have worked to achieve this blissful silence?"
    w "你知道我费了多大劲儿才换来这清静日子吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18877
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_12ba9393:

    # p "Yes.{w} Not at all, because it was {b}me{/b} who won the game."
    p "知道个屁。{w} 还不是因为{b}我{/b}赢了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18879
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f6d82dab:

    # "Bandile can't help but chuckle in the background of your bickering."
    "你们在那儿吵得不可开交，Bandile在后面都忍不住笑了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18881
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a6f7ce1c:

    # w "Then you should know how difficult it was to come up with something, since you obviously didn't have any ideas and just passed it on to me."
    w "那你也该知道想出点东西有多难，你倒好，啥主意都没有，直接甩给我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18883
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0f87d273:

    # w "But all right, talk. Only for this lesson though."
    w "行吧，说吧。就这一次啊，下不为例。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18887
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6a60a8ba:

    # w "Do you have any idea how hard I have worked to achieve this blissful silence?... All right, talk. But only for this lesson."
    w "你知道我费了多大劲儿才换来这清静日子吗？...... 行吧，说吧。就这一次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18893
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a43686c8_2:

    # "Julian lets out a dramatic sigh as he is released from his shackles."
    "Julian从束缚中解脱出来，发出一声夸张的叹息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18895
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fa35aabe_2:

    # j "Fucking finally."
    j "他妈的终于。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18897
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_20076c1b_2:

    # j "Thank you.{w} God."
    j "谢谢你。{w} 天啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18899
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_dc8f5f37:

    # j "Don't get me wrong, I'm up for all kinds of stupid shit, but teaching a music lesson without being able to speak?"
    j "别误会，我啥蠢事儿都干，可不能说话还教个屁的音乐课？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18903
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fe129ead:

    # j "I mean, if I at least had some paper I could write it down, but I don't really want to waste the few sheets I brought for my letters on {i}this{/i}, you know."
    j "就算有纸能写写画画也行啊，但我可不想把写信那几张宝贝纸浪费在{i}这事儿{/i}上，懂吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18907
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1fc24dd6:

    # j "I'd have to buy new ones, and who knows, I've never been to Morocco, where would I even go there to buy new paper? Do they even {i}use{/i} paper?"
    j "到时候还得买新的，谁知道啊，我又没去过摩洛哥，我上哪儿买新纸去？他们那儿{i}用{/i}纸吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18909
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_959aa1f5:

    # b "You can buy some paper in most ports, don't worry. You can also usually buy some from our officers or our Doc. She always has some in storage, too."
    b "放心吧，大多数港口都能买到纸。而且通常也能从咱们的军官或者医生那儿买到，她那儿总是备着货呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18919
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ab0ee7fa:

    # "You feel Wolf's sharp gaze slowly turning to you."
    "你感觉到Wolf那犀利的眼神慢慢地转向你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18921
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_417f4cc4:

    # w "Do you see what you did?..."
    w "你看看你都干了些什么好事？..."

# game/script day2.rpy:18931
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_458ebaca:

    # j "Anyway..."
    j "算了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:18933
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_74c45bbe:

    # j "Wolf, you're not quite hitting the right angle. You're blowing over the fife."
    j "Wolf，你角度不对，气儿都吹过笛子了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18939
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_662842cc:

    # w "I know that. I just can't get it to work, that's the problem."
    w "我知道啊。就是弄不好，卡在这儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18941
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_5fe8172c:

    # w "You can repeat yourself a dozen times, but if I can't figure it out, it won't help."
    w "你说一百遍也没用，我琢磨不出来啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18978
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9be7c8a3:

    # p "I think I might be able to help.{w} May I?"
    p "我想我能帮上忙。{w} 可以吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:18980
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_749e8bd0:

    # j "Uh, sure."
    j "额，行吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18993
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9b8b4b11:

    # "The lizard dips to the side and lets you slide over to Wolf."
    "那蜥蜴往旁边挪了挪，让你滑到了Wolf旁边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18995
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_63599158:

    # p "Right, blow again, just like before, and just keep going."
    p "好，再吹一次，跟刚才一样，继续吹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18997
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_77b9f7ef:

    # "Initially Wolf wants to raise the fife, but you lay your paw on it to stop him."
    "Wolf刚想抬起笛子，你就把爪子按了上去，阻止了他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:18999
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_27d43e73:

    # p "Without it."
    p "别用笛子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19001
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bb8ce964:

    # "He looks rather uncomfortable having you this close. And not just that, but to have you so close only to stare at his muzzle."
    "你离这么近让他浑身不自在。 不止这样，靠这么近就为了盯着他的嘴看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19003
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_8644ac5c:

    # "Sure put him right on the spot..."
    "这下可把他架在火上烤了..."

# game/script day2.rpy:19007
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_3398b0fd:

    # "You watch closely as he shapes his lips as he's been taught, attempting to get a sound out of the non-existent instrument."
    "你仔细地看着他学着之前教的样子，调整嘴型，想从那不存在的乐器里吹出点儿声响。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19009
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7c11a401:

    # "However, you notice that he simply has difficulty guiding the air with his lower lip. You bring your hand to his mouth, showing it briefly so as not to startle him, and then press it ever so gently against his lower lip."
    "然而，你发现他就是没法用下唇控制气流。你把手放到他嘴边，先晃了一下让他有个准备，然后轻轻地压在他的下唇上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19013
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d6ab618f:

    # "The gleaming white of his eyes catches your attention as they widen at your touch, and you are hardly able to imagine just how much he must want to push you aside..."
    "他那双闪着白光的眼睛因为你的触碰而睁大，你都能感觉到他有多想一把推开你..."

# game/script day2.rpy:19017
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_13c6701d:

    # "But you survive the encounter.{p}Just."
    "但你还是活下来了。{p}好险。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19019
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_11e75ee1:

    # p "Like this. To direct it further down. I think that's what's giving you trouble."
    p "像这样。让气往下走。我觉得问题就出在这儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19021
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_5077dcff:

    # j "Precisely, that's what I meant by angling it down. You don't want it going over the fife. All you get is that wet, mushy sound."
    j "没错，我说的向下倾斜就是这意思。你不能让它盖过横笛，那样声音就糊了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19034
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7037ecaf:

    # "He breaks away from your finger, leaning back until you sit back down on your old spot."
    "他松开你的手指，向后一靠，你也顺势坐回了原来的位置。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19036
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e6e02ce9:

    # w "You can keep your paw to yourself again."
    w "爪子拿开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19038
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_b97b8c2a:

    # w "Don't make a habit of touching me, understand?"
    w "别动手动脚的，懂？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19040
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_aef87465:

    # w "This once. No more."
    w "就这一次，下不为例。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19046
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_723e341b:

    # j "Oh, so you allow him to see you shirtless, but suddenly a touch is too much?"
    j "哟，他光膀子给你看就行，碰一下都不让了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19048
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_15cf676e:

    # w "That is just me keeping up my end of the bargain. Nothing more."
    w "我只是在按约定办事，没别的意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19050
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_41426fc6:

    # j "Sure, whatever you say."
    j "行行行，你说了算。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19057
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c7235bf7:

    # "One more attempt by him, and with your guidance it sounded closer to a real tone. Not only that, but as he keeps adjusting it, you can hear the tone it produces shifting until it snaps into the firm, high note you want it to make!"
    "他再次尝试，在你指导下，这回听着像模像样了！而且，你听，他一调整，音调就在变，最后“啪”一下，成了！就是你要的那种又准又高的音！"

# game/script day2.rpy:19070
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_cb57e031:

    # "Julian is the experienced one here, best to just let him do it instead of inadvertently instilling some bad habits in Wolf."
    "Julian是老手，还是让他来吧，省得把Wolf教坏了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19072
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6ba87f7b:

    # j "It's not that difficult, honestly, you're probably just thinking about it the wrong way."
    j "没那么难，真心的，你就是想岔了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19082
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a9647f67:

    # j "You want to guide it down with your lips, here let me show you."
    j "要用嘴唇带着往下走，来，我给你看看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19086
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_44c532be:

    # "He leans in close and tilts his head back a little to show off his scaled lips. His tail lifting up in the air to keep his balance."
    "他凑过来，微微仰头，亮出长着鳞片的嘴唇，尾巴也翘起来保持平衡。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19088
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_87ca6c4d:

    # j "What you're doing is {i}this{/i}."
    j "你现在是“{i}这样{/i}”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19090
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e0e1e39c:

    # "He blows a few puffs of air through his lips, then he slowly adjusts them so that the stream is slightly downward."
    "他嘟起嘴唇吹了几口气，然后慢慢调整，让气流稍微向下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19092
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fb661d28:

    # j "But {i}this{/i} is where you want it to go, see?"
    j "但得是“{i}这样{/i}”，懂了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19096
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bf7e3010:

    # b "This looks so strange..."
    b "这姿势，怎么看怎么怪……"

# game/script day2.rpy:19098
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d77faf07:

    # "Bandile chimes in with a barely suppressed chuckle."
    "Bandile忍不住笑了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19100
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1d5b6dd9:

    # j "Shush, I know."
    j "闭嘴！"

# game/script day2.rpy:19102
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_e9fe701b:

    # p "It does rather make you look like you just want to give him a smooch."
    p "这姿势，不知道的还以为你要亲他呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19106
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f18c0893:

    # "Wolf growls at you."
    "Wolf冲你低吼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19112
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ed11117f:

    # j "I said {i}shush{/i}. {w}Or I'll throw you out of the classroom."
    j "我让你“{i}闭嘴{/i}”！{w}再闹把你扔出去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19116
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1dea199c:

    # j "Down like this. Not too much, but just a little bit."
    j "往下压一点，像这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19120
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_735c0fdb:

    # "He slowly and deliberately switches between them a few times before Wolf pushes him back onto the box Julian had been sitting on."
    "他慢悠悠地来回演示了几遍，Wolf一把把他推回了Julian刚才坐的箱子上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19126
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7a0afea7:

    # w "Stop that!" with hpunch
    w "别闹了！" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:19130
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1f3e42f3:

    # w "I get it."
    w "我明白了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19132
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_89f0b9e6:

    # j "Do you see what I mean?"
    j "懂了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19134
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_34fbd70d:

    # w "Yes, I think so. And with it, had a closer look at your ugly mug than I ever wanted to have in my life."
    w "是，大概懂了。不过也让我被迫近距离欣赏了你那张臭脸，真是倒了八辈子霉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19144
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a5ecdfe6:

    # j "What? Did you two hear that? Are you telling me that wasn't a {i}textbook{/i} attempt at flirting with him?"
    j "啥？你们俩听见了没？这要不是“{i}教科书{/i}”级别的撩汉，我名字倒过来写！"

# game/script day2.rpy:19149
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_92cfb914:

    # j "And here I though that's how all you wolves are courting their partner, I felt like I almost had him sweep me off my feet."
    j "我还以为狼族都这么求偶呢，差点以为他要直接把我抱走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19151
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0c7d972e:

    # p "I think I am incapable of even imagining Wolf doing that..."
    p "我觉得我压根没法想象 Wolf 会做那种事..."

# game/script day2.rpy:19161
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_bb853849:

    # w "No, usually, it involves a fight until one is left on the ground, bloodied, and writhing in agony.{p}We can try that."
    w "不，一般都得先干上一架，打到一方趴在地上，浑身是血，痛苦地哀嚎。{p}我们可以试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19171
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_48df050d:

    # "Julian tips his head to the side, as if actually considering the offer, before he raises his index finger to speaks up."
    "Julian 歪着头，好像真在考虑这个提议似的，然后抬起一根手指，慢悠悠地说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19173
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_cf115be2:

    # j "You know. I didn't expect that you would actually want to involve me in wolven customs so readily, but after some deliberation I think I'll have to politely decline."
    j "你知道吗，我还真没想到你这么快就想拉我入伙，体验你们狼族的习俗，不过嘛，仔细想了想，我还是得说声抱歉，恕难从命了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19175
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_c5b2b690:

    # j "Though... I don't appear to remember that particular section during my education."
    j "虽说...我怎么记着我学过的东西里没这一条啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19185
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_4157cc40:

    # "Clearly having had enough of this conversation, Wolf goes ahead and brings the fife to his lips once again for his next attempt."
    "显然是被我们聊得够呛，Wolf 啥也没说，直接又把横笛凑到嘴边，打算再试试。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19189
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_a6729bd0:

    # "It's not an immediate success, but from the sounds you can tell that he's adjusting, until finally a proper tone rings true from the instrument."
    "这回也没立马成功，不过听声音就知道他找着感觉了，慢慢地，总算是从那玩意儿里吹出了个像样的调儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19199
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_0b1b4713:

    # "Wolf almost startles himself when he finally manages to get a clean sound out of it. He pauses for a moment before trying again and immediately gets another clean tone."
    "Wolf 好不容易吹出一个干净的音，差点没吓一跳。他愣了一下，又试了一遍，这回立马又是一个清脆的音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19201
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f7d3d52d:

    # b "Wooo! You got it!"
    b "哇哦！吹出来啦！"

# game/script day2.rpy:19211
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fba3ba7c:

    # j "Of course he did. He's learning from a contemporary master!"
    j "那当然，他可是师从我这样的当代大师！"

# game/script day2.rpy:19213
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_fb654bc7:

    # "Julian proudly proclaims, eyes closed, chest raised and his fists steadying his sides."
    "Julian 闭着眼，骄傲地挺起胸膛，双手叉腰，得意洋洋地说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19215
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_df14c9f4:

    # w "Humble as ever."
    w "还是那么谦虚啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19219
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9469a8d3:

    # "His brows rise in quick succession before he opens his eyes again."
    "他眉毛一挑，又睁开了眼睛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19227
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1ae3a6f1:

    # b "But... It was [name] who actually helped him hit the tone."
    b "不过... 其实是[name]帮他找对了音。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19231
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_dd7bc7c0:

    # j "...And his studious assistant."
    j "...还有他那用功的助手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19237
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_46781e8f:

    # j "However I'm not sure we should be doing much more than that. At least for today. It took you a while to get a tone, so I'd say it's probably best if you take a couple of days to practice that."
    j "话是没错...不过我觉得今天就练到这儿差不多得了。你刚开始学，能吹出个调儿就不错了，这几天还是先好好练练，找找感觉吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19239
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_965948e7:

    # j "You know, get you comfortable with it so that I could throw you out of bed and you would still hit the tone perfectly as the first thing you do in the morning."
    j "让你彻底适应适应，省得我哪天把你从被窝里踹起来，你也能立刻吹出个调来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19243
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ba2354e3:

    # w "Sounds like what I would prefer myself."
    w "这主意听着不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19251
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6273a3e1:

    # p "I knew you had enough of us already. You did well, though."
    p "我就知道你早听腻了。不过你小子学得挺快。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19258
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_21368195:

    # j "Already had enough of us?"
    j "听腻了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19262
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_dc11398b:

    # j "You've done well, though."
    j "你学得挺快的，真的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19264
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_aecab5fb:

    # j "I mean it."
    j "我是说真的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19266
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_87133f9f:

    # j "It took me a lot longer to get it right."
    j "我当初可是费了老鼻子劲才学会的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19268
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_81f1ff2b:

    # "Wolf pauses briefly, searches for the right words and ultimately just settling on two simple ones."
    "Wolf 顿了顿，似乎在想该说些什么，最后还是简单地蹦出了几个字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19270
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_de4a10ab:

    # w "Thank you."
    w "谢谢你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19272
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_1c060ee3:

    # b "Are we calling it a day, then? What are you all going to do for the rest of your free time?"
    b "那今天就到这儿？你们接下来打算干嘛去？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19276
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d3afd749:

    # "Julian crosses his arms behind his back and looks up at the sails above."
    "Julian 把手背在身后，抬头望着头顶的船帆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19278
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_40a922d2:

    # j "Honestly? I might just throw myself in the hammock. I'm not sure I can do another shift without getting {i}some{/i} sleep before it."
    j "说实话？我大概要直接躺尸吊床了。不眯一会儿，下一班岗我可遭不住。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19280
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_cfe93bd3:

    # p "I think I'll follow your example for once."
    p "难得啊，我这回也跟你一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19284
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_ca0412a7:

    # j "Didn't I just say that I'm a great teacher? You should follow my example more often."
    j "我不是早就说过了，我可是个好老师！你以后得多跟我学着点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19290
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_d2137c0e:

    # "He pushes himself to his feet and gives you a playful smack on the shoulder."
    "他站起身，笑着拍了拍你的肩膀。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19294
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_5520216f:

    # b "That sounds like the wise choice. I won't keep you then, I still have to clean up anyway.{p}We'll see each other tomorrow."
    b "听起来是个明智的决定。我不打扰你收拾了，咱们明天见。{p}"

# game/script day2.rpy:19309
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_7c904bb5:

    # "Before you go below deck though, Julian helps you up and leans in close to whisper to you once you are on your feet."
    "不过，在你去下层甲板之前，Julian扶你站稳，凑到你耳边小声说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19317
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_84368b57:

    # j "Do you think Wolf was telling the truth about wolven courting habits?"
    j "你说Wolf说的那些关于狼人求偶的鬼话，你真信啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19323
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_02157dc4:

    # p "What? You {i}actually{/i} believed it?"
    p "啥？你{i}还真{/i}信了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19325
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_73a8afde:

    # j "How would I know?!"
    j "我哪儿知道啊？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:19327
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_9faddf4f:

    # p "Oh, I don't know, by using your brain and thinking about it for about... One second."
    p "拜托，动动你那脑子稍微想想也知道了吧... 就一秒钟的事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19331
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_6a07df7c:

    # "You give him a goading slap on the muzzle before you both head off to get some rest."
    "你笑着轻轻拍了一下他的鼻子，然后你们就各自散了去休息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19333
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_f0dc6c0f:

    # j "Coming along, Wolf?"
    j "Wolf，一起不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19338
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_eb2c3805:

    # "You do the same and get up from the ground before you follow Julian down to get some rest."
    "你也从地上爬起来，跟着Julian下去休息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19343
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_de125db5:

    # p "Coming along, Wolf?"
    p "Wolf，一起不？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19349
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_81b55ec6:

    # p "Hmm... I'm not sure this will work as a music lesson when the one student you had is gone."
    p "哎... 他走了，这还怎么上音乐课啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19353
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_5c650193:

    # j "I have you two."
    j "我还有你们俩呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19355
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_bca8b446:

    # b "I don't think either of us are here to {i}actually{/i} learn it. Not like Wolf anyway."
    b "我俩又不是{i}真的{/i}想学，反正跟Wolf那家伙不一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19359
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_03de74d8:

    # j "I have Bandile."
    j "我还有Bandile。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19361
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_9fb393df:

    # b "Sure, but I'm not really here to actually learn it. Not like Wolf anyway."
    b "话是这么说，但我可不是{i}真{/i}想学，反正跟Wolf那家伙不一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19364
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_d4c812db:

    # b "It wasn't what I expected from him, but you two know him better, I don't know."
    b "我真没想到他是这样的人，不过你们比我了解他，我也不好说啥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19368
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_bc4b54d3:

    # j "I wouldn't go that far. We've only known him since the three of us arrived yesterday."
    j "倒也没那么夸张。我们昨天才刚到，认识他也才一天。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19370
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_24e24902:

    # p "Well, I guess I will go after him and give him his fife back. Doesn't sound like we'll be practising much on our own."
    p "哎，我还是去追上他，把他的横笛还给他吧。 看来咱们自己是没法好好练了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19396
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_d1a9c48a:

    # "Your search for him takes you below deck, where your first instinct to check his hammock turns out to be the right one, and you find him resting in it with his elbow draped over his eyes."
    "你下到甲板下面找他，第一个想到的就是他的吊床，结果还真找对了，他正躺在吊床上，胳膊搭在眼睛上睡觉呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19404
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_5dc406a1:

    # w "What is it now?"
    w "又怎么了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19406
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_5caf823b:

    # "He speaks without lifting his arm aside to even look at you."
    "他胳膊都没抬，眼睛都没睁，就直接问你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19408
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_2d4555fe:

    # p "What do you mean, what is it now?"
    p "你这话什么意思，又怎么了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19410
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_dbbc5871:

    # p "You asked Julian to teach you how to play your instrument and then you just up and left in the middle of it."
    p "你让Julian教你吹笛子，结果你给人撂这儿自己跑了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19412
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_7c725f01:

    # p "What do you expect me to do?"
    p "你想让我干嘛？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19414
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_32747ccf:

    # w "For you to put the damn thing down in my bag and walk away, is what I expect you to do."
    w "我以为你会把这玩意儿扔我包里然后走人呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19418
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_dc5d9882:

    # w "But knowing you, you're probably here to play the helpful cat and talk about it."
    w "认识你这么久，你肯定是来当老好人，想开导我的吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19420
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_386f4351:

    # p "Well, that's what I was hoping to do, but I can't exactly force you to sit down with me."
    p "没错，我就是这么想的，但我又不能逼着你跟我一块儿坐下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19422
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_72d455e2:

    # p "If you ever want to though, you can always come by."
    p "你要是想学，随时都可以来找我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19431
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_4a489d44:

    # "You bend down and carefully tuck the fife into his simple linen bag, making sure that it won't fall out by accident. The brief glimpse you get of its contents reveals about what you expected."
    "你弯下腰，小心翼翼地把横笛塞进他那简简单单的亚麻布包里，确保不会掉出来。 你瞥了一眼包里，发现里面的东西和你预料的差不多。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19433
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_86a7db25:

    # "Clothes.{w} Nothing else."
    "衣服。{w} 什么都没有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19443
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_e5b217fe:

    # w "But knowing you, you're probably just here to be a bloody nuisance."
    w "我看你就是来找茬的吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19445
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_0e4d7ba4:

    # w "Even you should understand by now that I've no interest in your company."
    w "就算是你，现在也该明白我对跟你凑在一起没半点兴趣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19447
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_f86b31a1:

    # p "Fine, have it your way then."
    p "行，随你便吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19449
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_fa04c650:

    # "Without much care you toss the fife into his hammock, watching it land somewhere on his stomach before he holds onto it."
    "你随手把横笛扔到他吊床上，看着它落在他肚子上，他这才捞住。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19451
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_e2de8de9:

    # "Without another word you turn your back and make your way over to your own hammock, certainly ready for some rest after this..."
    "你二话不说，转身就走回自己的吊床，折腾了这一通，可真想好好歇歇了……"

# game/script day2.rpy:19459
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_a56ed2fc:

    # w "But knowing you, you're probably just here to fucking talk. To talk so you can feel good about yourself."
    w "不过，了解你的人都知道，你他妈的就是想找人说话。想靠说话自我感觉良好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19461
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_a9735ac9:

    # p "That's why I came, yes. But it sounds like you're not looking for it."
    p "没错，我就是为此而来。不过，听着你好像并不需要。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19463
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_244205d8:

    # w "Even {i}you{/i} should understand by now that I've no interest in your company."
    w "就算{i}你{/i}，现在也该明白我对跟你凑在一起没半点兴趣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19465
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_32e351b1:

    # w "So just leave the fife in the bag and leave."
    w "所以，把横笛放回包里，然后滚蛋。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19474
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_d92def99:

    # "You bend down and tuck the fife in his bag. The brief glimpse you get of its contents reveals about what you expected."
    "你弯腰把横笛塞回他的包里。瞥了一眼，包里的东西果然不出你所料。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19476
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_86a7db25_1:

    # "Clothes.{w} Nothing else."
    "衣服。{w} 什么都没有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19478
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_goafter_033370cf:

    # "You grant him his desired silence and leave, making your way over to your own hammock to try and get some rest yourself."
    "你由着他自己安静会儿，然后走开，回到自己的吊床上，也想好好休息一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19490
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_81b55ec6:

    # p "Hmm... I'm not sure this will work as a music lesson when the one student you had is gone."
    p "哎... 他走了，这还怎么上音乐课啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19492
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_f0a3c455:

    # b "Not exactly how I expected this lesson to go, I'll admit, but you two know him better, I don't know."
    b "我得承认，这可不是我预想的教学方式，不过你们俩比我更了解他，我也不懂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19498
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_df08296e:

    # j "I wouldn't go that far. We've only known him since the three of us arrived yesterday, but he gets along with him pretty well."
    j "我倒不至于这么说。我们昨天才认识他，不过他相处得还不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19500
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_f82be0d0:

    # "Julian remarks, making a vague gesture in your direction."
    "Julian说着，朝你这边大概比划了一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19502
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_6afc6adc:

    # p "I think it's best to leave him alone. He just prefers his peace and quiet and I'm not sure if going after him will do any good."
    p "我觉得还是让他一个人待会儿比较好。他就是喜欢清静，我不太觉得去打扰他能有什么好处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19504
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_f2fb0fa1:

    # p "Perhaps it was just a bit much to have us gawking at him while he was struggling."
    p "也许是我们盯着他挣扎的样子，让他觉得不太自在。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19508
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_bc4b54d3:

    # j "I wouldn't go that far. We've only known him since the three of us arrived yesterday."
    j "倒也没那么夸张。我们昨天才刚到，认识他也才一天。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19510
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_15ac7264:

    # p "It's probably best to just leave him. He doesn't exactly like company at the best of times, and I don't think running after him will result in anything but him snapping back at you."
    p "最好还是别管他。他平时就不喜欢有人烦他，而且我觉得现在追上去，他只会朝你发火。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19516
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_222866c2:

    # j "It's Wolf. He'll be fine.{p}He survived the dice game with the two of us, didn't he?"
    j "他是Wolf，没事的。{p}他跟咱们俩玩骰子都挺过来了，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19520
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_b8d0f4b3:

    # j "And he left there as well. Was anything wrong? Nah, he still stood in line the next time our larboard watch was called up on deck."
    j "而且他自己也走了。有什么不对吗？没啊，下次左舷值班在甲板上点名的时候，他还不是照样排队。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19522
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_82e18a53:

    # j "That's just the way he is."
    j "他一直就是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19528
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_cda5d306:

    # j "It's wolf. He'll be fine.{p} He survived playing dice with me earlier as well."
    j "他是Wolf，没事的。{p} 之前跟我玩骰子，他也活下来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19530
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_2dc7b050:

    # j "And sure, maybe that was just with me... but it was with {i}me{/i}."
    j "当然，也许只是跟我玩……但那可是跟{i}我{/i}玩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19532
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_7d0bf13c:

    # j "Not only that, but he only threatened to kill me, like, twice."
    j "不止这样，他才威胁要杀我两次而已。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19536
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_625fc114:

    # j "Was it twice?..."
    j "两次吗？……"

# game/script day2.rpy:19538
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_5e39bfc2:

    # "Julian stops to recall the events of this morning, tapping the air as he adds up the instances in his mind."
    "Julian停下来回忆今天早上发生的事，一边用手指点着，一边在脑子里数着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19542
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_6699de3a:

    # j "Four times."
    j "四次。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19544
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_b8aa792f:

    # p "I guess."
    p "知道了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19548
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_53eeff17:

    # j "Trust me. Where I grew up, I've seen a lot of men come and go, and there have been quiet types like him. Some just are like that."
    j "相信我。我从小长大的地方，见过太多来来往往的人，也有像他这样安静的。有些人天生就那样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19556
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_83653489:

    # b "It can be a big change to start working on a ship. I wouldn't worry too much. Besides, he's the oldest among us, we don't have to shepherd him, nor do I think he'd take kindly to us attempting it."
    b "刚开始在船上干活，变化是挺大的。我倒不觉得需要太担心。再说，他是咱们当中年纪最大的，用不着咱们去操心，而且我觉得他也不会喜欢咱们管他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19558
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_ff4b8ef1:

    # p "You're probably right. I'll keep the fife for now and bring it back to him later, unless you still want to practice, Bandile?"
    p "你说的可能对。我先拿着横笛，晚点再还给他，除非你还想练练，Bandile？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19565
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_025518ce:

    # "The rabbit shakes his head, gets up from where he's sitting and stretches on the spot."
    "这只兔子摇摇头，从座位上站起身，原地伸了个懒腰。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19569
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_3b8d1547:

    # b "I think I'll just take my success in actually getting a note out of it and quit while I'm ahead. I can imagine the next step would be learning to play multiple notes and I'd just get my fingers all tangled up."
    b "我想我能成功吹出一个音就该收手了，见好就收。我能想到下一步就是学着吹多个音，到时候我的手指肯定全拧一块儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19571
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_4f950b05:

    # b "They're still needed, you know. And everybody on this thing can only tie knots, not open them."
    b "你知道，他们还是需要的。而且这船上的人只会添乱，不会解决问题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19573
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_8023bd44:

    # b "And then you'd all starve because I couldn't feed you and it would be a whole scene."
    b "不然你们都得饿死，我可喂不饱你们，那就要出大事了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19575
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_07a4e41b:

    # "He dramatically dismisses the suggestion."
    "他夸张地拒绝了这个建议。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19583
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_8b510b70:

    # j "You can bring it back. I think I'll get some rest too, rather than being completely worn out for our next watch."
    j "你拿回去吧。我还是先歇会儿，不然下一班岗就没力气了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19609
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_8a4e61da:

    # "Later during your free time, you make your way over to his hammock to stash away his fife. You had hoped that you could do it without him noticing, but you see him resting in it with his elbow over his eyes."
    "你趁着空闲，想神不知鬼不觉地把他的横笛藏到他的吊床上。结果却看到他正用胳膊肘遮着眼睛躺在那里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19618
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_cb59a24f:

    # "He jolts into motion as he hears you step close and lifts himself onto his elbows." with hpunch
    "你一走近，他就吓了一跳，赶紧用手肘撑起身子。" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:19622
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_3ff32927:

    # w "Ah fuck!{w} It's you..."
    w "啊，操！{w}是你啊..."

# game/script day2.rpy:19624
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_59676fd8:

    # w "What do you want?"
    w "你想要什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19626
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_f9e48d53:

    # p "I'm sorry, I didn't want to scare you. I'm just bringing back the fife.{p}I made sure to wipe it, too."
    p "对不起，我不是想吓你。我把横笛拿回来了。{p}"

# game/script day2.rpy:19630
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_34e21d14:

    # "You hesitate for a moment, but in the end dare to add in another quick word."
    "你犹豫了一下，但还是忍不住补了一句。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19632
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_3b641c45:

    # p "And... you did well."
    p "而且...你吹得不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19641
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_80b205f4:

    # "You don't get a single word in return while bend down to stash the fife in the simple linen bag of his belongings. The brief glimpse you get of its contents reveals about what you expected."
    "对方一句话也没搭理你。你弯下腰，将横笛塞回他那只朴素的麻布随身行囊里。匆匆瞥过一眼的包内物件，跟你预料的大差不差。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19643
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_86a7db25:

    # "Clothes.{w} Nothing else."
    "衣服。{w} 什么都没有。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19645
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_fifelesson_space_4b52a838:

    # "Further granting him his desired silence, you simply leave again without another word."
    "为了不再打扰他，你一言不发地离开了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19657
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_37714da3:

    # "The day has taken it out of you, that is undeniable. And the idea of a comfortable hammock lulling you to a well-deserved slumber, even if just for an hour, sounds ever so enticing."
    "今天可真够累的。现在只想躺在吊床上好好睡一觉，哪怕只睡一个小时也好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19659
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6ab38b8f:

    # "Unfortunately, supper is being given out. Damning you to a short-lived rest unless you want to miss out on it."
    "倒霉的是，现在要发晚餐了。要是不想饿肚子，就只能先少睡一会儿了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19666
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_fd08ce4f:

    # "With a grip to the crossbeams you steady yourself against the rocking of the ship as you walk along the deck, feeling the well-worn planks against the pads of your paws as you scan them for the little number plates that indicate the hammock spots."
    "你扶着横梁，稳住被海浪摇晃的身体，走在甲板上，感受着脚下老旧的木板，一边寻找着吊床的号码。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19668
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f0b5bdd3:

    # "You pay no mind to the vague movement in your peripheral vision. Even after just a short stay like yours one grows accustomed to the constant movement on board rather quickly."
    "在船上待久了，很快就能习惯这种摇晃，所以你也没在意周围的动静。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19670
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_311cb2f6:

    # "No, you are focused on one goal, and one goal only."
    "你只有一个念头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19674
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1376a2da:

    # "The promise of rest and a glimmer of comfort.{w} Maybe even some sleep..."
    "好好休息一下，舒服一下。{w}最好能睡个好觉……"

# game/script day2.rpy:19678
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2d5b1aa8:

    # "The sudden touch on your shoulder snaps you back to reality."
    "突然，有人拍了拍你的肩膀，把你从幻想中拉了回来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19685
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e4df6ba8:

    # "Turning to face it, you find the familiar face of the ship's Doctor."
    "你回头一看，是熟悉的船医。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19687
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2b2f5722:

    # r "Would you be so kind and come along for a moment?"
    r "能帮我个忙，过来一下吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19689
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6b77ff9a:

    # p "I was just about to get some rest."
    p "我刚想去睡觉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19691
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d0c586bd:

    # "You vaguely point at the hammocks."
    "你朝吊床那边指了指。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19693
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_13d08e49:

    # r "I just need a bit of help. It'll be but a second."
    r "就帮我个小忙，很快就好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19695
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4d3a8506:

    # "So close...{p}Yet so far...{p}Maybe you can, just..."
    "近在咫尺...{p}遥不可及...{p}也许能行，就……"

# game/script day2.rpy:19697
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ecd3dcaa:

    # p "Am I allowed to decline?"
    p "我能拒绝吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19701
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cf462bc6:

    # "Your answer catches her off guard and she stops in her step."
    "你的回答教她始料未及，不由自主地驻足停下了脚步。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19703
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ea9b17f6:

    # r "Uh, yes.{w} Yes, you may."
    r "呃，可以吧。{w}嗯，可以。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19705
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6e806e2e:

    # r "It's not urgent enough that I would absolutely require the assistance."
    r "也不是什么非你不可的急事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19709
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_adf50845:

    # r "It would simply be appreciated."
    r "帮个忙，就感激不尽了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19711
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_991b5f28:

    # "Well... If it's supposed to be quick, you'll just get some rest after it."
    "好吧... 如果很快就好，事后你也能好好休息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19713
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f7733d26:

    # p "Lead the way, Doctor."
    p "医生，带路吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19721
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e16a55c9:

    # "You tag along behind the cheetah as she leads you past the busy caboose to an unassuming door at the front of the deck."
    "你跟在那只猎豹身后，她领着你绕过忙碌的船员生活区，来到甲板前部一扇不显眼的小门前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19725
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b558fe29:

    # "She pushes down the handle and swings the door open to invite you into the small cabin."
    "她按下把手，打开门，示意你进入小舱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19738
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_82ac0281:

    # "Obliging her you step into the small storage room, barely big enough to fit two people standing without stepping on each other's paws."
    "听她的话，你走进这个小储藏室，里面狭窄得 едва 只能站下两个人，免得互相碍事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19740
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8a535ba8:

    # "It is only lit by what little natural light makes it all the way back here through the open door."
    "这里的光线很暗，只有 через 开着的门勉强能照到这里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19742
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2d67fceb:

    # "An array of differently sized crates fills the space. Some just stacked on the ground, some placed on the shelves that are attached to the wall."
    "房间里堆满了各种各样的箱子。有的直接堆在地上，有的放在 закреплённых 在墙上的架子上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19744
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d173f336:

    # "Thankfully the seas have been calm, or otherwise the room would probably be quite a mess."
    "幸好最近海面平静，不然这里肯定早就乱套了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19748
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cbf7f173:

    # "She invites you to sit down on the largest crate as she reaches up to one of the shelves to take out a few of the smaller boxes."
    "她让你坐在最大的箱子上，自己走到架子旁，取下几个小 коробки。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19761
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7d5f605e:

    # p "What am I supposed to help with?"
    p "我该做些什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19763
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cf23418c:

    # "She turns around with a smile on her face and hands them to you one after another."
    "她转过身， улыбаясь 着把盒子一个接一个地递给你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19765
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_63da0175:

    # r "I have to sort through some of these crates to find the shipments that I have requested."
    r "我得把这些箱子 сортировать 一下，找到我订的货。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19767
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e4a2b7e8:

    # r "Usually, anything destined for a cabin the crew doesn't have access to gets stored here until the assigned member picks it out."
    r "一般来说，凡是送到船员不能随便进的船舱的东西，都会先放在这里，等收货人来拿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19769
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_591db674:

    # r "Mostly it's my stuff, the purser, and whatever the Officers and Captain ordered to be loaded for them."
    r "大部分是我的东西，还有事务长的，以及军官和船长让他们运上船的东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19777
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d8493f6f:

    # "You yawn before you can answer, and cast a longing look back through the doorway."
    "你还没回答就打了个哈欠，忍不住回头看了眼门口，一脸想回去的样子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19781
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_44289e2d:

    # "You play with the thought of asking her for something in return for your help."
    "你 вдруг 想着，是不是该要点什么好处来换取帮忙？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19783
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_3ac5ef1c:

    # "After all..."
    "毕竟……"

# game/script day2.rpy:19785
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e47172ed:

    # "... you could be relaxing in your hammock {i}right now{/i}."
    "……现在你本可以躺在吊床上{i}放松呢{/i}。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19787
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_70351ee0:

    # "Your valiant sacrifice is worth something, right?"
    "我这英勇牺牲，总得有点价值吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19804
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cf584f5d:

    # r "Now don't look like such a pouting kitten over there and this will be done in just a minute."
    r "别在那儿嘟着嘴，像个小猫咪似的，很快就弄完了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19806
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f764f632:

    # r "Would you be so kind and check these boxes?"
    r "你能帮我看看这些箱子吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19810
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_13ccf396:

    # p "Do I get something in return for my help?"
    p "帮了忙，我能得到什么好处？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19812
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e9813b80:

    # "She doesn't respond."
    "她没有回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19816
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b33bce13:

    # "You set the box down beside you and start with the smallest one of them."
    "你把 коробку 放到一边，先从最小的 начать。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19820
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_86f3e3f2:

    # "You undo the latch that holds them closed and lift up the lid, the wood they are made of running coarsly against your fingertips."
    "你打开箱子的闩锁，粗糙的木头刮过你的 пальцы。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19822
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ea7fd291:

    # "A square grid of nine dark glass bottles greets you."
    "一排九个深棕色的玻璃瓶 мгновенно 映入眼帘。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19824
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_fd8a69c8:

    # "It's hard to see through the brown glass they are made of, but they appear to be filled with some kind of liquid."
    "棕色玻璃瓶 почти непрозрачные, 但似乎里面装了一些 ёмкость."

# game/script day2.rpy:19828
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_fec3a03e:

    # "You pick one of the bottles and examine the black label, which bears the fancy white lettering of some manufacturer's name."
    "你拿起一个 флакон，检查黑色的 этикетка，上面印着 какой-то 厂家花哨的 белые буквы。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19830
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cf15b221:

    # "A name you have never heard of before."
    "这牌子 ты слыхом не слыхивал."

# game/script day2.rpy:19832
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_45a6610c:

    # p "What am I supposed to look for?"
    p "我要找 что？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19836
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_40dc9b92:

    # r "Oh, um, each box should contain a manifest addressed to me as the ship's surgeon. Rajeeyah al-Maghribi."
    r "哦，对了，每个箱子里都应该有一份货物清单，收件人写的是我，船医Rajeeyah·马格里比。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19841
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c00a2c47:

    # "The room is bathed in the warm mixture of sounds coming from the lively ship, while Rajeeyah adds the scraping of wood as she slides out another box."
    "房间里回荡着船上热闹的声响，Rajeeyah又拉出一个箱子，发出木头摩擦的吱嘎声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19845
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b59ce6e1:

    # "In your search for the manifest you find the small, folded slip of paper tucked away at the side of the box."
    "你在找清单的时候，发现一个叠好的小纸条塞在箱子边上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19849
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6ec4495e:

    # r "Oh, you are able to read, right?"
    r "哦，你认字的吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19851
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19855
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_889f6bec:

    # "The dimly lit cabin makes it hard to read what's written on the piece of paper."
    "舱里光线太暗，看不清纸上写的啥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19857
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_38a35de5:

    # "It appears to list the contents of the box, along with the seller's information, and the same from the owner of the Conway."
    "好像是箱子里的货物清单，还有卖家和“Conway号”号船东的信息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19859
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e4b810c5:

    # "At the very bottom you find Rajeeyah's name as the one who requested the items."
    "最下面是我的名字，Rajeeyah，写着是我要的这些东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19861
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_df9c44bb:

    # p "This one's yours."
    p "这个是你的那份。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19863
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_768d1220:

    # p "Uhm...silver-{cps=1.5}...{/cps} nitrate? I think it says."
    p "嗯...硝酸银？{cps=1.5}...{/cps} 好像是这个。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19865
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8120b533:

    # p "The handwriting on it is hard to decypher."
    p "字迹太潦草，不好认。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19867
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2030f3f4:

    # p "I'd need a candle."
    p "我得找根蜡烛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19871
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_469d7030:

    # "You say and tuck the piece back into the box."
    "你说着，把纸条放回箱子里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19873
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_009c317b:

    # p "Do I just set it aside somewhere?"
    p "我就放这儿行吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19875
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8864e134:

    # r "Yes, yes... somewhere there."
    r "行，行……就放那儿吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19879
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_0665f9c1:

    # r "I had to replenish our supply since the incident with Perce. Probably prudent to avoid it happening again."
    r "之前Perce那事儿之后，我得赶紧把货补上。再出这事儿可就麻烦了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19881
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1275e0a9:

    # r "It was a close shave for him. A bit too close for comfort if I'm quite honest."
    r "他那次可真是死里逃生。说实话，我都替他捏把汗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19885
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cfae2eab:

    # r "We ran out of it for one of the crew, so I made sure to acquire ample of it to prevent it from happening again."
    r "之前有个船员用完了，所以我这次多备了点，省得再出岔子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19887
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_58209bfe:

    # "A swift flick of her wrist points you towards the vacant space near the door."
    "她手腕一指，指向了门口附近的空地。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19889
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_06570ddf:

    # r "Just try not to put it outside or you can be postively certain that someone will take the opportunity to fall over it."
    r "别放外面啊，不然肯定有人一脚踩上去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19891
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_da6ea4df:

    # r "Sometimes it feels like they are looking for opportunities to hurt themselves."
    r "有时候我都觉得他们是故意找机会让自己受伤。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19895
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f1a4f592:

    # "You chuckle and set down the box next to the door."
    "你笑了笑，把箱子放在了门边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19899
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1a3d3834:

    # p "So...{w} do I get something?"
    p "那...{w} 我有啥好处啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19903
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5d199ce5:

    # p "I am giving up my valuable hammock for this, you know."
    p "我可是把我的宝贝吊床让出来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19905
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f4ce89b7:

    # p "I barely managed to sleep either, this new schedule is killing me."
    p "而且这新班表也太要命了，我都没怎么睡过觉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19907
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b6669dfa:

    # "You try to make your case sound as pitiful as possible."
    "你尽量说得可怜兮兮的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19909
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a4edb716:

    # r "You sailors are something else."
    r "你们水手啊，真是绝了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19911
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7bc9b22e:

    # p "Not doing badly at this whole gruff sailor thing, eh?"
    p "演得还挺像个粗鲁水手的，嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19913
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a0f231cc:

    # r "One way to put it."
    r "话是没错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19915
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5645d276:

    # r "You know, I was thinking about a simple \"Thank you [name],\" \"Well done [name], I'm very grateful for your help.\""
    r "我还以为你会说句“谢谢你啊，[name]”，或者“干得不错，[name]，多亏你帮忙啦。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:19917
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b478a61f:

    # r "Maybe even \"I couldn't have done it without you, Mr. [family_name],\" but that might be putting it on a bit too thick."
    r "要是能说句“没有你我可怎么办啊，[family_name]先生”，那就更好了，不过估计你不好意思说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19921
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4cf146f9:

    # r "We also can sit down for dinner together like you asked yesterday. How does that sound?"
    r "就像你昨天说的，咱们也能一起吃个晚饭。怎么样？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19930
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4a76081d:

    # r "I knew we would see eye to eye on this."
    r "我就知道咱们在这事儿上能想到一块儿去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19932
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_066ccdae:

    # "She smiles and hands you another box."
    "她笑着又递给你一个箱子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19936
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_08c35fb4:

    # r "We can get something to eat right after we're done here."
    r "完事儿咱们就能去吃点东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19942
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b40ed23a:

    # "She turns and cocks her head as she looks at you."
    "她转过身，歪着头看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19944
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_40266511:

    # r "Right after this?"
    r "就现在？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19946
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ad6b8b76:

    # p "Sure, why not?"
    p "当然，何乐而不为呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19948
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c29d91e3:

    # p "I was thinking about having a bite after some rest, but someone, and I won't name any names, dragged me away from that."
    p "我本来还想着歇会儿再吃点东西，结果某人啊，我就不点名了，硬是把我从那儿拽走了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19952
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ada9e872:

    # "She can't quite keep the short laugh of hers silent."
    "她没忍住，噗嗤一声笑了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19954
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7cf57a16:

    # r "Whoever it was must have had no manners at all."
    r "也不知道是谁，一点礼貌都不懂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19958
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2a1b51a6:

    # r "Sure we can do that. I haven't had anything to eat yet myself."
    r "行啊。我自己也还没吃呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19966
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a40baacf:

    # "She slowly turns around and cocks her head, narrowing her eyes as she looms above you."
    "她缓缓转过身，歪着头，眯起眼睛，居高临下地盯着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19968
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a44aebcc:

    # "You miss all the shots you don't take... right?"
    "不试一下，怎么知道行不行呢，对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19970
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_92725143:

    # p "Nothing too much, just..."
    p "也没什么，就是…"

# game/script day2.rpy:19972
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b0a6c436:

    # r "And what exactly do you have in mind?"
    r "你到底在打什么主意？"

# game/script day2.rpy:19974
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a8d5011f:

    # "The usual warmth from her voice evaporates and it takes on a colder, sharper tone, like an icy dagger that is about to strike with deadly precision."
    "她声音里平时的那种温暖消失了，取而代之的是一种冰冷、尖锐的语调，像一把淬了冰的匕首，带着致命的精准，随时准备刺过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19978
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8256d01a:

    # r "{cps=5000}And that exactly would that be?{/cps}" nointeract
    r "{cps=5000}那又会是什么呢？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day2.rpy:19986
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9955b0ac:

    # p "We can close the door and nobody will know."
    p "咱们关上门，谁也不会知道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19990
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e5aea000:

    # "Her eyes pierce you with a cold and contemptuous stare."
    "她用一种冰冷而轻蔑的目光刺穿你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19992
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_0781c68d:

    # r "You better tell me that this is simply the worst joke you've thought of in your life, Mr. [family_name]."
    r "你最好告诉我，这只是你这辈子想过的最烂的笑话，[family_name] 先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19994
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6ba8082d:

    # r "And you better do it quick."
    r "而且最好快点说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:19996
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_20b0fcdf:

    # p "Oh, lighten up, Rajeeyah, don't be such a prud-"
    p "哎哟，放轻松点，Rajeeyah，别这么死板——"

# game/script day2.rpy:20002
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_68f8ec4b:

    # "Her palm slams against the wall next to you, causing the wood to vibrate against your back." with hpunch
    "她的手掌猛地拍在你身旁的墙上，震得你后背都跟着发麻。" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:20010
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_3bf25e53:

    # "You feel your expression twist into a grimace as the pressure of her gaze becomes too much and you try to evade her eyes."
    "你觉得表情都扭曲了，实在受不了她那充满压迫感的目光，想躲开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20018
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2d2757e3:

    # "Only for one brief moment however, before you are forced back to face her by her hand on the underside of your jaw."
    "但这只是转瞬之间，她就用手托住你的下巴，强迫你重新面对她。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20020
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b376f840:

    # r "You will address me with due deference, Mr. [family_name]!"
    r "[family_name] 先生，你得对我放尊重点！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20022
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7bb7ea87:

    # p "I'm sorry."
    p "我错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20024
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2ce4cbd4:

    # p "Doctor."
    p "博士。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20030
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7195d399:

    # "She slowly leans back and allows you some space again, crossing her arms in front of her chest and bringing her tail close to her body."
    "她慢慢往后退了退，给你留出一些空间，然后双臂抱在胸前，尾巴也蜷了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20032
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f13b307e:

    # p "It's just a little fun.{w} A way to blow off some steam after a hard day."
    p "就是开个玩笑嘛。{w} 辛苦了一天，放松放松。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20034
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_443d0738:

    # p "I've heard enough whispers about how sailors keep each other entertained on a ship."
    p "关于水手们在船上怎么互相找乐子的事，我他妈听得耳朵都起茧了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20036
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_838f904a:

    # p "Come on, you can't tell me you don't think about some release every once in a while."
    p "得了吧，你敢说你脑子里就没闪过那点事儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20038
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_27be14ff:

    # r "None of that is {i}any{/i} business of yours." with hpunch
    r "这他娘的跟你没半点关系。" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:20040
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f15215bc:

    # r "I am appalled that you would have the audacity to think this acceptable behaviour towards your superior..."
    r "你竟然敢觉得这种事能冲着你的上级做出来……我简直不敢相信！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20042
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e4eaae92:

    # r "No, forget about rank, that you would think this acceptable behaviour towards {i}me{/i}."
    r "不，别跟我扯什么等级，你竟然觉得能对我，做出这种事！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20044
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4756e653:

    # r "Or {i}anyone{/i} for that matter."
    r "或者对任何人都一样！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20048
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b5f4d55f:

    # r "I didn't think much of what you said yesterday. Simply a young recruit who was all too flustered, and barely got the words across his lips."
    r "昨天你说的那些屁话我根本没当回事。就当是个新来的小毛头，紧张得话都说不利索。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20050
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f6f45888:

    # r "But this is who you really are?"
    r "但这就是你真实的样子？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20052
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cb8a871d:

    # r "This is all you are after?"
    r "你他妈就这点追求？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20054
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_fca9bfaf:

    # r "Thinking with nothing but that meager cock of yours."
    r "满脑子就想着你那点儿可怜的玩意儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20056
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_39f1102e:

    # r "Wanting to use me at the first opportunity you see, like I am nothing but cheap entertainment?"
    r "一看有机会就想上我，当老娘是廉价的窑姐儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20060
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_915c0430:

    # r "That you think of me as nothing but cheap entertainment?"
    r "你就把我看成是廉价的窑姐儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20062
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b0e5a7a8:

    # r "I was wrong."
    r "我看错你了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20064
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1f43f739:

    # r "You are, in fact, nothing like the other sailors."
    r "你的确跟那些水手不一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20066
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_73ae705d:

    # r "No."
    r "不行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20068
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e6661fcb:

    # r "You are worse."
    r "你更烂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20070
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_accc039d:

    # r "Much worse."
    r "烂透了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20072
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c946f928:

    # r "At least the others have the bare minimum of decorum to usually behave themselves around a woman on this ship."
    r "至少其他人还知道装装样子，一般都会在船上的女人面前收敛点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20074
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a2ff96a6:

    # r "Clearly it was a grave error to even consider you to help..."
    r "看来考虑让你帮忙真是个天大的错误……"

# game/script day2.rpy:20076
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_601e5de0:

    # r "Rest assured the mate and captain will hear of your conduct."
    r "你放心，你的所作所为，大副和船长都会知道的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20078
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4fa19777:

    # r "They will be the one to decide what to do with you."
    r "他们会决定怎么收拾你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20080
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_99810517:

    # r "Get out of this cabin at once."
    r "滚出我的房间，立刻！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20105
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_73ae705d_1:

    # r "No."
    r "不行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20109
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_671fc726:

    # "Her eyes sharpen into a judgemental glare, probably arguing with herself if she should kick you out of the room then and there."
    "她目光如刀，带着审判意味瞪着你，大概在心里盘算着要不要现在就把你踢出去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20111
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_666efe81:

    # "You quickly try to salvage the situation with a timid apology which, miraculously, seems to calm her down a bit and tip the balance in your favor."
    "你赶紧怂了吧唧地道歉，想挽回局面。奇了，这招好像有点用，她稍微冷静了点，天平好像往你这边倾斜了一点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20113
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6b82954a:

    # r "I have no idea what possessed you, Mr. [family_name], but I will overlook your poor judgment this once and attribute it to your ignorance of the proper conduct around the crew, and especially your superiors."
    r "我真不知道你他妈的是哪根筋搭错了，[family_name]先生。不过这次我就原谅你的冒犯，就当你是新来的，不懂规矩，不知道该怎么跟船员，尤其是你的上级相处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20115
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_994400df:

    # p "I-... I'm sorry, Doctor."
    p "我……对不起，医生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20117
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2034a0f0:

    # p "I didn't mean to offend. I just was-"
    p "我不是故意要冒犯你的。我只是……"

# game/script day2.rpy:20119
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5a304aed:

    # r "Just stop."
    r "闭嘴！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20128
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9955b0ac_1:

    # p "We can close the door and nobody will know."
    p "咱们关上门，谁也不会知道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20132
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e5aea000_1:

    # "Her eyes pierce you with a cold and contemptuous stare."
    "她用一种冰冷而轻蔑的目光刺穿你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20134
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6facb832:

    # r "Are you really suggesting what I presume you are suggesting?"
    r "你真想做那种事？我没理解错吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20136
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_3b0f42f5:

    # p "It's just a quick feel."
    p "就摸一下，又不会少块肉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20138
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5f0c6b10:

    # p "Come on, just having a bit of fun here and you are a beautiful woman."
    p "别这样嘛，就当是找点乐子，再说你这么漂亮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20140
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7ffcb2eb:

    # p "It doesn't cost you anything and I've heard enough whispers about how sailors keep each other entertained on a ship."
    p "反正又不用你花钱，而且我听够了水手们在船上那些事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20146
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_68f8ec4b_1:

    # "Her palm slams against the wall next to you, causing the wood to vibrate against your back." with hpunch
    "她的手掌猛地拍在你身旁的墙上，震得你后背都跟着发麻。" with hpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:20154
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_3bf25e53_1:

    # "You feel your expression twist into a grimace as the pressure of her gaze becomes too much and you try to evade her eyes."
    "你觉得表情都扭曲了，实在受不了她那充满压迫感的目光，想躲开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20163
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2d2757e3_1:

    # "Only for one brief moment however, before you are forced back to face her by her hand on the underside of your jaw."
    "但这只是转瞬之间，她就用手托住你的下巴，强迫你重新面对她。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20165
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f15215bc_1:

    # r "I am appalled that you would have the audacity to think this acceptable behaviour towards your superior..."
    r "你竟然敢觉得这种事能冲着你的上级做出来……我简直不敢相信！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20167
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e4eaae92_1:

    # r "No, forget about rank, that you would think this acceptable behaviour towards {i}me{/i}."
    r "不，别跟我扯什么等级，你竟然觉得能对我，做出这种事！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20169
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4e99fa84:

    # r "Or anyone for that matter."
    r "或者说，任何人都一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20173
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b5f4d55f_1:

    # r "I didn't think much of what you said yesterday. Simply a young recruit who was all too flustered, and barely got the words across his lips."
    r "昨天你说的那些屁话我根本没当回事。就当是个新来的小毛头，紧张得话都说不利索。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20175
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f6f45888_1:

    # r "But this is who you really are?"
    r "但这就是你真实的样子？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20177
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cb8a871d_1:

    # r "This is all you are after?"
    r "你他妈就这点追求？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20179
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_fca9bfaf_1:

    # r "Thinking with nothing but that meager cock of yours."
    r "满脑子就想着你那点儿可怜的玩意儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20181
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2533777b:

    # r "Wanting to use me at the first opportunity you see, like I am nothing but a cheap whore?"
    r "一有机会就想占我便宜，你把我当成什么了，廉价的妓女吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20185
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_94f59463:

    # r "That you think of me as nothing but a cheap whore?"
    r "你把我当成什么了，廉价的妓女吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20187
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_81f23990:

    # p "Oh, come on Rajeeyah, that's not what I impli-"
    p "别这样说，Rajeeyah，我不是那个意思......"

# game/script day2.rpy:20189
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b376f840_1:

    # r "You will address me with due deference, Mr. [family_name]!"
    r "[family_name] 先生，你得对我放尊重点！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20191
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7bb7ea87_1:

    # p "I'm sorry."
    p "我错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20193
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2ce4cbd4_1:

    # p "Doctor."
    p "博士。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20199
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7195d399_1:

    # "She slowly leans back and allows you some space again, crossing her arms in front of her chest and bringing her tail close to her body."
    "她慢慢往后退了退，给你留出一些空间，然后双臂抱在胸前，尾巴也蜷了起来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20201
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_fffb05a1:

    # r "I was wrong.{w} You are nothing like the other sailors."
    r "我错了。{w} 看来你和那些水手不一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20203
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_73ae705d_2:

    # r "No."
    r "不行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20205
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e6661fcb_1:

    # r "You are worse."
    r "你更烂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20207
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_accc039d_1:

    # r "Much worse."
    r "烂透了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20209
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_25b6858f:

    # r "At least the others have the bare minimum of decorum to behave themselves properly around a woman."
    r "至少他们还懂得在女人面前稍微收敛一点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20211
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a2ff96a6_1:

    # r "Clearly it was a grave error to even consider you to help..."
    r "看来考虑让你帮忙真是个天大的错误……"

# game/script day2.rpy:20213
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_601e5de0_1:

    # r "Rest assured the mate and captain will hear of your conduct."
    r "你放心，你的所作所为，大副和船长都会知道的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20215
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4fa19777_1:

    # r "They will be the one to decide what to do with you."
    r "他们会决定怎么收拾你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20217
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_99810517_1:

    # r "Get out of this cabin at once."
    r "滚出我的房间，立刻！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20245
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e5836d37:

    # r "Now you're just taking advantage of me not enjoying the alcoholic rations."
    r "你现在是看准了我不喜欢喝配给的酒，故意占我便宜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20247
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6659f711:

    # r "Clever."
    r "真有你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20251
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9b44cb52:

    # "She chuckles and hands you another box."
    "她轻笑一声，递给你另一个箱子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20253
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_af55f886:

    # p "They don't say that we have nine lives for nothing."
    p "都说猫有九条命，可不是随便说说的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20255
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_297e3d9d:

    # p "Being smart gets you out unharmed in many situations."
    p "多动动脑子，在很多要紧关头都能保你全须全尾脱险。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20261
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_fa68042d:

    # r "Now that's not even a particularly difficult decision.{w} Sure you can have my cup later."
    r "这根本就不是什么难事儿。{w} 回头我的杯子给你用就是了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20263
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c9acb7fe:

    # r "I'm not the biggest fan of the alcoholic rations to be honest. Though don't you start taking advantage of that."
    r "说实话，我不太喜欢喝配给的酒。你可别想借此占我便宜啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20265
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e5ed2c47:

    # "You chuckle and grab the next box she hands over."
    "你笑着接过她递来的下一个箱子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20267
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_3978e43a:

    # p "I will try to keep myself reined in."
    p "我会尽量注意分寸的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20269
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ff345487:

    # p "No promises though."
    p "但我可不敢保证。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20275
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7a55f451:

    # "You go for the next box and open it, prying out the piece of paper once again to check for the recipient. And once again you find Rajeeyah's."
    "你拿起下一个箱子打开，再次撬开纸条，查看收件人。结果又是Rajeeyah的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20281
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c1896fe2:

    # p "You're not from here, are you?"
    p "你不是本地人吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20285
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d8427c30:

    # "You try to escape the awkwardness of the moment with your question."
    "你试图用这个问题来缓解此刻的尴尬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20287
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a9a5514e:

    # "She appears to be just as happy with your decision and turns back to her work, picking out the last box from the shelf while she answers."
    "她好像也挺高兴你这么做的，转身回去干活，一边从架子上拿下最后一个箱子，一边回答你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20293
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_970b96ef:

    # r "Why?"
    r "为什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20295
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2571b545:

    # p "Uh, the name. It doesn't sound local."
    p "呃，你的名字。听着不太像本地人的名字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20297
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_250b5720:

    # r "And? It's a ship. We have picked up sailors from countless harbors."
    r "那又怎么样？这是一艘船，船上水手来自五湖四海。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20299
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9f40196c:

    # p "I'm just curious."
    p "我就是好奇。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20301
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9019348c:

    # r "Morocco."
    r "摩洛哥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20303
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6156725e:

    # r "Is where I'm from."
    r "我从摩洛哥来的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20305
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_0489a6c0:

    # p "Morocco? Isn't that the next harbor we will be anchoring in?"
    p "摩洛哥不是咱们下一个要去的港口吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20307
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_78e25cb2:

    # r "It is."
    r "的确晚了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20309
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cef18bce:

    # p "I look forward to seeing your homeland in that case."
    p "那可太好了，我很期待去看看你的家乡。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20311
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_29547d12:

    # p "I've never really been far from the place I was raised. Well, until now that is."
    p "我从小就没怎么离开过家。好吧，至少现在离开了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20317
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8298ae06:

    # "She coldly hands you the last of the boxes from the shelf checks some of the others that are stored in the room herself."
    "她冷冰冰地把架子上剩下的最后一个箱子递给你，然后自己又检查了房间里存放的其他箱子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20319
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d5d8766f:

    # p "It must have been a while since you last saw it."
    p "你一定很久没见过它了吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20327
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7c1ec14a:

    # "Busy lifting the last box off of the shelf she didn't even turn around to answer."
    "她正忙着从架子上搬最后一个箱子，头也没回地应了一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20329
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_40378f3b:

    # r "From here? The open north Atlantic ocean?{p}No, indeed I am not."
    r "从这儿能看见？这可是开阔的北大西洋啊。{p}当然不是了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20331
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_41efc0b2:

    # r "How did you find out?"
    r "你怎么知道的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20333
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9fd8e538:

    # r "Was it the missing fins?"
    r "是少了鱼鳍看出来的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20337
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_bfde4c00:

    # p "You know what I mean."
    p "你明白我的意思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20339
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d9b4d08d:

    # "She must have been struggling to keep it together with only the fact that she is facing away saving her from you picking up on it, as she immediately burst into a laugh."
    "她肯定在极力忍着，多亏了她背对着我，才没让我发现她的异样，紧接着就噗嗤一声笑了出来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20345
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b53edf73:

    # r "I was born in Morocco."
    r "我出生在摩洛哥。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20347
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4708d363:

    # p "Morocco?"
    p "摩洛哥？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20349
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6c3586a9:

    # p "Isn't Morocco our next harbor?"
    p "摩洛哥不是咱们的下一个港口吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20351
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_78e25cb2_1:

    # r "It is."
    r "的确晚了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20353
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_aa9600c5:

    # p "Sounds like we are going to be visiting your homeland then."
    p "这么说，咱们要顺道拜访你的家乡啦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20355
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_59d3a2bf:

    # r "Indeed we will."
    r "没错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20357
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b4d64816:

    # p "Well, I'm looking forward to seeing it for myself in that case."
    p "那我可真期待亲眼去看看了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20361
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_41120c3a:

    # r "You won't quite get to see the town I called my home."
    r "不过你没法看到我记忆中的家乡小镇了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20363
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e8ecc016:

    # r "I was born in Safi, not Mogador. A town up north from where we will be anchoring. Too far away to reach during our stay in the harbor, though."
    r "我出生在萨菲，不是莫加多尔。它在我们停靠港口的北边，有点远。咱们这次停靠时间短，恐怕没机会去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20365
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_eff7b479:

    # r "It has been a while since I've last seen it for myself."
    r "确实很久没回去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20367
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8e0cc5ed:

    # p "How long?"
    p "多久了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20369
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a6f7a445:

    # p "I never really made it far from the place I was raised."
    p "我以前几乎没怎么离开过长大的地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20371
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_76018d0d:

    # p "Well, until now."
    p "嗯，直到现在。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20373
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9fbb6354:

    # p "So I can only imagine how nice it must be to return after such a long time."
    p "这么说来，离家这么久，这次回去肯定感触很深吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20377
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_78b4d3dd:

    # "You close one of the boxes after finding out this one isn't addressed at her. The latch falling back into place with a wooden click."
    "你发现手里的箱子不是寄给她的，又默默地盖了回去，木头锁扣发出咔哒一声。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20381
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_18031528:

    # r "It has been a while, that's true."
    r "是啊，确实挺久了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20385
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7f7f8dc3:

    # r "Two years."
    r "两年了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20387
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_23d277be:

    # r "We don't land there often, though this time we have a lucrative freight contract for a load of grain, so I am lucky to spend a few days in my homeland again."
    r "我们不常在那边靠岸，不过这次我们接了个大单，要运一批谷物，所以我很幸运能在家乡待上几天。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20389
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4ba1d338:

    # r "Though originally I left even before that."
    r "其实我最开始离开那儿的时间更早。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20391
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d1060b5e:

    # r "Two years is how long it's been since I last set foot on Moroccan soil."
    r "准确地说，自从我上次踏上摩洛哥的土地，已经过去两年了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20393
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_511cd9f5:

    # r "I left on my own accord back then, but I would be lying if I said that I am not missing it."
    r "当初我是自愿离开的，但要说我一点都不想家，那我就是在自欺欺人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20399
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_fb1a3f74:

    # r "Smell the familiar smells.{w} See the familiar colors of the towns. {w}Finally sit down for a good tea again... Mmm.."
    r "闻着熟悉的味道，{w}看着小镇那熟悉的色彩，{w}最后再舒舒服服地喝上一杯好茶……嗯……"

# game/script day2.rpy:20401
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6e1cc813:

    # "You notice her lips bend into a subtle smile."
    "你注意到她嘴角微微上扬，露出了一个浅浅的笑容。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20403
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f581cadb:

    # r "It'll be nice."
    r "那感觉肯定很棒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20405
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b10b9284:

    # p "Someone rather enjoys their tea?"
    p "看来你很喜欢喝茶啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20407
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5bfafb7c:

    # r "Find me a Moroccan who doesn't."
    r "你能找出一个不喜欢喝茶的摩洛哥人吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20409
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_aa1ed634:

    # r "It's an event for us. You sit down, take your time to get lost in the moment with family, friends, some person walking down the street. Whoever it may be."
    r "对我们来说，喝茶可是件大事。 坐下来，和家人、朋友，甚至是街上的陌生人，一起沉浸在那份悠闲惬意之中。 不管和谁都行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20411
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c150176b:

    # r "I've been missing it. Not many of the men here are drawn in by that prospect, nor do they usually have the time."
    r "我一直都很想念那种感觉。 船上的弟兄们对这些都不太感兴趣，而且他们也难得有那个闲工夫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20415
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5aff3cf4:

    # r "Where's the gambling?"
    r "哪儿有得赌钱？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20417
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8c236937:

    # r "Where drunken pleasure?"
    r "哪儿能喝个烂醉？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20421
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c5c0f514:

    # r "Only exception is when we're crossing into colder regions. Now, when they have to reef the sails in a sleet storm, let me tell you then a cup of tea gets traded like a bar of pure gold."
    r "除非是到了天寒地冻的地方。 我跟你说，要是在冰天雪地里顶着风暴收帆，那会儿能喝上一杯热茶，简直比金子还珍贵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20423
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_94bc1f80:

    # p "I can believe it."
    p "我信。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20427
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e8f0054e:

    # p "Speaking of, the passenger we took with us mentioned that he enjoys the occasional cup of it."
    p "说起来，这次搭船来的那位也挺喜欢喝茶的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20429
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_69bb28d9:

    # p "Perhaps you can have your tea with someone yet."
    p "说不定你能找到人一起喝一杯。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20433
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5d7a09dc:

    # r "The lanky chap?"
    r "那个瘦高的家伙？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20435
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f8815307:

    # p "You are one to talk."
    p "你也好意思说别人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20437
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1b6c911f:

    # "You return with a playful tone"
    "你用一种俏皮的语气回应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20441
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_dc60e26a:

    # r "We cheetahs are naturally built slim."
    r "我们猎豹天生就是这身板儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20443
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_21f0c5b1:

    # r "Perhaps I shall pay him a visit."
    r "那我可得去拜会拜会他了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20447
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b4781698:

    # p "It's only natural to feel drawn to your homeland. Especially after god knows how long."
    p "离家这么久，想家是人之常情。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20449
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7f7f8dc3_1:

    # r "Two years."
    r "两年了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20451
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8f1a1b85:

    # r "It's not a harbor we land at very often."
    r "咱们不怎么在那港口停靠。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20453
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4ba1d338_1:

    # r "Though originally I left even before that."
    r "其实我最开始离开那儿的时间更早。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20455
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d1060b5e_1:

    # r "Two years is how long it's been since I last set foot on Moroccan soil."
    r "准确地说，自从我上次踏上摩洛哥的土地，已经过去两年了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20459
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cc0b6a6e:

    # p "Do you have anything planned coming back after all that time?"
    p "离开这么久，这次回去有什么打算吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20461
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_05b95c05:

    # p "For most of us it's probably just going to be more work."
    p "对我们大多数人来说，恐怕就得更卖力干活了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20463
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f22277ba:

    # p "Or whatever it is you do as a sailor during the stay in a harbor."
    p "或者说，水手在靠港期间还能有啥事儿干呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20465
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_69d709bd:

    # r "Running."
    r "跑步。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20467
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a374088c:

    # "Her answer takes you aback and you stare at her with wide-open eyes."
    "她这话可真让你吃了一惊，你瞪大了眼睛看着她。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20469
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_670be001:

    # p "Running?"
    p "跑步？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20471
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4f7b6c8c:

    # p "Deserting from...{w} the ship?"
    p "从……{w}从船上开溜？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20475
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cf7be1af:

    # "Now it was her turn to stare back in disbelief, her teeth peeking past her ajar lips."
    "现在轮到她一脸难以置信地瞪着你，微微张开的嘴唇里露出牙齿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20477
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e4af39d0:

    # "She catches herself with a quick shake of her head."
    "她赶紧摇了摇头，让自己清醒一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20481
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_19fcb7b1:

    # r "What?"
    r "啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20483
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_73ae705d_3:

    # r "No."
    r "不行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20485
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_96731d0e:

    # r "{i}Running{/i}."
    r "{i}跑步{/i}。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20487
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_61e67a26:

    # r "To nowhere."
    r "哪儿也不去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20489
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8ce0e50b:

    # r "Just for the sake of it."
    r "就是想跑着玩儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20491
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_772aee62:

    # p "Oh...{w} You {i}really{/i} are a cheetah, aren't you?"
    p "哦……{w}你{i}还真{/i}是只猎豹啊，我说得对吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20497
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f3e12545:

    # r "Someone has to keep the nature of our species alive."
    r "总得有人肩负起延续人类天性的使命吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20499
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ececf712:

    # p "Hopefully you're not just doing it for that. That sounds like it would become a bit of a chore at some point."
    p "希望你不是光为了这个。不然时间久了，肯定会觉得烦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20501
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2379576e:

    # r "I do enjoy it, though I appreciate the concern."
    r "我是真心喜欢，不过还是谢谢你的关心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20507
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_0bc7db9d:

    # "She laughs."
    "她笑了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20511
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ce8c965d:

    # r "Not just {i}any{/i} cheetah.{w} A king cheetah."
    r "可不是{i}普通的{/i}猎豹。{w}是猎豹之王！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20513
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9b83d6c3:

    # r "If not me, then who else would keep the nature of our species alive?"
    r "如果我不跑，谁来保持我们猎豹的天性呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20515
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ec099e3b:

    # r "Though perhaps queen cheetah would be a more fitting title, don't you think?"
    r "不过，也许叫猎豹女王更合适，你说呢？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20517
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d571bc5a:

    # p "A worthy one."
    p "当之无愧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20521
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_0f465cbe:

    # "You play along, imitating the tone of a servant."
    "你配合她演戏，模仿着下人的腔调。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20523
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1e82c1e8:

    # r "But, no, I just like it, and unfortunately this ship is not convenient for a run."
    r "哎，没办法，我就是喜欢跑步，可这破船根本没法跑啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20525
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f40d30e3:

    # r "Fighting against the waves, fighting against the slippery wet planks, the wind, having to weave through you lot and avoid the tar dripping from above..."
    r "跟海浪较劲，跟湿滑的甲板较劲，顶着大风，还得在你们这群人里钻来钻去，还得小心上面滴下来的焦油……"

# game/script day2.rpy:20527
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_31faca5b:

    # r "It's not the same, and whenever I'm out here I just crave that euphoric feeling I get from it."
    r "感觉完全不一样，我只要待在这儿，就浑身难受，只想跑起来，享受那种快感。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20529
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5c36568a:

    # p "At least I won't have any trouble spotting you among the crowd."
    p "起码这样，我在人群里一眼就能认出你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20533
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6271a695:

    # p "Didn't you mention your partner yesterday?"
    p "你昨天不是说你有伴侣吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20535
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_faef17de:

    # p "You two haven't seen each other in two years?"
    p "你们俩都两年没见了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20539
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_98bb12b8:

    # p "Two years, huh..."
    p "两年了啊……"

# game/script day2.rpy:20541
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1a0282af:

    # p "That's a rather long time."
    p "这也太久了吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20543
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_78e25cb2_2:

    # r "It is."
    r "的确晚了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20545
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8acdcc18:

    # r "There are a lot of close people that I haven't seen in years."
    r "我也有好多关系很铁的人，好几年都没见过了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20549
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_989d5da4:

    # r "Parents, friends, my partner... lover..."
    r "爸妈，朋友，还有我的伴侣……爱人……"

# game/script day2.rpy:20551
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ecc8d6b5:

    # p "Hold on, you have a partner?"
    p "等等，你有伴侣了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20555
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cafa5813:

    # p "One that you haven't seen in two years?"
    p "还是个两年没见过的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20557
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_887d14e1:

    # p "You just up and left for several years?"
    p "你就这么一声不吭地走了好几年？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20561
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6fb77f1d:

    # p "Aren't you concerned about the relationship?"
    p "你就不怕感情生疏了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20568
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_97228f70:

    # "She carefully puts the box you just sealed back on the shelf, where a wooden lip makes sure it stays in place even during rough seas."
    "她小心翼翼地把你刚封好的箱子放回架子上，架子上有个木条挡着，就算风浪再大也不怕掉下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20576
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6fdd7a71:

    # r "Partner... Lover..."
    r "伴侣……爱人……"

# game/script day2.rpy:20578
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_484e2336:

    # "Your eyes never lose their focus on her."
    "你的眼睛一直没离开过她。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20582
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_45e0a6ee:

    # r "Concern is not the right word."
    r "用“担心”这个词，不太对。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20584
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f97a1710:

    # r "Not quite."
    r "倒也不是。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20586
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b6bb34b2:

    # r "To tell you the truth, he was one of the reasons I felt I needed to leave."
    r "跟你说实话吧，他算是我下决心离开的原因之一。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20588
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a175128d:

    # r "The one I needed this distance from."
    r "我就是想离他远点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20592
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_fb7f1266:

    # r "I don't know."
    r "不知道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20594
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_69d5ccef:

    # r "Whether it still is a relationship, or if it ever truly was, I don't know."
    r "这算不算一段感情，或者说，它曾经真的存在过吗？我也不知道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20596
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5d5c8e58:

    # p "It's alright if you prefer not to talk about it."
    p "你要是不想说，也没事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20598
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6fb7a72c:

    # r "I'm sorry."
    r "我错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20600
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_afdcb179:

    # r "I guess it's just making me nervous being this close to being back home in Morocco, and I'm feeling the need to get it off my chest."
    r "可能是快到摩洛哥了吧，我心里有点慌，所以想跟你说说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20602
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9e06bdcd:

    # p "Anyone might feel that way in your place.{w} Don't apologize."
    p "换成任何人在你的立场上，心里多半也会这么想。{w}犯不着道歉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20606
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6e392d6f:

    # p "If talking about it helps, then I can take over the role of the ship's doctor for a moment."
    p "要是说出来会好受点，我不介意暂时扮演一下船医的角色。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20608
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6a34f9c3:

    # p "Though I don't have it in my power to hand you some rum."
    p "虽然我没法给你来上一口朗姆酒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20610
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5a9eca42:

    # "You try to bring some levity into it."
    "你想让气氛变得轻松一点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20612
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e2977f64:

    # "Without much of a reaction."
    "但没什么反应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20614
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_51941a85:

    # r "You know, usually it was him who left."
    r "你知道吗，以前都是他一走了之。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20616
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4f2833a8:

    # r "Days.{p}Weeks.{p}A month or two."
    r "几天。{p} 几周。{p} 一两个月。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20618
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_69c507f6:

    # r "I told him that I had a brighter future, that we would never speak again."
    r "我跟他说我会有更好的前途，我们以后都别再见面了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20622
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_0e493581:

    # "She shakes her head."
    "她摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20626
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9aa7a203:

    # r "I suppose I meant all of it, at the time."
    r "我想当时我是真的这么想的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20628
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_689cde29:

    # p "I'd probably feel the same if my partner kept on disappearing again and again."
    p "如果我的伴侣总是动不动就消失，我大概也会有一样的感觉吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20630
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5bf73ac9:

    # p "He never told you why?"
    p "他没告诉你原因吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20632
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a722d5af:

    # r "Not for any one disappearance as he left, but I knew."
    r "倒不是因为哪一次 конкретно 的失踪，但我心里有数。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20634
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d2f449ee:

    # r "He never made it too much of secret to me that when his family comes calling he comes to help."
    r "他也没怎么瞒我，只要家里人来求助，他就会去帮忙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20636
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_777595a0:

    # r "If we needed money? He went and got it."
    r "我们要是缺钱？他就去搞钱。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20644
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c096715e:

    # "She shrugs and checks one of the boxes herself to speed up the process, setting it back into the shelf as one that must not have been for her."
    "她耸耸肩，自己也拿起一个箱子检查了起来，想加快速度，然后又放回了架子上，看来不是她的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20650
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d14f3820:

    # r "I appreciate you having an open ear for me, but I'm just keeping you from your rest longer than necessary."
    r "谢谢你听我倾诉，不过我好像耽误你太久了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20652
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_652fddc5:

    # r "Especially on a dog watch I don't want to steal too much of what little there is."
    r "尤其是在这种午夜班，我可不想占你那点休息时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20654
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_90aa9412:

    # r "I'm sure it's just the excitement of being this close to home again and not knowing how everything has changed after that time."
    r "估计就是快到家了，有点兴奋，又有点担心这么久没回去，家里都变了样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20660
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4edff769:

    # r "The opportunity I got provided that distance and gave me the space to learn my trade."
    r "也是那次机会让我离他远远的，能安心学手艺。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20662
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_626cdfc8:

    # r "And later led me to Arthur, and in turn this ship."
    r "后来又遇到了Arthur，然后才上了这条船。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20664
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_765d7645:

    # r "So it is the reason why you are talking to me right now in the first place."
    r "所以说到底，我才能在这儿跟你说话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20666
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_46bf85bc:

    # r "But... Can't say I'm not feeling a little nervous coming back."
    r "不过......要说一点都不紧张，那肯定是假的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20668
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_32e2b9e7:

    # r "Not just coming back top him, but coming back to everything to see how it changed."
    r "不光是回去见他，也是要回去看看一切都变成什么样了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20670
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_079bb181:

    # r "However I'm just keeping you from your rest longer than necessary."
    r "However I'm just keeping you from your rest longer than necessary."

# game/script day2.rpy:20672
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_652fddc5_1:

    # r "Especially on a dog watch I don't want to steal too much of what little there is."
    r "尤其是在这种午夜班，我可不想占你那点休息时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20674
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_68dcd71f:

    # r "Let's get this done so you can get your rest."
    r "赶紧弄完，让你去休息吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20676
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_827e8ffc:

    # "She briefly adjust the cuff of her sleeve and checks another box."
    "她稍稍整理了一下袖口，又勾选了一个方框。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20678
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4f2affd7:

    # p "Been quite a while that you've been with this ship then."
    p "那你在这艘船上待的时间不短了啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20680
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_aa4b0f5c:

    # r "It has."
    r "是啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20682
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_18777e81:

    # r "Truth be told I never felt much of a urge to go out to sea. Who wants to operate on someone with the added difficulty of waves, mice, and the loving odor of bilgewater spilling into the upper decks?"
    r "说实话，我以前真没想过要出海。谁会喜欢在波涛汹涌、老鼠乱窜，还弥漫着令人作呕的舱底污水气味的船上给人动手术？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20686
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_44ee7690:

    # r "No, no, no."
    r "不，我可受不了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20688
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cf110c71:

    # r "I was a new surgeon and it was difficult enough on steady ground."
    r "我当时只是个刚入行的新外科医生，就算在陆地上都够呛了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20690
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_3e26adee:

    # r "It was a bit of a shock when I came on board."
    r "所以刚上船的时候，我确实有点震惊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20692
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5b613f8d:

    # p "Don't have to tell me."
    p "这还用你说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20694
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_dbb9a05b:

    # p "I {i}want{/i} to be here and it still is a struggle to get used to it."
    p "我{i}想{/i}留在这里，但到现在都还在努力适应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20698
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2ee6e40d:

    # r "So yes, it has been longer than I assume it would become, but I suppose life just has a habit of taking you in directions you don't expect."
    r "所以嘛，待的时间确实比我想象的要长，不过我想人生就是这样，总是会把你带到意想不到的方向。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20700
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_197706ad:

    # "The cheetah shakes her head and takes one of the boxes you checked already to store it again."
    "cheetah摇了摇头，拿起你已经检查过的一个箱子，重新放了回去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20704
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7025ed05:

    # r "Did you check this one?"
    r "这个你检查过了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20706
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6186867a_1:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20710
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_af03b426:

    # r "What this ship does provide though is a bit of a calmer place to work."
    r "不过，这艘船确实能提供一个相对平静的工作环境。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20713
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9eec346a:

    # p "Very un-cheetah like."
    p "真不像猎豹会做的事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20717
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ec49d1a1:

    # "She playfully chides you to stop it."
    "她笑着嗔怪你别说了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20721
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e6881625:

    # r "Most days at least."
    r "至少大多数时候是这样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20723
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4846781d:

    # r "Much different to what I would be dealing with in a hospital."
    r "和我在医院里要面对的情况可太不一样了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20725
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_84a35bcf:

    # r "And I guess testament to the draw Arthur had on me."
    r "我想这也证明了Arthur对我的吸引力有多大。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20727
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4d1e195d:

    # r "He can be rather convincing."
    r "他啊，说起话来能把你给说服了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20729
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6dea7b5a:

    # p "A side of him I've yet to see..."
    p "我还没见过他那一面呢……"

# game/script day2.rpy:20731
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5bd85ef7:

    # r "When would I ever be allowed to hold the status of the head doctor in any hospital?"
    r "我什么时候才能在医院里当上院长啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20733
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e8bd9568:

    # r "No matter how many years I'd work my tail off, in the end I'd always be a supporting actor to my male colleagues."
    r "不论我拼命苦干多少年，到头来在那些男同行眼里，我都永远只能充当个跑腿打杂的配角。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20735
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1f575e9b:

    # r "In came Arthur with the promise of my own little hospital."
    r "结果Arthur出现了，还答应给我一间属于我的小医院。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20737
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_89eb9665:

    # r "He knew I needed the change."
    r "他知道我需要改变。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20739
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7c21d2a8:

    # r "This ship promised exactly what I wanted at the time."
    r "当时这艘船能给我的，正是我想要的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20741
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_cd2feb57:

    # r "My hospital."
    r "我的医院。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20743
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9f547daa:

    # r "One without as much death around."
    r "一个没有那么多死亡的地方。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20745
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_320fbb0f:

    # r "And colleagues... friends, who appreciate the care I can provide them with."
    r "还有同僚……真正感激我悉心照料的真心朋友。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20749
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f8714515:

    # r "Though..."
    r "“不过话说回来…”"

# game/script day2.rpy:20751
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c7e71d3f:

    # r "What death there is weighs heavier on the heart."
    r "这里的死亡，每一桩都让人更加痛心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20753
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a4dc8f07:

    # r "I've yet to decide if making friends of the people you know might very well be your future patients is a good thing or not."
    r "我还没想好，把认识的人变成自己未来的病人，这到底是好事儿还是坏事儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20755
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_e99e5da5:

    # r "Perhaps I'll grow wise enough to make a decision in the future."
    r "也许以后我能想明白吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20757
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_29aac4be:

    # p "I can only imagine."
    p "我能想象。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20759
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_24317ba1:

    # r ". . ."
    r ". . ."

# game/script day2.rpy:20761
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_40e43632:

    # r "I suppose it might be."
    r "也许吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20763
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2835412b:

    # "She stops again, a pregnant silence laying heavily between her words."
    "她又停了下来，沉默在两人之间蔓延，沉甸甸的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20765
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8188533a:

    # r "Up until the point where you can't do anything for them, or they simply get swept out to sea and you aren't even given the courtesy of trying..."
    r "直到你对他们无能为力，或者他们直接被海浪吞噬，你甚至连救助的机会都没有..."

# game/script day2.rpy:20767
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_39b5bfc2:

    # r "When all that is left is a solemn silence."
    r "当一切都归于沉寂。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20769
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_03ca50af:

    # r "And an empty hammock..."
    r "还有一张空荡荡的吊床..."

# game/script day2.rpy:20771
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b8695b8f:

    # "She looks over at the doorway with a pensiveness clouding her eyes."
    "她望向门口，眼神里满是心事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20773
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7bb7ea87_2:

    # p "I'm sorry."
    p "我错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20775
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8b05c7b3:

    # "You add, not even wanting to imagine it happening on your stay on the ship."
    "你赶紧补充道，真不想这种事发生在我待在这船上的日子里。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20777
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_dce75c5b:

    # "She swallows."
    "她咽了口唾沫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20781
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_133066e4:

    # r "Sorry."
    r "“对不起。”"

# game/script day2.rpy:20783
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8a053020:

    # r "I don't know why I brought it up."
    r "我也不知道自己怎么就说起这个了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20785
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_060f6e8c:

    # r "I shouldn't even mention the possibility. Or what good has it ever done to summon bad luck by calling to it?"
    r "我真不该提这些。没事儿自己吓唬自己干嘛，乌鸦嘴！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20787
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ad18dd0e:

    # p "Probably nothing."
    p "肯定没什么好处。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20789
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d6cb50a0:

    # p "You must know our first mate pretty well if you two worked together on this ship for so long."
    p "你们在这船上共事这么久，肯定很了解我们的大副吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20791
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_11db522b:

    # p "Arthur, I mean."
    p "Arthur，我是说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20795
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_638510c3:

    # "Her ears perk up as you help her veer the conversation away from the previous topic."
    "你岔开话题，想让她别再想之前的事儿，她也来了精神。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20797
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c6e93588:

    # r "I do."
    r "认识。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20801
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_33d7542d:

    # r "He is the one who offered to bring me onto this ship in the first place."
    r "当初还是他主动提出让我上船的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20805
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_36912be7:

    # r "A fantastic first mate."
    r "他可是个了不起的大副。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20807
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_3410afc5:

    # r "About the best any vessel could hope for."
    r "任何船都希望能有这么一位大副。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20811
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_970b96ef_1:

    # r "Why?"
    r "为什么？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20815
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d5274e35:

    # p "Er, I planned to ask you about him at dinner."
    p "额，我本来打算晚饭的时候问问你关于他的事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20819
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_be1b0dbc:

    # r "You planned to?"
    r "你还打算问他？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20821
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p "那个..."

# game/script day2.rpy:20823
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_88ccf4ac:

    # p "It's not exactly what I {i}wanted{/i} from it. I had hoped for more casual things to talk about."
    p "这跟我想象的有点不一样。我本来想聊点更轻松的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20825
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_efacb485:

    # p "At least yesterday, when I first asked you for the dinner."
    p "至少昨天我第一次邀请你吃晚饭的时候是这么想的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20827
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c6102c2b:

    # p "But, I feel like he's been treating me unfairly since I joined."
    p "可是，自从我来了之后，总觉得他对我不太公平。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20831
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_75d565f2:

    # p "I don't know if it quite feels like that to me."
    p "我倒没觉得。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20833
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_511c6168:

    # p "I'm sure you must be telling the truth, but I feel like he has been treating me unfairly since I joined."
    p "我知道你肯定说的是实话，可我就是觉得自从我来了之后，他对我一直不公平。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20835
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b740b0b9:

    # p "Hounding me for every mistake and seeing my fault in everything that's happening."
    p "总是盯着我的错处，好像什么事儿都是我搞砸的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20837
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4e1d1101:

    # p "Surely it can't be that he's like this to everyone.{w} No, I {i}know{/i} that it isn't how he treats everyone."
    p "他肯定不是对谁都这样吧。{w} 不，我{i}知道{/i}他待人肯定不是一概而论。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20841
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6ad89850:

    # p "That is I wanted to talk with you about, since you've worked on this ship for a while."
    p "我就是想跟你打听打听他，毕竟你在这船上干了这么久。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20845
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ce8a480e:

    # p "You worked on this ship for a long time."
    p "你在这船上工作很久了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20847
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_bc9af7bc:

    # p "You know him well, and probably know what draws his ire."
    p "你很了解他，应该知道什么会触怒他吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20851
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1839cd61:

    # r "Sure."
    r "行吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20853
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d8050f1b:

    # r "But only if you check the box you've been holding on for all of eternity so we can be done here."
    r "行，那你先把手里那箱子点了，咱们也好交差。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20857
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2e021007:

    # "Suddenly the sensation of the wood against the pads of your fingers returns to your attention and you snap into action to open it up."
    "突然，你注意到手指指腹传来的木头触感，赶紧打开了箱子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20859
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5404aa1d:

    # p "He's been a real piece of work."
    p "他可真是个难对付的家伙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20861
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_12cd3a24_1:

    # p "Well..."
    p "那个..."

# game/script day2.rpy:20863
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_4ab7fe25:

    # p "Maybe I am?"
    p "也许我是？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20867
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d25cfebf:

    # "You unfold the manifest while you talk and check for the name."
    "你一边说话，一边展开货物清单，查找名字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20869
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b17c2e89:

    # "Rajeeyah al-Maghribi."
    "Rajeeyah al-Maghribi。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20871
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a306126c:

    # "Another one for her."
    "又是她的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20873
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_03f492f7:

    # r "He can be harsh."
    r "他的确挺严厉的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20877
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1808b714:

    # r "And you didn't make the best first impression yesterday during dinner."
    r "而且昨天晚餐的时候，你给他的第一印象不太好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20879
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9f035f1d:

    # r "I'm not sure why you thought having dinner with us would be acceptable."
    r "我真不知道你哪来的想法，觉得可以和我们一起吃饭。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20881
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7040fe73:

    # r "Though usually he does make an effort to be lenient with entirely new landsmen and ease you lot into things."
    r "不过，他通常还是会尽量宽容那些刚上船的新手，让你们慢慢适应。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20883
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ca8eb115:

    # r "Mind you, only for a few days before you better start carrying your weight, but he does know that it can be a lot to get to know the ropes."
    r "当然了，也就那么几天，之后你们最好开始承担起自己的责任。不过他明白，要熟悉这些规矩确实需要时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20885
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8e861d26:

    # r "But in the end all he cares about is sailing, this ship, and the sailors that keep this little wooden world afloat."
    r "但说到底，他最关心的还是航海，这艘船，以及那些让这小小的木头世界漂浮在海上的水手们。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20887
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_3c9ddeb2:

    # r "Do that well and he will be satisfied."
    r "把这些做好，他就会满意。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20891
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_abd0b026:

    # "You put the box with the others."
    "你把箱子和其它的堆放在一起。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20893
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_f612cdd7:

    # p "Those are all for you."
    p "这些都是给你的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20897
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_39ab08d0:

    # r "Perfect, thank you, Mr. [family_name]. Would you be so kind and carry those two?"
    r "太好了，谢谢您，[family_name]先生。您能帮我拿这两个吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20903
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6379df03:

    # p "I can do that. Where to?"
    p "没问题。送到哪儿？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20905
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_5443ae65:

    # r "Whatever table is still open next to the caboose."
    r "随便放到船尾小屋旁边哪张空着的桌子上就行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20907
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_072e1a70:

    # r "That is if you still would like to sit down together for dinner."
    r "如果您还愿意赏光，一起吃个晚饭的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20909
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_eddfaffe:

    # "Your ears perk up at the suggestion and some new energy floods through you."
    "听到这话，你立刻竖起了耳朵，一股新的力量涌上心头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20911
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_07a55bc3:

    # p "Of course. I'd like that!"
    p "当然！我很愿意！"

# game/script day2.rpy:20917
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_87a38043:

    # r "I'll take the other and we can head for supper if you like."
    r "我来拿另一个，您看咱们是不是可以去吃晚饭了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20921
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_05e443c1:

    # r "Then you take those, I'll take the rest and we can head for supper."
    r "那您拿这些，我拿剩下的，咱们去吃晚饭吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20931
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d08eca93:

    # "You bend down to pick up the boxes before leading Rajeeyah through the open door and back to the open deck around the caboose."
    "你弯腰拿起箱子，然后带着Rajeeyah穿过敞开的门，回到了船尾小屋周围的甲板上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20938
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_c4ade1ac:

    # "The place is lively with activity as everyone is busy taking their dinner, spinning yarns, smoking, or just enjoying the company of the other sailors during their time off."
    "这里热闹得很，大伙儿有的在吃晚饭，有的在吹牛，有的在抽烟，或者只是在休息的时候享受和水手们待在一起的时光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20950
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_eda1267f:

    # "You spot an open table and hurry over to lay claim to it with the two boxes you're lugging with you."
    "你发现一张空桌子，赶紧过去，把你拖着的两个箱子放上去占位子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20956
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_54949339:

    # "She leisurely follows suit and drops off what she is carrying as well."
    "她也不紧不慢地跟上来，放下她手里的东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20958
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_1b2b76b7:

    # p "Dinner.{w} Finally."
    p "晚餐。{w} 终于。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20960
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6294b791:

    # p "We're getting to the good parts."
    p "要开始精彩的部分了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20964
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d12c6555:

    # r "Helping me wasn't the good part?"
    r "帮我忙还不算精彩吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20966
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_119511e6:

    # p "There are two parts to it."
    p "分两部分说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20968
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_bc866b48:

    # "She curiously cocks her head to the side."
    "她好奇地歪着头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20970
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_0034e327:

    # r "Which are?"
    r "哪两部分？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20972
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_6584aec1:

    # p "The part that involves helping during my valuable time off. That one is the bad one."
    p "一部分是占用了我宝贵的休息时间帮忙，这部分很糟糕。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20974
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b839b7f1:

    # p "And the part where the work is done alongside you."
    p "还有...能和你一块儿干活。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20976
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8c63606c:

    # p "Now that is what makes it bearable."
    p "这么一来，倒也能忍受了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20978
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2c205df7:

    # r "Bearable, huh?"
    r "能忍受，嗯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20980
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_be76fb5b:

    # r "I didn't realize that my presence would receive the high praise of being \"bearable.\""
    r "我没想到我的存在竟然能得到“能忍受”这么高的评价。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20982
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9b37eea2:

    # p "I can't sound too eager, can I? It would make it awkward."
    p "我不能显得太急切，是吧？那样就尴尬了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20986
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a5b73807:

    # r "So you thought this would be awkward, but not asking for a kiss?"
    r "所以你觉得这事儿会尴尬，但索吻就不会？"

# game/script day2.rpy:20988
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_62b6754d:

    # p "Well... it was."
    p "嗯...是的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20990
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_7bb7ea87_3:

    # p "I'm sorry."
    p "我错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20992
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_54f1f7c6:

    # p "I guess this is me just learning how not to be an idiot..."
    p "看来我这就是在学着怎么才能不当个傻瓜..."

# game/script day2.rpy:20994
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_0da161a9:

    # p "But... let's see."
    p "但是...我寻思寻思。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20996
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2fec2880:

    # p "Doing it in your company is what made it enjoyable."
    p "有你陪着，干活才变得有趣。"

# game/script day2.rpy:20998
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_77ba347f:

    # p "Is that better?"
    p "这样说好点了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21002
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d709f93c:

    # r "Enjoyable... Yes, that will do."
    r "有趣...这词儿不错。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21008
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_a2eb9fd6:

    # r "I'll take the other and we have to bring them down to the surgery."
    r "我拿另一个，咱们得把这些搬到手术室去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21019
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ae453a07:

    # "You bend down to pick up the boxes before leaving through the open door to lead Rajeeyah on the way back to the cabin."
    "你弯腰拿起箱子，穿过敞开的门，领着Rajeeyah往船舱走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21021
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d8d05e44:

    # "The chatter of the crew grows louder as soon as you exit the compartment and make your way to the stairs."
    "你一走出隔间，走向楼梯，船员们的嘈杂声就更大了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21023
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_420e493d:

    # "You glance over your shoulder whenever you talk to her."
    "你和她说话的时候，总是不由自主地回头看她。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21025
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_be49d6dd:

    # p "That's what everyone's been telling me."
    p "大家都这么跟我说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21027
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_03bb8318:

    # p "Learn fast this, be a good sailor that...{p}Hasn't helped."
    p "快点学会这些，成为一个好水手...{p}可没什么用。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21029
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_8116f7b1:

    # p "Which is what I mean when I say it feels like he has it out for me."
    p "所以我才说，感觉他好像故意跟我过不去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21031
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_ecaed77a:

    # p "Did I make some mistakes?"
    p "我犯什么错了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21033
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_05224883:

    # p "Sure."
    p "行吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21037
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_9138a750:

    # p "But was my dinner blunder yesterday really a good enough reason to still be all over my tail?"
    p "我就不明白了，昨天晚餐那点破事儿，至于现在还死盯着我不放吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21041
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_65adfe66:

    # r "Breaking rank?"
    r "坏了规矩？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21043
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_dba0d616:

    # r "It's not looked upon favorably. Especially when you do it so boldly, or stupidly might be the better word for it, as you did yesterday."
    r "这事儿行不通的。尤其是你昨天那么明目张胆，或者说蠢到家了，就更行不通了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21049
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_3f46f6ba:

    # p "But it's hardly reason enough to be all over my tail like that."
    p "但这也不至于让你这样死盯着我不放吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21051
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_d865e048:

    # "Rajeeyah stops you before you go down the stairs and proposes that you go first so that she can pass you the boxes one by one, instead of risking them falling while going down."
    "你正要下楼，Rajeeyah 叫住了你，提议让你先下去，她再一个一个地把箱子递给你，免得下楼的时候箱子掉下去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21055
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_2a4d4c2a:

    # "You agree, descend to the next deck and wait for her to give you the first box."
    "你同意了，下到下一层甲板，等着她把第一个箱子递给你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21057
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_55e27ecd:

    # r "Hmm, it is unusual, I admit, would you like me to ask him about it?"
    r "嗯... 确实有点奇怪，我承认。要不我去帮你问问他？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21059
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_b34049d9:

    # p "Oh god, please don't!"
    p "哦，我的老天，千万别！"

# game/script day2.rpy:21061
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_436e8332:

    # p "Every time he speaks to me, or my name comes up, it only seems to get worse. I don't think it would do me any favors if you just went up and asked about me."
    p "每次他跟我说话，或者提到我的名字，情况只会更糟。你要是直接跑去问他关于我的事，我肯定吃不了兜着走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21063
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_51dbd180:

    # r "Hm...{w} I understand... I will keep my ears open when I'm with him and the other gentlemen though. Perhaps I can glean something when I'm sitting with them."
    r "嗯... {w} 我明白了... 不过，我和他还有其他人在一块儿的时候，我会留个心眼的。说不定我在他们旁边坐着的时候，能打探点消息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21065
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_07ced154:

    # p "That would be appreciated, Doctor."
    p "那就多谢您了，医生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21067
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_745da3d0:

    # "The last box makes it to you and it's just another minute before you dropped them off in Samuel's current cabin and head back to your precious break time."
    "最后一个箱子也递给你了，又过了一会儿，你把它们放在Samuel现在的船舱里，然后回去享受你宝贵的休息时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21069
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahafterdinner_df301323:

    # "Rajeeyah thanks you for your help before she excuses herself to take her dinner with the other officers and the captain."
    "Rajeeyah 感谢你的帮忙，然后找了个借口和其他军官还有船长一块儿去吃晚饭了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21083
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_a67acb3a:

    # r "Let's get something to eat."
    r "咱们去吃点东西吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21087
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_4b57a61c:

    # w "He will not." with vpunch
    w "他想都别想。" with vpunch

# game/script day2.rpy:21091
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_68ca3748:

    # w "At least not until I get my cut."
    w "至少在我拿到我那份之前，没门儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21096
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_9d75edbd:

    # "Wolf's voice sends a jolt through your body, clearing up any lingering fatique from earlier in an instant, and replaces it with an adrenaline-spiked tension, much to the chagrin of Rajeeyah who must have seen him coming up behind you."
    "Wolf 的声音像一道闪电击穿了你的身体，瞬间扫清了你之前残留的疲惫，取而代之的是肾上腺素飙升的紧张感。Rajeeyah 肯定早就看到他从你身后摸过来了，现在肯定气得牙痒痒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21105
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_feb01ec5:

    # "You watch the dark shape of his emerges in the corner of your eye, and his leg brushes against your tail as he steps out from behind you and stops between you and Rajeeyah."
    "你眼角的余光瞥见一个黑影，他从你身后走了出来，腿蹭到了你的尾巴，然后停在你和 Rajeeyah 之间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21107
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f337b5f4:

    # p "FUCKING HELL, WOLF!"
    p "我去你的，Wolf！"

# game/script day2.rpy:21109
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_553b8497:

    # p "Do you have to scare me like that?"
    p "你非得这么吓唬我吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21111
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_4309ad3a:

    # w "No."
    w "不行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21113
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_46b64cdf:

    # p "Why do it then?"
    p "明知故问？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21115
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_5cb828ce:

    # w "Your lack of awareness isn't my fault.{w} She didn't flinch, did she?"
    w "你自个儿后知后觉，可怪不到我头上。{w}她自己都没退缩畏惧，不是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21117
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_0e494314:

    # "You raise your hand in an animated gesture towards the cheetah."
    "你抬起手，手舞足蹈地指向那只猎豹。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21119
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b0a91728:

    # p "Of course she didn't! She probably saw you creeping up behind me!"
    p "她当然没被吓着！她估计早就看到你鬼鬼祟祟地摸到我身后了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:21121
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_e71e2b53:

    # p "Ugh, whatever, what do you want?"
    p "真是服了，你到底想干嘛？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21133
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b7f094c3:

    # "Wolf raises his arms to rest them against a crossbeam and crosses his legs as he calls for Bandile."
    "Wolf 抬起胳膊，靠在横梁上，翘起二郎腿，然后叫 Bandile 过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21142
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_18da7adb:

    # w "Cook! Dinner ration for me and for him. I'll take 'em both."
    w "厨子！给我和他准备两份晚饭。都给我拿过来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21146
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_3d17e4d4:

    # w "Cook! Dinner ration for me and for him. Halve his and add it to mine."
    w "厨子！给我和他准备两份晚饭。把他的那份匀一半到我这儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21148
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_8f3241f2:

    # p "What?!"
    p "哈？！"

# game/script day2.rpy:21152
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_fcaf40fe:

    # w "What? Forgot the game already?{p}You owe me."
    w "怎么，这么快就忘了规矩了？{p}你还欠我呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21156
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_326f3a5b:

    # b "I'm afraid you're not in a position to take the ration of others. I have to make sure everyone gets their allotted share."
    b "恐怕你不能动别人的口粮。我得保证每个人都有份。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21160
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_1e15aa30:

    # w "It's a bet, mate. Just taking what's mine."
    w "这是老子的赌注，伙计。我只是拿回我该得的那份。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21162
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d140efb2:

    # "You feel Wolf's hand grip your upper arm firmly as he drags you closer."
    "你感到Wolf一把抓住你的上臂，把你拽了过去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21164
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_27e0019e:

    # b "Is that true?"
    b "真的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21166
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_41ab8786:

    # "The rabbit leans forward and looks at you intently, scanning for the truth as he waits for your reply."
    "那只兔子凑近了，眼神专注地打量着你，想从你的表情里搜寻出真相。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21172
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_8678bd07:

    # p "Fine... yes, I lost at dice. Just hand him the bowl."
    p "好吧……我承认，骰子我输了。把碗给他吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21176
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_4a8efa8d:

    # p "Man, I hoped you would forget, but does it have to be today? I wanted to eat together with her."
    p "老天，我还想着你能忘了这茬呢，非得是今天？我还想和她一块儿吃呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21178
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_8138b201:

    # "You watch Bandile scoop out two lumps of green stuff and drop them into bowls with a flourish. He sprinkles some salt on them and passes them to Wolf."
    "你看着Bandile耍了个花样，舀出两坨绿糊糊，扔进碗里。他撒了点盐，递给了Wolf。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21182
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f161a09c:

    # b "He owes you the grog, too?"
    b "他也欠你酒钱？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21184
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_975f28bb:

    # w "You bet."
    w "那是当然。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21188
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_6a866d0e:

    # p "Well, yes. Stupid dice... Just do as he says. I'll get by on half a ration."
    p "好吧，没错。都怪那该死的骰子……按他说的做吧。我省着点，一半口粮也能凑合。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21192
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_27e3a0e3:

    # p "I had hoped you would forget."
    p "我还希望能蒙混过关呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21194
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_63de3a62:

    # "You watch Bandile scoop out two lumps of green stuff and drop them into bowls with a flourish, then cut one of them in half and add it to the other bowl, piling it up high enough to extend beyond the rim of the bowl."
    "你看着Bandile耍了个花样，舀出两坨绿糊糊，扔进碗里，又把其中一坨切成两半，堆到另一个碗里，都快冒出来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21196
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_7056b8a1:

    # "He sprinkles some salt on them and passes them to you, Wolf snatching his overfilled one, while you settle for your meager starvation ration."
    "他撒了点盐，递给你。Wolf一把抢过那碗冒尖的，你只能认命地接过你那点可怜的口粮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21200
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f161a09c_1:

    # b "He owes you the grog, too?"
    b "他也欠你酒钱？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21202
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_975f28bb_1:

    # w "You bet."
    w "那是当然。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21208
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_94440ff2:

    # p "Bandile, what's on the menu today anyway? Certainly doesn't look like we're being treated to salmon anymore."
    "Bandile，今儿个菜单上是啥啊？看来咱们是没指望再吃上鲑鱼喽。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21217
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_822e337d:

    # r "Dog's body."
    r "狗粮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21219
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_3477d555:

    # "Rajeeyah interjects."
    "Rajeeyah插嘴道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21221
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_916fa049:

    # r "The salmon is a one-time meal at the beginning of the journey.{w} Makes sure everyone departs in high spirits."
    "鲑鱼就开船的时候吃一顿。{w} 保证大家伙儿都精神抖擞地出发。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21225
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_9d99b75e:

    # b "Precisely! And it lets me have some fun.{w} Only so much I can do with dog's body. I had some lemon and asparagus over from yesterday that I mixed into it, might taste interesting enough."
    b "就是！而且我也能找点乐子。{w} 这狗粮也变不出什么花样。我把昨天剩下的柠檬和芦笋掺进去了，没准味道还挺新鲜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21227
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_61faa935:

    # p "Sounds as if I can count myself lucky that I didn't gamble yesterday's dinner away."
    p "这么说来，我还得感谢自己昨天没把晚饭给赌光了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21229
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_86966c00:

    # b "Most certainly."
    b "那是当然。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21239
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_18804fef:

    # p "And we're square then, Wolf?"
    p "那咱们就扯平了，Wolf？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21243
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_23542a60:

    # "You glance at Wolf who has already taken his first bite and is about to leave. He nods briefly at you before he walks away to find a quiet spot to eat."
    "你瞟了Wolf一眼，他已经啃了一口，准备开溜了。他冲你点了下头，就走开找地方吃饭去了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21245
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_86d9f1aa:

    # "You follow suit to sit down at the table with Rajeeyah."
    "你也跟着在桌边坐下，挨着Rajeeyah。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21257
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_313201d9:

    # "You you raise your paw to get Bandile's attention, who looks up from the cleaning duties he had turned to for a moment."
    "你抬起爪子想引起Bandile的注意，他抬头看了看，他刚才在忙着收拾。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21259
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_2d942a9a:

    # b "One for you as well?"
    b "你也来一份？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21261
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_615781e9:

    # "You nod and watch Bandile turn to the large pot and scoop out a lump of green stuff that he drops into a bowl with a flourish. It doesn't look as appetizing as yesterday's Salmon... gone is the mouth-watering sizzling sound as well."
    "你点点头，看着Bandile转向大锅，舀出一坨绿糊糊，花里胡哨地扔进碗里。看起来远不如昨天的鲑鱼那么诱人…… 让人流口水的滋啦声也没了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21267
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_a065dfc6:

    # "He adds some salt on top to spice up the green blob and hands you the bowl."
    "他往绿糊糊上撒了点盐，把碗递给你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21269
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_3bb6d3e4:

    # p "No salmon today, I take it?"
    "今天没鲑鱼吃咯？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21271
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_3b409a75:

    # b "No, no. It's dog's body."
    b "没啦，没啦。是狗粮。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21273
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_9ac59fa3:

    # "He explains as you inspect your dinner."
    "你一边打量着你的晚餐，他一边解释道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21275
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_916fa049_1:

    # r "The salmon is a one-time meal at the beginning of the journey.{w} Makes sure everyone departs in high spirits."
    "鲑鱼就开船的时候吃一顿。{w} 保证大家伙儿都精神抖擞地出发。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21277
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_6fcffdc2:

    # "Rajeeyah interjects from behind you."
    "Rajeeyah 在你身后插了句嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21281
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_9d99b75e_1:

    # b "Precisely! And it lets me have some fun.{w} Only so much I can do with dog's body. I had some lemon and asparagus over from yesterday that I mixed into it, might taste interesting enough."
    b "就是！而且我也能找点乐子。{w} 这狗粮也变不出什么花样。我把昨天剩下的柠檬和芦笋掺进去了，没准味道还挺新鲜。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21283
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_07dced42:

    # r "I'm sure it'll be great, Bandile."
    r "我相信肯定很美味，Bandile。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21285
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_af1d6a41:

    # "You see the rabbit smile and close his eyes as you and Rajeeyah head off to find a place to sit down."
    "你看到那兔子笑着闭上了眼睛，你和 Rajeeyah 便动身去找座位。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21295
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_16484d24:

    # "The two of you walk past the others to get to your empty table. You sit yourself down, with the hull of the ship almost hugging you on one side, and the busy open deck on the other."
    "你们俩穿过人群，来到一张空桌子旁。你一屁股坐下，一边是紧挨着的船身，另一边是熙熙攘攘的甲板。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21301
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_83782b6f:

    # "On the opposite side of the table you watch as she holds her dress aside before sitting down on the bench. The singular clank of but one bowl placed on the table leaving you to look at hers with a pang of envy..."
    "你坐在桌子对面，只见她撩起裙子，在长凳上坐了下来。桌上“当”地一声只放了一个碗，让你看着她的那份，心里直犯酸..."

# game/script day2.rpy:21303
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_e10baa87:

    # "You know, you can ask..."
    "你知道，你可以开口要一点..."

# game/script day2.rpy:21310
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_05d08c96:

    # p "May I try some of yours?{w} Just a bite."
    p "能让我尝一口吗？{w} 就一小口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21314
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_0b49275f:

    # "She raises her eyes from her bowl as she digs her spoon into it."
    "她挖了一勺，从碗里抬起头看着你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21316
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_5bc46b54:

    # r "Oh, so now I am the one you want to suffer for your gambling habits? No, no, I think you are very well served with what you have."
    r "哦，现在想起我了，要我替你承担赌博的后果？想都别想，我觉得你现在这份已经很不错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21320
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_4e590245:

    # "Her words carry a playful tone and she points over to the empty spot where your bowl could have been."
    "她俏皮地指了指你本该放碗的空位。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21322
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_147288ff:

    # p "Harsh."
    p "真狠。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21324
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_c3a11957:

    # r "I learned quickly that as a doctor on a ship, I sometimes have to make the calls that, while for their own good, have people scream at me."
    r "当了船医我才明白，有时候为了他们好，我不得不做出一些让他们对我大呼小叫的决定。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21326
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_fc9681ab:

    # r "Usually over something rather more severe than missing supper, though."
    r "当然，通常是因为比没饭吃更严重的事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21330
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_35891647:

    # p "Please remind me to never get injured."
    p "记住，千万别让我受伤。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21332
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_99bd53e2:

    # "She chuckles before taking her first bite of her meal."
    "她吃吃地笑了，然后开始享用她的晚餐。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21336
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_a856fd92:

    # "You bite your lips and live with your lot of watching the cheetah savor her meal alone."
    "你只能咬咬牙，认命了，眼巴巴地看着猎豹独自享受美餐。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21338
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_226050e2:

    # r "Let's see if he was honest about the asparagus and lemon, or if it's just plain dog's body."
    r "看看他有没有在芦笋和柠檬上说谎，还是说这玩意儿真是名副其实的“劣质食物”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21340
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_cbcef4a1:

    # p "Rub it in, will ya?"
    p "你是故意气我的吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21342
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ff02765a:

    # "She dips her spoon into the mushy heap to get her first taste of it."
    "她舀起一勺糊糊，尝了第一口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21346
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_a51f430e:

    # "Her eyes trail off to the ceiling as she focuses on the taste."
    "她抬头望向天花板，细细品味。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21348
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_e3a11f98:

    # r "No asparagus yet, but I think I can taste the lemon juice. Doesn't feel like he had a lot of it left over, but this is better than nothing."
    r "还没吃到芦笋，不过我想我尝到了柠檬汁。估计他也没剩多少了，但总比没有强。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21350
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_c7e08a36:

    # r "One of the meals you better get used to, because it'll be served to you often on the meatless days."
    r "这可是你最好习惯的伙食之一，因为在没肉的日子里，你少不了要吃它。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21352
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_202210fa:

    # p "{i}Rub it in, will ya?{/i}"
    p "{i}你是故意气我的吧？{/i}"

# game/script day2.rpy:21356
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ac7e727d:

    # "She holds a hand in front of her muzzle as you force her into a laugh."
    "你逗得她笑了起来，她连忙捂住了嘴。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21358
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_e2a44164:

    # r "I'm sorry, I'll stop."
    r "抱歉，我不说了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21364
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ac9e5060:

    # "On the opposite side of the table you watch as she holds her dress aside before sitting down on the bench."
    "你坐在桌子对面，只见她撩起裙子，在长凳上坐了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21366
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_7f289b8d:

    # "You aimlessly poke your spoon in the green mush that is your food. Quite a far cry from yesterday's dinner."
    "你无精打采地用勺子戳着盘子里绿色的糊状物。这和昨天的晚餐简直是天壤之别。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21370
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f437193a:

    # p "So... dog's body?"
    p "所以...真是“劣质食物”？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21372
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_efff02f1:

    # "The question catches her attention just as she is fixing her dress to sit down."
    "这个问题引起了她的注意，她正要坐下，还在整理裙子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21374
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_94c322b3:

    # r "Hm?... Oh, it's pease pudding. Dog's body the crew calls it."
    r "嗯？...哦，是豌豆布丁。水手们都叫它“劣质食物”。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21378
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_7a043a39:

    # r "Some peas, some butter and salt. Today with some asparagus and a sprinkle of lemon if Bandile is to be believed."
    r "豌豆，黄油和盐。如果Bandile没骗我的话，今天还加了芦笋，再撒上一点柠檬。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21380
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_59100ad6:

    # r "Let's see if he told us the truth."
    r "咱们看看他有没有说实话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21382
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d9f0f693:

    # "She digs her spoon into the soft pile and brings it up to her lips to try."
    "她用勺子挖了一大勺，送到嘴边尝了尝。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21386
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_a51f430e_1:

    # "Her eyes trail off to the ceiling as she focuses on the taste."
    "她抬头望向天花板，细细品味。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21388
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_e3a11f98_1:

    # r "No asparagus yet, but I think I can taste the lemon juice. Doesn't feel like he had a lot of it left over, but this is better than nothing."
    r "还没吃到芦笋，不过我想我尝到了柠檬汁。估计他也没剩多少了，但总比没有强。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21392
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_c7e08a36_1:

    # r "One of the meals you better get used to, because it'll be served to you often on the meatless days."
    r "这可是你最好习惯的伙食之一，因为在没肉的日子里，你少不了要吃它。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21397
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f91bda3a:

    # "You go ahead and try it yourself."
    "你要不要先尝尝？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21399
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d08bc9e6:

    # "It wasn't exactly the gourmet meal from yesterday, and instead tastes about as bland of a mush of peas as it looks like. Though the buttery undertone, and the hint of citrus do just about save it from wanting to throw it in the bin."
    "这玩意儿可比不上昨天那顿大餐，吃起来就是一坨平淡无味的豌豆糊。不过，多亏了那点黄油味儿和一丝丝柑橘的清香，才勉强让人没把它直接扔进垃圾桶。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21403
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_c69a26c2:

    # r "Oh... about Arthur, I've been wondering... Are you certain that you are not just unaware of your mistakes?"
    r "哦……关于Arthur，我一直在想……你是不是根本就没意识到自己犯了错？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21405
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_295d62ab:

    # p "I'm with two other new sailors, but he only appears to be after me."
    p "我和其他两个新来的水手一起，但他好像就盯着我一个人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21407
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_9744532d:

    # p "I don't feel that I am doing much worse than them."
    p "我不觉得我比他们做得更差。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21411
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_fe52b2ae:

    # "You two pause your conversation briefly as a crew member walks by your table to the front of the ship, momentarily blocking the evening sunlight that's streaming through the porthole on the other side of the hull."
    "你们的谈话被打断了片刻，一个船员从桌旁走过，往船头方向去了， 잠깐 挡住了从船舱另一侧舷窗照进来的傍晚阳光。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21413
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_16ac5544:

    # r "I get that he can be harsh, but he is exceptional at what he does, believe me. He just wants the best for the ship, which means getting everyone to the destination safely."
    r "我知道他可能要求严苛，但他确实能力出众，相信我。他只是想让这条船万无一失，确保把大家都安全送到目的地。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21415
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b5180959:

    # r "Just because this is a merchant vessel doesn't mean it's free from many of the dangers that navy sailors talk about back home."
    r "别以为这是艘商船就太平无事了，海军水手们常说的那些危险，咱们这儿一样也少不了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21417
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_07fae332:

    # r "I'm often the first one who has to deal with their consequences."
    r "我呢，就总是第一个要处理那些麻烦事的人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21422
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_34dcc8c9:

    # r "You saw it yourself today and know what something as simple as a worn sheet can do.{p}We're fortunate it only cost some flesh and not the whole leg."
    r "今天你也看到了，就因为一块磨损的帆索，差点出了大事。{p}幸好只是伤了点皮肉，没把整条腿都搭进去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21425
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_1539fbd7:

    # r "You heard what happened to Samuel today and know what something as simple as a worn sheet can do.{p}We're fortunate it only cost some flesh and not the whole leg."
    r "今天Samuel的事你也听说了吧，就是因为一块磨损的帆索，差点酿成大祸。{p}好在只是蹭破了点皮，没把整条腿都赔进去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21427
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_e36a8808:

    # "You lean over the table, putting more weight on it as you lower your voice slightly. The ropes that hold it in place strain under the extra weight."
    "你压低声音，身子也更往前倾了，桌子不堪重负，固定它的绳索也吱吱作响。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21431
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_38969339:

    # p "I get that, Doctor, but Arthur sees {i}me{/i} as somehow being responsible for it."
    p "我明白你的意思，医生。但Arthur总觉得 {i}我{/i} 要为这件事负责。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21435
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_cdf403af:

    # p "No matter my account of the event."
    p "无论我怎么解释都没用。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21439
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d3ba7bf6:

    # p "I wasn't even around when it happened, for goodness' sake."
    p "老天作证，事发当时我根本不在场。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21441
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_476dca29:

    # p "He thinks I somehow tampered with the rope."
    p "他觉得我动了手脚，篡改了绳索。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21445
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_2e4fe14d:

    # p "In his eyes, {i}I{/i} hurt Sam..."
    p "在他眼里， {i}我{/i} 害了Sam……"

# game/script day2.rpy:21447
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_c0594960:

    # r "That is... rather unlike him."
    r "他不像是会这样的人啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21451
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_eeb3c878:

    # r "Did he really accuse you of that?"
    r "他真这么指责你了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21453
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_aeae12e3:

    # p "Well... he didn't outright say it to me, but the implication was rather clear."
    p "倒也没明说，但话里话外的意思很明显。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21459
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d454ecb7:

    # "Rajeeyah hasn't eaten much, mostly she was just moving and stirring the dinner in her bowl while she listens. Sometimes you see the flick of her tail above the edge of the table."
    "Rajeeyah没怎么吃东西，只是有一搭没一搭地搅着碗里的饭，一边听我们说话。偶尔能看到她的尾巴尖儿从桌边扫过。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21463
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_1d0817e8:

    # "You feel a hand on your shoulder before Rajeeyah can say anything as one of the sailors draws your attention."
    "你还没等Rajeeyah开口，就觉得有人拍了下你的肩膀，一个水手正招呼你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21473
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_c42fd9e3:

    # "You look over to the other table and see Konrad leaning forward across the gap between the tables."
    "你朝另一桌看去，Konrad正倾身向前，凑过桌子之间的空隙。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21477
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_21d370a4:

    # "Once he has your attention he turns on his bench to join in with you two."
    "他吸引了你的注意后，便直接转过身，坐到长凳上，加入到你们这边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21493
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_574d2ca7:

    # "He reaches over to your table and pulls your cup of grog towards himself. You try to keep hold of you cup by holding firmly onto the bottom of it when he speaks up."
    "他伸手过来，想把你的格罗酒杯拽走。你赶紧抓紧杯底，想保住自己的酒，这时他开了口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21497
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_91601868:

    # k "Ah-ah, I seem to recall that you still have a debt to pay, lad."
    k "呵-呵，我记得你还欠着债呢，小子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21501
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_4064dab0:

    # p "First Wolf takes half, and now you're trying to rob me blind as well?"
    p "“狼”先拿走了一半，现在你又想把我榨干是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21505
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_bab26d3f:

    # k "A deal's a deal, I did ya work, so I'm just taking what's mine."
    k "说定了就是说定了，我替你干了活儿，所以就拿我应得的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21507
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_375a3a90:

    # "You let go and he lifts the cup off of the table and must have noticed the missing contents of it as he quickly peeks inside."
    "你一松手，他就拿起杯子，似乎发现了里面是空的，立马朝里头瞥了一眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21509
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_587a9818:

    # p "I thought I was on a ship, but I'm surrounded by nothing but sharks..."
    p "我还以为上了条船，结果是误入了狼窝..."

# game/script day2.rpy:21513
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b7a21451:

    # k "You had some already?"
    k "你已经喝了一些了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21515
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b6f6506c:

    # p "I just said Wolf has already got half of it."
    p "我只是说 Wolf 已经拿走一半了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21519
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_cf1b8532:

    # k "Ah, fuck it. I'll be generous today, lad.{w} We're even."
    k "去他妈的。老子今天就大方一回，小子。算清了。{w} "

# game/script day2.rpy:21523
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_493c957e:

    # k "Could have been a bit nicer and actually bring it ta me, but I'll let it slide."
    k "本可以客气点，亲自给老子送来，不过这次就饶了你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21525
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_88c5f218:

    # "You remember the deal you made with him earlier in the day and let go of the cup so he can take it from you."
    "你想起了今天早些时候和他达成的协议，松开了杯子，让他拿走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21529
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_6bacfce1:

    # k "Good lad. Looks like we're even."
    k "小子不错。看来是两清了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21533
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_10c0649d:

    # "He announces with the cup raised and takes a first sip of the grog before he leans in close again, banging it on the table when he puts it down."
    "他举杯示意，灌了一口格罗格，又凑近了些，把杯子往桌上重重一顿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21537
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ecff865b:

    # "His voice is hushed as if he wants to ensure only you and Rajeeyah can hear him."
    "他压低声音，好像只想让你和 Rajeeyah 听见。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21541
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_493b28b9:

    # k "Oi, the ol' Draft you were talking about."
    k "喂，你之前说的那个老征兵令。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21545
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_01c956b5:

    # k "But...Arthur...Listen, the ol' Draft you two were talking about."
    k "但是...Arthur...听着，你们两个之前说的那个老征兵令。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21547
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d3c29219:

    # k "He has never been the same since he came face ta face with a Siren. Lured him in and left us with a cursed first mate."
    k "自从那次和海妖碰面后，他就跟变了个人似的。被海妖迷了心窍，留给咱们一个被诅咒的大副。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21549
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_869bcf90:

    # k "He's seeing ghosts, lad."
    k "他看到鬼魂了，伙计。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21551
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_696ec225:

    # k "Probably thinks ya are the next to haunt his vessel."
    k "恐怕他觉得你就是下一个要来船上作祟的幽灵。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21553
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_2f57fdbf:

    # k "Or fears ya are drawing in the spirits."
    k "或是担心你招来什么妖魔鬼怪。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21555
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d353fc05:

    # r "Mr. Wagner, don't be absurd."
    r "Wagner先生，别说蠢话了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21557
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_7e456b25:

    # "The cheetah interjects with an exasperated sigh escaping her lips."
    "猎豹女士没好气地叹了口气，打断了他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21561
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_75722a20:

    # k "Absurd? Am I wrong?"
    k "蠢话？我说错了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21565
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ecff98bb:

    # r "Yes.{p}Yes, you are."
    r "当然。{p}你当然错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21567
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_921d6b47:

    # r "You know very well that he is not cursed, or possessed, or...{w} Or any other such nonsense like that."
    r "你心里清楚得很，他才没被什么诅咒，也没被什么附身，或者...{w} 或者其他乱七八糟的鬼东西。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21569
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_222ab6f8:

    # r "You've worked with Arthur longer than most of the crew, and know as well as anyone just how well this ship has been run with the help of his care and guidance."
    r "你和Arthur共事的时间比大多数船员都长，你比谁都清楚，在他的悉心照料和英明领导下，这艘船才能运作得这么好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21573
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f85dd372:

    # k "And what makes you think that {i}you{/i} would know?{p}A woman at sea.{p}One not even one of the crew."
    k "你又凭什么 {i}觉得{/i} 自己会知道？{p}一个女人，还跑到船上来。{p}甚至都不是船上的人。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21575
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ca9cac8b:

    # k "Fine dining with the other gentlemen you think yourself to have a better understanding of what the crew knows over a member of the crew himself?"
    k "你以为跟那些绅士们吃了几顿饭，就比我们这些在船上干活的更懂行了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21579
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_633db25e:

    # r "Mr. Wagner, I think the recruit and me have had quite enough of your tales."
    r "Wagner先生，我看我和这位新来的已经听够了你的故事了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21581
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_a2952f45:

    # "She dismisses the lynx with a simple hand gesture, yet Konrad doesn't appear to let himself be turned away so easily."
    "她只是简单地挥了挥手，想让这只猞猁走开，但Konrad看起来并不打算就这么算了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21585
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b5cce787:

    # k "Look, Doctor, with all due respect, but the lad needs to know."
    k "听着，医生，我知道我不该多嘴，但这小伙子有权知道真相。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21587
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_9494e826:

    # k "He is the one who has ta go up the shrouds the next time we're called to. And he has ta make the decision if he wants to follow through with it or not when Arthur's the one calling him ta do something reckless."
    k "下次升帆的时候，可是要他爬上去的。而且如果Arthur让他去干什么傻事，他自己也得拿主意，看看要不要听他的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21589
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_44b02686:

    # k "As one of the most seasoned members of this crew I have a duty to keep him safe. Whether that is teaching him the skills required, or knowledge, or just the crew's history he needs to know."
    k "我是船上最有经验的船员之一，保护他的安全是我的责任。无论是教他必要的技能，知识，还是让他了解咱们船上的一些老故事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21606
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_338a5a06:

    # "You turn to the lynx to invite him to go on as Rajeeyah lets her head slump into the palm of her hand."
    "你转向那边的猞猁，想问问他接下来怎么办，拉姬娅却直接把头撑在手心上，一脸不耐烦。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21612
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_6b4eb0b7:

    # k "Jack-tar ta jack-tar, lad."
    k "老水手对老水手，小兄弟。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21616
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_547ecc0a:

    # k "I won't talk ill of the mate, but keep your wits about ya. The Siren's call is pulling on him every day. Once a sailor hears their call it never completely fades from their ears, even if they make it out alive the first time."
    k "我不会说大副的坏话，但你小子可得留点神。海妖的诱惑每天都在引诱着他。一旦水手听到了海妖的呼唤，那声音就永远挥之不去了，就算侥幸活下来，也摆脱不了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21620
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_68dc04af:

    # k "You either sink to the depths with her, or she'll keep calling, and calling, and calling."
    k "要么就跟着她沉入海底，要么她就一直叫，一直叫，没完没了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21622
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_fd57998d:

    # p "A Siren's call? So he survived an encounter with one?"
    p "海妖的呼唤？这么说，他还活着从海妖手里逃出来了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21626
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_1f4a1a90:

    # "Konrad takes a moment to look around the deck before he leans in close and answers with a faint whisper that crossed his lips."
    "Konrad先是环顾了一下甲板，然后凑近了，压低声音说道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21630
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_2bac6b62:

    # k "{i}He{/i} did."
    k "{i}他{/i}是逃出来了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21632
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_1754b458:

    # r "Mr. Wagner!"
    r "瓦格纳先生！"

# game/script day2.rpy:21636
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_15696699:

    # k "That is all I can say though, one does not talk about such matters on the open sea, lad."
    k "我只能说这么多了，小兄弟，这种事可不能在海上随便乱说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21640
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f281c120:

    # k "It has a tendency ta fall on the ears of the Reaper himself who never tires of following the call."
    k "这种话很容易被死神听到，他老人家最喜欢追着这种召唤不放了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21648
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_81932df7:

    # r "Mr. Wagner, I will not repeat myself, this is quite enough."
    r "瓦格纳先生，我不想重复第二遍，你说的够多了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21650
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b3d7a241:

    # r "We don't need your stories about imaginary curses."
    r "我们这儿不需要什么虚构的诅咒故事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21656
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_6f5d9076:

    # "Konrad slowly turns his head to her and leans back, bringing his hand up to mimic the motion of lifting his cap in a salute."
    "Konrad慢慢地转过头看着她，向后靠去，抬手比划了一个抬帽致敬的姿势。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21666
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_7746e9c9:

    # k "As you wish... {i}Doctor{/i}."
    k "遵命...{i}医生{/i}。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21668
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_910f6b2e:

    # "His last word carries a hint of contempt with it, kept just subtle enough to avoid further repercussions."
    "他最后那句话里带着一丝轻蔑，但隐藏得很深，没让人抓住把柄。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21670
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_dad256be:

    # p "Cursed, huh..."
    p "诅咒，呵呵..."

# game/script day2.rpy:21674
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_fc4cb3bd:

    # r "Don't you start with it as well, look at what you did Mr. Wagner."
    r "你也别跟着瞎掺和，看看你都干了些什么，瓦格纳先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21678
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f5877350:

    # k "Told him the truth he wanted to hear is what I did, Doctor."
    k "我只是告诉他，他想听真话罢了，医生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21680
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f55169d4:

    # k "I don't want nothing ta happen ta the lad."
    k "我可不希望这孩子出什么事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21684
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_68711d33:

    # p "It's alright, Doctor. I wanted him to continue."
    p "没事儿，医生。 我想听他继续说下去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21686
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_fc4f8b13:

    # p "What kind of curse is it?"
    p "那到底是什么诅咒？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21688
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_7d5962d9:

    # k "That I do not know. I don't think anyone does."
    k "我也不知道。 我想没人知道。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21690
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_78fcd7b2:

    # k "We don't have witches on board, or those that are versed in the dark arts. They might be able ta tell, but as a sailor?"
    k "咱们船上又没有女巫，也没有懂巫术的人。 她们或许能看出来，可我们是水手啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21692
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_92218627:

    # k "Nah, we just have a sense for them, lad. One sees a lot out at sea, ya know."
    k "不，我们只是对这些事比较敏感，小兄弟。 你知道的，在海上什么事都有可能发生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21694
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_aa0e71da:

    # p "Really, what kind of things?"
    p "真的吗？ 都有什么事啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21696
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_1f2e543e:

    # k "Appar-"
    k "鬼..."

# game/script day2.rpy:21700
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_60571551:

    # "Rajeeyah quickly raises her voice and cuts him off."
    "拉姬娅突然提高了嗓门，打断了他的话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21702
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b5759fda:

    # r "He can tell you on his own time, not when I decide to offer mine."
    r "他什么时候想说，自然会告诉你，用不着我来安排时间。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21704
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_36b748b5:

    # r "We wanted to sit down together, not with him. And I would prefer my supper to be a quiet affair {i}if{/i} at all possible."
    r "我们想单独坐坐，不想和他一起。 如果可以的话，我希望晚饭能安静点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21706
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_2e72b1e2:

    # "She narrows her eyes at the end of the sentence."
    "说完，她眯起了眼睛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21708
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_53bd4268:

    # "You get the hint."
    "你懂的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21710
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_366c3a97:

    # p "Er... Sorry, Konrad."
    p "额…抱歉，Konrad。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21714
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_2f4a8584:

    # k "Don't worry, I understand. The Doc's not a {i}sailor{/i} after all, is she?"
    k "别担心，我明白。毕竟，咱们的医生又不是个{i}水手{/i}，是吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21716
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_28691dcd:

    # r "Mr. Wagner, If there is one more word I will make sure that the next splinter will happen to require a full amputation."
    r "瓦格纳先生，你要是再多嘴一句，我保证下一块木头渣子就得让你把整条胳膊都锯了！"

# game/script day2.rpy:21720
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_fca9889d:

    # "Konrad laughs heartily at that and turns back to his own table."
    "Konrad听了这话，放声大笑，转身走回了自己的桌子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21722
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_21562e46:

    # k "Point taken, Doctor."
    k "我明白了，医生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21727
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ca20785b:

    # "She looks over to him and her expression softens a little once Konrad is out of earshot."
    "她看了Konrad一眼，等他走远了，听不见了，表情才缓和了一些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21729
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f197f626:

    # p "You two don't exactly sound like best friends."
    p "听你们俩的口气，可不像什么好朋友啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21731
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d2e0a248:

    # r "Friction on a ship is unavoidable."
    r "船上嘛，磕磕碰碰是免不了的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21733
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_626f71ad:

    # r "Some people you don't have to like. All you have to do is to be able to work together."
    r "有些人，你没必要喜欢他们，只要能一起干活就行。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21735
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_4cd8a5e1:

    # r "Thankfully as the surgeon there isn't a whole lot of overlap between my work and theirs. Which rather helps the situation."
    r "幸好我是个外科医生，我的工作和他们没什么交集，这也算帮了大忙了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21737
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_c9c4f691:

    # p "I guess it's bound to happen with so many souls on board."
    p "唉，船上这么多人，总会有点摩擦的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21739
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_6943c074:

    # p "So, you don't believe in the curse?"
    p "这么说，你不信什么诅咒之类的？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21743
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_4416ee76:

    # "She is busy eating again already and raises a brow of hers at your question."
    "她又埋头吃了起来，听到你这么问，抬了抬眉毛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21747
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_e9040aff:

    # r "Can we just..."
    r "我们能不能就…"

# game/script day2.rpy:21749
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_55cf624a:

    # "She pauses and waves at the bowls on the table."
    "她顿了顿，指了指桌上的碗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21751
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_59a22089:

    # r "...focus on the supper, please."
    r "…先好好吃饭，行吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21753
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b4fa6407:

    # "You nod and dig into your own."
    "你点点头，也开始吃自己的那份。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21764
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_16956703:

    # "You smile as you gently remove his hand from your arm."
    "你笑着把他的手从你胳膊上轻轻拿开。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21768
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_f833c5b6:

    # p "I appreciate your concern, Konrad, but I was talking to the Doctor, and {i}only{/i} her."
    p "谢谢你的关心，Konrad，但我和医生说话呢，而且是{i}只{/i}想和她聊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21770
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_04d170ca:

    # p "Not that I don't value your advice and experience, Konrad, but right now I am looking for hers."
    p "不是我不重视你的建议和经验，Konrad，只是我现在想听听医生的看法。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21772
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_df88cf2f:

    # p "Is that alright?"
    p "没问题吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21777
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b4f6d49c:

    # "He leans back over to his table and quietly appears to judge your response for a good couple of seconds, stroking his bearded chin with his thumb."
    "他往后靠回自己的桌子边，安静地盯着你，似乎在评估你的回答，一边用拇指摩挲着满是胡须的下巴，足足过了好几秒。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21779
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_4b74e28f:

    # k "Very well."
    k "好吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21781
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_5c62e74a:

    # k "But don't say I didn't warn ya. I don't think he'll ever doom this vessel, but {i}some{/i} forces are pulling on him."
    k "话先说在前头，到时候别怪我没提醒你。我不觉得他会诅咒这条船，但有{i}些{/i}力量正在影响他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21785
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_e0c9e37f:

    # "He looks into your eyes for a few seconds that linger longer than they should, before he leaves you two to your convesation by turning away and out of earshot."
    "他盯着你的眼睛看了几秒钟，那眼神停留的时间长得有点不正常，然后才转过身去，走开了，让你们俩能好好说话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21788
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_559ac7b8:

    # "He looks into your eyes for a few seconds that linger longer than they should, grabs the cup of grog before he leaves you two to your conversation by turning away and out of earshot."
    "他盯着你的眼睛看了几秒钟，那眼神停留的时间长得有点不正常，拿起一杯格罗酒，然后才转过身去，走开了，让你们俩能好好说话。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21798
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_c265bda4:

    # r "Thank you."
    r "谢谢你。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21802
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_7421d6b3:

    # p "Last thing I need is a cursed first mate."
    p "我最不想看到的就是有个被诅咒的大副。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21806
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_0e493581:

    # "She shakes her head."
    "她摇了摇头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21808
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_6b43daa6:

    # r "Thankfully, you don't have to worry about that. Arthur may be many things, but cursed he is definitely not."
    r "谢天谢地，你不用担心这个。Arthur这人毛病是不少，但肯定没被什么诅咒缠上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21812
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_54a4e04a:

    # r "Sailors just need some... {i}any{/i} explanation for whatever is left unexplained. The weather turning against us. The mast snapping. Someone being lost at sea during a storm..."
    r "水手嘛，总得找点…{i}什么{/i}理由来解释那些说不清道不明的事儿。比如天气突然变坏，桅杆突然断裂，或者有人在暴风雨中失踪…"

# game/script day2.rpy:21814
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_540ef56a:

    # r "I get them.{w} I really do."
    r "我理解他们，{w} 我真的理解。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21818
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_eb77e692:

    # r "I don't envy your or their position of having to climb up and haul in the royals during a gale."
    r "我可不羡慕你们，在大风天还得爬上桅杆收帆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21824
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_7128d4ce:

    # p "I'm sorry if this may hit a sore spot, but I'm surprised that Konrad doesn't exactly hold you in the highest regard."
    p "这话可能有点伤人，但Konrad那家伙好像不太看好你啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21828
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_9557539c:

    # r "He does not."
    r "一点也不像。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21832
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_dc37a3cd:

    # r "It's exactly what Samuel meant by him being a navy guy. He's traditional to the core and with that comes stuff like this."
    r "Samuel说的没错，他就是个海军老古董，满脑子都是老传统。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21834
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_5bbfeb65:

    # r "Legends.{w} Old tales."
    r "都是些传说，{w}老掉牙的故事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21836
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_716d8dd8:

    # r "He can spin you a yarn, but if you should believe him?"
    r "他啊，讲故事倒是挺溜，但能不能信就另说了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21838
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ebf68ad1:

    # r "That I am not so certain of."
    r "我可没把握。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21840
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_0d68667a:

    # r "I'm not sure he even believes it himself, or do you think he'd stay on a cursed ship?"
    r "我甚至怀疑他自己都不信，不然他会待在这艘被诅咒的船上？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21842
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_da390537:

    # r "And he only accept me as long as I stay away from anything looking like a rope."
    r "而且他还只允许我待在这，只要我别碰任何绳子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21846
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_1bfd3eda:

    # r "No women shall go out to sea..."
    r "女人不能出海......"

# game/script day2.rpy:21850
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d5b9d3de:

    # r "Konrad's a traditional guy through and through. Old Salt who's seen it all, and well, who keeps those traditions close to heart."
    r "Konrad是个彻头彻尾的老古董。是个见多识广的老水手，那些老传统他可是记得死死的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21852
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_5bbfeb65_1:

    # r "Legends.{w} Old tales."
    r "都是些传说，{w}老掉牙的故事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21856
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_716d8dd8_1:

    # r "He can spin you a yarn, but if you should believe him?"
    r "他啊，讲故事倒是挺溜，但能不能信就另说了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21860
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ebf68ad1_1:

    # r "That I am not so certain of."
    r "我可没把握。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21862
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_0d68667a_1:

    # r "I'm not sure he even believes it himself, or do you think he'd stay on a cursed ship?"
    r "我甚至怀疑他自己都不信，不然他会待在这艘被诅咒的船上？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21864
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_e3fccee6:

    # r "Unfortunately, besides tales of curses, said traditions also include sayings that no woman should be allowed out to sea."
    r "可惜的是，除了诅咒传说，那些老传统里还包括女人不该出海这一条。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21866
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_69b6bccb:

    # r "You might already notice where the problems arise..."
    r "你可能已经发现问题在哪了吧......"

# game/script day2.rpy:21868
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_1127ef2e:

    # r "The only reason there's no mutiny about my presence is because I'm here on Arthur's behalf, and I suppose they just don't consider me a real sailor."
    r "我没被他们赶下去，唯一的原因就是我是代表Arthur来的，而且估计他们也没把我当成真正的水手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21872
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_a6db1bff:

    # r "One perk of being the ship's surgeon."
    r "当船医这点还是有点好处的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21874
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_bcd3b2e6:

    # p "So if it's not a curse, am I just the next in line that he picks out as a target?"
    p "所以如果不是因为什么诅咒，我就是他下一个要找茬的对象？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21876
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_c715ecd0:

    # r "You're not. Believe me, I know him. He wants nothing but the best for the ship, and all of us who work on it."
    r "你想多了。相信我，我了解他。他一心为了船好，也为了咱们大家好。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21878
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_ffabd8f4:

    # p "Doesn't exactly feel like it to me. If he is so concerned about the crew, why would he pick me out like this?"
    p "我可没感觉到。如果他真那么关心船员，干嘛单单挑我出来？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21880
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_80ca6163:

    # p "I am part of it after all."
    p "我也是船员的一份子啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21882
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_5e442065:

    # p "I'm doing my best just like Konrad, just like Samuel, and just like Arthur himself."
    p "我也在尽力做好我的工作，就像Konrad、Samuel，还有Arthur一样。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21884
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_7bf8106e:

    # "She pauses for a moment before she answers with another shake of her head."
    "她停顿了一下，摇了摇头才回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21888
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_00bf9156:

    # r "To be honest with you, I don't quite know."
    r "说实话，我也不是很清楚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21890
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_d6a981f4:

    # r "Perhaps you just had bad luck and made an unfortunate first impression.{w} In the end he's a sailor at his core, and anyone who works hard and is diligent about their work will be on his good side."
    r "也许你只是比较倒霉，第一印象不太好。{w} 但说到底他还是个水手，只要你努力又勤奋，他就会对你另眼相看。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21894
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_cd32c2b9:

    # r "Do that and you shouldn't have any trouble."
    r "做到这些，你就不会有什么麻烦了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21896
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_df88d49c:

    # p "That's what everyone keeps telling me..."
    p "大家都是这么跟我说的……"

# game/script day2.rpy:21900
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_fde5ea76:

    # r "I could ask him directly if you would like me to?"
    r "你要是想知道，我可以帮你去问问他？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21904
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_b34049d9:

    # p "Oh god, please don't!"
    p "哦，我的老天，千万别！"

# game/script day2.rpy:21908
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_436e8332:

    # p "Every time he speaks to me, or my name comes up, it only seems to get worse. I don't think it would do me any favors if you just went up and asked about me."
    p "每次他跟我说话，或者提到我的名字，情况只会更糟。你要是直接跑去问他关于我的事，我肯定吃不了兜着走。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21910
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_51dbd180:

    # r "Hm...{w} I understand... I will keep my ears open when I'm with him and the other gentlemen though. Perhaps I can glean something when I'm sitting with them."
    r "嗯... {w} 我明白了... 不过，我和他还有其他人在一块儿的时候，我会留个心眼的。说不定我在他们旁边坐着的时候，能打探点消息。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21912
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahdinner_07ced154:

    # p "That would be appreciated, Doctor."
    p "那就多谢您了，医生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21931
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_49061c3b:

    # "Just as she promised, it would be the first mate, Arthur, who comes looking for you about half an hour later as you are out on deck. Anxiously pacing up and down as you just can't quiet your thoughts."
    "就像她说的那样，大概半小时后，大副Arthur就来找你了。你正在甲板上焦虑地踱步，脑子里乱糟糟的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21933
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_546b0da7:

    # a "Mr. [family_name]."
    a "[family_name]先生。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21935
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_ed55c889:

    # "You can't tell if his voice is any harsher than usual, but what you can notice is that he has the thick scent of a freshly smoked pipe clinging to him."
    "你听不出他的声音有没有比平时更凶，但他身上那股刚抽完烟斗的味儿倒是挺浓的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21937
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_27b151da:

    # "You obviously know what this is about, and stand up straight, quickly saluting the officer."
    "你知道他为什么来，立刻站直了，朝他敬了个礼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21939
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_0e466dc9:

    # "He is accompanied by another crew member on each side of him."
    "他旁边还跟着两个船员。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21941
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_0556ce0c:

    # p "Officer."
    p "长官。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21943
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_13d239e1:

    # "For a moment he just looks at you without a single word leaving his lips for almost half a minute."
    "他就那样盯着你，足足有半分钟，愣是一个字都没说。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21945
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_090952a5:

    # "You are unsure if you're expected to speak up or not."
    "你拿不准是不是该先开口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21947
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_a3fbcc78:

    # a "I take it that you know why I am here?"
    a "我想你应该清楚我为什么而来吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21949
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_2630d3fb:

    # p "Sir, I think I do."
    p "是，长官，我想我明白。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21953
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_c7255a8b:

    # a "Why am I here, recruit?"
    a "我来这儿做什么，新兵？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21955
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_aa8bc355:

    # p "Because of Rajeeyah, I assume."
    p "我猜是因为Rajeeyah的事。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21957
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_b8cae63f:

    # "He tilts his head ever so slightly as he hears your response."
    "听到你这么说，他微微侧了下头。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21959
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_dc21b2af:

    # a "I am not here because of {i}her{/i}."
    a "我不是为了 {i}她{/i}来的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21963
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_8ec87d82:

    # a "I am here because of {i}you{/i}. What has gotten into you that you think your behaviour is in any way, shape, or form acceptable?"
    a "我是为了 {i}你{/i}来的。 你到底是怎么回事，竟然觉得你那些行为还能见人？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21965
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_6aa75602:

    # a "Explain."
    a "解释清楚。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21976
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_32417b8c:

    # "A heavy step brings him closer, forcing you to crane your neck further back to look up at him."
    "他沉重地踏上一步，逼得你不得不仰起头才能看他。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21978
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_ab2a57fa:

    # a "Who in the vast seven seas do you think you are?"
    a "你以为你是谁？ 吃了熊心豹子胆了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21980
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_aa50873b:

    # a "The king?"
    a "国王？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21982
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_c6c082a7:

    # a "The God Poseidon?"
    a "海神波塞冬？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21986
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_c40f7e24:

    # a "Or do I happen to wake up today, only to speak in the presence of blessed holy virgin herself?"
    a "还是说我今天走了什么运，竟然能跟圣女大人说话？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21988
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_d603e18d:

    # "Answering becomes almost impossible with the lump that you find stuck in your throat. You swallow hard and clear your throat."
    "你觉得喉咙里像是堵了块石头，想回答都难。你用力咽了口唾沫，清了清嗓子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21992
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_d14d4e4b:

    # a "Are you?"
    a "你是吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:21994
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_7eaff810:

    # a "I kindly requested you to tell me."
    a "我可是好好地问你呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:21996
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_9a2b4677:

    # p "{size=-20}No, sir.{/size}"
    p "{size=-20}不，先生。{/size}"

# game/script day2.rpy:21998
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_f5c24d9f:

    # "You respond meekly."
    "你有气无力地回答。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22002
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_73f1a0e4:

    # a "Again! This time like you've got a pair."
    a "大声点！像个带把的男人一样！"

# game/script day2.rpy:22004
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_e33fcfef:

    # a "You seemed so proud of them from what I heard."
    a "听人说，你好像挺以此为荣的啊。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22006
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_9f7c2e36:

    # "You tremble and take a deep breath to voice a more audible \"No, Sir.\" this time."
    "你浑身发抖，深吸一口气，这次总算大声喊了出来：“不，先生！”"

# game/script day2.rpy:22008
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_996dd0e1:

    # p "I apologize, sir. I just..."
    p "我很抱歉，先生。我只是......"

# game/script day2.rpy:22010
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_cfb92a31:

    # p "I had poor judgment."
    p "是我猪油蒙了心。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22012
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_29b191c9:

    # a "I shouldn't have been so lenient with you, you know. I had a feeling about you right from the start, but I thought better of it."
    a "我真不该对你心慈手软，你知道吗。一开始我就觉得你不对劲，还总想着往好处想。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22016
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_5fc60191:

    # a "Thought that maybe that feeling was wrong."
    a "以为也许是我看走了眼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22018
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_46401318:

    # a "Saw a boy with an eagerness and a sense of what a privilege it is to be, and work on a ship like this."
    a "以为你是个渴望上进，也明白在这船上干活是多大荣幸的小子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22020
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_1c1633cb:

    # "His broad hand reaches out to you, grasps the underside of your chin and forces you to look up at him properly, without any chance of avoiding eye contact."
    "他粗壮的手一把抓住你的下巴，强迫你抬起头，不让你有丝毫回避。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22022
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_477e63ce:

    # a "Clearly however, it wasn't."
    a "看来，是我错了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22026
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_1ac68c21:

    # a "See, I can understand a misstep.{w} Men away from their homes, confined for months."
    a "听着，一时犯错我可以理解... 男人们背井离乡，一困就是几个月。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22028
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_425d4109:

    # a "And yet, in the space of a day, you managed to insult hundreds of years of naval order several times over."
    a "可你倒好，一天之内，三番五次地挑战海军的规矩。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22030
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_999fa9ee:

    # a "And more importantly you insulted the dignity of a valued member of this crew."
    a "更重要的是，你侮辱了咱们船上一位重要人物！"

# game/script day2.rpy:22037
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_31f2eccd:

    # "With his other hand Arthur gestures to the nearby crew members, who, without question step in close to you on Arthur's command."
    "Arthur抬手示意，附近的船员立刻毫不犹豫地靠了上来，听候他的命令。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22039
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_66a74a8f:

    # a "Prepare him for 12 right away, and gather the rest of the crew..."
    a "准备行刑！先打十二鞭！把其他人都叫过来..."

# game/script day2.rpy:22046
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_9cd683d4:

    # "You find yourself with your shirt stripped, and your arms tied securely to the rigging. The crew, Arthur and Rajeeyah foremost, surround you."
    "你发现自己已经被剥光了上衣，双手紧紧地绑在帆缆上。船员们围了上来，Arthur和Rajeeyah也在人群最前面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22048
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_a68d5be8:

    # "You do spot Julian, Samuel and Wolf among them as well, looking at you in concerned silence."
    "Julian、Samuel和Wolf也在人群里，他们正一脸担忧地看着你，沉默不语。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22050
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_a762eea1:

    # "Arthur steps forward, hands clasped behind his back as he speaks in a calm but stern tone."
    "Arthur背着手，向前走了一步，语气平静却严厉。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22052
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_cb655c80:

    # a "Mr. [family_name]. As a result of your repeated acts of disobedience to your superiors, you are hereby sentenced to 12 lashes."
    a "[family_name]先生。鉴于你屡次违抗上级，现判处你鞭笞十二下！"

# game/script day2.rpy:22054
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_63928e14:

    # a "The things that hold this small wooden world together are hard work and discipline. I expect you, as I expect everyone, to behave with decorum required of a proud sailor on this very ship."
    a "咱们这条船，靠的就是规矩和纪律。我希望你，也希望所有人，都给我拿出个像样水手的样子来！"

# game/script day2.rpy:22056
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_04250838:

    # a "And I cannot afford to allow anarchy to reign on this ship."
    a "我绝不允许这艘船上出现任何混乱！"

# game/script day2.rpy:22058
translate Chinese day2_eveningchoice_rajeeyahprelash_e197a85c:

    # a "Do you have any last words before we begin?"
    a "行刑之前，你还有什么要说的吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22102
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_0a164fca:

    # "The upcoming scene portrays your character's recovery from his punishment. It is less explicitly gory and instead deals with overall themes of pain and injury."
    "接下来的场景会描述你受刑后的状态。其中不会有太多血腥暴力的直接描写，主要展现痛苦和受伤的主题。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22104
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_84647406:

    # "Given the difficulty in determining blood censorship boundaries for a scene revolving around injuries, you have the option to bypass this scene entirely."
    "考虑到受伤场景中，血腥程度的审查界限很难确定，你可以选择跳过此场景。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22106
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_85a26e4c:

    # "If you choose to play out the scenes, then the direct references to blood will be censored (as the censorship option suggested), but themes of general pain and injury will remain."
    "如果你选择继续，（就像审查选项建议的那样）对血液的直接描写会被省略，但疼痛和受伤的主题仍然会保留。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22117
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_b37a8f61:

    # "Alright, the scene will continue."
    "好吧，我们继续。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22121
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_175eeb70:

    # "You rouse to a burning thrum originating from your back."
    "你挣扎着醒来，背上传来一阵灼烧般的刺痛，还嗡嗡作响。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22123
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_3b1f6895:

    # "The gentle sway of the ship rhythmically shifts your weight from side to side."
    "船身轻柔地摇晃着，你的身体也跟着有节奏地左右摇摆。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22125
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_473e9dfd:

    # "Then the hard, unyielding sensation of wooden planks beneath you joins upon your senses.{w} You're not in your hammock, but instead, a thin sheet of cloth is all that separates you from the deck."
    "然后，你感觉到身下坚硬的木板，真硌得慌。{w} 你不是在吊床上，而是一层薄布垫在甲板上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22127
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_a66252ff:

    # "You find yourself on your stomach, arms splayed out to your sides, your head turned to one side. A shiver runs through you as another sensation makes itself known-"
    "你发现自己趴在地上，胳膊伸在两边，头歪向一边。一阵寒意袭来，还有一种感觉也变得清晰——"

# game/script day2.rpy:22129
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_5c260824:

    # "Your upper body is bare."
    "你光着上半身。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22131
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_86d0c013:

    # "It's far from a comfortable position, with the hard deck, the persistent pain, and the chilly cold all vying for your attention. Yet, there's comfort in the simple act of keeping your eyes closed."
    "这姿势可不好受，坚硬的甲板，没完没了的疼痛，还有这刺骨的寒意，都让你难受。不过，闭上眼睛倒能稍微好受点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22133
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_4bedb714:

    # "Just a little longer."
    "再缓一会儿。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22142
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_f69a6931:

    # "Eventually, you muster the strength to coax your eyes open, allowing the cabin's dim light to filter in."
    "你终于鼓起力气，慢慢睁开眼，让舱里昏暗的光线照进来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22146
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_2e2b4204:

    # "Even without making a conscious effort to survey your surroundings, the familiarity of this place doesn't escape you."
    "就算没仔细看，你也知道这是在哪儿，熟门熟路的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22148
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_5ceb9eaf:

    # "You've been here before,{w} tending to Mr. Blackborow."
    "你以前来过这儿，{w} 照顾Blackborow先生来着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22152
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_78b32ab2:

    # "The surroundings may be unfamiliar to you, but you don't feel the desire to look around."
    "也许你对周围不太熟，但现在也没心思四处张望。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22154
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_e7ff0b53:

    # "For now, you don't question it, focusing instead on managing the steady throb of pain."
    "先别管那些了，还是想想怎么对付这一下一下的抽痛吧。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22158
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_ac77a962:

    # r "You're coming to?"
    r "你醒了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22162
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_25541c6e:

    # r "Mr. [family_name]?"
    r "[family_name]先生？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22164
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_b91107d8:

    # r "Are you awake?"
    r "醒醒？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22170
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_467ca5b7:

    # "It's her—Rajeeyah. Her voice is a familiar whisper in the room, followed by the soft patter of footsteps as she navigates the cramped cabin to face you."
    "是她——Rajeeyah。耳畔传来了她在舱房中那声熟悉的轻柔细语，紧接着是轻缓的脚步声，穿过逼仄狭小的舱房来到你面前。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22172
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_c58271e9:

    # "Speaking proves to be a struggle, your first attempt failing to produce anything audible. Only on your second try, and with added effort, do you manage to form words."
    "说话真费劲，第一次尝试根本发不出声音。第二次用了点力气，这才勉强挤出几个字。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22174
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_b503ca7c:

    # p "Am I here because of... the punishment?"
    p "我在这儿，是因为... 那个惩罚？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22176
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_b32d7414:

    # "She nods, allowing you a moment to gather your thoughts."
    "她点了点头，让你先缓口气。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22178
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_9a4bcb49:

    # p "How long have I been out?"
    p "我昏了多久？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22180
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_346075f3:

    # r "For the night."
    r "一晚上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22184
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_c49ecc4a:

    # r "And now it is,{w} I think three bells into the forenoon watch."
    r "现在嘛，{w} 我想应该是上午班的三更天了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22186
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_3f41d547:

    # r "Do try to keep your voice low, Mr. Blackborow is asleep right now."
    r "尽量小点声，Blackborow先生还在睡呢。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22190
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_745e4581:

    # "With a bit of effort, you turn your head and catch sight of Perce's bed standing tall next to you"
    "你费劲地转过头，看到Perce的床就在你旁边，高高地立着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22194
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_3903a808:

    # "With a bit of effort, you turn your head and catch sight of the other patient's bed standing tall next to you."
    "你费劲地转过头，看到另一个病人的床就在你旁边，高高地立着。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22198
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_138c4350:

    # "You attempt to roll onto your side to get a better look at her, but as you do, you scrape parts of your injured back against the deck, sending a jolt of pain coursing through you."
    "你想要侧过身，好好看看她，结果背上的伤口蹭到了甲板，疼得你直抽抽。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22200
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_68fddd73:

    # "You hiss through clenched teeth and allow yourself to fall back onto the deck."
    "我咬紧牙，倒吸一口凉气，重重地摔回甲板上。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22204
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_861b79c2:

    # r "I would recommend staying on your stomach."
    r "我劝你还是趴着吧，会舒服点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22208
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_404f865f:

    # "She watches as you figure out what positions you best avoid for now."
    "她在一旁看着，让你自己琢磨现在怎么躺着能稍微好受些。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22210
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_0c01e635:

    # p "Shit..."
    p "操..."

# game/script day2.rpy:22216
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_0396e939:

    # r "Not exactly pleasant, is it?"
    r "这滋味，不好受吧？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22218
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_956f0309:

    # r "Maybe next time you'll watch your tongue."
    r "下次说话小心点。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22220
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_81f19e95:

    # r "It might have just spared you this ordeal."
    r "也许就能躲过这一劫了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22222
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_ae391e08:

    # p "It hurts like shit, {w}I can hardly move..."
    p "疼死我了… {w} 简直动都动不了… "

# game/script day2.rpy:22224
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_6de276f4:

    # p "How bad is it?"
    p "情况糟透了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22228
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_49c06d36:

    # r "Is it hurting badly?"
    r "疼得厉害吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22230
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_efb9ed77:

    # p "I wouldn't call it pleasant, no."
    p "好受？一点也不！"

# game/script day2.rpy:22232
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_a66e286d:

    # r "It's to be expected, considering it's a punishment."
    r "谁让你受罚呢，活该。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22234
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_3811ead3:

    # r "I'm afraid I'll have to clean it, which I doubt you'll like to hear either."
    r "接下来我得给你清理伤口，估计你也不爱听。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22236
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_02f27787:

    # "You wince pre-emptively."
    "你本能地抽搐了一下。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22238
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_af579f55:

    # p "I could do without that."
    p "这步能不能省了？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22240
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_7a89327e:

    # r "You can't, trust me."
    r "省不了，信我。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22242
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_6de276f4_1:

    # p "How bad is it?"
    p "情况糟透了吗？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22244
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_b4c51c85:

    # r "He didn't hold back."
    r "他下手真狠。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22246
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_0b27867d:

    # p "I felt as much."
    p "我感觉到了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22248
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_5bb33022:

    # p "Still do..."
    p "现在还疼着呢…"

# game/script day2.rpy:22252
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_d420a1d5:

    # r "You'll survive. You're not the first one to recive a flogging."
    r "你死不了。又不是第一个挨鞭子的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22254
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_85eaa72d:

    # r "It'll hurt like hell, might not look pretty either, but it is just a flogging."
    r "会疼得像下地狱一样，可能还会皮开肉绽，但说到底也就是一顿鞭子。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22260
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_5a3ee85d:

    # r "You'll be fine, but it will take a little while before you can comfortably wear a shirt again."
    r "你会没事的，就是得过阵子才能舒舒服服地穿衬衫了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22262
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_c9772b01:

    # r "However, I can't say for certain if you'll bear scars on your back or not."
    r "至于会不会留疤，我就不敢保证了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22264
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_3c6dcf66:

    # r "You have thick enough fur that it softened the blows somewhat, but a flogging is a flogging. There's no way around that."
    r "你毛厚，多少能卸点力，但鞭子就是鞭子，该疼还是得疼。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22269
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_01ecae21:

    # "Rajeeyah rises from her chair, reaching into a desk cupboard to retrieve a bottle. Alongside it, she grabs a small piece of fabric, deftly twisting it into a makeshift tube."
    "Rajeeyah站起身，从桌子里的柜子里拿出一个瓶子，又扯下一块布，麻利地卷成一个临时的管状物。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22277
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_91a8a85f:

    # "She lowers herself to her knees, presenting the rolled fabric to your muzzle."
    "她跪下来，把卷好的布料凑到你嘴边。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22281
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_8fd2cc94:

    # r "We'll need to clean it."
    r "得清理一下伤口。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22283
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_0ba324bb:

    # r "Ensure you don't wake Mr. Blackborow in the process."
    r "别把Blackborow先生吵醒了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22285
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_f9eb5b7a:

    # "You clamp down on the fabric, adjusting its position with a slide of your hand until it rests securely behind your canines."
    "你咬紧布条，用爪子扒拉着调整了一下位置，让它牢牢地卡在犬齿后面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22287
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_1d7fa0a4:

    # "The taste is far from pleasant—a hint of mold, a common trait among the ship's cloth, coupled with an unpleasant texture against your tongue and gums."
    "嘴里的滋味着实称不上美妙——一股淡淡的霉味，在船上粗布织物中再常见不过了，咬在牙龈和舌尖上的口感更叫人难受。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22291
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_60400c72:

    # r "I'm going to have to clean the wounds or they'll scar for certain if they swell."
    r "我得赶紧给你清理伤口，不然肿了肯定留疤。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22293
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_dc1be2fb:

    # r "This will hurt.{w} A lot.{p}Bite down on this so you don't hurt yourself, and to muffle your screams."
    r "会很疼的。{w} 非常疼。{p}咬紧这块布，免得咬伤自己，也能稍微压住你的惨叫。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22295
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_abe572da:

    # r "With some luck we won't wake up Mr. Blackborow."
    r "希望别把 Blackborow 先生吵醒了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22297
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_f9eb5b7a_1:

    # "You clamp down on the fabric, adjusting its position with a slide of your hand until it rests securely behind your canines."
    "你咬紧布条，用爪子扒拉着调整了一下位置，让它牢牢地卡在犬齿后面。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22299
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_a3f2eb57:

    # p "Nuh Guahanhees."
    p "Nuh Guahanhees."

# game/script day2.rpy:22301
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_1d7fa0a4_1:

    # "The taste is far from pleasant—a hint of mold, a common trait among the ship's cloth, coupled with an unpleasant texture against your tongue and gums."
    "嘴里的滋味着实称不上美妙——一股淡淡的霉味，在船上粗布织物中再常见不过了，咬在牙龈和舌尖上的口感更叫人难受。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22305
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_2ddef9a2:

    # "Rajeeyah uncorks the bottle of potent alcohol, soaking some of it into the fabric in her other hand."
    "Rajeeyah 拔开烈性酒精的瓶塞，用另一只手拿着布，浸了些酒精上去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22309
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_766f268f:

    # p "I dun het he shilver shuff?"
    p "额...硝、硝酸银...在哪...？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22311
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_a302c1c6:

    # "You watch as she leans over your back, following her movements with your eyes as far as they allow."
    "你看着她俯下身，在你背上忙活着，眼睛尽力追随着她的动作。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22319
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_38c10b3d:

    # r "What? The silver nitrate?"
    r "什么？硝酸银？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22323
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_692e9142:

    # r "This will be enough."
    r "这些够用了。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22326
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_33a15f1e:

    # r "What?{w} Oh, you mean the silver nitrate solution I used for Mr. Blackborow?"
    r "什么？{w} 哦，你是说我给 Blackborow 先生用的硝酸银溶液啊？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22330
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_177508f6:

    # r "We don't have much of it, so I'll only use it on the worst areas. The rest will be treated with alcohol."
    r "咱们存货不多，我只会在最严重的伤口上用。剩下的就用酒精处理。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22337
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_f9d82824:

    # "She presses the alcohol-soaked cloth to your skin without any warning, igniting a searing burn along your spine."
    "她二话不说就把浸了酒精的布按在你背上，像火烧一样沿着你的脊椎蔓延开来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22341
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_8b40fb0e:

    # r "This will sting."
    r "会很刺痛的。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22343
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_5bd4b6ad:

    # "She gently dabs the wet cloth against your skin, but even with her extra care it still sends a searing sensation up your spine."
    "她小心翼翼地用湿布擦拭你的皮肤，但即使这样，灼热感还是直冲你的脊梁。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22345
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_946eaff3:

    # "You jerk away at the initial contact, forcing her to pause."
    "你刚一接触就猛地躲开，她不得不停了下来。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22351
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_662a10a8:

    # r "Pull yourself together, will you?"
    r "你给我振作点，行不行？"

# game/script day2.rpy:22353
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_934e622e:

    # "Rajeeyah waits until you relax before applying another touch."
    "Rajeeyah 等你放松下来，才敢再次下手。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22357
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_62108958:

    # "You grit your teeth, biting down hard on the piece of cloth as you endure the agony of her cleaning your extensive wounds."
    "你咬紧牙关，死死咬住那块布，忍受着她清理大面积伤口带来的剧痛。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22359
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_8f94a412:

    # "It feels like an eternity before she finally releases you from your suffering, and once she does, you pass out almost immediately from the sheer exhaustion of it all."
    "你感觉时间过得特别慢，好像过了一个世纪那么久，她才终于让你解脱。你一放松下来，就因为精疲力竭，直接昏了过去。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22363
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_f8f0df6d:

    # "A pit forms in your stomach as you watch and brace yourself for the impending treatment."
    "看着她，你心里直打鼓，胃里也好像破了个大洞，只能硬着头皮等待接下来的治疗。"

# game/script day2.rpy:22365
translate Chinese day3_lashing_recovery_757e338b:

    # "Thankfully for you, you pass out again almost immediately at her touch. Sparing you from having to endure it."
    "谢天谢地，她一碰你，你就又昏过去了，省得受罪了。"

